15318',4.2,2485,'no','Cave','A group of former military elites set out to explore an uncharted abyss, not knowing their worst nightmare is waiting for them deep beneath the ground.','/4RbStTnnZCDKLNqf9iPNbOBf1Bn.jpg','2016-09-02',85,'Released','Go deeper','Cave',410118,2.654,4.4,'WR7see4Z7Lk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41157,_binary '\0','/2CjY7TiNDKhuI0rk8K0Vq0UvIHZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4915672',4.5,4549,'en','7 Guardians of the Tomb','An innocent discovery of a well-preserved mummified Emperor from 200 BC China unearths a 2000 year old nightmare - a secret that should have remained buried.','/lBW7Aq7RzsFbrnmn9RCkpd6GbXf.jpg','2018-01-19',90,'Released','Unearth the legend. Unleash the curse.','7 Guardians of the Tomb',409582,4.2212,5.3,'Olo-3Wbxte4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41158,_binary '\0','/wfabrzHzfYTdCj3iSCY7OEQbND0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4916630',7.6,85911,'en','Just Mercy','The powerful true story of Harvard-educated lawyer Bryan Stevenson, who goes to Alabama to defend the disenfranchised and wrongly condemned — including Walter McMillian, a man sentenced to death despite evidence proving his innocence. Bryan fights tirelessly for Walter with the system stacked against them.','/2bDZl3PzFLFWe4gaFUQnnaslqT3.jpg','2019-12-25',137,'Released','Every generation has its hero. Meet ours.','Just Mercy',522212,11.4029,7.842,'GVQbeG5yW78','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41159,_binary '\0','/6iQUVNO2EFN0oq9hP5AOS9xzybR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4917224',4.6,5183,'en','9/11','Five random strangers find themselves trapped in an elevator in the World Trade Center\'s North Tower on 9/11. They work together, never giving up hope, to try to escape before the unthinkable happens.','/pGkjEL7RkMogMI6aznsKmZOhd8I.jpg','2017-09-07',88,'Released',NULL,'9/11',455558,4.0025,5.1,'33eLaNNTUKY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41160,_binary '\0','/3q01ACG0MWm0DekhvkPFCXyPZSu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4919268',6.5,116641,'en','Bad Boys: Ride or Die','After their late former Captain is framed, Lowrey and Burnett try to clear his name, only to end up on the run themselves.','/oGythE98MYleE6mZlGs5oBGkux1.jpg','2024-06-05',116,'Released','Miami\'s finest are now its most wanted.','Bad Boys: Ride or Die',573435,21.9182,7.313,'ZTQyMmz-cQE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41161,_binary '\0','/1Wyq9q1onWU3Tx0cXX2hdWljF4X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4919484',6.7,8219,'en','Little Men','Jake is a quiet, sensitive middle schooler with dreams of being an artist. He meets the affably brash Tony at his grandfather\'s funeral, and the unlikely pair soon hit it off. The budding friendship is put at risk, however, when a rent dispute between Jake\'s father, Brian, and Tony\'s mother, Leonor, threatens to become contentious.','/mMmXSUZ66XoxmT4zdkUkVDdU8Mu.jpg','2016-08-05',85,'Released','Be on each other\'s side.','Little Men',373473,2.9038,6.43,'Dk9-5M-PerQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41162,_binary '\0','/sqqJ6idBgIgRtKsiBU2XhX5A8Sj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4920098',4.9,1744,'en','Somnium','Gemma moves to LA, hoping to become an actress. She takes an overnight gig at a sleep clinic that promises to make their clients’ dreams come true. But the longer she spends there, the more it becomes clear that something sinister is going on.','/cPUeMJkPLDWSOA6OU862EdZhylS.jpg','2025-08-28',90,'Released',NULL,'Somnium',1289893,2.1135,5.1,'8H-29I9eBF4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41163,_binary '\0','/An1FS6Baec7uogTcQyEYqruYAtM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4920274',7.5,7832,'en','Regular Show: The Movie','After a high school lab experiment goes horribly wrong, Mordecai and Rigby must go back in time to battle an evil volleyball coach in order to save the universe — and their friendship.','/p44RoW4naoE1nlSGOqqT0J2pc09.jpg','2015-09-01',69,'Released','Save the universe from yourselves or you\'re fired.','Regular Show: The Movie',354857,6.6802,7.941,'k6JF3MkAY6w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41164,_binary '\0','/wMTpOS4owf27iNVUoKp1rAtawTY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4920360',6.6,1752,'en','Aquarela','From massive waves to melting ice, filmmaker Victor Kossakovsky travels around the world to capture stunning images of the beauty and raw power of water.','/mn0lQODobXaiWkZB2qjRe9OZyql.jpg','2018-09-29',90,'Released',NULL,'Aquarela',539016,1.9406,6.5,'3xAIuDF25kE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41165,_binary '\0','/IIEIystX8p4uBFOXU1BGsyIrqk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4921370',2.4,1268,'ru','Максимальный удар','The agents of the Federal Security Service of Russia and the US Secret Service are forced to work together to prevent a full-scale international crisis.','/gFkT9PxdbngMU5rRKSgQOulB5AH.jpg','2017-11-30',110,'Released',NULL,'Maximum Impact',489013,2.4074,3.5,'5ZqslqqS9t0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41166,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4921860',6.9,8616,'hi','MSG 2 The Messenger','The film talks about Guru Ji, the spiritual leader accepts the challenge of vanishing social evils like gender-related issues, drugs abuse and alcoholism from the society. Some people with vested interest conspire to kill this spiritual leader.','/cqKA6RjdgwQbZkVZNAsUQhjTwr0.jpg','2015-09-18',134,'Released',NULL,'MSG 2 The Messenger',373195,0.5061,2.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41167,_binary '\0','/uYrWbsvFYZgQF4cwDDPPsnDl8IM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4922674',5.9,6295,'en','Parallel','A group of friends stumble upon a mirror that serves as a portal to a \"multiverse\", but soon discover that importing knowledge from the other side in order to better their lives brings increasingly dangerous consequences.','/eUi9srjugUumdUK8sGO9ndMFXgI.jpg','2018-04-10',104,'Released','You can\'t go back.','Parallel',426793,3.3923,5.974,'mHoIR1nUJbI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41168,_binary '\0','/erIfV6Xm60tsEySsrDolb8DoqNP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4922692',6.4,6820,'es','Kiki, el amor se hace','Through five stories, the movie addresses sex and love: Paco and Ana are a marriage looking for reactivate the passion of their sexual relations, long time unsatisfied; Jose Luis tries to recover the affections of his wife Paloma, sit down on a wheelchair after an accident which has limited her mobility; Mª Candelaria and Antonio are a marriage trying by all way to be parents, but she has the trouble that no get an orgasm when make love with him; Álex try to satisfy Natalia\'s fantasies, while she starts to doubt if he finally will ask her in marriage; and finally, Sandra is a single woman in a permanent searching for a man to fall in love. All them love, fear, live and explore their diverse sexual paraphilias and the different sides of sexuality, trying to find the road to happiness.','/16LZn5Z6QZ1gWmLQQn4EcdnV9q6.jpg','2016-04-01',102,'Released',NULL,'Kiki: Love to Love',370978,2.7671,6.1,'rT7_bbyI7PA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41169,_binary '\0','/aSQPsZOd1bQOFhXplCLmcd9SUM4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4923846',5.9,2022,'en','Christmas in the Smokies','Christmas in the Smokies is a modern day Christmas classic set in the beautiful Smoky Mountains. It tells the story of one family\'s journey to save their historic berry farm against all odds during one fateful holiday season.','/6OUjPWqqRMqxPhTYeZ1loXuQDkI.jpg','2015-10-16',85,'Released',NULL,'Christmas in the Smokies',366242,1.9312,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41170,_binary '\0','/nm9ewu3qrqrJYlnBigU66kKvZJg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4924624',6.6,1267,'en','InnSæi','A story of soul searching, science, nature and creativity, InnSæi takes us on a global journey to uncover the art of connecting within today\'s world of distraction and stress.','/aC6UMs64I3rWfbV1yqApClXftg1.jpg','2016-06-30',74,'Released',NULL,'InnSæi',431242,1.4699,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41171,_binary '\0','/60XJOemSR9LQRDgBMRN7qkdLsPH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4924942',6.4,19540,'es','El guardián invisible','When the naked body of a teenage girl is found on the banks of the River Baztán, it is quickly linked to a similar murder one month before. Soon, rumours are flying in the nearby village of Elizondo. Is this the work of a ritualistic killer or is it the basajaun, the ‘invisible guardian’ of Basque mythology? Inspector Amaia Salazar leads the investigation, taking her back to the heart of the Basque country where she was born, and where she hoped never to return. Shrouded in mist and surrounded by impenetrable forests, it is a place of unresolved conflicts and a terrible secret from Amaia’s childhood that will come back to haunt her. Faced with the superstitions of the village, Amaia must fight the demons of her past to confront the reality of a serial killer on the loose. But as she is drawn deeper into the investigation, she feels the presence of something darker lurking in the shadows…','/uxR7CqLRdQ2QuOPP9ymunPrRBCq.jpg','2017-03-03',129,'Released',NULL,'The Invisible Guardian',392207,3.9029,6.5,'coOxcnfBr9s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41172,_binary '\0','/jwBiY1kE5089i2WpfS1MHDYp3VO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4925292',7.4,369077,'en','Lady Bird','Lady Bird McPherson, a strong willed, deeply opinionated, artistic 17 year old comes of age in Sacramento. Her relationship with her mother and her upbringing are questioned and tested as she plans to head off to college.','/gl66K7zRdtNYGrxyS2YDUP5ASZd.jpg','2017-09-01',94,'Released','Fly away home.','Lady Bird',391713,14.3014,7.249,'cNi_HC839Wo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41173,_binary '\0','/gWE2VGDx5FyVxSMv7tH38P6PFPm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4925340',5.9,2264,'it','The Nest (Il nido)','Samuel, a boy who lives with his mother Elena in Villa dei Laghi, an isolated manor surrounded by woods, feels trapped in the family routine, growing up seemingly protected, but unsatisfied and restless.','/f3DNmm0VXlwaPkTuKgznQdrDveD.jpg','2019-08-15',109,'Released','There\'s no place like home','The Nest',600184,3.1411,6.26,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41174,_binary '\0','/hpDuLFn6uaCNyUbBYNyY6BFP9HA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4926538',5,2399,'fr','Les Tuche 2 : Le Rêve américain','Les Tuche, a modest french family, change his life after winning a super lottery. Thanks to the money of his parents, the son, Donald (aka \"coin-coin\") goes to Los Angeles to improve his english. On the L.A. University, he meets Jennifer, daughter of a famous American financier.','/27KhcV8Yd98yhEk6vcU1cKHn8Rj.jpg','2016-02-03',94,'Released',NULL,'The Tuche Family: The American Dream',369776,2.6462,5.6,'o_Q2UakeaIs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41175,_binary '\0','/x9s4I93c3K7Mn6gbgnd1JJyppcP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4926822',6.1,1344,'fr','C\'est quoi cette famille ?!','Thirteen-year-old Bastien is the center of a reconstructed family: six half-brothers and sisters, eight \"parents,\" and as many houses. His tasks within the family are far more complex than what he has to do at school. But enough\'s enough: the children decide to wage a revolution and turn the rules upside down. All together, they squat a large apartment and now it\'ll be up to the parents to come to them!','/dnsEJOMcO2NLaoCVqIDJOLMMMh.jpg','2016-08-10',99,'Released',NULL,'We Are Family',391700,2.6942,6.3,'XBKMPy57rK0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41176,_binary '\0','/ryUhPFvo5n6gErwhKwbxE0wmgz5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4927574',6,4879,'tr','Siccîn 2','Adnan and Hicran are happily married however when their son die as a result of a mysterious accident Adanan becomes distant from his wife. Hicran starts investigating her past to see how it could connect to the death of her son.','/92HBT46woySCuwROxD0P1C1m0Af.jpg','2015-07-10',93,'Released','Every living creature will taste death.','Sijjin 2',388192,2.2173,5.438,'bKEiQKYQHGk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41177,_binary '\0','/jz4a2Vog89vGnQXm1JIcS4cvrtm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4928620',8.3,5433,'ml','പത്തേമാരി','Pathemari features the life of Pallikkal Narayanan who migrated to the Middle-East in the early 1980s, when the Kerala Gulf boom was at its peak.','/1pV5saZKVHdUNJojBhib9zNxiBD.jpg','2015-10-09',110,'Released','The journey of survival','Pathemari',278398,1.2045,7.556,'NB9zGBWLkb8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41178,_binary '\0','/sGXrwGT8KI7hQ1IIdww7AaPa0zq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4928814',5.9,2292,'en','You, Me and Him','Despite their age difference, Lesbian couple Olivia and Alex are very much in love. But as the question of pregnancy rears its head and their neighbour John befriends them, they both start making some truly disastrous decisions.','/rpAkySUQOe8H3yw1DDO5VnJwMws.jpg','2018-02-01',98,'Released','Two\'s company, three\'s a total nightmare.','You, Me and Him',465026,2.4036,5.6,'zyWOfLzJlvM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41179,_binary '\0','/4zN1G8Fiqkuuk0QU1bXbVC5PMbK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4929038',6.2,4021,'pt','O Ornitólogo','Stranded along a sublime river fjord in northern Portugal, an ornithologist is subjected to a series of brutal and erotic Stations-of-the-Cross-style tests.','/xS7akhtD1fwDzLseiTkDKOEwXHr.jpg','2016-09-16',118,'Released','Things happen, you just have to believe.','The Ornithologist',377274,1.3027,6,'3xvyW5zXx1c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41180,_binary '\0','/v0jz0Lln6G7HyKnBL4qvmIki3Yr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4929720',5.6,2409,'en','Patchwork','A delightfully dark, Frankenstein-themed horror comedy about a re-animated corpse, made from the stitched together body parts of three murdered young women, that decides to go on a bloody quest to find their killer and avenge their deaths!','/rrTLOdqGPDy5OS2J2aa4G4luQ2L.jpg','2015-10-15',86,'Released','Some Assembly Required','Patchwork',360007,1.5651,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41181,_binary '\0','/90sDP8tqlqoPmIF71WpCCUowNNF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4930814',5.7,1368,'ml','ഡബിൾ ബാരൽ','In Goa, two thugs, Pancho and Vinci, are approached by a crime boss, Don, with an offer to buy two precious stones, Laila and Majnu. However, these two end up initiating a gang war.','/vZaEYzxx7JEZ3lzED1EsHDUV7Wx.jpg','2015-08-28',150,'Released',NULL,'Double Barrel',338927,0.9567,5.5,'L3yxnDk4LbA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41182,_binary '\0','/ag9NBmSc6CNTfvElzofOBWoWXSN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4932154',7.1,7993,'de','Die Mitte der Welt','A strange family: 17-year-old Phil lives with his mother and twin sister in an old mansion on the outskirts of town. When he returns from summer camp, the mood in the mansion has soured somehow. Phil doesn’t worry about it, hanging out with his best friend Kat instead. When he starts to feel attracted to a mysterious new student at school, Phil is plunged into emotional turmoil only exacerbated by the trouble at home.','/6gXgSBF3baQsHqDuIcuEzWt71Gv.jpg','2016-11-10',115,'Released',NULL,'Center of My World',360737,3.6137,7.1,'IsY3Xj-RVWc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41183,_binary '\0','/fsqgUzVIzy28t29b9ApxcVyZBVw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4932244',4.2,1566,'en','2 Lava 2 Lantula!','When an unprecedented amount of sinkholes erupt all over Florida, a new nest of fire spitting LAVALANTULAS is awakened… wreaking their fiery havoc all over the sunshine state.','/e2cFhdk9SVthl6JuUHqSLpY5gME.jpg','2016-08-06',85,'Released','Fire Burns... Lava Bites Again!','2 Lava 2 Lantula!',391975,2.6466,5,'NIowlca3M6c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.