94,2.2793,5.9,'y9SfWmXQY3o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41192,_binary '\0','/24fWJGdv3eLZvqgy9OMC5GMN4dx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4935446',7,2760,'en','Heart of a Dog','Musician and performance artist Laurie Anderson reflects on the deaths of her husband Lou Reed, her mother and her beloved dog.','/qAeaTynkC8WPgna0UTTnb0WGswq.jpg','2015-10-21',75,'Released','What do you see when you close your eyes?','Heart of a Dog',352197,2.9114,6.5,'HnKVjZfKhYs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41193,_binary '\0','/2FT4Li1enVvQBaYSqvGji6vlvbE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4935462',7.5,5514,'en','Amazing Grace','A behind-the-scenes documentary about the recording of Aretha Franklin\'s best-selling album finally sees the light of day more than four decades after the original footage was shot.','/eABsBr5TnW8FBSSSsAKFnwDW1BW.jpg','2018-12-07',87,'Released',NULL,'Amazing Grace',356199,2.6677,7.1,'-zP1sXSAkHs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41194,_binary '\0','/tBI5Z0vgdvqLNQXv9ApsjKrLfB8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4936176',5.8,8706,'en','Mascots','Eager contestants don big heads and furry suits to vie for the title of World\'s Best Mascot.','/b1OIQmekcJvaQxtQvyBllZQCzmn.jpg','2016-09-10',94,'Released','From the sidelines to the spotlight.','Mascots',368993,1.5163,5.4,'rPxuwEA7Avc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41195,_binary '\0','/LLVvgPXBmIvVPG6MQaPLYVE9HE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4936450',7.3,15695,'ro','Bacalaureat','After his daughter is assaulted and left with an injury that may jeopardize her opportunity to study in the UK, a Romanian doctor decides to do whatever it takes to secure her future.','/FLocEtNx189qFvqRpaYArNK8w2.jpg','2016-05-20',128,'Released','A father will do anything to save his daughter\'s future','Graduation',374458,3.8024,6.8,'5hKtgrj7UXo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41196,_binary '\0','/yiJk6ixkFQDqhR1x4s8Bbhy9S2G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4937114',3.1,2935,'en','Rogue Warrior: Robot Fighter','A few decades from now - Sienna, a rebellious robot-fighting arms dealer, lives on a post-apocalyptic Earth. When the cities start to fall under the control of the A.I. Scourge, a hyper-weaponized robot army, Sienna decides to leave the Earth and journey to the centre of the galaxy, seeking a mythical weapon that can neutralize any form of A.I.Pursued by giant machines, Sienna loses everything she cares about in an effort to save the last vestiges of humanity in an A.I. controlled galaxy.','/xJwgBNUS3Xlt6RfoVeBYcgpNimj.jpg','2017-06-02',101,'Released',NULL,'Rogue Warrior: Robot Fighter',470458,1.5216,4.6,'LUUsELHtdxk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41197,_binary '\0','/wFmwCrAjvsI4AUpCj0DHAuF0JuO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4937564',4.6,2417,'fr','Sex Doll','High-priced London call girl Virginie goes about her work as a prostitute with a cool detachment, trading sex with wealthy businessmen for money, but never getting emotionally involved. That all changes when she meets Rupert, an enigmatic stranger with unclear intentions. Risking everything, Virginie plunges into a dangerous affair that puts her between a ruthless madam who forbids romantic attachment and a dark, sexy man who could be her saviour or her downfall.','/grWS1nNexgCQacAIF6Um5PS5N5y.jpg','2016-12-07',102,'Released','A tale of modern love.','Sex Doll',412520,3.3254,5.7,'PlfX9Fqq_Ss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41198,_binary '\0','/iERTZ4SkeUQnjweTyrjQf28qI5f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4937812',6.9,2808,'ta','தூங்கா வனம்','An undercover cop finds himself in a Catch-22 situation where he has to return the drugs he had stolen from a kingpin in exchange for his son. The bag containing the drug goes missing, and with both gangsters and cops on his tail, can he get out of this mess?','/ydqz82ndB2QTj51ubvl6iG6lQI1.jpg','2015-11-10',127,'Released',NULL,'Thoongaavanam',363178,1.1363,5.875,'htRNI9Boo78','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41199,_binary '\0','/lvxznRSXxzmGGh4kicfmYvZhedK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4938374',4.9,4828,'en','Open Season: Scared Silly','The humans and animals believe a werewolf is on the loose, and former hunter Shaw uses the opportunity to re-open the season. Boog, Elliot, and Mr. Weenie have to face their fears and find the werewolf to get the season closed permanently.','/tFD3HdVIXVbvVixIGhNmJBaqyAI.jpg','2015-12-18',84,'Released','Elliot is on an adventure to take the Boo out of Boog!','Open Season: Scared Silly',382517,7.0633,5.935,'Z3nGcP8fews','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41200,_binary '\0','/p48mJF1wmI4EFUe3qa5LER6rxut.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4938484',6.9,2247,'en','Silicon Cowboys','Launched in 1982 by three friends in a Houston diner, Compaq Computer set out to build a portable PC to take on IBM, the world’s most powerful tech company. Many had tried cloning the industry leader’s code, only to be trounced by IBM and its high-priced lawyers. Explore the remarkable David vs. Goliath story, and eventual demise, of Compaq, an unlikely upstart who altered the future of computing and helped shape the world as we know it today.','/wf4h6Za4d1agoKSEZpTSj4t1PAQ.jpg','2016-09-16',77,'Released','They risked their future to create ours...','Silicon Cowboys',381058,1.0915,6.8,'7wjJYqUkHd8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41201,_binary '\0','/sYbdAWcTqcdLtpAnwIWjrIw6t0r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4938602',5.7,1828,'en','The Lion Guard: Return of the Roar','Set in the African savannah, the film follows Kion as he assembles the members of the \'Lion Guard\'. Throughout the film, the diverse team of young animals will learn how to utilize each of their unique abilities to solve problems and accomplish tasks to maintain balance within the Circle of Life, while also introducing viewers to the vast array of animals that populate the prodigious African landscape.','/pzcQ7cQBHIdsKLN4exd7bCyy1pk.jpg','2016-01-25',44,'Released','A new hero finds his roar!','The Lion Guard: Return of the Roar',359983,4.431,6.7,'COG1D2f5ilY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41202,_binary '\0','/wZChfaCxRJM7bcX3nhHwCXcLvhI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4938790',7.3,2538,'tr','Rüzgarın Hatıraları','At the times of World War II, accomplished painter and translator Aram flees Istanbul due to political offenses. When he is trapped at the USSR-Georgia borders, his flight turns into a remembrance of things past...','/4GNjLkEKy1Rf7AMYUzqHuZZLpDV.jpg','2015-12-11',124,'Released',NULL,'Memories of the Wind',372232,1.5006,6.6,'Yo7WLxTnyYw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41203,_binary '\0','/7kyhEU4T9SnUiB6qseTPQjClTuz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4939066',6.2,6859,'ko','인천상륙작전','A squad of soldiers fight in the Korean War\'s crucial Battle of Incheon.','/c9Md7hQTNjFUZF0LgpWpVCS1GcI.jpg','2016-07-27',111,'Released','The Odds Were 5000 to 1 … One was all They Needed.','Operation Chromite',407887,4.7271,5.815,'KNqlM0j3ycg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41204,_binary '\0','/iZNNQLV2uejoj89DQEh668EqO4j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4940336',3.6,3779,'en','Risen','Disaster unfolds when a meteor strikes a small town, turning the environment uninhabitable and killing everything in the surrounding area. Exobiologist Lauren Stone is called to find answers to the unearthly event. As she begins to uncover the truth, imminent danger awakens and it becomes a race against time to save mankind.','/1vdRDS0UYDlJNBqRSqUuhBHf6eb.jpg','2021-08-20',109,'Released','We\'re at the edge of a mass extinction.','Risen',850099,3.2575,5,'gyb2wGcgxEM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41205,_binary '\0','/VybC5bdEqZYfU3sSsvsTE4WOpV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4940370',6.3,7104,'sv','Hundraettåringen som smet från notan och försvann','Drinking the tasty Folk Soda puts a spring in the 101 Year Old Man’s step and his next adventure takes him around the World and back to Sweden, during which time he is chased by the CIA, a Balinese debt collector and becomes an executive at a soft drink company.','/eIDOtXucNE2F1mwTyw6JB8m74wU.jpg','2016-12-25',108,'Released',NULL,'The 101-Year-Old Man Who Skipped Out on the Bill and Disappeared',404791,2.6625,6.438,'mN83l9Des3M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41206,_binary '\0','/cn6SzcqqJslI787kthET65T19fU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4940416',5.8,4649,'en','Duck Duck Goose','After he’s grounded by an injury, a high-flying bachelor is saddled with two wide-eyed orphans as they come face-to-face with the dangers and beauty of the outside world.','/7XURM64DYa9DpS70I2rM4suvq1s.jpg','2018-03-09',91,'Released','Family can be a wild ride','Duck Duck Goose',375107,8.565,6.219,'45MzzFoEASQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41207,_binary '\0','/ifzN6idu7UKE8TYhwDzf0PCuSkU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4940456',4.6,1972,'hi','मिर्ज़िया','Two star-crossed lovers must battle the forces which try to keep them apart at different timelines and at different world\'s.','/lkPsc3VW4YD54K91h2KZGLaIYuk.jpg','2016-10-07',129,'Released','Dare to Love','Mirzya',403540,1.1693,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41208,_binary '\0','/4Z0BKbjHzreE9NoYAvhP7W55Wr9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4942270',5.1,1238,'da','Alle for tre','Nikolaj is now an civilian, and likes his new job as preschool-teacher. Timo is seperate from his Wife Lonnine, and the social workers threats to break his rigtg to see his son Heino. If is not pay five yeas \"child-support-money\" with he has not paid. One day the brother father Arno, dies and they find out the have an unknowen brother in Italy, with is the sole seated legacy to the motorcycle, and the heist goes to steal it.','/dYSdhmCnBbURydHWWFZUueYdLxu.jpg','2017-02-02',90,'Released',NULL,'All for Three',420956,1.0766,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41209,_binary '\0','/ed1pHOjyGUY5JL1dUqQONOSJPDJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4943218',5.1,2348,'ar','المختارون','In this dystopian thriller, with civilization a thing of the past, a man puts his family in peril when he reluctantly lets outsiders into his compound.','/fDBlIFntmminhCOaSTv3Gn0WByC.jpg','2016-10-08',95,'Released',NULL,'The Worthy',413780,2.0164,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41210,_binary '\0','/7RJmCyuTPbckzian3DvSbfgWSYE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4943322',6.4,27267,'en','The Ottoman Lieutenant','Lillie, a determined American woman, ventures overseas to join Dr. Jude at a remote medical mission in the Ottoman Empire (now Turkey). However, Lillie soon finds herself at odds with Jude and the mission’s founder, Woodruff, when she falls for the titular military man, Ismail, just as the war is about to erupt.','/keHVpf7x6Na3KK7ep2BXzd2jlCv.jpg','2017-03-28',111,'Released','In a land on the brink of war the most dangerous place to be is in love.','The Ottoman Lieutenant',433356,3.6218,6,'X6K_M2FL71w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41211,_binary '\0','/2m9eru3p4tbMcv2kmaHe4yOzBVq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4943992',8.3,1281,'ur','منٹو‎','The controversial and troubled Indo-Pakistani writer Saadat Hasan Manto finds his artistic choices challenged by censors.','/xK3G1TZql42bpyJP9inA3nPA6tt.jpg','2015-09-11',127,'Released',NULL,'Manto',421337,1.9043,9.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41212,_binary '\0','/kIXJRoqUdqU9AowvS7PqBqMK8N8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4943998',7.3,29724,'en','Deadwood: The Movie','Follow the 10-year reunion of the Deadwood camp to celebrate South Dakota\'s statehood. Former rivalries are reignited, alliances are tested and old wounds are reopened, as all are left to navigate the inevitable changes that modernity and time have wrought.','/fCQ13cqd02dop7Chkov0fPl4r3t.jpg','2019-05-31',110,'Released','Welcome the fuck back.','Deadwood: The Movie',538225,5.3576,6.733,'ejqSTxm8Fws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41213,_binary '\0','/k7coKB2VvMED4pZdXZeYi4BOgHo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4944352',7.3,2840,'tl','Heneral Luna','Set during the Philippine-American War, a short-tempered Philippine Revolutionary Army general faces an enemy more formidable than the American army: his own treacherous countrymen.','/vCwbsgkdzpgTADyaa3g4jaWVAaR.jpg','2015-09-09',118,'Released','Nation or self?','Heneral Luna',359105,1.808,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41214,_binary '\0','/92oqNzaQrXbqc7ewO2BPfnLBVvi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4944596',7.1,13630,'es','Que Dios nos perdone','Madrid, summer 2011. Economic crisis. 15-M movement and 1.5 million pilgrims waiting for the Pope’s arrival live side by side in a Madrid that’s hotter and more chaotic than ever. In this context, detectives Velarde and Alfaro must find what seems to be a serial killer. Their against-the-clock hunt will make them realise something they’d never imagined: neither of them are so very different from the killer.','/nTF8FzV5CgiH4Qi8YrF1Ef3w63U.jpg','2016-10-28',127,'Released',NULL,'May God Save Us',394684,3.1927,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41215,_binary '\0','/wz8DmIrlIL6SugjXy3cQtiLBt3z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4944658',6.7,4414,'es','El faro de las orcas','A mother travels to Patagonia with her autistic son with the hope that a ranger and a pod of wild orcas can help him find an emotional connection.','/yDi2k4wScLHDSoz1b2ak1MNHQAX.jpg','2016-12-16',110,'Released','A place to dream','The Lighthouse of the Orcas',430161,1.6282,6.954,'uLPgwsI0WKA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41216,_binary '\0','/oqQwPb9FFIp52HjSDlgxMqdsOsD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4947084',7,2621,'ml','അനാർക്കലി','Shanthanu, a former Navy officer arrives in the Lakshadweep islands searching for his long lost love, Nadira. As he confronts the memories of a forbidden romance and the people tied to their past, his journey becomes one of longing, redemption, and enduring love across time and distance.','/bpXcSDAIcTAq6EUXWfqrGSJ2tbq.jpg','2015-11-13',166,'Released',NULL,'Anarkali',371107,1.2381,5.981,'zbqfe_dm6sw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41217,_binary '\0','/rmGm8IPadUrmxy5GCP61DdQJ0PK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4948452',6.7,5005,'fr','L\'Étudiante et Monsieur Henri','Because of his wavering health, Monsieur Henri can no longer live alone in his Paris appartment. Particularly grumpy, he ends up nonetheless accepting his son Paul\'s suggestion that he let one of his rooms out to a young female student. Far from falling for her charms, Henri uses her to orchestrate utter family chaos...','/vcwKqfw1bQeDz4tS96ca1mHZqLV.jpg','2015-10-07',100,'Released',NULL,'The Student and Mister Henri',360638,2.6469,6.65,'k9q551tvuVQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41218,_binary '\0','/ql9saC04QP2wnpZkCieKvZW23ra.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4948632',7.2,1917,'bn','রাজকাহিনী','In August 1947, the British passed a bill regarding the partition of Bengal. Delving into the grim history of the Partition, Mukherjee\'s movie Rajkahini is woven around a border between the two nations that runs through a brothel housing 11 women.','/op7PSses8Q0Rmu8DwKl1F4qtr6D.jpg','2015-10-16',160,'Released','Srijit Mukherji’s Tale of Kings','Rajkahini',371791,1.3414,7.85,'ru4G6EwhK9k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41219,_binary '\0','/cx1TBJARKMvyaRnPArevBdruK8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4948838',5.2,1572,'es','Demonios tus ojos','Oliver, a young film director, discovers on a porn Web site one night that the protagonist of one of the erotic videos is his younger half-sister Aurora. In the process of finding out what she was doing there, Oliver will become fascinated by his sister.','/sU3xrLwWGAnZtkK9JP5CoaJ0ERa.jpg','2017-01-31',94,'Released',NULL,'Sister of Mine',432991,3.5573,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41220,_binary '\0','/kqAuZJn3Oq3z2b0ZYNRwuFKeXsX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4949112',5.5,3206,'ro','Touch Me Not','Together, a filmmaker and her characters venture into a personal research project about intimacy. On the fluid border between reality and fiction, Touch Me Not follows the emotional journeys of Laura, Tómas and Christian, offering a deeply empathic insight into their lives. Craving for intimacy yet also deeply afraid of it, they work to overcome old patterns, defense mechanisms and taboos, to cut the cord and finally be free. Touch Me Not looks at how we can find intimacy in the most unexpected ways, at how to love another without losing ourselves.','/tcz5rD4ChAqNiYDwmoa8yVyRsOY.jpg','2018-10-05',125,'Released','Tell me how you loved me, so I know how to love','Touch Me Not',499155,1.9009,5,'fQ8IKnYwK1I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41221,_binary '\0','/op8VP5bKaRSKO7MxDi4BKOuAeKL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4949290',3.6,2486,'en','Killing Salazar','An elite team of DEA agents are assigned to protect a dangerous drug lord and take refuge in a luxury hotel while they await extraction. They soon find themselves at the center of an ambush as the drug lord\'s former associates launch an explosive assault on the hotel.','/2J7jc9VZroyf4rFlyWJ0mIreu2A.jpg','2017-01-23',100,'Released','In this game, there is only one king.','Killing Salazar',412678,2.7824,4.9,'FRAGnFK-Ch8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41222,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4949324',6.6,2132,'hi','मोहल्ला अस्सी','An idealist Sanskrit teacher deals with issues like commercialization of religion as things around him change and he struggles to keep up. But is he ready to pay the price?','/bGSbaG6AIIaACEMprEsf2xiLgyO.jpg','2018-11-16',120,'Released',NULL,'Mohalla Assi',356399,1.152,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41223,_binary '\0','/rsdFvneLY76JGXQ1rYovyeUtqyc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4950110',6,4703,'en','I\'m Not Ashamed','Based on the journal entries of Rachel Joy Scott, the first student killed in the Columbine High School shooting in 1999.','/P4bxuNq5XT0Wc3MYpoLP52e0P6.jpg','2016-10-21',113,'Released','Her faith would touch the world.','I\'m Not Ashamed',409502,5.6514,7.1,'GjgeFACV7oY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41224,_binary '\0','/tpn4FbxL6oeZh8YtanV1a0k7dLB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4951982',6.6,24028,'en','Kursk','Barents Sea, August 12th, 2000. During a Russian naval exercise, and after suffering a serious accident, the K-141 Kursk submarine sinks with 118 crew members on board. While the few sailors who are still alive barely manage to survive, their families push for accurate information and a British officer struggles to obtain from the Russian government a permit to attempt a rescue before it is late. But general incompetence are against all their efforts.','/1Y09MkMJ8CESSPW4fcbDm9s5cAS.jpg','2018-11-07',118,'Released','Together till the end.','Kursk',401200,5.9884,6.6,'9sUJRrcuJ3E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41225,_binary '\0','/46GikxYW84dRh71sWVY0eRQiHLX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4954522',6.9,97596,'fr','Grave','Stringent vegetarian Justine encounters a decadent, merciless, and dangerously seductive world during her first week at veterinary school. Desperate to fit in, she strays from her principles and eats raw meat for the first time. She soon experiences terrible and unexpected consequences as her true self begins to emerge.','/kc8jT1MAiKM0iwdjAwC5lQrTNry.jpg','2017-03-10',99,'Released','What are you hungry for?','Raw',393519,5.5367,7.025,'cdDZpQGsM5U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41226,_binary '\0','/qO9gSwfWCQogiWMHZC7tEPunRJO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4954660',7,2840,'ja','名探偵コナン 純黒の悪夢（ナイトメア）','On a dark night, the Japanese police is raided by a spy. Different countries\' intelligence agencies - such as England\'s MI6, Germany\'s BDN, and America\'s CIA - as well as the FBI\'s secret files are going to be taken, but public safety officers lead by Tooru Amuro arrive just in time. The spy steals a car and escapes. The spy and Amuro are then locked in a dead heat on the highway, and just as it is about to cause an accident with multiple cars, the spy\'s car is hit by FBI agent Shuichi Akai\'s rifle bullet and falls of the roadway. The next day, Conan and his friends go to a newly-remodeled aquarium in Tokyo. Under the main attraction, a Ferris wheel, Conan finds an attractive woman alone and injured. Her left and right eyes are different colors.','/pXYeXuomi8EpXsXO4cvt5mdfSCD.jpg','2016-04-16',112,'Released','Can you forget your past... no matter how dark it is?','Detective Conan: The Darkest Nightmare',374856,5.354,6.8,'XiEamTc1R5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41227,_binary '\0','/4nOShZSE5V5MWZgZs4NjDcDHiSo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4955162',6,1859,'en','Barbie in Rock \'N Royals','When royal Princess Courtney trades places with famous rock star Erika, two worlds collide while both learn to appreciate new friends and experiences.','/aCKWWQpEijagMEfIOz0vW0aTDmv.jpg','2015-08-12',84,'Released','Raise Your Voice!','Barbie in Rock \'N Royals',355111,6.3864,6.9,'BQfVCzUn0Wo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41228,_binary '\0','/yizHZ1ynp8INr1O6QNIg5yBLGtW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4955566',5.8,5912,'en','Almost Friends','A man in his mid-20s, still living at home with his mother and stepfather, puts all his eggs in one basket: the girl who works at his local coffee shop. The problem is, she has a serious boyfriend. As they become closer, the line between friendship and intimacy is blurred, and the situation forces both to examine where they are in their lives.','/uJMknKxZagbhAYiiMjEaFnsZzRR.jpg','2017-11-17',105,