ోయ్','Forgetful Lucky falls in love with the demure Nandana. But she doesn’t know he has trouble remembering things and her dad does!','/fa2Nv68gcmgZJbKCJV5T45fwA8P.jpg','2015-09-04',145,'Released',NULL,'Bhale Bhale Magadivoy',367553,1.3971,6.481,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41289,_binary '\0','/t5p87zY3MKSOHFIwOBbwmjxA5rS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4993964',5.8,4205,'fr','À fond','A family together with their grandpa go on a vacation, when their new car won\'t stop and it nearly escapes crashing into a hundred cars.','/hrExpoA2E2bCrSZ6VPWHHdzY2y.jpg','2016-11-11',91,'Released',NULL,'Full Speed',382598,3.405,6,'eLjy6HUUyqU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41290,_binary '\0','/zUzBkasy0MhX0LvOzbtxK1dxhxE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4994718',5.7,3840,'tr','Kocan Kadar Konuş: Diriliş','A girl tries to manage the demands of her traditional family\'s wishes and her own as she embarks on a journey to marry the love of her life.','/uIA4o67iG0aeC2Hqy98IEfkTTZi.jpg','2016-01-01',108,'Released',NULL,'Husband Factor: Resurrection',376436,1.7949,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41291,_binary '\0','/nQoTSysJmu9065TylBUeXYf2qHh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4994736',7.3,4524,'tr','Annemin Yarası','Upon turning eight-teen, Salih leaves the orphanage to find his lost family and begins working in a Serbian farm. Suddenly, at the most unexpected moment he has found a home. Will he ever be able to let go of the ghosts of his past and be happy in this new life? As tension escalates disquieting secrets surface. A gripping tale of family, love and identity, My Mother\'s Wound follows Salih as he searches for a trail of hope amongst war-torn lives.','/3HX8UG0Pcrkz8A9kSFjYxbMhLGR.jpg','2016-03-03',120,'Released',NULL,'My Mother\'s Wound',386591,1.222,6.8,'rlqUvpMoAv4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41292,_binary '\0','/4wfA61Mi6E8GncUn8ze4w0jz0Za.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4995540',6.5,47505,'en','Being the Ricardos','Lucille Ball and Desi Arnaz face a crisis that could end their careers and another that could end their marriage.','/oztBLWdRk5gApYmNdADXvXkLT5m.jpg','2021-12-10',132,'Released','A story behind one of the most influential shows of all time.','Being the Ricardos',517088,5.4658,6.5,'WvrjCdtB0zM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41293,_binary '\0','/2s8TbA7w9t4oi87lHI74SNeOc8j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4995590',7.2,2471,'en','Junun','A documentary capturing the creation of the album Junun inside Rajasthan’s 15th-century Mehrangarh Fort. Paul Thomas Anderson follows Jonny Greenwood, Shye Ben Tzur, Nigel Godrich, and the Rajasthan Express as they record a cross-cultural fusion of Indian, Israeli, and Western music.','/tsssow8XqZgP6KhT39Shx45sWBK.jpg','2015-10-08',54,'Released',NULL,'Junun',355600,1.3941,7.2,'dLhSyy6UM94','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41294,_binary '\0','/7XI3DfxdQwvgXTCx29fglvcirQP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4995776',6.6,35522,'en','The Red Sea Diving Resort','Sudan, East Africa, 1980. A team of Israeli Mossad agents plans to rescue and transfer thousands of Ethiopian Jews to Israel. To do so, and to avoid raising suspicions from the inquisitive and ruthless authorities, they establish as a cover a fake diving resort by the Red Sea.','/bTgd1QQFTKdxESevtffAvIvCnz2.jpg','2019-07-28',130,'Released','In the 1980s one partnership saved thousands of lives','The Red Sea Diving Resort',465003,5.3438,6.8,'80WflPMzAcw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41295,_binary '\0','/bYZM4DoHrmzY3oq2qrcXAYQmLNp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4995790',7.1,83578,'sv','The Square','A prestigious Stockholm museum\'s chief art curator finds himself in times of both professional and personal crisis as he attempts to set up a controversial new exhibit.','/pefcv5VNspSK4Dt8doei5bJmmln.jpg','2017-08-25',151,'Released',NULL,'The Square',401246,5.7881,6.741,'EUzRjRv0Ib0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41296,_binary '\0','/rBo0yYQTruIYEuXdyCAyVVlNb2H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4996328',7.4,23131,'en','Ordinary Angels','Inspired by the incredible true story of a hairdresser who single-handedly rallies an entire community to help a widowed father save the life of his critically ill young daughter.','/wdi9kEU4W2UeBTtdqOPZISGMtDR.jpg','2024-02-22',118,'Released','Find your purpose. Make a difference.','Ordinary Angels',974036,8.025,7.674,'Nh9vNnimfTo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41297,_binary '\0','/3GkP6FY0kcuKYFE5eTeYwkiZZaK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4997624',6.4,2422,'en','Summer Love','Maya Sulliway is a struggling single mom who\'s studying to become an accountant. When her young daughter goes off to sleepaway camp, Maya accepts a summer internship at Kizzmit, a tech company known for developing a popular social app, in order to receive college credit.','/dATs3E9PpdAYSIFYBbdsfWjLUEJ.jpg','2016-08-20',84,'Released',NULL,'Summer Love',411081,1.9938,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41298,_binary '\0','/peJmavN1H3Js9SiqQbPNs8Hgwgr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4998632',6.1,114842,'en','Ambulance','Decorated veteran Will Sharp, desperate for money to cover his wife\'s medical bills, asks for help from his adoptive brother Danny. A charismatic career criminal, Danny instead offers him a score: the biggest bank heist in Los Angeles history: $32 million.','/hUbgg3mMSbY9PlpTxBo4IFUVSd6.jpg','2022-03-16',136,'Released','It was supposed to be a simple heist.','Ambulance',763285,15.8338,6.625,'7NU-STboFeI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41299,_binary '\0','/gnaExMrBDw9hhgb1GacWapOV3mV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4998772',4.3,3918,'en','Bedeviled','When a group of teenagers receive an invite to download the latest smartphone app, an intelligent personal assistant, they expect a harmless way to get directions and restaurant recommendations. But the sinister nature of the app soon reveals itself, tormenting the friends by tapping into their darkest fears.','/nj41nDNmpRNQSaHithu8VmOGUDG.jpg','2017-06-28',91,'Released','Don\'t accept his invite.','Bedeviled',407531,2.0075,5.2,'mJ17UDWze7E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41300,_binary '\0','/tWKCzJR24RKFUy8b7bSvPp2VCGL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5000250',6.3,1392,'it','In Fondo Al Bosco','When young Tommi goes missing during a festival in the Dolomites in 2010, his parents are devastated. Five years later, a boy is found with no name or records; DNA tests prove it is Tommi. But while Tommi\'s father Manuel welcomes him back with open arms, his mother Linda is not convinced that it is her son. Suspicion and superstition permeate the pores of this eerie mystery thriller.','/7bDcMSOgKm69KOGOPASf2rfTEmL.jpg','2015-11-19',90,'Released',NULL,'Deep in the Wood',369233,2.1714,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41301,_binary '\0','/nfxVCbJRNRlJwaO5hskuFMmzu6d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5001436',3.1,1678,'en','The Curse of Robert the Doll','A cash strapped student who starts working the night shift at a Museum suspects that one of the exhibits, a creepy vintage doll named Robert, is alive and wreaking havoc after hours.','/kTWfR2YTsKqOhwgIvUxgoN3wa2x.jpg','2016-09-12',79,'Released','He wants to be your friend... forever','The Curse of Robert the Doll',404461,1.5976,3.5,'1IZJoZpt8uY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41302,_binary '\0','/hTLydq9rAuO0Eus1WWqab1tpyGg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5001718',6.3,45190,'en','Everything, Everything','A teenager who\'s lived a sheltered life because she\'s allergic to everything, falls for the boy who moves in next door.','/gukkmf3W5Cev7winxBa8FHvKLql.jpg','2017-05-18',96,'Released','Risk everything... for love.','Everything, Everything',417678,5.0649,7.237,'0LyEE7eR0nM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41303,_binary '