15:21:10.000000'),(41449,_binary '\0','/ql8S2rTkztIUHuwfAuiDeGNXvm2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5087462',6.4,1313,'en','Trailer Park Boys: Drunk, High and Unemployed','You thought the boys would actually sober up? Not until after they change the world.','/5IieFirFkfWMlyJLNV4PaEF7bXT.jpg','2015-12-09',74,'Released','Live In Austin','Trailer Park Boys: Drunk, High and Unemployed',372337,1.7978,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41450,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5087548',4,1789,'en','Gorenos','Miles is haunted by a supernatural entity in the wake of his 18th birthday','/piytICTJDN65xuyuIiIOkQ6qMr8.jpg','2016-06-05',81,'Released','What doesn\'t kill you makes you weaker...','Gorenos',437600,1.3106,4.2,'g3D_0DaPYQM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41451,_binary '\0','/qoJAtAzA4OBi178GWcNWFTx5GIz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5088794',7,3394,'ro','Câini','Roman returns to the land near the Ukrainian border he has just inherited from his grandfather. Fully decided to sell this vast but desolate property, he is warned by the local cop that his grandfather was a local crime lord and his men will not let go of the land - and their smuggling business - without a fight.','/Aw1Mblqim460svfDxcCzXkFeFL8.jpg','2016-09-23',104,'Released',NULL,'Dogs',392812,1.8684,6.3,'uh4iEZ_X5kY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41452,_binary '\0','/mXVo3AhAHFdI1ITbzgk4dOMEQia.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5089534',6.5,4483,'en','Freak Show','The story of teenager Billy Bloom who, despite attending an ultra conservative high school, makes the decision to run for homecoming queen.','/dGkKEnSe2uJit6IINShE9JHyGSt.jpg','2018-01-12',91,'Released',NULL,'Freak Show',440424,3.244,6.739,'drg74wOy8z8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41453,_binary '\0','/eduYYQSmT4NLQlNhsrU9BdSPTFm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5089786',7.5,7549,'es','100 metros','Based on the incredibly true story of a Spanish man with Multiple Sclerosis who tried to finish an Iron-Man: 3,8km swimming, 180km cycling and 42 running. And he was told that he could not make 100 meters.','/3tSFaWi4CGnwBMYD429ocKVeoIM.jpg','2016-11-04',108,'Released',NULL,'100 Meters',402693,3.0672,7.384,'YFzabCeVadg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41454,_binary '\0','/2vFuG6bWGyQUzYS9d69E5l85nIz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5090568',6,134032,'en','Transformers: Rise of the Beasts','When a new threat capable of destroying the entire planet emerges, Optimus Prime and the Autobots must team up with a powerful faction known as the Maximals. With the fate of humanity hanging in the balance, humans Noah and Elena will do whatever it takes to help the Transformers as they engage in the ultimate battle to save Earth.','/gPbM0MK8CP8A174rmUwGsADNYKD.jpg','2023-06-06',127,'Released','Unite or fall.','Transformers: Rise of the Beasts',667538,26.2022,7.162,'WWWDskI46Js','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41455,_binary '\0','/moGGIEojEjPFt5uc2PyJG4GbfKh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5091014',6.5,3956,'en','Jasper Jones','Fourteen-year-old Charlie\'s life changes when Jasper takes his help to dispose of the body of his girlfriend, Laura. He decides to look for the murderer and falls in love with Laura\'s younger sister.','/kB0fpfm0aArdBOdokVXUxS3rxtP.jpg','2017-03-02',105,'Released','A knock at the window. Their lives changed forever.','Jasper Jones',414027,2.2324,6.4,'Ti0XVYcRR4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41456,_binary '\0','/eWUZQXzqkgU9ShrUZt2EiKpMyj0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5091530',5.9,8052,'en','M.F.A.','After the accidental death of her rapist, an art student becomes an unlikely vigilante, set out to avenge college girls whose rapists were not charged.','/ntXFNanjY22rsyXS94FiSYHJFKN.jpg','2017-03-13',92,'Released','Mastering the art of revenge.','M.F.A.',438435,2.5462,6.1,'0QQ3Ync7DbI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41457,_binary '\0','/lNlWxQFrAnbDzOSrXONxII4gKNp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5091538',6.2,3044,'fr','La Folle Histoire de Max et Léon','In this WW2 epic comedy – in the vein of “La Grande Vadrouille” – our two heroes, Max and Léon, two lazy and partier pals, will try by all possible means to avoid going in the battle zone… This will lead the duo to demented and wild adventures.','/kegrl8KAkQerucZMsbG66afFeDD.jpg','2016-11-01',98,'Released',NULL,'Max & Leon',392142,2.257,6.3,'Ca7LnSCk33g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41458,_binary '\0','/iVQifEAWEGA5ajuTjLFv3kFSIOK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5091612',7.3,7142,'fr','Un sac de billes','At the beginning of the 1940s, in a France occupied by Nazi forces, lived the Jewish Joffo family. Happy and tight-knit, she sees her future darken when all members of the family are forced to wear the yellow star. Fearing the worst, the parents organized their family to flee to the free zone in the south of the country. Maurice, twelve years old, and Joseph, ten years old, will therefore leave alone in order to maximize their chances of finding their older brothers already settled in Nice. The brothers left to their own devices demonstrate an incredible amount of cleverness, courage, and ingenuity to escape the enemy invasion and to try to reunite their family once again.','/kjVPBXfo7frULyUzQ8NRPAflP8G.jpg','2017-01-18',113,'Released','Home Is Where Family Is','A Bag of Marbles',398924,4.0785,7.795,'vIPluU4V03o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41459,_binary '\0','/y6Zh9ICQDjfwI4kChGzDmq9Ku7p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5092380',5.9,8476,'fr','Dans la brume','When a deadly mist engulfs Paris, people find refuge in the upper floors of the buildings. With no information, no electricity and hardly any supplies, Mathieu, Anna and their daughter Sarah try to survive the disaster.','/hjePJQDv7GitTrEU67TANuhbytv.jpg','2018-04-04',90,'Released','Don\'t breathe. Don\'t stop.','Just a Breath Away',477489,4.6638,6.3,'4eU52Gh3P08','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41460,_binary '\0','/zNQVEWDpxjRuI6dggo6hS6FOyM1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5092484',5.4,2574,'en','Beneath Us','The American Dream becomes a nightmare for a group of undocumented day laborers hired by a wealthy couple. What they expect to be their biggest payday turns into a terrifying fight for survival.','/uqo4lQ5n0hGSdztBLURleHUDnmu.jpg','2020-03-06',82,'Released','They came for the American Dream. They Got A Nightmare.','Beneath Us',590575,2.3485,5.7,'465Go4NzIf4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41461,_binary '\0','/lfMtVr5hkFeGy4dMaEf3XUQr76d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5093026',7.2,97276,'en','Papillon','Henri “Papillon” Charrière, a safecracker from the Parisian underworld, is wrongfully convicted and sentenced to life imprisonment in the penal colony of French Guiana, where he forges a strong friendship with Louis Dega, a counterfeiter who needs his protection.','/ahF5c6vyP8HWMqIwlhecbRALkjq.jpg','2017-09-07',134,'Released','The greatest escape adventure ever told','Papillon',433498,8.8474,7.319,'xqj7XOv9mC8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41462,_binary '\0','/iYdgEUE2W2aJkgqfSjf1x3gFfuV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5095030',7,506450,'en','Ant-Man and the Wasp','Just when his time under house arrest is about to end, Scott Lang once again puts his freedom at risk to help Hope van Dyne and Dr. Hank Pym dive into the quantum realm and try to accomplish, against time and any chance of success, a very dangerous rescue mission.','/cFQEO687n1K6umXbInzocxcnAQz.jpg','2018-07-04',119,'Released','Real heroes. Not actual size.','Ant-Man and the Wasp',363088,22.9413,6.895,'8_rTIAOohas','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41463,_binary '\0','/fcNno43tiFnaycu1mO9TqfbPL45.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5095076',5.6,2409,'en','Wardriver','He’s a Wardriver: a hacker who steals from banks, not people—until he’s noticed. Now the money turns violent, and the woman caught in it could save him or kill them both.','/rBZA12Hf4yZZgud6iPuFU49L7zk.jpg','2026-03-04',93,'Released','Hacking. Stealing. Surviving.','Wardriver',938150,5.9161,7.427,'7Fcbg_pJbrY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41464,_binary '\0','/jgxLhp4QjfVvIDT9GPusIESoEgz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5095506',8.1,6817,'tr','Tight Dress','Lisa is a young designer from Paris. She is starting to work as an independent designer and she wants to make a fashion show. A friend of her, a girl named Hêlin persuades Lisa to make the show in Diyarbakir, telling her that in there you can find the most beautiful girls to parade as models.','/28SEkHke2JHbrICS2ISx8kb6j8W.jpg','2016-12-28',77,'Released',NULL,'Tight Dress',528885,0.9355,10,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41465,_binary '\0','/2Jmqs0uCi6JFw5HFm9lKOQKzVpV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5095510',7.2,4294,'en','Stick Man','Stick Man lives in the family tree with his Stick Lady Love and their stick children three, and he\'s heading on an epic adventure across the seasons. Will he get back to his family in time for Christmas?','/hChFSATMxo9cDpDGl5iit5dx7yy.jpg','2015-12-07',27,'Released',NULL,'Stick Man',374251,4.1874,6.8,'K7SLexWe6ko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41466,_binary '\0','/AdLmv5OdHzAb00aHoE5aPVpFgMl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5096470',5.6,23458,'en','Love Wedding Repeat','While trying to make his sister\'s wedding day go smoothly, Jack finds himself juggling an angry ex-girlfriend, an uninvited guest with a secret, a misplaced sleep sedative, and the girl that got away in alternate versions of the same day.','/u0MV99rB1hv8tkjtBJHfwIGCVKD.jpg','2020-04-10',100,'Released','One wedding. One simple plan. What could possibly go wrong?','Love Wedding Repeat',624808,2.903,5.664,'x6CyqhYsLqo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41467,_binary '