,'Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41515,_binary '\0','/lSSHgrnjQf3jC6YNbKmGUE0z1J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5124096',6,3047,'ta','தங்கமகன்','The happiness of Tamizh and his middle-class family is shattered when his dad commits suicide. The youngster tries to understand why his father took this extreme step and clear his name.','/mRNbc52rDcFrr3EnIcHY1tVTqUB.jpg','2015-12-18',121,'Released',NULL,'Thangamagan',368017,1.231,5.8,'1DYWEC_Rfy0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41516,_binary '\0','/1jhCnDSNoV7JmC2cf5qQG2lorn8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5125414',4.7,1876,'bn','আমাজন অভিযান','Anna, an Italian woman, approaches Shankar, an explorer, to accompany her in search of the golden city of El Dorado. He accepts the offer and sets out on an adventure through the Amazon.','/6nOozjdFiyl4V7i9xasULL9FIc4.jpg','2017-12-22',140,'Released',NULL,'Amazon Obhijaan',496681,1.1101,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41517,_binary '\0','/crBW5hKJk8BzsGMMTzTBYFTDapd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5125894',6.2,8335,'en','Poms','After moving to a retirement community, loner Martha eventually befriends her fun-loving neighbor, Sheryl, and forms a cheerleading club for young-at-heart seniors, though they face roadblocks along the way.','/m2ksKdmWIoUh3GJfu9oEBLorjAJ.jpg','2019-05-09',91,'Released','It’s never too late to chase a dream.','Poms',574241,3.9769,6.6,'-9PypHxfY_M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41518,_binary '\0','/nAQQEkrgvntAO8zwJHVlTBFtMlx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5125930',6.5,2253,'pt','O Silêncio do Céu','After being a victim of rape within their own home, Diana chooses to keep the trauma secret. Mario, her husband, also has something to hide. The silence takes the couple\'s account over the day turns gradually into a peculiar form of violence.','/bE5cuGJEEM5nXSGMCcfhYPw8UtQ.jpg','2016-09-22',102,'Released',NULL,'The Silence of the Sky',413388,2.3941,6.401,'9eDlO73C5h4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41519,_binary '\0','/jobrjnPjNM4bekB9VtmkvKRjBTf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5126274',6.3,2180,'pt','O Animal Cordial','A restaurant owner going over the edge when an armed robbery is attempted at his establishment. He holds everyone captive at gunpoint – criminals and customers alike – and situations corrode into a nightmare state, guided by manipulation and raw compulsion.','/o7TZODLR9pMhKypYclFDdo1Z68o.jpg','2018-08-09',98,'Released',NULL,'Friendly Beast',461774,1.7781,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41520,_binary '\0','/iUH1dWoIR1eoE6sEzwhH49T0sE0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5126922',6.7,12160,'en','The Pirates of Somalia','After an inspiring chance encounter with his idol, rookie journalist Jay Bahadur uproots his life and moves to Somalia looking for the story of a lifetime. Hooking up with a local fixer, he attempts to get embedded with the local Somali pirates, only to quickly find himself in over his head.','/a8dlDPwo9mnorurL6ukIpyHZZd7.jpg','2017-12-08',117,'Released',NULL,'The Pirates of Somalia',394537,3.5281,6.8,'tYAAaVP31gs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41521,_binary '\0','/yyWMsx7mqnHtuOk7afwXuKONucH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5127398',6.8,3713,'pl','Planeta Singli','He is one of the top celebrities in the country: a fast-talking TV host, who can joke his way out of any situation. Women want to be with him, men want to be like him. He is looking for a new topic to discuss in his popular talk-show. She is a teacher at a musical school - a timid girl looking for Mr. Perfect on an internet dating site. He will help her realise her potential and teach her how to recognise various types of men for what they are, she will teach him what real life is about. The show will become a huge hit. It seems they are destined to fall in love and be together, but one day she actually does meet Mr. Perfect on the net.','/7bePLXgvcpj2xlQfT9CUwVE7QLy.jpg','2016-02-05',136,'Released',NULL,'Planet Single',383682,1.8192,6.6,'g6idUc7bPCw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41522,_binary '\0','/f5uwFqPLnjJWF3xDjFPpfMvWGES.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5128266',5.2,1852,'ta','பத்து எண்றதுக்குள்ள','A driving instructor is tasked with taking Shakila, an orphan, from Chennai to Mussoorie. However, he falls in love with Shakila and tries to save her when he learns the truth about his task.','/jZx7x4JUadJBa8AFZYsc5gN5k8E.jpg','2015-10-21',144,'Released',NULL,'10 Endrathukulla',330414,1.329,4.5,'3vygWI0XK4E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41523,_binary '\0','/AbVxDd2901CGVjybb504v78Ld7n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5128328',7.2,5775,'ta','நானும் ரௌடிதான்','Pandian, the son of a cop and a wannabe rowdy, falls in love with Kadambarai, a hearing-impaired girl, who wants him to take on Killivalavan, a gangster-politician who has murdered her parents.','/1fWnzmBxZMEJZZATogoMPebazYB.jpg','2015-10-21',140,'Released',NULL,'Naanum Rowdydhaan',320910,1.3932,6.292,'6Fj_fzW_BOo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41524,_binary '\0','/whcs30g1D0Xd5Fd2wV4Q0ELbAPH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5128826',5.2,2040,'en','The Alchemist Cookbook','Self-made chemist Sean, a recluse living in an old trailer in the woods, suffers from pill-popping delusions of fortune. When his manic attempts at cracking the ancient secret of alchemy go awry he unleashes something far more sinister and dangerous.','/mD37S35Ewj6gJpJjfeBEX2qlzsR.jpg','2016-03-13',82,'Released',NULL,'The Alchemist Cookbook',381063,1.313,5.1,'q42qZ1oKnfw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41525,_binary '\0','/bcPPFjFwTIbdU17e6DocRqZXDEu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5129510',6.8,2874,'fr','La Mort de Louis XIV','August 1715. After going for a walk, Louis XIV feels a pain in his leg. The next days, the king keeps fulfilling his duties and obligations, but his sleep is troubled and he has a serious fever. He barely eats and weakens increasingly. This is the start of the slow agony of the greatest king of France, surrounded by his relatives and doctors.','/uEgmmAnz5qlW43XFeGbcjI1wrAz.jpg','2016-11-02',115,'Released',NULL,'The Death of Louis XIV',371859,1.7522,6.5,'BzfNF1t5DTk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41526,_binary '\0','/hrchlLkjT0ejyp7tWIprCZxRHm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5129682',5.6,10051,'en','King Cobra','It’s 2006, YouTube is in its infancy, and internet porn is still behind a paywall. Taking the stage name Brent Corrigan, a fresh-faced, wannabe adult video performer is molded into a star by Stephen, a closeted gay porn mogul who runs the skin flick empire Cobra Video from his seemingly ordinary suburban home.','/sEun5y2q3aIrmpIAAhtS9G2JwH0.jpg','2016-10-21',93,'Released','Sex is not a game, it\'s business.','King Cobra',390584,4.6116,5.8,'9aRRbm16PC8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41527,_binary '\0','/fEw70ZKXrrzg5d6UsguagSPOG5o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5129818',7.4,5477,'de','Im Strahl der Sonne','Over the course of one year, this film follows the life of an ordinary Pyongyang family whose daughter was chosen to take part in Day of the Shining Star (Kim Jong-il\'s birthday) celebration. While North Korean government wanted a propaganda film, the director kept on filming between the scripted scenes. The ritualized explosions of color and joy contrast sharply with pale everyday reality, which is not particularly terrible, but rather quite surreal.','/1ijxeCOlQHRvG3KA9oPxGGRi39s.jpg','2015-10-30',110,'Released',NULL,'Under the Sun',369769,2.2853,7.192,'8QRFx5pXb_M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41528,_binary '\0','/yi85CYTY8mypILefEWT6ppnaWqF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5131906',4.9,3159,'en','Fender Bender','In a small New Mexico town, teenager Hilary gets into a fender bender and innocently exchanges her personal information with the other driver, a terrifying and bizarre serial killer who stalks the country’s endless miles of roads and streets with his old rusty car, hungrily searching for his next unsuspecting victim.','/92VjZqSkaUDpXvrAiMZRGIxBFLU.jpg','2016-05-23',91,'Released','A Crash Course In Terror!','Fender Bender',397278,1.8102,5,'tHsOUeIVwd0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41529,_binary '\0','/wsD8nxCRrVyGLsBLQhVgtTdl6Kr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5133308',7,16951,'es','Al final del túnel','A paraplegic computer engineer who moves in a wheelchair and works in his basement starts hearing noises and voices of bank-robbers.','/gKfm5UqRwvoNiImFQLEH2WDMK5S.jpg','2016-04-21',120,'Released','Risk everything.','At the End of the Tunnel',394374,4.2525,7.042,'fPc0SQyD-ac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41530,_binary '\0','/csRHWprXYOf6IxADtskBxhDyVT0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5133392',6.4,1287,'ru','Зоология','Natasha is a lonely, middle-aged admin employee at the zoo who still lives at home with her mother. One day her life is turned upside down when she discovers she has grown a tail…','/3RuFcjiabI701XCAl9Tzp2tZ2XA.jpg','2016-11-24',87,'Released','It\'s Never Too Late To Grow A Tail','Zoology',405670,0.9594,5.2,'3gYjXgV3lxw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41531,_binary '\0','/xlrfVXG27AND092TU8XKPWTyGn1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5133572',6.9,6633,'en','Crown for Christmas','Allie Foster, a struggling New York artist, reluctantly accepts to act as a governess to a rebellious Princess Theodora of Winshire. When Allie forms an unlikely bond with the princess, she attracts the attention of the handsome King Maximillian, who’s facing an arranged marriage against his heart’s wishes. As Christmas Eve draws near, Allie finds herself swept up in romance, royalty and the spirit of the holidays.','/7lRL9n6Zvvl7BMpGzELvzWJx2df.jpg','2015-11-27',84,'Released',NULL,'Crown for Christmas',360603,4.0673,6.9,'oRZf8-SoQ6I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41532,_binary '\0','/rwUorXcUSTLo0CJo48JEenhzjRR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5133810',6.3,5853,'en','12 Gifts of Christmas','When Anna Parisi, an unemployed fine arts painter, is unable to make ends meet, she is hired to become a personal Christmas shopper for Marc, an uptight corporate exec. As they begin working together, Marc learns that Christmas giving has less to do with the amount of money spent and more to do with the importance of the gift, while Anna discovers she might find success as an artist in a way she never expected. The best gift of all of course is the love they discover with one another.','/2gBuhcMRL03OLd5IOD5cVFe8gBv.jpg','2015-11-26',84,'Released',NULL,'12 Gifts of Christmas',363483,2.6836,6,'TLwh4vgAyy8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41533,_binary '\0','/zWzveM0K7M4FdTXJxWenwVGrINh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5134254',6.2,1359,'en','Drunk Bus','A directionless, young campus bus driver and a punk rock Samoan security guard named Pineapple form an unlikely kinship as they navigate the unpredictable late shift shit show known as the \"drunk bus.\" Together, they break out of their endless loop and into a world of uncertainty, excitement and incredibly poor decision-making.','/dBkljyGgsLiYCwIveQaktbae9WV.jpg','2021-05-21',101,'Released',NULL,'Drunk Bus',659360,1.7002,5.7,'gu1MtdMRFTs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41534,_binary '\0','/6XgfCIphRPU39NVBdR8XsOyb5Xh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5135532',7,1344,'en','Garage Sale Mystery: Guilty Until Proven Innocent','When Jenn\'s old pal Sandra becomes the prime suspect in a murder case, it\'ll be up to her to discover who done it before time runs out.','/rcTCWsFNW7OM67WLvPKUOf3Kq1e.jpg','2016-01-03',84,'Released',NULL,'Garage Sale Mystery: Guilty Until Proven Innocent',371182,1.8909,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41535,_binary '\0','/jTpEhrUSqomu3UdMXP8og7d7dOe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5137380',7.8,3546,'te','కంచె','A love story played out against the backdrop of World War II.','/xKYefD66zwrx2DbGSWoB5rjjmk6.jpg','2015-10-22',119,'Released',NULL,'Kanche',364795,1.2098,6.087,'FtcdflQAOs4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41536,_binary '\0','/o8u0NyEigCEaZHBdCYTRfXR8U4i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5140878',6.5,172975,'en','Annabelle: Creation','Several years after the tragic death of their little girl, a doll maker and his wife welcome a nun and several girls from a shuttered orphanage into their home, soon becoming the target of the doll maker\'s possessed creation—Annabelle.','/tb86j8jVCVsdZnzf8I6cIi65IeM.jpg','2017-08-03',110,'Released','You don\'t know the real story.','Annabelle: Creation',396422,14.4112,6.6,'EjZkJa6Z-SY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41537,_binary '\0','/5CLjBQ6Cvl0hq2V0hbok3X1lXYG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5141042',6.9,1703,'bn','শুধু তোমারই জন্য','Adi is devastated after his girlfriend\'s death while Nayantara is left in shock after her boyfriend leaves her. Adi and Nayantara get married to each other but find it difficult to forget their past.','/rrfUbUqmufmMrMcBQEwrdTtIQHo.jpg','2015-10-16',149,'Released',NULL,'Shudhu Tomari Jonyo',378495,1.4297,7.875,'m23Jv9veV_o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41538,_binary '\0','/eGpKp3M1u7dyaGyiNLyoJ66rHtn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5141686',7.4,1395,'en','Jago: A Life Underwater','Jago tells the story of an 80 year old sea nomad called Rohani who has spent his life plying the waters of South East Asia’s Coral Triangle. The story is told entirely from Rohani’s perspective, against the spectacular backdrop of the Togian Islands, and recreates events that capture the turning points in his life, as a hunter and as a man. We were able to bring Rohani’s past experiences to life by working closely with his family and friends in the village where he grew up. These are the people you see representing Rohani in the film at various stages in his life. Story telling is a big part of Bajau culture, and a way of preserving traditions through generations, so everyone was very enthusiastic about what we were trying to do and brought lots of ideas of their own, especially Rohani. Although he had never had a camera pointed at him, it certainly wasn’t the first time he’d sat around telling stories. We were just lucky that he let us capture it on film.','/fURZxyednytT8BdEZyIVZCqxZvB.jpg','2015-09-24',48,'Released',NULL,'Jago: A Life Underwater',419109,1.3032,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41539,_binary '\0','/AhwEkJY1RRna8M0dcSAhR9aCeF4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5143226',5.2,17979,'en','12 Feet Deep','Two sisters are trapped under the fiberglass cover of an Olympic sized public pool and must brave the cold and each other to survive the harrowing night.','/y83L5OM2bQsaEm6H2bkgBDEggjx.jpg','2018-11-08',85,'Released','100,000 gallons of water. 50 meters wide. NO. WAY. OUT.','12 Feet Deep',459928,4.4086,6,'jxL67tUPt7Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41540,_binary '\0','/nQFhEuvc2vFyASQ4TY0S1yJErYT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5143586',6.6,1388,'tr','Rüzgarda Salınan Nilüfer','Handan and Korhan a middle-aged couple who live their lives in one of istanbul\'s best neighborhoods. Handan constantly invents things for herself in order to fill her life. Handan, imitates her friend Sermin and starts writing! But this desire, which is innocent in the first place, will become jealous over time and diverge in different ways.','/eTWkwrrYQ0BUVKp2M49iyYGXYuW.jpg','2016-09-23',108,'Released',NULL,'The Swaying Waterlily',422040,1.4102,6.2,'9bAlLvPiAjg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41541,_binary '\0','/61n9PN5Puj4uYfa6Zb5O9WHcPNd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5143700',6,1649,'fr','La guerre des tuques 3D','To amuse themselves during the winter school break, the kids in a small village decide to have a massive snowball fight. Luke and Sophie, both 11 years old, become the leaders of the opposing sides. Sophie and her cohort defend an elaborate snow fort against the assault of Luke’s horde. Whichever side occupies the fort at the end of the winter break, wins. But what starts out as pure youthful fun and enthusiasm deteriorates into a more serious conflict. Joy is restored when all the children decide to attack the fort rather than each other and happily destroy every last bit of the snow fort.','/dC1rjdwynUgeZIexSqOUGM3kNpX.jpg','2015-11-12',82,'Released','War, war, it\'s not a reason to hurt each other!','Snowtime!',366656,2.5929,6.1,'8NVHUxcAYGI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41542,_binary '\0','/32EMFV8Ms3GIGz9OyVthkUJmhJJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5143890',4.1,1459,'en','Justice','A U.S. Marshal seeking justice for his brother\'s murder defends a small town from a corrupt Mayor and his henchmen with intents to revive the civil war.','/uqvjf3HOGiWLgUB6h15yKb2p2x6.jpg','2017-09-15',99,'Released','Revenge has a new name','Justice',453807,1.9243,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41543,_binary '\0','/sGIfwDYvfU0h1G7pGWEhdEi9hT2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5144174',6.8,41646,'en','The Dry','Aaron Falk returns to his drought-stricken hometown to attend a tragic funeral. But his return opens a decades-old wound - the unsolved death of a teenage girl.','/zM12bfL2TEqVRXjiQIFUWUMLcCg.jpg','2021-01-01',117,'Released','Where the truth lies.','The Dry',567797,5.3366,6.779,'7X7KkP68RZE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41544,_binary '\0','/akZPui8RjkyIaglxLwnywczrOYK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5146068',6.5,2010,'pl','Wszystkie nieprzespane noce','What does it mean to be awake in a world that seems satisfied to be asleep? Kris and Michal push their experiences of life and love to a breaking point as they restlessly roam the city streets in search of answers, adrift in the euphoria and uncertainty of youth.','/fvvJW25w6ooWAnBHdA9QBIm6J35.jpg','2016-11-04',100,'Released',NULL,'All These Sleepless Nights',376386,1.2006,6.3,'toRRACvGp60','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41545,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5147042',6.8,1379,'en','Unseen','In 2009, police discovered the bodies of eleven women decomposing in and around the home of known sex offender. With unprecedented access to the surviving victims, UNSEEN looks into how this killing spree went unnoticed for so long.','/uaFNoyhyQeNpwvlOEo0cEzsyznT.jpg','2016-04-01',77,'Released',NULL,'Unseen',434784,1.3528,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41546,_binary '\0','/sEyYwNHJ6AO1Wnh0JuRTBmlZ8No.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5147214',6.3,17650,'id','Headshot','A young man washes ashore, his memory gone - but his past comes back to haunt him after he is nursed back to health and his killing ability is needed when he takes on a powerful drug lord.','/lGamnocYl4omp1txOs21OjEmgux.jpg','2016-09-24',118,'Released','They should have killed him.','Headshot',403605,4.0824,6.4,'uDQFd1iQyjw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41547,_binary '\0','/xkliTZgHx042oDy4qJwCK1PvvUg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5149490',5.7,5812,'en','Gwen','A mysterious — and suspicious — run of ill fortune plagues a teenage girl and her mother and sister on their hillside farm in this folk story set in the dark hills of Wales during the industrial revolution.','/3VeWyKSyWjZ3fMh2VX1UX2dviQw.jpg','2018-07-12',84,'Released',NULL,'Gwen',543768,1.0807,5.5,'2ROhan7hfPI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41548,_binary '\0','/AhkirfgU32n0D1uxpaGYJEKy2Hu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5151570',7.1,38084,'en','Mrs. Harris Goes to Paris','A 1950s London cleaning lady falls in love with an haute couture dress by Christian Dior and decides to gamble everything for the sake of this folly.','/eUg0HDLhTEDcXGBU2iK6QRBILv4.jpg','2022-07-15',116,'Released','Follow your dream.','Mrs. Harris Goes to Paris',754609,9.5418,7.296,'iO9JcPbbmAA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41549,_binary '\0','/fDJh0w6RhekyTjx72XpSkcj4og7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5151716',6.6,4877,'en','Tony Robbins: I Am Not Your Guru','Granted unprecedented access, director Berlinger captures renowned life and business strategist Tony Robbins behind the scenes of his mega seminar Date with Destiny, pulling back the curtain on this life-altering and controversial event, the zealous participants and the man himself.','/3aGyfLk9QHta2Ccfs51TdHZEYWG.jpg','2016-07-15',115,'Released','Our entire life changes in a moment.','Tony Robbins: I Am Not Your Guru',376426,2.1129,6.4,'HUHMZf3qwsQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41550,_binary '\0','/dZkhe0DqyRHdwhtddYUi0OJyXXU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5152640',3.9,2496,'en','Shortwave','A modern and unrelentingly tense psychological thriller based on a theory of the origins of shortwave radio frequencies, Shortwave is an unnerving reminder that some stones are best left unturned.','/eAZ0TQLmrlkB5AaAf5NiR0Gaba6.jpg','2016-06-04',85,'Released',NULL,'Shortwave',401121,1.2162,4.6,'vy9-4LOTf-0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41551,_binary '\0','/zZLvILFQO2RrW0JsMDOonFS0gl4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5153236',6.1,8454,'en','Hampstead','Emily Walters is an American widow living a peaceful, uneventful existence in the idyllic Hampstead Village of London, when she meets local recluse, Donald Horner. For 17 years, Donald has lived—wildly yet peacefully—in a ramshackle hut near the edge of the forest. When Emily learns his home is the target of developers who will stop at nothing to remove him, saving Donald and his property becomes her personal mission. Despite his gruff exterior and polite refusals for help, Emily is drawn to him—as he is to her—and what begins as a charitable cause evolves into a relationship that will grow even as the bulldozers close in.','/svyFdV8QrOyheU2lEDuBnrcCQT5.jpg','2017-06-23',102,'Released',NULL,'Hampstead',441728,2.9664,6.049,'wsJv_bJBHSY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41552,_binary '\0','/wnZIPnZHnHjdNuH4LEumkrDsuHr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5153288',6.3,7033,'en','Backstabbing for Beginners','An idealistic young employee at the U.N. investigates the grisly murder of his predecessor – and uncovers a vast global conspiracy that may involve his own boss.','/WVaq7KNnittRDkgmb58DaDEnK3.jpg','2018-01-18',108,'Released','If you dig too deep, you may not like what comes up','Backstabbing for Beginners',476678,3.5627,6.2,'P3GdyaVQ20I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41553,_binary '\0','/qziKhMyrVqj567jlbj55GpBdKf9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5153860',4.3,1579,'en','Female Fight Squad','A former fighter reluctantly returns to the life she abandoned in order to help her sister survive the sadistic world of illegal fighting and the maniac who runs it.','/iI9c8XNdPuwB4RYbHMd62QNhoRK.jpg','2017-03-16',90,'Released','Revenge Rules','Female Fight Squad',440777,2.3289,6.1,'maAb7b_Kmss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41554,_binary '\0','/lpARmzSzhb1g5wWpXjrldpAL3ew.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5153956',4.9,9053,'en','Last Sentinel','Set in the future on a war-ravaged Earth, four exhausted soldiers man Sentinel - a remote military base in a vast ocean that separates two warring continents. While their tour of duty ended three months ago, the relief crew still hasn\'t arrived and as the empty weeks turn to months, paranoia descends, testing relationships to breaking point...','/pD1o9B0ibENdNroYrBCQemG2jnr.jpg','2023-03-17',112,'Released','Is there anybody out there?','Last Sentinel',516806,5.2704,5.315,'P1XLouhrxQ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41555,_binary '\0','/nMOEd4RkXd2WZTUrUivWYyuXazD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5154288',5.9,9406,'en','Prevenge','A pregnant widow, believing herself to be guided by her unborn child, embarks on a homicidal rampage.','/5OWrwvKscVc7Md0IvtTLZmjXbKt.jpg','2017-02-10',89,'Released','Killing for two.','Prevenge',395982,2.3411,5.523,'8bEPU_58akI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41556,_binary '\0','/tAE1vkxYk8CSI8VMTg7eYtOIQOR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5154466',3.8,3681,'tr','Bizans Oyunları: Geym of Bizans','Fed up with South America’s heat, the Maya, lured by rumors of golden soil, migrate to Anatolia, settling near Bağcılar and blending their advanced techniques with Turkish tribal culture. Their rapid rise, however, alarms Byzantium: peace-loving Emperor Klitor III is an avid Maya admirer, but his scheming wife, Empress Klitorya V, and his brother Muhteris conspire to eliminate Klitor, then abduct all Maya women to the imperial dungeons. Their twisted plan? By “improving” Byzantine lineage with Maya genetics while the men take local wives—“only God should know loneliness”—they intend to dilute the Maya’s flawless DNA into common stock.','/qsk4vQaQtMhG9b8kp7pd48pysa4.jpg','2016-01-15',101,'Released',NULL,'Bizans Oyunları: Geym of Bizans',389702,0.8875,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41557,_binary '\0','/kLLlAYn9a9fsf4Xiz1Jtb1haD1x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5154896',6.4,4561,'de','Der geilste Tag','The overambitious pianist Andi and the more laid back Benno have one thing in common: They will both die soon. So the two of them decide to have the most awesome day before its too late.','/kd02ybOkAfmLaZDdAJL8DXT6ix8.jpg','2016-02-25',113,'Released',NULL,'The Most Beautiful Day',373889,2.6859,7.009,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41558,_binary '\0','/dA7YLnc5ztTGiVPWz3GsaMRRz9r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5155780',6.2,41061,'en','The Discovery','In the near future, due to a breakthrough scientific discovery by Dr. Thomas Harbor, there is now definitive proof of an afterlife. While countless people have chosen suicide to reset their existence, others try to decide what it all means. Among them is Dr. Harbor\'s son Will, who has arrived at his father\'s isolated compound with a mysterious young woman named Isla. There, they discover the strange acolytes who help Dr. Harbor with his experiments.','/nLIDouFvreSrs8xK62zuvpEPDw0.jpg','2017-03-31',102,'Released',NULL,'The Discovery',376134,4.4993,6.3,'z9j6WcdU-ts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41559,_binary '\0','/7a9sOXKdRxXFHIVHqg7FNu7liU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5156274',6.4,3524,'en','Cardboard Gangsters','A group of young Cardboard Gangsters attempt to gain control of the drug trade in Darndale, chasing the glorified lifestyle of money, power and sex.','/p8xEFeBpEYxA4rUYEvEYUaeYDcG.jpg','2017-04-22',88,'Released','Take back what\'s yours','Cardboard Gangsters',462445,1.2993,6.4,'paJYAk6Lkmc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41560,_binary '\0','/ztcIb7dmJvRigpQsBfV5bpnIyAs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5156746',6.2,6495,'hi','फोर्स २','ACP Yashvardhan teams up RAW Agent KK to bring down the master mind terrorist, Shiv.','/kiPHlQm1EV6yruDQWaocj0C8waY.jpg','2016-11-18',123,'Released','A Dead Soldier is a Martyr.. A Dead Spy is a Traitor','Force 2',426558,2.1042,6.7,'r4O4Xec60_k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41561,_binary '\0','/1W7dcVP217NES85DbSD7BHxJkPd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5156770',6.2,2120,'en','Charming Christmas','Meredith Rossman has made Rossman\'s Department store her entire life, not leaving any time for Christmas or romance. But when she is roped into donning the store\'s antique Mrs. Claus outfit to play Mrs. Claus at Rossman\'s famous Santaville, her life takes some unexpected turns. Through the help of the suit and the charming store Santa, Nick, Meredith rekindles her love of Christmas, the store, their employees and possibly even begins a new love with Nick.','/kDPaywj4BrVRq8p183dBURhYR1J.jpg','2015-11-08',84,'Released',NULL,'Charming Christmas',363476,2.3202,5.6,'hqMPadkvHMM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41562,_binary '\0','/txL5DLuBi3GtXR4Cka1ofTR1IqS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5156910',2.3,1392,'en','Ouija 3: The Charlie Charlie Challenge','An Eccentric haunted house owner invites a group of hapless teens to play the terrifying game known as Charlie Charlie, overnight in the many attractions his house has to offer. While the game is meant to be a mere spectacle of spooky fun, it soon turns into a true nightmare leaving the teenagers, and the owner, battling for their lives.','/aKxNpZDq4qp1mYkiwst4MTaKMIW.jpg','2016-10-21',85,'Released','Play the game if you dare','Ouija 3: The Charlie Charlie Challenge',431392,2.0348,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41563,_binary '\0','/77or0xGz5jpcBEFuok6FnPzsZzY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5157030',5.7,1292,'cn','陀地驅魔人','Street-smart exorcist Fatt has an unique method of dealing with vengeful spirits: He negotiates with them and persuades them to let go of their grudges. After recordings of his exorcisms go viral, Fatt attracts the attentions of a murderous spirit who’s targeting mediums, as well as a troublesome reporter who takes great interest in Fatt and his close relationship with a female spirit.','/fxuF3gfMy8Qvd49M9W7BYh5FduN.jpg','2015-11-26',103,'Released','Gangster by day, exorcist by night','Keeper of Darkness',371451,1.8863,5.774,'yOfaCTrbGq4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41564,_binary '\0','/7qGosswKTj9VWgB6Rk4jrnJlQtJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5157052',4.4,2613,'en','Nightworld','When former LAPD officer Brett Anderson takes a job as head of security at an old apartment building in Sofia, Bulgaria, he soon begins to experience a series of bizarre and terrifying events. Soon after delving into the building\'s sinister history and investigate its shadowy owners and past employees, Brett uncovers a malevolent force nestled deep in the bowels of the building that will do anything to be set free into our world.','/a35L3GnAVEXr8fozEbWcYUcvYEm.jpg','2017-05-29',92,'Released','The afterlife is darker than you think','Nightworld',464757,1.4428,4.4,'0T7jHCQX-Xs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41565,_binary '\0','/519qFDWmi48RgHLd1TFy4wOXs4n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5157326',7,4510,'de','Western','A group of German construction workers set out for a foreign construction site in the Bulgarian province. The strange country awakens adventure feelings among the men. At the same time, they are confronted with their prejudices and mistrust. For two of the men, a nearby village becomes the stage for a competition for the recognition and favor of the village.','/tLWwFrU0JFHIzQzxDpF8CKxfeey.jpg','2017-08-24',121,'Released',NULL,'Western',452000,1.1631,6.612,'p8f8zHDwv_c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41566,_binary '\0','/5Mfbh6kW4akjjfCZJLwt6Tbfe2G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5157456',4.6,5492,'ru','Викинг','The early Middle Ages. A time of heavy swords and dark blood law. The ruling clan is in discord. The guilt for the accidental death of the brother has fallen on the Grand Duke. According to the law, revenge must be taken by the younger brother, a bastard. For the refusal to kill, he has to pay with eve- rything he had, because “for peace you need more swords than for a war”...','/xxl0YHkYHHCetgnG2fgezUaQiHc.jpg','2016-12-29',133,'Released','Blood laws call for revenge!','Viking',369698,3.1054,4.861,'5FWtcorm7hA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41567,_binary '\0','/a4bLN32DOZkKiJCky97lfNNX9k5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5157682',6.9,9047,'fr','L\'Ascension','A true story of Samy, native of La Courneuve, who is out of love for Nadia, decides to climb Mount Everest.','/tlNg2wOSuZOjgrbcLtbetOppUM5.jpg','2017-01-25',103,'Released',NULL,'The Climb',421447,2.4987,6.693,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41568,_binary '\0','/7EEQ9UZ7xIKoz