lives a claustrophobic life under her father\'s cold and domineering control. When Bridget Sullivan, a young maid, comes to work for the family, Lizzie finds a sympathetic, kindred spirit, and a secret intimacy soon blossoms into a wicked plan.','/z2iuBcwznen3kC9z4LeOzBSz1BB.jpg','2018-09-14',106,'Released','The legend of Lizzie Borden','Lizzie',460071,5.3187,6.198,'1BHPGudlLuc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41573,_binary '\0','/lE4IBs12gq5CHOMGy3IUJ69q2Wi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5161018',6.1,2024,'hu','Budapest Noir','A murder mystery set in 1936 Budapest, just as Hungary was preparing to align itself with Hitler. A beautiful young girl is found dead and nobody wants to investigate—except Gordon, a crime reporter who has a gut feeling that things are not what they seem.','/CnYgTfVZ9Mlp83hOyL4D0s18Xe.jpg','2017-11-02',95,'Released',NULL,'Budapest Noir',466205,1.2563,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41574,_binary '\0','/bCOXIQtHJ5mJ7Z0EJxiKjI7jWrg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5161058',6.4,1600,'ru','Гуляй, Вася!','Mitya accidentally proposed to his girlfriend. The problem is that Mitya is already married to Vasya, who refuses to grant him a divorce. Can Mitya and his friends convince Vasya to change her mind?','/iRC412zbdZw4aKZSKUpRApvAtLW.jpg','2017-02-16',90,'Released',NULL,'Have Fun, Vasya!',430263,1.5008,5.961,'S2Ar-Rvu2_o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41575,_binary '\0','/gDxYU0qgl5xUKkKYYRdEhZeNsKa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5161376',3.9,2453,'en','Tonight She Comes','After a girl goes missing, two of her friends and a mysterious set of strangers find themselves drawn to the cabin in the woods where she disappeared. They will laugh, they will drink, they will kiss, they will make love, and THEY MUST ALL DIE.','/cnX9ojQSLNfhAHuOKRoVT942Ubs.jpg','2018-02-13',84,'Released','Everyone else will die','Tonight She Comes',415633,1.23,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000