er into bidding for three llamas at a county fair. Once they arrive, however, they cause such chaotic destructive mayhem that Shaun has to carefully remove them – high-speed chases, careful rooftop scrambles and dangerous falls ensue.','/a3wjyadC2l3ehoqHjKlk5w89ErM.jpg','2015-11-13',30,'Released',NULL,'Shaun the Sheep: The Farmer\'s Llamas',374252,3.7802,6.6,'xaDme8lu_eQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41594,_binary '\0','/nrVe80sCxmcdbcG61jbCUh0zYyL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5175450',6.4,16186,'en','Mark Felt: The Man Who Brought Down the White House','The story of Mark Felt, who under the name \"Deep Throat\" helped journalists Bob Woodward and Carl Bernstein uncover the Watergate scandal in 1974.','/6Oq2lQaePXJJwcguc8aqB7EpduZ.jpg','2017-09-28',103,'Released',NULL,'Mark Felt: The Man Who Brought Down the White House',390061,5.5818,6.194,'c34BtMNwTzE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41595,_binary '\0','/msj2VmaHEvJ0cKLZkdMLE6AO5dc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5176252',6.1,5046,'es','La llamada','María and Susana, two rebellious teenagers, spend the summer in a catholic camp. While they are grounded during a weekend, the most unexpected arrival in the most unexpected way will change their feelings about life, love and freedom.','/1HvtsruMolE6w59HETXMfInc2DA.jpg','2017-09-29',109,'Released','Prepare for ecstasy.','La Llamada',426338,1.781,6.8,'WJooYRR2vCQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41596,_binary '\0','/boaGoU0SBGH1UQcHVZTi9PGOcmu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5176536',5.7,1454,'en','Center Stage: On Pointe','Jonathan Reeves is tasked with infusing more contemporary styles and modernism into the American Ballet Academy, and enlists his top choreographers Charlie, Cooper and Tommy to recruit dancers to compete at a camp where the winners will be selected to join the Academy. Bella Parker, who has always lived in the shadow of her hugely successful sister Kate, finally gets her chance to step into the limelight as one of the dancers recruited for the camp.','/nhoeKkP9XgYecnFQB7gXv4CzB0E.jpg','2016-06-25',92,'Released',NULL,'Center Stage: On Pointe',402543,2.2308,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41597,_binary '\0','/wNvqIg49KSBo093ZqBMg7ojLXSn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5176580',6.2,1561,'en','Wild Nights with Emily','Explore Emily Dickinson\'s vivacious, irreverent side that was covered up for years — most notably her lifelong romantic relationship with another woman.','/jWfJhvNxAy48QwQ3RI3MSPUMbj3.jpg','2018-03-11',84,'Released',NULL,'Wild Nights with Emily',502147,1.9275,5.9,'u36bKgONkfI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41598,_binary '\0','/ejmwCnlgWXkpDLsrhsnB8Mn6dcu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5177088',6.1,55992,'en','The Girl in the Spider\'s Web','After being enlisted to recover a dangerous computer program, hacker Lisbeth Salander and journalist Mikael Blomkvist find themselves caught in a web of spies, cybercriminals and corrupt government officials.','/w4ibr8R702DCjwYniry1D1XwQXj.jpg','2018-10-25',115,'Released','The past never forgets.','The Girl in the Spider\'s Web',446807,8.3405,6.2,'XKMSP9OKspQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41599,_binary '\0','/wrifTYmJPTxBf26xJrwyPfGbg3T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5177114',7.5,20725,'en','Young Woman and the Sea','This is the extraordinary true story of Trudy Ederle, the first woman to successfully swim the English Channel. Through the steadfast support of her older sister and supportive trainers, she overcame adversity and the animosity of a patriarchal society to rise through the ranks of the Olympic swimming team and complete the 21-mile trek from France to England.','/bZlecCuBVvKuarNGvchBwaOsQ3c.jpg','2024-05-31',129,'Released','Defy the odds.','Young Woman and the Sea',774531,11.6863,7.85,'7tNvrYzPUrk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41600,_binary '\0','/hm21I7yc6oYBogTloET3eXsVPlq.jp