ery Battery. There he encounters only the aged Commander, and through their flashbacks we see the fate of the Fifth Battery which was disbanded in that very village.','/wb4NYW8ihDrfPCIda0tDxmhYZQs.jpg','2018-11-01',120,'Released',NULL,'Soldier\'s Lullaby',550519,1.1108,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41604,_binary '\0','/2kY390rVe8EXXOwl7XZ5yMRqxr4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5179598',5.6,16126,'en','Billionaire Boys Club','A group of wealthy boys in Los Angeles during the early 1980s establishes a get rich quick scam that turns deadly.','/7EpC1etIcUQxqPnBz0CpHLp3evv.jpg','2018-07-19',108,'Released','Young. Handsome. And cunning.','Billionaire Boys Club',385360,5.3337,5.725,'P208BnSSoys','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41605,_binary '\0','/w93509Dz3Cq5hwlQ1UE9IpTNV5T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5181260',6.2,3005,'en','The Unbreakable Boy','When Scott and Teresa LeRette learn that their son Austin is both autistic and has brittle bone disease, they initially worry for their son’s future. But with Scott’s growing faith and Austin’s incredible spirit, they become \'unbreakable\', finding joy, gratitude, and courage even in the most trying times.','/ob1cuQzzggELGtWx5TchixKsBVn.jpg','2025-02-20',108,'Released','When the odds are unbelievable, show the world you\'re unbreakable.','The Unbreakable Boy',765897,6.1705,7.849,'pGbLX3__m60','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41606,_binary '\0','/apBUC70udhxoLzXo7DqclQ6gcXo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5181830',6.4,15172,'en','Wendell & Wild','Two scheming demons strike a deal with a punk rock-loving teen so they can leave the Underworld and live out their dreams in the Land of the Living.','/5dsX6UAHqkQz1kiV8bs8SvjyVNa.jpg','2022-10-21',105,'Released','It\'s time to face your demons.','Wendell & Wild',511817,7.7952,6.579,'tJp5pLsXhgo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41607,_binary '\0','/aGAWFJ9DvlDRzz8SGW1DVplB28a.jpg','2026-10-06 