ising in homoerotic drawings of muscular men, free of inhibitions. His work – made famous by his signature ‘Tom of Finland’ – became the emblem of a generation of men and fanned the flames of a gay revolution.','/VsyYMo3A8z0iHR0Hfuj0ZFtIQJ.jpg','2017-02-24',116,'Released',NULL,'Tom of Finland',405204,2.851,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41680,_binary '\0','/jsxQ1VsLxPLzkT0ZBypWe9c5Ixa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5227140',6,1315,'ja','ミュージアム','In Tokyo, Japan, several grotesque murders take place on rainy days. Detective Sawamura, who is in charge of the case, soon discovers that his own family is connected to the crimes.','/eU4EJcA4w0Mo7GwA2W9GC236157.jpg','2016-11-12',132,'Released','The serial killer is laughing in the rain','Museum',392681,2.8379,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41681,_binary '\0','/uQt8RztoyGp91XoijDU64T37llO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5227746',5.9,9801,'sv','Den blomstertid nu kommer','Sweden faces a mysterious attack while Alex tries to reunite with his youth love, Anna.','/470k2PqJSFTzRCM2XLS35nPKmfA.jpg','2018-06-20',129,'Released','We never thought it would happen to us.','The Unthinkable',518502,2.7455,5.641,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41682,_binary '\0','/wr4ShqtpTpEjRQ1KVWyOE1rV3cN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5228262',4.9,1353,'en','A Happening of Monumental Proportions','During the course of one day, a group of students at a school in Los Angeles find themselves caught up in a plot of sex, lies and dead bodies.','/pEpxxeWWdp4G2hz1DicObq98KhF.jpg','2017-05-05',81,'Released',NULL,'A Happening of Monumental Proportions',423985,2.1124,5.2,'h1MmpxUbY4k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41683,_binary '\0','/neiSVb9kT7SvAp1ENX3wpunC80L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5228304',4.7,4504,'en','Bees Make Honey','A widow hosts a gathering for her high-society friends in an attempt to help solve her husband\'s murder.','/lkrb6vkIWo6NqCufFIThMS9a8