er Jérémie. As seasons go by around their vineyard, they\'ll have to trust each other again.','/m8Y433w0oaFyZnBUhXv5H180aqU.jpg','2017-06-14',113,'Released',NULL,'Back to Burgundy',432087,3.7961,6.9,'v2hcDb7gJ4I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41709,_binary '\0','/731qXwHLBdeKS5dwkG39rFqRqxb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5247776',5.9,1457,'de','Rückkehr nach Montauk','Author Max Zorn, now in his early 60s, is on a promotional book tour in New York when he encounters the woman he could never forget. They spend a weekend together, seventeen years have passed. Can there be a future for their past?','/rwKRbh71rLljCXEmtnglooyefnU.jpg','2017-05-11',106,'Released',NULL,'Return to Montauk',436352,2.3416,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41710,_binary '\0','/xGEwro28YWCJ9qPYDrT4YfnaReh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5248342',6,1464,'no','Welcome to Norway!','A couple decide to open a home for refugees in the remote cold mountains of Norway.','/ivaOENJa30pk48PcHI007JpyLom.jpg','2016-03-04',90,'Released',NULL,'Welcome to Norway!',382125,1.0392,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41711,_binary '\0','/ou8DQx4F0JBrgYglAucYJyE6PZZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5249706',5,1231,'en','Don\'t Look at the Demon','A spiritual medium leads a paranormal investigative TV crew to a haunted home only to discover that the evil spirit she’s facing holds the key to her troubled past.','/wSfQ0JEjoeVeVCQR3bmMLl6xBHK.jpg','2022-09-29',95,'Released','Inspired by True Banned Ritual','Don\'t Look at the Demon',1022128,3.1298,6.8,'NY4_yNJoKWU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41712,_binary '\0','/wMzToVniA09xWS0DXSRQiufVvpZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5251328',7.1,9160,'ja','ONE PIECE FILM GOLD','The glittering Gran Tesoro, a city of entertainment beyond the laws of the government, is a sanctuary for the world’s most infamous pirates, Marines, and filthy rich millionaires. Drawn by dreams of hitting the jackpot, Captain Luffy and his crew sail straight for the gold. But behind the gilded curtains lies a powerful king whose deep pockets and deeper ambitions spell disaster for the Straw Hats and the New World alike.','/9PgiOFTLZXP7emlwcIt0yRasJ9h.jpg','2016-07-23',120,'Released','It\'s a life-or-death gamble!','One Piece Film: GOLD',374205,8.7319,7.234,'NmyGak3l12Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41713,_binary '\0','/nIbqMHWS6q4kOoKBs9HfrgHqqQW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5252624',5.5,2167,'en','Stalked by My Doctor','When a teenage girl is miraculously saved by a heart surgeon, the doctor begins to flirt with her. Her father doesn’t believe her and unbeknownst to all, the doctor is obsessed with the girl.','/fJn7Mo1RjC0mTqiiVY0T2VlSmwz.jpg','2015-12-26',90,'Released','When care turns into obsession.','Stalked by My Doctor',374515,2.2171,6,'V7Jep_m1WRI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41714,_binary '\0','/aUhyPlj1ci8cJCt8DnbTlBrMPkA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5253282',6.8,6288,'en','The Bachelors','After the early death of his wife, a mourning father moves with his teenage son across the country for a private school teaching job. Their lives begin to transform due to two unique women, who help them embrace life and love again','/yAwoDmcLFuZxg5bHzYgRexYhykm.jpg','2017-10-20',99,'Released','It\'s never too late for a second chance.','The Bachelors',397601,4.1085,7,'N1p1RA_QuGA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41715,_binary '\0','/kvSFYQG9tW7JOOhpFOWv6b1pbB0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5253294',5.9,6925,'fr','Radin !','François Gautier is stingy! Saving puts the joy, it causes pay sweats. His life is set for the sole purpose of never spend anything. A life that will switch in one day: he falls in love and discovers he has a daughter he did not know existed. Forced to lie in order to hide his terrible default, this will be the beginning for François problems. Because lie can sometimes be expensive. Very expensive…','/axdQyS20MtoBnXLpzJhn3g6etqZ.jpg','2016-09-28',89,'Released',NULL,'Penny Pincher!',382511,3.8052,5.6,'J4djUlleGCo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41716,_binary '\0','/8PTvLePWm1Yi5uJHloZJPpc0BZJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5253630',6.3,1537,'lt','Gautas iškvietimas','The dark comedy Gautas iškvietimas is a mockumentary-style film about a police precinct facing staff cuts. Officers, fearing for their jobs, work harder than ever, but the month\'s calls turn out to be more chaotic than expected. To make matters worse, one officer is caught using stolen drugs from the evidence room... Explosions, shootouts, helicopters, love, erotica, music stars, movie stars, and much more—all in Tadas Vidmantas\' comedy Gautas iškvietimas.','/lLx3cSQgdW3XqJAo9X5ezLEGN2O.jpg','2016-03-04',84,'Released',NULL,'Call To Action',385655,0.8408,5.8,'epeKR0IitIc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41717,_binary '\0','/doZknFSxaF0lfEDmfPRZFNsfIIJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5254610',5.8,15538,'en','Final Score','When a stadium is seized by a group of heavily armed criminals during a major sporting event, an ex-soldier must use all his military skills to save both the daughter of a fallen comrade and the huge crowd unaware of the danger.','/5m3FEfxGQ7MdNNfUwNtA6paXRDs.jpg','2018-09-07',105,'Released','It\'s all about to kick off','Final Score',421658,8.8611,6.1,'aLzYyK8gPSI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41718,_binary '\0','/5R9nh7HgQjAwihjuJUmLkMAGymu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5254640',6.1,1563,'en','Spa Night','A young Korean-American man works to reconcile his obligations to his struggling immigrant family with his burgeoning sexual desires in the underground world of gay hookups at Korean spas in Los Angeles.','/huDRmhI7ryCgwncjsyqzJsO9bxf.jpg','2016-08-19',96,'Released',NULL,'Spa Night',374440,1.5746,5.6,'tWKCEXd0plA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41719,_bina