RtlJoTwl.jpg','2020-12-01',79,'Released','Break out before the outbreak','Deadlocked',768275,2.0913,4.8,'pPXUVAqQ1YY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41727,_binary '\0','/vGZTyglSEzL7evznmyIAoubsKiM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5258850',7.4,12316,'fr','Au revoir là-haut','In November 1918, a few days before the Armistice, when Lieutenant Pradelle orders a senseless attack, he causes a useless disaster; but his outrageous act also binds the lives of two soldiers who have nothing more in common than the battlefield: Édouard saves Albert, although at a high cost. They become companions in misfortune who will attempt to survive in a changing world. Pradelle, in his own way, does the same.','/pkO5YoznMR9neuHVzhxHK9JJpAj.jpg','2017-10-25',113,'Released',NULL,'See You Up There',430424,7.7449,7.818,'bIqPXc5QU3U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41728,_binary '\0','/e58A9ZzjjYRIG6Z6nBm5NoIR9gl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5259496',6.9,1404,'it','Indivisibili','Daisy and Viola are siamese twin sisters on the verge of turning 18 living in the suburbs of Naples. They are blessed with beautiful voices and thanks to their performances at weddings, communions and baptisms, they get the livelihood for the whole family. Kept isolated from the rest of the world by their own father who just exploits them in order to make money, their life turns upside-down when one of them falls in love for the first time and they discover that they can be separated.','/iseAcq2JgmGSmhFRIAjTSqozMzr.jpg','2016-09-29',100,'Released',NULL,'Indivisible',408438,0.9703,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41729,_binary '\0','/4tphk3VbqoRtCVuOzlEQxUrpR6c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5259822',5.1,11591,'en','Tesla','The story of the Promethean struggles of Nikola Tesla, as he attempts to transcend entrenched technology—including his own previous work—by pioneering a system of wireless energy that would change the world.','/v0guO0krvyz8IfKGxEje04LVM9d.jpg','2020-08-14',102,'Released','My achievements and conquests will be evaluated in the future','Tesla',517412,4.2582,5.8,'OqCD9wRdOUE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41730,_binary '\0','/3z8cveYwdIz2IZRhm6cHu8f2HRT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5259966',5.5,3146,'es','No manches, Frida','After being released from prison, Zequi, a bank robber, sets out to recover money buried by his accomplice; but is horrified to learn that a high school gymnasium is now over the site where the loot is hidden.','/6HfyXfIEywLa2HvcswKi44dDKxL.jpg','2016-09-02',100,'Released','The students are bad, the teachers are worse.','No manches, Frida',375794,9.3064,7.738,'eeDYKlRV9Qs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41731,_binary '\0','/jyf7bNJs4CpZMwoeyo3RbbVtA9r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5262792',3.2,6873,'en','Dirty Dancing','Spending the summer at a Catskills resort with her family, Frances \"Baby\" Houseman falls in love with the camp\'s dance instructor, Johnny Castle, and nothing is ever the same for anyone in the Houseman family.','/ySL7B4FgYZR5xFBWc7c7lssuCN9.jpg','2017-05-24',130,'Released','A musical re-imagining','Dirty Dancing',444902,3.1094,5.5,'MRorazuKwDc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41732,_binary '\0','/ryBicX6Nx8VPfTZhqvr55GTCGSF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5263116',6.9,2457,'it','In guerra per amore','It\'s 1943 and World War II is raging in Europe. In New York, Arturo and Flora the daughter of a restaurant owner are in love, but she is promised in marriage to the son of a Mafia boss. There is a way around this, but to be able to marry Flora, Arturo needs to get permission from her father, who lives in a village in Sicily. Arturo doesn\'t have any money, so the only way he can get to Sicily is to enlist in the U.S. Army, which is preparing for a landing on the island.','/bmy7S1xTY9yLJTg48pxucx790xZ.jpg','2016-10-27',99,'Released',NULL,'At War for Love',403450,2.0787,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41733,_binary '\0','/wUMDnvi1xa8iMEpRDVAXrcAtqus.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5264838',5.4,4783,'en','Crater','After the death of his father, a boy growing up on a lunar mining colony takes a trip to explore a legendary crater, along with his four best friends, prior to being permanently relocated to another planet.','/n8ZpMwYT02XjpQHpSxn1eJw5Zpz.jpg','2023-05-12',104,'Released','Miles from Earth, their adventure begins.','Crater',620705,5.9197,6.607,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41734,_binary '\0','/hsR4XY0qgk7ouAfmaIbTTzrAvM0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5265662',5.8,3323,'en','Christmas Land','Jules has just inherited a quaint magical Christmas-themed village and Christmas tree farm bequeathed her by her grandmother. She plans to sell it and use the profits to buy her dream home in New York City. But the longer Jules stays on the farm and the more she learns how important Christmas Land has been to so many families, the more Jules starts to question her motives to sell.','/mSvM4uXrUTRdKg7wYLyg6JTd2Fk.jpg','2015-12-20',83,'Released',NULL,'Christmas Land',369054,2.6491,5.6,'jE4UdAKAfU4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41735,_binary '\0','/sUnAK6VaypBQAMrYa9XU8tGcp9X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5265898',4.9,1972,'en','Dead Ant','When the 1989 \"one-hit-wonder\" glam-metal band \"Sonic Grave\" embark on a trip to Coachella in hopes of a comeback, their peyote trip pit stop in Joshua Tree incites an \"unworldly\" vicious attack, and they must \"rock\" themselves out of harms way.','/2NoqvEpApbcnSWFpbHAswOYufSQ.jpg','2017-10-10',87,'Released',NULL,'Dead Ant',480923,2.0709,5.1,'DiEhWDt_bWU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41736,_binary '\0','/2ZNCgEGtJFQjsyUinhDirqa7AcZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5265960',6.1,7859,'es','La región salvaje','A meteorite deposits an alien monster with strange powers near the home of an unhappy couple.','/oDuOKue0CCUPc3febMJmdFVysZR.jpg','2016-05-15',98,'Released','When desire surpasses fear.','The Untamed',387801,5.4411,5.92,'qfdurv4kzUA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41737,_binary '\0','/8Y8o6YPcJE6MbAiByoTyjRY74ll.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5265964',6.8,2330,'es','Nuestro tiempo','A family lives in the Mexican countryside raising fighting bulls. Esther is in charge of running the ranch, while her husband Juan, a world-renowned poet, raises and selects the beasts. Although in an open marriage, their relationship begins to crumble when Esther falls in love with an American horsebreaker and Juan is unable to control his jealousy.','/zc1PFbsxGSknbb0AqKTA8ArXG5e.jpg','2018-09-28',177,'Released',NULL,'Our Time',389218,1.9069,6.7,'T8rm0H_hjeM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41738,_binary '\0','/yjOG57YxZsPFrCbKGn2mOHXyYi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5265980',3.6,4661,'en','Tabernacle 101','It is about two Atheists who run a video blog debunking Psychics, Mediums and religious beliefs. However, a death experiment goes totally wrong and as a result they attract evil entities that stalk and haunt them.','/qqc91o0fOKTJKn7Ehx7rCJ39E4L.jpg','2019-08-30',99,'Released',NULL,'Tabernacle 101',627322,0.91,3.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41739,_binary '\0','/KFlX7gRyibU3gvBWTIqwiwlJOf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5266218',5.3,1355,'te','బెంగాల్ టైగర్','A happy-go-lucky Aakash who becomes the right hand man of a powerful politician who arranges for him to be married to his daughter Shraddha who falls in love with him, until he reveals the truth that he is already in love with another woman Meera.','/pL52qn8jmspte3k2LwmCAmd3L0g.jpg','2015-12-10',151,'Released',NULL,'Bengal Tiger',363152,1.3217,4.667,'GCvipxfEnJY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41740,_binary '\0','/sQENipE4TjyTnY8xBZvPKzi23jo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5266668',3,1653,'en','Rogue Warfare','A group of military elite from the U.S., Russia, UK, China and France join forces to fight an elite underground terrorist network.','/78hDh9EHDMbox4FlKlOrRfrmgpU.jpg','2019-10-04',103,'Released','All nations, one enemy.','Rogue Warfare',627879,2.4392,5.6,'FeAJwJwqNQo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41741,_binary '\0','/bHrlWNVW96SMmWzrNi0EwKyjWCU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5267472',5.5,5131,'en','Step Sisters','Jamilah has her whole life figured out. She\'s the president of her black sorority, captain of their champion step dance crew, is student liaison to the college dean, and her next move is on to Harvard Law School. She\'s got it all, right? But when the hard-partying white girls from Sigma Beta Beta embarrass the school, Jamilah is ordered to come to the rescue. Her mission is to not only teach the rhythmically-challenged girls how to step dance, but to win the Steptacular, the most competitive of dance competitions. With the SBBs reputations and charter on the line, and Jamilah\'s dream of attending Harvard in jeopardy, these outcast screw-ups and their unlikely teacher stumble through one hilarious misstep after another. Cultures clash, romance blossoms, and sisterhood prevails as everyone steps out of their comfort zones.','/9QrO9BuS93Ii2BKre0IyvkpHW8E.jpg','2018-01-19',104,'Released','Stomp it like it\'s hot','Step Sisters',431072,2.6857,6.4,'qMXO6Up6pvE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41742,_binary '\0','/hD69Qot8j7GzoTb4MIFUBH2U0K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5268348',6.7,6064,'en','Generation Wealth','Over the past 25 years, Lauren Greenfield\'s documentary photography and film projects have explored youth culture, gender, body image, and affluence. Underscoring the ever-increasing gap between the haves and the have-nots, portraits reveal a focus on cultivating image over substance, where subjects unable to attain actual wealth instead settle for its trappings, no matter their ability to pay for it.','/ehe6Hrf9Re7BdO7ErIM49FrO0JY.jpg','2018-07-20',110,'Released','The American dream just keeps getting more expensive.','Generation Wealth',493014,1.5051,6.4,'fyfC1AVhfb8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41743,_binary '\0','/hoJC8IUBg26pjR58MoYtTW8XSwG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5268648',5.6,1860,'pl','Listy do M. 2','In their pursuit of perfect Christmas well - known characters accompanied by some new faces happen to experience tiny miracles! The adventures they come across help them realize that the most important things in life - hope, acceptance and family - are within their reach and that real love is the best Christmas present!','/sBhIcqMRMNfXlyGa9KXQjC0GhTq.jpg','2015-11-13',99,'Released',NULL,'Letters to Santa 2',370291,1.481,6.158,'bqZfg3oyMN4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41744,_binary '\0','/ts2j3Fwk3f8WAY4AMPYrmOXyRz6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5269396',6,2776,'zh','三少爷的剑','Weary of the bloodshed and violence from the martial arts world, a powerful swordsman banishes himself to the humble life a vagrant, wandering the fringes of society. But his violent past refuses to let him go quietly. The master swordsman must regain the ability to wield his sword and fight those disrupting the peace he so desperately craves.','/jritqkUKkS8cB90jvRvtWiGRE18.jpg','2016-12-02',108,'Released',NULL,'Sword Master',367206,3.7598,6.4,'MEbX6lo_9pM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41745,_binary '\0','/j3axYB8CpoNGs9mqjCdy7eCnRIY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5269560',6.9,1982,'cn','十年','Five shorts reveal a fictional Hong Kong in 2025, depicting a dystopian city where residents and activists face crackdowns under iron-fisted rule.','/dpZbxJEiOktio70MknB0PgRH9jf.jpg','2015-11-15',104,'Released','Five Hong Kong Stories, One Undesirable Future.','Ten Years',376916,1.9377,6.967,'M4zebygSaZE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41746,_binary '\0','/nT4lnpFMihsCsaS3qj5maqiCBFA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5270810',6.6,3140,'ru','Землетрясение','After the devastating Spitak earthquake of December 7th, Konstantin Berezhnoy, a 50-year-old Russian, and Robert Melkonyan, a 28-year-old Armenian, work together to rescue the desperate survivors.','/2HlOFOPaR0gD5jNJubxB3hRRLSH.jpg','2016-12-01',101,'Released',NULL,'The Earthquake',413953,2.0233,6.676,'O9vJd2Vgbxc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41747,_binary '\0','/9ZwsGUTiODh5IR3vbgThe4qZ7O5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5270948',6.4,15544,'en','Chappaquiddick','Ted Kennedy\'s life and political career become derailed in the aftermath of a fatal car accident in 1969 that claims the life of a young campaign strategist, Mary Jo Kopechne.','/kkTD7ufZd7AqAnZP5IMnrQXKRpM.jpg','2018-04-06',107,'Released','The Untold True Story','Chappaquiddick',432301,4.1858,6.125,'jTzPXc2DW2k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41748,_binary '\0','/d3kcSODqLqODL6qGrQT2vmTOodk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5271432',6.7,2154,'ml','അടി കപ്യാരേ കൂട്ടമണി','The story revolves around a bunch of college students living in a boy\'s hostel. The story unfolds over a period of four days in the hostel. Problems begin when a young woman enters the hostel.','/uSqEH5rwR6SYtDt7Hktyu96PvYL.jpg','2015-12-24',133,'Released',NULL,'Adi Kapyare Kootamani',374755,1.5625,6.692,'inD9csXlF1Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41749,_binary '\0','/oRFsSgTaMjmkoyCAMY65zsBdGKj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5271442',7.9,3909,'ur','مالک','A man of Pakistan\'s Elite Special Forces whose life gets entangled with Politics. They soon realize that serving the nation is more complicated than simple following of orders.','/rODmgBDH7TMk2fDM3nCeduoGBUo.jpg','2016-04-08',155,'Released',NULL,'Maalik',391955,0.854,6.462,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41750,_binary '\0','/5IHPxCeflw0dSRHtAQibQpypWcz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5271772',5.5,2933,'es','El hilo rojo','Seven years after their first infatuated encounter, Abril and Manuel meet again. Despite the fact that they are both married, it is soon apparent that their attraction has only grown.','/iqOovsJWgh7zYeNMUfOc4Xxxhrn.jpg','2016-05-19',100,'Released',NULL,'The Red Thread',394723,3.3146,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41751,_binary '\0','/53S8ZkcMMuqXTrXi45pzBjuA0Ak.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5273624',5.5,4081,'zh','西游伏妖篇','Tang Monk brings three disciples on a journey to the West. On the outside, everything seems harmonious. However, tension is present beneath the surface, and their hearts and minds are not in agreement. After a series of demon-capturing events, the monk and his disciples gain mutual understanding of each others\' hardships and unease. Finally, they resolve their inner conflict and work together to become an all-conquering, demon-exorcising team.','/8YcgbJatxoBjQqQHF52NdcdkIJZ.jpg','2017-01-28',109,'Released',NULL,'Journey to the West: The Demons Strike Back',435800,3.9732,6.048,'Nzb4JjCUdj0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41752,_binary '\0','/5JyhGnQVJSMw8MQIMDMHNBHAvhg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5273720',4.9,2042,'en','All the Creatures Were Stirring','When an awkward date on Christmas Eve leads a couple into a strange theater, they\'re treated to a bizarre and frightening collection of Christmas stories, featuring a wide ensemble of characters doing their best to avoid the horrors of the holidays. From boring office parties and last-minute shopping, to vengeful stalkers and immortal demons, there\'s plenty out there to fear this holiday season.','/wJCTXnfN3AEfgiwsMEXmMxDvIqi.jpg','2018-04-06',80,'Released','Have a merry Christmas!','All the Creatures Were Stirring',512474,2.1686,5,'JhVIeDhvqb4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41753,_binary '\0','/3RDkJ2jYYvOXpiCJLTjJyCnnmBI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5274066',5.5,1907,'en','Raising the Bar','16-year-old Kelly quits an elite gymnastics program and moves to Australia. To help out a new friend and show up an old rival she re-enters competitive gymnastics, she\'ll have to find a way to move forward while making amends with her past.','/4PmeOpZK9Qvnsuo02TqBO1wHecR.jpg','2017-03-09',93,'Released','Competition at its best!','Raising the Bar',396289,1.3318,6.5,'7eUFkeKHRwk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41754,_binary '\0','/8Ut3M5bBjHEAcQi8cvV9Vg8CrlU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5275128',4.9,1282,'en','Destination: Dewsbury','Back in the 80s, five friends cause raucous in their schooldays. Twenty years on and they\'ve got jobs they don\'t want and wives who don\'t want them. The leader of the gang, Frankie, is now dying in Yorkshire. The others find out and they get together for one last sad, mad, bad road trip to Dewsbury, before it\'s all too late. Mix in a dollop of The Inbetweeners\' intellectual wit, add a pinch of bromancing from The World\'s End, and then stir in a few ladles of The Hangover\'s vomit and you\'ve got Destination: Dewsbury, destined to be one of 2018\'s funniest releases.','/42Wd3LWBYlVRLEIy8smysOUJx0W.jpg','2019-03-01',86,'Released',NULL,'Destination: Dewsbury',576185,1.3904,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41755,_binary '\0','/7ZVbWmGVRNeAKTS0Ffm1vXB4mZN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5275476',6,1277,'de','Fikkefuchs','Burned out and lonely Rocky is almost 50 years old and has seen better times as a womanizer. One day, Thorben shows up at his door claiming to be his son. He is trying to get advice on how to be successful with women.','/wWRiQLxQrCpaant8gNaKcCMwMte.jpg','2017-06-23',101,'Released',NULL,'Bed Bugs',464287,1.0621,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41756,_binary '\0','/d663QlgXkIEVgG6RnlI5JJUykMo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5275828',7,13938,'en','Lo and Behold: Reveries of the Connected World','Werner Herzog\'s exploration of the Internet and the connected world.','/yv9ecMFec43ReHGy1fDntPF4FS2.jpg','2016-03-04',99,'Released','The human side of the digital revolution.','Lo and Behold: Reveries of the Connected World',360030,2.5213,6.6,'Zc1tZ8JsZvg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41757,_binary '\0','/yEka20zQrj6zsVYXmPuCjKUPaX5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5275830',7.5,1480,'en','Eat That Question: Frank Zappa in His Own Words','Utilizing potent TV interviews and many forgotten performances from his 30-year career, we are immersed into Frank Zappa’s world while experiencing two distinct facets of his complex character. At once Zappa was both a charismatic composer who reveled in the joy of performing and, in the next moment, a fiercely intelligent and brutally honest interviewee whose convictions only got stronger as his career ascended.','/tndnO5z3QmIyOMuyy3zzUPBY2Ia.jpg','2016-05-03',93,'Released',NULL,'Eat That Question: Frank Zappa in His Own Words',373479,1.965,7.3,'eB7XUpSUnoQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41758,_binary '\0','/faHLBtaO8zJgaI3N6yanstNkkmk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5275838',7.5,1655,'en','Mapplethorpe: Look at the Pictures','Nude men in rubber suits, close-ups of erections, objects shoved in the most intimate of places—these are photographs taken by Robert Mapplethorpe, known by many as the most controversial photographer of the twentieth century. Openly gay, Mapplethorpe took images of male sex, nudity, and fetish to extremes that resulted in his work still being labelled by some as pornography masquerading as art. But less talked about are the more serene, yet striking portraits of flowers, sculptures, and perfectly framed human forms that are equally pioneering and powerful.','/9sA1JDTwZ8vqbsRzY0O9C70eJB8.jpg','2016-06-16',105,'Released',NULL,'Mapplethorpe: Look at the Pictures',373349,1.9057,6.9,'gkNCITzUA3U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41759,_binary '\0','/pcjHAIyZbw5C79jSE2VWvsx9ish.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5275844',7.4,2671,'en','Michael Jackson\'s Journey from Motown to Off the Wall','Director Spike Lee chronicles Michael Jackson\'s early rise to fame.','/dJuuKMTG73WR2O14QBo4VgbW4Ei.jpg','2016-01-24',93,'Released',NULL,'Michael Jackson\'s Journey from Motown to Off the Wall',373451,2.3879,7,'O_AFMraqm84','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41760,_binary '\0','/a9jBEm8wb4XJIvAdFJlAVgVxbB5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5275892',8.9,24161,'en','O.J.: Made in America','A chronicle of the rise and fall of O.J. Simpson, whose high-profile murder trial exposed the extent of American racial tensions, revealing a fractured and divided nation.','/nFmg2G4IJ0x9mALXkYFN8Gw0Dw5.jpg','2016-05-20',467,'Released',NULL,'O.J.: Made in America',377462,3.9135,8.4,'HrB3rOcrJxg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41761,_binary '\0','/xMbD7TNDNg2qBL89LFrUsgHhXeP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5277952',6.8,1889,'de','Das Tagebuch der Anne Frank','The story of Anne Frank, the Jewish girl who went into hiding with her family in Amsterdam and became a victim of the Holocaust.','/vkapO6E74s1v52GUzAHLnrRoA0S.jpg','2016-03-03',128,'Released',NULL,'The Diary of Anne Frank',377060,2.043,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41762,_binary '\0','/14sGKb6Sey0SmFpjLUgt64Lv7VZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5278460',7.2,7545,'en','Audrie & Daisy','A documentary film about three cases of rape, that includes the stories of two American high school students, Audrie Pott and Daisy Coleman. At the time of the sexual assaults, Pott was 15 and Coleman was 14 years old. After the assaults, the victims and their families were subjected to abuse and cyberbullying.','/4AsrmTmKMVs8PmBnu6jNpMekoBj.jpg','2016-09-23',95,'Released','Shame is trending','Audrie & Daisy',376228,1.2563,7.2,'sXw843GfNFw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41763,_binary '\0','/cu8b92uSUw1NFi5P6HK6qRxSILu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5278462',7,1337,'en','Author: The JT LeRoy Story','New York magazine’s October 2005 issue sent shockwaves through the literary world when it unmasked “it boy” wunderkind JT LeRoy, whose tough prose about his sordid childhood had captivated icons and luminaries internationally. It turned out LeRoy didn’t actually exist. He was dreamed up by 40-year-old San Francisco punk rocker and phone sex operator, Laura Albert.','/2d0J8YiDFZnXswjmJdJHpo4NLlC.jpg','2016-01-22',110,'Released',NULL,'Author: The JT LeRoy Story',373348,2.0207,6.6,'AbRbIzmpsQM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41764,_binary '\0','/kJmC4MAA2BczYUJJE169QKKGnTk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5278464',7,6613,'en','Holy Hell','An inside look at a West Hollywood cult formed by a charismatic teacher in the 1980s that eventually imploded.','/qD85xZGbePSCJhlALzY1FR1xVm8.jpg','2016-05-27',100,'Released','Based On 22 Years of Footage Inside a Modern Cult','Holy Hell',373472,1.2344,6.6,'2f2BG43JW0o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41765,_binary '\0','/FwV7sa7Qs7rN5ack1fSgAGscAa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5278466',7.6,1796,'en','Jim: The James Foley Story','In August, 2014, a video of the public execution of American photojournalist James Foley rippled across the globe. Foley wore an orange jumpsuit as he knelt beside an ISIS militant dressed in black. That image challenged the world to deal with a new face of terror. And it tested one American family. Seen through the lens of filmmaker Brian Oakes, Foley’s close childhood friend, Jim takes us from small-town New England to the adrenaline-fueled front lines of Libya and Syria, where Foley pushed the limits of danger to report on the plight of civilians impacted by war.','/ng7aABnVoUp9dUHv92E3Uo5nqul.jpg','2016-01-23',111,'Released',NULL,'Jim: The James Foley Story',373441,1.7402,7.4,'O7UTdyP2fmk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41766,_binary '\0','/1ZtTi3s6IYtYMpKJbbrCJKfnNib.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5278506',7.4,23189,'en','Tickled','Journalist David Farrier stumbles upon a mysterious tickling competition online. As he delves deeper he comes up against fierce resistance, but that doesn’t stop him getting to the bottom of a story stranger than fiction.','/qxUbPwyhzNEyUZYOZm6t8yYSQf.jpg','2016-05-26',92,'Released','It\'s not what you think.','Tickled',373072,2.5292,7.2,'6Vs4ar_rM4I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41767,_binary '\0','/469qFUOMKyce1USVwdiy3busDXw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5278578',6.9,1763,'en','Newtown','A look at how the community of Newtown, Connecticut came together in the aftermath of the largest mass shooting of schoolchildren in American history.','/h4zPk6Xbt2k87TmYAJ3ewCvzFfO.jpg','2016-01-24',85,'Released','What remains after all is lost?','Newtown',376234,1.0374,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41768,_binary '\0','/zjAuQ3YJIB0YRLfBFy5CzbHRWKU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5278592',6.2,1278,'en','Kate Plays Christine','Follow actress Kate Lyn Sheil as she prepares for her next role: playing Christine Chubbuck, a Florida newscaster who committed suicide live on-air in 1974. As Kate investigates Chubbuck’s story, uncovering new clues and information, she becomes increasingly obsessed with her subject.','/jZW66hJcBD7zR3K78NNV5LBhsXu.jpg','2016-08-24',112,'Released',NULL,'Kate Plays Christine',340484,1.0368,5.7,'48QQhgJ_GLE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41769,_binary '\0','/1TjFPOmvaL8TJfPt0J3neLKjNvt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5278596',7.6,10868,'en','Weiner','Documentary featuring a jaw-dropping, behind-the-scenes look at the attempted comeback of Anthony Weiner in 2013 as he mounts a campaign for New York City mayor in the wake of his sexting scandal. Featuring unfettered access to the candidate and his campaign.','/r3eyunSmbTmvCSrKkU7YCmPyLQU.jpg','2016-05-20',96,'Released',NULL,'Weiner',376261,1.9049,7.3,'nJ4FIGnJknk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41770,_binary '\0','/kwUym7oi1fOJBwnyoQce66xNpoO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5278832',6.2,11339,'pl','Córki dancingu','Two mermaid sisters, who end up performing at a nightclub, face cruel and bloody choices when one of them falls in love with a beautiful young man.','/mxdssWM8WyzBFq6pYwBHeTIJK1A.jpg','2015-12-25',93,'Released',NULL,'The Lure',375742,2.7453,6.15,'Y8IiWjTItmk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41771,_binary '\0','/5aFPJnEvU7pffD6diLcJXnnHRf5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5278930',7.3,1746,'en','Sky Ladder: The Art of Cai Guo-Qiang','Known for his spectacular pyrotechnic displays, Chinese artist Cai Guo-Qiang creates his most ambitious project yet: Sky Ladder, a visionary, explosive event that he pulls off in his hometown in China after 20 years of failed attempts.','/bYE9EZbplP8gbqaT1w9wsSW4n5c.jpg','2017-09-22',80,'Released','Discover an artist reaching for the sky.','Sky Ladder: The Art of Cai Guo-Qiang',376389,2.1961,7,'lLTT8ogRf50','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41772,_binary '\0','/eGFaGSTpYL1zWMugkLIZdZoPckN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5280626',6.7,2803,'sv','Den unge Zlatan','The decisive years of Swedish soccer player Zlatan Ibrahimović, told through rare archive footage in which a young Zlatan speaks openly about his life and challenges. The film closely follows him, from his debut with the Malmö FF team in 1999 through his conflict-ridden years with Ajax Amsterdam, and up to his final breakthrough with Juventus in 2005.','/l2RxbkV56deZFaI1arbFPA1PpHh.jpg','2015-02-17',99,'Released',NULL,'Becoming Zlatan',379998,1.7007,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41773,_binary '\0','/3UpW7HAB7eZrVFmahtN1wZWlSVw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5280684',4.2,2652,'en','The Ice Cream Truck','Mary moves back to her suburban hometown to find that the suburbs are scarier in more ways than she ever remembered.','/wOQwPf4OyhM5l5RRQ8GLxNNmS14.jpg','2017-08-18',96,'Released','Suburbia can be a killer.','The Ice Cream Truck',434389,1.9888,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41774,_binary '\0','/8cdrqlyDB4R1cjU3YXwzswQ8a53.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5282006',6.3,3612,'ru','Дуэлянт','Returning to Saint Petersburg after a long exile, the dashing Yakovlev, a retired army officer, makes a comfortable living by winning other people\'s duels. An enigmatic, focused, and extremely skilled professional, he leaves a trail of dead bodies behind him as he swirls through polite society, frequently called upon to wield a pistol as a surrogate in duels at dawn. But when Yakovlev meets the naïve young Prince Tuchov and his beautiful sister, Princess Martha, the normally cold-hearted mercenary is surprised by hitherto undetected emotions. What transpires uncovers a series of revelations about his past and his present self.','/zlVkUY2bBJ5XYTDiry16u70oayQ.jpg','2016-09-29',110,'Released','On The Dark Side Of Honor','The Duelist',376565,2.2791,6.3,'W-4BHdC6hTs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41775,_binary '\0','/uOlcPMv6FqlP0cLejD2sjnfKrpJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5285050',7.3,2096,'ta','பசங்க 2','The frustrated parents of two hyperactive kids realise the key to unlock their kids\' potential lies in them accepting the kids\' exuberant nature, thanks to an understanding doctor and his teacher wife.','/2mlkY8THWDThDQXb0M1PjejzJeE.jpg','2015-12-24',127,'Released','Haiku','Pasanga 2',364023,1.0837,7.06,'berbc5hVptI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41776,_binary '\0','/rqQoVdvz53T1dBEMOr1XckTTrKb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5286268',5.5,2667,'fr','Mes trésors','A high-profile burglar reconciles with his two daughters (half-siblings) to help him retaliate against his ex-partner who betrayed him.','/AfUebvbwsS4DPihTNcWpjBBv2Bs.jpg','2017-01-04',91,'Released',NULL,'Family Heist',426830,3.5289,5.704,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41777,_binary '\0','/gdBumr0oYE43nTwkS7Cv5AUzRwm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5286432',5.8,1523,'de','Berlin Falling','Frank left his life as a soldier behind and wants to rebuild his life in Brandenburg. He is on his way to meet his daughter, Lily, after a long time of not seeing her. As he stops at a gas station he meets Andreas, who needs a ride to Berlin. Reluctantly, Frank agrees to take Andreas with him - unaware of the consequences.','/aTB9gDQOf6R9fIFcFvre2eYDeEi.jpg','2017-07-13',91,'Released',NULL,'Berlin Falling',429886,1.5785,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41778,_binary '\0','/dqsfaex2abk3lvWwIfsdfcOF3fx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5286444',7.6,25360,'hi','नीरजा','Neerja is a portrayal on the life of the courageous Neerja Bhanot, who sacrificed her life while protecting the lives of 359 passengers on the Pan Am flight 73 in 1986. The flight was hijacked by a terrorist organization.','/alDRJWHI1TfqB9ev6cMbVE5P92x.jpg','2016-02-19',122,'Released','Fear Gave Her Courage','Neerja',376869,1.7977,7.3,'ze6NtpA5GYM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41779,_binary '\0','/148iBnXTfFZb2awTvXXR6cwDwCB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5287168',7.2,8806,'sv','Sameblod','Elle Marja, 14, is a reindeer-breeding Sami girl. Exposed to the racism of the 1930s and phrenological examinations at her boarding school, she starts dreaming of another life. To achieve this other life she has to become someone else and break all ties with her family and culture.','/vSQWzjzmZONLGDPnzWa1e7xRfr8.jpg','2017-03-03',110,'Released',NULL,'Sami Blood',408435,1.8394,7.268,'4Y3xkshhwLM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41780,_binary '\0','/55jZIDXB2KAxCysvycqvUTO3urX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5289520',7.3,1669,'ro','6,9 pe scara Richter','A humble Romanian actor in his 40\'s, hardly surviving between a complicated part in a musical, a depressed wife, and the obsession of an imminent, devastating earthquake, becomes the victim of his manipulative father.','/abFpALrtrVJ8JmHGKaXRx7SYjDo.jpg','2016-05-27',116,'Released','Movie classified in category I of seismic risk.','6.9 on the Richter Scale',435009,1.3327,6.8,'ZwCynlcm1PM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41781,_binary '\0','/fwIJa5Me3AX9WTL0fzdpn4X6f7A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5290524',6.7,14690,'it','Quo vado?','Checco is 39 and lived his entire life with his parents. He loves his job where he does nothing the whole day, until something happens that will change his behavior and his life forever...','/oJ9w9tHdkLOs2hTJ4SAsBC0Bqtg.jpg','2016-01-01',86,'Released',NULL,'Where Am I Going?',374416,2.4314,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41782,_binary '\0','/dKulaMMlgPJnB0cdAOw91gLS55.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5290566',1.6,1464,'tr','Çılgın Dersane 4: Ada','This time, the team we see with Ada is adapting to the conditions of an island while enjoying the sea and sun, setting sail for new adventures. While struggling to survive on the island where they will stay for a certain period of time, things start to get complicated with the addition of mysterious and even scary characters to the comical events they experience.','/2BUd7oL3trsVWpqSNsOGwv9MXG5.jpg','2015-01-16',93,'Released',NULL,'Çılgın Dersane 4: Ada',348834,1.4633,2.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41783,_binary '\0','/nmyhkgVzUcQMieoe91uOOb4TpAJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5290620',2,4715,'hi','क्या कूल हैं हम 3','In order to impress his girlfriend\'s conservative father, a porn actor uses his fellow adult movie stars in creating a fake traditional family.','/w9XCRN8JOe2cylkPePv6uLT6Bkc.jpg','2016-01-22',124,'Released','India\'s first porn-com.','Kyaa Kool Hain Hum 3',376884,1.2072,2.882,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41784,_binary '\0','/ferdDyXvWARYARWcZNMBE372L6u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5290882',6.6,4193,'zh','唐人街探案','After being rejected from the police college, a mannerly man travels to Bangkok where he and an energetic distant relative must solve a murder case.','/sYmdUFpcpRqlmeETqhcMrYJbjbN.jpg','2015-12-31',135,'Released',NULL,'Detective Chinatown',373200,2.9554,6.8,'XDWHxtGMgGw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41785,_binary '\0','/l86Le8IYes1IzHcTIVPVIUYnsTA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5291604',7.7,1444,'bn','স্বপ্নজাল','Set in the \'90s in suburbs of Bangladesh and West Bengal, a love story developed between two young souls against the backdrop of communal riots.','/oOizqhhPUX6Gl6Hcs0okZhAPUIH.jpg','2018-04-06',141,'Released',NULL,'Swapnajaal',522359,1.7039,5,'Pup6pxmNfC4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41786,_binary '\0','/7scVQtLbHq7DwimNllHA45YilWx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5291792',5.5,2171,'en','Furlough','In between caring for her mother, a young woman works part time at a prison. The rookie guard gets a chance to prove her mettle when she\'s tasked with accompanying a hell-raising inmate on an emergency furlough to visit her dying mother. But things soon spiral out of control, sending the pair on a hilarious, surprising, and ultimately touching road trip.','/cw1RkjmbNfIbujkPGh6a8J9Lrf1.jpg','2018-03-16',84,'Released','There are pros and cons to every friendship.','Furlough',502426,1.9044,5.7,'0dQGD5lRan0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41787,_binary '\0','/t6R51hogU5KnQ2ot1LSWMgVqvn2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5291862',3.5,1265,'en','Internet Famous','A group of Internet \"sensations\" compete for a tv show. Parody of the Internet.','/uVoW2fahXeKBZh3qTMmKfXggkHv.jpg','2016-06-21',87,'Released','Love them. Hate them. Follow them.','Internet Famous',401442,2.2123,3.9,'lfPkNGh_gaw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41788,_binary '\0','/aXrw7OZmS2dNEa1Vcj1RYirAASa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5294198',5.9,7660,'en','Catfight','The rivalry between two former college friends comes to a head when they both attend the same glamorous event.','/j3kLVDNJlU6IIMmt