Heights is an adaptation of Milen Ruskov\'s novel of the same name, published in 2011. The film explores the Bulgarian realities of the 1870s a few years before the war, that would liberate the country from the Ottoman occupation. Directed by Victor Bojinov and adapted by Neli Dimitrova, the story follows Gicho a young man in a revolutionary group led by Dimitar Obshti, a real-life revolutionary fighting against the Turks. After a successful train robbery Obshti entrust Gicho with a special mission: to deliver a letter to Vasil Levski, the country\'s most famous freedom fighter, now considered hero and dubbed The Apostle of Freedom.','/cLASLPF7R71srTQ12FwTqOqx99X.jpg','2017-11-10',120,'Released','Everyone wants to live','Heights',477866,2.5795,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41815,_binary '\0','/mMtUybQ6hL24FXo0F3Z4j2KG7kZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5311514',8.4,404997,'ja','君の名は。','High schoolers Mitsuha and Taki are complete strangers living separate lives. But one night, they suddenly switch places. Mitsuha wakes up in Taki’s body, and he in hers. This bizarre occurrence continues to happen randomly, and the two must adjust their lives around each other.','/vfJFJPepRKapMd5G2ro7klIRysq.jpg','2016-07-01',106,'Released','Separated by distance, connected by fate.','Your Name.',372058,29.5393,8.487,'RuyHIkXdYf8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41816,_binary '\0','/lFLQNIkNVIHLXNVDHbt4pow4lXc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5311542',7.7,28532,'de','Werk ohne Autor','German artist Kurt Barnert has escaped East Germany and now lives in West Germany, but is tormented by his childhood under the Nazis and the GDR regime.','/fn0Tp9SG0IQ3Nx8iHPYPiseLMWd.jpg','2018-10-03',188,'Released',NULL,'Never Look Away',423612,7.6156,7.743,'gCEYXnDNcrg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41817,_binary '\0','/mUbq0l1nGHbyFyNncxvLJMKXMUw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5311546',8.8,8235,'mr','नटसम्राट','A veteran Shakespearean actor steps off the stage and into the painful tragedy of old age, facing ungrateful family and his fleeting legacy. Based on a play of the same name written by playwright Kusumagraj (V. V. Shirwadkar).','/x4KvM8NBi8m44aqwEMgsJPzA5Ne.jpg','2016-01-01',166,'Released','The King Of Theatre','Natsamrat',378227,1.6918,8.3,'DCXDyIsPEN8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41818,_binary '\0','/vBId5iBnayC6yyqKFeX9shSaoCQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5312232',8.3,16595,'mr','सैराट','Archi, a local politician’s daughter, and Parshya, a fisherman’s son, fall in love resulting in violence between the families due to the stringent casteism in the village.','/d8K4ZI1RSxMkIIwu5cuvZmzwohq.jpg','2016-04-29',170,'Released',NULL,'Sairat',383367,1.461,7.6,'iShPI_JF524','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41819,_binary '\0','/sMRClEfKQ1SmrsCt3NgWVynzevr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5313016',6.6,1611,'en','Love in Paradise','When a Western movie star is forced to spend a PR weekend at a dude ranch, his fans are horrified to learn he\'s actually a city slicker who\'s afraid of horses and has never been west of the Hudson River.','/2X1ZTZY442QYsLdUrW6Gk8x05bO.jpg','2016-01-02',84,'Released',NULL,'Love in Paradise',374603,1.9777,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41820,_binary '\0','/688EDSOOC2WR2kwjvmbmjmMIMxd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5313906',6.4,1252,'fr','Zombillénium','Zombillenium, the Halloween theme park, happens to be the one place on earth where real monsters can hide in plain sight. When Hector, a human, threatens to disclose the true identity of his employees, the Vampire Park Manager has no other choice but to hire him. To see his daughter, Hector must escape from his zombie and werewolf co-workers.','/nqchkfd2LaFFRvpjWPYPUNMQOQR.jpg','2017-10-18',78,'Released',NULL,'Zombillénium',454549,2.7832,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41821,_binary '\0','/yuXpvShHGBqcVtG9KcAZxoUgbGF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5314118',7,5191,'en','Journeyman','A boxer suffers a serious head injury during a fight, and must deal with the consequences.','/47ITipyIx7QPjB1oyNsR6H52Ic0.jpg','2018-03-30',92,'Released','Some fights you cannot fight alone','Journeyman',429194,1.4815,6.622,'KCKQ9bVO4w4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41822,_binary '\0','/4pEbf7P2xlifhNmwAemcdAbomyZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5314190',6.9,2963,'en','Sgt. Stubby: An American Hero','The true story of the most decorated dog in American military history - Sgt. Stubby - and the enduring bonds he forged with his brothers-in-arms in the trenches of World War I.','/rmpykGuvJznJw4iY4hpVVn5ZDdh.jpg','2018-04-13',85,'Released','The incredible true story of America\'s top underdog','Sgt. Stubby: An American Hero',433694,4.8251,7.9,'ab0pd9oNf7Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41823,_binary '\0','/93OyDHh1GjepWdv5KxUpP1tPYjO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5314450',6.7,4494,'en','Burden','Ku Klux Klansman Mike Burden opens the Redneck Shop and KKK museum in historic Laurens, SC. He subsequently falls in love with a single mother and, under her influence, quits the Klan and is taken in by an African American Reverend.','/23tMG9TdzcABOpnTlgfIGZtQ6DN.jpg','2018-08-05',129,'Released','Based on the powerful and inspiring true story.','Burden',424201,1.8367,6.1,'SATynwll5fE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41824,_binary '\0','/rgZ3hdzgMgYgzvBfwNEVW01bpK1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5315210',6.2,39543,'en','Lou','A young girl is kidnapped during a powerful storm. Her mother joins forces with her mysterious neighbour to set off in pursuit of the kidnapper. Their journey will test their limits and expose the dark secrets of their past.','/djM2s4wSaATn4jVB33cV05PEbV7.jpg','2022-09-23',107,'Released',NULL,'Lou',429473,4.9631,6.469,'QILhvR4QPsQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41825,_binary '\0','/3FJ53wbpjSAGY98KYiHJ4DQccDr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5315212',5.5,48852,'en','Senior Year','A 37-year-old woman wakes up from a 22-year coma, and returns to the high school where she was once a popular cheerleader to finish her senior year and become prom queen.','/6UqbcDQhCYpxboK58Z0eVfdeHcT.jpg','2022-05-11',114,'Released','High school has changed. But she hasn\'t.','Senior Year',800937,6.9529,5.901,'HCtDkpe89aY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41826,_binary '\0','/6ATLd3vjzni4HiCh4bknzcTRE51.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5316540',5.7,29034,'en','Close','A counter-terrorism expert takes a job protecting a young heiress. After an attempted kidnapping puts both of their lives in danger, they must flee.','/iYAwwdE5KvDaU4Uyll5h4XscXkc.jpg','2019-02-22',95,'Released','Trained to protect. Born to survive.','Close',460321,4.5671,6,'qWKsiHEpiJM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41827,_binary '\0','/hpK2WqK7CuZ5iV8L0zH9uWrF4lg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5316648',4.1,6248,'hi','Blind','A brutal cat and mouse game between a blind ex-cop Gia Singh and a psychopathic serial killer, who likes to torture and kill young women.','/s0OPCt54xWdQOewOlXLETi2POWf.jpg','2023-07-07',124,'Released',NULL,'Blind',780381,1.0164,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41828,_binary '\0','/zU7ErL9C6mcOpxZpaqvC1f22F0i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5317546',6.9,2006,'en','Murder, She Baked: A Peach Cobbler Mystery','With The Cookie Jar, Hannah Swensen has a mouthwatering monopoly on the bakery business of Lake Eden, Minnesota. But when a rival store opens, and one of the owners is found shot to death in the store, Hannah is determined to prove that she wasn\'t the only one who had an axe to grind with the Quinn sisters. Somebody wasn\'t fooled by the Georgia Peaches and their sweet-as-pie act--and now it\'s up to Hannah to track down whoever had the right ingredients to whip up a murder.','/j01HSBHf7EhYXdlI4vbdRrqX7Tf.jpg','2016-01-10',84,'Released',NULL,'Murder, She Baked: A Peach Cobbler Mystery',371181,2.1045,7.1,'KNWsRujBzbs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41829,_binary '\0','/kxkLO3qhmvoJhIT76nUQdoVhb3Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5317914',6.1,2462,'ru','Ледокол','The story is based on the real events of 1985. The team of a Russian polar icebreaker “Mikhail Gromov” discovered a giant iceberg. The ship came into collision while attempting to take cover from the weather and is forced to drift with ice along the Amundsen Sea coast. The crew of “Gromov” spent 133 days of polar night trying to find a way out of their icy trap. They have no room for mistakes; one wrong move and the vessel is crushed by ice.','/zvVjhgkuGXivxdyYK8nTAfpROLF.jpg','2016-10-20',120,'Released',NULL,'The Icebreaker',393277,2.29,5.866,'5caGIyrhXks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41830,_binary '\0','/8zqznH6imO7FmXeStoxI7Uw3z7h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5318534',5.5,1731,'en','People You May Know','An introvert realizes he can be whomever he wants to be on the Internet.','/xweS8KHCYU84GNNUpsrQ7CV8ZeV.jpg','2017-04-07',92,'Released',NULL,'People You May Know',447358,2.0607,5.2,'eJ4n2PKpppE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41831,_binary '\0','/7dEAViBTMRKEmZMEgRg4FUwX5Gr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5319866',6,2056,'en','Slamma Jamma','Wrongfully accused and sent to prison, a former basketball star prepares for the national slam dunk competition while finding redemption in himself and in those he loves.','/neKzLN7UaFzwP3H1r0FyYVtMGTh.jpg','2017-03-24',104,'Released',NULL,'Slamma Jamma',428323,1.8208,6.1,'T1qNcsB6PtY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41832,_binary '\0','/xosG4ldBmRcG6VV1sK37Tyzj9H3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5320514',7.6,5017,'ml','ആക്ഷൻ ഹീറോ ബിജു','Biju is an honest policeman who fights the injustice head-on. In his pursuit to keep things under control and clean, he encounters a series of events and cases which test his authority, honesty and integrity. With a week to his wedding, what ensues is a heartfelt story of a cop sans the cinematic hype.','/nQFi62nYw8CISzV0US6sb7v324v.jpg','2016-02-04',144,'Released','A ride with a police officer','Action Hero Biju',381374,1.458,7.36,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41833,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5320522',6.5,1499,'ml','മൺസൂൺ മംഗോസ്','D.P Pallickal, an amateur film maker who claims he is the next film legend. D.P has great passion, but lacks talent. His family and friends constantly make fun of his amateurishness of his masterpiece short films.','/kR1knO2mQQsjRegYMlTluu5o3zF.jpg','2016-01-15',132,'Released',NULL,'Monsoon Mangoes',378891,1.1719,6.2,'tdSfogH3Gbs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41834,_binary '\0','/4FrEYi7T0JUdx3cRor3m4u6q4ad.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5322004',6.8,2872,'en','Three Months','Caleb, a South Florida teen, loves his camera, his weed and his grandmother. On the eve of his high school graduation, everything changes when he\'s exposed to HIV. While he waits three months for his results, Caleb finds love in the most unlikely of places.','/eTD5TXjNbQ9c0BawMquBCO667yE.jpg','2022-02-23',104,'Released','It\'s amazing what you can discover when life gets f*cked up.','Three Months',793992,2.5853,7.076,'9QUnHtGBEug','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41835,_binary '\0','/rYpOaLb908aDspCuaa1o7nn5Bf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5322012',5.1,26354,'en','Wish Upon','A teenage girl discovers a box with magical powers, but those powers comes with a deadly price.','/u0vnocj57vJt5DHoBEqUOD1G4SU.jpg','2017-07-07',91,'Released','Be careful what you wish for.','Wish Upon',440597,5.5799,5.7,'2TlcxQdK0og','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41836,_binary '\0','/s6YqemOeTUfxOlUxGJixEgt9qpw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5322168',7.1,2787,'en','Snapshots','Rose spends her days fishing near the beautiful lake house she’s called home for 50 years. She’s not getting any younger and her daughter Patti worries about Rose being all alone, but the stubborn matriarch will not sell. There are memories here that she doesn’t want to leave. These come flooding back one weekend during a visit from Patti and granddaughter Allison, when a long-forgotten roll of film reminds Rose of the summer she met and fell in love with the bold and beautiful Louise.','/vLyx4n6Rcim8E57VRjU6B6Kspzw.jpg','2018-07-27',95,'Released',NULL,'Snapshots',507697,1.9272,7.1,'Ta1HPCggZ3Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41837,_binary '\0','/bHM3Gx3a76oX8WtIzqTXZLnadbk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5323568',6.5,1949,'ml','പുതിയ നിയമം','Louis Pothen is an all rounder. He is divorce lawyer, he participates in live TV channel debates on various topics, and he is a film critic, too. His wife Vasuki Iyer is a Kathakali artist, and together with his school-going daughter, they live in a city highrise. The story further focuses on an incident that sort of transformed the lively Vasuki into an introvert. What follows is a dramatic exploration of Vasuki\'s recent past and how she gets over it.','/9ymNTdX5WD5yUiT38RmUjSi4qJD.jpg','2016-02-12',133,'Released','New Law','Puthiya Niyamam',371813,1.3415,6.42,'tLu86VMDMiQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41838,_binary '\0','/g2HDk6byPIciEZNAm24KNpBwymD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5323640',6,7996,'ta','சி3','A reputed cop from Tamil Nadu takes charge in Andhra Pradesh to solve the mysterious murder of a top police officer, and takes on local thugs and criminals during the course of his mission.','/eSSNPcF2FQ0JUQ1OQ8xwibZgNqE.jpg','2017-01-26',155,'Released','The Universal Cop','Si 3',376440,1.7985,5.52,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41839,_binary '\0','/5lAMQMWpXMsirvtLLvW7cJgEPkU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5323662',8.2,149952,'ja','映画 聲の形','Shouya Ishida starts bullying the new girl in class, Shouko Nishimiya, because she is deaf. But as the teasing continues, the rest of the class starts to turn on Shouya for his lack of compassion. When they leave elementary school, Shouko and Shouya do not speak to each other again... until an older, wiser Shouya, tormented by his past behaviour, decides he must see Shouko once more. He wants to atone for his sins, but is it already too late...?','/tuFaWiqX0TXoWu7DGNcmX3UW7sT.jpg','2016-09-17',129,'Released','Sometimes the answer is as simple as learning to listen.','A Silent Voice: The Movie',378064,16.2603,8.4,'E7utbHbxDAM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41840,_binary '\0','/vNZHUbV1EdI11bD7yzOBGbRYzaY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5323760',6.3,2034,'da','Vinterbrødre','A brother odyssey set in a workers\' environment during a cold winter. We follow two brothers - their routines, habits and rituals - and a violent feud that erupts between them and another family.','/dCGmJllbpuFIrhUscbCXxsUxOZ6.jpg','2017-12-07',93,'Released','A Lack of Love Story','Winter Brothers',466172,1.7467,5.9,'m0RaGwzqLBE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41841,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5324456',6.8,1648,'ml','വേട്ട','Two police officers trapped in a web of deception and lies from everyone they trust after they take up a case involving a mysterious man who is arrested for a double homicide.','/pcuA4E3M4RO7227XMDfV0EfhA5X.jpg','2016-02-26',112,'Released','Hunt','Vettah',385238,1.2068,6.7,'I8VyKEceCsA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41842,_binary '\0','/97VEHuxdYPeqPulI3cbhtPNJEWz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5324800',5.5,1819,'fr','Ils sont partout','Four separate stories deal with stereotypical ideas about Jews: their alleged influence on politics, the stereotype of Jewish business-mindedness, the Mossad, the Jewish world conspiracy and the memory of the Holocaust.','/nO2e8IVtpWtdM3lawEE6svyfvhZ.jpg','2016-06-01',111,'Released','They Are Everywhere','The Jews',393407,2.4464,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41843,_binary '\0','/2fC29LRezRnpQwnbjxXSO7dakb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5325452',4.7,10361,'en','Boo! A Madea Halloween','Madea winds up in the middle of mayhem when she spends a hilarious, haunted Halloween fending off killers, paranormal poltergeists, ghosts, ghouls, and zombies while keeping a watchful eye on a group of misbehaving teens.','/82TLEZv1rOJNgllfYD22NkivGDH.jpg','2016-10-21',103,'Released','Trick or treat, fools.','Boo! A Madea Halloween',380124,3.8544,5.8,'-sPHseSGr9Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41844,_binary '\0','/h5k7cS1KLPTGOrzRW6Ulqb0jszi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5325684',3.4,2033,'hi','Hate Story IV','Tasha, who aspires to make it big in life, catches the eye of two womanising brothers, who promise to make her a star. Yet her hidden intentions may prove deadly for the duo.','/7mI6YgCVFfKDSlSDN8MuSY8oCFJ.jpg','2018-03-09',131,'Released','Hate is Coming','Hate Story IV',501192,1.0754,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41845,_binary '\0','/soHvoglTiaErt3BpNCVawd58Dl5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5327922',5.6,1788,'en','Mythica: The Godslayer','As the Lich King\'s zombie legions ravage the world, a cursed young sorceress embarks on a quest to obtain a weapon from the gods. But when she joins her sworn enemy in a desperate attempt to save the world, she must recover the good in herself before her friends are all dead, and defeat the Lich King before the gods are destroyed and the world forever enslaved.','/a2RjGmJPfk3Wcb8wMoLe5dkxeMj.jpg','2016-12-17',118,'Released',NULL,'Mythica: The Godslayer',401689,2.5031,6.1,'kU1ZtjWZML4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41846,_binary '\0','/p5rlMIvxWI7jBXur6wjeNiaZVPj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5328350',6.3,6498,'pl','Pokot','A story about Janina Duszejko, an elderly woman, who lives alone in the Klodzko Valley where a series of mysterious crimes are committed. Duszejko is convinced that she knows who (or what) is the murderer, but nobody believes her.','/8a3rRg9hMp1swcejSGbUSDdSFl1.jpg','2017-02-24',128,'Released',NULL,'Spoor',432799,1.8931,6.2,'O96ZznajP5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41847,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5328602',4,3244,'en','Hell Trip','A group of young tourists arrive at an abandoned lodge in Africa that holds an ominous and deadly secret.','/mq5uw4yXoOitDAKQ6TWAe1Uli4S.jpg','2018-09-14',86,'Released','The Journey Ends Here.','Hell Trip',516604,1.0808,3.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41848,_binary '\0','/vxda5MKQVGD3P0imt3tW9QCacZJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5329376',6.2,9038,'en','Beware the Slenderman','In this horrifyingly modern fairytale lurks an online Boogeyman and two 12-year-old girls who would kill for him. The entrance to the internet quickly leads to its darkest basement. How responsible are our children for what they find there?','/f5W2nhbnzOR2aNa7vSpwWCzzAw2.jpg','2016-03-11',115,'Released','On May 31st, 2014, in the woods outside of Waukesha, Wisconsin, two 12-year old girls stabbed their classmate 19 times. This is the true story of what drove them to do it.','Beware the Slenderman',376424,1.705,6.5,'6p1eVLEbOIw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41849,_binary '\0','/3fbcSHlu2SQ9Gcek0PfcDCGLL5P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5329524',6.5,2836,'en','All Things Valentine','Avery, a blogger with a string of disappointing Valentine’s Days, is ready to give up on love when she meets handsome veterinarian Brenden. When Avery finds out Brenden blames his recent break up on her blog and is the one leaving her angry comments, she begins to question whether the bond they’ve began to build is a true love story or yesterday’s news.','/2iU19KivcXMk27837pwsVv6wcTj.jpg','2016-01-31',85,'Released','All you need is love.','All Things Valentine',377428,1.9238,5.9,NULL,NULL,NU