en seeing the same nightmare for some time, but she keeps living unaware that what she sees is actually remembering. A 30-year-old woman who works in a News Channel, living alone in the flat left by her musician parents who died in a car crash twenty years ago. Is it? The question creeps into her mind, and then (or maybe even before) her life through recurring nightmares: Is it possible that her parents did not die in a car crash?','/aNAj7LAqeVwvTySjW7zMuhuKE5U.jpg','2017-05-12',94,'Released','We Forget Everything, Except For Our Nightmares','Inflame',438532,0.8651,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41855,_binary '\0','/oxEuaEHqM7ZjI6KhIo7T3SljqKc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5334704',7.5,15951,'en','Twin Peaks: The Missing Pieces','A feature-length compilation of deleted and alternate takes from Twin Peaks: Fire Walk with Me, assembled by creator David Lynch to continue the story of the final week of Laura Palmer’s life.','/xQevnHeRxlQTfXQ5RxXJE4PnVUO.jpg','2014-07-16',91,'Released',NULL,'Twin Peaks: The Missing Pieces',284457,4.3572,7.2,'g5EqPZMZO4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41856,_binary '\0','/xB3qbS9LoO0VJ6dO2M6So8bBjNa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5335128',6.9,5985,'ml','കലി','A young wife hopes to convince her husband to change his short-tempered attitude toward life, but an incident on a remote highway may finally decide the matter.','/92JuEJ0bB6yVjikLj7oiUxmHdtU.jpg','2016-03-26',116,'Released',NULL,'Kali',391036,1.8319,6.446,'vJ72PkYYZHs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41857,_binary '\0','/bNPTZFJDEQymJg6ha2o3Ac5IhMC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5335314',8.1,4047,'ro','Un pas în urma serafimilor','A group of freshmen in an orthodox college are introduced in a world of cons, pleasure and money, but they soon discover that\'s not the way one\'s life should be lead.','/d0L7xfHBWKk8J8ckvR55VUoqxmo.jpg','2017-09-22',150,'Released',NULL,'One Step Behind the Seraphim',449752,1.3847,7.7,'wqC19z8Ayr8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41858,_binary '\0','/teFULIdnxbEIKsy7jzWu35KybJe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5335394',6.5,1363,'ta','கதகளி','Returning from the states to marry his girlfriend, a common man is blamed for the murder of a local don due to their enmity in the past. He is caught in a web of conspiracies as he struggles to prove his innocence and the don\'s in-laws order their henchmen to take him down.','/fFPLFLH7rgn0f2k5VhUWgG6G1tn.jpg','2016-01-14',125,'Released',NULL,'Kathakali',368012,0.9329,6.381,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41859,_binary '\0','/mlJoaocwe4yopxastL9ki8vKSy1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5335774',8.3,5230,'ro','Cravata galbenă','The extraordinary life of Sergiu Celibidache, from his childhood in Romania to his exile in pursuit of a career in music, his struggle for survival in wartime Germany and his rise, fall and rise again, in an unimaginable life journey.','/tkCQjcvLKG5HhvVyqkNriifLgLW.jpg','2025-11-14',145,'Released','Greatness comes at a cost.','The Yellow Tie',1245119,3.768,8.2,'2BhecPoz6bU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41860,_binary '\0','/11hLXThOT3ntF0lsRu1HHVlqGAT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5338222',7.4,5967,'ja','ぼくは明日、昨日のきみとデートする','Takatoshi Minamiyama majors in art at an university in Kyoto. On the train to the school, he sees Emi Fukuju and falls in love with her at first sight. Gathering up all his courage, he speaks to her. They begin to date and enjoy happy days together, but Emi reveals her secret to him.','/wtRJKkspD4pv3fd2lO2cT93dpzq.jpg','2016-12-17',111,'Released',NULL,'My Tomorrow, Your Yesterday',428099,3.2389,7.5,'hdA7iA32XaA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41861,_binary '\0','/yh8uHhSsNlWWMJwougARLCE8Nbv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5338620',8,2342,'hi','Satyavati: And We Call This Love','\"When you are shunned and looked down upon for non-conformance, there is nowhere to go. When your protector has become the threat, there is nowhere to go.When the crime gets legitimized in the garb of tradition, there is nowhere to go\" Satyavati- and we call this love is a story that takes place in today\'s times where tenderness & innocence come under attack and all that remain is a scar. And nowhere to go.','/tByVfyDwbgc4GIM8cXZfKCEgbar.jpg','2016-05-18',81,'Released',NULL,'Satyavati: And We Call This Love',511340,1.508,3.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41862,_binary '\0','/4F49qaAAByaA5NSHfWlUXRBb2D5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5338644',5.1,1751,'fr','Madame Hyde','Mrs. Géquil is an eccentric teacher despised by her colleagues and students. On a stormy night, she is struck by lightning and faints. When she wakes up, she feels different. Will she now be able to keep the powerful and dangerous Mrs. Hyde contained?','/oGolRZ4pwq42wY45pbErEtLc3oO.jpg','2018-03-28',95,'Released','A shy teacher by day. A dangerous creature at night?','Mrs. Hyde',446171,2.0169,4.3,'GsuH63FAIx4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41863,_binary '\0','/kTaMDD9LAmIpGjsoA5hWWn3eJ19.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5338774',6.8,1959,'en','Power of Grayskull: The Definitive History of He-Man and the Masters of the Universe','This documentary looks to forge the greatest, most definitive, documentary on everything He-Man and the Masters of the Universe, She-Ra, the live action movie, New Adventures of He-Man, the 200x series and much more! They delve into the toys, comics, cartoons, and movies from all eras by talking to the artists, creators, executives and actors who helped make it a reality.','/4P5uySVECRxbmNAiOmsKDbskRjl.jpg','2017-09-09',95,'Released',NULL,'Power of Grayskull: The Definitive History of He-Man and the Masters of the Universe',540556,2.3457,7,'rwM8ScDycYY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41864,_binary '\0','/rMtxdxpt2f7HkWmYqR5jgDfE8Mb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5339418',4.8,4359,'en','Ryde','Technology brings us closer. Or perhaps it brings strangers, a little too close. But how much can you really trust someone? With a new ride share service, you never know who will be getting in a car with. Or if you\'ll ever get out.','/9beQCY3w1GiqCSeAQeU4GBb7oZW.jpg','2017-09-15',84,'Released','You have reached your final destination.','Ryde',471493,1.3979,4.4,'3RLQTGyqYSs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41865,_binary '\0','/a26Gj4TqFKEdku1XLIWLFpzUgv4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5340300',7.1,14982,'en','Lean on Pete','Charley Thompson, a teenager living with his single father, gets a summer job working for horse trainer Del Montgomery. Bonding with an aging racehorse named Lean on Pete, Charley is horrified to learn he is bound for slaughter, and so he steals the horse, and the duo embark on an odyssey across the new American frontier.','/7SuPHSo9Uw8GACkP2oPst512Qhl.jpg','2018-04-06',121,'Released','You can’t get anywhere on your own.','Lean on Pete',407890,4.5565,6.9,'bhTXPAH-gIs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41866,_binary '\0','/6eoHmYdTJ9UtoYrrfrEWzgED7Vf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5340362',6.5,2732,'en','Anything for Love','Katherine, a high-powered executive who believes men are intimidated by her career, is persuaded by her friend to create an internet dating profile claiming she is an executive assistant.','/jvKECIiRF6qSp6LOXKfkuw1XpIO.jpg','2016-02-14',84,'Released',NULL,'Anything for Love',379990,2.9124,6,'E6IKTaz2Mi4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41867,_binary '\0','/bjUHlIaqzRKa3BPGPeVtSucr4XK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5340522',6.3,1818,'te','సోగ్గాడే చిన్నినాయనా','Ramu and Seetha have come to India for divorce. Ramu\'s mother Satyabhama is helpless and desperately remembers her dead husband Bangarraju. Lord Yama decides to send him to earth to help her.','/zCAk3HdAfWbhd7JHl9XqFz7nops.jpg','2016-01-15',145,'Released',NULL,'Soggade Chinni Nayana',378777,1.199