s nine year old son, the family dog, and two of his son\'s friends backpacking in the mountains of Colorado only for all five of them to be struck by lightning.','/bxw9tRRPZHIQ3vYOubS3DVfgnDo.jpg','2017-10-06',92,'Released','One dog can change everything.','The Stray',470205,1.4678,6.2,'zNEP_mJFXS0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41873,_binary '\0','/fVcbXwdg5Seo44PzCQJHIc6KGFr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5342950',5,3933,'en','The Wolf Hour','Once a known counterculture figure, June E. Leigh now lives in self-imposed exile in her South Bronx apartment during the incendiary \'77 Summer of Sam. When an unseen tormentor begins exploiting June\'s weaknesses, her insular universe begins to unravel.','/5SyTpTdc2cWnqHECMvI5lBxuq2Y.jpg','2019-01-26',99,'Released',NULL,'The Wolf Hour',483353,3.0493,5.3,'AhFxMqhGtzg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41874,_binary '\0','/gVjiwn600GPSbL36I7wO62gH6Uw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5344054',4.4,9272,'en','American Night','A neo-noir set in the New York City\'s corrupt contemporary art world where the art dealer John Kaplan and the ruthless head of New York\'s mafia, Michael Rubino, fight for money, art, power and love.','/isN2CPsxUNyU8z5ig1xxoXfHOF5.jpg','2021-10-01',123,'Released','Art + Life = Chaos','American Night',695080,3.308,4.3,'fmffb2NHruM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41875,_binary '\0','/yj1HFRGCviH7Vh6Cmnylf7H3S5C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5344794',3,4053,'en','Sniper: Special Ops','A Special Ops military Force, led by expert sniper Sergeant Jake Chandler, are sent to a remote Afghan village to extract an American congressman being held by the Taliban.','/jgE31g7hqV9UVJKqz3LCwm5oDb8.jpg','2016-04-03',84,'Released','He\'s watching your six.','Sniper: Special Ops',394223,3.1946,4.3,'Ar-5PAj-YOc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41876,_binary '\0','/cRotDg3FZ1Kij0PU0SLp1eS6HMH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5345298',5,3804,'en','Patient Seven','Dr. Marcus, a renowned psychiatrist, has selected 6 severe mentally ill and dangerous patients from the Spring Valley Mental Hospital to interview as part of research for his new book. As Dr. Marcus interviews each patient, one by one the horrors they have committed begin to unfold. However, Dr. Marcus soon learns that there is one patient who ties them all together - Patient Seven.','/m5r7gdj65mfcghrzEob42YRyvAX.jpg','2016-10-11',116,'Released','Try to remain calm.','Patient Seven',410126,2.2057,5.2,'oSWZ2oFqgrk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41877,_binary '\0','/9NNY9oXn5rqk3VZDLQgTdBvwoHq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5348236',6.7,3303,'fr','Sage femme','Claire is a midwife and has devoted her life to others. At a moment when she is preoccupied by the imminent closure of the maternity clinic where she works, her life is further turned upside down when Béatrice, her father\'s former mistress, turns up on the scene. Béatrice is a capricious and selfish woman, Claire\'s exact opposite.','/wBrJGrTmUaGeJVPxAqJT2iZHQCA.jpg','2017-03-22',117,'Released',NULL,'The Midwife',439154,3.309,6.1,'S_FLOFTvqdQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41878,_binary '\0','/xe7PSGl603NPPAOvSr1bs44hQs3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5350358',6.4,1321,'de','Jonathan','A young man struggles with the pressure of caring for his terminally ill father while trying to unlock a secret that his father seems determined to keep from him. The story takes another dramatic turn when Ron, Burghardt’s long-lost friend from his youth, re-appears — and a well-kept family secret is uncovered.','/myBiRSPMOknyhaGRbZUtNy9Q9YO.jpg','2016-05-05',99,'Released',NULL,'Jonathan',380874,1.1127,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41879,_binary '\0','/dMzdWsi3KzyvcBjmyo7M5mJdMAu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5351458',5.6,6369,'en','The Hatton Garden Job','In April 2015, the Hatton Garden Safe Deposit Company, an underground safe deposit facility in London\'s Hatton Garden area, was burgled by 4 elderly men. With the stolen property having a value of up to £200 million, the incident has been called the \"largest burglary in English history\".','/oHKjxdTw0e85Vo9G3VviUihvFkV.jpg','2017-04-14',93,'Released','It\'s never too late to come out on top.','The Hatton Garden Job',448847,4.2405,5.518,'E8Ao-3NlhMA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41880,_binary '\0','/gHCAEAC96OS2YpqXYDcBu7nahV7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5351818',6.1,5214,'fr','Rock\'n Roll','Guillaume Canet is told by a young co-star that he\'s no longer Rock\'n Roll and can\'t sell films anymore. He then tries to prove her wrong and gets help from his girlfriend, Marion Cotillard.','/tkzVWew2NgepjYDWu5WeVXLEeCj.jpg','2017-02-15',123,'Released',NULL,'Rock\'n Roll',382589,2.1658,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41881,_binary '\0','/nyvclBVmlgQtfjv1beY0hZL0eh5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5352846',5.4,7050,'en','Drone','Ideologies collide with fatal results when a military drone contractor meets an enigmatic Pakistani businessman.','/o1Zp7DBOkxDhGCg6fXhuaFaFwsN.jpg','2017-05-26',91,'Released','Choose your target wisely.','Drone',452068,4.0813,5.3,'n1EKlcvHTvk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41882,_binary '\0','/weDuRCMSCXgVQNQmSsfCQtdAmoK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5354160',8.8,31152,'bn','আয়নাবাজি','Ayna is an actor, and the prison is his stage. Unable to pursue his passion in a rigid society, he turns real life into his theater—taking money from the powerful to serve their prison sentences in their place. Everything changes when he falls for the girl next door, inspiring him to pull off one final swap and leave the dark trade forever. But his last performance plunges him deep into a treacherous rabbit hole. To survive a merciless system and break free from a criminal game he helped build, this underdog must execute the ultimate escape.','/1Cz5Q7PH2JklNV7OzMkTenPGrEf.jpg','2016-09-30',144,'Released','Mirror Game','Mirror Game',418325,1.9167,7.922,'zfTM48zbi_c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41883,_binary '\0','/sfsP1rCgPhyFkRnuxhPS92TXV0t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5356670',3.2,1278,'en','Hell Girl','A demonic creature not of this world impregnates a woman. 160 years later a team of ghost hunters must set aside their quick buck party mentality when they discover one of their team is the offspring of the entity haunting the place - and its true target. The offspring and her friends become uneasy allies with the ghost of the mother to destroy the demon and restore harmony.','/ku33DN2nw0LvdapeA6g6QTV7BgM.jpg','2019-04-02',81,'Released',NULL,'Hell Girl',599484,1.6196,5.5,'z47bI7lay6g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41884,_binary '\0','/iIlkWN6J2Hhq5N3SqaBQJQNRvhZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5357556',6.2,3070,'nl','De Premier','The Belgian PM is abducted and he finds his wife and children taken hostage. If he wants to see them again – alive – he has to kill the person he is meeting later that day. And that person is no less than... the president of the United States.','/eQnBG1FVRZfEZrnYSfmGJJIQ36L.jpg','2016-03-02',115,'Released',NULL,'The Prime Minister',394645,1.786,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41885,_binary '\0','/bekTvv3qfw9aJTm6JiMtLcxkynm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5358948',3.2,1585,'hi','One Night Stand','An obsession with a woman Celina with whom Urvil had a one-night stand brings disharmony into hiss life and destroys his peace of mind.','/A0CExJQZRf8CWDLPGSywTTHLeZl.jpg','2016-05-06',97,'Released',NULL,'One Night Stand',396389,1.4287,4.048,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41886,_binary '\0','/fAgn3iepk1wBQZcnGoG2MfiWgaj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5359624',6.9,2150,'hi','CRD','The Purushottam Karandak — a real-life inter-college festival in which theater students compete head-to-head — becomes an ideological battleground in this bold,brilliant exploration of the creative impulse. IFFLA alum Kranti Kanade leaves no radical idea or experimental flourish behind as he tells the story of Chetan, an aspiring young writer who dreams of winning the competition but struggles to find his own artistic voice. After Chetan clashes with his tyrannical acting professor, he enlists his own group of misfits to perform a play against his college’s official team. If only he could come up with a great story and keep his own temper and libido in check. And should true art even be placed in a competition, where one vision is declared the best?','/6yu0G5IIgZL1o6tx4xUVX1YbpPg.jpg','2016-11-04',108,'Released',NULL,'CRD',390836,0.5061,7,'Bi5mdz6xofo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41887,_binary '\0','/3ZQRLuXNTbewOHDfxF51fy74gh4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5360952',5.2,23883,'en','The Hurricane Heist','Thieves attempt a massive heist against the U.S. Treasury as a Category 5 hurricane approaches one of its Mint facilities.','/rAmcj5IZcx59dhev3UnVDEGlImK.jpg','2018-02-28',103,'Released','The storm of the century... the heist of a lifetime.','The Hurricane Heist',430040,6.6305,5.7,'KP4sl0_pN68','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41888,_binary '\0','/hvdRLJSKy2a3Ulzrl1Wlnqq2pKZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5360996',5.9,12381,'en','Mary Magdalene','In the first century, free-spirited Mary Magdalene flees the marriage her family has arranged for her, finding refuge and a sense of purpose in a radical new movement led by the charismatic, rabble-rousing preacher named Jesus.','/oLbqnVAmD8ISel1SLTY3Ek0TWz8.jpg','2018-03-15',120,'Released','Her story will be told','Mary Magdalene',407439,5.5262,6.307,'JS3rRHwrOpM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41889,_binary '\0','/mRvyTpWRkaNqC2q5Tkyr9UVlYKE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5361488',5.2,2287,'en','Magellan','After NASA picks up a trio of mysterious signals from within our own solar system, astronaut Roger Nelson is dispatched on a multi-year solo mission aboard the Magellan spacecraft to investigate the sources.','/dtdhkxH8JVwauuGBxkt4YLA0wJf.jpg','2017-02-12',103,'Released','The universe knew we were coming.','Magellan',406240,2.3203,4.962,'gLnXdzFx7v8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41890,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5362352',7,4628,'en','DC\'s Legends of Tomorrow: Their Time Is Now','The producers introduce audiences to the characters and concepts of \"Legends of Tomorrow\", the upcoming spin-off of superhero series \"Arrow\" and \"The Flash\".','/tLSemZ0uBV5GIO5vK0wnTdGttVc.jpg','2016-01-19',22,'Released',NULL,'DC\'s Legends of Tomorrow: Their Time Is Now',1726818,0.4356,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41891,_binary '\0','/jYARwJDHkvn8uHTahvDYd7q1RI7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5362940',6.3,2707,'en','Eternal Beauty','When Jane is rejected by life, she spirals into a chaotic, schizophrenic world where love and normality collide with humorous consequences.','/2wXrBtfrvwMWE1i3iHjKjoRZjYk.jpg','2020-08-21',94,'Released','Embrace different','Eternal Beauty',501953,3.1283,6.2,'5GoIVAd6xOs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41892,_binary '\0','/kQGxGXzYiCumY8kmXXpgbZyZQK8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5362988',7.7,320424,'en','Wind River','An FBI agent teams with the town\'s veteran game tracker to investigate a murder that occurred on a Native American reservation.','/pySivdR845Hom4u4T2WNkJxe6Ad.jpg','2017-08-03',107,'Released','Nothing is harder to track than the truth.','Wind River',395834,17.549,7.441,'E0qRHABxvfc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41893,_binary '\0','/7b5R8FfGUzlxfhOkPpL3xyIeuyF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5363618',7.7,188957,'en','Sound of Metal','Metal drummer Ruben begins to lose his hearing. When a doctor tells him his condition will worsen, he thinks his career and life is over. His girlfriend Lou checks the former addict into a rehab for the deaf hoping it will prevent a relapse and help him adapt to his new life. After being welcomed and accepted just as he is, Ruben must choose between his new normal and the life he once knew.','/3178oOJKKPDeQ2legWQvMPpllv.jpg','2020-11-20',121,'Released','Music was his world. Then silence revealed a new one.','Sound of Metal',502033,8.1271,7.7,'VFOrGkAvjAE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41894,_binary '\0','/7CWvxA8vBDjfvQS5v37BgiwPIHm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5364518',5.7,3054,'en','Dater\'s Handbook','A woman changes her personality according to a dating guide book to find a husband but realizes the man she wants is the one who loves her for who she is.','/v5useBW3c1ZaxXZWZXD3Nv0k1vi.jpg','2016-01-30',84,'Released',NULL,'Dater\'s Handbook',374614,1.9468,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41895,_binary '\0','/fQqdVbHgbBdSZhmYRXNvfeaw25.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5364920',6.2,1314,'kn','ಮಾಸ್ಟರ್ ಪೀಸ್','Yuva grows up to be a local goon against the wish of his mother. His accidental confrontation with a dangerous drug lord lands him into a web of problems.','/tdPaOUzoASd0Dg26bxTvKXnLTHB.jpg','2015-12-24',158,'Released',NULL,'Masterpiece',419557,1.1498,5.556,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41896,_binary '\0','/fJwSQeu9z7svzdidG7By3OqZulO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5368798',3.9,1419,'en','Hanky Panky','A man and his sentient napkin friend save the world from a dark evil in a cabin deep in the Utah mountains, and also learn to love. Based on the short of the same name filmed in 2014.','/tQHbLzTYmXAKIT0m5SH8w8xHYMu.jpg','2023-12-09',86,'Released',NULL,'Hanky Panky',919131,1.5688,5.2,'dqKFZm04ViM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41897,_binary '\0','/jL1ugurZaUxKNIcqgu6vyTwHrZG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5369484',7.1,1876,'de','24 Wochen','Astrid is a comedian who makes people laugh for a living; her husband Markus is her manager and the two of them work well together. They have a nine-year-old daughter and are expecting their second child. When they learn that their child will not be born healthy, they are at first optimistic that they will be able to meet this challenge – although they have no idea what awaits them. But the closer it gets to the due date, the more Astrid begins to worry about the future of her unborn child as well as that of her family and her career. After many discussions and arguments Astrid realises that the decision that will affect all their lives must be made by her alone. What complicates matters further is the fact that, as a successful entertainer, she is in the eye of the public and the media.','/nKzmeKmZWIoSPbwxocStemcTgwL.jpg','2016-09-22',103,'Released',NULL,'24 Weeks',378695,1.4118,6.5,'I2dxZmsITgY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41898,_binary '\0','/1KMDZ1bc5piX15VsW7mYu9TN52a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5370828',7,4454,'pl','Sztuka kochania: Historia Michaliny Wisłockiej','Michalina Wislocka, the most famous and recognized sexologist of communist Poland, fights for the right to publish her book, which will change the sex life of Polish people forever.','/tZ9yE8zutovEcXwARSv3RBugo6T.jpg','2017-01-27',121,'Released',NULL,'The Art of Loving: Story of Michalina Wislocka',432025,1.953,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41899,_binary '\0','/6rKx3paYMRDImAkoe8q1QDSuChj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5371168',6.8,9281,'en','The Extraordinary Journey of the Fakir','Ajatashatru Lavash Patel has lived all his life in a small Mumbai neighborhood tricking people with street magic and fakir stunts. He sets out on a journey to find his estranged father but instead gets dragged on a never-ending adventure.','/40ZAC1HMDL8knY9r7uJ7uwj5udy.jpg','2018-05-09',96,'Released','\"Chance\" is everything.','The Extraordinary Journey of the Fakir',407447,7.5535,6.9,'SylItu9-D0I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41900,_binary '\0','/iqMgPLDj0tywuyJMKwMwynncw8n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5372466',6.3,4837,'ta','இரு முகன்','A disgraced RAW agent Akilan (Vikram) is recalled by the agency to track down a crazy scientist and a cross dresser Love (also Vikram), who has discovered a deadly new drug ‘Speed inhaler’.','/hDXsugXi4fqiQaBWjnfotsqlqAe.jpg','2016-09-08',150,'Released',NULL,'Iru Mugan',391274,1.5197,5.341,'0sjudcc3ItU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41901,_binary '\0','/3X0wfyOggqerfWfQQFOff0XBiy3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5372528',4,2317,'en','Manifest Destiny Down: Spacetime','In this absurdist satire, an awkward physics genius and a hot ex-Catholic sorority girl wake up after blacking out Halloween night to discover they missed the evacuation of Earth. A mysterious agent pursues the feuding couple as they figure out how to work together to solve the recently entangled multi-verse and ultimately try to save humanity from AI.','/vtDK9PWx1Ofra2IwauDQwItHk1l.jpg','2019-05-18',101,'Released','Get ready to trip!','Manifest Destiny Down: Spacetime',643419,0.9548,4.1,'eMiozZNbtB0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41902,_binary '\0','/kwccaxm4rN5eVVZzkRIkac8Lba9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5375040',7.5,3681,'en','Cameraperson','As a visually radical memoir, CAMERAPERSON draws on the remarkable footage that filmmaker Kirsten Johnson has shot and reframes it in ways that illuminate moments and situations that have personally affected her. What emerges is an elegant meditation on the relationship between truth and the camera frame, as Johnson transforms scenes that have been presented on Festival screens as one kind of truth into another kind of story—one about personal journey, craft, and direct human connection.','/p1Od99QxnzCB9vKu9uxkZQlPZQ5.jpg','2016-09-09',102,'Released',NULL,'Cameraperson',376534,2.548,6.7,'jx52F4iLTL8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41903,_binary '\0','/u8xQ0v36D4EPGqvdkkEjaaPhQ7o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5375100',8.9,1670,'en','Paint Drying','A static shot of paint drying on a brick wall.','/tw35g8GpzuJWmFypKI7RfWcTHcE.jpg','2023-11-10',607,'Released',NULL,'Paint Drying',1481046,1.171,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41904,_binary '\0','/3R3LzaZDUap9NODqsigzlbUa8xl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5375324',7.3,3970,'ml','അനുരാഗ കരിക്കിൻ വെള്ളം','The life of a father and son and their life experience when son tries to breakup with his lover.','/np91tdbrH6RrWp0XphRzXb7YRNi.jpg','2016-07-07',130,'Released',NULL,'Anuraga Karikkin Vellam',406162,1.2901,7.148,'hB1eipWb_YI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41905,_binary '\0','/zwDhFrSHnAKc9V1G7Fxz5TCt2pv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5375434',6.5,2509,'it','Sicilian Ghost Story','In a little Sicilian village at the edge of a forest, Giuseppe, a boy of 13, vanishes. Luna, his classmate who loves him, refuses to accept his mysterious disappearance. She rebels against the silence and complicity that surround her, and to find him she descends into the dark world which has swallowed him up and which has a lake as its mysterious entrance.','/bqKVM6ujKR1UkyehoRaBsxw2D8w.jpg','2017-11-18',122,'Released',NULL,'Sicilian Ghost Story',453347,1.7715,6.5,'5ZhAC1E4S7w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41906,_binary '\0','/hISb9I8xZN1zHuEPAZggix9KBnj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5376196',6.7,3017,'de','Wilde Maus','Kings should be treated courteously! At least, that\'s what famous music critic Georg thinks. But he finds himself counting pennies when his chief editor suddenly fires him from the Viennese newspaper for which he has been writing for decades. While keeping his dismissal a secret from his psychotherapist wife Johanna, whose mind is occupied solely by getting pregnant, Georg begins to plot his revenge.','/lWI8TMdCzx9ztuvWkbAWozk07xM.jpg','2017-02-17',103,'Released',NULL,'Wild Mouse',424634,1.5521,6.556,'bf-colU4kCg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41907,_binary '\0','/tpKeXhXtWOkXjCbH79V3JoTb3iA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5376232',7.6,3323,'ml','ജേക്കബിന്‍റെ സ്വർഗ്ഗരാജ്യം','Jacob, a successful businessman, is settled in Dubai with his family. He is forced to flee to another country when he ends up with a huge debt as his friend betrays him.','/hYOC2JTcVkXS0FYK3rbWpLsj8Ir.jpg','2016-04-08',145,'Released',NULL,'Jacob\'s Kingdom of Heaven',388088,1.0182,7.485,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41908,_binary '\0','/nGHcMV6QHZr7cYNwBX7zBP973BU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5377564',7.4,4532,'kn','ಮಗಳು ಜಾನಕಿ','A journalist who intents to write an article on traffic rule breakers gets dragged into a whirlpool of murder cases and deception.','/fjl9czd3zj0QpeaXAysAGwM9UrD.jpg','2016-05-20',121,'Released',NULL,'U Turn',397490,1.2102,6.644,'Kdh5P8dtMXA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41909,_binary '\0','/hU6kWS2TurCECOsAi7DjgXfxLcW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5377604',6.4,3777,'pl','Pitbull. Nowe porządki','Policemen from two precincts are joining forces to fight the Mokotowska Group.','/ji28TGlJzjeSqqOXPrPa6tpvSDt.jpg','2016-01-22',133,'Released',NULL,'Pitbull: Public Orders',382155,0.9911,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41910,_binary '\0','/tZkRuGSa4we7D1SdGBN8qqtT4SI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5378092',6,3253,'uk','Викрадена принцеса: Руслан і Людмила','This wonderful story happened in the age of valiant knights, beautiful princesses, and battling sorcerers. Ruslan, a wandering artist dreaming to become a knight, met beautiful Mila and fell in love with her; he didn’t even suspect that she is the King’s daughter. However, the lovers’ happiness wasn’t meant to last too long. Chernomor, the evil sorcerer, appeared in a magic vortex and stole Mila right before Ruslan’s eyes to transform her power of love into his own magic power. Without further ado, Ruslan sets out on a chase after the stolen princess to overcome all obstacles and to prove that real love is stronger than magic.','/jJaRhOk9FaPTIqP8L4NqnOYEXHo.jpg','2018-03-07',85,'Released','Love is stronger than magic','The Stolen Princess',463116,4.0635,6.7,'RDOPiR5IAaI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41911,_binary '\0','/cQgzM5odw39DPz3vXt5ubOR2grj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5379294',6,3100,'pt','O Matador','In lawless badlands, reclusive Cabeleira sets out to discover the fate of his gunman father and grows to be a feared assassin himself.','/cPvW6PchT6Dsss3sStKilnhKvGT.jpg','2017-09-13',99,'Released',NULL,'The Killer',466190,1.6845,6.116,'hFfmYait6IY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41912,_binary '\0','/kqguapHFuUjKQ6Q7QQfTaJf4tfa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5390066',5.4,5308,'en','Permission','Anna and Will, were each other’s first every-things: first kiss, first love, first and only relationship. Now, 10 years in, at Anna’s 30th birthday party, as Will is about to propose, the couple’s best friend makes a drunken toast, suggesting that they should sleep around before their inevitable marriage. The joke lands like a lead balloon, but the thought lingers until Anna proposes that they try opening their relationship – as a sexual experiment.','/6UsR27Y5BV7bIxuOyr9mj3MV9Id.jpg','2018-02-09',99,'Released','How can you be certain he is the one, if he is the only one?','Permission',390059,3.2148,5.1,'3Ywb3SfyJak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41913,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5390430',7.6,1234,'en','Accidental Courtesy: Daryl Davis, Race & America','Daryl Davis has an unusual hobby. As a musician he has played with legends like Chuck Berry and Little Richard, but in his spare time he likes to meet and befriend members of the Ku Klux Klan. Join Daryl on his personal quest to understand racism.','/rnEZp4yeHfru0ujaHErcweUJYzZ.jpg','2016-03-13',95,'Released',NULL,'Accidental Courtesy: Daryl Davis, Race & America',381019,1.1684,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41914,_binary '\0','/5C01GuAmEJp951X7fm66SPBlsxU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5390504',7.3,59400,'en','Detroit','A police raid in Detroit in 1967 results in one of the largest citizens\' uprisings in the history of the United States.','/r0ldqSFASpqSM5xTrpcZGO6Ef2G.jpg','2017-07-28',143,'Released','It\'s time we knew.','Detroit',407448,4.7466,7.236,'HFeWsDpy9y0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41915,_binary '\0','/uugcOIfnh8Gz0nxUbduWCoxjWct.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5397194',6.1,52446,'en','Anon','Set in a near-future world where there is no privacy, ignorance or anonymity, our private memories are recorded and crime almost ceases to exist. In trying to solve a series of unsolved murders, Sal Frieland stumbles onto a young woman who appears to have subverted the system and disappeared. She has no identity, no history and no record. Sal realizes it may not be the end of crime but the beginning. Known only as \'The Girl\', Sal must find her before he becomes the next victim.','/xhBTO9n3fxy3HJt7WlR9h9vvVmk.jpg','2018-05-03',100,'Released','Anonymity is the enemy','Anon',396806,5.0908,6.025,'4zaJ1f2_D94','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41916,_binary '\0','/gJduZE3cAmLVQknEfiR5t0vT4Ie.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5402714',4.2,2290,'en','Here After','When her teen daughter displays increasingly disturbing behavior after a near death experience, a mother becomes convinced the girl brought something evil back from the other side.','/by3EEDIVTdhNJolYK2Msn1RHRFH.jpg','2024-07-25',89,'Released',NULL,'Here After',1096838,3.3568,5.5,'ukhI37_Z9XA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41917,_binary '\0','/d4WS0Y8iAKfwiYdfInxGXPzkrZE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5419676',7.1,2607,'en','Feminists: What Were They Thinking?','In 1977, a book of photographs captured an awakening - women shedding the cultural restrictions of their childhoods and embracing their full humanity. This documentary revisits those photos, those women and those times and takes aim at our culture today that alarmingly shows the need for continued change.','/3Af6B4RrmvkMrADxqvNy7DJTAxc.jpg','2018-02-19',86,'Released',NULL,'Feminists: What Were They Thinking?',507618,2.4566,7.5,'uAgeCLYnwNg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41918,_binary '\0','/wRrhiUWQSrmCzuVRTUfrei6p3VY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5420210',5.7,14875,'en','The Comeback Trail','Two movie producers who owe money to the mob set up their aging movie star for an insurance scam to try and save themselves. But they wind up getting more than they ever imagined.','/ublJIJbc2NZ30ptXj4O2d2apo1t.jpg','2020-11-12',104,'Released','Hollywood has never pulled a stunt like this!','The Comeback Trail',650783,7.1033,5.8,'H9aJATnSseo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41919,_binary '\0','/8T6LF94Rv71gAM00Y0m5L2ikZEx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5420886',5.8,7102,'en','Walking Out','A city teen travels to Montana to go hunting with his estranged father, only for the strained trip to become a battle for survival when they encounter a grizzly bear.','/wK3l4ZfcRXFph6uop7yr7scM2SP.jpg','2017-01-21',96,'Released','Survival Runs In Their Blood','Walking Out',428446,2.8564,5.9,'OepnD5GHZp8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41920,_binary '\0','/ddUD0Pb7M3Z7tjgQFrxvz1blLSf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5424228',7.4,1981,'en','Love, Gilda','Diaries, audiotapes, videotapes and testimonials from friends and colleagues offer insight into the life and career of Gilda Radner -- the beloved comic and actress who became an icon on Saturday Night Live.','/56ei7PaqG2dSNfuSMgeuOYOTFrU.jpg','2018-09-21',84,'Released','Life is short, but funny is forever.','Love, Gilda',511972,1.5135,7.2,'1B44XRFotuo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41921,_binary '\0','/1KRfupPMh0Gq31ZImuTi3ibSa0q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5425264',6,1747,'zh','精灵王座','In the mythical Elven world of Altera, an epic battle unfolds between the beautiful Princess Liya and the Dark Elf Elena, who has gained possession of a jewel so powerful it allows its holder complete authority over all Alterans.','/yCV6x3ovzdPEF8LC7JmTr0wOxs3.jpg','2016-07-31',90,'Released',NULL,'Throne of Elves',408355,3.81,7.653,'Uc2mYQayFfQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41922,_binary '\0','/iyx6Y6hKu3Xjp96BiWEE5me4oam.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5427032',3.6,7655,'tr','Osman Pazarlama','Osman, is a small scale entrepreneur in a middle class neighborhood of Istanbul where he operates from a hangar transformed into an office. He dreams of getting rich through the sales of products imported from the Far East and also self invented products, thus marrying the girl he loves from the neighborhood. The biggest challenge he faces to marry the girl he is in love with is to convince the girls father that he is a successful businessman. Osman believes the only way to do this is making a big breakthrough with his company. He embarks on many adventures to sell his products, all end up in hilarious misfortunes and failures. On his journey to become rich, the only companions he has are Erkan and Songül who is the daughter of a family friend from the neighborhood. At the end of the day Osman will come to realize that wealth was never far-off.','/XLZWTD0jY7C4xSDMA80gvWdnxo.jpg','2016-02-19',114,'Released',NULL,'Osman Pazarlama',386376,1.3548,3.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41923,_binary '\0','/sxj8EsehEt295QcqoF7g6VzX36p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5427194',6.5,7077,'en','The Miracle Season','After the tragic death of star volleyball player Caroline \"Line\" Found, a team of dispirited high school girls must band together under the guidance of their tough-love coach in hopes of winning the state championship!','/cIVYjwi8QcZ9AQk4WRYgW4iUmXb.jpg','2018-04-13',100,'Released','Every point. Every game. Every match. Was for her....','The Miracle Season',425373,3.1207,7.2,'HXPvOq6ioRU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41924,_binary '\0','/v6bGT2CgGGs2oClMHMXUs1mgFY6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5431016',3.2,1277,'pt','Os Dez Mandamentos: O Filme','Follows Moses leading and conducting the Hebrew people from the slavery of Egypt to the freedom towards the Promised Land according to the Ancient Testament Bible book of the Exodus. The story told like never before is faithful to the Scriptures.','/yctfYDrHAPcJP54D2BCH9R5GTY2.jpg','2016-01-28',120,'Released',NULL,'The Ten Commandments: The Movie',372519,3.48,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41925,_binary '\0','/x8yC6wnHRxPSqS4PImuMVZSqA6O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5431082',6.5,8382,'da','Underverden','Zaid is a successful heart surgeon with an expensive apartment and pregnant girlfriend. One night he gets a visit from his brother Yasin, who is desperate for money, but he refuses. Soon after, Yasin is found beaten to death and Zaid is overcome with guilt. As guilt gives way to anger, Zaid becomes a masked avenger and takes on Copenhagen\'s criminal underworld in his quest for justice.','/bn7d8LvRuLID5DIQL3EwO28BjMT.jpg','2017-01-19',112,'Released',NULL,'Darkland',425298,3.2791,6.2,'333cCxNembY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41926,_binary '\0','/5aeU1u0HR3mNQf3yJYnpouG5NsI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5431284',6.6,2144,'en','Saint Judy','The true story of immigration attorney Judy Wood and how she singlehandedly changed the U.S. law of asylum to save women\'s lives.','/pwIejqS8wU7cYXqnAJzMpxTWqsa.jpg','2018-09-22',106,'Released','The fight for one is a fight for all.','Saint Judy',550506,3.8053,6.9,'w8qvdfdQ9xA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41927,_binary '\0','/1LkrmLPAiPL11jJyKdJJkIAWl5v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5431600',3.4,3195,'en','The Black Room','Paul and Jennifer Hemdale have just moved into their dream house. But their happy marriage is about to be put to the test as they slowly discover the secret behind the black room in the cellar. Something else is already living in their new home and it is growing stronger every day.','/uHZDs43AxPhitL2Xrw7mncuyS4q.jpg','2017-04-28',91,'Released','A supernatural tale where evil takes on a sexy side.','The Black Room',425931,2.4578,3.8,'khoAYSvFnoA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41928,_binary '\0','/wONHmd6x0UW6AV1DLzxlNwH9sQn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5431890',7.3,61562,'en','Official Secrets','The true story of British intelligence whistleblower Katharine Gun who—prior to the 2003 Iraq invasion—leaked a top-secret NSA memo exposing a joint US-UK illegal spying operation against members of the UN Security Council. The memo proposed blackmailing member states into voting for war.','/lyCGqSkT3PqLYQXiWs4FCVJBAYW.jpg','2019-08-30',112,'Released','Nothing is more dangerous than the truth.','Official Secrets',393624,7.7124,7.224,'t64H3S7r4wo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41929,_binary '\0','/lFb1Ey6HqCdc2D74Zt5kr7EpQKT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5433114',7.7,19616,'en','Diego Maradona','Constructed from over 500 hours of never-before-seen footage, this documentary centers on the personal life and career of the controversial football player Diego Maradona who played for SSC Napoli and Argentina in the 1980s.','/3eBZxi0xcXBnEYq4m4YTVf0eHWX.jpg','2019-06-14',130,'Released','Rebel. Hero. Hustler. God.','Diego Maradona',536841,3.5929,7.4,'JNaRrDX8MUc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41930,_binary '\0','/xXHZeb1yhJvnSHPzZDqee0zfMb6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5433138',5.2,184059,'en','F9','Dominic Toretto and his crew battle the most skilled assassin and high-performance driver they\'ve ever encountered: his forsaken brother.','/deEmLILTPejEb6OGsXRJ5MCvyDW.jpg','2021-05-19',143,'Released','Not all blood is family.','F9',385128,10.4109,6.98,'5eblKqTZ-0Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41931,_binary '\0','/4XM8DUTQb3lhLemJC51Jx4a2EuA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5433140',5.7,150142,'en','Fast X','Over many missions and against impossible odds, Dom Toretto and his family have outsmarted, out-nerved and outdriven every foe in their path. Now, they confront the most lethal opponent they\'ve ever faced: A terrifying threat emerging from the shadows of the past who\'s fueled by blood revenge, and who is determined to shatter this family and destroy everything—and everyone—that Dom loves, forever.','/fiVW06jE7z9YnO4trhaMEdclSiC.jpg','2023-05-17',142,'Released','The end of the road begins.','Fast X',385687,39.4018,6.979,'32RAq6JzY-w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41932,_binary '\0','/3lESlBa8dJECPLp23wvXR7UZstQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5434870',6.3,3976,'en','Little Sister','After returning to her childhood home, young nun Colleen finds her old room exactly how she left it: painted black and covered in goth and metal posters. Her parents are happy enough to see her, but her brother is living as a recluse in the guesthouse since returning home from the Iraq war.','/xsE4ApQf4by53uG7QOdypQRakp.jpg','2016-10-06',91,'Released',NULL,'Little Sister',381069,1.5631,6,'NB5nOYvqqCY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41933,_binary '\0','/wvBuXgA77FaCVKy2iejr4wuxa8G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5434972',7.4,1990,'en','Fastball','Since 1912, baseball has been a game obsessed with statistics and speed. Thrown at upwards of 100 miles per hour, a fastball moves too quickly for human cognition and accelerates into the realm of intuition. Fastball is a look at how the game at its highest levels of achievement transcends logic and even skill, becoming the primal struggle for man to control the uncontrollable.','/v0PI2XUPrse8pNhu2MWlul6u1S7.jpg','2016-03-25',87,'Released','The game is played in the blink of an eye.','Fastball',330068,1.3716,7.2,'2l7T40_kx4I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41934,_binary '\0','/b5aUetkKZiO0iefhum8IM5NTdnf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5435084',6.2,2009,'ar','بركة يقابل بركة','The story of two lovers who are united in an environment hostile to dating of any kind. Barakah is municipal civil servant from Jeddah and an amateur actor in a theatre troupe. Barakah is a wild beauty, who functions as a crowd-puller for her stylish mother’s boutique and runs her own widely-seen vlog. They both defy customs and traditions, as well as the religious police, using modern communication technologies and traditional dating methods.','/2zX6xziWLqNgMThGxYBMJue7RgV.jpg','2016-02-15',88,'Released',NULL,'Barakah Meets Barakah',382750,0.7431,6.4,'ATCgNkSrXTo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41935,_binary '\0','/DPHrczA2TWU0poerCiAIRh9F7d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5436082',6.6,1370,'it','Un bacio','Lorenzo, Blue and Antonio have a lot in common: they are sixteen, attending the same class in the same school in a small town in the northeast, each have a family that loves them. And all three, though for different reasons, have come to be isolated from other peers. Their new friendship helps them to resist, until the mechanical attraction and fear the judgment of others do not grasp them unprepared.','/eQw1JGdeMzaAADZVZPbFm6OKowR.jpg','2016-03-31',101,'Released',NULL,'One Kiss',390669,2.1558,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41936,_binary '\0','/hCSbTTWvOlXUpCCm0kylnt8XpOG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5436158',6,1618,'ml','ഊഴം','A demolition expert teams up with his fiancée and brother to avenge the deaths of their family members from the corrupt scientist who got them killed.','/krGK09PhasasEG0WqYXt4rN2woW.jpg','2016-09-08',140,'Released','It\'s just a matter of time...','Oozham',415007,1.3255,6.393,'LZYp4FSIABU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41937,_binary '\0','/rWdzJIeFRfQp1ICFuLslD5D6Hht.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5436168',6.4,1424,'ml','പ്രേതം','Three happy-go-lucky friends run a coastal resort till a series of mysterious events leave them worried. The plot thickens when a mentalist named John Don Bosco enters the fray to investigate the possibility of a paranormal entity.','/gzjXkR4nxfNz0AWCJgS7lZ49nlP.jpg','2016-08-12',127,'Released','How? Why? What did you gain?','Pretham',411279,0.9753,5.696,'u4WVmGn3VQ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41938,_binary '\0','/eFpSaFzmP916Vf0QdEJSE9M0uOO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5436228',6.7,9647,'en','Woman Walks Ahead','Based on a true story, this riveting western follows a headstrong New York widow as she journeys west to meet Sioux chief Sitting Bull, facing off with an army officer intent on war with Native Americans.','/qI5NcQHR0nsykPqlG2qnfFyMgW6.jpg','2018-06-28',103,'Released','Defy your times','Woman Walks Ahead',396373,5.1081,6.779,'qHR0AEDMg0M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41939,_binary '\0','/mNiVBMDBaQU2A5XA1KnvmkL6rPI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5437928',6.7,28390,'en','Colette','After marrying a successful Parisian writer known commonly as Willy, Sidonie-Gabrielle Colette is transplanted from her childhood home in rural France to the intellectual and artistic splendor of Paris. Soon after, Willy convinces Colette to ghostwrite for him. She pens a semi-autobiographical novel about a witty and brazen country girl named Claudine, sparking a bestseller and a cultural sensation. After its success, Colette and Willy become the talk of Paris and their adventures inspire additional Claudine novels.','/5fvcs8x7k16wGdet16qkx1cKBPM.jpg','2018-09-21',112,'Released','History is about to change','Colette',454652,4.9554,6.9,'c_8U7gjb2k4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41940,_binary '\0','/9FuMd3qKSCL4tqPrTpB3cwjhz8e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5439464',6.7,1264,'en','The Bridge Part 2','The second-half of the movie picks up in the present day, seven years later, with Ryan returning home from being on the road touring as a professional singer and Molly working at her father\'s corporation.','/yaQ6wNAeHJaP2SBPn5XnEsQ9h4O.jpg','2016-03-20',85,'Released',NULL,'The Bridge Part 2',381615,1.9961,6.2,'22XNIILpvDg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41941,_binary '\0','/eszmHIWJHAKdnJcE3KcvVzOb6Jd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5439796',7,178441,'en','Logan Lucky','Trying to reverse a family curse, brothers Jimmy and Clyde Logan set out to execute an elaborate robbery during the legendary Coca-Cola 600 race at the Charlotte Motor Speedway.','/mQrhrBaaHvRfBQq0Px3HtVbH9iE.jpg','2017-08-17',119,'Released','See how the other half steals.','Logan Lucky',399170,14.8875,6.735,'aPzvKH8AVf0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41942,_binary '\0','/zL7CozbpAbGSdhBsuTI847tu5Fo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5439812',6.4,20850,'en','Zola','A waitress agrees to accompany an exotic dancer, her put-upon boyfriend, and her mysterious and domineering roommate on a road trip to Florida to seek their fortune at a high-end strip club.','/bJLCPROp9bmNndurwZpVnOioVpB.jpg','2021-06-30',86,'Released','Y\'all wanna hear a story?','Zola',539565,3.9457,6.21,'24KbaKlCDDI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41943,_binary '\0','/yzoyr6nuB3ChA38MSHjYKlMpU6W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5440700',7.4,26894,'ta','தெறி','When an honest cop, Vijay Kumar\'s family is ruthlessly slaughtered by a politician and his aides, he decides to change his identity and commits his life to bring his daughter up in a serene atmosphere. But some freak events end up compromising his identity and what he does to save his daughter and avenge the death of his family unfurls as Theri.','/f6BhexotEqO3GejXa3FopBNGL6M.jpg','2016-04-14',157,'Released',NULL,'Theri',370076,2.09,6.864,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41944,_bi