ased',NULL,'Kammatti Paadam',398786,1.6286,7.88,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41969,_binary '\0','/pO7RV2LBce9WOXt8YXPp1YPDnHO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5458566',5.3,3055,'da','Dræberne fra Nibe','The two tradesmen Ib and Edward are tired of their lifeless marriages and dream of living the good life from the stash of money they\'ve earned moonlighting for years. After a huge fight with their wives the two men get drunk and hire a Russian contract killer to do a hit on their spouses. But they have badly underestimated their wives, and this becomes the start of an absurd journey where Ib and Edward to their own horror end at the top of a kill list.','/mWMb0cLiuSofPLguY43S93BJq2Z.jpg','2017-01-12',90,'Released',NULL,'Small Town Killers',425716,2.1569,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41970,_binary '\0','/2KDcNydVRHD5GlCQ0NWVpYC6JL0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5458812',6.3,2741,'en','Appetite for Love','Mina has everything going for her, but her world is turned upside down when work sends her to her hometown in Tennessee where she must convince an old, stubborn restaurant owner to sell his property. There is just one problem- the restaurant is now owned by her ex-boyfriend Clay, who claims he will never sell. He resists her negotiations every step of the way, and all the while sparks fly.','/iijOHt8helVKEaghhoRguu0OtQi.jpg','2016-02-06',85,'Released',NULL,'Appetite for Love',377431,1.7528,5.7,'gTi5MS7wZOU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41971,_binary '\0','/nl9qVm3EbFOqgEQrXtaJtlSAVf0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5459382',6.9,2504,'en','The Etruscan Smile','Rory MacNeil, a rugged old Scotsman, reluctantly leaves his beloved isolated Hebridean island and travels to San Francisco to seek medical treatment. Moving in with his estranged son, Rory sees his life transformed through a newly found bond with his baby grandson.','/yGKJxR3hkFDxBwefTDXPseaBv6k.jpg','2018-04-12',103,'Released',NULL,'The Etruscan Smile',513243,2.8871,6.3,'3zwmlKxa3d4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41972,_binary '\0','/lCVOfAHjGbMxBzlEk4M9GXdQbdR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5459644',6.9,1981,'ta','ஜில் ஜங் ஜக்','Three bumbling underlings who are tasked with smuggling cocaine get into problems during their journey.','/oYMVaJwHH2Cot5hYQbHT4j28gBv.jpg','2016-02-12',133,'Released',NULL,'Jil Jung Juk',366148,1.2615,6.659,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41973,_binary '\0','/qYWU43f9ogtsXGHsk5icePERyGd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5460068',6,1661,'en','Emo: The Musical','Ethan, a sullen high-school student whose life is defined by what he hates, finds love with a blindly optimistic Christian girl Trinity, much to the annoyance of his angst-filled band mates and her evangelistic brethren.','/nMPGVuoyS1L73cxsHL2gbTHHcyo.jpg','2016-08-12',94,'Released','High school sucks','Emo: The Musical',402362,1.4232,6,'6qmTrZ1PdQA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41974,_binary '\0','/zqRGIqDKoNZfj0XvkuX7hNJWq7D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5460276',7.2,33636,'hi','काबिल','Rohan is a kind, happy young man who has been blind since birth and works as a voice-over artist for a living. Through friends, he meets Supriya, a working woman who is also blind, but proudly independent. The two start liking each other and get married. Rohan toughest journey starts in his quest of vengeance for Supriya\'s indirect murderers.','/ojs8b5N2BgFYoHCSb6vu0egZb6v.jpg','2017-01-25',139,'Released','The Mind Sees All!','Kaabil',403867,1.9086,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41975,_binary '\0','/rM06ByoYtf108zllPGZIaYqLSZe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5460508',5.9,5376,'fa','بادیگارد','A government bodyguard protects a politician from a suicide bomber, and then begins to question his dedication to his job.','/7Ds2bBM4SHpYMOfrsXVoaXPelVd.jpg','2016-02-11',109,'Released',NULL,'Bodyguard',423448,1.1898,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41976,_binary '\0','/5IpFLdulLkJyxvt8vHTZfp84C1i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5460522',5.5,3044,'en','J.T. LeRoy','A young woman named Savannah Knoop spends six years pretending to be a transgender writer named JT Leroy, the made-up literary persona of her sister-in-law.','/43ffZhMCWQhzMneGP4kDWoPV48X.jpg','2019-04-26',105,'Released','Based on the incredible true lie.','J.T. LeRoy',460070,3.4863,5.5,'UQialkjB22o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41977,_binary '\0','/jSOomjSssNJdU7Hrf3CROkNSv6n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5460530',5.2,10135,'en','Vengeance: A Love Story','When a new friend is brutally assaulted, Detective John Droomor is put by chance in charge of the investigation. Although the evidence against the perpetrators seems overwhelming, there is nothing definitive in the case that guarantees justice is served, even more so if some people are willing to twist and betray it.','/kPUFcGPI9FChybFHIJJBZZLiIlg.jpg','2017-03-16',99,'Released','Beyond good and evil is Justice','Vengeance: A Love Story',397415,6.8449,5.577,'oWHUlhEkP1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41978,_binary '\0','/3Szt3K3Q2xGajdWPZmmafQcgr9d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5460548',6.5,1278,'fr','Corporate','Emilie is a bright young workaholic manager in Human Resources, working for a huge French agro-food company. But, one day, one of the employees commits suicide at the company in front of her. While an investigation is underway, stuck between her traumatized colleagues and under pressure of a powerful hierarchy, she will have to get by on her own.','/xb2xMfTTLZZibl7gqx29QzFxBYp.jpg','2017-04-05',95,'Released',NULL,'Corporate',431479,2.0769,6.3,'ea-EGrSYjwI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41979,_binary '\0','/4gBp0F0pdAcL6RPtGCVl7vtkm2H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5460658',8.1,19900,'fa','ابد و یک روز','Somaieh, the youngest daughter of an indigent family, is getting married and fear is overwhelming each and every member of the family regarding how to overcome their difficulties after she\'s gone.','/oy0KMmuGr3pnobRZo5eZSvlmtg9.jpg','2016-03-16',112,'Released','We all die one day, don\'t worry, no one\'s ever left alive.','Life and a Day',391039,1.8543,7.9,'VBIJhlPwrZI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41980,_binary '\0','/7QRCqo0WZ42JYAuupnIuSzbSHZ5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5460858',6.6,7471,'en','The White Crow','The story of Rudolf Nureyev, whose escape to the West stunned the world at the height of the Cold War. With his magnetic presence, Nureyev emerged as ballet’s most famous star, a wild and beautiful dancer limited by the world of 1950s Leningrad. His flirtation with Western artists and ideas led him into a high-stakes game of cat and mouse with the KGB.','/5OF4zAdfQWKDTiiRpbZvZUsLioq.jpg','2018-08-31',127,'Released','To dance you must be free','The White Crow',477887,4.1919,6.6,'BklqjGWxNMs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41981,_binary '\0','/ku8W8VGN4RxpBAUw1c1ZJgQtqQp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5460880',6.4,12230,'en','Ideal Home','A couple is going through marital troubles made worse when a previously unknown grandson shows up.','/bmXBT2uL4HQGimyfy5iu4ESnEaJ.jpg','2018-06-21',91,'Released','These dads suck','Ideal Home',399725,3.6849,6.4,'lK3qmEe2cJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41982,_binary '\0','/2HpZ6pl1FbCNaThfxWhGMOdqpz7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5460986',6.8,1914,'en','The Guv\'nor','A feature documentary about the life of Lenny McLean, as seen through the eyes of his only son, Jamie.','/qK2Z3tqsvrQD6Aaa0ABtHzbFQ63.jpg','2016-10-05',85,'Released','The life of Lenny McLean','The Guv\'nor',419324,1.8539,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41983,_binary '\0','/UosNvrnrCu9E24TEzeNYjt4WWO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5461168',7.4,1280,'ar','نوارة','Nawara works as a housemaid for a family closely linked to the Mubarak regime. On the eve of the 2011 revolution the family decides, for safety, to leave the country temporarily and ask her to look after the villa. Flush with cash for expenses, Nawara calls her fiancé Mustafa and the two are soon enjoying a taste of life at the top. Her journey from the alleys of her poor neighborhood to the luxury compound brings with it the worries of the people and their simple dreams—and an experience she could never have imagined.','/2xvkyxRRX0Ef50AM2gPjE7kZBZg.jpg','2016-03-23',122,'Released',NULL,'Nawara',382408,1.1456,8,'z-oM0nN2lfg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41984,_binary '\0','/aqSN0jyzGrJUqCe0OeVzSymcRbk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5461944',7.6,80470,'en','Hotel Mumbai','Mumbai, India, November 26, 2008. While several terrorists spread hatred and death through the city, others attack the Taj Mahal Palace Hotel. Both hotel staff and guests risk their lives, making unthinkable sacrifices to protect themselves and keep everyone safe while help arrives.','/v32SC4HFZtlDRWXMaR2V2dWqAXJ.jpg','2019-03-14',123,'Released','November 26, 2008… Terror struck the heart of India.','Hotel Mumbai',416144,7.274,7.5,'A8IxhVslvro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41985,_binary '\0','/cbwHBusH6tp5KM0TEalIRl4BXRr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5461956',5.2,9053,'en','The Clapper','Eddie Krumble works as a paid audience member for infomercials and experiences a whirlwind of overnight fame after a late-night talk show host publicizes his frequent infomercial appearances.','/vsm2gxPoZDzG3ocTArrK8ak7go4.jpg','2018-01-26',89,'Released','How can you find each other when everyone is looking for you?','The Clapper',422615,2.8006,4.9,'hFYwmBzqoac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41986,_binary '\0','/u4GyLPqtdLB84Tqhk2IwOmEEaVL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5462288',6.5,9554,'en','Rockaway','Inspired by true events, a man recounts the summer of \'94, when he and his brother plotted revenge against their abusive father.','/8X6HtQ47x2ZqRrDrV3jb3VhuLSq.jpg','2019-01-11',90,'Released',NULL,'Rockaway',503207,1.9771,6.7,'tAVwwOEh2KU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41987,_binary '\0','/ozc8RAW9Bwt3T99iUjCrUvL7j1c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5462326',5.6,29985,'en','Mom and Dad','In a suburban community, moms and dads, one after the other, mysteriously feel the irresistible impulse to attack and kill their own offspring.','/vjjFEFMhENFQUmUn15zGaCJBD0A.jpg','2018-01-19',86,'Released','They brought you into this world. They can take you out.','Mom and Dad',401561,7.5289,5.409,'O4Kb40pnoOY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41988,_binary '\0','/dKAudJwmkENqL1FZYP9351rItZs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5462400',6.4,2553,'es','Kóblic','Colonia Helena, Argentina. The mysterious Tomás Kóblic, a former Navy pilot, works as a fumigator while dealing with his dark past and the intrigues of the corrupt police commissioner…','/aTpSCZ8VaqSyUkI3PhEQIHnYzbC.jpg','2016-04-14',92,'Released','There is nowhere to hide from yourself','Kóblic',391617,2.1679,6.006,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41989,_binary '\0','/4FFfnMSHCDZSwr5K2lkRZnAMg9y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5462464',5.9,2520,'nl','My Foolish Heart','In 1988 Amsterdam, a Dutch police detective finds himself on a bittersweet journey of discovery as he investigates the mysterious demise of jazz icon Chet Baker, found dead on the street below his hotel room in the city center.','/wJ0xH6at0MEYuvYlgu8IDTQdVn3.jpg','2018-11-01',83,'Released','The last days of the iconic jazz legend','My Foolish Heart',548947,0.9201,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41990,_binary '\0','/fYI8WX2DquAHMqwh5mOMxc6RU5j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5462602',7.5,151617,'en','The Big Sick','Pakistan-born comedian Kumail Nanjiani and grad student Emily Gardner fall in love but struggle as their cultures clash. When Emily contracts a mysterious illness, Kumail finds himself forced to face her feisty parents, his family\'s expectations, and his true feelings.','/9fJTT8pBxxQsFILJHTtHhdYFr77.jpg','2017-03-30',120,'Released','An awkward true story.','The Big Sick',416477,7.7572,7.322,'GX3Regj6nAg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41991,_binary '\0','/ydmyk8pTGOBTJ1E1wY7V3NBAftv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5463152',5.8,3521,'fa','بارکد','Behind each person is a story , behind each story is a person , so we have to be patient before any judgment','/uYXzIEjU9iG34s5ZEtLJxGp2dqE.jpg','2016-02-11',100,'Released',NULL,'Barcode',406771,0.9633,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41992,_binary '\0','/3P52oz9HPQWxcwHOwxtyrVV1LKi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5463162',7.6,757791,'en','Deadpool 2','Wisecracking mercenary Deadpool battles the evil and powerful Cable and other bad guys to save a boy\'s life.','/to0spRl1CMDvyUbOnbb4fTk3VAd.jpg','2018-05-15',120,'Released','Prepare for the Second Coming.','Deadpool 2',383498,29.946,7.489,'20bpjtCbCz0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41993,_binary '\0','/7FThEn5EWs4O6oE8deJDinN3cmF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5463172',6.8,2530,'fa','ایستاده در غبار','The life and times of IRGC officer Ahmad Motevaselian, who served as a commander during the Iran-Iraq War and ultimately disappeared in Lebanon in 1982.','/q9WXG2Aom9uVPJzTlG1Mgj4rubo.jpg','2016-06-08',98,'Released',NULL,'Standing in the Dust',406598,0.9643,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41994,_binary '\0','/delLXINQxdLa3CRstbTN0eAdf12.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5463378',6.6,3122,'fa','اژدها وارد می‌شود!','On Jan. 22, 1965, the day before the Iranian prime minister is assassinated, a car drives up to a shipwreck. Inside the wreck, a banished political prisoner has hung himself and the walls are covered in diary entries, literary quotes, and strange symbols. Fifty years later, the evidence, including intelligence tape recordings, is found in a box. The contents attest to the fact that the inspector and his colleagues were arrested, but why?','/1jB1htK08eEBwypBJJ7rPHbpGFI.jpg','2016-04-27',107,'Released',NULL,'A Dragon Arrives!',377150,0.803,6,'GTtzOFxmnTs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41995,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5463510',6.4,4055,'fa','لانتوری','Lantouri is the name of a gang that mugs people in broad daylight on the streets of Tehran and breaks into homes in the city’s rich northern district. The gang also kidnaps children from families who have become wealthy through corruption and embezzlement of state funds. The film begins with the confessions of individual gang members. Sociologists, human rights activists and political hardliners also have their say. Gang member Pasha runs amok because Maryam, a socially committed, self-confident journalist, does not reciprocate his feelings. The badly injured young woman demands lex talionis – the law, applicable in Iran, of ‘an eye for an eye’.','/j6lIGyidxKEBGKS1sgxmP7Frm1m.jpg','2016-10-15',115,'Released',NULL,'Lantouri',382754,1.0467,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41996,_binary '\0','/8bYGpm2EqSibuaulyAzop0r2EWn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5464234',4.7,8980,'en','Kill Switch','A pilot battles to save his family and the planet after an experiment for unlimited energy goes wrong.','/8K6pfMcT3hiIlCFw2RrHoXLshxl.jpg','2017-06-01',91,'Released','Worlds will collide.','Kill Switch',423988,3.9079,4.9,'SernjeZIsM8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41997,_binary '\0','/qMyZLZV0v9ONQg6ri7U9WtD0EsY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5465370',5.9,4701,'hi','Akira','Akira Sharma is your average Jane from Jodhpur. Early in life she sees an atrocity committed on a neighbour and learns to defend herself. And, a spitfire is born.','/jU0gw5z6JrazhGOh4UfULKqt268.jpg','2016-09-01',138,'Released','No one will be forgiven..','Akira',404579,1.4656,5.5,'QsCkty3mpg0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41998,_binary '\0','/7WlWJSWfkUwnT5xonQKunLnyCl0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5465868',5.5,1850,'es','Me casé con un boludo','Florencia, a rising actress, ends up falling in love with her co-star, a famous film star. When they decide to marry, Florencia becomes aware that in reality she fell in love with the character and that her husband is indeed a real idiot.','/rWo38m3XwcbOeArt2UOixPtkoB9.jpg','2016-03-17',110,'Released','It could happen to anyone','I Married a Dumbass',389995,1.4034,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41999,_binary '\0','/lN73JGB12ih5VBwLBjBYSgcFE1O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5465970',3.8,1700,'en','Attrition','When a Thai girl with mythical powers goes missing, Axe and his old team unite in attempts to bring her back.','/pBFqLpJzwYK13XxKoJtARxJiuvf.jpg','2018-09-24',85,'Released','A story of kung fu and honor','Attrition',550134,2.8562,4.4,'F8qHNWjwtCQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42000,_binary '\0','/aJKvkpFEmuU8JlxqUlHYSo2LN3w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5466186',5.9,18395,'en','7 Days in Entebbe','In 1976, four hijackers take over an Air France airplane en route from Tel Aviv to Paris and force it to land in Entebbe, Uganda. With 248 passengers on board, one of the most daring rescue missions ever is set in motion.','/nrC63ikbK4jDp3knvBqxPoWYEMM.jpg','2018-03-15',107,'Released','248 passengers were held hostage. For seven days, the world was held captive.','7 Days in Entebbe',433627,6.4459,5.828,'GXkGNZEikPU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42001,_binary '\0','/8n1CqgTao5eyzOo12AQhOqkM4SD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5466576',6.8,3109,'ms','BoBoiBoy: The Movie','BoBoiBoy and his friends come face-to-face with a greedy alien treasure hunter as they race to find a powerful ancient object on a mysterious island.','/jVwoMOZQjhO7V223NOT8RRazXMp.jpg','2016-03-03',102,'Released',NULL,'BoBoiBoy: The Movie',378102,1.7106,7.9,'4shpW9bq2sE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42002,_binary '\0','/qtiU2JBTAT7lLgMDahbR8dvbYTY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5467554',6,2345,'en','Daphne','Daphne is a young woman negotiating the tricky business of modern life. Caught in the daily rush of her restaurant job and a nightlife kaleidoscope of new faces, she is witty, funny, the life of the party. Too busy to realise that deep down she is not happy. When she saves the life of a shopkeeper stabbed in a failed robbery, the impenetrable armour she wears to protect herself begins to crack, and Daphne is forced to confront the inevitability of a much-needed change in her life.','/dML8OAPjmwAYS1nXx0xRCaWrRxB.jpg','2017-01-29',87,'Released',NULL,'Daphne',436245,1.4657,5.6,'8RKOToCMuQk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42003,_binary '\0','/4jscc5kzH3MQHk2KZrkhHcvI1rm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5468014',7.5,1466,'ja','デジモンアドベンチャー tri. 第3章「告白」','After seeing Meicoomon\'s abrupt transformation and killing of Leomon, Agumon and the other Digimon are kept isolated in Koushiro\'s office in order to prevent them from infection, but signs of infection begin to appear in Patamon.','/mr9qCQCwYqMpiqc30uOVhVJNSWe.jpg','2016-09-24',91,'Released',NULL,'Digimon Adventure tri. Part 3: Confession',378106,2.6731,7,'_C-lb-_wQh8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42004,_binary '\0','/iuJTMrW5LP8SeRgN8iWPZbbyqm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5468016',7,1285,'ja','デジモンアドベンチャー tri. 第4章「喪失」','Upon arriving at the Digital World after the \"reboot\", the Digidestined are hunted by a new villain. Meanwhile, Sora is troubled by her partner Digimon\'s indifference towards her.','/rbTOYEesS4pLLMUuja5V8cAzTrx.jpg','2017-02-25',82,'Released',NULL,'Digimon Adventure tri. Part 4: Loss',422347,2.0699,6.9,'mx8uOuFQXL8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000');
INSERT INTO `movies` VALUES (42005,_binary '\0','/lFme9sdFpUWDcgI3q00AF4m6C5Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5468300',6.3,4641,'fa','خشم و هیاهو','Khosro, a pop singer, lives a hectic life with his wife Tina and their son Moez. His life is further complicated when he begins a love affair with a female fan. A terrible event ensues obliging the lovers to each recount their side of the story in pursuit of the truth.','/hkjsJ5B6uUUVS3gA3gldyhsYOTG.jpg','2016-02-11',100,'Released',NULL,'Sound and Fury',394287,1.0046,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42006,_binary '\0','/z4HAfXdcODZg3irn21RR4Sf78RC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5470222',3.2,2538,'en','Contract to Kill','Harmon is a CIA/DEA enforcer investigating Arab terrorists captured in Mexico. With his team--seductive FBI agent Zara and spy-drone pilot Sharp--he flies to Istanbul and uncovers a brutal plot: Islamic extremists plan to use Sonora drug-smuggling routes to bring deadly weapons, and leaders, into the U.S. To prevent an attack on America, Harmon must turn these two savage forces against one another before his time--and his luck--run out.','/lSkgRQDzLYzvu0ygiVnLNyKI55z.jpg','2016-12-09',90,'Released','War has no borders.','Contract to Kill',423627,2.2926,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42007,_binary '\0','/krCNGj85AF7DcMjlOVz5lWl21NP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5471480',7.1,3034,'no','Magnus','From a young age Magnus Carlsen had aspirations of becoming a champion chess player. While many players seek out an intensely rigid environment to hone their skills, Magnus’ brilliance shines brightest when surrounded by his loving and supportive family. Through an extensive amount of archival footage and home movies, director Benjamin Ree reveals this young man’s unusual and rapid trajectory to the pinnacle of the chess world. This film allows the audience to not only peek inside this isolated community but also witness the maturation of a modern genius.','/iREs3gCWywQHILPpc2cDBw6CRiD.jpg','2016-09-09',76,'Released','Child. Genius. Champion.','Magnus',390409,2.5157,6.847,'YhrUFssohM4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42008,_binary '\0','/sFN1KnAVJhy5oV0gIEMf3HicxBb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5472374',6.1,6849,'hi','मेरी प्यारी बिंदु','Abhimanyu Roy is stuck with writer\'s block until he decides to re-live the memories of his childhood sweetheart Bindu who aspires to be a successful singer and struggles to give Abhi the one thing he craves - stability.','/hKZZiiHuHFopzJwl0JYttRWEzKD.jpg','2017-05-11',119,'Released',NULL,'Meri Pyaari Bindu',455470,1.4192,6.181,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42009,_binary '\0','/v3bsLir6vYYYw94PGeGMABnRj52.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5472758',6.5,6104,'hi','हैप्पी भाग जाएगी','After fleeing an arranged marriage, a feisty Indian woman finds herself stranded in Pakistan where the ex-governor\'s son helps reunite her with her boyfriend.','/sEWDNSBe5BfUchkJ5BsJV6VUgwF.jpg','2016-08-19',126,'Released',NULL,'Happy Bhag Jayegi',406042,1.277,6.3,'9OXFk-pdi6c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42010,_binary '\0','/gqfMZITSrYR1BAMhu0oh8yxHcn6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5473090',5.6,2985,'en','Swinging Safari','1975: A 200-ton blue whale gets washed up on a local beach and the kids think it’s the biggest thing that’s ever happened in Australia. Behind closed doors, the Mums and Dads of a quiet suburban street are going to celebrate in their own special way, by joining the sexual revolution and throwing a wife-swapping key party. And like the rotting whale, it’s all about to go spectacularly wrong.','/zs9wcNHidBPhcTmiWzXuFam823v.jpg','2018-01-18',97,'Released','Staying alive was harder than you think.','Swinging Safari',454033,4.407,5.3,'ZB95v_pyQq8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42011,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5473696',4.1,1582,'hi','Muzaffarnagar Baaqi Hai','A hard look at the causes and aftermath of the September 2013 Muzaffarnagar riots through the eyes of local people of Muzaffarnagar in the Hindi heartland of Uttar Pradesh.','/eeUbcnbkEq0wC0Qsubc2fVh0T7y.jpg','2015-02-18',136,'Released',NULL,'Muzaffarnagar Baaqi Hai',574690,0.4573,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42012,_binary '\0','/wMiOXnNvt9duYohroSl3ZszByu1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5474036',6.8,9821,'hi','मनमर्ज़ियाँ','A spirited girl finds herself caught in a complicated love triangle while burdened with societal and familial pressures.','/6AyCbhLIDjRZFJ1nxzWOd4YlTJI.jpg','2018-09-14',155,'Released',NULL,'Manmarziyaan',523277,1.7545,6.743,'ToxnuakJrqE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42013,_binary '\0','/cYf7GHdSnhyLvo2HUd7kQ4zYkuP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5474042',4.7,8806,'hi','Half Girlfriend','A boy meets a girl named Riya and falls in love. After struggling to convince her to be his girlfriend, she half-heartedly agrees to be his `half-girlfriend\'.','/jvacZc9CVkjCA25ds4UqnOWbSpV.jpg','2017-05-18',135,'Released','More Than A Friend, Lesser Than A Girlfriend','Half Girlfriend',413884,2.638,6.255,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42014,_binary '\0','/aIcYXAxxQhPnYOgJrY5tXE3ctPc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5474644',6.5,2348,'en','My Little Pony: Equestria Girls - Legend of Everfree','When Canterlot Highschool goes on a trip to Camp Everfree, they’re surprised to find a magical force is causing strange things to happen around camp. With the help of the Mane 6 and especially Sunset Shimmer, Twilight Sparkle must confront the dark “Midnight Sparkle” within herself and embrace her newfound magical abilities to save the camp.','/fo9LoPjqK7wLv7g7zZM1LcnqsVg.jpg','2016-10-01',73,'Released',NULL,'My Little Pony: Equestria Girls - Legend of Everfree',405314,3.4517,7.5,'GW-iRG8PevM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42015,_binary '\0','/sbkSGGHFtTfKMVIkYLBVWXWTX57.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5475734',5.5,2574,'pl','Dywizjon 303. Historia prawdziwa','After the fall of the September Campaign of 1939, two Polish pilots are forced to fight for their nation in foreign battlefronts.','/a3O1zY9INsubcJp1od8ccQULfhm.jpg','2018-08-31',95,'Released',NULL,'303 Squadron',430727,2.6272,5.9,'vSHeKwLnp8o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42016,_binary '\0','/clFQR5zwzDrayMVVe7axo0YLFfh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5476944',7.7,2080,'ja','黒執事 Book of the Atlantic','Ciel learns of a \"Aurora Society\", that is rumored to be researching how to bring the dead back to life. Their next meeting is scheduled to be conducted on the ship Campania, voyaging across the Atlantic Ocean. Much to Ciel\'s dismay, Elizabeth \"Lizzy\" Midford, is taking the same ship, thus leaving him with no choice but to get aboard as well.','/4jU2Bdk1MB2OvP4BBvTJIPQc0BF.jpg','2017-01-21',100,'Released',NULL,'Black Butler: Book of the Atlantic',432131,3.2304,7.5,'YFRGd6DMtjs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42017,_binary '\0','/mlz167d59SaF3BhzWPu6G69sFw7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5477194',8,4148,'ta','இறைவி','Three men try to overcome the problems in their lives not realising the impact their efforts are having on the women in their lives.','/81wvyetBoSvsGobxzClUtoTX1UD.jpg','2016-06-03',153,'Released',NULL,'Iraivi',369094,1.6492,7.203,'DH3iKNTT9-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42018,_binary '\0','/9gUBPWpW5c4dDoo4l95ghGBmqJl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5477402',7.2,1880,'nl','Strike a Pose','In 1990, seven young male dancers joined Madonna on her most controversial world tour. Their journey was captured in Truth or Dare. As a self-proclaimed \'mother\' to her six gay dancers plus straight Oliver, Madonna used the film to make a stand on gay rights and freedom of expression. The dancers became paragons of pride, inspiring people all over the world to dare to be who you are. 25 years later, the dancers share their own stories about life during and after the tour. What does it really take to express yourself?','/srAZUYB9V7eWJsJdyJ25SrQCFC1.jpg','2016-06-29',89,'Released',NULL,'Strike a Pose',381649,1.1316,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42019,_binary '\0','/4hfR16UNtwVILhUCl1UPNg71VWC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5477566',6,8159,'en','Barry','A young Barack Obama forges his identity while dealing with race, divergent cultures and ordinary life as a New York City college student.','/1Dg6phOePOHc4DHA5I7qjXB3fvA.jpg','2016-09-10',104,'Released','Before he was Barack, he was Barry','Barry',397717,2.5497,5.687,'i6qlPeS1kGY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42020,_binary '\0','/yzuKHGtyWa4Yha3SSbTCrBmZcxC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5477608',6.6,7425,'hi','कहानी 2','Vidya Sinha has only one obsession in life. She wants to see her teenage daughter Mini, who is paralysed waist-downwards, walk again. But, is this scenario as obvious as it seems? Or is Vidya an impersonator of Durga Rani Singh from Kalimpong, who is wanted for kidnapping and murder?','/7JCbW4oEnGWfX1qkhLnrVdpmFVw.jpg','2016-12-01',127,'Released',NULL,'Kahaani 2',413547,1.0372,6.563,'Ez4mXaeSKuk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42021,_binary '\0','/6YV4PBqsh8MgmT22RGUvPAcyk4e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5478456',5.3,2458,'en','We Are Zombies','In a city infested with the LIVING-IMPAIRED aka non-cannibal zombies - three slackers after easy money must fight small-time crooks and an evil megacorporation to save their kidnapped grandma.','/nU5ZeQpy32xbwtxHua1ZkT5QquZ.jpg','2024-07-17',80,'Released',NULL,'We Are Zombies',1139106,2.858,5.9,'_SUdGQFYSCA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42022,_binary '\0','/vBSsIyWExRpe3Robi8SAnayrMq1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5478478',7.2,108990,'en','Hostiles','A legendary Native American-hating Army captain nearing retirement in 1892 is given one last assignment: to escort a Cheyenne chief and his family through dangerous territory back to his Montana reservation.','/rqoezyB51GfhiloOB5ZErg5HXas.jpg','2017-12-22',134,'Released','We are all…','Hostiles',384680,8.1556,7,'lrD0I-vLsXM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42023,_binary '\0','/hztIZ8V5vR9B7k4gEAHbA8SGHxv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5478632',6.8,3868,'tr','Kaçma Birader','A family with diversified members travels to İstanbul from Yozgat after their youngest son fell in love with a girl.','/sO27kvr7d9a2QF6JazYl53hODVB.jpg','2016-03-09',107,'Released',NULL,'Kaçma Birader',386579,1.6414,6.2,'f4jl-9toGRw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42024,_binary '\0','/iK8HtuBtcxpTF3m9lMvzXyCtFcr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5479616',5.1,5371,'es','Amar','Laura and Carlos love each other as if every day was the last, and perhaps that first love intensity is what will tear them apart a year later.','/6uOMVZ6oG00xjq0KQiExRBw2s3P.jpg','2017-04-21',105,'Released',NULL,'Loving',441614,0.4511,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42025,_binary '\0','/cwQ7IO6ZNBnlQ1b8zA7pXzkdT5S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5480340',5.9,4509,'en','Ice Age: The Great Egg-Scapade','A harried prehistoric bird mother entrusts her precious, soon-to-hatch egg to Sid. When she recommends him to her neighbours, business booms at his new egg-sitting service. However, dastardly pirate bunny, Squint, who is seeking revenge on the herd, steals, camouflages and hides all the eggs. Once again, with Squint’s twin brother assisting, Manny, Diego and the rest of the gang come to the rescue and take off on a daring mission that turns into the world’s first Easter egg hunt.','/ysQqYp9G37Q114Nc6uvCHbDmaj6.jpg','2016-03-19',25,'Released','The world’s first Easter egg hunt. It all started right here.','Ice Age: The Great Egg-Scapade',387893,6.905,6.4,'74tcmiPJt_o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42026,_binary '\0','/u5ZfCU2eJJMKZV2Z7AFDn1rCq2x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5480528',3.9,1271,'en','Mother, May I Sleep with Danger?','Theater major Leah brings her new love home to meet her mom, Julie, who is surprised when Pearl comes to the door. Julie tries to embrace the idea of Leah’s new love interest, but she can’t shake the feeling that something is very wrong. Julie’s suspicions lead to a startling discovery about Pearl that puts Leah in serious danger. Will Julie be able to save her daughter from an eternity of heartache before it’s too late?','/l4hJiuqtw6xA7IvXNvnTHhtiuYI.jpg','2016-06-18',86,'Released',NULL,'Mother, May I Sleep with Danger?',399747,2.4157,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42027,_binary '\0','/bDmDpjKFHovVk5cQFKeV7njJYtB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5480782',6.7,4717,'pt','As Boas Maneiras','Clara, a lonely nurse from the outskirts of São Paulo, is hired by mysterious and wealthy Ana as the nanny for her unborn child. The two women develop a strong bond, but soon Clara discovers a terrifying secret about the child.','/dFGfmI9tIWCpEZbGUhI40uznL1F.jpg','2018-01-25',136,'Released',NULL,'Good Manners',315205,1.8156,6.539,'Og6QD5N23as','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42028,_binary '\0','/hpTfONsjx6HrHRg9WTFmdHZgRvV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5481184',4.5,3169,'zh','封神传奇','During the reign of King Zhou, an official enters his bedchamber, and is devoured by the monstrous tails of Daji, his concubine. Outside their city, several warriors within a metal wagon discuss their strategies to free the Invisible People and their Chief, when Jiang Ziya appears to them. He tells them that when King Zhou was younger, he let himself become possessed by the Black Dragon for his quest for power.','/nMiTkBfAmXtCW2tbWHRiGb09Bjv.jpg','2016-07-28',130,'Released',NULL,'League of Gods',406429,3.5015,5.7,'XrHBdVEZ3BQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42029,_binary '\0','/oDvkt6sbGBLXt6EfPgl5ozoIb2f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5481404',4.8,3561,'en','Dead Rising: Endgame','Investigative reporter Chase Carter must stop a secret government conspiracy in the zombie infested quarantine zone of East Mission City.','/yQZCTiMWnXNTeKtnBAOmGdUT0rf.jpg','2016-06-20',96,'Released',NULL,'Dead Rising: Endgame',400605,3.1368,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42030,_binary '\0','/t9KQcuG5ymVbJISL3CbNJEvGcwG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5481984',2.2,1290,'en','Sinister Squad','When a supernatural cult threatens Earth, Alice must assemble a team of fairy tale villains to face the literal forces of Death.','/vRiUN3Hg6vAg0o2lT3HPnWnIIC5.jpg','2016-07-05',90,'Released','Super bad. But in a good way.','Sinister Squad',404947,1.6192,3,'C_QcAHiLS24','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42031,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5483082',6,1367,'fa','دختر','A young girl leaves her hometown in south of Iran for a half day trip without permission of his strict father to attend a close friend\'s goodbye party. In her way back home hazy weather changes all she planned.','/5XPi4kHytRRTURmAXHMxlsirhVA.jpg','2016-06-28',103,'Released',NULL,'Daughter',407427,0.763,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42032,_binary '\0','/lmD9YFl9UzrrKewVko3qvD6NT7P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5483626',5.5,2280,'ta','எனை நோக்கி பாயும் தோட்டா','A college student’s life takes an unexpected turn when he falls for an actress caught in a dangerous web of control. As their love story unfolds, he is drawn into a high-stakes world where survival becomes the ultimate challenge.','/sFs2upNXyv3tbYyVpJX1AVUpMjJ.jpg','2019-11-29',152,'Released',NULL,'Enai Noki Paayum Thota',428378,1.3579,5.048,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42033,_binary '\0','/cdczbM4skbXJz6D9ukXFk3lRZ02.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5485456',6.3,1264,'en','The Rooftop Christmas Tree','A legal team must work together to figure out the mystery behind a rooftop Christmas tree to keep the owner from going to jail for Christmas -- again.','/cUeaUIP5eWTgAnSAFhIn8PyX8kR.jpg','2016-11-27',85,'Released',NULL,'The Rooftop Christmas Tree',428119,2.0332,6.1,'f-vHjA9xRZE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42034,_binary '\0','/4eGIfS8O7cdTaVMAKaNVhHfKtnJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5487052',6.2,1624,'ru','День выборов 2','Igor Tsaplin wants to be elected for a third term and PR team already familiar to us will help him.','/cve3rtPqQRK6SniT2qIXRSOKI4m.jpg','2016-02-18',105,'Released',NULL,'Elections Day 2',376716,0.9437,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42035,_binary '\0','/gLQHmkqzIxYXM6JdGhG7OMVPNMR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5487524',4.4,1282,'ru','Ночные стражи','When eighteen-year-old Pasha rescues a beautiful young woman from a band of strangely powerful attackers, he discovers an underworld of supernatural beings living among us.','/jj1WvBwmGUYJKdsd12xhOol5trP.jpg','2016-08-01',97,'Released',NULL,'Night Guards',402193,2.4113,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42036,_binary '\0','/fR7C3hlHYYzehPNT2Wv4nI4xJqU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5488854',6.9,2408,'es','La vida inmoral de la pareja ideal','Lucio and Martina used to share an indescribable chemistry during their highschool years, however, they took separate ways. 25 years later they meet again, but this time they decide to invent an ideal life in order to hide themselves from an inevitable truth: they were really waiting for each other in all of these years.','/9bS2QeaSGkEZua61tuFb7ZwagdY.jpg','2016-10-28',91,'Released','There are loves that endure years','Tales of an Immoral Couple',387062,1.9946,6.8,'fVwiczePA0s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42037,_binary '\0','/1w74ruCtq4Uh4WJ2QDqIt8VJvHo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5491920',7.1,3641,'ta','சேதுபதி','Sethupathi, an inspector, investigates the murder of a cop and finds that Vaathiyar, a big shot, is responsible for the killing. He arrests Vaathiyar, but an unf