 the child not in Istanbul, but in Ayvalık, Küçükköy, where Ali\'s grandmother lives, based on a dream she had. Here too, her shocking requests will not end, and Ali will find himself in very comical situations. However, the child\'s birth there will also provide a solution to a very important problem for the townspeople.','/lvANwir9ZKkv0iZUW7KBbCAkzSu.jpg','2016-03-04',102,'Released',NULL,'Ali Kundilli 2',447234,0.8485,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42057,_binary '\0','/rP3VzfjnWXIb7hCHpveQYYKuS3g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5505316',4.2,5959,'tr','Kolpaçino: 3. Devre','Özgür accidentally comes across the money of a mafia leader.','/a8kWG7jAJjoAGlsSwX7CXrmXoAQ.jpg','2016-03-10',93,'Released',NULL,'Kolpachino 3: Chain',400852,1.5218,4,'ybPk4FR1-p0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42058,_binary '\0','/frIIobWv0d23pU7qEyYswX3beus.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5510934',8.9,6231,'bn','অজ্ঞাতনামা','A migrant worker\'s passing leads authorities on a wild goose chase on his identity and what to do with his corpse.','/6uBYWBPVZ11SfoaXVVPmgpWWHO3.jpg','2016-08-19',100,'Released',NULL,'The Unnamed',418204,1.3024,7.66,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42059,_binary '\0','/7wIYHtTXZRo7ha4hxoiTqvz5UnW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5512872',5.6,4507,'en','Be Somebody','Pop superstar Jordan Jaye has a big dream he just wants to live like a regular teenager. When he\'s chased down by some excited female fans, he finds a perfect hideout and a reluctant new friend from a small town, high-school art student, Emily Lowe. Despite being from different worlds, they soon discover they have way more in common than they ever imagined. Over the course of several days, the two embark on an unexpected journey of friendship, first love and self-discovery -- proving that maybe opposites really do attract.','/hS0tUZVhIW7LW2jErF5ILY9PiR3.jpg','2016-06-10',88,'Released','Dare to dream','Be Somebody',397517,2.6321,6.5,'IZNbzq5eV