an revolution.','/fcQOeSQV6flz28ybZCkcmCsdqkR.jpg','2017-06-19',111,'Released',NULL,'The Nile Hilton Incident',428495,3.061,6.61,'IL5xTf8tfWQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42099,_binary '\0','/vLDz1V7CNRf5uue4eAgbJPRT99q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5540992',6.4,9946,'en','Shock and Awe','A group of journalists covering George Bush\'s planned invasion of Iraq in 2003 are skeptical of the presidents claim that Saddam Hussein has \"weapons of mass destruction.\"','/x8Y9lKNnroACauSxmVQRkACj2ow.jpg','2017-12-09',90,'Released','They risked everything to uncover the truth.','Shock and Awe',476335,5.425,6.274,'-9xTDZDYfI8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42100,_binary '\0','/o1X1oCbQRg3VOWEUefiL8PXBB8L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5541132',7.1,2500,'de','Grießnockerlaffäre','After a provincial policeman gets falsely accused of a crime that was committed with his pocket knife, he begins a turbulent hunt for the real murderer.','/8I9AqTEUrPiltwxgWg442YngqyI.jpg','2017-08-03',98,'Released',NULL,'The Dumpling Affair',427027,1.4266,7.058,'ceyfRvOU37A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42101,_binary '\0','/7HlX7R8yTSlxqmzMxVemsOEkAfo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5541240',6.7,60024,'en','To the Bone','A young woman dealing with anorexia meets an unconventional doctor who challenges her to face her condition and embrace life.','/pkdxhdB3dRUqazqoy9lzUvhayjc.jpg','2017-01-22',107,'Released','Don\'t fade away','To the Bone',401104,4.8881,7.202,'705yRfs6Dbs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42102,_binary '\0','/cknjcnAD4xFxktXlkG1nzSLJzAn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5541848',7.2,31166,'en','What the Health','Filmmaker Kip Andersen uncovers the secret to preventing and even reversing chronic diseases, and he investigates why the nation\'s leading health organizations doesn\'t want people to know about it.','/sz9cPeSmiGLA1EDUPszlrWfSrId.jpg','2017-03-16',97,'Released','The health