 Taboo',453364,4.0561,7.1,'xUnSemNTycE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42153,_binary '\0','/liz04gP0R3IbaLbKu7cJS37Bt7S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5585272',5.5,10339,'en','Through the Glass Darkly','A year after Charlie\'s daughter disappears, another girl from Elrod, Georgia goes missing. Convinced there is a connection, Charlie draws suspicion and contempt from local law enforcement and townspeople as she stops at nothing to expose its most devastating and darkest secret.','/fKLfCWHGFLQjS2ZbIa35sjXh4nE.jpg','2020-09-24',103,'Released','The truth lies in her past.','Through the Glass Darkly',737666,2.6492,5.1,'y7r_uL95YEs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42154,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5585836',2.9,1809,'en','Canaan Land','\"Canaan Land\" is a love story between Brother Billy Gantry, a charismatic con man, phone psychic, and preacher, who falls for Sister Sara Sunday, a sincere Christian.','/9IMjbJ2L1rVspWvqpFUTsIqnzs.jpg','2020-12-12',112,'Released','A con man preacher falls for a true believer and discovers his con game isn\'t a game anymore.','Canaan Land',627641,1.5631,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42155,_binary '\0','/cmBVEV68cusbedgnHVon2xOsiv7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5586052',7.2,1891,'de','Die Unsichtbaren','Four young Jews survive the Third Reich in the middle of Berlin by living so recklessly that they become \"invisible.\"','/ba8TNJlVTAwbNmNallMnTu4Swhi.jpg','2017-10-08',110,'Released',NULL,'The Invisibles',403308,1.8635,7,'k2aVBot4DNY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42156,_binary '\0','/gzk3YMlVqEFNzFXFz98ueRHnwMa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5586362',4.4,4867,'en','Maus','Alex and Selma are a couple in love on a trip to the heart of Bosnia and Herzegovina. Suddenly, Selma feels a mysterious force is chasing them.','/cOnVhuqmirMo3c1vlQcI2jnfWT7.jpg','2017-09-21',90,'Released',NULL,'The Maus',461931,1.2182,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42157,_binary '\0','/zIoxBSm31WjusKXJXFBvqH3b4WH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5586914',6.7,1734,'ko','그날의 분위기','A train ride brings two unlikely souls together as Bae, a committed partner of a serious 10-year relationship, sees her world turned upside down by the charming playboy Kim. Seated together on a business trip from Seoul to Busan, the two find themselves on an adventure to remember.','/jwDsnlagaZb2jaydkemwi69Jx5B.jpg','2016-01-14',103,'Released','To win her or to lose her.','Mood of the Day',376252,2.5774,7.154,'v_yA_KNTVCs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42158,_binary '\0','/4ATMHvq7islHTcbvYKbOIMQeP7n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5589212',5,1223,'en','Extracurricular','Miriam, Derek, Ian, and Jenny are overachieving high school students doing everything by the book. Straight As, sports, yearbook, band, and – when coursework allows – planning and executing elaborate murders.','/pPX6i486V5ZJkDvNkMAvqCDUVA2.jpg','2020-01-17',91,'Released','After school is when the real fun begins','Extracurricular',401313,1.2407,5.1,'WWmGdCFX8W0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42159,_binary '\0','/6e5j8i5CupvML0aYH3LE5EGgtyb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5589768',6,1721,'nl','Soof 2','After her marriage comes undone, Soof has to re-invent herself and get her tumultuous life back on track.','/ttwN1G1y5yVih2pG3tOKcLrmDqg.jpg','2016-12-08',100,'Released',NULL,'Soof 2',425186,0.7992,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42160,_binary '\0','/rwr038BaQBqRQbnP8yps4hXp5Dp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5591666',5.7,12834,'en','The Domestics','A young husband and wife must fight to return home in a post-apocalyptic mid-western landscape ravaged by gangs.','/j64I3u1wwgPct3stvvKU2ikl14w.jpg','2018-06-28',95,'Released','In the end, defend.','The Domestics',426814,4.521,6.167,'IrcQhTm2h2I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42161,_binary '\0','/3Jol3HFqCLhHKBMaunXe9ruMJp2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5591786',7.1,1410,'uk','Червоний','Year 1947. Commander of UPA Danylo Chervonyi gets into the terrible slaughter of Stalin\'s camps, where he must go through hell and inhumane prison conditions, prosecution of criminal leaders, meanness, betrayal and despair. Danylo finds the strength to resist repression of the camp commander and makes a desperate attempt to break free, raising the first rebel in the camp.','/s7irWZIrfkU8nytS3mfsGn9ekXS.jpg','2017-08-24',110,'Released','The fight that still on','Chervonyi',421915,1.4688,7.447,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42162,_binary '\0','/hYmLuWTvNf6RypCYgz1qOvLLAGg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5592248',6.3,66664,'en','The Beguiled','During the Civil War, at a Southern girls’ boarding school, young women take in an injured enemy soldier. As they provide refuge and tend to his wounds, the house is taken over with sexual tension and dangerous rivalries, and taboos are broken in an unexpected turn of events.','/x4R9jyiZhJzevASus5n6WyHQTdR.jpg','2017-06-23',93,'Released','Innocent, until betrayed.','The Beguiled',399019,8.4097,5.918,'_r_FSRbuZ9Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42163,_binary '\0','/7U6Q8VnfjEu7HzzAxznscJqjo0D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5592796',6.4,9426,'en','Driven','FBI informant Jim Hoffman lures troubled automobile magnate John DeLorean to an undercover sting for cocaine trafficking.','/5szS3NXiycrTL67AunS7TLG0EE0.jpg','2019-08-15',113,'Released','How a lemon became a legend.','Driven',520016,3.5823,6.2,'WK82Y6TKHg8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42164,_binary '\0','/sP3xtGBYcQejqkTn22aZz8c3U8v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5592878',6.4,14977,'eu','Errementari','Basque Country, Spain, 1843. A police constable arrives at a small village in Álava to investigate a mysterious blacksmith who lives alone deep in the woods.','/ltpi1uLkvx2BKHWwbpMjqdAtdHn.jpg','2018-03-02',98,'Released',NULL,'Errementari: The Blacksmith and the Devil',477033,2.9059,6.383,'V1E240HdoR0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42165,_binary '\0','/aF6ZNNt254abdvywjjvvRTf8DOn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5593384',7.9,5541,'et','Tõde ja õigus','Estonia, 1872. The uncompromising new owner of Robber\'s Rise must battle with hard work, his spiteful neighbor and with his own family and beliefs to transform the poor land into a flourishing farm of his dreams.','/l8HlPxCzyGz5sNXSNi6GbSKOgC9.jpg','2019-02-22',165,'Released',NULL,'Truth and Justice',583841,2.1929,7.634,'LWDyVmq6ako','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42166,_binary '\0','/lVR7yfkObpcD6yG0DGHUAGDjE7r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5594080',7.4,3510,'en','To Walk Invisible','To Walk Invisible takes a new look at the extraordinary Brontë family, telling the story of these remarkable women who, despite the obstacles they faced, came from obscurity to produce some of the greatest novels in the English language.','/v90nEr5JhLyOWnloKRlNWVrzhBp.jpg','2016-12-26',120,'Released','The Lives of the Brontë Sisters','To Walk Invisible',430158,1.892,7.3,'lC8VUfUb-hU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42167,_binary '\0','/eTfik9sRZTcaWIMJGVhmUqrbL0Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5595168',6.7,24503,'ja','キングスグレイブ ファイナルファンタジーXV','The magical kingdom of Lucis is home to the world’s last remaining Crystal, and the menacing empire of Niflheim is determined to steal it. King Regis of Lucis commands an elite force of soldiers called the Kingsglaive. Wielding their king’s magic, they fight to protect Lucis. As the overwhelming military might of the empire bears down, King Regis is faced with an impossible ultimatum – to marry his son, Prince Noctis to Princess Lunafreya of Tenebrae, captive of Niflheim, and surrender his lands to Niflheim rule. Although the king concedes, it becomes clear that the empire will stop at nothing to achieve their devious goals, with only the Kingsglaive standing between them and world domination.','/xGMgspge6uYoypRiasAmlluDlXH.jpg','2016-07-09',115,'Released','The Final Fantasy XV saga starts here.','Kingsglaive: Final Fantasy XV',390734,4.377,6.772,'iP8EgMUVmwk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42168,_binary '\0','/qxvsDiaD7UZoz0JfXYMM302PEgq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5596352',6.5,1607,'zh','火锅英雄','When three friends open a hot pot restaurant in a former bomb shelter, they discover it’s linked by a single wall to the bank vault next door. While deciding to take the easy money or go to the police, they find out one of the bank’s employees is a former classmate and look to enlist her in deciding their future.','/2drSTNudM11yUkOCwqf5xS4JCZ6.jpg','2016-04-01',97,'Released',NULL,'Chongqing Hot Pot',388403,1.9575,6.447,'9_5NW5HyCf4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42169,_binary '\0','/whHc0tLO6I4ALvlUHGuJM329RUB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5597198',6.9,2807,'ur','پنجاب نہِیں جاؤں گی‎','A man vows to win the heart of the woman he loves.','/j00DqulduMkONV8yE46uQgk06I2.jpg','2017-08-31',159,'Released','I won\'t go to Pakistan','Punjab Nahi Jaungi',465134,1.0901,6.9,'z1AaNERuYHs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42170,_binary '\0','/5mTHMygeAm96hKuELNRgkkfFtXu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5597408',6.8,1371,'ko','시간이탈자','A high-school teacher in 1983 and a detective in 2015 join forces through their dreams to change the perilous fate of the woman they both love—30 years apart.','/enNzmbscuisQVAev4vj7muDwtNq.jpg','2016-04-13',107,'Released','Since that day, their dreams became a window connecting two worlds.','Time Renegades',385962,2.2994,7.1,'VTg3zrSsZjU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42171,_binary '\0','/tJgVMjAijX1fk99qhgOUDAMw4Tr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5597946',5.7,1684,'fr','Débarquement immédiat!','French border cop José Fernandez has just one last extradition to do before his long-awaited promotion to the crime bureau. But his detainee Akim, victim of a judiciary glitch, is outraged to find himself saddled with the identity of a potential terrorist and put on a flight back to Kabul, where he has never even set foot before! What starts as a routine trip for Fernandez and his skirt-chasing partner Guy goes haywire when their plane is grounded in Malta, forcing them to bunk up with Akim, who will stop at nothing to avoid extradition!','/h0QB2TGtfnl7GxPsWDCLzFKlVDS.jpg','2016-07-13',90,'Released',NULL,'Last Call for Nowhere',382518,2.179,5.663,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42172,_binary '\0','/ls3wjiOmWk8FAcfSqVrwPGpMzxR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5598100',7.2,2594,'fr','Patients','After a serious sport accident in a swimming pool, Ben, now an incomplete quadriplegic, arrives in a rehabilitation center. He meets with other handicapped persons (tetraplegics, paraplegics, traumatized crania), all victims of accidents, as well as a handicapped since his early childhood. They go through impotence, despair and resignation, with their daily struggle to learn how to move a finger or to hold a fork. Some of them slowly find a little mobility while others receive the verdict of the handicap for life. Despite everything, hope and friendship help them endure their difficulties.','/sv2Xdpk4nzY2qKAg5oG2qZkTrY9.jpg','2017-03-01',110,'Released',NULL,'Patients',434616,1.442,7.4,'iJgP-O1Yrqg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42173,_binary '\0','/w4uYP6ebNaLQIjsHcjQhjz3BB2m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5598102',7.8,14530,'fr','Visages Villages','Director Agnès Varda and photographer/muralist JR journey through rural France and form an unlikely friendship.','/1NX6NTj9FiiJwEgRUmEifSzE7Na.jpg','2017-06-28',94,'Released',NULL,'Faces Places',451995,3.1955,7.6,'P7rFMO7ODBk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42174,_binary '\0','/1K3eMmurLIs9LlT0KP94wGCbyPv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5598110',6.1,4954,'fr','Iris','The sudden disappearance of a wealthy banker\'s wife cracks open a dizzying world of secret fetishes, desperate acts and elaborate deceptions.','/tzVLPSoLfs0U3JHeGW5RKvsRAO.jpg','2016-11-16',98,'Released',NULL,'In the Shadow of Iris',395763,2.0473,5.9,'BNHyTnzxeyk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42175,_binary '\0','/hlo9GMZSOeihdBXxAAVLqrXIZmM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5598160',6.5,3115,'fr','Jeune femme','Broke, with nothing but her cat to her name and doors closing in her face, Paula is back in Paris after a long absence. As she meets different people along the way, there is one thing she knows for sure: she\'s determined to make a new start and she\'ll do it with style and panache.','/zz3WiqmC0ySu03Ruzlc0bKyOaqb.jpg','2017-11-01',97,'Released',NULL,'Jeune Femme',452016,3.2482,5.839,'_PIJNf8fwkA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42176,_binary '\0','/hF2Hk6BT3QLJZKmx6Hp8wKBqFQt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5598172',4.9,1907,'fr','Si j\'étais un homme','Jeanne wakes up one morning and her life is about to take a funny turn, at first sight nothing has changed in her - to a small detail.','/ncDa148htqFhM5EXm32vszTWi0C.jpg','2017-02-22',95,'Released','One morning, she woke up with something extra!','If I Were a Boy',430528,3.3371,5.338,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42177,_binary '\0','/4jzX0R2GvtGyYmIzJwST6A15hWe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5598216',7.2,7735,'en','Team Foxcatcher','With never-before seen home video, this film recounts the paranoid downward spiral of John E. du Pont and the murder of Olympic wrestler Dave Schultz.','/aeHMJUVHo0EgfiFaM7pyxK5k8qu.jpg','2016-04-18',91,'Released','An Olympic hero. A delusional benefactor. At the intersection of ambition and paranoia lies tragedy.','Team Foxcatcher',390520,0.8764,6.965,'WZczesrBFRA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42178,_binary '\0','/2CbgsjUzoyEXBH0rvAxfdI5fwLU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5598234',5.3,1737,'en','Bowie: The Man Who Changed the World','Experience an inside look at David Bowie\'s incredible influence on music, art and culture via interviews with some of the people who knew him best.','/okiUq69MB9Wgj9fNE0u4RWCGus3.jpg','2016-05-09',98,'Released',NULL,'Bowie: The Man Who Changed the World',434949,1.478,5.735,'SgIohffTxIw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42179,_binary '\0','/lECfRcKuZzIm3uyIt6K7SuudDfN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5598292',5.2,19413,'en','Polaroid','High school loner Bird Fitcher has no idea what dark secrets are tied to the mysterious Polaroid vintage camera she stumbles upon, but it doesn\'t take long to discover that those who have their picture taken meet a tragic end. Bird and her friends must survive one more night as they race to solve the mystery of the haunted Polaroid before it kills them all.','/6a1iqhfM0Y31kNPOSNPIuPrsYQ6.jpg','2019-01-10',88,'Released','Beware this camera... Once you take it, it takes you.','Polaroid',431075,4.4035,6.031,'lN_Xb7A2QpI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42180,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5598578',4.5,3042,'hi','Baa Baaa Black Sheep','The world turns upside down for Baba on his 25th birthday, when he learns that his apparently boring father is in fact a dreaded hitman, and that his family has made a tradition out of this morbid business for the past 12 generations! Now, the time has come for Baba to take over as the 13th. And as if all of this is not enough, there is the strange case of the love interest with her own secrets, a stolen Renoir painting and prowling contract killers. The plot thickens, but is Baba ready for the mayhem that\'s about to ensue!?','/4YPaN7EiaLreQJATcUimCNlUS9j.jpg','2018-03-23',103,'Released',NULL,'Baa Baaa Black Sheep',512114,1.1501,5,'letr-X8TBuA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42181,_binary '\0','/ec1GvRIV2ycwmldrjdhxynkmmf2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5598764'