:10.000000'),(42215,_binary '\0','/lvC9CrcsSFazXuzXZwmHBrXioZC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5616294',5.7,14703,'en','Spinning Man','Evan Birch is a family man and esteemed professor at a distinguished university. When a female student goes missing, police Detective Malloy has reason to be suspicious when crucial evidence makes Evan the prime suspect in her disappearance.','/lb73nmpv97C4C5WXoxTE0DD7ptU.jpg','2018-04-06',100,'Released','What you believe, what you know, is all how you spin it.','Spinning Man',458109,5.0076,5.6,'syitpT-swzE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42216,_binary '\0','/97FlKLWIQLJRpMvFTvkXQ9IHuLg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5617310',5.3,1538,'en','Webcast','Stranded in the suburbs, student filmmaker Chloe begins to make a documentary about her family\'s troubled past. Whilst filming, she and best friend Ed, witness an hysterical girl appearing to escape from a neighbour\'s house, only to be quickly dragged back inside again. Is she a recovering drug addict like the neighbours say? Or is she really in danger from those who claim to be caring for her?','/kvqwhMf5xfUwHbgZDYaw9gX1ZuK.jpg','2018-12-15',95,'Released','Neighbourhood. Watch.','Webcast',411267,1.1691,6,'ea5a2IOwxHM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42217,_binary '\0','/bd70ecQnRqcwHB7v3KEu3m4n6Zg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5617312',4.5,2934,'en','The Bay of Silence','Will believes his wife Rosalind is innocent of their son\'s suspected murder, only to discover the devastating truth behind her past links her to another unsolved crime.','/oB3LX9C3FbJvPtrk1J7qHQKvzLr.jpg','2020-08-20',93,'Released','Some secrets echo forever.','The Bay of Silence',623958,4.3141,4.5,'F7mVOJrl1z4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42218,_binary '\0','/yb9LHNTFdokqsGDYfWNa7WNGHXY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5617916',1.9,5315,'en','Airplane Mode','En route to the world\'s largest social media convention in Australia, Logan Paul is scared to death; today is his first time flying. All of his worst nightmares come true when the passengers refuse to switch their phones to airplane mode, causing the plane\'s controls to go haywire and electrocuting the pilots.','/jWcxcTE0LfDL1M4NSN2NORvEyho.jpg','2019-08-02',80,'Released','The internet is about to crash!','Airplane Mode',550115,3.3026,2.6,'BaH8YyjbDZQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42219,_binary '\0','/xfTLqhyq1zoFql7X6h37j6DIvVQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5618690',8,1530,'en','Street Gang: How We Got to Sesame Street','Take a stroll down Sesame Street and witness the birth of the most influential children\'s show in television history. From the iconic furry characters to the classic songs you know by heart, learn how a gang of visionary creators changed the world.','/o5o7Lubqk0HDxtLR2aCEoO3P6lp.jpg','2021-04-23',107,'Released','The story of the street that changed history.','Street Gang: How We Got to Sesame Street',476044,2.2039,7.4,'hQDydUQQNCA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42220,_binary '\0','/lK0QUQVs8ywBZ0WSjDu9Qu1nciy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5618752',6.5,2659,'ru','Кроткая','A woman lives in a small village in Russia. One day she receives the parcel she sent to her husband, serving a sentence in prison. Confused and angered, she sets out to find why her package was returned to sender.','/rGQ5owiGxmY7J2drGNdDKxUFlmy.jpg','2017-08-16',143,'Released',NULL,'A Gentle Creature',442947,2.1616,5.9,'Sun3D8VqkGY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42221,_binary '\0','/5uayF96i4JWtdNH3uJy5IpImDBT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5619332',5.6,43230,'en','Life of the Party','When her husband suddenly dumps her, longtime dedicated housewife Deanna turns regret into re-set by going back to college... landing in the same class and school as her daughter, who\'s not entirely sold on the idea. Plunging headlong into the campus experience, the increasingly outspoken Deanna – now Dee Rock – embraces freedom, fun, and frat boys on her own terms, finding her true self in a senior year no one ever expected.','/749iUAWQWeutQuTd9excjmigecw.jpg','2018-05-10',105,'Released','Give life the old college try.','Life of the Party',399796,7.0722,6.1,'T1B1CxmAXLk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42222,_binary '\0','/noNMHp461qETqftTGRC4xJtJ8Pf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5622412',4.7,8162,'en','Black Water','A deep cover operative awakens to find himself imprisoned on a submarine. With the help of a fellow prisoner and an amateur agent, he must race against the clock to escape the vessel and expose who set him up.','/qvcJ2gPPELyoGkuUgVZ3JV7Jxb8.jpg','2018-05-18',105,'Released','Some secrets never surface','Black Water',454615,5.3954,5.6,'WOTDGACjzcY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42223,_binary '\0','/mRZDHjArYNWpOv06kxRK1cduQKh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5624466',5.7,7332,'en','Son','When a young boy contracts a mysterious illness, his mother must decide how far she will go to protect him from terrifying forces in her past.','/4fl6EdtMp6p0RKJgESdFti1J3dC.jpg','2021-03-18',98,'Released','You can\'t outrun a family secret.','Son',754934,2.5278,5.99,'OxwA_E0ywUs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42224,_binary '\0','/t3W767pq9rUdMXxVGzWVt2hs1Hs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5628302',6.8,18844,'en','Beast','A troubled woman living in an isolated community finds herself pulled between the control of her oppressive family and the allure of a secretive outsider suspected of a series of brutal murders.','/kZdncyp1IKhEqwv5zdmUpK5Dc7S.jpg','2018-04-18',107,'Released','Be careful what you unleash','Beast',470918,3.4341,6.5,'kZMgjJrDWZs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42225,_binary '\0','/iFMARpEJnSQBUDKzKvvRw6ATVF3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5628418',6.2,4956,'no','Askeladden - I Dovregubbens hall','Espen “Ash Lad”, a poor farmer’s son, embarks on a dangerous quest with his brothers to save the princess from a vile troll known as the Mountain King – in order to collect a reward and save his family’s farm from ruin.','/uyJEfpAflLCkqn6PFHu9EHxmbI6.jpg','2017-09-29',100,'Released','Something big is coming','The Ash Lad: In the Hall of the Mountain King',444090,6.4329,6.787,'Chnl8RdG09Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42226,_binary '\0','/dJILgUxIis6x8JwmLhHKC4voFSz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5628792',6.4,1465,'fr','Aurore','Aurore has separated, just lost her job, and learns that she is going to be a grandmother.','/gxMK7webO1uaoMWgGDfCqlbnLpr.jpg','2017-04-26',86,'Released',NULL,'I Got Life!',444291,2.5389,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42227,_binary '\0','/yi6lKRgQT7FDHE706PE7MxN5CDA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5628902',5.2,7584,'en','Rabid','The quiet Rose works in women\'s fashion clothing, hoping to be a designer. A traffic accident damages her face. She gets experimental stem cell treatment, leaving her stronger and prettier than ever - but there\'s a side effect.','/4Tg5ELMmCJFhZCn7jZtHIcpOprz.jpg','2019-12-13',107,'Released','Pray it doesn’t happen to you.','Rabid',384756,2.7604,5.8,'E24TLm2WNQg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42228,_binary '\0','/588O5O6C0Wq8RfIctuthalUkW3n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5629340',6.7,2188,'fr','Ôtez-moi d\'un doute','Erwan, a strapping Breton who clears mines for a living, is shaken when he discovers that his father is not his father. Despite his affection for the man who raised him, he quietly sets out to find his biological father, and succeeds in locating Joseph, an endearing old codger he takes a liking to. Just when things look settled, another unexpected “bomb” hits Erwan in the form of Anna, an elusive nymph.','/xlnf99tJK93J1G9LlihOxdnWJoZ.jpg','2017-09-06',100,'Released',NULL,'Just to Be Sure',418970,2.8125,6.4,'fN46DCFr2Y0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42229,_binary '\0','/1btUYcOIfh5JrKPhLh2HlbzsgCa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5629524',4.5,3804,'ru','За гранью реальности','Contemporary Moscow. A talented gambler gathers a team of people with supernatural powers to win big at a casino. But they find a much stronger mystical rival.','/2wCc7YaeolNRo4Bh3xNG4zmu1XQ.jpg','2018-03-01',101,'Released',NULL,'Beyond the Edge',497727,3.7255,5.5,'sRAB7pMFhRw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42230,_binary '\0','/1i1XwuVcgjoydpTiDoFhLBiqU0Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5629964',4.8,5439,'en','The Midnight Man','A girl and her friends find a game in the attic that summons a creature known as The Midnight Man, who uses their worst fears against them.','/gtrxCwIvpb70NR9RECkt8dPrTJd.jpg','2016-09-30',95,'Released',NULL,'The Midnight Man',492621,3.9499,5.779,'b4pd7Tlpqak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42231,_binary '\0','/gSA9VUfo9Mm8vMsUALDkrtFS7nO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5631456',7.2,2472,'pt','Como Nossos Pais','Rosa is in her late 30s, a child of the 1970s with divorced parents. She lives with her own family in São Paulo. Overwhelmed by an eruption of individual passions, lies and the expectations of three generations, she tries to discover who she really is.','/lU9VOndlXf4Dqu9FVpp8ubmizl2.jpg','2017-07-27',102,'Released',NULL,'Just Like Our Parents',439066,1.356,7.2,'3SrlEuUbMjU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42232,_binary '\0','/fy2vZIcpm3YzFHxOwUNUjfC7WyA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5633706',7.2,2105,'ja','彼らが本気で編むときは、','After being neglected by her mother, a little girl is taken in by her uncle and his transgender girlfriend, who create a loving home for her.','/oUbsvNZiwepEuSFKuZY36RPdqYr.jpg','2017-02-25',127,'Released','A new kind of household.','Close-Knit',428733,2.01,7.1,'wNz0m9uajO4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42233,_binary '\0','/5G0z1UwIEpvyQmWTAdcuoCc26N2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','