e','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42237,_binary '\0','/6mf4fsL1l6tL5npJrPD3aoY6g63.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5635638',7.1,2436,'en','White Boy','“White Boy Rick”, as he was called, was a novelty: A white teenager seemingly running a major inner-city drug operation. In May of 1987, 17-year-old Richard Wershe Jr. was charged with a non-violent, juvenile drug offense. By the time of his arrest he was already a Detroit legend, frequently making front-page headlines and leading the local television news. In this film, gangsters, hit men, journalists and federal agents struggle to explain why he remains in prison at nearly 50 years old. The possible explanation is more stunning than the crimes Wershe was alleged to have committed.','/yp0mFuaUmgV2NSpd5QMymmtNud3.jpg','2017-03-31',82,'Released',NULL,'White Boy',450648,0.8857,7.1,'UBa0Lv8eon4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42238,_binary '\0','/9q0henxKLdLLlNlwUGwDB3VPHgz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5636228',2.7,10473,'en','Lumina','When the sudden appearance of lights from the sky causes his girlfriend to disappear, Alex and his friends embark on a quest to find her. Their journey soon leads them to a deep underground military base where they encounter government agents and an alien menace that threatens their lives.','/tySni5LziDoPSgicjAc3FRFiKfe.jpg','2024-07-12',120,'Released','Embrace the darkness, fear the light','Lumina',1113231,1.1189,3.7,'HYqLSIpbs8Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42239,_binary '\0','/urroAW1sqEaWNWlCNdmWNbN868A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5636668',6.4,1329,'zh','记忆大师','A man becomes involved in a memory manipulation operation to try and regain lost memories. He thinks the exercise may help repair his failed marriage, but accidentally ends up with the mind of a serial killer.','/2bykI8po16H8a3zQMOsOFFARw3d.jpg','2017-04-28',120,'Released',NULL,'Battle of Memories',449306,1.4546,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42240,_binary '\0','/sKsN4QXjLZDRNfz4FZz6XRZLFJS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5637188',5.6,1283,'hi','Saat Uchakkey','SAAT UCHAKKEY is a comedy caper about 7 petty crooks blundering their way through an exciting gamut of mystery, greed, treachery and running into one riotous crisis after another. Set against the gritty backdrop of Old Delhi, this burlesque film opens a window into the unpredictable world of magical realism, where the lingo is spattered with the choicest of swear words and the mannerisms with sidesplitting humor.','/wZwPFL7wnwgHxbEoNrtDFWuNYs8.jpg','2016-10-14',139,'Released',NULL,'Saat Uchakkey',421515,1.0255,4.9,'I1mLGPn1S4I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42241,_binary '\0','/4qvt99tA8fnAPqI3qCaqtJhlxpy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5637542',6.1,2451,'nl','Ron Goossens, Low Budget Stuntman','Alcoholic and low budget stuntman Ron Goossens has to get The Netherlands\' most successful actrice between the sheets in order to save his own marriage. Will he succeed? A new outrageous comedy from the writers/directors of New Kids Turbo, New Kids Nitro and Bros Before Hos.','/36DtuxvsOM7zv4qnkJkmSkXvoZY.jpg','2017-01-26',83,'Released',NULL,'Ron Goossens, Low Budget Stuntman',430945,1.7022,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42242,_binary '\0','/4SJCHpsgDJsHFrElYK9OAlIPFWl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5638474',4.5,1511,'hi','Wajah Tum Ho','A hooded vigilante is broadcasting murders on a news channel. Will the police catch him alive before he live-casts another death?','/a08ZyIvRsnoes9NabNLC9xd5511.jpg','2016-12-16',136,'Released','Murder goes live tonight.','Wajah Tum Ho',430508,1.5986,5.043,'sBueTW-W7Qc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42243,_binary '\0','/4GuJWuQMbiwMNrYahghOsRpEo8t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5638500',4.2,2314,'hi','1920 London','Shivangi lives in London with her husband Veer Singh. One day, he receives a gift from Rajasthan. From then, strange things happen with Veer and his condition deteriorates.','/rs4RBiOX8qoUG5bw1SlGFuzUYws.jpg','2016-05-06',120,'Released','Fear strikes again.','1920 London',392222,1.1401,4.315,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42244,_binary '\0','/vaArQHq1lHFNppoJlMlv30Gs2fQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5638642',6.4,148194,'en','The Ritual','A group of college friends reunite for a trip to the forest, but encounter a menacing presence in the woods that\'s stalking them.','/9022CYEGqYETCeXN1oE3uwYJWub.jpg','2017-10-11',94,'Released','Your darkest dream awaits you.','The Ritual',433808,10.3981,6.3,'3G3N0-6-YpA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42245,_binary '\0','/lNaL2nkbjaZ5b2Mz4zchyuOHLO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5638952',6.9,1240,'ka','დედე','It\'s 1992. Young Dina lives in a remote mountain village where life is strictly governed by centuries of tradition. Dina\'s grandfather has promised her to David, who is returning from the war. But with him comes a comrade-in-arms, the handsome Gegi, and Dina falls in love. Is it possible to defy the firmly established order?','/i1t8eHeEQfDR9RCI083MtIFRAoo.jpg','2017-09-10',97,'Released','A woman\'s restless fight for freedom.','Dede',473764,1.6618,5.7,'bXbABE1cBIs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42246,_binary '\0','/hnDmX7PwpnrNrAQvYQgYemkS9Fx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5639354',7.1,28669,'es','Una mujer fantástica','Marina\'s life is thrown into turmoil following the death of her partner. Mourning the loss of the man she loved, she finds herself under intense scrutiny from those with no regard for her privacy.','/x2yNruMR8bAJOIQ3wd7HR9qWjW3.jpg','2017-04-06',104,'Released','My name is Marina Vidal. Do you have any problem with that?','A Fantastic Woman',429191,3.8859,7,'PJHex4ZitgA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42247,_binary '\0','/r1mVcyEfTR5HZ0g2qxCSZEVp4Ih.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5639388',4.5,2412,'hi','राज़: रीबूट','Newly-weds Rehaan and Shaina move to Romania after the former is offered a job. When Shaina senses paranormal activity around her, she learns that her husband is harbouring a secret from her.','/9S7KOgIFlr2F3Zv6dFK22rIeR1a.jpg','2016-06-17',127,'Released',NULL,'Raaz Reboot',363335,1.0765,4.048,'V496LGfxr38','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42248,_binary '\0','/dCSmuAoO7NMkDkkuMQA0J48Ba9E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5639446',5.9,7091,'en','Jonathan','Jonathan is a young man with a strange condition that only his brother understands. But when he begins to yearn for a different life, their unique bond becomes increasingly tested.','/nTd0PBJkA1HLM9yImDnRZDzGAwb.jpg','2018-11-08',101,'Released',NULL,'Jonathan',422619,2.2673,5.9,'lhkANfgdLB0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42249,_binary '\0','/rImnqIqrO70DB0TSchWOJx5qOPO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5639898',5.3,2033,'en','Social Animals','Determined not to turn into her parents, or be drawn into any relationship longer than a one night stand, Zoe constantly struggles with her failing business and love life. Then she falls in love for the first time with Paul. But there\'s one problem: Paul is married.','/45QgvkuwZF8mffzDcK3wZSpNpA0.jpg','2018-06-01',90,'Released','Love is never picture perfect','Social Animals',506407,2.8188,6.072,'EiFGL9OM0fs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42250,_binary '\0','/oX6rYilUqQJMcMzCn6K61UifOnN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5640450',6.3,44570,'en','ARQ','Two old friends living in a dystopic future become trapped in a mysterious time loop — one that may have something to do with an ongoing battle between an omnipotent corporation and a ragtag band of rebels.','/mU4VeXVK18JtCZsy7i0zczlA9p7.jpg','2016-09-16',88,'Released',NULL,'ARQ',410199,3.9112,6.1,'JY0DGLrd9GY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42251,_binary '\0','/viLWzzO3nvFZ2ppHqijVgTBklLH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5641542',5.2,2056,'en','Gnaw','Jennifer Conrad is a small-town girl starting over in the big city. Fleeing an abusive relationship, all she wants is a chance to begin again. But it is hard to start over when something is eating you while you sleep . . . one painful bite at a time.','/7Z8OTmCjxVibRIEmcSD89pzpze.jpg','2017-09-16',99,'Released','Eat...Prey...Love','Gnaw',483987,1.9293,5.4,'VEqT115KWck','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42252,_binary '\0','/fjZGYRe0Up1lZsEmQ4G22UywUJw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5641832',6.9,2431,'hu','Kojot','Muggy heat, small-town bleakness, unspoken social problems, hierarchy fights. This is Tuzko town, somewhere in Hungary, nowadays. Here comes Misi who inherits his grandfather\'s house and his property. Misi is a disillusioned, frustrated, constantly refugee young man. He can\'t find his role in his life, his job and relationship. He starts to build and renovate the house with some men from the town, but it violates the local oligarch\'s interests. Hard struggle begins for the property, for the love and for the life.','/wbUSLK71Jv4RqaSrdBKMaUVcPnc.jpg','2017-02-16',132,'Released',NULL,'Coyote',442370,1.9008,5.857,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42253,_binary '\0','/6ZYtbyhjfZiZf2vmxx1Wk2KWYxT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5642124',6.6,2654,'fr','L\'Amant d\'un jour','After a bad breakup, a college-aged Parisian moves into her father\'s flat only to discover that he is living with his new girlfriend - a young woman her age.','/rv3IfHRi6yquYjAMBbvCLhG0qBk.jpg','2017-05-31',76,'Released',NULL,'Lover for a Day',434131,1.9134,6.182,'yueoWaB2jrQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42254,_binary '\0','/3fDnM7DDz6dnlfO1XiOSBwWmgQh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5642720',4.5,1456,'ml','കസബ','Rajan Zachariah is a Circle Inspector of Police and he is working in the Palakkad District. He is going to a village situated in the Kerala-Karnataka border to investigate a murder case that is very important to him.','/oTP0nREagUSrfQTNdoLwuyMd5yE.jpg','2016-07-07',137,'Released','Kingdom of the King','Kasaba',406781,1.0944,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42255,_binary '\0','/m4CTwMLAFEkRMegjGGcey24UWfD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5643380',6.5,3880,'es','Taekwondo','Fernando is on vacation with his friends at a country house in Ezeiza. They relax by the pool, drink, smoke, and reveal their deepest secrets while displaying a playful freedom, as if they were children at summer camp.','/nc5dO2rWhUpmc8hdVaOmo4QGQCH.jpg','2016-08-18',105,'Released',NULL,'Taekwondo',413666,2.7287,6.792,'tT6AvSrqTbs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42256,_binary '\0','/s5dUtU9FTNw0Dv4A4uj3QbDNu3U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5644050',7.6,1753,'en','Pick of the Litter','Follows a litter of puppies from the moment they\'re born and begin their quest to become Guide Dogs for the Blind, the ultimate canine career. Cameras follow these pups through a two-year odyssey as they train to become dogs whose ultimate responsibility is to protect their blind partners from harm.','/9TQQ6hq4igBLXKEuFE2woI3rRY.jpg','2019-01-10',81,'Released','Training begins the moment they\'re born.','Pick of the Litter',503257,1.5159,7.4,'oW7GVR2c80k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42257,_binary '\0','/ofghaIIJ9UM3fob8UFwUtpz03Bd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5644726',6.3,1499,'ko','탐정 홍길동: 사라진 마을','Hong Gil-dong is an infallible private detective with an exceptional memory and quirky personality. While chasing the only target he failed to find, he gets entangled in a much bigger conspiracy than he bargained for.','/6ABeeYbYTARUUIiqcQbRS4rQUgR.jpg','2016-05-04',125,'Released','It takes a bad guy to catch a bad guy.','Phantom Detective',394170,2.0327,6.875,'OrPO1dwKVgk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42258,_binary '\0','/auA1OaJKbim8E7ACnMYmvHz5wNB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5644740',6.8,2776,'ko','더 킹','A young Korean man surpasses his difficult childhood by becoming a powerful prosecutor, but soon learns that real power comes at a price.','/97UeWeCYcK9gkiZLPNJIj0JDRFi.jpg','2017-01-18',134,'Released','Only One Will Become.','The King',434724,3.1255,7.3,'6BlXO5xDbyk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42259,_binary '\0','/hzRgIS5CyCwtNcuuHQsdpWNoClz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5646136',4.8,8167,'en','Hillary\'s America: The Secret History of the Democratic Party','Bestselling author and influential filmmaker Dinesh D’Souza reveals the sordid truth about Hillary Clinton and the secret history of the Democratic Party. This important and controversial film releases at a critical time leading up to the 2016 Presidential campaign and challenges the state of American politics.','/wtoAwIm5mZb2MDPBfeOxhjRSXq9.jpg','2016-07-15',107,'Released','See the movie that changed the election.','Hillary\'s America: The Secret History of the Democratic Party',391995,1.661,5.4,'Bxn5I6tnU_Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42260,_binary '\0','/dIMkisSN68boD8p9k052SN3n0iq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5648036',4.5,4388,'en','S.M.A.R.T. Chase','A washed-up private security agent has to escort a valuable Chinese antique out of Shanghai but is ambushed en route.','/rw5qHjaMTwER15MfwUG13WXQ0Cy.jpg','2017-09-30',95,'Released','Get in. Get out. Get even.','S.M.A.R.T. Chase',473920,4.1354,4.8,'oX24J_cQIt0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42261,_binary '\0','/aOI3o06xhCgLmA6Bcpm4KRDeMXF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5648882',7.1,43760,'en','The Burial','When a handshake deal goes sour, funeral home owner Jeremiah O\'Keefe enlists charismatic, smooth-talking attorney Willie E. Gary to save his family business. Tempers flare and laughter ensues as the unlikely pair bond while exposing corporate corruption and racial injustice.','/9ssNSfNKpzZwhbFsnW3wa82m2sG.jpg','2023-10-06',126,'Released','Never settle.','The Burial',763165,8.6683,7.084,'ZOhIdaufd3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42262,_binary '\0','/99Rd26ceIhonpOP5JoqcXYqnkD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5649108',6.6,49898,'en','Thoroughbreds','Lily and Amanda, two high school students living in suburban Connecticut, rekindle their unlikely friendship after years of drifting apart. Together, they devise a plan to kill Lily\'s abusive stepfather by hiring a lowlife drug dealer.','/dBhskn3zQZu1DKy1ZjjmJRxJUxm.jpg','2018-03-09',92,'Released','Good breeding gone bad','Thoroughbreds',397722,3.7533,6.4,'TPcV_3D3V2A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42263,_binary '\0','/GOwNU7Z9G3ORjNxdZnURfuIGS6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5649144',7.6,149445,'en','The Florida Project','The story of a precocious six year-old and her ragtag group of friends whose summer break is filled with childhood wonder, possibility and a sense of adventure while the adults around them struggle with hard times.','/5QnDxdJg1fi6uMSkSi4x8tHsltm.jpg','2017-10-06',112,'Released','Find your kingdom.','The Florida Project',394117,10.4079,7.426,'WwQ-NH1rRT4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42264,_binary '\0','/cb2Qv6c5eFEhOwGjzOGO0OUf9pW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5651050',7.9,3756,'en','Bright Lights: Starring Carrie Fisher and Debbie Reynolds','An intimate portrait of Hollywood royalty featuring Debbie Reynolds, Todd Fisher, and Carrie Fisher.','/l81ArRwCIyXM0cDtCcprOGrfnaR.jpg','2016-10-10',95,'Released','A different kind of Hollywood love story.','Bright Lights: Starring Carrie Fisher and Debbie Reynolds',398738,1.9918,7.4,'K97Rthh-qmk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42265,_binary '\0','/w95Xy9YByHqPip7RYFABGwspdvG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5651338',5.7,2029,'de','Jugend ohne Gott','German students compete to enter one of the country\'s elite schools.','/fm0d9TOAglrzpkcx5NpjDOO9vqf.jpg','2017-08-31',114,'Released',NULL,'Godless Youth',418098,2.0679,6.054,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42266,_binary '\0','/61QNJEtapy1rjprgMRvuHYlL8L9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5652768',6.5,1370,'en','Across the River and into the Trees','In post WW2 Venice Italy, American Army Col. Richard Cantwell, haunted by the war, faces news of his illness with stoic disregard. Determined to spend a weekend in quiet solitude, he commandeers a military driver to visit his old haunts in Venice. As Cantwell\'s plans begin to unravel, a chance encounter with a remarkable young woman begins to rekindle hope. Based on the harrowing novel by Ernest Hemingway.','/ya9Xbrh8rN8EDeFBiI1tEjGY05o.jpg','2023-10-11',106,'Released',NULL,'Across the River and into the Trees',763147,2.6629,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42267,_binary '\0','/MrnSQzIwftHPAXJa9DrkebfnXu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5653294',6.6,6670,'ru','Экипаж','A story about bravery, self-sacrifice and human dignity put on trial by the merciless power of nature. A young pilot is fired from military air force after disobeying an absurd order. He gets a job as a co-pilot with a civil airline. Being brutally honest and direct, he is not on best terms with his new colleagues. During a flight to Asia his crew receives a distress message from a volcanic island and makes a decision to attempt a rescue mission. Will it be a success? Will they survive the disaster? They have a single chance to find that out: by being a team and sticking up for one another.','/nL1WhzLiD2nZ7ixQcp5K0z4eEB7.jpg','2016-04-21',138,'Released','A mid air rescue mission','Flight Crew',380111,3.2377,6.893,'vTzlfO_zKsQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42268,_binary '\0','/cayWJjzy4YlSvZcSkGnkLfCuEJ7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5653444',6,2777,'en','The Swap','Based on the book by Megan Shull, The Swap follows the adventures of a rhythmic gymnast named Ellie with a make-it-or-break-it competition, and the younger brother named Jack in a hockey family who\'s vying for a varsity spot on his school team. But when a simple text causes the two to swap bodies, their paths take an unexpected cross.','/4GvjFcWaSnVrbHjFof1Sy8tZK1r.jpg','2016-10-07',89,'Released',NULL,'The Swap',417028,3.0264,6.7,'HTSf-4rDFFo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42269,_binary '\0','/yTkPVSqQg4icpkzfO1o4uwkJxj3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5653514',6.5,9169,'en','Bad Day for the Cut','A middle-aged Irish farmer, who still lives at home with his mother, sets off on a mission of revenge when the old lady is murdered.','/53Jh8cMCfDOI87XnPBCIiTCwN6U.jpg','2017-10-20',99,'Released','Revenge is in the blood.','Bad Day for the Cut',430043,2.1984,6.4,'rqAmglk317k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42270,_binary '\0','/lpxMzlCGGtFbfxlbcoWH43UhIu8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5654600',6.4,1297,'en','Saturday Church','Ulysses is a shy and effeminate boy who finds himself coping with new responsibilities as man of the house after the death of his father. Living alongside his mother, younger brother, and conservative aunt, Ulysses is also struggling with questions about his gender identity. He finds an escape by creating a world of fantasy filled with dance and music. Ulysses\' journey takes a turn for the better when he finds a vibrant transgender community.','/kKRNAOOyRMIcO8ZMLg74YeaeyTB.jpg','2018-11-14',82,'Released',NULL,'Saturday Church',450608,1.512,6.2,'IAra4mxDRYs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42271,_binary '\0','/qLZybHJpIiYNy7odDCSGR7LyRP2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5655222',6.5,11009,'en','The Hero','Lee, a former Western film icon, is living a comfortable existence lending his golden voice to advertisements and smoking weed. After receiving a lifetime achievement award and unexpected news, Lee reexamines his past, while a chance meeting with a sardonic comic has him looking to the future.','/9eJ6zEluTW0Z2ODG9Z5vJNY3RZg.jpg','2017-06-09',97,'Released',NULL,'The Hero',425751,4.0249,