ommunity.','/eQxYOTzNaSdWp5mdrgoELlLggbd.jpg','2017-06-16',93,'Released',NULL,'Humor Me',460216,1.7806,5.7,'rHFpydQdqv0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42279,_binary '\0','/q03podtLGEWYoydzYwpn99mFsYw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5658296',5.3,3086,'fa','نهنگ عنبر: سلکشن رویا','Arjang, A 50-year old man, has loved Roya from his childhood years but he has failed to marry her due to some reasons. Roya migrates to the united states with her family due to some social restrictions of 1980s. Arjang who has never forgotten Roya, meets her different times later but each time he fails to marry her again. He has 50 now and is a wealthy man, so he insists Roya to stay in Iran and marry him.','/6c0xYHAzgrncLqpdcNd53vuIuCv.jpg','2017-10-06',82,'Released',NULL,'Sperm Whale: Roya\'s Selection',457786,0.737,3.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42280,_binary '\0','/rZwmA9WtrntPnaR8urEPIYoI8Hy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5662550',3.2,1570,'en','Dead Trigger','2021 - 5 years after the outbreak of a mysterious virus that turned humans into bloodthirsty, undead beasts much of the world’s population has been decimated. When governments were unable to keep the disease at bay, the Contagion Special Unit was formed with the toughest soldiers and best specialists to fight the infected. Because of the rapidly decreasing number of soldiers, a popular online video game Dead Trigger that mirrors the terrifying events was created. The best efforts of the gamers are monitored by the CSU who recruit the highest rated zombie killers. The young recruits are called “Dead Triggers”. The movie follows a group of young recruits who must travel to the origin of the outbreak to find a missing team of scientists who were searching for a cure.','/uI2c30FyDEeBaa7Ka7tZYH344tC.jpg','2017-07-19',92,'Released','Based on the Hit First-Person Shooter Game','Dead Trigger',462115,2.8813,3.6,'69j-qeMX4Fo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42281,_binary 