zono Kaori through childhood friend Sawabe Tsubaki. Kaori plays the violin and has a free sprit. Since meeting her, Kousei is able to face the piano again. Meanwhile, Kaori holds a secret.','/bMMHlNZ5AhjixOhMHAoJCjqwplZ.jpg','2016-09-10',122,'Released','Experience the joy of love and the pain of loss.','Your Lie in April',401146,1.6377,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42296,_binary '\0','/3An5TOYitpGnZWU3GhLGVKI4vcA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5672286',7.3,2889,'en','Indian Horse','Follows the life of Native Canadian Saul Indian Horse as he survives residential school and life amongst the racism of the 1970s. A talented hockey player, Saul must find his own path as he battles stereotypes and alcoholism.','/6PRmK9svHolvZ2CLNoBkmViYlrB.jpg','2018-04-13',96,'Released','You have the gift. You have the vision.','Indian Horse',471616,2.4147,6.9,'02cyFlnvA4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42297,_binary '\0','/mIBG74mhGEJnBubhYLkCtvplcNr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5672290',6.5,72750,'en','The First Omen','When a young American woman is sent to Rome to begin a life of service to the church, she encounters a darkness that causes her to question her own faith and uncovers a terrifying conspiracy that hopes to bring about the birth of evil incarnate.','/tnsDyNNkOxYUyjD8CNJoAla6YvY.jpg','2024-04-03',119,'Released','Create something to fear.','The First Omen',437342,14.528,6.8,'6GMiIRitv5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42298,_binary '\0','/iBDtSgp2TsCTzVyYLWq9e2KMoen.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5672502',7,1340,'en','Garage Sale Mystery: The Novel Murders','When Jennifer makes a home delivery for a customer, she finds the recipient has been murdered. She soon realizes that the victim\'s cold-blooded demise is a re-enactment of a murder in a classic mystery novel.','/9SEBCZIriFD9sbCMEN7iNDMUN9B.jpg','2016-06-05',84,'Released',NULL,'Garage Sale Mystery: The Novel Murders',396390,2.4336,6.5,NULL,NUL