ach other.','/lRpXOyT9LRalrZTXliXyaPVwsqX.jpg','2016-06-11',84,'Released',NULL,'Stop the Wedding',396393,1.7593,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42329,_binary '\0','/eYVVhXpu2jhuxMWOrWDNuPGKvkW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5688868',5,4736,'en','Primal Rage','A newly reunited young couple\'s drive through the Pacific Northwest turns into a nightmare as they are forced to face nature, unsavory locals, and a monstrous creature, known to the Native Americans as Oh-Mah.','/8tGM0Vv4X60r6zHDGcpanIrDcdm.jpg','2018-07-31',106,'Released','The Legend of Oh-Mah','Primal Rage',436373,3.084,5.4,'Mv0a-7FY5g4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42330,_binary '\0','/x832ykgj3fx0Q0MFKEno77XM47e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5688932',6.9,95654,'en','Sorry to Bother You','In an alternate present-day version of Oakland, black telemarketer Cassius Green discovers a magical key to professional success – which propels him into a macabre universe.','/peTl1V04E9ppvhgvNmSX0r2ALqO.jpg','2018-07-06',112,'Released','Destiny is calling.','Sorry to Bother You',424781,7.6512,6.779,'XeISaoQDh2g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42331,_binary '\0','/rFVdcLMOXcDCBK4wrKj1cYWt2zL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5688996',6.3,20823,'en','Alex Strangelove','Alex Truelove is on a quest to lose his virginity, an event eagerly awaited by his patient girlfriend and cheered on with welcome advice by his rowdy friends. But Alex, a super gregarious dude, is oddly unmotivated. A magical house party throws Alex into the presence of Elliot, a hunky college guy, who pegs Alex as gay and flirts hard. Alex is taken aback but after a series of setbacks on the girlfriend front he takes the plunge and learns some interesting new facts about himself.','/6OemqmvthXswt5KFmtXBCMMloJ4.jpg','2018-04-16',99,'Released','Love can be confusing','Alex Strangelove',511785,2.9211,6.556,'V-1KhZiQs3U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42332,_binary '