er that will alter their lives forever.','/gXiE0WveDnT0n5J4sW9TMxXF4oT.jpg','2017-10-01',132,'Released','Is it better to speak or die?','Call Me by Your Name',398818,22.8492,8.08,'Z9AYPxH5NTM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42405,_binary '\0','/eGljNfNCrPhFYG2RXXmmE0OKu5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5727208',7.4,362015,'en','Uncut Gems','A charismatic New York City jeweler always on the lookout for the next big score makes a series of high-stakes bets that could lead to the windfall of a lifetime. Howard must perform a precarious high-wire act, balancing business, family, and encroaching adversaries on all sides in his relentless pursuit of the ultimate win.','/6XN1vxHc7kUSqNWtaQKN45J5x2v.jpg','2019-12-13',136,'Released','This is how I win.','Uncut Gems',473033,14.9756,7.173,'akKdBkmugEI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42406,_binary '\0','/led6mPvEAMsF5fpJUqiUy07ZPty.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5727282',6.9,36759,'sv','Borg vs McEnroe','The Swedish Björn Borg and the American John McEnroe, the best tennis players in the world, maintain a legendary duel during the 1980 Wimbledon tournament.','/vIQqjcrSnyCqLpqwScnvFY1bpkL.jpg','2017-09-08',108,'Released','Some stars shine forever','Borg vs McEnroe',397538,5.2448,6.897,'S1S4mWgbhIk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42407,_binary '\0','/rOo8r3NzUVL5Q9mIb6xbsdp5b3c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5728684',7.2,6504,'en','Sour Grapes','Controversy erupts when an unassuming young man floods the American wine market with fake vintages valued in the millions, bamboozling the wine world elite, in this humorous and suspenseful tale of an ingenious con on the eve of the 2008 stock market crash.','/8jLfS18TvzQ4IkpMXHIgWgS8kZW.jpg','2016-05-27',86,'Released','True Story - Fake Wine','Sour Grapes',396232,1.9488,7.3,'hPUYuwSRwB8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42408,_binary '\0','/axRYPjeLD4zjJNaIw4TPopbKVfs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.