 directors such as Ridley Scott, Tony Scott, Michael Bay, Ron Howard, Gore Verbinski and Christopher Nolan. His credits include some of the biggest blockbuster movies of all time along with acclaimed TV series such as The Crown and Planet Earth II. This concert was filmed on 7th May 2016 in Prague during Hans Zimmer’s hugely successful European concert tour. Hans was accompanied by a band, orchestra and choir, 72 musicians in total, including guitarist Johnny Marr. The staging was spectacular with a ground breaking light show, stunning visuals and a state of the art sound system. Hans Zimmer performs on multiple instruments and gives introductory insights to many of the pieces during the concert. This show is a treat for lovers of both great music and great movies.','/hHs54DFWuXJqh1XmYZVDsiiVHS8.jpg','2017-10-01',139,'Released',NULL,'Hans Zimmer: Live in Prague',435011,3.1302,8.577,'7reir6nGoD4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42412,_binary '\0','/w0VLu0oMIl8I1MsvBGly7VojzHm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5733210',8.3,2061,'fr','Terra','A visually stunning documentary that reflects human\'s relationship to other species on Earth as humanity becomes more and more isolated from Nature.','/9ECabmYbogtN4im7JujKNIhUcdc.jpg','2015-12-01',97,'Released',NULL,'Terra',395985,1.6031,8.3,'5pMScorWcyU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42413,_binary '\0','/jVbhGPXQIKdWQ2IP28Y75OLH9NW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5734214',6.4,1681,'en','Summer in the City','When a small town woman with southern charm is given a big promotion managing a store in the Big Apple, she tries to adopt a big city personality and it leads to disastrous results.','/srAEQJakSy3o5NmB52lO6WFDBJG.jpg','2016-08-13',84,'Released',NULL,'Summer in the City',407335,2.2577,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42414,_binary '\0','/kkdymnbzSR5qUfpwKDZ5csitfv1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5734576',5.3,29818,'en','The Possession of Hannah Grace','When a cop who is just out of rehab takes the graveyard shift in a city hospital morgue, she faces a series of bizarre, violent events caused by an evil entity in one of the corpses.','/hDDb0H0uJp2wjoJBbBHbKlYRbug.jpg','2018-11-29',86,'Released','Death is only the beginning.','The Possession of Hannah Grace',434555,8.9538,5.65,'RHAgri92JP8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42415,_binary '\0','/9bA0JHOvaNVZHQdfgzXPdAEyBhe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5735280',5.5,6293,'en','It Stains the Sands Red','In the throes of a zombie apocalypse, a troubled woman from Las Vegas with a dark past finds herself stranded in the desert with a lone and ravenous zombie on her tail.','/rBCjDBa2Dau9WqEslCpdJni394M.jpg','2016-10-08',92,'Released','If the heat doesn\'t kill you, something else will','It Stains the Sands Red',434873,2.9415,5.6,'lD-J5DLPo4o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42416,_binary '\0','/dfGWqp8kbf9IGWFZQEKhnXAjWD4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5735464',6.6,2981,'ko','마스터','Korea’s biggest network marketing scam reveals a far greater network of corruption and conspiracy lurking underneath.','/onDrDG7BxvSIcmdWSdz3t92yPb.jpg','2016-12-21',143,'Released','Deception. Corruption. Conspiracy.','Master',382220,3.0045,6.928,'iF-E4FhjpR8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42417,_binary '\0','/k303bREblg3ySFCaXXXhrFbtceH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5735582',6,1391,'zh','樓下的房客','A loafer inherits an apartment block and lets out the place to a group of tenants, including a lusty gymnastics teacher, a geeky college student, a single father with his young daughter, a gay couple, a writer and a sexy female office worker. An incredible story is about to unfold as they start their lives in the same building.','/qsKUFtU4bvI0mPiutQcfrKLF6RS.jpg','2016-06-23',115,'Released',NULL,'The Tenants Downstairs',403032,2.3754,6.2,'bLIUgB1PNWQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42418,_binary '\0','/s9u0PIH