'Coin Heist',429238,2.5002,5.378,'xUyTRSlmXf4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42426,_binary '\0','/hZSl0328bmUKwawustiEHIwF9j4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5740852',5.9,3898,'en','All Creatures Here Below','The story of a desperate young couple on the run, who seek refuge in Kansas City.','/ms7bt666RakBF2a8zYiROFDlbrf.jpg','2019-05-17',91,'Released','You can run from the past but not from the truth','All Creatures Here Below',415085,2.2995,4.9,'0AqbsEzVfnk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42427,_binary '\0','/2i1p4MGPr5yaAhB1vY6ssQjhwPT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5740866',7.3,8382,'en','Whitney','Examines the life and career of singer Whitney Houston. Features never-before-seen archival footage, exclusive recordings, rare performances and interviews with the people who knew her best.','/j1c6dTycYBMZs2T1wKA6bknLLa6.jpg','2018-07-05',120,'Released','All the music. All the stories. All the answers.','Whitney',507256,3.3473,7.3,'CmYobfC00Eg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42428,_binary '\0','/n1DBSYDZqDnMq9i2EzBz4fIv8nN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5741304',5.4,1715,'km','Jailbreak','What started as a simple escort mission will soon turn to chaos as the prisoners of Koh Kla take over the prison grounds. A special task force gets trapped in the prison will have to fight their way out for survival, to protect a key witness.','/tlNucd0Yi7cIN6DFsa2SoJw5cMm.jpg','2017-01-31',100,'Released','If You Give Up, You Die','Jailbreak',433623,2.6488,5.7,'vtADEKSAvvY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42429,_binary '\0','/oofnBJDCWyQfySaabpsWVo1PN5l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5741902',7.4,1254,'ja','続・深夜食堂','The Master\'s late-night diner welcomes a woman troubled by funeral fans, an elderly scam victim, and a noodle delivery man struggling with love.','/rmyM5UYm79JPNeNXCh8tz3B0eSo.jpg','2016-11-05',108,'Released',NULL,'Midnight Diner 2',429285,2.3148,7.513,'8dmZhlHupOI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42430,_binary '\0','/g2yZ1kiGwLO5AUSmtsEJeFEWghJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5742374',6.7,136503,'en','You Were Never Really Here','A traumatized veteran, unafraid of violence, tracks down missing girls for a living. When a job spins out of control, Joe\'s nightmares overtake him as a conspiracy is uncovered—leading to what may be his death trip or his awakening.','/nx4lUyQNEzJowcF55VAP0TQEaX0.jpg','2017-11-08',89,'Released',NULL,'You Were Never Really Here',398181,7.7067,6.5,'R8oYYg75Qvg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42431,_binary '\0','/yvcsAYA91dshyQvtHSEFcSxnMWl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5742568',3.5,1440,'en','Day of Reckoning','Some years ago, the world experienced a \"day of reckoning\" when creatures came up from below and purged humanity of evil. Now, it is happening again.','/lQOrFfaFTtSSmOtDCSM2EzHguOq.jpg','2017-05-18',85,'Released','Hell will rise','Day of Reckoning',418588,3.1428,5,'YKSk25Usc3w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42432,_binary '\0','/vzGTvnuugQdNbLvC2QDsDc81oBP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5742874',5,2466,'hi','सर्कार ३','Subhash Nagre or Sarkar, the patriarch of the most powerful family of Maharashtra, continues to hold centre-stage because of his immense clout with the masses. In this outing, the Godfather is joined by his grandson Shivaji Nagre who loves and hates his grandfather with equal intensity. Will Shivaji betray Subhash? Or will he become a prey to his grandfather’s machinations?','/bZEEsWvuznU5ZdHd6LUCvOpdNJB.jpg','2017-05-11',132,'Released','Angrier Than Ever','Sarkar 3',441868,1.3034,5.15,'B27zvZRfeSo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42433,_binary '\0','/p9ZJgAHQV41TeiheUwH9AUH5C7L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5743656',6.8,3541,'hi','फोबिया','A talented artist tries to curb her phobia of being in public places, only to be convinced that a malevolent spirit is haunting her.','/uZVIKQR2Oubdw2CobFQRHMNkAp6.jpg','2016-05-27',112,'Released','When Your Biggest Enemy Is You.','Phobia',399068,1.2692,6.868,'fBP6rYLfgFE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42434,_binary '\0','/sTKHWjGk5WIRY4AoXAbqAuNppQM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5745450',5.7,2874,'hi','Chef','Roshan Kalra is a three-star Michelin chef who gets fired from New York\'s Gulli restaurant after he punches a customer. Forced to take a break, he flies to Kochi to spend time with his son, Armaan and his estranged wife Radha Menon. It\'s a fruitful trip because he manages to mend broken family ties. In a bid to help him get his mojo back, his wife suggests he put up his own food truck and begin afresh.','/6GHPvxiy0Y7hnumdNubwsGqHTc1.jpg','2017-10-06',133,'Released',NULL,'Chef',471972,1.916,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42435,_binary '\0','/uvBBSnnwC9ehl6HKwBuJfeLKqgJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5746054',5.5,1479,'de','Die sagenhaften Vier','Four crazy antiheroes on the run. Their leader is the unworldly innocent, naive Marnie, a house cat who is not allowed to leave the house and only knows about real life from television','/lU2Cx5lbSNMxgeKQPDOhAUdw91y.jpg','2019-04-11',84,'Released','One gang of runaways. One secret mission. One pawsome adventure!','Spy Cat',509733,4.2083,6.8,'NjOPH7W8XnI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42436,_binary '\0','/5kMK0pdQpX4xsEoO5OushLBW3WE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5748380',6.2,3286,'tr','Sen Benim Her Şeyimsin','When an old fling shows up with their infant child, a dallying man-child must take on the role of father and create a fairytale world for his daughter.','/7HmbURFQoXfVYLHaGrUDKM1t6EK.jpg','2016-12-09',107,'Released',NULL,'You\'re Everything To Me',445650,1.6333,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42437,_binary '\0','/hOcuJc5tOCf6WHnw7Lcvd38Mzmn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5748392',4.3,4645,'en','Escape Room','Four friends who partake in a popular Los Angeles escape room find themselves stuck with a demonically possessed killer. They have less than an hour to solve the puzzles needed to escape the room alive.','/dCthgwsV0AXIMqliQL6njAWf7Sb.jpg','2017-08-31',86,'Released','Let the game begin...','Escape Room',431259,3.1485,4.8,'WuehyuS56g8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42438,_binary '\0','/jIkH6cy0Haa1cyitn6gtKmE3lxu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5748448',6.2,46825,'en','Copshop','On the run from a lethal assassin, a wily con artist devises a scheme to hide out inside a small-town police station. However, when the hit man turns up at the precinct, an unsuspecting rookie cop finds herself caught in the crosshairs.','/9LEWWWEhS7SZXFDuH1YYhs0VFct.jpg','2021-09-09',108,'Released','Someone\'s gotta take the hit.','Copshop',738652,5.5389,6.279,'uFlyLJbzCt4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42439,_binary '\0','/rNvNAqOPNwPCK315aZda1XNk75d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5748648',4.9,1491,'el','The Bachelor','A mistake made by the bride rejoins 4 old friends of disaster and a father in law! 5 guys go to Thassaloniki to tear everything down. A father in law gets in a hearse in order to kill a love in the making. An ex-girlfriend dances tango with her memories as a partner. A cancelled wedding and a relationship that starts with the brides vail floating at the wind of independence.','/4N28Bt0hccf2fZiCIJVqsAfRqSE.jpg','2016-12-01',110,'Released',NULL,'The Bachelor',400753,1.3187,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42440,_binary '\0','/q6GsGCc0Ncymil1WiTrhsScRKdG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5749596',6.2,3267,'fr','Le Livre d\'image','In Le Livre d’Image, Jean-Luc Godard recycles existing images (films, documentaries, paintings, television archives, etc.), quotes excerpts from books, uses fragments of music. The driving force is poetic rhyme, the association or opposition of ideas, the aesthetic spark through editing, the keystone. The author performs the work of a sculptor. The hand, for this, is essential. He praises it at the start. “There are the five fingers. The five senses. The five parts of the world (…). The true condition of man is to think with his hands. Jean-Luc Godard composes a dazzling syncopation of sequences, the surge of which evokes the violence of the flows of our contemporary screens, taken to a level of incandescence rarely achieved. Crowned at Cannes, the last Godard is a shock film, with twilight beauty.','/5y1mTTYPVvaPeKIVqy3DymE6osv.jpg','2018-10-11',88,'Released','Nothing but silence. Nothing but a revolutionary song.','The Image Book',414030,3.1992,6.285,'CTY-m5uc7T8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42441,_binary '\0','/hqwHXhVD3zkbRur62eMLVWr3Tvm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5751998',6.6,13413,'en','Small Town Crime','Mike Kendall, a disgraced ex-cop, is fighting a losing battle with the bottle. When he finds a woman left for dead at the side of a road, Kendall turns private eye to track down her killers, taking one last shot at redemption.','/scaazdj3prZ5H9YyKYqPM47GulO.jpg','2018-01-19',91,'Released','Doing the right thing the wrong way.','Small Town Crime',412000,2.8049,6.4,'c63I7rjWcYw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42442,_binary '\0','/w7kxkSSQy3sZWDC4K8y0m2GYZ2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5752192',5.4,12925,'fr','Méandre','After getting a car ride from an unknown man, Lisa wakes up in a tube. On her arm is strapped a bracelet with a countdown. She quickly understands that every 8 minutes, fire burns an occupied section. She has no choice but to crawl into safe sections to survive. To know why she’s there and how to get out, Lisa will have to face the memories of her dead daughter…','/gDNHgbbDgLcl67Q0Ges9R3qvwUU.jpg','2021-07-01',91,'Released','You have just woken up stuck in a pipe full of deadly traps. How far will you go?','Meander',523936,3.8701,5.836,'0nMJabVFEIw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42443,_binary '\0','/bOnfMsSm5cgvI23IVJSXR4t6UzU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5752346',7.2,3024,'en','Belushi','Using previously unheard audiotapes recorded shortly after John Belushi’s death, director R.J. Cutler’s documentary feature examines the too-short life of the once-in-a-generation talent who captured the hearts and funny bones of devoted audiences.','/85yNzqsGBdqRclEZEW0BKRAcrR8.jpg','2020-05-16',108,'Released','Everyone loved him. Few knew him.','Belushi',661845,2.0638,7,'ZMoI-e1dqrM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42444,_binary '\0','/yx4o9fL7taFvPnQjdqgGfOp2Uc0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5752360',5.8,3767,'en','The Female Brain','The neurological inner workings of romantic relationships between men and women are studied for science.','/3YZrbhNQdZFE2yueFFw1QJ84YvF.jpg','2017-06-17',98,'Released','Think again.','The Female Brain',406668,2.8302,5.5,'YTDz_dKAdns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42445,_binary '\0','/fnoO8tuavPQlKqsuL8cbm7rOprd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5752606',5.9,3754,'en','Maze','Inspired by the true events of the infamous 1983 prison breakout of 38 IRA prisoners from HMP Maze, which was to become the biggest prison escape in Europe since World War II.','/bWEF3a1qErRIjmLW0xU28zAgV9D.jpg','2017-09-22',93,'Released',NULL,'Maze',464566,2.2622,5.812,'bHzfPqwA9x8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42446,_binary '\0','/gIEDbu6Gd1xI7er0UGNNiGZGrzA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5753212',5.5,1264,'tr','Üç Harfliler 3: Karabüyü','After losing his parents, he gives this house to the rent to avoid staying in the house of the Alev family, who is living a great destruction. But there is a lot that he does not know about the new couple who rents the house. And these mysteries will turn the Alev into a very difficult situation.','/7emt2viUwRFqYmINPoYv2n0ryUu.jpg','2016-07-01',87,'Released','Watch the blackbird','Three Letters 3: Black Magic',438739,1.4821,4.208,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42447,_binary '\0','/gaPrwXYiUfp6kLjtOHaQc18tudW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5753552',6.4,2329,'it','Moglie e marito','Married for ten years, in full crisis, thinking about divorce. But following a failed scientific experiment, they suddenly find one inside the body of the other.','/4DOI8zRChA2x7tBQowLfintVQ9s.jpg','2017-04-13',105,'Released',NULL,'Husband & Wife',445793,3.0362,6.6,'1org4MBIaJY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42448,_binary '\0','/auXrHU6O17n9Tz11SHReoorjrU6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5755238',7,47295,'en','Leo','Jaded 74-year-old reptile Leo has been stuck in the same Florida classroom for decades with his terrarium-mate turtle. When he learns he only has one year left to live, he plans to escape to experience life on the outside but instead gets caught up in the problems of his anxious students — including an impossibly mean substitute teacher.','/gSOVog7ydsaF1YpgAqBqnKYFGY.jpg','2023-11-17',102,'Released','Breaking out this November.','Leo',1075794,7.7867,7.3,'G_AEL-Xo5l8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42449,_binary '\0','/1up1c3fkoY9u0gktHse5Ej1LL9R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5755594',3.7,1515,'fa','سلام بمبئی','Ali is an Iranian exchange student from Iran who is studying medicine as a cardio resident in Mumbai. By chance, he saves the life of one of his classmates Karishma, who has attempted suicide. Little by little he tries to talk to Karishma and give her hope and happiness, which eventually leads to the two of them falling in love.','/nxaA1BPpeq1suaoTuuCRycAi5OC.jpg','2016-08-09',120,'Released','Hello Mumbai','Salaam Mumbai',456251,1.6696,3,'fhCd0bbVc5o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42450,_binary '\0','/koioVt57lwya0AuFsc5I1vxxCHB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5755606',5,1305,'hi','Banjo','A musical drama film directed by Ravi Jadhav, starring Riteish Deshmukh and Nargis Fakhri in the lead roles.','/sWJLsCVU7MckdprbbQi8g02wRYr.jpg','2016-09-23',140,'Released',NULL,'Banjo',403517,1.9848,4.5,'29m2livchlI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42451,_binary '\0','/iiI3LFrXNpYbqDYQ69RLB4TUkZR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5758404',7.1,1270,'en','Step','The senior year of a girls’ high school step team in inner-city Baltimore is documented, as they try to become the first in their families to attend college. The girls strive to make their dancing a success against the backdrop of social unrest in their troubled city.','/427ZSBDRQ3nTst3ljrEKfQP6mx9.jpg','2017-07-28',83,'Released',NULL,'Step',433010,1.8499,7.5,'uVN4aVYA2eA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42452,_binary '\0','/dUlDQIfsFiAqrBafVmlLCY9mN6S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5758726',5.8,1920,'en','Mega Time Squad','A small-town criminal finds an ancient Chinese time-travel device that can help him pull off a heist and start a new life-but he may not survive the consequences of tampering with time. The Castle meets Looper, Mega Time Squad is a study in high-meets-low, combining elements of the sci-fi, the crime thriller and the comedy to make a comedy heist film with a time-traveling twist.','/thHCbZVdA4DL0R8f84aUz83FSgg.jpg','2018-07-20',86,'Released',NULL,'Mega Time Squad',521936,1.6764,6.2,'b82efYkuMKw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42453,_binary '\0','/oMKFQmoVgB69fyXfSMu0lGlHJP2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5758778',5.8,147264,'en','Skyscraper','Framed and on the run, a former FBI agent must save his family from a blazing fire in the world\'s tallest building.','/52ml62vClzrlqvXZq2FEW6UF6c1.jpg','2018-07-11',102,'Released','Don\'t look down','Skyscraper',447200,11.9635,6.3,'_pIEzZVqwFs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42454,_binary '\0','/fplNpVBpftnL1VlEA3bXxudF2Zn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5758802',4.6,2788,'en','Literally, Right Before Aaron','Still reeling from his breakup with college sweetheart Allison, Adam\'s world is thrown into further chaos when he’s surprisingly invited to attend her upcoming wedding. Returning home for the festivities, Adam must confront unresolved feelings while trying to convince himself and everyone else that he is truly happy for her.','/4fdjQ5lFbkSWlAUv7px6KSEOdxP.jpg','2017-04-22',97,'Released','Her wedding. His funeral.','Literally, Right Before Aaron',450477,3.3632,4.8,'5zxz7JqyPyY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42455,_binary '\0','/430DV9AgQ4mV8WjahXDvMKEfOHJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5759434',6.3,2078,'zh','烽火芳菲','It’s 1941 and the Japanese attack on Pearl Harbor has destroyed America’s morale. The US President Franklin D. Roosevelt then decides to risk it all by bombing Tokyo and raise more hope for his citizens. After completing its mission, a unit of the US Air Force is forced to make an emergency landing in China. Its commander Jack Turner (Emilie Hirsch) barely survives but gets rescued by Ying (Crystal Liu), a local widow who will stop at nothing to hide him from the Japanese occupant.','/ztcaeAzK3VkllaWB0VEQdcSD7BO.jpg','2017-11-10',97,'Released',NULL,'The Chinese Widow',528210,3.06,7.23,'3KLzs8mB7FM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42456,_binary '\0','/6jtAnToTQAfQmwh6K6JiiqB0qoy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5759590',2.8,2537,'en','Angels Fallen','After the tragic loss of his wife battling the forces of darkness, Gabriel is persuaded to rejoin his former team of demon hunters traveling from relatively obscurity in America to the deep unknown regions of Europe. He is joined by his estranged best friend Michael who harbors a dark secret, the mystical Hannah whose visions predict the future, and a motley crew of demon slayers. After losing part of his team Gabriel must confront his tragic past and decide who really is friend or foe.','/9mVHxdtlmTZUpgps2cvPqVeJEtb.jpg','2020-01-14',86,'Released','Four angels will come to destroy mankind.','Angels Fallen',662844,2.5086,5.7,'lUh5UOJyCfw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42457,_binary '\0','/c6Splshb8lb2Q9OvUfhpqXl7uP0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5761544',6.1,47591,'en','Kandahar','After his mission is exposed, an undercover CIA operative stuck deep in hostile territory in Afghanistan must fight his way out, alongside his Afghan translator, to an extraction point in Kandahar, all whilst avoiding elite enemy forces and foreign spies tasked with hunting them down.','/lCanGgsqF4xD2WA5NF8PWeT3IXd.jpg','2023-05-25',119,'Released','The only thing more dangerous than the mission is the escape.','Kandahar',717930,7.4062,6.8,'IBh9c2WFFz0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42458,_binary '\0','/z1josz5xhHCI7Pt0Eg5Kc1e7GBn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5761986',3.6,1327,'en','Hunter\'s Moon','A trio of young sisters are attacked by local thugs. Then a force inhabiting the orchard exacts its revenge.','/pgsqkck2iPtyTSeZ6JVs5EMEaCK.jpg','2020-03-24',81,'Released','Something lurks within','Hunter\'s Moon',458673,2.716,3.7,'hAfVAuR3GLs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42459,_binary '\0','/yYRlnouG1Nue6Yv3S6ftiShRNma.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5764024',5.4,5910,'hi','ओके जानू','Adi and Tara move to Bombay to pursue their dreams. A chance meeting sparks off a heady, no strings attached romance until their careers pull them apart. Will ambition prevail over matters of the heart?','/3kpdqZHsD35Lc5l9TnjwO36jWgo.jpg','2017-01-12',135,'Released',NULL,'Ok Jaanu',413882,2.0589,5.788,'HLdbAdya2po','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42460,_binary '\0','/aSjOJMrQYz3EC5e7JzfGxy2Yhuh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5764096',7.9,36566,'hi','हिंदी मीडियम','Mita and Raj Batra, an affluent couple from Delhi’s Chandni Chowk, are grappling with getting their daughter admission into an English medium school. But there is one big problem. Their zubaan is Hindi, and the elitist snobs won’t let the Hindi speaking hoi-polloi fit in.','/2v0nQd3kYBV0iPNCVHiaLWGb1hg.jpg','2017-05-19',132,'Released',NULL,'Hindi Medium',456570,1.9377,7.4,'GjkFr48jk68','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42461,_binary '\0','/7rgwd3OruyWyKpBxMJiKzKq88mm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5765192',6.4,1468,'it','La tenerezza','Back from the hospital where he has been treated after a heart attack, Lorenzo is on his way upstairs to his top-floor apartment in Naples when he meets Michela. The charming young woman, who has just moved to the facing apartment, has forgotten her keys and finds herself locked out. Cynical and grumpy, the retired lawyer who has been living estranged from the rest of the world, should normally leave her to her fate but he mellows under her spontaneous charm. He helps her, becomes friends not only with her but with her husband Fabio and their two children. For once, the self-declared misanthropist seems to be experiencing the long forgotten feeling of empathy.','/7PMIXj8jHgeNKulzsJIo2HnvHi9.jpg','2017-04-24',103,'Released',NULL,'Tenderness',439552,1.6684,6.346,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42462,_binary '\0','/hINq9R7bPiGpLOXRA4pl6toh5f3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5767628',4.3,3961,'en','Kill \'em All','After a massive shootout, a mysterious stranger arrives at a local hospital on the brink of death. Then, a foreign gang brazenly comes to the hospital to hunt him down. His nurse, the sole surviving witness to the follow-up shootout, must face an FBI interrogation that unlocks a plot of international intrigue and revenge.','/cWkZQqS2IxMcvH7UZSHFR8YYRfk.jpg','2017-06-06',96,'Released','When you don\'t know who to trust...','Kill \'em All',449503,7.0278,5.7,'sCVIclirqo0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42463,_binary '\0','/4hhRgTjAkQaB6xcOCJ5lSz8EeOR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5768474',6.8,1937,'ko','비밀은 없다','For 15 days, a politician and his wife navigate a scandal after their daughter goes missing on the eve of the national elections.','/jFGVWTS5mvHqW3Wp2nqs2ov1mVG.jpg','2016-06-23',102,'Released','D-15 to election, daughter has vanished.','The Truth Beneath',401133,2.2755,6.825,'XD4qSnyhGrA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42464,_binary '\0','/5dbRgLb4IBEQArCxBp7Dw7sYsOC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5768992',3.2,2533,'en','The Academy of Magic','Aura is gifted with magical abilities; she and her friends have many exciting adventures at the academy, but soon Aura learns that the school hatches many dark secrets that she must uncover. Will she be able to unveil the truth?','/pDM55o8QVZLCKQ9WGejXrdeOJzJ.jpg','2020-07-16',89,'Released',NULL,'The Academy of Magic',708352,2.5919,7.1,'_1GaYympn1M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42465,_binary '\0','/ttwAIECTmwr2p0JnwFyNiDtk3Ks.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5769414',6.6,2564,'ja','忍びの国','Raised suckling poison arrows among the sparring Iga ninja factions, Mumon is a carefree 16th-century mercenary. When the ninja council makes a power play to defeat the young Nobukatsu Oda struggling to step into his father’s warlord shoes as they expand rule across the country, Mumon jumps into the fray to satisfy his new bride Okuni’s demand that he make good on his promises of wealth. Yet Mumon soon finds what is worth fighting for beyond money or nation.','/AaLPEGw6IxGO5phpE8a4ZKGHC9H.jpg','2017-07-01',125,'Released',NULL,'Mumon: The Land of Stealth',461211,1.9059,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42466,_binary '\0','/qQ4Ortz3emo41XDA4lxkY0XoCdD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5770430',5.2,2903,'es','Ozzy','Ozzy, a friendly, peaceful beagle has his idyllic life turned upside down when the Martins leave on a long and distant trip. There\'s only one problem: no dogs allowed! Unable to bring their beloved Ozzy along for the ride, they settle on the next best thing, a top-of-the-line canine spa called Blue Creek.','/sfg5cNvZNo6wjHAxkKwt6nqI2gp.jpg','2016-10-14',90,'Released','Fast & Furry','Ozzy',411221,3.4932,6.1,'ay5sm4rNfp8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42467,_binary '\0','/3PezXrFmOQhGkDcsmRj9nlwKgFn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5770620',6.1,4510,'en','The Lovers','The separation of a long married couple goes awry when they fall for each other again.','/tRWza39fHyef12FvScIBduaHMi6.jpg','2017-05-05',94,'Released','A love so strong it can survive marriage.','The Lovers',426253,2.591,5.374,'nk-T71VhP8I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42468,_binary '\0','/emOo9AFT4aJoDcye7RrQcnOzoen.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5770864',5.2,11880,'en','The Man from Earth: Holocene','14,000-year-old \"Man from Earth\" John Oldman, now teaching in northern California, realizes that not only is he finally starting to age, but four students have discovered his deepest secret, putting his life in grave danger and potentially destroying the world\'s most popular religion.','/krOWstmTUdfafRbXH9YAjVj2zE5.jpg','2017-10-13',98,'Released','One must pay dearly for immortality','The Man from Earth: Holocene',415312,4.5018,5.5,'lLfAW8KO6NE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42469,_binary '\0','/2IUkdZM6IZfHM70SrLtUSvemtlo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5771640',7.1,1748,'fr','Noces','Zahira, 18, is close to her family until her parents ask her to follow Pakistani tradition to choose a husband. Torn between family customs and her western lifestyle, the young woman turns for help to her brother and confidant Amir.','/cATTGdEjhcSWRRsqoIc6VQZYzas.jpg','2017-02-22',95,'Released',NULL,'A Wedding',413837,1.2147,6.6,'_6Vq62Y1DPQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42470,_binary '\0','/fyOUFrJbKm271A4meFqzX3mg96G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5771710',5,1533,'fr','Rodin','Auguste Rodin (1840-1917), man of the people, autodidact and revolutionary sculptor - the most brilliant of his era. At 42, Rodin meets Camille Claudel, a young woman desperate to become his assistant. He quickly acknowledges her as his most able pupil, and treats her as an equal in matters of creation.','/3bQGnpTM2uluIMC1wfZWW5ldunp.jpg','2017-08-31',119,'Released',NULL,'Rodin',445768,2.5785,4.7,'FbIE8VKqVGE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42471,_binary '\0','/eVRKfeVWydnruVLxgaW2ilPKNOf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5773402',8.9,5283,'en','Dominion','Exposing the dark underbelly of modern animal agriculture through drones, hidden & handheld cameras, the feature-length film explores the morality and validity of our dominion over the animal kingdom.','/mzqwEuYSPQ7Kj6ovg016KclS0Sw.jpg','2018-03-29',120,'Released',NULL,'Dominion',472796,1.8302,8.47,'LpDJlEQsDoA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42472,_binary '\0','/xvMp9yz2iodFMCGuzG0f8HoqvEY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5773986',7,3932,'en','Studio 54','Studio 54 was the epicenter of 70s hedonism - a place that not only redefined the nightclub, but also came to symbolize an entire era. Its co-owners, Ian Schrager and Steve Rubell, two friends from Brooklyn, seemed to come out of nowhere to suddenly preside over a new kind of New York society. Now, 39 years after the velvet rope was first slung across the club\'s hallowed threshold, a feature documentary tells the real story behind the greatest club of all time.','/x10hLXIQVGJ5n0Nn2pLVTKBNxXK.jpg','2018-06-15',98,'Released','Nothing this fabulous could last forever','Studio 54',493101,2.6026,6.511,'N-tAZD7TpU4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42473,_binary '\0','/tya34K7D4jtDrVbvExyvTx97Aen.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5774060',5.9,110309,'en','Underwater','After an earthquake destroys their underwater station, six researchers must navigate two miles along the dangerous, unknown depths of the ocean floor to make it to safety in a race against time.','/gzlbb3yeVISpQ3REd3Ga1scWGTU.jpg','2020-01-08',95,'Released','7 miles below the ocean surface something has awakened','Underwater',443791,11.8597,6.301,'jCFWEzIVILc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42474,_binary '\0','/sjQepwkDKxle9sIhGuDX6A9MdcW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5774062',6.5,19441,'en','Spontaneous','When students in their high school begin inexplicably exploding (literally), seniors Mara and Dylan struggle to survive in a world where each moment may be their last.','/qhDICM8YxuDn9241O2UVEe9DupC.jpg','2020-10-02',102,'Released','An explosive love story.','Spontaneous',604578,4.8808,6.746,'0dt523AHZWY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42475,_binary '\0','/iEYDBciiuW68Q5bLCzkVBgKnfi7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5774450',6.7,52216,'en','Summer of 84','After suspecting that their police officer neighbor is a serial killer, a group of teenage friends spend their summer spying on him and gathering evidence, but as they get closer to discovering the truth, things get dangerous.','/zastd8zM2ftOJpC7Y6gRFqAB7r.jpg','2018-08-10',106,'Released','Every serial killer lives next door to someone','Summer of 84',470229,6.0457,6.9,'Lxj0mgS3fRg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42476,_binary '\0','/lJoFskQRXXHmDD3ktViGjuG0Tzw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5775220',4.1,1658,'hi','Noor','The jumbled up, crazy and happening life of journalist Noor takes a dramatic turn when she comes across a news breaking cover story','/guyCaip5KScqgtMQsDH9Ac3spmn.jpg','2017-04-21',116,'Released','One girl, many moods','Noor',411625,2.243,4.556,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42477,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5775536',6.2,1244,'hi','My Client\'s Wife','Manas Verma, a lawyer, is defending Raghuram Singh who is accused of assaulting his wife. However, Raghuram claims that he is being framed. To get to the bottom of the matter, Verma starts investigating the case further and finds that not everything is the way that it seems. Manas uncovers some shocking truths that might change the case.','/gKfEI5WizgJjL4faGGCS0pbgy4f.jpg','2020-07-31',107,'Released','Sometimes truth is stranger fiction','My Client\'s Wife',729081,1.3157,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42478,_binary '\0','/ijjRrrmQ4kVFkAqnpUNaWZ4h3yW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5776208',6.2,17845,'ja','バイオハザード ヴェンデッタ','When a fearless enemy out for revenge unleashes a brutal and deadly new virus, BSAA captain Chris Redfield enlists the help of Agent Leon S. Kennedy and Professor Rebecca Chambers to bring down the death merchant and save New York City.','/kdiMtgjWXEH9QZ85hgmWaSwshjf.jpg','2017-05-27',97,'Released','Kill evil or die trying.','Resident Evil: Vendetta',400136,15.9828,6.922,'B1PJGWC5ThY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42479,_binary '\0','/sJZd1H4cl2Nxhj0nutVCK5pMczL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5776858',7.4,164102,'en','Phantom Thread','In 1950s London, a renowned dressmaker\'s meticulous lifestyle begins drastically changing as his relationship with his young muse intensifies.','/hgoWjp9Sh0MI97eAMZCnIoVfgvq.jpg','2017-12-25',130,'Released',NULL,'Phantom Thread',400617,12.164,7.315,'xNsiQMeSvMk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42480,_binary '\0','/zMhfjTmdZblh37fyVHkwv6DuGGv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5777628',8.2,5824,'en','One More Time with Feeling','Andrew Dominik\'s One More Time With Feeling is a remarkable black and white documentary which chronicles the creation of Nick Cave & The Bad Seeds\' album Skeleton Tree. Originally a performance based concept, the film evolved into something much more significant as Dominik delved into the tragic backdrop of the writing and recording of the album. The result is stark, fragile and raw, and a true testament to an artist trying to find his way through the darkness. It documents the writing, recording and performing of Nick Cave & the Bad Seeds’ sixteenth studio album, Skeleton Tree.','/opORnjagpi1KKfGVNX2NuNECdzE.jpg','2016-09-02',113,'Released',NULL,'One More Time with Feeling',404141,2.35