amagiri and his family come under threat after a godman and his goons try to displace him from his centuries-old ancestral home as part of building an ashram. The “curse” that befalls Pattabhiraman in the face of opposition leaves him broken, till a mysterious ally lends him his support. Their fight against the evil forces forms the rest of the plot.','/zI54MejpifV0pzVcFYBGtGtrMUX.jpg','2017-07-07',168,'Released','When miracle meets man epics are Born','Tiyaan',450047,1.2076,5.306,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42485,_binary '\0','/kZwpxqIXPqNfRigrqF5rN8L54a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5783956',6.4,57635,'en','When We First Met','Using a magical photo booth that sends him back in time, Noah relives the night he met Avery over and over, trying to persuade her to fall for him.','/pscQKoikkSJxAu8O5LKtjgGJEt1.jpg','2018-02-08',97,'Released','All he needs is a second chance... to be her first choice.','When We First Met',433310,6.6763,6.6,'d2sJNee7FQ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42486,_binary '\0','/oLc0VizFElVFBVP6pW1Yh30U1qH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5784350',7.7,2727,'bn','প্রাক্তন','A married woman on journey from Mumbai to Howrah by train meets her ex-husband.','/lGWXLRG2Qqy3ejEA1NSKNdvbg8q.jpg','2016-05-27',142,'Released',NULL,'Praktan',420952,1.2119,6.275,'rMJPxLAjuXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42487,_binary '\0','/sij04reKwrZA7OStRA8akgdwidw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5785116',5.6,3152,'hi','बेगम जान','On the eve of Independence, the chairman of the Border Commission, Sir Cyril Radcliffe decides to divide India and Pakistan into equitable halves. What the administration doesn’t account for is the line running through the middle of Begum Jaan’s brothel situated plonk on the border; with one half falling in India and the other in Pakistan.','/spjYSwKazSQEkeMywBZIpnzilQp.jpg','2017-04-14',128,'Released','My Body. My House. My Country. My Rules.','Begum Jaan',413548,2.0346,5