d only: Desire. Rocco Siffredi reveals all, even if it sometimes means busting his own myth: his true story, beginnings, career, wife and children… and the ultimate revelation that will change his life forever.','/wGVnyKJm37uXqL1wAeLfnGuYw0m.jpg','2016-11-30',105,'Released',NULL,'Rocco',416148,6.7659,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42492,_binary '\0','/429x9ZU5IQY6L0HGshBGY1LQpjB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5789976',5.6,17951,'en','King of Thieves','London, England, April 2015. Brian Reader, a retired thief, gathers an unlikely gang of burglars to perpetrate the biggest and boldest heist in British history. The thieves assault the Hatton Garden Safe Deposit Company and escape with millions in goods and money. But soon the cracks between the gang members begin to appear when they discuss how to share the loot.','/rtfS7y2XQ0vjTrm6khq508N0Ehk.jpg','2018-09-04',108,'Released','It\'s never too late to earn','King of Thieves',520360,7.3959,5.6,'AkQHNgeg--Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42493,_binary '\0','/9Q3YJH0SmTmx2v3fZog9AknGquR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5790274',6.8,2359,'en','Three Bedrooms, One Corpse: An Aurora Teagarden Mystery','While Aurora \"Roe\" Teagarden searches for her piece of the American dream, she decides to test the waters of the family business - real estate sales. Only thing is there\'s a dead body in the first house she shows. When a second body shows up in another home, Roe realizes there\'s more to real estate than she thought.','/wRkZigA3uI3iqlTo1E024doHOps.jpg','2016-06-12',84,'Released',NULL,'Three Bedrooms, One Corpse: An Aurora Teagarden Mystery',393737,3.2989,6.7,'Pr9OqRrHP7U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42494,_binary '\0','/vqqkMVn89S712pyk66DDNeJ9sT3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5790492',5.6,2804,'es','Es por tu bien','Three brothers-in-law try to get their daughters to dump their undesirable boyfriends.','/f7AAqlwqAtxQQWiQzh0sjsfnsjG.jpg','2017-0