p of one another in a tiny apartment, driving one another crazy. Then her controlling father has a stroke and is left completely bedridden, and Marijana takes his place as head of the clan. Soon, she is working two jobs to keep everything afloat, while her mother and disabled brother do their best to scupper the ship. Driven to the edge, Marijana finds comfort in seedy sex with random strangers; and this taste of freedom leaves her wanting more. But now that she has finally found freedom, what\'s she meant to do with it?','/1KUulFZi6DgBGrC1TrlQZxOsOoO.jpg','2016-09-01',105,'Released',NULL,'Quit Staring at My Plate',408436,1.1789,5.9,'PjE6IE9QgNk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42499,_binary '\0','/vB6rIwaUOgXk2C0HfbxUGVSvdF7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5792468',5.9,6392,'en','Butterfly Kisses','A filmmaker discovers a box of video tapes depicting two students\' disturbing film project featuring a local horror legend, The Peeping Tom. As he sets out to prove this story is real and release it as a work of his own, he loses himself and the film crew following him into his project.','/7XxXYgak0oUhYx8fc0xv6n7dvJ7.jpg','2018-10-23',91,'Released','The camera doesn\'t lie.','Butterfly Kisses',480733,2.2788,6,'wBK1zH6XvRc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42500,_binary '\0','/vCkY9WH2JRlHWxFfD4yweHoBYlF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5792472',4.8,3537,'en','Take the 10','A day in the life of two best friends, a drug dealer, and a store manager collide at a hip-hop concert in the Inland Empire.','/mxfCWWyvU1ZIOomTXFHMYrCS4fs.jpg','2017-01-20',80,'Released',NULL,'Take the 10',433245,3.2606,5,'7iXwR0mFHn8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42501,_binary '\0','/9VqvhI7mBuqAHit2aWVVaYZ0JCL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5792656',5.4,11600,'en','Running with the Devil','A leader of a drug cartel sends his two toughest henchmen to investigate why a shipment was botched.','/qJ2H94PpXxZgiGGUNkyLSKZzm8u.jpg','