ily while defending herself from the dangers of the street.','/4WHkXS4828gKrhZg4Tje5gj5QVs.jpg','2017-01-22',98,'Released','Life is a battle.','Roxanne Roxanne',426257,2.0477,6.054,'IKA8H_LolNM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42506,_binary '\0','/vwbmp3vvX4U0VjinaQktYOBt5kW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5797184',6.8,50918,'en','Escape from Pretoria','South Africa, 1978. Tim Jenkin and Stephen Lee, two white political activists from the African National Congress imprisoned by the apartheid regime, put a plan in motion to escape from the infamous Pretoria Prison.','/8GGS0jkFFCnmdStvZED6NL6V7gd.jpg','2020-03-06',102,'Released','Survival is key','Escape from Pretoria',502425,5.9672,7.168,'ao1A4SyfVhg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42507,_binary '\0','/gede9Fq6taeT7tkf8843fJcP34x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5803528',5.3,1313,'nl','100% Coco','13 year old Coco loves fashion and has her own unique style. She dreams of becoming a famous fashion icon. But on her first day of school she is made fun of and everyone calls her \'Coco the Clown\'. Devastated, she decides to leave her vintage dresses, panther boots and striped socks at home and to dress herself more unnoticeable. Her anonymously kept fashion vlog as Style Tiger is a huge hit however. Is there still a chance that she will become a style icon? And does Bruno, that quirky boy she knows from school and secretly likes, finally notice her? Slowly Coco learns that she just has to be 100% herself!','/qOULNNkz56MT2t3CLzGFwazgRf0.jpg','2017-07-06',88,'Released',NULL,'100% Coco',461590,1.4502,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42508,_binary '\0','/1uecj8izDDjvZ4syzJQCOKRBjaa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5804038',7.9,24980,'en','I Am Not Your Negro','Working from the text of James Baldwin’s unfinished final novel, director Raoul Peck creates a meditation on what it means to be Black in the United States.','/zwd0Zti7BvY1mO0mTPzM0fRrtc6.jpg','2017-0