e a dragonslayer.','/1aqqYXoLTER1N2mR9MD5CNGqxhA.jpg','2016-12-25',101,'Released',NULL,'The Last Dragonslayer',431742,2.3101,5.9,'KxEXcQMDaV0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42517,_binary '\0','/2clFQ5Spg1DwX1gcVWTHAqXgnlP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5808778',6,8160,'es','Pieles','In a strange world where people share numerous deformities, the same problem we all face challenges each of them: to find someone who accepts you as you are. Sometimes, that means finding yourself first.','/brhuoXTrYexjF5cs4A605429u0P.jpg','2017-06-09',78,'Released',NULL,'Skins',435707,2.6257,6.36,'3xzPE6J2hIU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42518,_binary '\0','/7VrvHUlc2UU51uVqZyMShCB5Axe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5809020',5.2,5484,'en','Handsome: A Netflix Mystery Movie','LA homicide detective Gene Handsome\'s knack for solving mysteries is matched only by his inability to make sense of his own problems.','/yc1GQhNw5MvznrtPmPY52dKsdrm.jpg','2017-05-05',81,'Released',NULL,'Handsome: A Netflix Mystery Movie',402582,2.7204,5.272,'gmU2Hq8AsYY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42519,_binary '\0','/6ny15NB909vUZqUUJeo2gRej2e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5810000',6.8,2944,'en','I, Timon','Shakespeare\'s forgotten masterpiece of a good man in an evil world.','/jU1RThWbvgwzgQ7fSluaqzFGD8k.jpg','2016-01-01',78,'Released',NULL,'I, Timon',1059314,1.4496,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42520,_binary '\0','/rolh1jKPxG16EgVLq2KJlHWLtrM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5810122',4.6,2031,'en','Let Her Out','Twenty-three years after her hooker mother tried to kill her in the womb Helen remains damaged psychological goods. A mindset that gets worse when she suffers a traumatic head injury in an accident. Awakening in hospital, it’s discovered Helen has a tumour growth in her brain causing her to experience dark visions, disembodied voices and the omnipresence of a strange young woman. Soon, lost in a walking nightmare, in which nothing is what it seems, and her vicious actions barely remembered, it becomes crystal clear that whatever is inside her cracked psyche will stop at nothing to get out.','/ioNGkm4JOzk7FuQ7CojIwTsKzxu.jpg','2016-08-25',89,'Released',NULL,'Let Her Out',404516,1.9505,4.9,'ISHQbTmiqNs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42521,_binary '\0','/hMg3Oa9QMhFJWch79uO7YB5KOiH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5810368',3.4,1700,'en','Deadly Detention','Five archetypal teens serving detention find themselves in a life or death situation.','/ket8bzYI0ryOV1JhjsmWIfvs7xf.jpg','2017-01-23',85,'Released','Five students were taught a lesson they would never forget...','Deadly Detention',475369,1.5466,3.9,'zOEEmsPzWy4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42522,_binary '\0','/nfhMm5o8BiihmeXjuJAd3s0gqaq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5813366',5.2,12204,'zh','机器之血','A hardened special forces agent fights to protect a young woman from a sinister criminal gang. At the same time, he feels a special connection to the young woman, like they have met in a different life.','/vL1KMUr0Jj6kEZ5YPZO7VQBZMLl.jpg','2017-12-18',109,'Released','The Fate of Mankind Lies in the Heart of One','Bleeding Steel',460648,5.3545,5.969,'PycUqhQxR1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42523,_binary '\0','/89FKPLdMaANvYwYVOl6Ta8Ndacg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5813916',8.1,113063,'tr','Dağ II','In a desolate war zone where screams of the innocent echo, on the very line between disaster and valor, 7 Maroon Berets will dance with death.','/dYCqrxuCuzhfgbYJbO2HN4zTeqa.jpg','2016-11-04',135,'Released','A storm is comming','The Mountain II',427008,2.0362,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42524,_binary '\0','/cMnVmutb5mVgIBeiMOncAbwNjvG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5814060',5.4,199647,'en','The Nun','A priest with a dark past and a novice nearing her final vows are sent by the Vatican to Romania to investigate a nun\'s death and face a demonic force.','/sFC1ElvoKGdHJIWRpNB3xWJ9lJA.jpg','2018-09-05',96,'Released','Pray for forgiveness.','The Nun',439079,21.7357,5.91,'UvMVjwwZOF4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42525,_binary '\0','/uG1v9Hk1XKICd6IJChRR20mBh8i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5814534',6.8,63867,'en','Spies in Disguise','Super spy Lance Sterling and scientist Walter Beckett are almost exact opposites. Lance is smooth, suave and debonair. Walter is… not. But what Walter lacks in social skills he makes up for in smarts and invention, creating the awesome gadgets Lance uses on his epic missions. But when events take an unexpected turn, Walter and Lance suddenly have to rely on each other in a whole new way.','/z52xI0MnoX1rqySFJYnmBqHbXRn.jpg','2019-12-04',102,'Released','Super spy. Super fly.','Spies in Disguise',431693,15.4495,7.544,'6FK19sxxnBU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42526,_binary '\0','/sD8dKJiAXKL61SMOQvwHJEVeynd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5814592',6.6,23077,'en','The Party','Various individuals think they’re coming together for a party in a private home, but a series of revelations results in a huge crisis that throws their belief systems – and their values – into total disarray.','/rzpbqnmMBtoNKwqwbp2KMaZmwWw.jpg','2017-07-27',71,'Released','A comedy of tragic proportions','The Party',415401,3.7225,6.336,'Uzfbc0JoqCQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42527,_binary '\0','/yvucColaE4yrjrf6mZFrDSy1xUA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5815016',6.3,1368,'en','Mosley','The film tells the story of Mosley, a \"thoriphant\" who rebels against his life of servitude and embarks on a treacherous journey to find the fabled city of Uprights.','/fc9O9QaGU0amISOD9XPCxJqRhen.jpg','2019-10-10',96,'Released','There is something noble inside of you.','Mosley',610445,2.5209,6.8,'MUnkgRbWulE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42528,_binary '\0','/xzMQUomguGq749lJqEUsuIfHlN