ecome friends. They share stories about their respective boyfriends, and Catherine is shocked to find that the man she is dating is a lookalike of Aishwarya\'s boyfriend. Even more shocking is the fact that when she reaches home, she finds out that her boyfriend has died in a car crash. Catherine decides to investigate the lookalike boyfriend and uncovers a thrilling mystery.','/9ntagSmaXYUBVMjikmqMqKJ3Pcq.jpg','2016-06-17',152,'Released',NULL,'Gentleman',400247,1.1506,6.87,'MgmowJ5r-es','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42532,_binary '\0','/btjMe2wSFZKA01JdQFOusm7K6rT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5815944',5.7,4194,'ja','東京喰種 トーキョーグール','A Tokyo college student is attacked by a ghoul, a super-powered human who feeds on human flesh. He survives, but has become part ghoul and becomes a fugitive on the run.','/m6MzYJVfXMjN4E1JB2pc1iud3gI.jpg','2017-07-16',119,'Released','Humans are no longer at the top of the food chain','Tokyo Ghoul',433945,2.9968,7.042,'b6tINlquCKU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42533,_binary '\0','/gzyVkRCOsCADTahf4aRgWHv7N0P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5816374',6.6,6246,'en','Band Aid','A couple who can\'t stop fighting embark on a last-ditch effort to save their marriage: turning their fights into songs and starting a band.','/hDYKhDkmvvPnYESr1yNG3K5oMZT.jpg','2017-06-02',91,'Released','Misery loves accompaniment','Band Aid',426230,3.2005,6.266,'TZoNcq49zUY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42534,_binary '\0','/wcwXz5ztCtUvRVlLHhSYC2wKLqd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5816652',5,1904,'en','In God I Trust','Redemption, violence, and faith define a young black man, a reckless white nationalist, and a pair of traveling vacationers during a random encounter within northern Idaho.','/oMr2hcKe9kzbLmWduTXueaszdtm.jpg','2018-11-28',98,'Released',NULL,'In God I Trust',622208,1.7669,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42535,_binary '\0','/9as73Rj0Y7nMZBZTwoyjyUpfjyS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5816682',6.8,40334,'en','Victoria & Abdul','Queen Victoria strikes up an unlikely friendship with a young Indian clerk named Abdul Karim.','/uIzQ8zZ0rqjqqJUIpeeovtTryAa.jpg','2017-09-13',112,'Released','History\'s most unlikely friendship.','Victoria & Abdul',423899,6.4928,6.9,'3xo-EP_O5pQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42536,_binary '\0','/1Zf8KuRm1yJhvZJi7QNxV8yjclz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5818818',7.1,3366,'de','Die göttliche Ordnung','Nora is a young housewife and mother, living in a quaint little village with her husband and their two sons. The Swiss countryside is untouched by the major social upheavals the movement of 1968 has brought about. Nora’s life is not affected either; she is a quiet person who is liked by everybody – until she starts to publicly fight for women’s suffrage, which the men are due to vote on in a ballot on February 7, 1971.','/xkdnTSj3Zia0rik1wh6agIf2jNF.jpg','2017-03-09',96,'Released',NULL,'The Divine Order',436167,2.2254,7.2,'oUKEjCeJQmE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42537,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5821424',5.1,2250,'ml','തോപ്പില്‍ ജോപ്പന്‍','Joppan\'s failed romance excuses him to be an alcoholic. Hoping to start a new life, he seeks out for some love but would fate favor him this time?','/qIVko33XkOWk79P6cHHhuLZv9Oj.jpg','2016-10-07',129,'Released','50% Love 50% Alcohol','Thoppil Joppan',423335,1.1519,5.2,'B7RBtZGbj2Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42538,_binary '\0','/7N7CtZftqEvgojR3QloukU0oWPg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5822536',6.6,36939,'en','Paddington in Peru','Paddington travels to Peru to visit his beloved Aunt Lucy, who now resides at the Home for Retired Bears. With the Brown Family in tow, a thrilling adventure ensues when a mystery plunges them into an unexpected journey through the Amazon rainforest and up to the mountain peaks of Peru.','/1ffZAucqfvQu36x1C49XfOdjuOG.jpg','2