 in a clam house; Humpty, Ginny’s rough-hewn carousel operator husband; Mickey, a handsome young lifeguard who dreams of becoming a playwright; and Carolina, Humpty’s long-estranged daughter, who is now hiding out from gangsters at her father’s apartment.','/gKYpAL1A01T9a1taGXAyfqXjI5x.jpg','2017-12-01',101,'Released','Come along for the ride.','Wonder Wheel',429189,6.1044,6.4,'VFM0UqX9MJ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42543,_binary '\0','/kiwnp0IauIAPlRKJ4LUhjqKK2wg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5826432',6,3246,'en','Burning Sands','Deep into Hell Week, a favored pledgee is torn between honoring his code of silence or standing up against the intensifying violence of underground hazing.','/nTOithYdgE4jAdSIuH1nAaxkmzY.jpg','2017-01-24',105,'Released',NULL,'Burning Sands',426265,2.1638,5.833,'8kyOvsbj_hs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42544,_binary '\0','/2uSy6CaqpedLiYDCmjDDXCuu8B3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5827212',6.2,4036,'fr','Laissez bronzer les cadavres','With a heavy haul of 250 kilograms of gold bullion, the grizzled criminal mastermind, Rhino, and his ruthless gang of cutthroats, head to a ramshackle retreat somewhere in the Mediterranean to lay low on a scorching day of July. However, the unexpected and rather unwelcome arrival of the bohemian writer, Bernier, his muse, Luce, along with a pair of no-joke gendarmes further complicates things, as the frail allegiances will soon be put to the test.','/5cMx2OkRsGZmEz6OgBhqda34S3z.jpg','2017-10-18',92,'Released','Who shall live and who shall die?!','Let the Corpses Tan',422708,2.3485,6.146,'7Q7xB9CMkks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42545,_binary '\0','/qGZe9qTuydxyJYQ60XDtEckzLR8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5827790',6.1,8132,'es','Orígenes secretos','In Madrid, Spain, a mysterious serial killer ruthlessly murders his victims by recreating the first appearance of several comic book superheroes. Cosme, a veteran police inspector who is about to retire, works on the case along with the tormented inspector David Valentín and his own son Jorge Elías, a nerdy young man who owns a comic book store.','/vJHSParlylICnI7DuuI54nfTPRR.jpg','2020-08-28',97,'Released',NULL,'Unknown Origins',438396,3.103,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42546,_binary '\0','/zxY1yP9FjJpV7T3hxqBBI5WNydx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5827916',7.4,32756,'en','A Hidden Life','Austrian farmer Franz Jägerstätter faces the threat of execution for refusing to fight for the Nazis during World War II.','/taUkn5MsZIq5kpTABsF2563j5zp.jpg','2019-08-27',173,'Released','Better to suffer injustice than to commit it.','A Hidden Life',403300,5.9249,7.171,'qJXmdY4lVR0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42547,_binary '\0','/d3fAR9lW5Jc4FBNhAGKvDWpiBlY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5828640',2.6,1772,'en','Planet of the Sharks','In the near future, glacial melting has covered 98% of earth\'s landmass. Sharks have flourished and now dominate the planet, operating as one massive school led by a mutated alpha shark.','/54hwLfOJONjqOFxGlEixpOHeEnx.jpg','2016-07-27',85,'Released','When the World Floods One Species Rises to the Top.','Planet of the Sharks',407620,2.0035,3.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42548,_binary '\0','/iDqWN9xUES3EM6M2NxmEzxPX9bA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5828874',6.1,2687,'en','My Summer Prince','When a prince, and heir to the throne, finds himself in some hot water for his partying ways, the royal family decides to hire a top notch PR consultant to work with him.','/tPBNr3T8kxRZJJ9SL9TpbZCuzqk.jpg','2016-08-06',84,'Released',NULL,'My Summer Prince',407334,2.5167,5.9,'nQFwgx0z2Uk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42549,_binary '\0','/6NU514eFd3Hb7Ff789pPn5n8uM6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5829032',4.4,2202,'en','Camp Cold Brook','Strange events plague crew members of a reality TV show when they visit an infamous backwood