d felon, and Viktor discovers a timely legacy is in the offing – his father’s apartment. The documentation for securing dad’s move into an old people’s home is signed in a flash. Nevertheless, the only one that can take him is miles away and, what’s more, the invalid starts to recuperate during the journey, which is when their real problems begin.','/j9SEegY3YsTVDykqVueVfY7zXS9.jpg','2017-10-12',90,'Released',NULL,'How Viktor \"The Garlic\" Took Alexey \"The Stud\" to the Nursing Home',466287,1.122,7,'O9TrJ6zVd_A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42569,_binary '\0','/y51NUFkurplsNWBExuqtGFXSLvl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5838806',7.2,1729,'ml','ആൻമരിയ കലിപ്പിലാണ്','2016 Indian Malayalam childrens film directed by Midhun Manuel Thomas and written by Thomas and John Manthrichal. Produced by Alice George under the banner of Goodwill Entertainments, the film stars Baby Sara, Sunny Wayne, and Aju Varghese.','/w4o6dIXEZezhraniK2tUFontWbo.jpg','2016-08-05',127,'Released',NULL,'Annmariya Kalippilaanu',411053,1.2302,6.966,'jM6OXH4J18g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42570,_binary '\0','/5134ndPOU5p99hTPeI8J5nClqqb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5841344',4.5,1464,'en','The Competition','A romantic comedy about a woman who thinks all people eventually cheat and a man who challenges her to a competition to prove that she\'s wrong.','/c7DtOmvuptoZz4s0vdg7BcAWbDS.jpg','2018-01-26',105,'Released',NULL,'The Competition',428589,1.719,4.1,'WQ0NT7PhvCM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42571,_binary '\0','/A6m01QHo92gaM7VCbOyNNBsgjFT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5842616',3.4,13821,'hi','वीरे दी वेडिंग','Kalindi, Avni, Sakshi and Meera are childhood friends. Kalindi and Rishabh are getting married, and the four gal pals come together for their veere’s wedding. But of course, there can be no shaadi without showsha and a lot of drama. This wedding celebration brings out skeletons from the closet, unspoken truths and some harsh realities as well.','/yeXnYRRQE2MT7s04uUfKS696cqi.jpg','2018-06-01',135,'Released',NULL,'Veere Di Wedding',483189,1.3412,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42572,_binary '\0','/fugdTm2XsAIxT5wVfp20lfogJak.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5842624',6.4,2767,'cn','危城','During the warlords era in China, a village located in rural area called Pucheng fell into dangerous situation when its government allocated all its military force to the front line, the cruel commandant Cao from the enemy troops arrived the village and killed the innocent, the guardians of Pucheng were desperate to fight against Cao for justice and to protect their homeland.','/frNzgqcLNno44PhcNREjM7AEXWL.jpg','2016-08-12',120,'Released',NULL,'Call of Heroes',413198,2.7171,6.5,'nyNb6pOWpPU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42573,_binary '\0','/i5St0PWbDpmKP3ghAaTYgME5Ojr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5842890',6.1,3678,'hu','Jupiter holdja','A young refugee, Aryan, is shot while illegally trying to cross the Hungarian border. While tending him back to health, a doctor at a refugee camp discovers that Aryan has gained an extraordinary talent—he can levitate. Aryan is smuggled out by the doctor, who is intent on exploiting his secret.','/lhxOYoKfLjaicDckUf8pX04ilOf.jpg','2017-11-02',129,'Released',NULL,'Jupiter\'s Moon',444395,2.3115,5.572,'ou5oxqQq95Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42574,_binary '\0','/AiXKQhgqGgC6t4RtWFrNx1ivhw2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5843670',5.3,4423,'en','The Stakelander','When his home of New Eden is destroyed by a revitalized Brotherhood and its new Vamp leader, Martin finds himself alone in the badlands of America with only the distant memory of his mentor and legendary vampire hunter, Mister, to guide him.','/3K9sca6hMxVzCtE7EnAxTjdKWpM.jpg','2016-10-14',85,'Released','Death is no escape.','The Stakelander',410988,3.5991,5.875,'RS99EzOY9jw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000