s and his estranged family that he can make it.','/gPuILPOmJcKOmALs01ar1wB7Wmv.jpg','2019-01-04',95,'Released',NULL,'One Last Deal',478502,1.5511,6.7,'SMrJzEtjV8Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42589,_binary '\0','/i6zS3tPgEbNCiDx5CbmU5OYhjKm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5851692',6.9,1279,'sr','Stado','Two of the most popular Serbian actors discover a script that they immediately want to work on, forgetting that creating in Serbia isn\'t as easy as it seems.','/hjmB9F1AxuXSLIWQ4b2u3WnLEza.jpg','2016-11-23',99,'Released','Witness, sheep! Witness how to become... a wolf.','Herd',427567,0.8077,6.8,'hjZL-ZKEC6s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42590,_binary '\0','/pcwvKDQWBxoKScRDoe6DHtecOcC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5851696',7.1,1767,'en','My Sailor, My Love','The thorny relationship between a woman and her retired father worsens after he becomes romantically involved with the housekeeper she hires for him.','/28gdL4fVM5yRK8d1NkE43ExHTLO.jpg','2022-09-30',102,'Released','It\'s never too late to love.','My Sailor, My Love',511424,2.6769,6.3,'WtyQidZxjRU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42591,_binary '\0','/uAv8MOm26tAbSZbUiOtrHZx10gQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5851786',5.6,4635,'en','Gnome Alone','When Chloe discovers that her new home\'s garden gnomes are not what they seem, she must decide between the pursuit of a desired high school life and taking up the fight against the Troggs.','/jWB0zhk1Rj1tIWUM98Wsh15gkiW.jpg','2017-11-02',85,'Released','Little dudes. Big trouble.','Gnome Alone',466876,5.891,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42592,_binary '\0','/xte6dUGLvFss0ZJIau9avtrfTQR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5851904',7.4,4573,'fr','Le Grand Méchant Renard et autres contes...','The countryside isn\'t always as calm and peaceful as it\'s made out to be, and the animals on this farm are particularly agitated: a fox who mothers a family of chicks, a rabbit who p