ews secret in hopes that the celebration runs smoothly.','/bsMoah6BOPoygMY3lHn3raSjMLy.jpg','2016-07-16',84,'Released',NULL,'A Perfect Christmas',403400,1.6088,5.3,'Ca-qNx_KwvQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42604,_binary '\0','/b0vt1vT2FKaLifsRWXKrk4RqDei.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5864238',6.3,1779,'en','Can\'t Buy My Love','Lilly, a hard working EMT, is only focused on her job and getting into medical school. So when wealthy slacker Jeff enters her life it throws her off course. At first, Lilly wants nothing to do with Jeff or his sense of entitlement and lack of direction. As she spends more time with him, she starts to realize that you can’t always judge a book by its cover.','/pS5sUhDvNp7EJXuYLvI8SKQ0eWA.jpg','2017-03-04',86,'Released',NULL,'Can\'t Buy My Love',445126,2.8214,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42605,_binary '\0','/9BnqMVrM6pBM3KlcVoiFXGHAN24.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5864680',6.4,2536,'en','Missing 411','Based on the book series by David Paulides, an investigation into the many disappearances that have occurred in National Parks and Forests of the United States and elsewhere over several decades.','/xfXP83Z60BineeI1RVmHsHhb3hX.jpg','2017-05-13',98,'Released',NULL,'Missing 411',357114,1.935,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42606,_binary '\0','/poVt3f1dCG3J6UnczY9Otml7WvT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5864904',5.6,9815,'en','The Capture','A group of scientists perform an unethical experiment bending both space and time –in the process they may have not only changed their lives but also the very fabric of the universe.','/iVpoC6Kzg96S63rc1RWmNuV7DP3.jpg','2017-11-16',78,'Released','Their discovery. Our end.','The Capture',543140,1.409,5.3,'ygVxwOH-S2I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42607,_binary '\0','/mXFmiaqqTPHatImHvQOujIYX7qF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5865326',6.3,58652,'en','The Laundromat','When a widow gets swindled out of insurance money, her search for answers leads to two cunning lawyers in Panama who hide cash for the superrich.','/hwNMJgbiUUvPCxsnADjbV9ysM5j.jpg','2019-09-27',96,'Released','Based on actual secrets.','The Laundromat',517909,8.3201,6,'wuBRcfe4bSo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42608,_binary '\0','/tnf6OsK17v3BsdRv5qMD5T7LCTB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5866930',5.6,3661,'cn','The Adventurers','The world\'s top thieves join forces to pull off the heist of a lifetime. But when they find themselves pursued across Europe by a legendary French detective, they\'ll have to take their game to the next level.','/5Vml5t3V1mnRAPyduPFUc8ew8HN.jpg','2017-08-11',108,'Released',NULL,'The Adventurers',452551,3.4342,5.959,'THOSPwDRfp4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42609,_binary '\0','/y3lodG6SlfajLBC4Yk0Pg76uvyo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5867226',3.8,1367,'en','Silencer','A retired hitman must reawaken all his deadly skills and fight a one-man war against his former employer.','/s2TexorQvaskAkAGsRFYmIJbQnz.jpg','2018-08-30',88,'Released','Let chaos reign.','Silencer',528484,1.1677,4.9,'PRfyLsohco4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42610,_binary '\0','/hwpbTeZEaKKUfiUjc2FJZpv7uAI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5867314',6.2,51541,'en','The Empty Man','On the trail of a missing girl, an ex-cop comes across a secretive group attempting to summon a terrifying supernatural entity.','/8apzu9JFTUMtOpYkHk6LNPOs3pY.jpg','2020-10-22',137,'Released','The first night you hear him. The second night you see him. The third night he finds you.','The Empty Man',516632,11.4845,6.161,'aistYRvIml0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42611,_binary '\0','/8Tk0pyAAdq0KFgeV9leRgEbNVT2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5867800',8.3,15215,'ta','அருவி','A gentle girl born and brought up amidst the ever growing eco-social-consumeristic environment finds it difficult to fit in the society. She decides to take it hard on the people.','/dqyDZ3B5R7OrTjioigQ7kqt20eH.jpg','2017-12-15',122,'Released',NULL,'Aruvi',423191,1.296,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42612,_binary '\0','/dP0zLzu9Xjwc6nXdpTdp6NAyY9L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5869350',5.7,1996,'sv','Morran och Tobias - Som en skänk från ovan','After an incident with a hot air balloon burner, Morran and her son Tobias have reduced their home of 34 years to ashes. With a burnt out caravan in tow filled with sooty household goods they make their move to a new council house. Whilst Morran sees the opportunity for a fresh start, Tobias has lots of creative ideas about improving the house. But there is something about their new home that feels familiar, and through a series of fortuitous events the lopsided duo are once and for all forced to deal with the past.','/iCJUxmgtfmvbF1BZWBUtAEOGe2R.jpg','2016-10-26',99,'Released',NULL,'Morran & Tobias: Godsend',404789,1.3976,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42613,_binary '\0','/9LEVhjQVUrhgOmlI3BP75aZhcqs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5870084',7,1294,'es','Más que hermanos','Two young siblings ended up living on the streets, having nothing left but their love. It\'s a story about survival, second chances and second falls, with an unexpected turn at the end.','/tExuJbpB9vDdpFK31QEBq4aksPn.jpg','2017-08-17',90,'Released',NULL,'Beyond Brotherhood',477359,1.17,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42614,_binary '\0','/10h1b1SMPjsJSrSVMPZG6vCGX2E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5870322',6.5,1337,'de','Rock My Heart','17-year-old Jana has a congenital heart defect. To defy fate, Jana seeks every challenge, plunges into every wild and dangerous adventure. Her parents does not like that and are even more in constant fear of their daughter.','/mFl6xsdaDNzM4KxhJOIJkq9wXBp.jpg','2017-09-28',105,'Released',NULL,'Rock My Heart',432870,2.3521,7.2,'gaTCiBCOTsY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42615,_binary '\0','/qLIcg7J94StYDFqTU5tPlQifNI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5871080',7.3,10117,'hu','A Viszkis','Between 1993 and 1999, one man robbed 29 financial institutions in Budapest. Banks, post offices and even travel agencies fell victim to his crime spree. The police had no leads and no hope of finding him during his six-year stint. The only clue left behind at the crime scenes was the distinct aroma of whiskey. The media christened him the “Whiskey Bandit”. Never physically harming anyone, many began to eagerly follow his escapades through the media. A Transylvanian immigrant, who also happened to be a goalie for one of the city\'s largest hockey teams, named Attila Ambrus, was finally identified as the “Whiskey Bandit”. The police had finally captured him... or so they thought.','/uaL59BF0jcHsvqxx3SSho3ZLAiY.jpg','2017-11-23',126,'Released',NULL,'The Whiskey Bandit',401600,2.2559,6.612,'9Qf_JA_WmvI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42616,_binary '\0','/l8aWEILNLNU5ZNWEe88c2NYzAWQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5873150',6.4,4370,'en','Strong Island','Examining the violent death of the filmmaker’s brother and the judicial system that allowed his killer to go free, this documentary interrogates murderous fear and racialized perception, and re-imagines the wreckage in catastrophe’s wake, challenging us to change.','/qGq7WCNv9S8GBbP8DfIchiaodWn.jpg','2017-01-23',107,'Released',NULL,'Strong Island',428612,1.361,6.3,'h64qugj_iDg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42617,_binary '\0','/g0axK3OABLOB037PSRQGNxngDWf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5881528',5.5,6469,'en','Damsel','Oregon, a small town near the sea, around 1870. Henry, a grieving man who aspires to preach as a way to overcome his unfortunate past, reunites with eccentric pioneer Samuel Alabaster, who has hired him to officiate at his marriage to the precious Penelope. What Henry ignores is that both must embark on a dangerous journey through the inhospitable wilderness to meet her.','/dNZxjsJwmKorpPvd0kquJffYROr.jpg','2018-06-22',113,'Released','Not all damsels need saving.','Damsel',414018,3.4692,5.3,'HikYI0jIAwU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42618,_binary '\0','/ottxCAgqFw007HHg24H0HFXgO1Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5882398',6.4,1400,'id','Warkop DKI Reborn: Jangkrik Boss! Part 1','Dono, Kasino, and Indro returned to action in the midst of the hustle and bustle of Jakarta. They once again acted as personnels of a private institution named CHIIPS.','/d9JVFB2xEBI8Y68hFx0n2pYEfsY.jpg','2016-10-08',95,'Released',NULL,'Warkop DKI Reborn: Jangkrik Boss! Part 1',405040,1.6153,6.8,'lmuNabammwk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42619,_binary '\0','/4lzfjalztSGeIwj6GIdWHfbeJUu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5882970',4,24220,'hi','Tubelight','Laxman Singh Bisht is nicknamed tube light by his neighbours because he is feeble-minded. Despite being special, Laxman lives by one life-lesson; keep your faith alive and you can do almost anything, even stop a war.','/hy7Ka19Vx2TwXA6OWZSe4XuMDlK.jpg','2017-06-22',136,'Released',NULL,'Tubelight',441881,1.918,5.3,'PGQRNKHJwH4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42620,_binary '\0','/3YR2p7afxCwWFtobYXeuVlFzDB1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5882982',6.8,2374,'ja','22年目の告白 ―私が殺人犯です―','The movie begins in the year 1995 where there were 5 peculiar murder cases. The murderer would always get someone close to the victim to witness how he would strangle the victim from behind with a rope but he would let the witnesses go and speak to the media on how the murders happened. Ito plays the role of Makimura, the police detective who was in charge of investigating the serial murders but failed to catch the cunning murderer and his respected superior ended up being killed as well. 22 years later in 2017 when the case is nearing its statute of limitations, a man named Sonezaki claims to be the culprit for the 1995 murders and even publishes a book titled \"Watashi ga satsujinhan desu\" to talk about the cases. Despite the disgust towards Sonezaki\'s actions, the intensive attention showered on him via the media and SNS makes him become the talk of town.','/o1DxZDxQSiE86Vo23NhZplsFNzA.jpg','2017-06-10',118,'Released',NULL,'Memoirs of a Murderer',450274,2.4645,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42621,_binary '\0','/kOijpwD8F885H4Bq5qnydS8R8kC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5883008',5.7,1668,'ja','風に濡れた女','Dissipated Tokyo playwright, Kosuke has retreated to the countryside after deciding that he\'s done with women, but the indefatigable cat-in-heat Shiori has other ideas, clinging to Kosuke like his shadow.','/hY17IGc6O6R26QhiymwVlvbzOaO.jpg','2016-12-17',77,'Released',NULL,'Wet Woman in the Wind',408270,5.4,5.8,'PwzEGwpql3M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42622,_binary '\0','/tnReBbHkaowJ4v7PpBiUzX29kRh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5883570',7,6612,'en','Bodied','A progressive graduate student finds success and sparks outrage when his interest in battle rap as a thesis subject becomes a competitive obsession.','/5urgy7sXFbvCK7SBmc0fF978AOb.jpg','2018-11-02',120,'Released','Meet Oakland\'s Newest Battle Rapper.','Bodied',431491,2.1953,7.212,'apxOPzcyBts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42623,_binary '\0','/tLXt1F32KbCReIfA5tb2urbTqaL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5883632',7,5996,'es','Esteros','Childhood friends Matías and Jerónimo reach adolescence and experience sexual attraction to each other, before being separated by circumstances. Later, as young adults, they meet again, and the film follows themes of complicated relationships and sexual tensions, as well as issues of homophobia.','/mEoW2zMX0ySZBBr7B1YuevwdpM4.jpg','2016-05-27',83,'Released','It\'s never too late to re-live your first love','Esteros',418718,2.2022,6.6,'tLb93aITF3s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42624,_binary '\0','/m4fZRsub0P7qP8Sj9pmecXbQxwx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5884004',7.5,1506,'en','David Crosby: Remember My Name','You thought you knew him. Meet David Crosby now in this portrait of a man with everything but an easy retirement on his mind. With unflinching honesty, self-examination, regret, fear, exuberance and an unshakable belief in family and the transformative nature of music, Crosby shares his often challenging journey.','/ukX2FulY6ZYLnNYIclixLVOVZB1.jpg','2019-07-19',95,'Released','Who are you when the lights have gone out?','David Crosby: Remember My Name',565718,1.7045,7,'ln9dtQ8tuKk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42625,_binary '\0','/yXybBEC45p84D0Ky7GmQQYrclVr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5884052',6.5,199754,'en','Pokémon Detective Pikachu','In a world where people collect pocket-size monsters (Pokémon) to do battle, a boy comes across an intelligent monster who seeks to be a detective.','/uhWvnFgg3BNlcUz0Re1HfQqIcCD.jpg','2019-05-03',105,'Released','Partner up!','Pokémon Detective Pikachu',447404,14.4742,6.896,'1roy4o4tqQM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42626,_binary '\0','/eRfANc4xSRNaR8E9fUI9hdLkCWB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5884230',6.5,20283,'en','Brad\'s Status','Although Brad has a satisfying career, a sweet wife and a comfortable life in suburban Sacramento, things aren\'t quite what he imagined during his college glory days. When he accompanies his musical prodigy son on a university tour, he can\'t help comparing his life with those of his four best college friends who seemingly have more wealthy and glamorous lives. But when circumstances force him to reconnect with his former friends, Brad begins to question whether he has really failed or if their lives are actually more flawed than they appear.','/uXiNpvig7EMq18VyNBUTlWrmN0q.jpg','2017-09-14',101,'Released',NULL,'Brad\'s Status',425980,6.2952,6.275,'eJQWL74p02Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42627,_binary '\0','/dhX8LZJkREFmRcr