-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42667,_binary '\0','/tdArpv2Av7MhGwbIMVnRgCy8dDn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5914350',7.4,1401,'en','The Rolling Stones: Olé Olé Olé! – A Trip Across Latin America','This exhilarating rock \'n\' roll road movie follows The Rolling Stones on their 2016 tour of Latin America, climaxing with their historic concert in Havana, Cuba.','/qJx1Kf1yybpjXIqhoEPdG6OJ63H.jpg','2016-10-21',105,'Released',NULL,'The Rolling Stones: Olé Olé Olé! – A Trip Across Latin America',408623,1.549,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42668,_binary '\0','/50DmRvHibD5WeUXDaxC8AGPuj7O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5914642',5.7,3238,'it','Youtopia','Eighteen-year-old Matilde lives with her grandmother and her mother Laura, a woman struggling with debt and failures. Completely disconnected from reality and attached to her online avatar, Matilde has found her own way to make money: stripping on webcam. One day, Laura is forced to reveal her debts to her daughter, who plots an ideal solution to their troubles, unexpectedly involving Ernesto, a wealthy bourgeois obsessed with sex and possessions.','/9eFZZuplF7SAP64ZD8aEgVKKLS6.jpg','2018-04-25',94,'Released',NULL,'Youtopia',513919,1.9765,5.1,'zPdj8OSgz4U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42669,_binary '\0','/zmJtqKaByFqYrxipeXyoAUSTD1w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5914996',7.3,5522,'ja','ノーゲーム・ノーライフ ゼロ','Six thousand years before Sora and Shiro were even a blink in the history of Disboard, war consumed the land, tearing apart the heavens, destroying stars, and even threatening to wipe out the human race. Amid the chaos and destruction, a young man named Riku leads humanity toward the tomorrow his heart believes in. One day, in the ruins of an Elf city, he meets Schwi, a female exiled \"Ex Machina\" android who asks him to teach her what it means to have a human heart.','/cCBB6BGRj5nCTaEgogDtkHfjOLK.jpg','2017-07-15',106,'Released',NULL,'No Game No Life: Zero',445030,4.9273,7.833,'0-KGvuSmdr0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42670,_binary '\0','/asMA2kyOrbDo8mRUvBaDBUULP9x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5916786',6.8,1297,'en','Garage Sale Mystery: The Art of Murder','Jennifer Shannon is a garage sale shopping expert whose sharp observation skills allow her to uncover valuable antiques, as well as help her local police department investigate crimes. While arranging a charity garage sale event, Jennifer finds a body in the attic of a local residence. While working to crack the case, Jennifer offers support to her loving husband, Jason, whose upcoming birthday has sparked a mid-life crisis. As Jennifer prepares to buy him the perfect gift, she receives an urgent voicemail from Tina, pleading for her immediate assistance. When she responds, the garage sale-expert-turned-sleuth finds herself standing face-to-face with a killer.','/mhWeUkyX6uCfIyFh454gjOLpJWd.jpg','2017-01-08',83,'Released',NULL,'Garage Sale Mystery: The Art of Murder',423671,2.2628,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42671,_binary '\0','/1Q9xEpkSTBgJISMZFLiPt96Jlhs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5918028',6.7,3815,'ko','아수라','A shady cop finds himself in over his head when he gets caught between Internal Affairs and the city’s corrupt mayor.','/vJmSw2QFvX5vqdGQSBGe1x7HEcJ.jpg','2016-09-28',136,'Released','Once you trip in, there is no way out.','Asura: The City of Madness',408620,3.1378,6.802,'7l8apC2X5Fo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42672,_binary '\0','/wRe8Et2LzalpcSgEsUuTQeU7UIS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5918074',7.4,6923,'hi','A Death in the Gunj','Life for a shy young Indian student slowly falls to pieces during a family road trip.','/vXSnbVgCJpsa3xQV93ol94eiXV0.jpg','2016-09-09',110,'Released',NULL,'A Death in the Gunj',408624,2.0396,7.073,'XliKkuxa_nA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42673,_binary '\0','/323R1b3D2WS17JXgdAfmPGNpMkJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5918090',6.8,2684,'zh','我不是潘金莲','Li Xuelian, a woman from the countryside is falsely accused by her husband of having an affair. To defend herself, Li moves from her small town to the big city until she reached the capital.','/oDuRRD2p0NVKP1gDPvGNjY7K6fl.jpg','2016-09-29',128,'Released',NULL,'I Am Not Madame Bovary',400114,3.0079,6.8,'WFa46h2tMfM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42674,_binary '\0','/owTL741kAuvJDKYnXKJCgTRGRud.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5918982',6.5,55061,'en','Possessor','Tasya Vos, an elite corporate assassin, uses brain-implant technology to take control of other people’s bodies to terminate high profile targets. As she sinks deeper into her latest assignment, Vos becomes trapped inside a mind that threatens to obliterate her.','/xC9GZeJZ3NagdkGg9nLQx0aPG6J.jpg','2020-10-02',103,'Released','No body is safe.','Possessor',435615,5.079,6.4,'ahn56QWkD0Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42675,_binary '\0','/46s1Izh0aOsgZhuZxeatIoVsRP4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5919756',5.4,5974,'en','Disappearance at Clifton Hill','Following the death of her mother, a young woman returns home to Niagara Falls and becomes entangled in the memory of a kidnapping she claims to have witnessed as a child.','/8qBNpBrNrOBC0sSmB1xg3vpI9WY.jpg','2020-02-28',100,'Released','The truth can be deceiving.','Disappearance at Clifton Hill',598577,3.0168,5.5,'zpiPxGgA3Mg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42676,_binary '\0','/ehyeBgEu4wV2aVOmLDRGLBu7KhW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5921218',6.6,4099,'en','The Mistletoe Promise','A chance meeting between two strangers who share a disdain for Christmas results in The Mistletoe Promise, a pact to help them navigate their holiday complications - together. But as they spend more time with each other and experience the magic of Christmas the phony couple discovers there may be more to their contract than business.','/lyWtlPVrL5vuSfTNqwOXhHHSh8k.jpg','2016-11-05',84,'Released',NULL,'The Mistletoe Promise',410315,2.0776,6.3,'EOz4BiVL63k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42677,_binary '\0','/ngrFnbtZjEvDvvbwLBHQ05kbt6Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5922124',6.2,1560,'en','A Crooked Somebody','An attention-seeking psychic is kidnapped and tries to use the situation to boost his popularity.','/sMi0sz3qnj2xBdT0tfHlqnw5zIh.jpg','2018-10-05',102,'Released','Better to be an honest nobody than a crooked somebody.','A Crooked Somebody',435036,2.1328,6.327,'xQ2L-srPp7o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42678,_binary '\0','/dJQ1RRB7CTVJr0pXQdBslhqx23F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5922484',6.7,3118,'en','Summer Villa','Although a successful romance novelist, Terry Russell hasn\'t had luck in her own love life. After a disastrous first date with cocky, hot-shot New York chef Matthew Everston, she retreats to her friend\'s French villa for the summer to finish her latest novel, with her reluctant teenage daughter in tow.','/npiWf0kTKOHyQoPnmL7HOfbNAhL.jpg','2016-07-23',84,'Released','There is a \"je ne sais quoi\" in the air','Summer Villa',407172,2.1686,6.4,'Vc1xvVqoD60','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42679,_binary '\0','/uaC3R0h5rnlvRblX7IBX0Q9XGJk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5923026',6.9,3719,'id','Marlina si Pembunuh dalam Empat Babak','After encountering a group of bandits with plans to rape and steal from her, a young widow ventures into the wilderness in search of justice.','/7pDpym7ix9dsB9a1KWVLN95X4z1.jpg','2017-05-15',93,'Released','Justice doesn\'t wait for the law. Justice is served by her own hands','Marlina the Murderer in Four Acts',453276,2.1768,6.7,'Oln1E114c1U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42680,_binary '\0','/wyDNiOVWwviCFzWITuxs9CnjmAW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5923962',7.1,18054,'ja','GANTZ:O','After being brutally murdered in a subway station, a teen boy awakens to find himself resurrected by a strange computer named Gantz, and forced to fight a large force of invading aliens in Osaka.','/9yTuw6ddf28lItHwgeqFSNtXsaG.jpg','2016-10-14',95,'Released',NULL,'GANTZ:O',396263,5.6084,7.4,'r37ARGRJC-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42681,_binary '\0','/jUCDtYmQgIpySFQ4d1VZdMDwREI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5925772',6.4,3838,'ml','CIA: Comrade In America','A young Aji Mathew is a communist who goes the whole nine yards for the ideologies he believes in. When the girl he loves leaves to the US out of the blue and her parents fix her wedding, Aji is left with just a fortnight to reach the country albeit with no passport or visa. How far he is willing to go for love forms the plot.','/1ke1nNHvASJ0kn1cs7PlCx1mWtH.jpg','2017-05-05',134,'Released','How far will you go for love?','CIA: Comrade In America',439601,1.4156,5.986,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42682,_binary '\0','/qa2Oonwq1hNews3snq0aWgL0w24.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5927352',6.2,21306,'tr','İstanbul Kırmızısı','Orhan who lived in London for years and did not come back to Turkey agrees to help Deniz -a famous director- edit his first book. Deniz has been living in a mansion with his family which started to lose its old brightness and power. Orhan finds himself in the middle of Deniz\'s complicated relationships, mysterious friends and stange family members. This is the first movie of Ferzan Ozpetek which is shot in Turkey after a long time. It is also based on his own book which has the same name with the movie.','/nSzgyCPVJVVKtb7LhvRoEjnyaQP.jpg','2017-03-02',110,'Released','Nothing is more important than love.','Red Istanbul',443486,3.0887,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42683,_binary '\0','/uH1B5P0LdTIdaaMGp2gN1ntQA7G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5927420',7,4651,'tr','Daha','Gaza is a 14-year-old boy who lives on the Aegean coast of Turkey. Together with his domineering father, he helps smuggle refugees from war-torn countries to Europe, giving them temporary lodgings and scant food until they attempt the crossing. Gaza dreams of escaping this life, but can\'t help being drawn into a dark world of immorality, exploitation and human suffering. Can you avoid becoming a monster when you\'ve been raised by one? Onur Saylak\'s debut feature, adapted from the award-winning novel of the same title by Hakan Günday, one of the first novels to document the refugee crisis in Europe, \"More\" is the gripping story of a boy that gets to grow up in a world where there\'s no room for innocence.','/s1qpdCimDoqhjODNTk12x2SlYwT.jpg','2017-07-03',115,'Released',NULL,'More',473768,0.9612,7.3,'RtgESjIapTc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42684,_binary '\0','/qEo36RiT8w4hMFlf9KohOSuX3HZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5929654',5.2,2638,'en','Think Like a Dog','A 12-year-old tech prodigy, whose science experiment goes awry, forges a telepathic connection with his best friend, Henry-his dog! The duo join forces and use their unique perspectives on life to comically overcome complications of family and school.','/cDbOrc2RtIA37nLm0CzVpFLrdaG.jpg','2020-08-06',91,'Released',NULL,'Think Like a Dog',513584,5.3774,6.7,'s3_5WZSOsn8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42685,_binary '\0','/5iT6eAI64JJM8p0dL6EExaUvydg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5929750',6,11422,'en','Beatriz at Dinner','Beatriz, an immigrant from a poor town in Mexico, has drawn on her innate kindness to build a career as a health practitioner. Doug Strutt is a cutthroat, self-satisfied billionaire. When these two opposites meet at a dinner party, their worlds collide, and neither will ever be the same.','/ypvlGBvm6p0EIvKCzJw0OqsuzK5.jpg','2017-06-09',82,'Released','She was invited, but she\'s not welcome.','Beatriz at Dinner',429107,2.4807,5.8,'bCLNTmNj5bI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42686,_binary '\0','/nrzKvKLEOYWFEi3iWefST8EKgga.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5929754',6.8,34069,'en','Wildlife','14-year-old Joe is the only child of Jeanette and Jerry — a housewife and a golf pro — in a small town in 1960s Montana. Nearby, an uncontrolled forest fire rages close to the Canadian border, and when Jerry loses his job (and his sense of purpose) he decides to join the cause of fighting the fire, leaving his wife and son to fend for themselves.','/hQSUwjSSRtWCA5EBoY22gGzaE8Y.jpg','2018-09-23',105,'Released',NULL,'Wildlife',417812,4.2951,6.6,'OoJpVQTY_t4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42687,_binary '\0','/mGBmiWmi7JqeTWnrPicRbkXcsuO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5929776',8.1,29781,'en','Before the Flood','A look at how climate change affects our environment and what society can do to prevent the demise of endangered species, ecosystems, and native communities across the planet.','/2fFTLaLbm8Ak7JBSYQ8Mb3jcFx9.jpg','2016-10-21',93,'Released','The science is clear, the future is not.','Before the Flood',410718,4.5417,7.7,'yyjr_3YnL_8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42688,_binary '\0','/trD8Th2ZfkpZLSvZwZu4q7bf1Z6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5930062',7.5,1270,'en','EFC','In this adrenaline-fueled story, the world of women\'s mixed martial arts is rocked by an explosive showdown between reigning champion Cassady Jones and rising star Alexa Star. The clash of these two titans sends shockwaves through the EFC, as the future of the sport hangs in the balance.','/kqloUNOICBmywXRE6ED2N2AHvJE.jpg','2024-08-20',87,'Released','Its not just another fight. Its the fight for everything.','EFC',393897,1.3115,4.2,'65BoFH_l634','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42689,_binary '\0','/izUFAnmnQLsR5lvwAt8LPv3WZCH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5931338',4.2,1367,'es','Horror Hotel The Movie','\"Aliens Stole My Boyfriend\" - Two cute alien chicks crash land their space buggy in the parking lot of the motor court looking for Earth boyfriends. \"Coma Girl\" - A macabre maintenance man falls in love with a comatose patient at the convalescent home where he works much to the dismay of her faithful husband. \"Brain Robbers In Love\" - A powerful older woman steals the body of a young woman using a top-secret brain-swapping devise stolen from a government vault. \"The Problem With Clones\" - A skip-tracer must search through a family of clones to find the sister who murdered her look alike. \"Four-Eyes\" - A paraplegic hit man is encouraged to pursue his gruesome talent by a man who wants to murder his ex-wife. \"Life After Men\" - In the near future, males are virtually extinct from disease and are tracked down my man hunters working for the new government.','/8vmtInukE6RIur4Rf5rbVMMUFiO.jpg','2016-10-21',103,'Released','Short slices of eerie tales taking place in a decrepit motor court motel in rural Georgia.','Horror Hotel The Movie',421822,1.0479,4.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42690,_binary '\0','/4kMf1NPk3OJyqUHbb2nVonuhhv7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5931726',6.9,2337,'en','The Julius House: An Aurora Teagarden Mystery','Aurora Teagarden is a beautiful young librarian with a passion for solving murders. After an exhaustive search for the perfect home, Aurora finally purchases her dream house, unaware of its murky history. As she prepares to move in, Aurora discovers that the family who once lived there mysteriously disappeared without a trace.','/uBwyOSg4JtgoZEpz9WQGFSVu4Yu.jpg','2016-10-16',84,'Released',NULL,'The Julius House: An Aurora Teagarden Mystery',414768,2.5644,6.9,'btWx6rVJ05w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42691,_binary '\0','/mYM8x2Atv4MaLulaV0KVJWI1Djv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5932368',3.1,5828,'en','Vanquish','Victoria is a young mother trying to put her dark past as a Russian drug courier behind her, but retired cop Damon forces Victoria to do his bidding by holding her daughter hostage. Now, Victoria must use guns, guts and a motorcycle to take out a series of violent gangsters—or she may never see her child again.','/AoWY1gkcNzabh229Icboa1Ff0BM.jpg','2021-04-16',96,'Released','She\'s got one night to save her life.','Vanquish',804435,3.6267,5.2,'fUElfp3DJ5Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42692,_binary '\0','/8jSzjgJFhV7nA5hG2LSq2qaG1BN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5932728',7.2,55613,'en','The Professor and the Madman','Professor James Murray begins work compiling words for the first edition of the Oxford English Dictionary in the mid 19th century, and receives over 10,000 entries from a patient at Broadmoor Criminal Lunatic Asylum, Dr. William Minor.','/gtGCDLhfjW96qVarwctnuTpGOtD.jpg','2019-03-07',124,'Released','The incredible true story that defined our world.','The Professor and the Madman',411728,5.6182,7.1,'8UG0-caYLfc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42693,_binary '\0','/jWrLZQHK3MBJwOgupZbjE2K8dEl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5933560',5.7,2826,'en','Permanent','This comedy, set in 1983 in small town Virginia, centers around a 13 year old and her family. The story of a hairstyle gone incredibly wrong and a young girl\'s plight to fit in while encountering bullies at a new school.','/fdnPEuJe69F58MphzHnXovcfBK0.jpg','2017-12-15',94,'Released','Hairstyles are temporary. Family is forever.','Permanent',450438,1.4976,5.2,'FwygvtzdhWk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42694,_binary '\0','/eoiQdUrCUtO29HueK0pnESaaky1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5934894',7.5,2808,'ta','தர்மதுரை','A once-promising village doctor, burdened by personal loss and family betrayal, spirals into alcoholism and becomes an outcast. His journey of pain, resilience, and rediscovery takes him from despair to a chance at redemption, as he confronts his past and searches for purpose, love, and reconciliation.','/cmSUOVaaaZsQRjSYpkSuWGbDStT.jpg','2016-08-19',167,'Released',NULL,'Dharmadurai',373587,1.2704,7.417,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42695,_binary '\0','/h6WbMYTl06WnWMaqlf4tfDttSPa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5934922',6.2,18265,'tr','İkimizin Yerine','Çiçek is a girl who grew up in a small village. She has so many questions about her own life with no answers. And then her life is changed by Dogan, her literature teacher.','/xdVEvb0WCzzcZxcf2DP8RCCZp1n.jpg','2016-10-21',126,'Released',NULL,'For Both of Us',449546,2.5136,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42696,_binary '\0','/50reJgWrWTXK3fvGh8idw71gxAO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5935704',7.1,41750,'hi','पद्मावत','Rajputana, India, 13th century. The tyrannical usurper Alauddin Khilji, sultan of Delhi, becomes obsessed with Queen Padmavati, wife of King Ratan Singh of Mewar, and goes to great lengths to satisfy his greed for her.','/5kk71s8Vmvt8XQOojevhTA5QcB0.jpg','2018-01-25',163,'Released','The Goddess Queen','Padmaavat',432527,2.7745,6.9,'X_5_BLt76c0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42697,_binary '\0','/xWOEcgMDWFIqhEgUtZydZ94ZVdy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5936492',5.7,5895,'en','The Witch in the Window','When Simon brings his twelve year-old son, Finn, to rural Vermont to help flip an old farmhouse, they encounter the malicious spirit of Lydia, a previous owner. And now with every repair they make – she\'s getting stronger.','/p4T3g4qZw5XDOZtRnjFIJ6ngjYT.jpg','2018-07-23',76,'Released','A New Start. An Old Spirit.','The Witch in the Window',521934,2.6655,6.1,'7tUnPTopmVc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42698,_binary '\0','/cLj1rpBxQU35G8lAn8WxQygBy3D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5936692',7.4,5258,'pl','Ostatnia rodzina','Beksiński is a gentle man with arachnophobia, despite his hardcore sexual fantasies and his fondness for painting disturbing dystopian works. Beksiński is a family man who wants only the best for his loving wife Zofia, neurotic son Tomasz and the couple\'s aging mothers. His daily painting to classical music eventually pays off and he makes a name for himself in contemporary art. Good Catholic woman Zofia tries to hold the family together, but troubled son Tomasz proves to be a handful with his violent outbursts and suicidal threats. Their relief is brief when he starts dating women and becomes a radio presenter and movie translator, and the concerned parents must be on constant watch to prevent their son from hurting himself. But Beksiński never believed that family life would always be sunshine and rainbows. As he tapes everything with his beloved camcorder, the 28-year Beksiński saga unfolds through paintings, near-death experiences, dance music trends and funerals...','/zkdH8b7gt5Pr6c4n2s9AiSv9lzq.jpg','2016-09-30',124,'Released','Family Life Isn\'t Always Sunshine and Rainbows','The Last Family',408292,1.3531,7.2,'XfFt9RfO9Bc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42699,_binary '\0','/w8VKCJuzbRRvhxYvGkBqK9HcNwj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5936866',6.2,6307,'en','A Dark Place','When a young boy turns up dead in a sleepy Pennsylvania town, a local sanitation truck driver, Donald, plays detective, embarking on a precarious and obsessive investigation to prove the boy was murdered.','/7QqFn9UzuSnh1uOPeSfYL1MFjkB.jpg','2018-10-07',89,'Released',NULL,'A Dark Place',412157,3.2502,6,'62zQXABj9GQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42700,_binary '\0','/hpy7XPjti4qFE0JevwQfrYJjcTl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5937296',7.6,2696,'bg','Slava','When Tsanko Petrov, a railroad worker, finds millions of lev on the train tracks, he decides to turn the entire amount over to the police. Grateful, the state rewards him with a new wristwatch… which soon stops working. Meanwhile, Julia Staikova, the head of PR for the Ministry of Transport, loses his old watch. Here starts Petrov’s desperate struggle to get back not only his old watch, but his dignity.','/zphTVGTM4oSisZGvWMUgns1JnGq.jpg','2017-03-02',101,'Released',NULL,'Glory',408293,1.0729,7.3,'uMVL6OrXS8E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42701,_binary '\0','/pymLNWKWStAtgjEkKqylbL0JC4t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5937770',5,5778,'en','Tell Me How I Die','When a group of college students take part in a clinical drug trial, an unexpected side effect of the experimental medicine gives them terrifying visions of their own deaths...which begin to come true. As they scramble to escape their fate, they discover that the killer is among them and shares their ability to see the future - only he seems to be one step ahead of their efforts to survive.','/edfgo6pyT1QFjbThLR1HfbNYl3g.jpg','2016-09-16',107,'Released','Knowing your fate is a real killer.','Tell Me How I Die',410876,3.4118,5.405,'XoLq4qWelD8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42702,_binary '\0','/c7tQ6auyiA8JAy6oBPwBG3kJIAR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5938084',5.7,2282,'tl','BuyBust','A special forces team is sent to snuff out a drug den, but find themselves trapped inside it after being set-up and betrayed.','/vvArzms4uGDAlqo6JfeAe0b4ro4.jpg','2018-08-01',127,'Released','How many lives are you willing to sacrifice?','BuyBust',496283,1.7196,5.9,'iE4D82n9VpE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42703,_binary '\0','/w6S5oV26ehgLe5QbGKlAd4NdAab.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5938950',7.3,2959,'en','Mystify: Michael Hutchence','Michael Hutchence was flying high as the lead singer of the legendary rock band INXS until his untimely death in 1997. Richard Lowenstein’s documentary examines Hutchence’s deeply felt life through his many loves and demons.','/qpxLFHp9B9EHKM96JZXJ8uf7ObG.jpg','2019-04-28',102,'Released',NULL,'Mystify: Michael Hutchence',586534,1.7812,7.2,'JRIFR3hkIpo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42704,_binary '\0','/A1ZpRTfpqDlKf0WkG51t4b1GBqW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5940342',3.6,1430,'en','Unhinged','Four American best friends decide to take the back roads travelling to a wedding in England, on their way a deadly secret forces the girls to be stranded in the woods, where they discover a house occupied by Miss Perkins.','/lDBEHBviHzxOeF4s4UF5hvEcsnt.jpg','2017-09-25',93,'Released','Something lurks in the attic...','Unhinged',454417,1.5422,4.8,'Hv5KlJayMLY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42705,_binary '\0','/5OoR3aVpxXluSCe9P5mhqOa36Gb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5941692',5.8,14503,'en','Miss Bala','Gloria finds a power she never knew she had when she is drawn into a dangerous world of cross-border crime. Surviving will require all of her cunning, inventiveness, and strength.','/ae9yrSAS7nLZPbbkOm61pSuIqeo.jpg','2019-01-25',104,'Released','Who would you become to save your family?','Miss Bala',500852,6.1508,6.3,'e-kPf-n4Mto','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42706,_binary '\0','/4jl01n7DgpTmqhGzOA0VC9kG0ST.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5942864',6.5,3651,'de','Styx','Rike is forty, a successful doctor whose job demands everything of her. She intends to use her much-needed annual holiday to fulfill her long-cherished dream of sailing alone from Gibraltar to Ascension, a small tropical island in the middle of the Atlantic. Her desire for a carefree holiday seems to be coming to pass but then, after a storm, her beautiful adventure suddenly turns into an unprecedented challenge when she spots a badly damaged, hopelessly overloaded refugee boat nearby.','/1I8xzhPPgoGAwDvGkjYNZqQgON.jpg','2018-09-13',94,'Released',NULL,'Styx',500853,1.4284,6.3,'4fREBiAyu2g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42707,_binary '\0','/6cKcmARVCYWsnvsB5uGx1DKzhYh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5943306',5,3229,'hi','फ्रीकी अली','A debt collector becomes a major sensation when he takes on the rich man\'s sport of golfing.','/5MfW0eNdoPCihc6ce25uo62H6GH.jpg','2016-09-09',120,'Released',NULL,'Freaky Ali',414276,1.1311,5.654,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42708,_binary '\0','/2N0XZxyPB8WSPcmijVSywyezV1e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5944496',6.5,1878,'en','Christmas Homecoming','A military widow, whose faith in Christmas has lapsed, rents an apartment to a handsome Army Captain, recovering from an injury in battle, and whose faith in Christmas is inspirational. As they team up to save the town’s military museum with a Christmas fundraising event, these two ‘wounded birds’ find themselves falling in love — and being healed by the magic of Christmas.','/6tviM77Kfi2bfvyrMLQ4fAHkz6e.jpg','2017-11-18',85,'Released',NULL,'Christmas Homecoming',479614,2.0104,6.7,'vHcEiz9hXkU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42709,_binary '\0','/wd76Uiph8xFZob8o6wjZcX5kaca.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5944812',3.5,1983,'en','Dead Sunrise','When the sun rises on an unsuspecting group of friends on a bushland road trip, so does the horror. They have stumbled upon an abandoned facility, yet there are children on the grounds, showing signs of reanimated life. And these children are hungry...','/clt1ET8F9ZF4SHB0w9S35U4NiO5.jpg','2016-09-13',80,'Released','An Aussie zombie film. With flesh-eating chldren.','Dead Sunrise',428420,1.3779,2.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42710,_binary '\0','/d2plahqbICvNTAvhk2lM0HojJGG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5946128',7.4,47941,'hi','Dear Zindagi','Kaira, a young girl, faces problems in her relationships. She meets Dr Jehangir, who helps her resolve her issues with her parents and get a new perspective on life, which leads to her following her passion and an improvement in her love life.','/oUg0N2isgZ5rrxdXnsemcKolfKZ.jpg','2016-11-23',151,'Released',NULL,'Dear Zindagi',413543,3.8377,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42711,_binary '\0','/vQISDnlCDr5PwG7PO53jYPcJImE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5946852',7.2,9590,'te','జనతా గ్యారేజ్','Anand is an environmental activist who lives in Mumbai. A chance exchange programme takes him to Hyderabad and here, a chance encounter with Satyam results in him taking over the Janatha Garage from the latter.','/1RiIzc08FG6kBr0E4LpUwSmtwcE.jpg','2016-09-01',165,'Released','All repairs are done here...','Janatha Garage',405924,2.0846,7.073,'7O4Hm070Bc8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42712,_binary '\0','/w3Fhu8dYbXSDwhiCuS8yDzOtohH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5947416',7.1,2533,'ko','덕혜옹주','Under the oppressive Japanese colonial rule, Deok-hye, the last Princess of the declining Joseon Dynasty, is forced to move to Japan. She spends her days missing home, while struggling to maintain dignity as a princess. After a series of failed tries, Deok-hye makes her final attempt to return home with help of her childhood sweetheart, Jang-han.','/sLPHjuCySL3re0qtdz3XJQdx61I.jpg','2016-08-03',126,'Released','Based on the true story of the last princess of the last empire.','The Last Princess',408360,2.5095,6.576,'SEoyVa6Y1W4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42713,_binary '\0','/7YUmBBNxlH6JLk9S7mJ3XVLZmTv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5949038',4.2,1697,'en','Redwood','A couple hiking out in the woods, disturb a nest of vampires.','/jm61ivvqfLjg0XemsSeXOAvzzHa.jpg','2017-08-24',80,'Released','Find yourself, before they find you.','Redwood',450829,1.4699,4.9,'RYtM_IVnmI4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42714,_binary '\0','/x74bdNj7uwpyUZPOhrldDUJvINe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5949946',6.3,2375,'en','My Christmas Dream','A department store manager sets out to create an amazing holiday display window to impress the owner. She asks a recently-fired employee to help her make the display, and as they work together, they start to fall in love.','/jCrE3Twc7PeLev4sCHkMtOPdrA5.jpg','2016-11-26',84,'Released',NULL,'My Christmas Dream',415962,2.023,5.8,'aNGarRXVm1c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42715,_binary '\0','/yRBc6WY3r1Fz5Cjd6DhSvzqunED.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5950044',7,443215,'en','Superman','Superman, a journalist in Metropolis, embarks on a journey to reconcile his Kryptonian heritage with his human upbringing as Clark Kent.','/ldyfo0BKmz5rWtJJKCvwaNS4cJT.jpg','2025-07-09',130,'Released','Look up.','Superman',1061474,43.0213,7.3,'MikgqM0LXr4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42716,_binary '\0','/gh9YcpJ01IsrwGkB3IK8K3LWQ25.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5951188',6.6,11114,'ru','Балканский рубеж','After the NATO bombing of Yugoslavia in 1999, the Yugoslav army pulls out of Kosovo region, leaving Serbian people at the mercy of the Albanian UCK. A small band of soldiers must take over the Slatina airport, and hold it until the Russian peacekeepers arrive.','/okiB4NUriKKbGjAtVSzveicPTtu.jpg','2019-03-21',130,'Released','No choice','Balkan Line',517093,4.861,7.4,'IcKtzxH4TQA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42717,_binary '\0','/wm5QhKgitszib5KjaWeNK6yAgoj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5952138',5.6,11303,'en','We Have Always Lived in the Castle','In Shirleyville, Vermont, during the sixties, sisters Merricat and Constance, along with their ailing uncle Julian, confined to a wheelchair, live isolated in a big mansion located on the hill overlooking the town, tormented by the memories of a family tragedy occurred six years ago. The arrival of cousin Charles will threaten the fragile equilibrium of their minds, haunted by madness, fear and superstition.','/ejp1MQSlekBjH3bBJrBlWItpmQW.jpg','2019-05-17',96,'Released',NULL,'We Have Always Lived in the Castle',411144,3.6715,5.548,'NQg-nUoMCBo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42718,_binary '\0','/fHkDtfR9u4tDfL803OOtTwfDqhF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5952266',7.8,3662,'en','The Ivory Game','Wildlife activists and investigators put their lives on the line to battle the illegal African ivory trade, in this suspenseful on-the-ground documentary.','/dWFyOj0wk8AFLqC8PH5LRD3kJht.jpg','2016-09-02',112,'Released','The hunt for the hunter begins','The Ivory Game',411023,1.4069,7.6,'3GPEKKaSmZY','YouTube','Trailer','202