nd Pakistani nurses are held hostage in Iraq by a terrorist organization, a renowned Indian secret agent is drawn out of hiding to rescue them.','/mdzNLFfCfuBoJz43l0SmMWWdu5t.jpg','2017-12-18',160,'Released','There will be peace.','Tiger Zinda Hai',441909,2.9775,6.253,'ePO5M5DE01I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42727,_binary '\0','/b6lDdjAJ5uuHmYAv9eT7dUyGVvS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5957584',6.2,3747,'en','Girl in the Box','The true story of 20-year-old Colleen Stan, a hitchhiking woman abducted by a young couple and held captive for seven years, during which time she\'s tortured and forced to live as a slave to her captors.','/uLH92vwvTlOjnSCG5JqJtH1fT9p.jpg','2016-09-10',87,'Released','Held captive for 7 years. Her story of courage is timeless.','Girl in the Box',413337,8.8369,6.7,'Ho9rhKXjwE8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42728,_binary '\0','/stD9ZDLBcoawB8tG5VtcaJn60qH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5959700',6,3362,'ta','தொடரி','A pantry boy falls in love with the touch-up girl of an actress travelling on his train, but an incident turns the train into an unstoppable force posing a threat to the passengers, and the romance.','/bUCE3kTWr80lYCNiJpV1IonPNCX.jpg','2016-09-22',168,'Released',NULL,'Thodari',376446,1.4689,4.476,'Gs3widGw6Tw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42729,_binary '\0','/vboN3mozqR4n6NRoQhsbvmaRuyo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5959952',7.5,1747,'en','Mission Control: The Unsung Heroes of Apollo','At the heart of the Apollo program was the special team in Mission Control who put a man on the moon and helped create the future.','/5pBpq1fieUBcoFUM4lbGp8dUKR6.jpg','2017-03-14',101,'Released','No giant leap is made alone.','Mission Control: The Unsung Heroes of Apollo',440319,1.2973,7.3,'GVDTSfyFTTY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42730,_binary '\0','/51ypVhVjplqXBycQiiumjXW98VT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5959980',8.4,24875,'ta','வடசென்னை','Anbu, a young carrom player in North Chennai becomes inadvertently involved in an ongoing conflict between two local gangsters.','/12TfMF60mrh9Uo5MD98zKUkSQ9t.jpg','2018-10-17',166,'Released',NULL,'Vada Chennai',410331,2.2327,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42731,_binary '\0','/qXzqEcHs9YcEgkjoNdWvxM2kIqZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5960374',5.8,21607,'en','Vox Lux','In 1999, teenage sisters Celeste and Eleanor survive a seismic, violent tragedy. The sisters compose and perform a song about their experience, making something lovely and cathartic out of catastrophe — while also catapulting Celeste to stardom. By 2017, the now 31-year-old Celeste is mother to a teenage daughter of her own and struggling to navigate a career fraught with scandals when another act of terrifying violence demands her attention.','/xmFOjB5bGvFqNzsX5TbIWzdvpGd.jpg','2018-09-07',114,'Released','A twenty-first century portrait.','Vox Lux',429202,3.9384,5.7,'-y4ti900jog','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42732,_binary '\0','/oYWQGbtxJEjeBUlB6dQm2Nb1Uyn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5960464',6.8,1589,'ur','جانان','The story of a Pakhtun girl who returns from Canada to attend her cousin\'s wedding in Swat, Pakistan and falls in love.','/xXjleOzKUoVyVJDQJaivO9kGtzk.jpg','2016-09-08',133,'Released',NULL,'Janaan',416238,0.8468,6.5,'UyAll2hOch0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42733,_binary '\0','/6DNcCxEn4AL7lUoDcmOEenn1BnM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5962210',6.6,52673,'en','Ingrid Goes West','Ingrid becomes obsessed with a social network star named Taylor Sloane who seemingly has a perfect life. But when Ingrid decides to drop everything and move west to be Taylor\'s friend, her behaviour turns unsettling and dangerous.','/3LEyW11onDltXHo0L1X23j9Nnvg.jpg','2017-08-11',98,'Released','She\'ll follow you.','Ingrid Goes West',411741,6.0482,6.4,'2STZ5D3yi74','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42734,_binary '\0','/iIKvL2Q4sWqneySQxg4mm8k9CUq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5963218',8.3,6974,'si','ආලෝකෝ උදපාදි','Aloko Udapadi is a Sinhalese epic historical film based on the story of King Valagamba of Anuradhapura (89 – 77 BCE).','/ccYZOP6Vt7O23DS1NpIA53OD5VV.jpg','2017-01-20',113,'Released',NULL,'Light Arose',443125,2.4586,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42735,_binary '\0','/hKIGH0X7TxvS2UU0Ixrl7pxO3G9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5966602',6.7,3306,'ru','Завод','When a factory is bound to close, a group of workers decides to take action against the owner.','/xWUPJmVA93U8QpzaUIqcR2iCeyG.jpg','2018-09-07',109,'Released',NULL,'The Factory',513349,3.375,6.3,'MUNIgCB8A18','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42736,_binary '\0','/eoZEmBq7R29c2Ma6OcHInyIZR6w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5966750',6.6,1218,'ko','싱글라이더','Promising fund manager Jae-hoon is at the brink of losing everything when his company goes bankrupt. Overwhelmed by despair, he takes an impulsive trip to Australia where his wife and son live. As his trip nears its unexpected end, Jae-hoon gets a chance to look back on his life.','/8IOObR7vo4K1moBRv8AOMsg5J6U.jpg','2017-02-22',97,'Released','A man visits his family in Australia after losing everything only to find another shocking truth…','A Single Rider',435603,2.0636,7.244,'5Tsb6D61nJk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42737,_binary '\0','/hrPM6KM36D0NhcEGL9t76tHG2XP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5968274',6.7,16787,'en','The Angel','True story of Ashraf Marwan, who was President Nasser\'s son-in-law and special adviser and confidant to his successor Anwar Sadat - while simultaneously Israeli Intelligence\'s most precious asset of the 20th century. Based on NYT bestselling book \'The Angel: The Egyptian Spy Who Saved Israel\' by Uri Bar-Joseph.','/d5vBixJD1coOvHvr8N2pbyffxFU.jpg','2018-05-15',114,'Released',NULL,'The Angel',468362,3.8075,6.552,'z0q2WbXQWbw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42738,_binary '\0','/xnz8kkRvqpzzDbRXONwVEjT78t7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5968394',6,60809,'en','Captive State','Nearly a decade after occupation by an extraterrestrial force, the lives of a Chicago neighborhood on both sides of the conflict are explored. In a working-class Chicago neighborhood occupied by an alien force for nine years, increased surveillance and the restriction of civil rights have given rise to an authoritarian system -- and dissent among the populace.','/u2ccL7X3osXwn3txIuXENRHmYQ5.jpg','2019-03-15',110,'Released','10 years ago, they took our planet. Today, we take it back!','Captive State',429471,8.2789,5.666,'ESxrJtJfIFU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42739,_binary '\0','/9n7RHq9ffObPf7ZDtN9DgXSULCx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5968910',6.1,1652,'en','Love on a Limb','Aimie Roarke is always up for a cause and when the town’s beloved Oak tree is set to be cut down, she takes it upon herself try and save it. When the Mayor hires a handsome new landscaper to cut it down, she decides the only way to save the tree is to chain herself to it. As Kyle attempts to wait her out and the two start to spend more time together, they may find the Old Tree brings them both more than they could have imagined in life and love.','/73hqur493IUZQhl3DAM2NKo7O19.jpg','2016-10-01',84,'Released',NULL,'Love on a Limb',412974,1.863,6.4,'o678Mp_Smdc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42740,_binary '\0','/uZZSGBtOkz2n3PT2gS0oUy8avId.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5969180',5.1,2339,'en','I Hate Kids','Nick Pearson is a life-long bachelor who is finally settling down. On the brink of his wedding he is surprised to find he has a 13 year old son who has come to find his him through the help of a psychic. The problem is Nick can\'t stand kids and would happily send the boy back to live with his biological mother, except that no one has any clue who that might be. Having nowhere to turn Nick must hit the road with the boy and the neurotic, inept psychic to track down dozens of his disgraced ex-flings to whom he must ask the awkward question - with very mixed results.','/zD6kuWM0W2qSlqCJljRFUnByBou.jpg','2019-01-18',89,'Released','3 words made him famous. 3 days will change his life.','I Hate Kids',511789,2.2919,5.8,'hJURFvWJYDA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42741,_binary '\0','/3gRvfpmPtBrJ5Xp6iLFyz7pJ06d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5969696',7.1,9630,'ko','군함도','During the Japanese colonial era, roughly 400 Korean people, who were forced onto Battleship Island \'Hashima Island\' to mine for coal, attempt to escape.','/7Pn9IK13JHhB7vS5TSgz79cdLra.jpg','2017-07-26',132,'Released','1945 Hashima. We called it hell on earth.','The Battleship Island',436391,4.6442,7.2,'9m92wZiU2sE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42742,_binary '\0','/mWFDBX8IwajnlxiEYVaLGXxfgQ1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5969846',5.3,1358,'fr','Sous le même toit','Delphine and Yvan divorce. While his financial situation does not allow him to find a home, Yvan remembers that he owns 20% of his ex-wife\'s house. He then returned to live with Delphine, in his 20%. The two ex will discover the joys of forced housemates.','/o8ZtzvBXiXJpAlHIPYmjzE3TKiO.jpg','2017-04-19',97,'Released','The hardest part of a separation is to live...','Room(h)ates',426962,2.3747,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42743,_binary '\0','/qFfcH6T5QkBHKFJd3n3YrQA4ekS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5970844',4.1,23193,'hi','Thugs of Hindostan','After the British company’s officer Clive takes over the kingdom of Mirza, Princess Zafira and Khudabaksh aka Azaad form a band of rebel pirates who swear to defeat the English officer and win their freedom back. The British Company in return, hire the wily thug Firangi track Azaad’s gang and thwart his plans.','/eonEvymAPpXvWvbBu21HYJx8VdS.jpg','2018-11-07',164,'Released',NULL,'Thugs of Hindostan',472138,2.6349,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42744,_binary '\0','/pbMbDlOAkVuvnxovBA2ENin59xH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5971474',7.2,180347,'en','The Little Mermaid','The youngest of King Triton’s daughters, and the most defiant, Ariel longs to find out more about the world beyond the sea, and while visiting the surface, falls for the dashing Prince Eric. With mermaids forbidden to interact with humans, Ariel makes a deal with the evil sea witch, Ursula, which gives her a chance to experience life on land, but ultimately places her life – and her father’s crown – in jeopardy.','/ym1dxyOk4jFcSl4Q2zmRrA5BEEN.jpg','2023-05-18',135,'Released','Be a part of her world.','The Little Mermaid',447277,22.2973,6.2,'0-wPm99PF9U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42745,_binary '\0','/mUccS2WUYois8DEUbvZMVxnHDwq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5972292',5.1,1253,'ml','തൃശ്ശിവപേരൂർ ക്ലിപ്തം','All that David Pauly ever wanted in life was to witness the downfall of his high school nemesis Chembaden Joey. When Joey louses up Davy\'s betrothal ceremony, Davy and his friends vow to scheme up something that would button up Joey forever. Enter Giri, a village boy who joins the gang on the mission, for vested interests of course. But little did he know then, about Baagirathi or the misadventures that awaited the gang on their revenge quest.','/7sN8NczPQAn2C3iUbZ1Z81oP3Sj.jpg','2017-08-11',138,'Released',NULL,'Thrissivaperoor Kliptham',428662,0.7918,4.556,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42746,_binary '\0','/AkhWGmBaEAFMCALYT3Zr1FQhYnj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt5973032',6.3,5911,'ja','アンチポルノ','Kyôko, a traumatized young Japanese girl, finds herself struggling with her self-confidence in her adult life. Growing up in a family without her mother and her sister, she constantly questions the rationale of sex and the notion of liberty in modern Japanese society.','/cSvswZ64qtYsrwXyvkce2LJv4fZ.jpg','2017-01-28',76,'Release