where the region\'s geopolitical strategies and alliances are in discussion, Argentine president Hernán Blanco endures political and family drama that will force him to face his own demons.','/gy2fvMbEuR1uJYGpM7oJ91HFRgl.jpg','2017-08-17',114,'Released','Ambition has no limits','The Summit',440374,2.6202,5.9,'3ov0Y9pWj1E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42851,_binary '\0','/wbhlajDQaPpeYkYxN0Gikhpmbzz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6047684',8,1239,'en','Signed, Sealed, Delivered: Lost Without You','Oliver\'s Divine Delivery Theory is put to the test when he and the POstables seem to be unable to deliver a damaged letter from a military veteran that\'s a matter of life and death.','/u7LaDx0TI9KWkhlIV5p9vegq2yD.jpg','2016-09-25',84,'Released',NULL,'Signed, Sealed, Delivered: Lost Without You',414762,1.8829,7.2,'9N5CvsehwJA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42852,_binary '\0','/pHIF6Uc79qcquP5LEz22yPUpSOc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6047974',7.3,1538,'ja','LUPIN THE IIIRD 血煙の石川五ェ門','A yakuza boss hires Goemon Ishikawa, a modern day samurai, to protect him aboard his cruise ship casino. Everything goes sideways when the famous thief, Lupin the Third, tries to rob the vessel. Lupin\'s being hunted by a powerful and mysterious man: the so called “Ghost of Bermuda.” With Goemon\'s employer dead in the ensuing chaos, his honor is at stake, and the only way to preserve it is with blood. But this opponent is like no other, and to make things right, Goemon may need to sharpen not only his sword, but himself as well!','/gdITbnd5QJzSWhntA3KkvQV4JHV.jpg','2017-02-04',54,'Released','Everything must return to the soil.','Lupin the 3rd: Goemon\'s Blood Spray',456611,5.3472,7.807,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42853,_binary '\0','/wGUKAVlDbhcgDlni2OAtGPnWsv2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6048582',7,1421,'en','The Falls: Covenant of Grace','Chris and RJ, former Mormon missionaries who fell in love seven years ago, are struggling to make their relationship work amid conflicts with their families and their faith. Determined to finally find closure and put the past behind them, the two men set in motion a quest for unconditional love that ultimately leads to the very top of the LDS leadership.','/7JjbAMJXyW9IKHIuJ8s7W1sS8NV.jpg','2016-09-01',119,'Released',NULL,'The Falls: Covenant of Grace',426639,2.2802,6.7,'7fWO9S6CAvo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42854,_binary '\0','/xXBnM6uSTk6qqCf0SRZKXcga9Ba.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6048922',7,136698,'en','Greyhound','A first-time captain leads a convoy of allied ships carrying thousands of soldiers across the treacherous waters of the \"Black Pit\" to the front lines of WWII. With no air cover protection for 5 days, the captain and his convoy must battle the surrounding enemy Nazi U-boats in order to give the allies a chance to win the war.','/kjMbDciooTbJPofVXgAoFjfX8Of.jpg','2020-07-09',92,'Released','The only thing more dangerous than the front lines was the fight to get there.','Greyhound',516486,13.5986,7.4,'5Byeq_hyh2U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42855,_binary '\0','/p1jxdxtZA8SdmgGgfYepfUhQ3NG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6048930',5.4,23801,'en','Naked','Following a wild night out with his best man, Rob Anderson wakes up to find himself naked in an elevator on the morning of his wedding day and is forced to relive the morning over and over again.','/qXRmYSB9C6SHdxTgY3wB72Riz9Y.jpg','2017-08-11',96,'Released','It\'s deja groom all over again.','Naked',433251,4.6777,5.8,'nIgeVoVMv90','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42856,_binary '\0','/dtGQWzmceUcR3IaH1JZvp1gKyI9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6051096',4.7,6158,'en','The Axiom','At the risk of her group\'s safety, a young woman travels into a National Forest where her sister has become trapped in a multi-dimensional world of monsters.','/6lxM6WEXxJUFOsnHbWPIYnwiT0c.jpg','2019-05-09',98,'Released','There are monsters in the forest. Don\'t tell.','The Axiom',517166,1.2156,5.4,'5245ZAYnwlw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42857,_binary '\0','/6IMhJ8o93iNNSLRaSqIVIA1S5Y8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6051260',4.5,3545,'en','Cruel Peter','It is Christmas 1908 in Messina, one of the richest merchant cities of the Mediterranean. Peter, the 13 year-old son of a rich English family is notorious for his cruelty to children, animals and servants. One night he is ambushed and wakes up in a coffin underground in the city\'s Gothic cemetery, buried in retaliation for his callousness by a servant boy from his mother\'s estate. When a powerful earthquake razes Messina to the ground, Peter is trapped and his whereabouts are forgotten. Until a century later an English archaeologist and his daughter arrive in the city.','/1CXlIZFOOjpEwoTbvqVLmp9zWrM.jpg','2020-02-06',95,'Released','He was the cruellest of all','Cruel Peter',664561,1.8087,5,'jGIDN4XRbXQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42858,_binary '\0','/uidAL9cOqEXzFtA0eM7atsHwm99.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6053192',4.6,1249,'en','House Red','When a couple travel to a remote vineyard in the south of Italy to spend the summer grape picking they soon discover that there is more to the terroir than meets the eye.','/hVTVpY6vxDvJwK3Yu15tDC687LS.jpg','2022-11-14',77,'Released',NULL,'House Red',733822,1.3763,3.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42859,_binary '\0','/mLwIDLa1FMkbKLteZRTatyvWLHX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6053438',7.1,68449,'en','First Reformed','A pastor of a small church in upstate New York starts to spiral out of control after a soul-shaking encounter with an unstable environmental activist and his pregnant wife.','/8HKA3Hwf8jQWy8TCYWr7C8Wft23.jpg','2018-05-18',113,'Released','The kingdom come undone.','First Reformed',458737,5.4684,7,'81-yub7Om6E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42860,_binary '\0','/9morAQCYVy