er Chiara, whom she had left over thirty years ago. Chiara was just eight years old at the time. She now approaches her mother with an unusual request: to spend ten days together with her.','/AqSYUeWKo7CfJqJh8uIzpeTuXqo.jpg','2018-02-23',113,'Released',NULL,'Sunday\'s Illness',442811,2.2193,6.6,'JjsBlJOQypw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42864,_binary '\0','/lFCwomQD5nYUXrj5dyqRJBN562b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6054058',5.8,4508,'te','ఖైదీ నెం.150','A convict who plans to escape the country unexpectedly switches his place with a good Samaritan who fights for the rights of poor farmers.','/fTtE0ENBSYEQeMhucVVFglUWemx.jpg','2017-01-15',147,'Released',NULL,'Khaidi No. 150',412326,1.3173,5.846,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42865,_binary '\0','/9F30DYjHZ2UEMHNm5LxZaPfnkbF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6054290',7.3,3570,'zh','七月与安生','The film spans two decades, as the story unfolds in a series of flashbacks that begin when Qiyue and Ansheng were just thirteen. The two became inseparable, until they met a boy who ended up tearing their lives apart.','/gVgKn7hV6nMNyE6WjFz1QTnLhtS.jpg','2016-09-14',110,'Released',NULL,'SoulMate',417419,2.2911,7.19,'6E44dDxcos8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42866,_binary '\0','/slo4uAwTb08rAq99pgLbV30oZzo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6054650',6.1,1283,'en','A Question of Faith','When Tragedy Strikes three Families, their Destiny forces them on a coverging path and mercy as the challenges of their fate could also resurrect their beliefs','/4DwBNsU23aI3A83Mtpj2QDmmXAH.jpg','2017-09-29',104,'Released',NULL,'A Question of Faith',467433,3.1276,7.48,'QzNuMWxPo80','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42867,_binary '\0','/mXdxoXvtoOxQ3mnzbzuvpGuJ8cW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6054758',8.2,8623,'kn','ಕಿರಿಕ್ ಪಾರ್ಟಿ','Karna from a small town has joined this engineering college and he gangs up with his hostel mates Loki, Alexander, Manja and others to fuel a lot of mischief in the college.','/16gpI8K51r2FzZ9wE0VXmrG5v9c.jpg','2016-12-30',165,'Released',NULL,'Kirik Party',433327,1.4715,7.6,'IfvnbER_6sQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42868,_binary '\0','/dLaU69dwoBIlhEqKvdoYn0cMmJa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6054846',6.2,5678,'no','Amundsen','The story of Norwegian explorer Roald Amundsen, the leader of the first expedition to reach the South Pole in 1911, and the first person to reach both the North and South Poles in 1926. Follows his all-consuming drive as a polar explorer and the tragedy he brought on himself and others by sacrificing everything in the icy wastelands to achieve his dream.','/yvz9rsCnqq1F0MauURPzps11Y6S.jpg','2019-02-15',125,'Released','Not the story of a hero','Amundsen',545836,3.1498,6,'WeLMOaf-4k4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42869,_binary '\0','/luMg4yboE00qGuSMTQc88UOfVne.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6054874',6.1,4261,'ru','Легенда о Коловрате','A story of a legendary battle, where seventeen fearless warriors defend their land against an army of thousands well-trained soldiers. In 13th-century Mongol warrior hordes and their leader, Batu Khan, control most of the known world. As the Mongols move towards Europe they invade the last Russian principality standing in their way. Little do they know, their plans are about to be ruined by a small detachment of heroic strong men led by a mysterious brave warrior. This is a story about courage, endurance and self-sacrifice for the sake of one\'s country. This is the story of Evpaty the Furious.','/4XCA70oDgYSBLJDvOgYs1Ca4rBm.jpg','2017-11-30',117,'Released',NULL,'Furious',415381,3.0446,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42870,_binary '\0','/7D7rmTFfP4eJg4MVp1ZWRHtJ37H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6055082',4.1,1331,'en','My Pet Dinosaur','When a young boy named Jake accidentally makes a new friend in an experiment gone wrong a troubled town is plunged into chaos. But with the creature rapidly evolving every day, Jake finds it increasingly difficult to keep his new pet secret. Jake\'s friends and new girl Abbie realize they are not the only ones interested in this strange, mischievous little dinosaur and soon discover that the only thing more mysterious than what it is, is who is looking for it.','/4IqrMLYLC11Z5W5eZkgeejabLj7.jpg','2017-04-22',96,'Released','Making friends is easy, keeping them is impossible...','My Pet Dinosaur',449700,2.1433,5.4,'ElbEomGet4Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42871,_binary '\0','/7D3mPNjf8l872N1S1aWBLAp2S7Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6056644',6.4,1446,'te','మజ్ను','Aditya, an assistant director, tries to impress Suma by narrating his old love story. However, while narrating the story, he realizes his true feelings for his ex-lover.','/jSEQrbrHbimWiSr5NmoUtNCaIrp.jpg','2016-09-23',138,'Released','Stop Drinking Start Loving','Majnu',409254,1.7027,6,'Y6ktNdbenGY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42872,_binary '\0','/91YouXHP7MufOfl1Ymw2LWKh6x2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6057032',7,2905,'en','Gook','Eli and Daniel, two Korean American brothers who own a struggling women\'s shoe store, have an unlikely friendship with 11-year-old Kamilla. On the first day of the 1992 L.A. riots, the trio must defend their store—and contemplate the meaning of family, their personal dreams and the future.','/Ij6zyFnVd3ha5uR5b4na3LYux6.jpg','2017-08-18',94,'Released',NULL,'Gook',432942,2.3387,6.5,'6Duh20o-qWs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42873,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6058226',7.3,2767,'ka','ექვთიმე ღვთისკაცი','Man who was a Guardian of The National Treasure of his homeland Sakartvelo (Georgia) in France placed in 39 big boxes, did not lose any item and brought it back in 1945 after 24 years of struggle and became a national hero.','/vK0yyX9bZ2DVbjAKzp0vAs2mWR0.jpg','2018-01-20',140,'Released',NULL,'Ekvtime: Man of God',573192,0.943,9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42874,_binary '\0','/hXCC1dBarQyyV6UrYQ6JrCNO5WN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6058394',6.1,2077,'hi','Anaarkali of Aarah','Hailing from Aarah in Bihar, Anarkali is an item girl, famous for her vocals, suggestive dance moves and innuendo laden lyrics. She enjoys her stardom and revels in the lusty glances. The singer acknowledges that she is no saint and even makes peace with the hatred she evokes among civilised society but what she refuses to tolerate is being exploited in public by an influential politician.','/nRK1wUXVtiSHNPDRuLPgsQJcteT.jpg','2017-03-24',113,'Released',NULL,'Anaarkali of Aarah',449361,0.9261,6.846,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42875,_binary '\0','/c4MhvYvcVACqfdyQ7PPjQrDKzK8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6059074',6.6,3793,'ml','ജോമോന്‍റെ സുവിശേഷങ്ങൾ...','A wayward youth of a rich father, Jomon is a carefree youngster who doesn’t care about ‘being responsible enough’ for his age. When the family lands in a financial soup out of the blue, a different side of the youngster surprisingly emerges. ​','/bGGYarM9KGD61F7Rmdioz6TJOuk.jpg','2017-01-19',157,'Released',NULL,'Jomonte Suvisheshangal',432583,1.3229,6.44,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42876,_binary '\0','/oAfqzybJRDH01EqY77QAaVdnxO2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6060156',6.8,23383,'es','Toc Toc','A group of patients meet at a prestigious psychologist\'s office. Apart from the day and time of the appointment, something else unites them all: all six suffer from OCD. But the plane bringing the doctor is unexpectedly delayed, which forces them to spend an endless wait until the doctor shows up. Will they be able to keep their manias, impulses, convulsions, obsessions and rituals at bay during the wait?','/8OM0FBfnpHmJVX9IiiuLGld3J6k.jpg','2017-09-01',96,'Released','I have to watch it. I have to watch it. I have to watch it. I have to watch it.','Toc Toc',437033,4.0631,7.1,'gnhjP