-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42892,_binary '\0','/rtAW7KxJREyVFtnNSXlviU9Wu7w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6076226',5.8,2866,'en','Rise of the Footsoldier 3','In the late 1980s, Pat Tate journeys from peddling pills in Marbella to his time in prison, where he solidifies his power before his release to reclaim his turf.','/1LgOIQNpTfWKY3wizRrQ6CvNAXK.jpg','2017-11-03',99,'Released',NULL,'Rise of the Footsoldier 3',484889,4.8513,6.357,'jzPsLEHImzk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42893,_binary '\0','/gbCzkatpXMJwejQcUi8eeslvNqQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6076366',8,3535,'ta','ஆண்டவன் கட்டளை','A young man, on the advice of an agent, lies that he is married, to go to London. But his visa application is rejected and now, he has to follow-up with a string of lies to hide one lie.','/rtythafvdg795tzwR4jeBMmonkL.jpg','2016-09-23',151,'Released',NULL,'Aandavan Kattalai',410432,1.5937,7.923,'PY2sEuriqLM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42894,_binary '\0','/pFTXI109QsSGxi3agfywAa5lpSw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6076802',6.6,2278,'en','Pumpkin Pie Wars','Competing bakery owners, Faye McKenzie and Lydia Harper have been feuding for years with the Lake Shore County Harvest Festival’s annual pumpkin pie bake-off at the center of it all. The winner not only gets bragging rights and a trophy, but a substantial boost to her business, as well. This year, however, the women are passing the torch to their respective children, Casey and Sam, and when romantic sparks fly between them, this bake-off promises to be one to remember.','/3Cf1XSafdv5t4reOV3FrVvi9PIb.jpg','2016-10-15',83,'Released',NULL,'Pumpkin Pie Wars',413440,1.7952,6.1,'LsqqMapbPME','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42895,_binary '\0','/fRKa59uee0pJSEm4zgVAheBEjw5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6078532',6.2,2159,'el','Καζαντζάκης','The true story of the greatest Greek writer of the 20th century, Nikos Kazantzakis, based on his work, Report 