taught her everything she needs to know about trust and survival, is brutally killed, Anna vows revenge. As she becomes entangled with an enigmatic killer whose attraction to her goes way beyond cat and mouse, their confrontation turns deadly and the loose ends of a life spent killing will weave themselves ever tighter.','/iQUj7MptHUlcXpaMLrqRNZRxGA9.jpg','2021-08-19',109,'Released','Made for vengeance.','The Protégé',645788,11.5663,6.5,'fSqa0a3mGk8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42900,_binary '\0','/1GGB93Vvo1z2hEjyAvbpoONgZWg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6081632',5.7,1556,'fr','Marie-Francine','A woman at the age of 50 moves back in with her parents after her husband leave her for a younger woman.','/zfcoM69h0EKLXP8Qb0msvbi5rVB.jpg','2017-05-31',95,'Released',NULL,'Marie-Francine',428756,1.8262,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42901,_binary '\0','/yB70SrspWic4RM8yi1w27FDSvIN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6081670',5.8,12697,'en','Possum','A disgraced children\'s puppeteer returns to his childhood home and is forced to confront his wicked stepfather and the secrets that have tortured him his entire life.','/5QOFKSpE7KacBriU95fxG6hmmvr.jpg','2018-10-26',85,'Released','Can you spy him deep within? Little possum. Black as sin.','Possum',472269,2.6727,6.163,'O5jaqmQyAJw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42902,_binary '\0','/oG6i6TrF7PV9lGSlcK3F7BRQjlu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6082222',5.3,2545,'tr','Yok Artık! 2','Barber Adnan is the neighborhood gossip. He knows everything about his customers in the neighborhood. When Adnan learns he\'s about to be fired, he clings to his job. Aykut, who is trying to become an internet sensation through his daughter\'s social media accounts, Merve, who left her city life behind to move to the village, and Meriç, who faced every possible mishap while visiting a village to ask for a girl\'s hand in marriage—these are the entertaining stories Adnan shares with the audience...','/lPGrsssEkHZzUuhTjhAHrKqPrMN.jpg','2016-10-07',82,'Released',NULL,'No Way! 2',446210,0.8852,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42903,_binary '\0','/vTw1MjLJfCFzFdq5iElKpjI0LIV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6083230',7.3,5413,'ko','리틀 포레스트','A young woman leaves the city to return to her hometown in the countryside. Seeking to escape the hustle and bustle of the city, she becomes self-sufficient in a bid to reconnect with nature.','/gKmPuyjmALswSQUF94PWXoAvkKM.jpg','2018-02-28',103,'Released',NULL,'Little Forest',448491,3.5395,7.6,'uKW0YaPUa2Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42904,_binary '\0','/5ViWWRc2sy0Au1ET77Qpn2jEctx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6083388',6.4,2585,'zh','荡寇风云','During the 16th century, pirates rule the Chinese coastline, pillaging the small villages and terrorizing the citizens. When maverick leader Commander Yu enlists the help of a sharp young general, they devise a plan to defeat the pirates. A violent clash of wit and weapons will decide who will rule the land.','/4rWq9Vwb1gVhQIqkhUKE0hPVwnz.jpg','2017-05-27',128,'Released',NULL,'God of War',455043,3.5346,6.3,'pQ6xZ_Om2Mo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42905,_binary '\0','/y10CET6cNCDgtrJ5psZmjtg9jGI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6083648',4.7,8931,'en','Looking Glass','A psycho- sexual thriller following a couple that buys an old motel in the desert looking for a new beginning, but what seemed at first as an escape is soon a thrilling ride through a mysterious world when Ray discovers a two way mirror and witnesses a horrifying murder. In a twisted game of cat and mouse, Ray must race to save his wife and himself from a gruesome secret connected to the motel and the strange people who visit there.','/6zSzaUmoUCwII2pGTqX1jaX8F0p.jpg','2018-02-16',103,'Released','Seeing is deceiving','Looking Glass',437375,4.5226,4.8,'Y9jPUvijVa4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42906,_binary '\0','/zhr06iXdSAXbGMrodUTCA4o9FCO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6084202',7.2,5717,'lv','Dvēseļu putenis','The love story of sixteen-year-old Arturs is interrupted by the First World War. After losing his mother and his home, he finds some consolation in joining the army, because this is the first time national battalions are allowed in the Russian Empire. But war is nothing like Arturs imagined – no glory, no fairness. It is brutal and painful. Arturs is now completely alone as war takes the lives of his father and brother. Also, no progress is made in the promised quick resolution of the war and timely return home. Within the notion that only he alone cares about returning home and that his homeland is just a playground for other nations, Arturs finds strength for the final battle and eventually returns home to start everything from scratch, just like his newly born country.','/cYMVgoTsFbn0HbDwUSxhWCD63mp.jpg','2019-11-11',124,'Released',NULL,'The Rifleman',567566,2.792,7.3,'qWN4qY55pJc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42907,_binary '\0','/xdDnTXhPd7q0gKu6KpDoZ9F3xeC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6085872',6.1,1584,'it','Poveri ma ricchi','The Tuccis, a close-knit family of country bumpkins, become millionaires overnight. When word gets out, nagging neighbors and acquaintances force them to leave for the big city to start anew—and openly flaunt their newfound wealth. Soon they\'ll realize they ain\'t got the faintest idea how today\'s upper classes actually live.','/mNhi8Xhtu2abtGqLCZqRxKzSVml.jpg','2016-12-15',98,'Released',NULL,'Poorly Rich',427989,1.7049,6.011,'9ZMdqpwfj78','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42908,_binary '\0','/hRp44FQPiKykFCBwZOOBoWYNTh9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6085974',6.7,1941,'en','Love Always, Santa','After losing her husband Bradley three years ago on Christmas Day, Celia Banks never thought she’d fall in love again. Now, her entire world revolves around taking care of her daughter, Lilly. Lilly writes a letter to Santa with one wish – for her mommy to be happy and find love again.','/5RXu0jaDXzxzqjtVDYLW5BbGuiA.jpg','2016-11-06',84,'Released',NULL,'Love Always, Santa',421629,1.5589,5.8,'cdzB_VB2R0c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42909,_binary '\0','/vQxW6ierQdgfSDITSHIUxvmyN32.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6086080',4,1713,'en','Mad Families','Three families compete for a camping spot during a busy Fourth of July holiday weekend.','/leliLuYey1PCfu91EMm38frxCQU.jpg','2017-01-12',90,'Released','Three familes. One campsite. May the worst family win.','Mad Families',431071,3.9393,4.6,'9gOnEXWaBKg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42910,_binary '\0','/ozUfK85XsZE6pQnU9vuz3vDADIJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6087226',6.3,13209,'ru','Кома','A young and talented architect comes to his senses after a horrific accident only to find himself in the odd dystopian world. A world that is filled with the memories of all current coma patients. Just like a human memory this world is fragmental, chaotic and unstable. This is COMA: icecaps, rivers and cities can all exist in a space of a single room and laws of physics are no longer laws as they can be bent.','/1hVEsBS4vnozB1yAsMiqW0IMxyp.jpg','2020-01-01',110,'Released','Wake up to save everyone','Coma',430155,4.9589,6.407,'5WohqZM2m8U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42911,_binary '\0','/nvxj7TwfyY9j2AnQDaNkLawaHAn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6087426',5.4,4851,'en','Still/Born','Still/Born follows Mary, a new mother who lost one of her twins in childbirth. As she struggles with the loss of one of her children, she starts to suspect something sinister is after her surviving child – a supernatural entity that has chosen her child and will stop at nothing to take it from her.','/kZ1BbnMArbnSISel8dK9mpRwWIB.jpg','2018-02-09',87,'Released',NULL,'Still/Born',429742,2.7325,5.8,'uzBXLW3fUEo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42912,_binary '\0','/gP2nOxQQniQ0CKdngBfaZQtrfuJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6089358',3.8,1308,'en','Haunting on Fraternity Row','A fraternity house throws their big \"Winter Luau\" party but when fraternity brothers and coeds begin dying horrible deaths they discover an evil entity has taken over the house.','/7Y9EsHwk61JcXbPjGndZrEwPuog.jpg','2018-11-02',93,'Released','Party until you\'re dead.','Haunting on Fraternity Row',551608,2.3082,5.5,'dIFZimoqPWI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42913,_binary '\0','/10qtFb7Idkf7AEtph1UoRyG95gK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6089700',3.6,2708,'en','The Hatred','Four young women travel to their college professor\'s new country home for a weekend getaway, only to discover that the house has a malevolent past.','/sCuZThFUGycGPwVblKdQO5MWzi0.jpg','2017-11-29',94,'Released','Your Fears Are Real','The Hatred',466129,1.6018,5.3,'m36srFQbv4Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42914,_binary '\0','/80mewBbpgPGqOqClgn81Jacq0c9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6090044',2.3,2493,'es','Romina','A shocking assault inspires horrific violence when a group of teens encounters a girl from their school while camping in a remote spot.','/klfBdSpbWnQLqVXXJD8Mczc3XfF.jpg','2018-07-13',75,'Released',NULL,'Romina',535488,2.1554,2.8,'e3xDr6fwsR0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42915,_binary '\0','/cfAsueSHK0hbSQe8jAnUgF8eOtj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6091936',6.4,1368,'zh','微微一笑很倾城','A college stud tries to level up his relationship with a computer science major after becoming attracted to her skills in an online role-playing game.','/wW8903K4gTSDgzJiU6iZmbeT5SC.jpg','2016-08-12',105,'Released',NULL,'Love O2O',412190,4.2816,6.7,'jKYUKgDq1fg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42916,_binary '\0','/proxvIB4yzKqFl0V10p6xtxWozf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6093618',5.4,1855,'en','Antiquities','After his father\'s death, a young man searches to find who his dad was only to stumble onto himself.','/d6xyWHELxrGlR5oaOX2Z22XM9uM.jpg','2019-01-25',93,'Released','Sometimes the past sticks with you','Antiquities',530624,1.3039,4.3,'zGLFsUaP6OU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42917,_binary '\0','/aJ4sjLVodZCKpx9zf4rgmwVOUvq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6094760',6,1613,'pl','Plac zabaw','It\'s the end of the school year and today is the last chance for 12-year-old Gabrysia to tell her classmate that she has fallen in love with him. She sets up a secret meeting and blackmails the boy to show up. But what was supposed to be an intimate talk spins out of control and leads to an unexpected ending.','/9xVnGGvyZh2bxapCe6xFqginCfS.jpg','2016-09-19',81,'Released','Childhood can be a dangerous game','Playground',413764,1.056,6.1,'YNO0N31ohpM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42918,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6095002',7.8,1658,'en','Fade to Black','Peter Short, the charismatic CEO of a major Australian company, learns that he has only months to live after he is diagnosed with terminal oesophageal cancer. Not wanting to face a painful death, Peter decides to source the lethal drug Nembutal, giving him the option to end his own life peacefully. With the help of a rogue doctor who supplies the drug to suffering patients, Peter sets out to have voluntary euthanasia legalised in Australia.','/jNnxG1u7LWZCzbATB548h0kTgik.jpg','2017-08-01',84,'Released',NULL,'Fade to Black',467038,0.4797,8,'n79XDmg7syc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42919,_binary '\0','/me5utxTz6hlEgAeQisexKHP27ZU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6095090',4.6,3243,'ru','Невеста','This is a story of a small town girl named Nastya. Her newly married husband Ivan drives her to his hometown to meet his family. Upon their arrival Nastya feels she made a wrong decision: she is surrounded by weird people and she sees creepy photos all around the house. Ivan disappears while 