iday.','/jJLL0E243c8CBTlryvYh69rQQV9.jpg','2018-03-21',174,'Released','For love, only Mektoub can decide.','Mektoub, My Love: Canto Uno',337676,4.1424,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42963,_binary '\0','/714qEzABtc2zNLA7EaezooI1IQY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6125690',6.6,2640,'ro','Ana, mon amour','Toma and Ana meet as students in the literature faculty, and quickly fall in love. But, because of Ana\'s mental illness, their relationship slowly collapses.','/bLFoUCVG82a9KaV4AtVwp9PZ0Gi.jpg','2017-03-03',127,'Released',NULL,'Ana, My Love',429732,1.7366,6.5,'315_92dJyrY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42964,_binary '\0','/t1VDCUayWT128fU6AWOSc6P8jIC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6126294',6.2,4956,'ta','ரெமோ','An aspiring actor dresses up as a female nurse to bag a role in a film, and more importantly, woo the love of his life.','/bhnpnKHsurKVtqbUGAVqB28Jqqr.jpg','2016-10-07',150,'Released',NULL,'Remo',402778,1.2058,5.682,'GEB4qrrWIgs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42965,_binary '\0','/chv1My026S6mBlCiV6dcASgzHOk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6126346',6,3042,'es','Thi Mai, rumbo a Vietnam','After losing her daughter in an accident, Carmen loses all incentive to keep going, until she receives an unexpected letter from the adoption agency: her daughter was finally granted the Vietnamese girl she had asked for adoption and whose name is Thi Mai.','/gG1riXv2FAkjz8hxpmT6gml8PMq.jpg','2018-01-12',99,'Released',NULL,'Thi Mai',437294,1.9141,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42966,_binary '\0','/fisaG1minKgd6NuSCLI95Lnq0H8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6126428',4.4,1591,'tr','Hep Yek 2','Gürkan and Altan have fallen into the hands of Cevat Bakır. Cevat Bakır, who killed Şahin for betraying him in the first film, spares the lives of Şahin’s accomplices, Altan and Gürkan, on the condition that they dispose of Şahin’s body. However, the two buddies mess up this task as well, bringing countless troubles upon themselves, just like in the first film, and manage to get the country’s most psychopathic men on their trail.','/1u442h9yfbxH4dedQ6XP4CB8CGu.jpg','2017-01-13',96,'Released',NULL,'Hep Yek 2',457827,0.96,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42967,_binary '\0','/c1oc9it19h1OVbdpO5djhe92zfo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6126492',3.2,1249,'en','Mother Krampus','Based on the myth of Frau Perchta, a witch that comes on the 12 days of Christmas taking children each night.','/lqrbTwfvIlyDATcaSIXEZtXfi50.jpg','2017-10-08',90,'Released',NULL,'Mother Krampus',477623,0.9439,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42968,_binary '\0','/1m8kFUHZA04CrtwPLMJoe7sW9mP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6127004',5.3,18835,'en','Paradise Hills','A young woman is sent to Paradise Hills to be reformed, only to learn that the high-class facility\'s beautiful facade hides a sinister secret.','/7V1N8vMPNDw6be3MDiA4DC0s4Bv.jpg','2019-08-29',95,'Released','Rebels Reign.','Paradise Hills',487083,3.9533,5.9,'9hk3s_IOpEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42969,_binary '\0','/oWfHT2qFpGgySrpnitNVRJ1d2Et.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6129232',7,1748,'sl','Pr\' Hostar','Due to poor business performance, a small hotel is being sold to an international buyer. Employees do not want to lose their jobs, so they take things into their own hands and try to sabotage the sale of the hotel.','/kymN9M1a2IcPMIs53NuLNgBsXvf.jpg','2016-10-27',87,'Released',NULL,'At Hostar',421802,1.0107,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(42970,_binary '\0','/pIWpXICFft0C7sRsjioU6Bj7Sjo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6129302',7.6,11688,'hi','Bhavesh Joshi Superhero','A young man who stands for the right discovers that he\'s destined to do bigger things, which will transform him from a common man into a Superhero.','/x2dzIELXWls5Aqutha502ZyF8WN.jpg','2018-06-01',155,'Released',NULL,'Bhavesh Joshi Superhero',527511,1.5084,7.5