ence are being used by its owner for sinister reasons.','/e26QQxiD9glX34qU9Lfj98nMCTA.jpg','2018-06-22',90,'Released','Don\'t fear the lies. Fear the truth.','Distorted',459258,2.7065,4.9,'QebgI4i8X4A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43000,_binary '\0','/bDz6fRvfU0jYLDXZNMW4YejcS19.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6144536',6.4,1290,'fr','Chez nous','Pauline, a devoted and generous home help nurse, raises her two children alone, while also looking after her father, a former steelworker. Taking advantage of her popularity, the directors of an extremist political party suggest she become their candidate at the mayoral elections.','/jIkWIuzubpNGv98uwuarltTF7rJ.jpg','2017-01-25',117,'Released',NULL,'This Is Our Land',430172,2.3761,5.9,'w9CQXkDwNSk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43001,_binary '\0','/kJfFqcP6jb1caPg6VMpAfkHUMLd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6144762',5.8,1882,'fr','Coexister','An opportunistic music producer brings together a rabbi, a priest, and an imam to preach about peaceful coexistence through song. But he\'s in for a surprise when he realizes the religious leaders are far from saints.','/lTXjPswcvDIqI72m4nuwEg12oPI.jpg','2017-10-11',90,'Released',NULL,'Coexist',432618,2.5243,5.9,'Qfj2lM0OrQI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43002,_binary '\0','/1203Iu8lN8DnfUZhYsb1RaFR58N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6146460',8.3,1222,'en','Hamilton\'s America','This documentary delves deeper into the creation of the Hamilton musical, revealing Lin-Manuel Miranda\'s process of absorbing and then adapting Hamilton\'s epic story into ground-breaking musical theater.','/8FqupfVfQNK9YmXbdxMaK7gHFhq.jpg','2016-10-01',84,'Released','The story behind the revolutionary musical','Hamilton\'s America',415078,2.0281,6.7,'_KsTjxKi5JE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43003,_binary '\0','/vVpEOvdxVBP2aV166j5Xlvb5Cdc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6146586',7.4,488277,'en','John Wick: Chapter 3 - Parabellum','Super-assassin John Wick returns with a $14 million price tag on his head and an army of bounty-hunting killers on his trail. After killing a member of the shadowy international assassin’s guild, the High Table, John Wick is excommunicado, but the world’s most ruthless hit men and women await his every turn.','/ziEuG1essDuWuC5lpWUaw1uXY2O.jpg','2019-05-15',131,'Released','If you want peace, prepare for war.','John Wick: Chapter 3 - Parabellum',458156,24.5165,7.439,'M7XM597XO94','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43004,_binary '\0','/84yj2klZlegwwdE3wFTCW7d6twD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6146590',5.1,1289,'en','F.R.E.D.I.','An intelligent, lovable robot known as \"F.R.E.D.I.\" is stolen from a secret research facility by the project\'s lead scientist. The robot is found by a 15 year old teenager, James. Soon the two begin to communicate and create a bond in which F.R.E.D.I. learns about teenage life and James learns about some new values.','/ayJCf4MI00lO55hOXVaKGVotEDX.jpg','2018-05-03',89,'Released','The best friend ever built','F.R.E.D.I.',487509,2.2046,5.9,'RtcIFzpLYqM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43005,_binary '\0','/q5CcvQ00jWaeCuRVPD3KSpCJ4Bi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6147260',6,1710,'pl','Atak paniki','Tragedy meets comedy in seven stories about how our entire world can collapse at any given moment.','/48PFPIwfYsRTYp4f1qqtlpTPMid.jpg','2018-01-19',100,'Released',NULL,'Panic Attack',470135,1.25,5.8,'mVjGA_khZcc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43006,_binary '\0','/3L3odEOqlL6SEpDfVh7MaNqyvC9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6148156',8.2,56115,'ta','விக்ரம் வேதா','A notorious gangster Vedha surrenders himself to encounter specialist Vikram whom he challenges every step of the way by narrating his life events in the form of riddles that needs to be solved in order to capture him.','/ob9YxdzRu5lfKgz0PNrlL45dorf.jpg','2017-07-21',147,'Released',NULL,'Vikram Vedha',432139,2.0701,7.247,'1sVr-uWZPjE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43007,_binary '\0','/l0vUzd701TzvN3jywXex9G01zpd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6149154',6,16846,'en','Waiting for the Barbarians','At an isolated frontier outpost, a colonial magistrate suffers a crisis of conscience when an army colonel arrives looking to interrogate the locals about an impending uprising, using cruel tactics that horrify the magistrate.','/k50gYFDfpAyxcIGjWjnXAaOM81e.jpg','2020-07-30',112,'Released',NULL,'Waiting for the Barbarians',505707,5.7023,5.9,'ZTtOuxgc9BQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43008,_binary '\0','/yagE1bdjECdEVxPz3rma7B7EKKI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6149936',3.9,1776,'en','The Lullaby','Returning to her home town, overwhelmed by the birth of her firstborn, nineteen-year-old Chloe van Heerden tries to come to terms with motherhood. Despite the support from her own mother, Chloe struggles with the demands of caring for a newborn child. The incessant crying of her baby, the growing sense of guilt and paranoia send her into a dark depression. With a heightened urge to protect her son, she sees danger everywhere.','/anYYzYYUgoEYsMnITf3LOUnKnLC.jpg','2018-01-27',86,'Released',NULL,'The Lullaby',480603,1.1145,5.8,'3goumKgutj8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43009,_binary '\0','/bKCmjLDnPV64YSakkMtS5HNsXP8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6150942',6.3,1404,'en','Becks','After a crushing breakup with her girlfriend, a Brooklyn musician moves back in with her Midwestern mother. As she navigates her hometown, playing for tip money in an old friend\'s bar, an unexpected relationship begins to take shape.','/ir3iuAxNepJufjJt4337ClnVhps.jpg','2018-02-09',91,'Released','Life. Love. Lyrics.','Becks',458987,1.1428,5.2,'rvYejgGap8A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43010,_binary '\0','/hzPvZfjfpmSjeqizKn5oFEXHSup.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6151714',6.5,1896,'el','Πλατεία Αμερικής','Tattoo artist Billy and unemployed Nakos are best friends from Athens. Old bachelor Nakos is a racist, obsessed with the victim mentality, and he rages at Greece’s increasing immigrant numbers. Billy, however, is in favor of foreigners coming. They meet in Amerika Square in Athens because of Syrian refugee Tarek.','/jeNVenor2PEMbK9FJ9iHnzH8ZMS.jpg','2016-10-11',87,'Released',NULL,'Amerika Square',421247,0.8616,5.9,'goJzKqpAdEk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43011,_binary '\0','/2MY0YVvQOncQzlvsacD8oczoYtS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6152554',7.3,1719,'en','Do You Trust This Computer?','Science fiction has long anticipated the rise of machine intelligence, and today a new generation of self-learning computers has begun to reshape every aspect of our lives. Will A.I. usher in an age of unprecedented potential, or prove to be our final invention?','/vWBS27xddEmGfraEykRAVxAWhqZ.jpg','2018-04-05',78,'Released',NULL,'Do You Trust This Computer?',516503,1.6457,7.097,'3CJE6XheubM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43012,_binary '\0','/emxFAmGEaoi86fT0eBHqCsK9ES.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6153538',6.3,1770,'de','Die kleine Hexe','The little witch is only 127 years old – too young for the annual coven of witches. Although she is not yet old enough to be a real witch she wants to become a really good one. This decision causes trouble inside her magic world.','/vTRg6yy75VQ0yoszgLQgp3MTHtE.jpg','2018-02-01',105,'Released',NULL,'The Little Witch',425194,3.6627,7,'dKVoJbvnOZI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43013,_binary '\0','/zl9uqCl5iUSb50sTk2BPzw6bJnU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6155172',7.6,179745,'es','Roma','In 1970s Mexico City, two domestic workers help a mother of four while her husband is away for an extended period of time.','/dtIIyQyALk57ko5bjac7hi01YQ.jpg','2018-11-21',135,'Released','There are periods in history that scar societies and moments in life that transform us as individuals.','Roma',426426,13.5872,7.6,'6BS27ngZtxg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43014,_binary '\0','/szeAEsSUujsudgIlPzC0texAhHw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6155190',8.1,6514,'en','Cercando La grande bellezza','Drama, documentary','/EaKHsW5FoEyIQBGPvv7nz6ERja.jpg','2015-10-24',61,'Released',NULL,'Cercando La grande bellezza',732284,1.2707,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43015,_binary '\0','/tdCHGB6Syji3xg8LRvv5tmvPtRY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6155194',5.2,2877,'en','Best F(r)iends: Volume 1','When a drifter befriends a quirky mortician, an unlikely business partnership is formed. Paranoia soon develops, however, and both men are forced to come to terms with the fragility of friendship and loyalty.','/uwd4qZ6hr13m3txjqyQtPJZKbyd.jpg','2017-09-04',103,'Released','Friendship before money','Best F(r)iends: Volume 1',421044,1.9616,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43016,_binary '\0','/aEmW8KkAgAe0JAhMAFm9EzKmseL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6155374',5.5,3405,'nl','Redbad','In the year of 754 AD, during a time of epic battles and bloodshed, the legend of the pagan warrior king, Rebad, is born, but so is a new weapon against his people: Christianity. Redbad must ultimately unite a Viking army powerful enough to defeat the seemingly invincible Franks.','/jmBXIR1nv1ueIBFBqKg60rLBzmQ.jpg','2018-06-28',160,'Released','The legend','Redbad',485296,3.5734,6.462,'20quzVl4oos','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43017,_binary '\0','/84G2n5VRBiFE534BbH4rTUpMI4Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6155456',6.1,2751,'en','Juanita','Fed up with her deadbeat grown kids and marginal urban existence, Juanita takes a Greyhound bus to Paper Moon, Montana - where she reinvents herself and finds her mojo.','/yKq6LErlgWizCtl3DcdYv86xn2e.jpg','2019-03-08',90,'Released','You can\'t find yourself if you never get lost','Juanita',581475,1.6244,5.4,'kg5uqDh00H4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43018,_binary '\0','/4CA5oG2T7dFPcPC5Sghj9tJFxZI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6155922',4.9,3508,'pt','Perdidos','When a group of friends fail to lower the ladder of their boat, they find themselves stranded in the surrounding waters and struggle to survive.','/1gSmNsz16HyYW5R0GVS54w4AGZx.jpg','2017-05-18',95,'Released',NULL,'Adrift',447076,1.2888,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43019,_binary '\0','/ikQUPr6bDhtwHTGppwf1gexfJwZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6156138',7.4,3603,'ja','37セカンズ','Yuma, a 23-year-old comic book artist with profound cerebral palsy, has been emotionally stunted by her well-meaning but overprotective mother. As she begins to seek independence and sexual awakening on her own terms, she discovers an unexpected path to love and forgiveness.','/v4wgYJQ3i6T7huwC2gtKZYUhxQ.jpg','2019-02-09',115,'Released','Disability is a state of mind.','37 Seconds',570735,7.4795,7.279,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43020,_binary '\0','/54HEQPoD7zWGGaCusDnDBG3aCFO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6156350',8.2,8371,'en','HyperNormalisation','We live in a world where the powerful deceive us. We know they lie. They know we know they lie. They do not care. We say we care, but we do nothing, and nothing ever changes. It is normal. Welcome to the post-truth world. How we got to where we are now…','/tTqI2xoB7cGO7HASB22Sss6x44J.jpg','2016-10-25',167,'Released','They know we know they lie','HyperNormalisation',419546,2.4866,7.4,'AUiqaFIONPQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43021,_binary '\0','/yg96OE7O9JBO9ZNy8nE15M0c1Fa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6157626',6.2,3337,'zh','妖猫传','During the Late Tang Dynasty, a manor is invaded by a demon cat and a sense of unrest befalls the capital of Changan. A poet is charged with investigating the case and meets up with a monk. The two work together and pull apart the thread of clues to reveal a history of truths leading to the events.','/9X3XeDLblva1fAnCX1VYd72d5wc.jpg','2017-12-22',129,'Released','Love. Death. Revenge.','Legend of the Demon Cat',434221,2.9901,6.2,'Yba215606Mc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43022,_binary '\0','/21LPPK1yQbI7qxVRhybZilRG9XT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6158692',5,1629,'en','Who\'s Watching Oliver','The story of a mentally unstable loner lost in a life forced upon him. By night Oliver aimlessly wanders the streets and bars on what can only be described as a truly shocking and humiliating killing spree. His only savior and possible way out of a life he is desperate to escape comes in the form of the beautiful Sophia with her sweet eccentricity and naivety to the danger she has put herself in.','/niRpKyhfJFbhYfigit4mNJXVg0Z.jpg','2018-07-03',87,'Released',NULL,'Who\'s Watching Oliver',448561,1.4431,5,'fZVdyoaUYhs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43023,_binary '\0','/qF6p4Z0DutjdfxrTJ5oAeo85qRD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6158988',7.2,1236,'bn','Eagoler Chokh','Nandini\'s murder at entrepreneur Bishan Roy\'s place lands police detective Shabor in a world of psychological game-play.','/k0nPQ2ulfem8dEVlXh0z1SMg1ad.jpg','2016-08-16',117,'Released',NULL,'Eagoler Chokh',433814,1.1413,7.875,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43024,_binary '\0','/grsp3vbmL41wKDRHQPvHxoXJpZW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6159268',4.1,1269,'en','The Nanny','Young Noa and Michael are put in the care of their new nanny, Leonor, who Noa suspects is a malicious supernatural being. Dismissed by those around her, Noa works to uncover Leonor\'s true identity, but soon finds herself with far more than she bargained for.','/h324sCgqkyQVre5a4uDfkXhm5c5.jpg','2018-05-01',80,'Released','Watch the children','The Nanny',513857,1.7085,5.4,'TkRGZOC4Pw4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43025,_binary '\0','/5cCCf1IwbHm5XBw5JeEcCKXmJmI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6159520',5.8,1547,'en','Chasing the Blues','Two rival record collectors attempt to con an old lady out of a rare but cursed 1930s blues record. When a series of unfortunate circumstances lands them in jail, the feud festers for over 20 years until they are released from prison and get a second chance at snagging the vinyl - this time from a more formidable foe.','/5HlvuqL7Hz3PjV2IPLeBRNTYBNw.jpg','2018-10-05',77,'Released','Would you give up everything for a song?','Chasing the Blues',474487,1.3063,5.5,'Rk71OwLyJ-0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43026,_binary '\0','/4QB2TfxmzgMDLmsVVk1HM4tt7ef.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6160448',5.7,48161,'en','White Noise','Jack Gladney, professor of Hitler studies at The-College-on-the-Hill, husband to Babette, and father to four children/stepchildren, is torn asunder by a chemical spill from a rail car that releases an \"Airborne Toxic Event\" forcing Jack to confront his biggest fear - his own mortality.','/kesxNdLZlmGoTRspDHU1WgdEuGw.jpg','2022-11-25',136,'Released','You can’t hear it if it\'s everywhere.','White Noise',744594,7.1552,5.596,'SgwKZAMx_gM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43027,_binary '\0','/tW9hfukmiu9IXw4REg9YLzyo53m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6162808',8.1,2219,'en','Miss Saigon: 25th Anniversary Performance','The epic love story tells the tragic tale of young Vietnamese bar girl Kim, orphaned by war, who falls in love with American GI Chris — but their lives are torn apart by the fall of Saigon.','/ty9X5o0D30BRIVIOHVstPfESXaB.jpg','2016-09-22',144,'Released','The Extraordinary 25th Anniversary Performance Recorded Live in London\'s West End','Miss Saigon: 25th Anniversary Performance',417820,2.578,7.951,'SWmNoMkYTtw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43028,_binary '\0','/saPa9r2LUTRFc0KbgX9accXzZ2o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6163356',5.8,4257,'en','Michael Moore in TrumpLand','Oscar-winner Michael Moore dives right into hostile territory with his daring and hilarious one-man show, deep in the heart of TrumpLand in the weeks before the 2016 election.','/34SMkpy0NcLnlbcDsUlIHS0Puad.jpg','2016-10-18',73,'Released','See the film Ohio republicans tried to shut down.','Michael Moore in TrumpLand',421851,1.8915,5.9,'WQhgnJv1P1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43029,_binary '\0','/5NdiylmWcsW78Gt5Ri4fO6Bzk14.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6164014',4.4,1404,'en','Circus Kane','A reclusive circus master invites a group of social media stars to his house of haunts. Anyone who can make it out before being scared into submission will earn $250,000 - but the stars soon learn they are not only competing for money, but also fighting for their lives.','/vJVF3Voz6LbJeMlLl6O4m8CjNhb.jpg','2017-10-10',88,'Released','LET THE GAMES BEGIN','Circus Kane',459667,2.3635,4,'jpS-vpqNfcE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43030,_binary '\0','/ueVnDMPdDDtAAjS8XniAiZkXes9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6164502',7.1,7568,'et','November','In a poor Estonian village, a group of peasants use magic and folk remedies to survive the winter, and a young woman tries to get a young man to love her.','/yMqtCSzSAB9Aiw8yiuUKBoxEeAm.jpg','2017-02-03',115,'Released',NULL,'November',437583,3.0034,7.031,'19QZy1YHL50','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43031,_binary '\0','/8SuOfD4MMpS8LcAfB6wdcYA7nfA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6164762',6.4,3403,'en','The Delinquent Season','In Dublin, two couples (Jim and Danielle; Yvonne and Chris) are seemingly living in marital bliss. However, when Chris\'s behaviour begins to change, Yvonne seeks solace in the arms of Jim, and before long they are in the midst of an affair. When a life-changing secret is later revealed, all four are forced to re-evaluate their lives, their marriages, and their friendships - but can anything be salvaged from the wreckage?','/xX43qZzsqqMZwzqwtUHX5P6PwZ4.jpg','2018-04-27',103,'Released','Love is a dangerous game','The Delinquent Season',467915,2.3064,6.2,'aAWOQbOPJIg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43032,_binary '\0','/ywYVvh83X8mf3BRCIna9Rx9dUQF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6165792',6.4,2172,'ja','光','The story follows the social intercourse between a cameraman, Masaya, with a visual impairment, and Misako who disconnects from the world.','/l7fR2WW7mnXl0nrZSHeCBxbljeH.jpg','2017-05-27',101,'Released',NULL,'Radiance',444428,2.5017,6.5,'rojTDGwMcOY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43033,_binary '\0','/uIk2g2bRkNwNywKZIhC5oIU94Kh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6166392',6.9,197291,'en','Wonka','Willy Wonka – chock-full of ideas and determined to change the world one delectable bite at a time – is proof that the best things in life begin with a dream, and if you’re lucky enough to meet Willy Wonka, anything is possible.','/qhb1qOilapbapxWQn9jtRCMwXJF.jpg','2023-12-06',117,'Released','Every good thing in this world started with a dream.','Wonka',787699,17.1076,7.034,'otNh9bTjXWg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43034,_binary '\0','/gnY5PQoRUtCn7gHrCZq70IesyrN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6167014',7.4,2464,'zh','驴得水','In order to pay for the donkey that brings them water, a countryside village registers it as a teacher at its local school. But when the charity group that funds the school visits for an inspection, the village has to find ways to hide their secret.','/jCgyF4gHAwEcahodiJkpILNfCYa.jpg','2016-10-28',111,'Released',NULL,'Mr. Donkey',421742,1.7736,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43035,_binary '\0','/aAhOB50wfXdTQ00Uzm0dUVLDUGj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6167116',6.1,2308,'en','Broadcasting Christmas','When the opportunity to co-host a talk show with the fabulous talk show diva Veronika presents itself two weeks before Christmas, Emily thinks this is her big break. To her surprise, she discovers she has stiff competition with Charlie, the local TV anchor who is her near equal on another station. With such interest and support for both reporters, a contest is created: for the two weeks leading up to Christmas, who can cover the best and most meaningful Christmas stories on the local news?','/c8VrxCL42EejLOWbzSfkLoLix5Q.jpg','2016-11-23',84,'Released',NULL,'Broadcasting Christmas',421759,1.7012,5.7,'YwIXZLEki_Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43036,_binary '\0','/f789yQcfWfBYTkVzo0ZGTodT40T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6167894',7.9,7142,'ml','അങ്കമാലി ഡയറീസ്','Six young friends in the small town of Angamaly tries their luck by starting a pork business lead by Vincent Pepe. They initially strike a business deal with Rajan and Ravi despite the duo having killed a close friend of theirs in a gang fight. Vincent is in love with Sakhi and plan to immigrate abroad with her. But their plans hit a road bump as the deal with the gangsters hits some road bumps.','/fwxgQakS3vUQIzgJMphQWHxAqr2.jpg','2017-03-03',132,'Released',NULL,'Angamaly Diaries',442000,1.1663,7.336,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43037,_binary '\0','/zIAbwnSOjIuNndozhvsED1tJKra.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6168002',6.1,1594,'ml','സഖാവ്','Comrade Krishna Kumar wants to make it big in politics but lacks the ideals a sakhavu should possess. He is ruthless enough to even get rid of friends who might be possible hurdles on his way up. His paths cross with that of a veteran comrade, sakhavu Krishnan and the film depicts how his life influences Krishna Kumar.','/orvGUwvIGtd65BeE1haFqvrGRvS.jpg','2017-04-14',163,'Released',NULL,'Sakhavu',450045,0.9558,4.81,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43038,_binary '\0','/7BfNIGev5vAZApDNiQA2h9sBCUf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6168298',7.7,3200,'th','แฟนเดย์..แฟนกันแค่วันเดียว','A woman suffers from a rare form of temporary amnesia, lasting for a day. Her shy colleague, who is secretly in love with her, tells her that they are a couple in order to experience being with her for just one day.','/fbYj8XuzuXTDkM26KMYeOk4mNga.jpg','2016-09-01',134,'Released','Would being in love for one day... be enough?','One Day',420541,1.5053,7.7,'ueBcBWrwR0o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43039,_binary '\0','/ipaCW3O6vFcZKfh1FLPeV4vArxI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6169694',5.8,14769,'en','I Think We\'re Alone Now','After a catastrophe destroys most of humanity, recluse Del lives in his small, empty town, content with the utopia he has methodically created for himself, until an interloper, young Grace, disrupts his solitude.','/9sNsmC8FKgr4hTfnGCS49WY20k4.jpg','2018-09-14',100,'Released','In the end… Chaos will find you','I Think We\'re Alone Now',451877,4.4762,5.766,'8IOw3z-sRNI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43040,_binary '\0','/gKDuRB6Uj3gzF8Dd85DOtkxi7KC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6170484',5.4,2412,'zh','捉妖记2','The sequel to Monster Hunt. Set in a world where monsters and humans co-exist, the franchise tells the story of Wuba, a baby monster born to be king. Wuba becomes the central figure in stopping an all-out monster civil war.','/9wOkj2VXLvqUPQ77MUzgzuz6Cv5.jpg','2018-02-16',110,'Released',NULL,'Monster Hunt 2',497984,4.8414,6.7,'5L5yMXAeEVg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43041,_binary '\0','/bgh5OlSNhcYGCVMqV0xTwNgkbY4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6170506',3.6,3420,'en','Beast of Burden','Sean Haggerty only has an hour to deliver his illegal cargo. An hour to reassure a drug cartel, a hitman, and the DEA that nothing is wrong. An hour to make sure his wife survives. And he must do it all from the cockpit of his Cessna.','/uexWTafwBClTU1qJTEHT0T8TZHb.jpg','2018-02-23',90,'Released','Lines are meant to be crossed.','Beast of Burden',454650,3.4744,4.265,'ynrVa9YWSJU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43042,_binary '\0','/8eSLzNuMBw3rfNxYDFb6yJZbaAW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6170804',5.1,1420,'en','The Assassin\'s Code','A rookie detective, son of a dead disgraced cop, works to solve his first major case while under the watchful eye of a ghost-like assassin.','/sszxkPZ3BvyDx2ohKRNMAtGts2T.jpg','2018-05-11',95,'Released','Honor never dies','The Assassin\'s Code',516321,2.6855,5.3,'cYhaKmc_hN4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43043,_binary '\0','/bifmpGuVdJDPPTU4IuCnsMNBOqD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6170954',6.2,8527,'hi','नाम शबाना','Shabana Khan, a special agent, is entrusted with the task of assassinating a deadly arms dealer by the Indian Intelligence Agency.','/xFHeFrOYzsHgAiZeGAjwJmDMen6.jpg','2017-03-31',147,'Released',NULL,'Naam Shabana',441071,1.7898,5.714,'OP_dV87Vj5Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43044,_binary '\0','/tcVQ2ZftltaFtyCTYv2cYugVQou.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6172460',6.9,4480,'en','Rocko\'s Modern Life: Static Cling','After 20 years in space, Rocko returns to a technologically advanced O-Town and makes it his mission to get his favorite show back on the air.','/nMoIFggYmEilUcS44XZuxYvHfG6.jpg','2019-08-09',45,'Released',NULL,'Rocko\'s Modern Life: Static Cling',439059,3.4113,6.6,'cuF9aZxoipE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43045,_binary '\0','/dY2gkFvspAJP5Lf57mIIA1Wf5Sm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6173484',6.6,2855,'en','Standing Up, Falling Down','An unlikely friendship kindles between a struggling stand-up comedian from L.A. — forced to move back home to Eastern Long Island with his tail between his legs — and a tragically flawed, but charming and charismatic, alcoholic dermatologist. Discovering to be kindred spirits, each helps the other find healing, in addition to the confidence to face the \"failures\" in their lives.','/sPf007Zt2zdPk62FfeNYnxBbXUG.jpg','2020-02-21',91,'Released','A comedy about second chances.','Standing Up, Falling Down',597231,2.8824,6.3,'DuRsr5NxzDQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43046,_binary '\0','/ekemLhl375ZxrvROiBdQK1dO43Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6173488',6.5,1671,'en','An Uncommon Grace','An army nurse returning from Afghanistan discovers her purpose in a rural Ohio farm community, along with a deep connection with a neighbor whose conservative Amish sect strictly forbids relationships with those outside his church community.','/ju55r2YeVlz0rUKWYUzl0LW8d1N.jpg','2017-02-12',90,'Released','She left for war; he brought her back home','An Uncommon Grace',437517,2.2069,6.5,'PmoppPznd-4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43047,_binary '\0','/mu4KdG8qUVSneT1LXRM1zGT0z8n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6173826',5.4,2809,'hi','Guest iin London','A young couple in London struggle to live with their estranged aunt and uncle, who overstay their welcome.','/tB83piOP5YueVMTdFxhbqX1FMsi.jpg','2017-07-07',132,'Released',NULL,'Guest iin London',464599,1.3525,5.242,'nPezCIqTZ-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43048,_binary '\0','/kDTLxyxFJhK0YPD1RN0BR5gQAjR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6173902',5.4,1708,'en','Hulk: Where Monsters Dwell','This All Hallows’ Eve, Nightmare is bent on conquering our waking world by crossing through the Dream Dimension, and converting each dreamer into a monster. Can Dr. Strange, Hulk and the Howling Commandos hold the line and put an end to his nefarious scheme?','/udUnSnQKzYddDpU6WNdTMB5XVEE.jpg','2016-10-21',75,'Released',NULL,'Hulk: Where Monsters Dwell',422153,3.5831,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43049,_binary '\0','/yEaP3drEAqFIWfiOuhELKsJsqx6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6173990',7.3,15672,'hi','Gold','Set in 1948, the historic story of India\'s first Olympic medal post their independence.','/xCcdW6nHRcrKWraErYV5g3tut7Q.jpg','2018-08-15',170,'Released','The Dream That United Our Nation','Gold',478682,1.7706,7,'dGm4TKHG_kY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43050,_binary '\0','/3wy4UTqaSwP1luw14SxMO5kxq5M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6175078',6.9,3672,'ko','럭키','A reverse comedy that tells the story of a perfectionist assassin who falls and hits his head in a sauna, giving him amnesia. When a down-and-out actor switches locker keys with him, they switch lives until the hit-man, who soon becomes an action hero on TV, starts to remember things.','/z0bMdh1pnVHwUV4Tq0R3KPTp9xA.jpg','2016-10-13',112,'Released','A HIT MAN WAKES UP WITH AMNESIA TO A SWITCHED LIFE.','Luck-Key',421928,2.9382,7.167,'jowO-T13KYc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43051,_binary '\0','/c4jwzF8rAD3c2YpPlRwrDAxWzT3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6175394',6.4,4141,'ru','Последний богатырь','Ivan is an ordinary guy who is transferred from modern Moscow to the fantasy world Belogorye. In this parallel universe where characters of Russian fairy tales live, magic is an integral part of daily life, and arguments are settled with the help of sword . Unexpectedly, Ivan finds himself in the middle of a battle between good and evil, and he must discover why everyone thinks that he must play the main role in upcoming events...','/oFEHcmPuI95aoeNrWXCVnA4oI5Y.jpg','2017-10-19',120,'Released',NULL,'The Last Warrior',471968,3.4069,6.905,'vm4f-ceQSpU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43052,_binary '\0','/uxddzfRfnASfB5lz7hJDRm2VYIF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6175486',3.7,2606,'en','Demons','Celebrated fiction writer and former priest, Colin Hampstead, and his wife, Kayleigh, are tormented by the ghost of her late sister, as the details of her grisly death are slowly uncovered.','/cIROisS4lZZTsoykty128bGiXPw.jpg','2017-10-06',105,'Released','Hell is empty. The devil is here!','Demons',479746,1.2336,5.4,'sMLBhNuVZ5U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43053,_binary '\0','/6bpOuHGR6VXu0ZJrc76xauORksK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6175764',6.7,2560,'de','Nur Gott kann mich richten','Ricky spent years behind bars after taking the rap for his brother Rafael and his buddy Latif after a failed robbery. Now, Latif wants to express gratitude by letting Ricky in on a coup that will bring lots of money. After some hesitation, Ricky agrees, and gets his brother Rafael on board. Everything runs smoothly, until police officer Diana turns up on the scene. A nerve-wracking cat and mouse game is set in motion. Director Özgür Yildirim’s most recent film offers insight into Frankfurt’s gangster world. As before in CHIKO – which also starred Moritz Bleibtreu – he portrays the daily life of the criminal underground scene in a large German city.','/pkUDydVQOqU0E1A4vzlaVMwspw9.jpg','2018-01-25',100,'Released',NULL,'Only God Can Judge Me',419734,1.8332,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43054,_binary '\0','/r3bDWZUniD06x3gAXWtbNifhSYZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6175820',6.9,4275,'de','Dieses bescheuerte Herz','When 30-ish rich kid Lenny has to take care of 15-year-old David, who’s suffering from heart disease, it’s the beginning of a wild adventure. Lenny fearlessly breaks all the rules to fulfill his young friend’s every wish.','/5URz6UQ9ZjKc0rEQsckcsMjO1jK.jpg','2017-12-21',104,'Released',NULL,'This Crazy Heart',427033,2.3353,7.331,'xdi_Ebor2KI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43055,_binary '\0','/aUdyvwegfuZiEYKs2c05cPCRxEZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6176336',6,1813,'de','Hagen - Im Tal der Nibelungen','Hagen von Tronje, the Burgundian master-at-arms, holds his troubled kingdom together while hiding his dark past. The arrival of the unpredictable dragon slayer Siegfried threatens to upend the old order. As King Gunter seeks Siegfried\'s help to win the fierce Valkyrie Brunhild, Hagen faces a tragic choice between loyalty to the king and his own identity.','/eQ1nTnV6neOhBeDJj87IUHDLwb0.jpg','2024-10-17',135,'Released','The greatest saga of all times.','Hagen',1209130,2.6183,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43056,_binary '\0','/82FlOl2zNyNgNAjEn9ekAHjQBNQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6176928',6,1452,'en','Whose Streets?','A nonfiction account of the Ferguson uprising told by the people who lived it, this is an unflinching look at how the killing of 18-year-old Michael Brown inspired a community to fight back—and sparked a global movement.','/tFvp4zHDxrKtJZYNcAaK5TswAby.jpg','2017-08-11',90,'Released','It\'s our duty to win.','Whose Streets?',433036,1.21,5.8,'XBl2-4EaLLs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43057,_binary '\0','/gP8zfI4SEyzg5UQiFQNxikpoUm1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6179746',5.4,5270,'en','The Gateway','A particle physicist grieving over the loss of her husband in a car crash uses a revolutionary machine to bring him back, with dire consequences for her family.','/3Gp2lj5jnP08Sie6j0gNL3zfiSE.jpg','2018-05-03',90,'Released','What would you do for love?','The Gateway',472744,1.7321,5.5,'gInFXtRvwlM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43058,_binary '\0','/sTSKcfoD0m1vgrnCinc6FKJfSDV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6180274',7.7,1586,'hi','Poorna','An Adivasi 13-year-old from Telangana becomes the youngest girl in history to climb Mount Everest.','/y6uxbfWtnvXvqoM6kDK4k8qsigd.jpg','2017-03-31',105,'Released',NULL,'Poorna',449777,1.3941,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43059,_binary '\0','/qgy7GXZFHONsd2R9fazJha8n94z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6182078',4.8,6490,'en','St. Agatha','St. Agatha is set in the 1950s in small town Georgia. A pregnant con woman named Agatha is on the run and seeks refuge in a convent hidden in deafening isolation. What first starts out as the perfect place to have a child turns into a dark lair where silence is forced. Ghastly secrets are masked, and every bit of will power Agatha has is tested. She soon learns the sick and twisted truth of the convent and the odd people that lurk inside its halls. Agatha must now find a way to discover the unyielding strength needed to escape and save her baby before she’s caged behind these walls forever.','/zpR3FzaagWTbwgFPn1P6sEZ4str.jpg','2018-04-20',103,'Released','Atone for your sins.','St. Agatha',502406,2.9636,5.5,'JPHkRJQ3ydw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43060,_binary '\0','/7t88SoT3Dd8DhGnQuVoSbMNUl3W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6182908',6.6,46298,'en','Smallfoot','A bright young yeti finds something he thought didn\'t exist—a human. News of this “smallfoot” throws the simple yeti community into an uproar over what else might be out there in the big world beyond their snowy village.','/zfaiO7QgpcvR8XDOMokWLRfKeTE.jpg','2018-09-20',96,'Released','There\'s been a big myth-understanding','Smallfoot',446894,11.6958,6.8,'34cHO5_LX9g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43061,_binary '\0','/sMJWZ74c1Y01Fswb0C0uDoVlpWe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6182954',6.9,2364,'ar','الكنز: الحقيقة والخيال','The events revolve around three eras: the Pharaonic era, the Mamluk era, and the first half of the 20th century. The events revolve around corruption and the power of some clerics over the ages to power and false and bad dealings with the people, and how to involve religion in politics in order to obtain positions. That there are clerics deliberately coloring and counterfeiting in this period of time to be the strongest and maintain their positions.','/w5hkOKcb8ExFl1tIzzdGCE5CFS0.jpg','2017-08-31',157,'Released',NULL,'The Treasure: Truth & Imagination',471402,1.3382,7,'krPCwmdlqwY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43062,_binary '\0','/mBmxc4EQi8GlNAgtx7r9SRxOivK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6183834',6.5,3391,'fr','Carbone','In danger of losing his business, Anthony Roca, an ordinary man, develops a scam that will become the heist of the century. Overtaken by the crime, he will have to deal with betrayal, murder and settling.','/gbFYXClD52Axdvo5h9XRVLDsBY.jpg','2017-11-01',104,'Released',NULL,'Carbone',427348,2.4351,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43063,_binary '\0','/93CoNRSqCfKQLFG8UJJKtJoaqjY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6185074',6.2,3802,'en','A Cinderella Christmas','Angie works hard to run her uncle’s events business while her cousin Candace takes the credit. When Angie takes a night off to have fun at the Christmasquerade Ball, the mask and gown allow her to let loose, and she quickly catches the eye of Nicholas, a wealthy local bachelor. But then Angie has to go before revealing her identity, leaving Nicholas searching for his mystery woman in this modern take on the classic fairy tale.','/yD4SvhjDKi7ppsceMbxXKgMBtUi.jpg','2016-12-04',93,'Released','One Night Changes Everything','A Cinderella Christmas',426808,1.8198,6.7,'-_DdKxQ9O50','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43064,_binary '\0','/2eyFqpycQQzU08CEq1cDAy2JGEK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6185286',6.8,3548,'en','Saving Capitalism','Former Secretary of Labor Robert Reich meets with Americans from all walks of life as he chronicles a seismic shift in the nation\'s economy.','/klxZFkVYV0bmOdeLI8YQ8GcE26m.jpg','2017-08-25',73,'Released','A nation divided by the bottom line.','Saving Capitalism',483010,1.1829,6.7,'8T9E2DBzAaI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43065,_binary '\0','/xQZCErvAiznVtnFVHVhfYbwlCXU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6186696',5.4,1262,'fr','La Femme la plus assassinée du monde','Set against the backdrop of the infamous Theatre Grand Guignol the story revolves around iconic actress Paula Maxa - the most famous of the Grand Guignol\'s leading ladies and the titular Most Assassinated Woman, who was graphically slain on stage multiple times a day.','/tC4IfhFv84CxC19BXN3678IeNRN.jpg','2018-07-09',102,'Released',NULL,'The Most Assassinated Woman in the World',478100,2.1829,5.3,'xacSes-zouQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43066,_binary '\0','/6TKLf5HdE8bCkzHvhmL5xctim6g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6186910',7.3,6988,'ta','இமைக்கா நொடிகள்','A CBI officer goes in search of a ruthless serial killer. Things get worse when the murderer targets the former and her family','/mHkeMrAqW4TnRkeI1Xl8qwuGyPg.jpg','2018-08-30',170,'Released',NULL,'Imaikkaa Nodigal',415193,1.8466,6.926,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43067,_binary '\0','/qSnP4Yt5H9pPmOS0T7m7M85xp4L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6186940',5.4,1439,'en','Hot Air','A right-wing talk show host\'s life takes a sudden turn when his 16-year-old niece comes crashing into his life.','/x301l8Ium9lDuEh2DCkkDB60zPj.jpg','2018-04-10',99,'Released','We all have a voice. Just be careful how you use it.','Hot Air',479315,2.1661,4.9,'anhaAehgVgI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43068,_binary '\0','/sZkhzNns3oXPl3BlIwZNKpZZnIm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6187134',6.5,2227,'en','Cowboys','Troy and his young transgender son Joe are on the run from his conservative mother in the Montana wilderness, with a detective in hot pursuit.','/88ddT0lpefhVCwN0hNCA4dH2IKU.jpg','2020-04-15',86,'Released',NULL,'Cowboys',681022,1.6296,6.2,'jKSxBCatIKA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43069,_binary '\0','/sGqqnvOqJg2HDHrjtCPIlCwF4Mu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6189022',6.4,124394,'en','Angel Has Fallen','After a treacherous attack, Secret Service agent Mike Banning is charged with attempting to assassinate President Trumbull. Chased by his own colleagues and the FBI, Banning begins a race against the clock to clear his name.','/fapXd3v9qTcNBTm39ZC4KUVQDNf.jpg','2019-08-21',122,'Released','Loyalty is under fire.','Angel Has Fallen',423204,18.0959,6.609,'5U2AJvU3bl4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43070,_binary '\0','/ngZXl98oeifZWiQAcmaItboEx6t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6189344',7,1617,'it','Tutto quello che vuoi','An aimless young troublemaker, Alessandro, squanders his days gambling and getting into fights, and he often spends his nights in jail. With few prospects, he begrudgingly accepts a job as a companion to Giorgio, an elderly poet suffering from Alzheimer’s. On their daily walks, the two banter and become friends, and Alessandro quickly learns more about this forgotten poet as the old man’s memory drifts. After learning a secret from Giorgio’s past, Alessandro and his friends work to uncover the mystery of this tale, an unexpected history lesson and a touching coming-of-age adventure.','/1FOuI1i7jWb4MNfPgIERrsUGYrM.jpg','2017-05-11',106,'Released',NULL,'Everything You Want',457601,1.6374,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43071,_binary '\0','/dxPDr0aeJFF1ZCOKAVtnrcjPFjG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6190198',6.3,1607,'ja','先生！ 、、、好きになってもいいですか？','Hibiki Shimada, a normal 17-year-old high-school student, still does not know how to fall in love—although surrounded by love \"experts\"—until one day she realizes she\'s fallen in love with her hot and nice 26-year-old teacher, Itō. She then takes a path to make her teacher understand how she feels for him.','/An1er9gMQZMVdamZI2Un8sd3FbJ.jpg','2017-10-28',113,'Released',NULL,'My Teacher',447180,2.526,7.1,'HpYqkdn2ilU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43072,_binary '\0','/kUMRSilcBvag2Ghie7PYlQ32bwo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6190348',6.5,1265,'en','Pin Cushion','Super close mother Lyn and daughter Iona (Dafty One and Dafty Two) are excited for their new life in a new town. Determined to make a success of things after a tricky start, Iona becomes \'best friends\' with Keely, Stacey and Chelsea. Used to being Iona\'s bestie herself, Lyn feels left out. So Lyn also makes friends with Belinda, her neighbour.','/947q315H51BBXJdyLRWqiLXSYhI.jpg','2018-07-13',82,'Released',NULL,'Pin Cushion',473706,1.7171,6.4,'hO0vGMGNWjQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43073,_binary '\0','/2ctzzoMYB8XmsJ75xfE1fXQnIZT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6190456',6.4,1719,'hu','X – A rendszerből törölve','Would you believe in a policewoman who suffers from such serious panic disorders that she is afraid to get close to any crime scene and has been on permanent office duty for more than a decade? Would you believe a lone mother who is unfit to pay her mortgage and also raise her rebellious teenage daughter? Indeed, no one believes that the troubled ex-detective has discovered a serial murder case. Personal dramas and a murder mystery unfold in present-day Budapest, where demonstrations are part of the pre-election life of a city still trying to cope with the shadows of its historical and recent past. It is a city where nothing seems honest and true, except through the eyes of an emotionally unstable policewoman and her misfit daughter who wants to know who her father truly was.','/4KoSAtCx2aOpt8s6cxIWUoeoHSQ.jpg','2018-11-01',111,'Released',NULL,'X - The eXploited',554364,1.8555,6.6,'utQL6m4Z1iA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43074,_binary '\0','/gbwN4yaMCB3KzC5tvMMoZwy0LWN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6191390',3.8,1280,'en','Gremlin','A man receives a mysterious box containing a terrible secret, a creature that will kill everyone else in his family unless he passes it on to someone he loves to continue its never-ending circulation.','/tsTzpzL1qrh6PSP8kX8f6HDRulo.jpg','2017-01-11',90,'Released','Big things come in small packages','Gremlin',436496,1.0951,3.9,'HycuIO8-NsY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43075,_binary '\0','/sErkQj6LSvzM8zdvnMvgp5ymV9E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6191876',7,1573,'en','What We Started','Bert Marcus and Cyrus Saidi present an informed and absorbing exploration of the history of EDM, boosted by an energetic soundtrack and anchored by the personal stories of legendary DJ Carl Cox and superstar newcomer Martin Garrix. Insights from numerous other DJs and musical talents like Moby, David Guetta, Paul Oakenfold and Usher help tell the often oppositional tales of old school vs. new school and mainstream vs. underground.','/dw8lZlaur7YEgsqr6c2Zx2DWqOk.jpg','2018-03-23',70,'Released',NULL,'What We Started',4