that belongs to a young man on the run...','/5MTsowSLS4ryluc2Nahj8ZzGi0F.jpg','2017-06-21',106,'Released',NULL,'Ava',453354,2.0453,6.3,'ZF2XRVr2o2c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43080,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6194850',6.6,1465,'lt','Zero III','An outrageous crime - action - comedy examining corruption and greed in Lithuanian politics.','/iZUcV3pPXbB2mRbVijUo4M9lY6w.jpg','2017-01-27',90,'Released',NULL,'Zero III',437830,1.0915,7.4,'JhRZORUkpOs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43081,_binary '\0','/axiLQwO5Z1YdNvhqy4VxUhUavW7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6194984',7.3,1517,'bg','Вездесъщият','The story of Omnipresent is centered around Emil, writer and owner of advertising agency who gradually becomes obsessed with spying on his family, friends and employees via hidden spy cameras. What starts as an innocent hobby ends up as a total disaster, as in the process he abuses his new power and eventually comes to realize that some secrets should be left uncovered.','/g7vKjV6rPC4cYLvF9veuWO6DVf4.jpg','2017-10-13',120,'Released',NULL,'Omnipresent',480645,1.1402,5.8,'UkJZ9zV6HFc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43082,_binary '\0','/oFyptNOx02o8sMcSsax4GSCAemg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6195094',6.4,48089,'en','Ghostland','A mother of two inherits a home from her aunt. On the first night in the new home she is confronted with murderous intruders and fights for her daughters’ lives. Sixteen years later the daughters reunite at the house, and that is when things get strange...','/ma9gY6OikBev8MsMaeA6h2EIdGo.jpg','2018-03-14',91,'Released','You really thought you’ve been scared?','Ghostland',476299,7.1842,7.397,'Q8KqeolPt2w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43083,_binary '\0','/d8ykdViWaxSSN5ZdAUGrDAhmROF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6195756',5.7,4721,'en','Wonderwell','In an idyllic Italian village, a young American girl on the threshold of adolescence is swept into a timeless magical adventure in Wonderwell.','/deoxTZeVAULpVvbbxrNxAcyHAkk.jpg','2023-06-23',96,'Released','Transform your world forever.','Wonderwell',456483,1.9996,5.5,'2hnU8hi528E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43084,_binary '\0','/O7GlRZ6nN1rqUXSkHbnXGjn6nl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6196936',6,9024,'en','The Kill Team','When Andrew Briggman — a young soldier in the US Army during the invasion of Afghanistan — witnesses the murderous behavior of fellow soldiers, under the direction of a malevolent Sergeant, he faces a moral dilemma. His increasingly-violent platoon becomes suspicious that someone in their ranks has turned on them, and Andrew begins to fear for his safety. A fictionalized dramatization based on a true story.','/wLRZbtrbV51oQuvqNeK6vhb6btV.jpg','2019-10-17',87,'Released','Soldiers. Brothers. Enemies.','The Kill Team',489245,4.9194,6.48,'0mab6h2sE5g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43085,_binary '\0','/eq33PifwGNHvNZxMXddH32w3Cr0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6197028',6.9,1803,'en','The Coming War on China','John Pilger reveals what the news doesn\'t - that the United States and the world\'s second economic power, China (both nuclear armed) are on the road to war. Pilger\'s film is a warning and an inspiring story of resistance.','/i8dLrZv0jD1pdQMeb4pC2owtjZy.jpg','2016-12-05',110,'Released',NULL,'The Coming War on China',426634,1.215,6.5,'kaoe4eAACu4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43086,_binary '\0','/c7TXEWIbLWJUi9c1w9yazNWBB4l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6197070',6.1,4431,'en','Blood Machines','An artificial intelligence escapes her spaceship to turn into a female ghost and challenges two blade runners to a galactic chase.','/nT8cZQCz5pf0NBSnZDTDrfC8Mgn.jpg','2020-09-01',50,'Released','The Cosmic Opera','Blood Machines',536517,1.3683,6.302,'pDPojzRXQOI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43087,_binary '\0','/e0ziCGOEXhSaNuIyfh5svpflXhT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6197094',5.5,1366,'it','Beata ignoranza','Ernesto and Filippo, two high school teachers, couldn’t be more different: Filippo is a cheerful liberal who is constantly online. Handsome and youthful, he is a serial seducer on the social networks. Ernesto, instead is a stern conservative, rigorously computerless. He is probably the last person around who still has a first-generation cell phone and his teaching methods are very traditional. They used to be best friends but an unresolved fight kept them far apart, until the day fate intervened and they found themselves teaching at the same school. Their opposite viewpoints will soon and inevitably lead to a new clash. The internet will force them to deal with their past, which resurfaces in the shape of Nina, a young woman who conducts an experiment on them: Filippo must try to leave the world of Internet and Ernesto must try to enter it.','/zI0jYXFdiG9jram9yWSadttUyxB.jpg','2017-02-23',102,'Released',NULL,'Ignorance Is Bliss',419522,1.6471,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43088,_binary '\0','/AlGZhb44qqwBlF4gAONo9mE88h3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6197484',5.4,2068,'es','Que baje Dios y lo vea','A young priest coaches a team of uncoordinated monks in order to win a soccer tournament and save their monastery from being turned into a hotel.','/1KOwQ6O42pk2mg3xbA0hQJInK5.jpg','2018-01-05',95,'Released',NULL,'Holy Goalie',437310,1.9114,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43089,_binary '\0','/5Iw2ArIWqy5PQnGgLi2ZTEtdrgp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6197494',5.1,4774,'en','Malicious','A young college professor and his pregnant wife unwittingly release a malevolent entity with murderous intentions.','/ms6V9gUMcw6T6ENgUCU7SL5x7dl.jpg','2018-06-23',90,'Released','It will take what\'s most precious to you.','Malicious',426375,3.2824,5.618,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43090,_binary '\0','/jnOHkANcd0RC4ns708moAUAU8AC.jpg','2026-1