st Order-','The Chaldea Security Organization was founded to focus on preserving the continuation of human history. They observe a world which magecraft couldn’t observe, and science couldn’t measure, all to prevent the certain extinction of humanity. But one day, the future that Chaldea continued to observe disappears and humanity’s extinction in 2017 becomes clear. Based on the assumption that Fuyuki, a provincial town in Japan, is the reason for humanity’s extinction, Chaldea issues an order to explore, investigate, and possibly destroy this singularity – a quest for the Holy Grail, the Grand Order.','/3u9kOT50sUxGGfzcVjljlQXbt4p.jpg','2016-12-31',72,'Released','A battle to take back our future begins now...','Fate/Grand Order -First Order-',428142,2.7748,6.776,'OUx-VN-DDmk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43123,_binary '\0','/4t6a0DTPzDZnvqX6qMtspSdpY1r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6214084',7.6,6262,'tr','İşe Yarar Bir Şey','A chance meeting on a train in the Turkish countryside leads two women to a journey that shows them the importance of setting a path for one\'s life.','/Rt5LimhHFGzWlKSp2bAjOVivFO.jpg','2017-04-12',107,'Released',NULL,'Something Useful',468274,1.5995,7.435,'gUa1gy966Kg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43124,_binary '\0','/cBd8YL9Rp4mEBrvx7UBM8Hrb01L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6214468',5.2,4168,'en','The Russian Bride','A Russian woman travels to America with her daughter to marry a reclusive billionaire offering them a better life, but soon begins to suspect her new husband might have a far more sinister plan for their arrangement.','/6Mv09q2IHhG6YPPffgnESQw2fcn.jpg','2019-04-12',91,'Released','Till death do us part','The Russian Bride',524787,2.7874,5.293,'NX7XeqOo37I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43125,_binary '\0','/cl5mGmZYVHnyU4EmezCmpndchMq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6214722',7.8,1830,'en','If I Leave Here Tomorrow: A Film About Lynyrd Skynyrd','The