nd Christian legend woven to try and create a more complete picture. It follows Longinus as the Roman soldier who put the spear to Jesus on the cross.','/pyuA80lQae6F9zdOIHuVLQzfLZh.jpg','2019-04-19',115,'Released','One last journey','The Christ Slayer',580494,1.2357,5,'2u9LK0t7n8k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43147,_binary '\0','/9pHxv7TX0jOKNgnGMDP6RJ2m1GL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6222118',4.7,9394,'en','The Doorman','A former Marine turned doorman at a luxury New York City high-rise must outsmart and battle a group of art thieves and their ruthless leader — while struggling to protect her sister\'s family. As the thieves become increasingly desperate and violent, the doorman calls upon her deadly fighting skills to end the showdown.','/pklyUbh4k1DbHdnsOMASyw7C6NH.jpg','2020-10-01',97,'Released','Be careful who you trust.','The Doorman',737568,7.1422,5.772,'pugLE1ifvbY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43148,_binary '\0','/i42FWbAW3aQMpU6LTl0VCKfJfOm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6222286',3.9,1362,'en','Perfect','A young man with a violent past enters a mysterious clinic where the patients wildly transform their bodies and minds using genetic engineering.','/b2a5ZkBbluJwbZfZvgKVKXP69xi.jpg','2019-05-17',85,'Released',NULL,'Perfect',462920,1.529,4.3,'7CAcn-q9IP8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43149,_binary '\0','/dTfvtJP2H2xNy6kH9YwCUIYauu2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6223806',6.8,5946,'is','Undir trénu','When Baldvin and Inga\'s next door neighbours complain that a tree in their backyard casts a shadow over their sundeck, what starts off as a typical spat between neighbours in the suburbs unexpectedly and violently spirals out of control.','/hiIYGMGAb5TrP8WnG2XsCjcmVKN.jpg','2017-09-06',89,'Released','Two Families. One Tree. A Bloody Mess.','Under the Tree',472640,2.6724,6.7,'tU7KeDwJCAc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43150,_binary '\0','/ynF37QsffZ1b3Xm2