e a greater evil takes over the town.','/s9xT8Kot0RiWDQ1Rl5gXTC8fQ49.jpg','2017-06-16',88,'Released','Some lines must be crossed.','County Line',521639,2.5446,5.9,'DArs5XTWv_k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43167,_binary '\0','/tTF8vFbu192NHDPxq0cHkstlwaz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6243370',2.9,2976,'en','The Demented','For one female entity time stands still, while for another time travels back and forth between the plains of the supernatural world.','/awKGmNSanNgdo5ilAa34i4ymiVf.jpg','2021-08-12',91,'Released','Life runs at 24 frames per second...','The Demented',642694,1.0136,1.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43168,_binary '\0','/aeiEJd3v2vf4AdCz0OI7HfPbmUL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6245488',6.8,2961,'en','Finding Father Christmas','Orphaned at a young age at Christmas, Miranda finds a clue that could unveil the truth about her father - and maybe a little something else will rekindle her Christmas spirit.','/wwvfUurOYrV3SI8MXINU6u0Q2qs.jpg','2016-11-13',84,'Released',NULL,'Finding Father Christmas',421630,1.7965,6.2,'4wS8bbzQDX0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43169,_binary '\0','/3ULzK4XTSC1wal11K7459fxnjjA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6246322',6,83419,'en','Don\'t Breathe 2','The Blind Man has been hiding out for several years in an isolated cabin and has taken in and raised a young girl orphaned from a devastating house fire. Their quiet life together is shattered when a group of criminals kidnap the girl, forcing the Blind Man to leave his safe haven to save her.','/aOu6PJVO9RyGAzdUwG6fupu0gpz.jpg','2021-08-12',98,'Released','Bad things happen to bad people.','Don\'t Breathe 2',482373,10.5934,7,'dCDLPlZAoeY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43170,_binary '\0','/y9wDrq3aGAjtywQ9xSddP3FR00e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6246534',7.2,1892,'en','Miss Virginia','A struggling inner-city mother sacrifices everything to give her son a good education. Unwilling to allow her son to stay in a dangerous school, she launches a movement that could save his future - and that of thousands like him.','/vc6QS4YRYfhtd5C0cS07TxTPwiL.jpg','2019-10-18',102,'Released','Be Brave. Be Heard. Believe.','Miss Virginia',574950,1.5704,7.8,'qOUUA7JTIEo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43171,_binary '\0','/10xi2WqeHKrb2eo6jD51a0LIw8D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6247936',6.4,2208,'fr','Django','The story of Django Reinhardt, famous guitarist and composer, and his flight from German-occupied Paris in 1943.','/snZ8Blip3oKY5V19tWded4eoYA0.jpg','2017-04-26',117,'Released',NULL,'Django',436334,1.98,6.3,'Lw5DvTAVomA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43172,_binary '\0','/xD9ZcS1wNouZpTLc3qWOyv3Ii1C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6248178',1.7,1242,'tr','Adam Mısın!','The famous people that host \"Beyaz Futbol\" find themselves in a terrible situation where one man controls them. In order to be free, the Beyaz Futbol team has to do the missions that the guy gives them.','/7od3RdvqchQvgW7utXQ6yqwLGwQ.jpg','2016-11-18',91,'Released','Are You A Person','Adam Mısın!',608436,1.5599,1.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43173,_binary '\0','/fZAxO4RxgCX3n7ptq6ZaqFXR6mb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6250604',7.7,1441,'bn','Swatta','A bohemian encounters a woman with whom a love affair ensues.','/7Nooqte2NGEwdJsoFIqZrSNrZLZ.jpg','2017-04-07',140,'Released',NULL,'Swatta',577290,1.478,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43174,_binary '\0','/apPJM6ns9T0PUo3c6TTziRmRyH5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6250650',5.1,1671,'en','Halloween Party','A college student unwittingly releases terrifying entities from her school\'s past via a Halloween-themed computer meme.','/9GyxiIRV7Sz4YCyUJ5x3kyDzVok.jpg','2020-10-02',93,'Released','Get haunted.','Halloween Party',544075,1.3457,5.9,'wX61veJtENE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43175,_binary '\0','/k98zx90KvkGmGxJ7inYYm