ident, John Callahan discovers the healing power of art, willing his injured hands into drawing hilarious, often controversial cartoons, which bring him a new lease on life.','/rKsiN37qMt8jad5GikZzSeevyI9.jpg','2018-04-04',115,'Released','Don\'t just sit there. Do nothing.','Don\'t Worry, He Won\'t Get Far on Foot',443009,5.1357,6.7,'2BwxeOzSx8A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43236,_binary '\0','/kVaTdQ4N3j64pIpFao31v7DeYcu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6288250',6.8,10878,'en','Patti Cake$','Straight out of Jersey comes Patricia Dombrowski, a.k.a. Killa P, a.k.a. Patti Cake$, an aspiring rapper fighting through a world of strip malls and strip clubs on an unlikely quest for glory.','/11MVxyp77zUPwc4cmqsUumNQYWK.jpg','2017-08-18',109,'Released',NULL,'Patti Cake$',426256,2.226,6.6,'L-591Dqa48g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43237,_binary '\0','/3naOwcmYNZfd80kC1OXmembjc8j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6288694',5.7,14822,'en','Acts of Vengeance','A fast-talking lawyer transforms his body and takes a vow of silence, not to be broken until he finds out who killed his wife and daughter and has his revenge.','/8dzAMMqEubPItk8EXrUXe0wyuzn.jpg','2017-10-27',87,'Released','Payback Speaks Louder Than Words','Acts of Vengeance',445954,6.5227,6,'9WNBGzyPD0U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43238,_binary '\0','/jEXOjVapXCShq5y4bkt36ioYs9c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6288876',6.5,3337,'en','A Christmas to Remember','A harsh TV personality, Jennifer, needs a break from her own life, so she hops into a car and drives to a small town mountain retreat. On her way there a blizzard veers off the road and she crashes. When she comes to she has complete amnesia and a friendly passerby takes her in. As time passes she still doesn’t remember who she is and the friendly passerby, a widower himself with three kids, assimilates her into his family. But as she slowly starts remembering who she is, she prefers the new life she’s built in the small town.','/xpOZBdq1bFf6nBSilkfLrtjhNL0.jpg','2016-12-18',84,'Released',NULL,'A Christmas to Remember',423893,2.6049,6,'oQzdzieD-zc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43239,_binary '\0','/jPYzClhrkuiqB2CX540pz7G53sK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6289224',4.1,1393,'en','Mondo Hollywoodland','Homage to the cult classic “Mondo Hollywood”, a groovy mushrooms dealer and a man from the 5th dimension journey through Hollywood to find the meaning of “Mondo.”','/77Mi4J7hDTBUi41UErCYb3ns3RM.jpg','2021-08-03',104,'Released','Explore the titans, weirdos, and dreamers.','Mondo Hollywoodland',571286,1.6337,6.2,'Yy0w6H64oQc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43240,_binary '\0','/cDLm4e4EsmcRGiKVtqHSedMfl7Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6289394',4.8,2515,'tr','Dönerse Senindir','Mehmet who is an idealist advertising photographer, has just separated from his girlfriend Selin. He deeply suffers from love pain but doesn\'t lose his hope of regaining her. Then he meets the mysterious Defne, who encourages him to take action before everything is too late. With the other close friends of Mehmet, they make a secret plan to bring back the lost love, Selin who is a very popular singer now, and the hopeful adventure which no one is sure of its ending whether it will be happy or not, begins.','/kbz1JZqmZINLzISnbSDLHmP6gam.jpg','2016-12-23',109,'Released','Most romantic version of love pain','Welcome Back',456669,2.0241,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43241,_binary '\0','/k1ljuosdTNQDIbUJa6i1MuYUI3p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6289452',2,3722,'tr','Kötü Çocuk','Kayla and Meriç seeks to find love inbetween purposeless teenagers who wants to fight Meriç without any reason.','/1v7pUkiUFLuvTHEiAWuS6BjHCQw.jpg','2017-01-20',120,'Released',NULL,'Bad Boy',437486,1.8304,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43242,_binary '\0','/ch2ZiazlS1KUfXTdjgRfNQKEfK2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.00