so-called sister, alongside her attractive boyfriend, compel Martina to go to Chile with one objective in mind: getting back her libido.','/gA6nTGlDtFdRtGEYHSEBzSJ1Xzy.jpg','2018-06-21',95,'Released','Thirsty for love','Dry Martina',510338,1.525,5.8,'SvrA1pdA7wc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43270,_binary '\0','/eA0qY147qTT8rPu65cgQb6GVjer.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6313158',6.2,5021,'tr','Olanlar Oldu','A mother\'s plan to find her bachelor son a match derails when a new prospect turns up and sinister schemes unfold.','/ikyl1liJU6G1Y31oegsnVkIKFlo.jpg','2017-01-19',103,'Released',NULL,'Bygones Be Bygones',433138,1.2859,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43271,_binary '\0','/peysDkfc3h0lkBWiafDLMlR4DD8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6313378',6.3,1466,'fr','La Douleur','In the last days of the Nazi-occupied France, writer Marguerite Duras awaits the return of her husband, Robert Antelme, arrested for being a Resistance fighter and then deported, while she maintains a tense relationship with her ambiguous lover and a dangerous game with a French collaborationist. Even when the Liberation arrives, she must still endure the unbearable pain of waiting.','/gcrKJJE5SOaTw6PPmO3FNrQenp3.jpg','2017-08-17',126,'Released','From the life of Marguerite Duras','Memoir of War',467675,2.0903,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43272,_binary '\0','/6swQWjlfmT9j2dt0vbAYAYNwzlw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6314690',5.4,1643,'fr','Les As de la Jungle','Maurice may look like a penguin - but he\'s a real tiger inside! Raised by a tigress, he\'s the clumsiest kung-fu master ever. Along with his friends, The Jungle Bunch, he intends to maintain order and justice in the jungle, as his mother did before he. But Igor, an evil koala, wants to destroy the jungle once and for all—helped by his army of silly baboons.','/rZ0T0yRe8iDqAgeZXRNvpAJh5z1.jpg','2017-07-26',97,'Released',NULL,'The Jungle Bunch',448779,3.9915,6.3,'H7