e, the songs, scores, the gestures, knitting, scenes she has to learn, things are going okay, there\'s progress, development, she is even overwhelmed. The film director also works, through his encounters, through archives, music, he let\'s himself be submerged, overwhelmed like the actress, by the actress.','/2MKyqhM5CfuFBdIc3vFtkrLZfCS.jpg','2017-09-06',98,'Released',NULL,'Barbara',451618,2.1386,5.9,'vQLwhY_kqFk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43409,_binary '\0','/12RXkIWUXwOHXgAmlxJNIWRGrri.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6412452',7.2,187033,'en','The Ballad of Buster Scruggs','Vignettes weaving together the stories of six individuals in the old West at the end of the Civil War. Following the tales of a sharp-shooting songster, a wannabe bank robber, two weary traveling performers, a lone gold prospector, a woman traveling the West to an uncertain future, and a motley crew of strangers undertaking a carriage ride.','/voxl654m7p36y8FLu8oQD7dfwwK.jpg','2018-11-09',132,'Released','Stories live forever. People don\'t.','The Ballad of Buster Scruggs',537996,11.6436,7.1,'_2PyxzSH1HM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43410,_binary '\0','/r1mfWgKzW0Yb3zsfix8MyFB3zlU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6412864',6.8,5556,'ko','밤의 해변에서 혼자','In a foreign city, an actress wanders through a seaside town, reflecting on her relationship with a married man. How important is love in one’s life? Younghee wants to find out.','/mprIyn1rl5ukAVP9Vi9ZaRKtKkw.jpg','2017-03-23',101,'Released',NULL,'On the Beach at Night Alone',434773,3.2477,6.54,'Fc-69WKXgDQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43411,_binary '\0','/dCIwaClTK8zJ36kEYZXIaxBblJS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6413410',6.6,3834,'ko','브이아이피','A son to a high-ranked official in North Korea commits a series of murders going across the countries around the world. The movie depicts the following events as South Korea, North Korea and Interpol start chasing down after 