9,'fr','Un beau soleil intérieur','Isabelle, Parisian artist, divorced mother, is looking for love, true love, at last.','/6O5F7dN47KUTB1HXcBvQlaQYYR6.jpg','2017-09-27',94,'Released','When you\'re not in love, what do you do?','Let the Sunshine In',431017,3.6168,5.221,'ps_Sau7xqQY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43423,_binary '\0','/ai16vB3j857Ilmebz8WmjxHqesA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6423886',5.7,4656,'en','Happy Anniversary','A quirky couple spends their three-year dating anniversary looking back at their relationship and contemplating whether they should break up.','/nQYX248aotb6ma6QxJ14utYEYoD.jpg','2018-03-30',78,'Released','Falling in love is easy. Landing is hard.','Happy Anniversary',451563,2.4352,5.749,'cAowbM5a58Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43424,_binary '\0','/hh0VUsnUlElvIJAlx6lW4fgdzqc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6425816',6.9,2264,'ja','ワンピース～ハート オブ ゴールド～','A girl named Olga is pursued by both the World Government and a man named Mad Treasure, as she is the only one who knows the location of the Pure Gold, a substance that can buy the entire world. Olga ends up sailing with the Straw Hat Pirates, and they journey to find the Pure Gold on the lost island of Alchemi, which is located inside the stomach of a large angler fish named Bonbori.','/e91hSNOwrV9FvC8LyaroK8dYTlZ.jpg','2016-07-16',104,'Released','Find the Pure Gold!','One Piece: Heart of Gold',433157,3.1167,7.439,'Z76HMpNy_8M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43425,_binary '\0','/mLdlarm9wHTQtd0iNxSCohZKK7M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6426028',6.2,6153,'fr','Un couteau dans le cœur','In the summer of 1979, gay porn producer Anne sets out to film her most ambitious film yet, but her actors are picked off, one by one, by a mysterious killer.','/Aodlp3TH6FBti9igUCt8f5KS7Nb.jpg','2018-06-27',102,'Released',NULL,'Knife+Heart',475930,2.693,5.848,'A6DVFhvs0AM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43426,_binary '\0','/xe5TEtqMWEcVweYz9Uxhu8qKbyx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6426832',5.4,1643,'ml','പുത്തൻപണം','The sudden implementation of demonetisation rattles the country, and a few black money hoarders in Kerala are trying their best to save their void currencies by hook or crook. Kasaragod-based financier Nithyananda Shenoy also gets embroiled in it, and drawn into the scene are also a few underprivileged folk in Kochi. Dramatic situations surrounding the hotchpotch ensue, as each one tries to set their lives straight.','/jePXxUxwHCdZJiTrVnU9QuNF7B4.jpg','2017-04-12',147,'Released','The New Indian Rupee','Puthan Panam',452416,1.226,5.6,'MnbnKY3eLxU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43427,_binary '\0','/7IN6kTd21GkUtPSpdp5kUc3syi7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6428150',6.8,2502,'en','High Strung Free Dance','Zander Raines, a dazzling and tempestuous young choreographer, gives the break of a lifetime to two hopeful artists when he casts a stunning contemporary dancer, Barlow, and innovative pianist, Charlie, in New York’s most-anticipated new Broadway show: Free Dance. But the move throws off the show’s delicate creative balance when Charlie falls hard for Barlow, while Zander embraces her as his muse.','/dOdWTC9gvdQLhN1eYpiy77c2QEQ.jpg','2018-09-13',103,'Released','Dream big. Dance free.','High Strung Free Dance',540158,3.4289,7.3,'7Gd4wmFJ-mo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43428,_binary '\0','/h5Vxa8BRTeuY2MEu6lnJjv6p2Zr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6428676',5.9,13889,'en','Wonder Park','A young girl named June with a big imagination makes an incredible discovery -- the amusement park of her dreams has come to life. Filled with the world\'s wildest rides operated by fun-loving animals, the excitement never ends. But when trouble hits, June and her misfit team of furry friends begin an unforgettable journey to save the park.','/8KomINZhIuJeB4oB7k7tkq8tmE.jpg','2019-03-13',86,'Released','Dream Bigger','Wonder Park',400157,12.2911,6.6,'5MRSBuQt51A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43429,_binary '\0','/ecksst0Cb1AO1CZwmGjJu11bfUo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6428912',6.2,2065,'en','Michael Jackson: Searching for Neverland','Based on the best-selling book, Remember the Time: Protecting Michael Jackson in His Final Days, and told through the eyes of Jackson\'s trusted bodyguards, Bill Whitfield and Javon Beard. The movie will reveal firsthand the devotion Michael Jackson had to his children, and the hidden drama that took place during the last two years of his life.','/mRZIiG4vJiCgJh4v2EPUVVTznC8.jpg','2017-05-29',102,'Released',NULL,'Michael Jackson: Searching for Neverland',458293,2.377,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43430,_binary '\0','/uo1T8TSKhMkMTsFKcMJAOO6P0Jm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6432062',6.8,2966,'en','The Birthday Wish','A woman expecting to get engaged on her all-important 30th birthday gets a different surprise after she makes her birthday wish: a glimpse into her future – which doesn’t resemble anything she’s ever imagined for herself.','/b9gK5vq7ByP76dYUC5xeCa7jWCo.jpg','2017-01-21',84,'Released',NULL,'The Birthday Wish',435117,1.8222,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43431,_binary '\0','/aKIrKbszS7Kq0aTGTCRTYMp1EDX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6432466',6.7,31015,'en','Moxie','Inspired by her mom\'s rebellious past and a confident new friend, a shy 16-year-old publishes an anonymous zine calling out sexism at her school.','/aLBo1Ca9PggcWY98ItW5ZkdxTuA.jpg','2021-03-03',110,'Released','Find your voice.','Moxie',583689,4.1006,7.188,'Sf34qI1hjKU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43432,_binary '\0','/mSjjzzuj87pJV3paZWBrtaro474.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6433456',7.1,7886,'sv','Unga Astrid','When Astrid Lindgren was very young something happened that affected her profoundly, and this combination of both miracle and calamity came to shape her entire life. It was an event that transformed her into one of the most inspiring women of our age and the storyteller a whole world would come to love. This is the story of when a young Astrid, despite the expectations of her time and religious upbringing, decided to break free from society\'s norms and follow her heart.','/eEbu8tFPSyM4zt9dPJjeFj3qwlF.jpg','2018-09-14',123,'Released','Be the author of your own story.','Becoming Astrid',484428,2.554,7,'ia4cgd7D90M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43433,_binary '\0','/dNtKJW5Ljs0tMXER0k8ij4zupGJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6433832',6.4,3696,'es','El árbol de la sangre','Marc and Rebeca, a young couple, travel to an old country house that used to belong to their family. Once there, they write the shared history of their roots, creating a huge family tree that harbours relationships of love, heartbreak, sex, madness, jealousy and infidelity, and under which also lies a history laden with secrets.','/z3GhO9usvGOkGm9Okiym8RyET8t.jpg','2018-10-31',130,'Released','No secret remains hidden forever','The Tree of Blood',502350,2.8079,6.4,'TcZkeghXof8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43434,_binary '\0','/7GR03LqwB7ePPPhaK5BAYNzt3Vm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6433880',6.1,17647,'en','Anna and the Apocalypse','A zombie apocalypse threatens the sleepy town of Little Haven—at Christmas—forcing Anna and her friends to fight, slash, and sing their way to survival. In a desperate race to reach their loved ones, they soon learn that no one is safe in this new world, and with civilization falling apart around them, the only people they can truly rely on are each other.','/jVyqqMzDVRjUMeIoaJKSUpRnB9Y.jpg','2018-11-30',97,'Released','Oh the weather outside is frightful...','Anna and the Apocalypse',461928,3.8804,5.995,'dfWIfwKJ7vA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43435,_binary '\0','/lR6U7JNQHr59vseT1PGwGkqOYIJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6433886',5.5,2011,'sv','All Inclusive','A trip to Croatia to celebrate Inger\'s 60th birthday. The whole thing sounded like a great idea until Inger caught her husband having an affair. When the plane takes off for Split the depressed Inger and her two daughters, much too sensible Malin (35) and chaotic Tove (32) are on board. Tove has to struggle to be included in Inger and Malin\'s circle, the sister\'s rivalry over their mother is so strong it quickly escalates into a competition of who can comfort Inger the best.','/pfsESs3zqx1BXxmqGY4uXHfnalU.jpg','2017-11-10',105,'Released',NULL,'All Inclusive',475429,1.0371,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43436,_binary '\0','/chylK86J7LV5IaCSxnqH8bbCimy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6434022',7,1870,'ko','당신, 거기 있어줄래요?','A terminally ill surgeon travels back in time through the use of unique capsules to reunite with his dead lover. He then meets his juvenile self and they try to prevent her death.','/mFyWyuZ7H0cqxwGH8H3DgQbsbEj.jpg','2016-12-14',111,'Released','What if you get 10 chances to change your past.','Will You Be There',422576,2.2238,7.2,'dZCy8fhSFOQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43437,_binary '\0','/8tMgRjafAokCj8zHzixzHQklr85.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6435934',5.1,1811,'fr','Le Dernier Voyage','The red moon threatens our existence on earth. Our only hope is the enigmatic Paul WR, the most talented astronaut of its generation. But few hours before the start of the mission, Paul disappears.','/qH1kQPQLus8UQSQ9tKZ7UeThlsj.jpg','2021-05-19',87,'Released',NULL,'The Last Journey',754765,2.627,5.3,'36R5c3gBVK8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43438,_binary '\0','/oq597AkQ3AOcUO1RdaUS8N6fmrz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6436620',5.2,12021,'en','White Men Can\'t Jump','Seemingly opposite street hoopers, Jeremy, an injury prone former star, and Kamal, a has-been prodigy, team up to take one final shot at living out their dreams.','/i83Ykng2HVY5EF043zMmeQdLUQY.jpg','2023-05-11',101,'Released','Play hard. Hustle harder.','White Men Can\'t Jump',920125,4.9525,6.4,'noxvcFVmG4E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43439,_binary '\0','/72QAA1dKmOrqZafe7UhHafDTjEq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6436726',6.3,36911,'en','7500','When terrorists try to seize control of a Berlin-Paris flight, a soft-spoken young American co-pilot struggles to save the lives of the passengers and crew while forging a surprising connection with one of the hijackers.','/hL2uecLh2rTTbuVbOriXP0PhqIJ.jpg','2019-12-26',94,'Released','The distress code is only the beginning.','7500',509585,3.086,6.151,'Z5Vz9nPw2lg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43440,_binary '\0','/lCmVc5jCTMvwCPz0rtUKURhwC92.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6438030',6.5,4273,'nl','Patser','Antwerp, Belgium. The lives of four small-time drug dealers spin out of control when they steal a shipment of cocaine, triggering a full out war between an Amsterdam drug lord and a ruthless Colombian cartel.','/tIM3LzDJYB2DwEYOuKxgYZVHBZI.jpg','2018-01-24',125,'Released','Ain\'t nothing but a \'G\' thang','Gangsta',483552,1.6741,6.714,'Va0YjPTh6tE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43441,_binary '\0','/uG1GUcp4z0ywuO8fjAU7eUz4Sie.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6438096',7.4,6240,'en','Becoming Warren Buffett','The story of the evolution of a boy from Nebraska who became one of the most respected men in the world, and the heroes who helped guide him along the way. By allowing access to his life and never-before-released home videos, Buffett offers a glimpse into his unique mind to help us understand what is truly important when money no longer has meaning.','/sMS6f2uBu0tyGK9iowA21La9F1o.jpg','2017-01-30',90,'Released','Find Out What Life Is Really Worth','Becoming Warren Buffett',438137,1.6989,7.208,'jXg0V2tyhXo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43442,_binary '\0','/190ciRd37DTA5QmYq6tTbaRtxNk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6438840',4.8,3240,'en','Howard Lovecraft & the Undersea Kingdom','After conquering R\'yleh and the Frozen Kingdom young Howard Lovecraft must now travel to the Undersea Kingdom in order to free his captured family, protect three mysterious magical books, and prevent the impending wrath of Cthulhu.','/oHvCi0e7p7yTSZOOJcYmoikykXk.jpg','2017-09-23',89,'Released',NULL,'Howard Lovecraft & the Undersea Kingdom',491277,2.2374,4.3,'fxAQmye2tZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43443,_binary '\0','/udMUwcH9UBxwjvpRD3f0ExEJq89.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6439020',6.4,24189,'en','The Personal History of David Copperfield','A fresh and distinctive take on Charles Dickens’ semi-autobiographical masterpiece, The Personal History of David Copperfield, set in the 1840s, chronicles the life of its iconic title character as he navigates a chaotic world to find his elusive place within it. From his unhappy childhood to the discovery of his gift as a storyteller and writer, David’s journey is by turns hilarious and tragic, but always full of life, colour and humanity.','/2epgo9k2Jrs7qrTL1Rork1mDSKT.jpg','2019-11-07',119,'Released','From rags to riches... and back again.','The Personal History of David Copperfield',520900,5.9402,6.4,'oHG7FnBDY0Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43444,_binary '\0','/ifT6iEO8RC2BxPtJ2BrGwhigzWK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6439558',3.5,19902,'tr','Recep İvedik 5','During his visit of condolence to Ismet\'s funeral, Recep Ivedik feels sorry about Ismet\'s remaining family members due to his latest unfinished job contract which would cause hard financial situation for the family. Therefore, Recep decides to finish Ismet\'s last job by replacing himself as a bus driver and to transport group of athletes. Although Recep and his accompanying friend Nurullah were expecting this could be a short trip, they learn that it is not because they have to transport young national athletes to sports organization in a foreign country. This becomes the beginning for them to have irreversible adventure. When they are on the road, unfortunate things happen and crisis appears for the team. Recep, who believes only in victory, takes control of the situation and develops his own methods in order to make the team successful while he face with all funny events.','/jPIYxH4A0JV5vUVggBGE1lIlUaQ.jpg','2017-02-16',114,'Released','A Folk Hero','Recep Ivedik 5',438703,2.1366,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43445,_binary '\0','/xF6s75kkvSAYvmBbJUdUl00JuOT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6439776',6.5,1466,'en','Walking the Dog','Kristie Simmons, an attorney, initiates a legal battle trying to get approval for a bike lane for the local residents. When Bill, a local veterinarian, informs her that a dog named Gidget needs a home, Kristie agrees. While out walking Gidget, Kristie meets Keith Amos, an attorney on assignment from Seattle, while he\'s walking his lovable dog, Simon. Keith is immediately smitten with Kristie, her initially pleasant reaction to him turns sour when she learns he is her opposing counsel in the bike lane case.','/uKP3CiBZXqFd8wy6BNP0joj8vQ0.jpg','2017-02-04',83,'Released',NULL,'Walking the Dog',437513,1.5117,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43446,_binary '\0','/yBi5Yt6Lot6x1SiLvCLCunGfTjF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6441120',6.7,1580,'tr','Taksim Hold\'em','On a Saturday night in Istanbul, despite the pleas of his fiancée, cynical Alper refuses to join the anti-government protests happening on his doorstep. He just wants to stay home for his weekly dose of poker, played with his regular crew of high-school friends. Alper\'s game is threatened as his friends set off on a series of passionate, and at times ill-thought-out, squabbles on whether they should join the demonstrations or not.','/6HSHULCtLFOu5alO1mVclkLcTTl.jpg','2018-04-27',90,'Released',NULL,'Taksim Hold\'em',517112,0.792,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43447,_binary '\0','/mTupUmnuwwAyA0CNqpwaZn5mqjk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6442686',4.4,2167,'en','WarHunt','1945. A U.S. military cargo plane loses control and violently crashes behind enemy lines in the middle of the German black forest. Major Johnson sends a squad of his bravest soldiers on a rescue mission to retrieve the top-secret material the plane was carrying, led by Sergeants Brewer and Walsh. They soon discover hanged Nazi soldiers and other dead bodies bearing ancient, magical symbols. Suddenly their compasses fail, their perceptions twist and straying from the group leads to profound horrors as they are attacked by a powerful, supernatural force.','/9HFFwZOTBB7IPFmn9E0MXdWave3.jpg','2022-01-21',93,'Released','The war was just the beginning.','WarHunt',697799,2.6121,5,'TdvVGqosR6c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43448,_binary '\0','/yh0HQQRTWqBJpJtnombyXJz2L8I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6442978',7.3,13775,'en','Mommy Dead and Dearest','Child abuse, mental illness, and forbidden love converge in this mystery involving a mother and daughter who were thought to be living a fairy tale life that turned out to be a living nightmare.','/l77SGOaXhLfkBPdl3UqsVMg0w1l.jpg','2017-03-11',82,'Released','In this family, every illness was a lie - except the mother\'s.','Mommy Dead and Dearest',438446,1.5492,7.4,'9L29EG8b8Gs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43449,_binary '\0','/hX5cGuen5cEdAVfAbBgWpYAQ55T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6443294',6.6,4020,'en','Blaze','Inspired by the life of Blaze Foley, the unsung songwriting legend of the Texas outlaw country movement that spawned the likes of Merle Haggard and Willie Nelson. The film weaves together three periods in Blaze\'s life, exploring his love affair with Sybil Rosen; his last, dark night on Earth; and the impact his songs and his death had on his fans, friends, and foes.','/g3rMWJRP6rQO5qP9E6umeRq9hGA.jpg','2018-08-17',129,'Released','Based on a true Texas love story','Blaze',489928,2.4129,6.3,'sXvwFdTTwhI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43450,_binary '\0','/bQXAqRx2Fgc46uCVWgoPz5L5Dtr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6443346',6.1,308633,'en','Black Adam','Nearly 5,000 years after he was bestowed with the almighty powers of the Egyptian gods—and imprisoned just as quickly—Black Adam is freed from his earthly tomb, ready to unleash his unique form of justice on the modern world.','/rCtreCr4xiYEWDQTebybolIh6Xe.jpg','2022-10-19',125,'Released','The world needed a hero. It got Black Adam.','Black Adam',436270,28.9402,6.8,'DvCFc5JtkkA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43451,_binary '\0','/AxFbxju0j5D0fEezeK5gLS1Fj1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6444140',5.9,3234,'es','Tiempo compartido','While staying at a tropical resort, a man becomes convinced the American timeshare company running it has an evil plan to take away his loved ones.','/jWwLENF11LVApfrCxjuG936cnID.jpg','2018-08-02',96,'Released',NULL,'Time Share',387827,1.6075,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43452,_binary '\0','/erpotokOTYi8wrHFHn898YaQiWc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6444838',6.5,2411,'fr','L\'Atelier','Antoine has agreed to follow a writing workshop where some young people in insertion must write a noir novel with the help of Olivia, a recognized novelist. The work of writing will bring to life the working-class past of the city. Its shipyard is closed for 25 years, a nostalgia that does not interest Antoine, influenced by the anxiety of the present world','/kiOfmz12ELxNhPzem69pD1Ng3Qq.jpg','2017-10-11',114,'Released',NULL,'The Workshop',444397,2.0743,6,'QJNSUYjM44o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43453,_binary '\0','/luSylfUQyA3N56EXAguoGJVSHOP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6445396',5.5,1314,'fr','L\'Embarras du choix','Even at the age of 40, Juliette is used to other people making decisions for her. When she meets two guys she likes, she has to finally make her own decision.','/d82mQYgcbld4l0FkURk5jJvdOyJ.jpg','2017-03-15',95,'Released',NULL,'You Choose!',437425,2.3194,5.666,'ZcKfhPkdc_8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43454,_binary '\0','/3UHkAGbm8H8hbgIUuxyMHOHHLuY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6445414',6.2,13269,'pl','Ukryta gra','Warsaw, Poland, during the Cuban Missile Crisis, 1962. Josh Mansky, a troubled math genius and former US chess champion, is recruited to hold a dangerous public match against the Soviet champion, while playing the deadly game of espionage hidden in the darkest shadows of a hostile territory.','/7YRO2Jamqb6ck5vJqrwWgMFWuPW.jpg','2019-11-08',104,'Released','Times change — The stakes remain the same.','The Coldest Game',585759,6.1547,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43455,_binary '\0','/d5M4QqUTzzSGIdkl12bZ7YaU7rb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6449730',7.7,4787,'hi','Bal Ganesh','The film is about the childhood of Lord Ganesh. The film covers a) Lord Ganesh\'s birth and b) The story behind Lord Ganesh\'s voracious appetite which recalls the incident of Lord Kubera inviting Lord Shiva and Goddess Parvathi for a feast and the consequential events','/jxdOoBf6L0bfNUMl6TuGOjZz4xN.jpg','2007-02-08',106,'Released',NULL,'Bal Ganesh',32134,1.343,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43456,_binary '\0','/AjtQdUX41skfo8tthtrnJZI9bXV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6450186',7.3,21179,'en','I Can Only Imagine','Growing up in Greenville, Texas, Bart Millard suffers physical and emotional abuse at the hands of his father, Arthur. When Arthur becomes terminally ill, he finds redemption by embracing his faith and rediscovering his love for his son. Years later, Bart\'s troubled childhood and mended relationship with his dad inspires him to write the hit song \"I Can Only Imagine\" as singer of the Christian band MercyMe.','/veZszwMZu8d3WMU6TJX9sV5w1Y4.jpg','2018-02-14',110,'Released','The song you know. The story you don\'t.','I Can Only Imagine',470878,5.9935,7.5,'-71zHVHdTWc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43457,_binary '\0','/a6cDxdwaQIFjSkXf7uskg78ZyTq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6450804',6.2,214950,'en','Terminator: Dark Fate','Decades after Sarah Connor prevented Judgment Day, a lethal new Terminator is sent to eliminate the future leader of the resistance. In a fight to save mankind, battle-hardened Sarah Connor teams up with an unexpected ally and an enhanced super soldier to stop the deadliest Terminator yet.','/vqzNJRH4YyquRiWxCCOH0aXggHI.jpg','2019-10-23',128,'Released','Welcome to the day after judgement day.','Terminator: Dark Fate',290859,19.9641,6.42,'8CjYw1hARhY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43458,_binary '\0','/ehtMTb2IzDl1coSvfuKDfSA3cjt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6451304',6.5,2423,'zh','大世界','Three parties pursue the million dollars that driver Xiao Zhang stole to help out his girlfriend.','/hDgqrlBmyFlD2MBu2Zave6S4Z80.jpg','2018-01-12',77,'Released',NULL,'Have a Nice Day',437220,1.4725,5.639,'sLjiPsX3pAw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43459,_binary '\0','/6s1ONEuRCcMTvptATfA5Y5WVHEw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6452332',6.8,3040,'ja','夜明け告げるルーのうた','In a small fishing village, a gloomy middle school student named Kai meets a mermaid named Lu.','/3L0a3iNraKyedBcHhrYD9sy4V5W.jpg','2017-05-19',112,'Released','Your \"love\" changes me.','Lu Over the Wall',436120,4.2267,6.942,'8eN5QnoNhx0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43460,_binary '\0','/3gCW9kwMs8OPLzJEPQikgv980m6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6452574',7.6,68237,'hi','संजू','Sanju explores some of the most crucial chapters from movie star Sanjay Dutt’s dramatic and controversial real life. It gives a lowdown on his tryst with drugs and his trials and tribulations in the Arms Acts case and the 1993 Mumbai blasts.','/q1wkN4VQuBTj1AeyTLLz2w6awMA.jpg','2018-06-28',161,'Released','One man... many lives','Sanju',496328,1.8965,7.217,'1J76wN0TPI4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43461,_binary '\0','/5IP1dwSmq2fJP5y3CIzmSFoA3DM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6455162',5.7,36537,'hi','भूल भुलैया 2','When strangers Reet and Ruhan cross paths, their journey leads to an abandoned mansion and a dreaded spirit who has been trapped for eighteen years.','/fw0oMHiMt9qOuKEJEmzFiCNAnXc.jpg','2022-05-20',143,'Released','The Haunting Comedy is Back','Bhool Bhulaiyaa 2',695962,2.1436,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43462,_binary '\0','/xDwcGnZvXnTRWm7ArzabGqvoLbs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6455992',6.6,2100,'en','Love Blossoms','Violet is a chemist who is carrying on the legacy of her Belgian family\'s perfume company by recreating her late father\'s secret formula.','/wlpBFrmPsMsh6upoGg2Zuqog07a.jpg','2017-02-18',84,'Released',NULL,'Love Blossoms',442154,2.6645,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43463,_binary '\0','/2F7pwPEWYhwgQKQYmNNLxbDnC4h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6456222',5.6,1593,'en','Nostalgia','A mosaic of stories about love and loss, exploring our relationship to the objects, artifacts, and memories that shape our lives.','/vbvexHHFLEonIuXul2AVpnwgrZw.jpg','2018-02-16',115,'Released','Memories of Lives Lived','Nostalgia',442709,1.9149,5.5,'97YwKGrq00s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43464,_binary '\0','/cxwImFWajltfkBhsTEy8ZXiQ9NP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6456326',5.4,9443,'en','Monsters of Man','A robotics company vying to win a lucrative military contract team up with a corrupt CIA agent to conduct an illegal live field test. They deploy four weaponized prototype robots into a suspected drug manufacturing camp in the Golden Triangle, assuming they\'d be killing drug runners that no one would miss. Six doctors on a humanitarian mission witness the brutal slaughter and become prime targets.','/sENLgxCVtZqCMQIeuLep8FmdInr.jpg','2020-11-19',132,'Released',NULL,'Monsters of Man',733317,5.9579,6.4,'Ada9SU8tShA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43465,_binary '\0','/e2XWFVTWVzzlULBte9H1ydU6j9s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6456384',3.3,1284,'en','Messenger of Wrath','An independent 12 year old girl named Three is home alone late one night when her house is invaded by several masked intruders. While trying to escape from them she learns of a far more dangerous threat waiting outside.','/lgAmvFiZ27AOstg5CJ8jBykWwvq.jpg','2017-09-08',122,'Released',NULL,'Messenger of Wrath',484853,1.0097,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43466,_binary '\0','/qguhBulASYazOmw636Co1OjkODB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6456614',6.3,1811,'en','Love at First Bark','Portland interior designer Julia Galvins (Jana Kramer) adopts a dog and seeks the help of expert and handsome dog trainer Owen Michaels (Kevin McGarry). When she is hired to design a nursery and a “puppery,” as well as plan a puppy shower fund-raiser for a pregnant client and her pregnant dog, Julia asks Owen’s advice, and their friendship just might turn into something more.','/WnKi7fozcNAzJ6vQ9TXx4atmr6.jpg','2017-04-01',90,'Released',NULL,'Love at First Bark',446483,2.0986,6.4,'NICrILggtiI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43467,_binary '\0','/oAXUUA1LggI5LsAoxrL59XVwj6v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6458228',6.8,1547,'it','Il peccato','The life of Michelangelo Buonarroti.','/A1AoTiokDbsyrsGBCGVvPWq5pJp.jpg','2019-11-14',134,'Released',NULL,'Sin',497835,1.7551,5.8,'cTM4_qYLwpE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43468,_binary '\0','/4WheZtibiG35ejDCkWcHbxar5Z6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6461318',6.4,2916,'en','Lorelei','A man is released from prison after 15 years. He reunites with his high school girlfriend, now a single mother of three. What follows is a lyrical take on love, regret and second chances.','/lv8OxXYRQRfA08YJt6eatbPnzcT.jpg','2020-09-09',111,'Released',NULL,'Lorelei',692989,2.3752,6,'aXR1gDNPhT4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43469,_binary '\0','/usZOcneQvvluCpoPO0fPsqCFDmf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6461514',6.4,1793,'zh','乘风破浪','When a son attempts to reconcile with his father, a series of fateful events allow him to experience the father\'s life in the past.','/qGQHrrodfrpvRRm9OuJ7s6KmFkA.jpg','2017-01-28',102,'Released',NULL,'Duckweed',438081,2.2388,6.561,'aQ5dIPeBVgc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43470,_binary '\0','/hOHTDxD2C6vGZDbxTtZBb3p70kP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6462160',7.6,2302,'en','Eating Our Way to Extinction','With searing insight that shines light in dark corners, EATING OUR WAY TO EXTINCTION is a compelling feature documentary that opens the lid on the elephant in the room no one wants to talk about. Confronting and entertaining, this documentary allows audiences to question their everyday choices, industry leaders and governments. Featuring a wealth of world-renowned contributors including Sir Richard Branson and Tony Robbins, it has a message of hope that will empower audiences.','/qlBh665NQDrKrKh858X5Rq3Npad.jpg','2021-09-16',81,'Released','When food costs the Earth, who pays the price?','Eating Our Way to Extinction',858381,2.1142,6.9,'31mdVdQr8SU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43471,_binary '\0','/iEZ869MTsn6IvoK7wbKrlnlqxuc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6462462',6.7,5399,'fr','Le Brio','After an incident, a brilliant professor known for his outbursts is forced to mentor the student he wronged for a speech contest.','/l43VMuUg1DoItf9nMcMSj2ZSbn3.jpg','2017-11-22',95,'Released',NULL,'Le Brio',452187,2.6269,7,'_CE-2H-a62A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43472,_binary '\0','/1Lzp5MDXX8MMuPi6wB4aNrq0uNU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6462506',6.9,2753,'ko','그 후','On her first day at work, Ahreum replaces a woman who broke up with the boss. The wife of the boss finds a love note, bursts into the office, and mistakes Ahreum for the other woman.','/AjOe8RrgFOqWvHE5YuPcB0tl0pR.jpg','2017-06-07',91,'Released',NULL,'The Day After',451957,1.6583,6.5,'dCILhysoZG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43473,_binary '\0','/qfKVvAjIKCocpjTAjxT6WkAA3MG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6462958',6.5,27768,'en','I Want You Back','Peter and Emma thought they were on the precipice of life’s biggest moments – marriage, kids, and houses in the suburbs – until their respective partners dumped them. Horrified to learn that the loves of their lives have already moved on, Peter and Emma hatch a hilarious plan to win back their exes with unexpected results.','/an4HVcLT4Ce2aXgxuSEnJ1UDdfp.jpg','2022-02-10',116,'Released','Their exes have moved on. They haven\'t.','I Want You Back',680860,6.0246,6.315,'AJ_Zry9KLb8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43474,_binary '\0','/fXUpEHR6Wt50u6rF4QfN04NeJNG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6463320',7.1,4928,'sq','Zana','Haunted by her long-suppressed past and pressured by family to seek treatment from mystical healers for her infertility, a Kosovar woman struggles to reconcile the expectations of motherhood with a legacy of wartime brutality.','/dmquR0vNrKsouolA85SCGrbpKGs.jpg','2019-09-21',97,'Released',NULL,'Zana',621746,1.5231,6.8,'-b6KuMRTrk0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43475,_binary '\0','/7GL4M0fPLtdq27sfXhzpTw7j9F6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6463494',6.8,1638,'de','3 Tage in Quiberon','1981, Quiberon, a small village on the coast of Brittany, France. Hilde Fritsch arrives to visit her old friend who has retreated to a spa hotel to escape the daily pressures of her life. Her friend is world-famous star Romy Schneider, but together, they appear like two regular women who are just happy to be reunited. Yet it quickly becomes apparent that Hilde is supposed to offer the support the sensitive actress needs to be able to truly face her own demons.','/nEwtaXRits97JOmZArRcAIJFdxo.jpg','2018-04-12',115,'Released',NULL,'3 Days in Quiberon',495271,2.3422,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43476,_binary '\0','/9JD5I9MH1ZNsDfDiLX7ZHkGRDjC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6464360',4.9,1957,'en','The Hollow Child','Samantha has lived her whole life in different foster homes. Now living in a small town, she never feels like she quite fits in, even with her own current foster family who might adopt her, or the boy who follows her around doing her classwork. So, it’s perhaps natural that she doesn’t know what to do with a curious tagalong little sister named Olivia. One day, Sam callously ditches Olivia, who wanders off into the woods on her own and disappears.','/lHeNY6zvR9yA2JWF9FrIOldsc2j.jpg','2018-05-18',92,'Released','Something is different about Olivia','The Hollow Child',433419,2.3484,6.3,'EgYvizDPUhw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43477,_binary '\0','/bkxX4LE1kqqHrS0B7JsG7ygFbaX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6464678',4.8,1876,'en','Housewife','Housewife is centered on Holly whose mother murdered her sister and father when she was seven. 20 years later and slowly losing her grip on the difference between reality and nightmares, she runs into a celebrity psychic who claims that he is destined to help her.','/gHwRQ3PxnxwET7s8TS8ZulciwVj.jpg','2017-09-08',82,'Released','There\'s Only You And Your Dreams','Housewife',449550,3.0465,5.444,'f1yGW4NKbWM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43478,_binary '\0','/w5wRVjmHrHrBuhwtYMcbqGrYT2w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6466464',5.5,2096,'zh','西游记·女儿国','The Monkey King and his friends try to break free from a ruler that takes them hostage. However, their exploits provoke the anger of a deity that decides to punish them for their actions.','/zMYnxPIkUVaRIuTpS77B8hLGkBB.jpg','2018-02-16',114,'Released',NULL,'The Monkey King 3',437543,3.9256,5.7,'F7MR5MsIoSQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43479,_binary '\0','/ztiFxuG0gC6wQ8y7JZFYbCQyN4Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6467266',7.3,103622,'en','Sing 2','Buster and his new cast now have their sights set on debuting a new show at the Crystal Tower Theater in glamorous Redshore City. But with no connections, he and his singers must sneak into the Crystal Entertainment offices, run by the ruthless wolf mogul Jimmy Crystal, where the gang pitches the ridiculous idea of casting the lion rock legend Clay Calloway in their show. Buster must embark on a quest to find the now-isolated Clay and persuade him to return to the stage.','/aWeKITRFbbwY8txG5uCj4rMCfSP.jpg','2021-12-01',110,'Released','Where will your dreams take you?','Sing 2',438695,22.2523,7.831,'EPZu5MA2uqI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43480,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6467380',6.9,4096,'hi','हिन्द का नापाक को जवाब - मश्ग - लायन हार्ट - २','Sher-e-Hind along with his sidekick Honey Preet Insan have infiltrated the Pakistani army where he gives them a befitting response to all their terrorist activities.','/ytb15zVEMBlcCMWuM8DtTzWh6k2.jpg','2017-02-10',127,'Released',NULL,'Hind Ka Napak Ko Jawab: MSG Lion Heart 2',481484,0.6229,3.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43481,_binary '\0','/fITlwbBGKpnAnL1bocK29yw8nbh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6467738',6.3,1624,'hi','इरादा','A mysterious bomb blast in a business tycoon\'s factory prompts the state CM to hire an NIA officer. He meets an ex-army man seeking revenge for his dead daughter and a journalist demanding justice for her slain boyfriend. Nothing is what it seems. The film raises contemporary ecological issue with lot of thrill.','/p7D7sc1cqY1CullErh55wuw5Bwx.jpg','2017-02-17',109,'Released',NULL,'Irada',441751,0.9753,6.9,'aY9nH6XUPuU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43482,_binary '\0','/xykbO5WO4M5oXuejrBrpLY0NAww.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6467968',7.5,2269,'bg','Посоки','A road movie set in present day Bulgaria, a country remains optimistic, mainly because all the realists and pessimists have left. At a meeting with his banker, a small business owner, who drives a cab to make ends meet, discovers the bribe he will have to pay to get a loan has doubled. The ethics board that reviewed his complaint about extortion now wants its share of the action. At his wit\'s end, he shoots the banker and then himself. The incident sparks national debate on talk radio about how despair has taken over civil society. Meanwhile, six taxi drivers and their passengers move through the night, each in hope of finding a brighter way forward.','/7hpdl26BDmI0ToeDAh7jzLCxWvC.jpg','2017-10-20',103,'Released','Bulgaria remains optimistic, mainly because all the realists and pessimists have left','Directions',451988,1.4296,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43483,_binary '\0','/fHv7fxj9TYVLKCzuuRFR3Sd90Tx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6468814',4.8,1314,'te','టచ్ చెసి చూడూ','The film revolves around a police officer called Karthikeya (Ravi Teja), who struggles to maintain a balance between his personal and professional life. Until one incident changes his life forever.','/nbjRmZ8VqQJm1id2p5BCGcPOXdd.jpg','2018-02-02',147,'Released',NULL,'Touch Chesi Chudu',456426,1.1375,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43484,_binary '\0','/2Wjxq7qeuyWvXSdqvOr5mkbcdwN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6469548',5.4,7865,'en','The Head Hunter','On the outskirts of a kingdom, a quiet but fierce medieval warrior protects the realm from monsters and the occult. His gruesome collection of heads is missing only one - the monster that killed his daughter years ago. Driven by a thirst for revenge, he travels wild expanses on horseback. When his second chance arrives, it’s in a way far more horrifying than he ever imagined.','/ol0DSLOIN8Rq1BcWDTsk6NNwas6.jpg','2019-04-05',72,'Released','Grief. Anger. Vengeance.','The Head Hunter',553141,3.4481,5.4,'PJ3UyXKnJDo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43485,_binary '\0','/y2vmh7nyYFhZ4aCwLErAOQdOnFT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6469960',2.9,2317,'en','An Imperfect Murder','Successful actress Vera Lockman thrashes during a nightmare in which she struggles with, shoots and kills her drug-dealer ex-boyfriend. Jolted awake, she reveals in her journal that the killing actually occurred the day before and that Sal, dead, lies in a trunk in her living room.','/545kAn3YxeLhmsY1gJBzZwkjQ1q.jpg','2017-09-03',71,'Released','Truth comes at a price.','An Imperfect Murder',468291,4.7247,3.4,'S06abmL_lS0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43486,_binary '\0','/7BZiAmm3qPK7QQ2HmUnScv2EvBM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6470762',5.9,2219,'ja','劇場版 マジンガーZ ／ INFINITY','When the evil Dr. Hell attacks the Earth, the mighty giant mecha Mazinger Z is formed to stop him.','/muN1Gf5SnGz8Il2ViqsIX4pkfxA.jpg','2017-10-27',95,'Released',NULL,'Mazinger Z: Infinity',452970,6.1818,7.007,'qZ2OYb1wxZc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43487,_binary '\0','/6EWrPiEy8aZfNNc8pS0Y6NYct5z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6470924',6.9,4362,'de','Berlin Alexanderplatz','In 2015, thirty year old refugee Francis, the sole survivor of a boat that illegally crossed the Mediterranean, is drawn into Berlin\'s seedy underbelly.','/5i3ZUjsjDWrcqPGRoKrHsAltBvD.jpg','2020-06-25',184,'Released',NULL,'Berlin Alexanderplatz',575659,1.9308,6.9,'l90T61uP-rI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43488,_binary '\0','/lYWzv5TlU0JqynBb0xktygDPBnQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6471054',6.8,2051,'hi','अज्जी','After her 10-year-old granddaughter Manda is brutally raped by a serial sex offender, the young girl\'s Ajji sets out to seek revenge, after custodians of law refuse to bring the rapist to book, thanks to his influential political background.','/l9o0MyXY9n7oukVLmH84v9yMCoT.jpg','2017-11-24',104,'Released',NULL,'Ajji',482154,1.6895,6.65,'Wxow_2bUNZA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43489,_binary '\0','/g2dJYpwPijoShObTRkNDIKn4E6z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6471264',5.4,9064,'de','Fack ju Göhte 3','A bank robber becomes a teacher after being released from prison and finds himself at the center of a number of crazy adventures.','/bXNF83QyA2YsBaTh3aATnBw4iQR.jpg','2017-10-26',120,'Released',NULL,'Suck Me Shakespeer 3',437670,4.3968,6.1,'NO5phXA1kfc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43490,_binary '\0','/cNO77lEXZx2NlMyqItmxhp5UNSC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6471684',6.4,3649,'pt','Polícia Federal: A Lei é Para Todos','2013. During Operation Bidone, the Federal Police seized a truck loaded with palm heart, which contained 697 kg of cocaine. The investigation falls on the team assembled by Ivan Romano, based in Curitiba and composed by Beatriz, Júlio and Ítalo. The traffic connections lead them to the dower Alberto Youssef and later to the former Petrobras director Paulo Roberto Costa, who reveals an immense structure involving builders and the government, in order to divert public money. As the investigation progresses, the group led by Ivan is increasingly approaching some of the country\'s most influential politicians.','/TRwF9lEuK0jqAcvvMmVEux8sH3.jpg','2017-09-07',107,'Released',NULL,'Operation Carwash: A Worldwide Corruption Scandal Made in Brazil',457064,2.0154,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43491,_binary '\0','/cYdHaKx6Ihj1BIvbxpCxIGXfZ02.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6472976',7.2,99064,'en','Five Feet Apart','Seventeen-year-old Stella spends most of her time in the hospital as a cystic fibrosis patient. Her life is full of routines, boundaries and self-control — all of which get put to the test when she meets Will, an impossibly charming teen who has the same illness. There\'s an instant flirtation, though restrictions dictate that they must maintain a safe distance between them. As their connection intensifies, so does the temptation to throw the rules out the window and embrace that attraction.','/kreTuJBkUjVWePRfhHZuYfhNE1T.jpg','2019-03-14',116,'Released','When life keeps you apart, fight for every inch.','Five Feet Apart',527641,10.6589,8.2,'24YrEAGF32M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43492,_binary '\0','/L7DIiAdP8DnNqOh7454ZrTYspR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6473066',7.5,13065,'en','Clouds','Young musician Zach Sobiech discovers his cancer has spread, leaving him just a few months to live. With limited time, he follows his dream and makes an album, unaware that it will soon be a viral music phenomenon.','/2YvT3pdGngzpbAuxamTz4ZlabnT.jpg','2020-10-09',121,'Released','Don\'t wait for tomorrow to live for today.','Clouds',630566,4.222,8.2,'OWEgUhWU4g4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43493,_binary '\0','/2Enmg9KVNty2rOPNtXU8XWUHQ0a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6474040',6.1,16068,'en','Stockholm','Based on the extraordinary true story of the European city’s 1973 bank heist and hostage crisis that was documented in the 1974 New Yorker article “The Bank Drama” by Daniel Lang. The events grasped the world’s attention when the hostages bonded with their captors and turned against the authorities, giving rise to the psychological phenomenon known as “Stockholm Syndrome.”','/ko3AS33BLNEBcp1CO4FvdRltTxr.jpg','2019-04-12',92,'Released','Based on an absurd but true story','Stockholm',437626,3.9727,5.9,'ydoaqi2Whkk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43494,_binary '\0','/8tNX8s3j1O0eqilOQkuroRLyOZA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6475714',5.2,76132,'en','Monster Hunter','A portal transports Cpt. Artemis and an elite unit of soldiers to a strange world where powerful monsters rule with deadly ferocity. Faced with relentless danger, the team encounters a mysterious hunter who may be their only hope to find a way home.','/1UCOF11QCw8kcqvce8LKOO6pimh.jpg','2020-12-03',103,'Released','Behind our world, there is another.','Monster Hunter',458576,12.546,6.508,'3od-kQMTZ9M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43495,_binary '\0','/ridcUDnFumpMB5AAsIvFafTSx5i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6476140',5.4,50086,'en','Serenity','The quiet life of Baker Dill, a fishing boat captain who lives on the isolated Plymouth Island, where he spends his days obsessed with capturing an elusive tuna while fighting his personal demons, is interrupted when someone from his past comes to him searching for help.','/hgWAcic93phg4DOuQ8NrsgQWiqu.jpg','2019-01-24',102,'Released','On Plymouth Island, no one ever dies… unless you break the rules','Serenity',452832,6.951,5.471,'k3zMlsEK8xA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43496,_binary '\0','/wSDQMFjmXRXcQAcbXpKJ15YkgUE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6478538',6,1731,'en','The Christmas Calendar','When Emily, a struggling baker in a small town, receives a handmade Christmas Calendar from a secret admirer, the local residents become obsessed with finding out the identity of the sender.','/zazcbohG6IQAUykFun9XvXeQiHf.jpg','2017-11-19',83,'Released',NULL,'The Christmas Calendar',488262,1.866,6.2,'mVYfpqDg9zw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43497,_binary '\0','/fel0mZMGrhCNFzhLjlMzHeVSTQ2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6479178',3.5,2651,'en','Picture of Beauty','In an early 20th century village, a painter with an unusual commission finds two pretty girls two model for him. The girls slowly come of age while exploring their sexuality and finding liberation in a repressed society.','/mH9ngk8aY6a96rlMRoHcSMb1Wno.jpg','2017-03-14',70,'Released','When inspiration comes first','Picture of Beauty',469877,3.5422,4.1,'BVO3Wrk4hbg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43498,_binary '\0','/eR7tL0uH2sgeq6he9vTnvdWtnTE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6479534',6.8,1498,'ko','미쓰백','A woman\'s past as a convict follows her everywhere and because of this she doesn\'t open up to others. But then she strikes up a friendship with a broken child who has suffered from domestic violence and decides to save the girl from the cruel world. A man who holds feelings for the woman, tries to protect her in his own way.','/rw84wVoKDu9PcZ4e7G8mymAb9P4.jpg','2018-10-11',98,'Released','At the bottom of misery, they find each other.','Miss Baek',544814,2.548,7.4,'gFJS8M2SjWo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43499,_binary '\0','/wWYHeEqbsgmmLm7XXqGUvFDB5ve.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6481232',8.6,1515,'bs','Scream for Me Sarajevo','In 1994, Sarajevo was a city under siege. Mortars and rocket propelled grenades rained onto the city, killing indiscriminately, every day. Amongst the madness, two United Nations personnel: a British military officer and another Brit working for the UN Fire Department, decided it would be fun to persuade a global rock star, Bruce Dickinson of Iron Maiden, to come and play a gig to the population. Scream for Me Sarajevo brings that story, in all its madness, to the big screen. A story of musicians who risked their lives to play a gig to people who risked their lives to live them.','/vA1ekBwl2eFmvcWyMJ7Q8s4u6gN.jpg','2018-04-13',95,'Released',NULL,'Scream for Me Sarajevo',474594,1.3056,7.8,'m3MedSfD57w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43500,_binary '\0','/h52FLilXlFNI96kiimrH24VEwkK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6481478',6.7,1641,'fr','Les Grands Esprits','Teacher in the most prestigious highschool in the country, François enjoys the life he’s always known, in the intellectual and bourgeois society of Paris. Trapped in a situation where he’s forced to accept a job in a school of a tough underprivileged suburb, he finds himself confronted to his own limits and to the upheaval of his values and certainties.','/qWtkbOrYwx3zO6FO9LPPhSuSrHR.jpg','2017-09-13',106,'Released',NULL,'The Teacher',462503,1.6848,6.5,'cRG9-DfHMoM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43501,_binary '\0','/3KvBX0KTSZgw0mVIn8vaeEkEktV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6483364',6.1,10500,'en','Teen Spirit','A shy teenager living on the Isle of Wight dreams of pop stardom. With the help of an unlikely mentor, she enters a singing competition that will test her integrity, talent, and ambition.','/8FF6jFKFbwrWWDEVVkGIZGL5mBU.jpg','2019-04-12',93,'Released','It’s time to shine.','Teen Spirit',440918,6.0109,6,'CkA6DpQEKTU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43502,_binary '\0','/hh8ewnJZiHJXzR0F9f0738JG0jj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6483422',4.5,1383,'en','They Reach','In 1979, a young girl stumbles upon a possessed tape player. She unknowingly unleashes a demonic entity that haunts her family while slowly dragging the small town of Clarkston to Hell.','/wX1t2sPKN2JGzp0rcg4sVx8fyid.jpg','2020-03-14',88,'Released','First you hear them. Then you see them. Then they reach...','They Reach',711705,1.9749,6.8,'NMMLm-vMHK4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43503,_binary '\0','/5aNFEcMFjDsdiRao2CnipUTFUwr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6484982',7.6,22592,'hi','न्यूटन','A government clerk on election duty in a conflict-ridden jungle of Central India tries his best to conduct free and fair voting despite the apathy of security forces and the looming fear of guerrilla attacks by communist rebels.','/ubzHA1aXUsWvQJHjvqBCHxzTBi5.jpg','2017-09-22',106,'Released',NULL,'Newton',439128,1.1118,7.2,'yU6zMPFd4UU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43504,_binary '\0','/uQKlp0DVf1K8zCEhRnXhcg7odb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6485304',6.9,3488,'es','Quién te cantará','Lila, a famous retired singer, loses her memory after suffering an accident, just as she planned her return to the stage.','/sHiwX3sXVFoM5Hj8yfkysmMGs9p.jpg','2018-10-24',125,'Released','When oblivion erases the voice, memory becomes the stage.','Quién te cantará',438373,1.911,7.1,'aPDMAH-mbSM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43505,_binary '\0','/7IJE6cNsbXYE2HzZSUQBj0RtUfv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6485666',7.5,42658,'ta','மெர்சல்','A few individuals in the medical profession are murdered or kidnapped, and the cop investigating the case suspects a doctor and arrests him. But is he the one who is behind these crimes? And why are they being committed?','/65Q1wpRPZ5E3UVUv2V5JBbJQCcj.jpg','2017-10-18',161,'Released',NULL,'Mersal',456287,2.0742,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43506,_binary '\0','/bU1cdizoY6F5Z6kyXjJvg5lH0jy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6485928',6.2,9659,'en','The Land of Steady Habits','After leaving his wife and his job to find happiness, Anders begins a clumsy, heartbreaking quest to reassemble the pieces of his fractured life.','/e2cdubbzgDBIVG8lELeQUq50qiZ.jpg','2018-09-12',98,'Released',NULL,'The Land of Steady Habits',452731,2.6332,5.6,'ZbKDFMW8hGE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43507,_binary '\0','/8FOt2KTxahKjSbkVUz8LgKFNFYp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6486630',5.4,1483,'fa','خفه‌گی','I was suffocating, but I don\'t kill her. I love it.','/sYm35zYUIkkNRStYMeR9g9WspUk.jpg','2017-10-18',90,'Released',NULL,'Asphyxia',439997,0.9136,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43508,_binary '\0','/kFQPhswso6KqtXomMAh0fh2F66F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6490394',7.2,1415,'en','Jellyfish','In Margate, England, life is not easy for teenager Sarah Taylor, between being bullied at school, being exploited by a dominant boss and having to take care of her depressive mother and her two siblings. But Sarah finds a way to channel her growing despair and fight adversity when her drama teacher gives her a new purpose.','/vfTlJE4vZHgqQERjQbZ1W8JkHM5.jpg','2019-02-15',98,'Released','Find your voice','Jellyfish',463157,1.2512,7.6,'o8-jtgz__R8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43509,_binary '\0','/y1WIEyWYN6djFv4ebIx3gKWuJyw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6490930',4.2,1904,'en','Project Ithaca','Five strangers awaken to find themselves trapped aboard an alien spaceship that seems to be harnessing their terror to power the ship. They begin to understand that these species have been abducting humans for decades and possibly centuries.','/b1ku6nZmy3XEtPWA3HnrQ4zuJRk.jpg','2019-06-07',85,'Released','They were always here','Project Ithaca',600836,2.0938,5.845,'QmEbkI80K8k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43510,_binary '\0','/jw2FmU7RKMMkgDCshUBE9OaXuaJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6490990',7.8,2138,'ja','ジョジョの奇妙な冒険 ファントム ブラッド','An adaptation of the original five volume arc of the popular JoJo\'s Bizarre Adventure manga, covering the Phantom Blood chapters. Jonathan Joestar is an aristocratic boy whose life is suddenly turned upside down by a mysterious new boy who arrives, Dio Brando. Dio has a connection to his father, and over time, a rivalry forms as Dio becomes obsessed with a mysterious, ancient, and mystical stone mask that Jonathan\'s father keeps. This film has not been publicly released outside of its original limited run in Japanese theaters and is considered virtually lost.','/hgnnUSkKuEpXfs0IpTu5uCsdcKx.jpg','2007-02-17',120,'Released',NULL,'JoJo\'s Bizarre Adventure: Phantom Blood',387470,2.7544,6.2,'YC54t2VSE4I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43511,_binary '\0','/dNyoPfDPvdSo5RdXxCgM1MXHMUc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6491170',7.2,1634,'en','Fittest on Earth: A Decade of Fitness','The 2016 Reebok CrossFit Games were a grueling five-day, 15-event test to find the fittest man and woman on Earth. \"Fittest on Earth: A Decade of Fitness\" follows the dramatic story of the top athletes who qualified and competed and offers an inside look at what it takes to be among the world\'s elite athletes, both in training and on the competition floor. The CrossFit Games challenge competitors to perform intense physical tasks, but the hardest part is sometimes mental. Athletes often learn the details of the events only minutes before they begin, and everyone handles the pressure differently. Which of these fierce competitors will rise to the top and earn the title of Fittest on Earth?','/fH5U8Rgql5UkDkkkRDNmuymzDhV.jpg','2017-02-01',116,'Released',NULL,'Fittest on Earth: A Decade of Fitness',438665,1.2077,6.7,'OJa4HPVAk3A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43512,_binary '\0','/9hZv8hyvggxfH6b8kBUovr9I5Lm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6491178',6.9,63136,'en','Dragged Across Concrete','Two policemen, one an old-timer, the other his volatile younger partner, find themselves suspended when a video of their strong-arm tactics becomes the media\'s cause du jour. Low on cash and with no other options, these two embittered soldiers descend into the criminal underworld to gain their just due, but instead find far more than they wanted awaiting them in the shadows.','/11wQX0gv1kW1cjXsMTnoKXxhaqk.jpg','2019-02-21',159,'Released','Those who can\'t earn a living must find another way to provide','Dragged Across Concrete',438674,8.2636,6.605,'2p5pdWyyZoc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43513,_binary '\0','/x374Bfdif3VUq8zqk8BrYD0ePOF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6493286',7.7,8144,'ko','1987','In 1987 Korea under an oppressive military regime, the unlawful interrogation and death of a college student ignite ordinary citizens to fight for the truth and bring about justice.','/vSiS2tysGNoL4QHYwWBPN0BIkbs.jpg','2017-12-27',129,'Released','The truth must be told.','1987: When the Day Comes',437103,3.6125,7.997,'eTzBIH51Irc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43514,_binary '\0','/yuKD3TjbRIKFmMaJceXMZaFcmUr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6493648',6.6,1513,'ja','DESTINY 鎌倉ものがたり','Set in an alternate universe, the ancient capital of Kamakura is a vibrant town where fantastical creatures live alongside humans. Akiko is a cheerful publishing assistant who moves into town after marrying Masakazu, a popular mystery writer. Akiko is surprised by the unusual town but enjoys the new curiosities surrounding her. However, just as she was beginning to settle in, a trifling incident sweeps her spirit to the underworld too soon. Convinced that destiny has something else in store for his wife, Masakazu journeys into the underworld to bring back Akiko’s spirit.','/h7FFTr5zUvOuiZmyYOMSMcedJ87.jpg','2017-12-09',129,'Released',NULL,'Destiny: The Tale of Kamakura',492136,2.2198,7.5,'4FjERsbOF-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43515,_binary '\0','/5NOTAaNJ68FtsIgiJyDswu4qnjf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6494052',6.5,3621,'te','నేను లోకల్','This story is about a happy-go-lucky young man, Babu, who falls in love with a girl. However, he runs into a problem while convincing her father to permit them to be together.','/2CjWcUIvoYFvvlm8773CYSnEYvA.jpg','2017-02-03',150,'Released','Attitude is Everything','Nenu Local',439057,1.8458,5.638,'9tEyWOPr2BA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43516,_binary '\0','/bHVruIcxkG868650XaeQIrQmCDX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6494358',7.5,1403,'en','Clive Davis: The Soundtrack of Our Lives','The life and successes of iconic music executive Clive Davis, from his miraculous start at Columbia Records through his trailblazing work at Arista Records and J Records, with a heavy dose of outstanding music sprinkled in between.','/9Vx3ZLSMgbEnjo9sHDBdZ5XGfrc.jpg','2017-04-19',123,'Released',NULL,'Clive Davis: The Soundtrack of Our Lives',453205,2.4472,6.7,'RaYqX-0AwRw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43517,_binary '\0','/rp6aXM2EWkaUdq6zbSlhUOY2869.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6494418',4.3,18933,'en','Siberia','Lucas, a diamond trader who travels to Saint Petersburg to arrange a sale, discovers that his Russian business partner has left his hotel and gone to a small Siberian village, so Lucas also heads there to try find him.','/eGfIsvdrUhTlQOkxQIELU7obDYj.jpg','2018-07-13',105,'Released','This was not the plan.','Siberia',438689,5.1982,4.7,'FrXPIZN2ehY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43518,_binary '\0','/gklkxY0veMajdCiGe6ggsh07VG2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6495056',6.6,48530,'en','Migration','After a migrating duck family alights on their pond with thrilling tales of far-flung places, the Mallard family embarks on a family road trip, from New England, to New York City, to tropical Jamaica.','/ldfCF9RhR40mppkzmftxapaHeTo.jpg','2023-12-06',83,'Released','Odd ducks welcome.','Migration',940551,25.715,7.356,'UkHxhPGpRuA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43519,_binary '\0','/xKUYPnJheAO8ynrOTLbQesg1IVt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6495094',5.3,1584,'en','Little Women','A modern retelling of Louisa May Alcott\'s classic novel, we follow the lives of four sisters - Meg, Jo, Beth, and Amy March - detailing their passage from childhood to womanhood. Despite harsh times, they cling to optimism, and as they mature, they face blossoming ambitions and relationships, as well as tragedy, while maintaining their unbreakable bond as sisters.','/3q5kEdiT0nRKVtm6eFBhD4nP3wq.jpg','2018-09-28',112,'Released','New generation, same sisters','Little Women',483347,2.0644,6.3,'U7yNDrTgwBY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43520,_binary '\0','/3ldiRRggT4CC38jEE4gqVgTUhVM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6495770',5.2,12865,'en','Action Point','A daredevil designs and operates his own theme park with his friends.','/5lqJx0uNKrD1cEKgaqF1LBsLAoi.jpg','2018-06-01',85,'Released','Real Stunts. Real Thrills. Real Messed Up.','Action Point',454283,4.682,5.5,'ri1Cc3Yz09U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43521,_binary '\0','/ny34w32qXuaqaLCZ1fau0JFnNrN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6496236',5.3,1280,'id','Danur','Risa is shocked that her three best friends are ghosts. An evil spirit kidnaps Risa\'s sister. Risa asks Peter, Wiliam, and Janshen for help.','/rqTxkcoq31q3mRJMV1iXexTanIE.jpg','2017-03-27',74,'Released',NULL,'Danur: I Can See Ghosts',450647,1.6477,5.6,'YLU6Qfi0cDY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43522,_binary '\0','/6pSuCtiiViZoB0ebZz55OPo5ng4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6497898',7.1,3142,'ar','In syriated','A mother attempts to keep her family safe as war rages and a sniper lies in wait outside her home.','/8pLN4rmIDLjQLvSZlacUtId4e76.jpg','2017-06-22',85,'Released',NULL,'In Syria',441646,1.8904,6.4,'OEtw3C2nUSw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43523,_binary '\0','/pdqJIyEGUNai6M1sCM30twwJB6m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6498644',7.4,2732,'en','Eric Clapton: Life in 12 Bars','An unflinching and deeply personal journey into the life and work of guitarist Eric Clapton told through his own words and songs.','/9LWL1rf6q4O2KdupubePnrgCedp.jpg','2018-03-30',135,'Released',NULL,'Eric Clapton: Life in 12 Bars',445065,2.4442,7.1,'KlZhlwljSDQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43524,_binary '\0','/oiPUcD1IIZrYGTSIpvTmd3dRmPo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6499752',7.5,238236,'en','Upgrade','A brutal mugging leaves Grey Trace paralyzed in the hospital and his beloved wife dead. A billionaire inventor soon offers Trace a cure — an artificial intelligence implant called STEM that will enhance his body. Now able to walk, Grey finds that he also has superhuman strength and agility — skills he uses to seek revenge against the thugs who destroyed his life.','/woLGROUdPWdBnLVFKYdGD3kFkPY.jpg','2018-05-31',100,'Released','Not man. Not machine. More.','Upgrade',500664,12.1173,7.514,'1hTLGlgZ4Z8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43525,_binary '\0','/8Pkvq1t4X6gnjVzxopOztEm34hw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6502580',4.7,1654,'ml','ചങ്ക്സ്','Final-year mechanical engineering students, Romario, Riyas, Yoodas, and Athmaram, think their lives are miserable since there is not one single girl in their class. Much to their joy, a girl called Riya joins their class and soon becomes friends with the boys. Termed as \'Mech Rani\' of the college, all the boys from the mechanical department begin to flirt with her, leading to comical situations.','/svNTQCVc7tzQrh20WJBiiOLbQEq.jpg','2017-08-04',121,'Released',NULL,'Chunkzz',459723,1.2799,4.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43526,_binary '\0','/xmfLkz196E6RC4YpZV0wJpEA5Af.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6502956',5.6,2527,'es','Yucatán','Two white collar thieves compete fiercely against the other trying to steal to an old baker the millions he won on the lotto.','/6z3f3I2YLpaipyYGItOf7c7kqRK.jpg','2018-08-31',129,'Released',NULL,'Yucatán',517324,1.1773,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43527,_binary '\0','/22GM4LJ3xvXoEwCfxzz1jE9ZO1d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6504538',5.5,4904,'en','Danger One','While transporting a dying man to the hospital, two paramedics find a million dollars in cash sewn into his clothing. When the man dies, they decide to keep it, setting them on a path for a hellish night of violence and mayhem.','/mG6MNa9fR6LIOaJhkJONflpGPvB.jpg','2018-09-14',101,'Released','One dead body. One million dollars. One long night.','Danger One',548204,2.7997,6.1,'ve95enHIVUs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43528,_binary '\0','/sQxRUfvoHl1ADGtXK055Hojj1tU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6505968',6.7,2513,'fi','Armomurhaaja','Euthanizer tells the story of a mechanic who euthanises sick and old pets as a side job. Despite the grim work, he has a soft spot for the animals. Trouble stirs when the owner of a dog he was supposed to end realises that the canine is still alive. The only innocent party in the drama that ensues is the dog itself.','/f2JcwM4C1vciVgCYlQhicRcuFib.jpg','2017-11-24',85,'Released','\"Small ones i gas, the big ones get a bullet\"','Euthanizer',471105,1.2445,6.6,'ByGuMtX9SsE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43529,_binary '\0','/zVITKJxmvzvi5sBECmfDK1i3wA7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6506146',5.1,1858,'id','Mata Batin','When her little sister claims she sees the dead, Alia consults a psychic, who opens her own eyes to the vengeful ghosts haunting their childhood home.','/sOUhG1OMRD5RfMpMnT1AhramdZI.jpg','2017-11-30',107,'Released','Believing is seeing.','The Third Eye',480007,1.3669,5.7,'d173ahbvzUA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43530,_binary '\0','/etXdtwnruC2ZM1ZdQJ8V3d71Eyd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6506264',5.4,14459,'de','Tides','In the not-too-distant future: after a global catastrophe has wiped out nearly all of humanity on Earth, an elite astronaut from Space Colony Kepler must make a decision that will seal the fate of the people on both planets.','/nX7ZUYwgGOCe5nXXwpNg4hAf1xB.jpg','2021-08-26',104,'Released','Will Earth wait for us?','The Colony',760873,5.2468,5.7,'H4yKeBYkHn0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43531,_binary '\0','/bwMBJhMPKiyGpKWBfeQlvCvmiTt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6506276',6.8,1246,'en','Lemonade','While working in the US on a temporary visa as a caretaker, Mara, a 30 year-old single mother from Romania, marries Daniel, an American. After the arrival of her son Dragos, everything seems to have fallen perfectly into place. When the process of getting a green card veers unexpectedly off course, however, Mara is faced with abuses of power on every level and forced to answer a dark question about herself – how far would you go to get what you want?','/iWF9iNLSiBIJ9AfC04HefNnvWSy.jpg','2018-10-04',85,'Released',NULL,'Lemonade',500824,1.6578,6.2,'RnAHmSxtVYA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43532,_binary '\0','/e1eKNn0VLQ1vETpOTLrlps5KZ1L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6508228',5.6,13849,'en','Ghosts of War','A group of World War II American soldiers encounter a supernatural enemy as they occupy a French castle previously under Nazi control.','/jR2SSICqmyaVV4lcR3PfNldJBPc.jpg','2020-07-03',94,'Released','You can\'t hide from yourself.','Ghosts of War',608195,4.9002,6.2,'Tv7HyN