5.9,2206,'zh','悟空傳','A giant rebelled against the heavens. It was declared a devil and defeated. The immortal heart evolved into Sun Wukong. The heavens found him, and ravaged his home. He enters the heavenly kingdom, disguised as a human, seeking retribution.','/hbqM7RnXlGO0dFXqMlJYc7z703p.jpg','2017-07-13',130,'Released',NULL,'Immortal Demon Slayer',452910,3.8406,7.611,'vC9a2sDa1NM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43541,_binary '\0','/xIAaN3AQqaJiN5RJ0WsmBady8Hq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6513656',3.9,38781,'en','Escape Plan 2: Hades','Ray Breslin manages an elite team of security specialists trained in the art of breaking people out of the world\'s most impenetrable prisons. When his most trusted operative, Shu Ren, is kidnapped and disappears inside the most elaborate prison ever built, Ray must track him down with the help of some of his former friends.','/A6tb8JNrie2qT8JC2tGqshayuck.jpg','2018-06-05',93,'Released','This isn\'t a prison. It\'s a machine.','Escape Plan 2: Hades',440471,9.6823,5.157,'6Q7vVt-MeXk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43542,_binary '\0','/wd30eAKM7BzshTFE40Z1F97QXOX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6514010',6.5,3058,'hi','ब्रिज मोहन अमर रहे','Faking his death to escape the realities of his uneventful life worked out well for Brij Mohan -- until he was sentenced to death for his own murder.','/zKOUPbyBlS2yzK9CYGxiG4mX41P.jpg','2017-12-13',100,'Released','Karma Is A B*tch','Brij Mohan Amar Rahe!',539470,1.215,5.5,'GlsqNBdYco8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43543,_binary '\0','/6PoAlGe7adu212bCO7kQSrTVbef.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6514196',6.5,6529,'hi','बाज़ार','After moving to Mumbai, an ambitious young man becomes the stock trader for a notorious businessman.','/zLAlaimyVfsRmaH1fv3qmfksMRP.jpg','2018-10-26',140,'Released',NULL,'Baazaar',556907,1.8335,6.1,'Pb7iJnIWzNk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43544,_binary '\0','/xnbMLcN1Av8AoQhOr4NVeyJiZRz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6515200',5.3,1584,'en','Two Heads Creek','A timid butcher and his drama queen twin sister quit the hostile confines of post-Brexit Britain and venture to Australia in search of their birth mother, but the seemingly tolerant townsfolk are hiding a dark, meaty secret.','/iRBUuQHgJPs3dFMCkngbncGzkez.jpg','2019-10-12',86,'Released',NULL,'Two Heads Creek',635772,1.9971,5.2,'VlTHIkp0EIc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43545,_binary '\0','/lSHVojy2zwL5AzwIqwY1CmgRVde.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6515342',6.1,4563,'fr','Knock','Doctor Knock is a former thug who has become a doctor and arrives in the small village of Saint-Maurice to make his fortune according to a particular method. It will make the villagers believe that they are not as healthy as they might think. It is thus that he will find in each one an imaginary symptom, or not, and thus will be able to exercise his profession lucratively. Under his seductive looks and after gaining the confidence of the village, Knock is on the verge of achieving his ends. But his past catches up with him and an old acquaintance disrupts the doctor\'s plans.','/2JhwA8uxxb5ZKjMH6eDHLuJLVUw.jpg','2017-10-18',113,'Released',NULL,'Knock',438348,2.9533,6.4,'4_8H1axUdUg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43546,_binary '\0','/te5GuHx6WoyClws4Gs4rBD6efdd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6515910',6.6,5673,'en','The Kindness of Strangers','Clara and her two sons escape from her abusive husband with little more than their car and plan to start over in New York. After the car towed away, the family meets Alice, who gets them into an emergency shelter. While stealing food at a Russian restaurant called ‘Winter Palace’, Clara meets Marc, who has been given the chance to help the old eatery regain its former glory. The ‘Winter Palace’ soon becomes a place of unexpected encounters between people who are all undergoing some sort of crisis and whom fate has now brought together.','/9E9CB9YdhBl2q9tMqqXfKgf9hyP.jpg','2019-12-12',112,'Released','A little help goes a long way.','The Kindness of Strangers',520390,3.7934,6.4,'LKCQ7gECxpk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43547,_binary '\0','/mgQum2DEYJaDe6opeQu9KvACOQ9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6516314',5.5,9275,'en','Piercing','After kissing his wife and baby goodbye for a seemingly normal business trip, Reed checks himself into a hotel room to accomplish something he’s always dreamed of: the perfect murder. As his sinister plans unfold, he soon realizes he might be in over his head with a mysteriously unhinged call girl named Jackie.','/1iDIFMzYxY25X25KDeARA6VoDl3.jpg','2019-01-03',82,'Released','Practice doesn\'t always make perfect.','Piercing',440444,2.2476,5.684,'07R4nnllBrM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43548,_binary '\0','/sh4rXuam1Gd9lriKbDOKMw9p1Ti.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6516590',3.7,1260,'en','Cold Zone','A storm is coming. No one could predict it. No one can measure it. Now one family must survive it. You can\'t come in from the cold.','/c47vzme1QvFdSYaVJuyy8rtJdBB.jpg','2017-05-16',85,'Released',NULL,'Cold Zone',437463,2.0602,4.6,'T1axKZJ3eA0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43549,_binary '\0','/3xmS8y5NbD7vWduHeXsorcEl0Za.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6518270',5.8,7265,'en','An Evening with Beverly Luff Linn','Lulu Danger\'s unsatisfying marriage takes a turn for the worse when a mysterious man from her past comes to town to perform an event called \"An Evening with Beverly Luff Linn: For One Magical Night Only.\"','/aTrgVu1QIPXMMfFbO0zxNqzk63p.jpg','2018-05-25',108,'Released','A love triangle with too many sides.','An Evening with Beverly Luff Linn',446695,2.8558,5.547,'ABhh1HifqJY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43550,_binary '\0','/8be2cqyw4pINnWxOZ929XNSmJyK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6520954',7.7,5547,'bn','দেবী','A girl with extrao