ns long gone. Now, this power has been stolen from the hands of the Fiore kingdom by the nefarious traitor Zash Caine, who flees with it to the small island nation of Stella. Frightened that the power has fallen into the wrong hands, the King of Fiore hastily sends Fairy Tail to retrieve the staff. But this task proves frightening as a shadowy secret lies in the heart of the kingdom of Stella. Dragon Cry follows their story as they muster up all their strength to recover the stolen staff and save both kingdoms.','/9SJFMVWiuJV55yLbPpWhHZ9MgHn.jpg','2017-05-06',85,'Released',NULL,'Fairy Tail: Dragon Cry',433422,5.506,6.6,'9Yk5cBOTcZ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43583,_binary '\0','/17FVlH4yYTG5qChmC4VcwT0V15N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6549510',4.1,1858,'en','Kill \'em All 2','Phillip and Suzanne are retired from the spy game, living peacefully off the grid. That\'s until their whereabouts are discovered by Vlad, the vengeful brother of their target from the first film.','/s5KZqIvyjwKpTRESCVrVGkT1JX3.jpg','2024-09-24',85,'Released',NULL,'Kill \'em All 2',1215162,6.8732,6.8,'LrZ9L2K23cw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43584,_binary '\0','/9mDG4jO8v4puoGj7IjMx6CSLUuy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6550794',4.4,1318,'zh','烧腊','Mia, an ex-prostitute, is trapped in a loveless marriage with the abusive Quan (Sunny Pang, who also stars in Headshot in this year’s Festival lineup), a butcher who runs a roast meat shop. When she meets sensitive funeral director Wu, their passion for one another escalates into an affair. But the path to true love is fraught with jealousy, forcing someone to make a deadly move.','/lGsOeq9b1K2cRlYVc0xa4Lk22Ob.jpg','2017-02-23',82,'Released',NULL,'Siew Lup',443801,1.8164,3.5,'oPBcBlskg18','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43585,_binary '\0','/tNiIzXFne4wtIOBmn91iigJUEuq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6555772',5.6,3880,'tr','Tatlım Tatlım','When a group of people meets at the same party, they form four different relationships, each experiencing similar phases of love.','/9Q7oRuLgHhi3XMbIB9sOmDlw52Y.jpg','2017-03-17',95,'Released','A surreal love out of nowhere…','Love, Surreal and Odd',447447,1.1148,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43586,_binary '\0','/iIJARs79gXWFmCWG2M5OXE9nUY5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6556552',5.2,1605,'fr','Momo','One evening, when they come home, Mr. and Mrs. Prioux are astounded to find that a certain Patrick has moved into their place. This strange young man has returned home to his parents in order to introduce his wife.','/inABiKUI7FpokXoMMj697T4WMCu.jpg','2017-12-27',85,'Released',NULL,'Finding Momo',443398,2.6858,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43587,_binary '\0','/33eANpz8fe47swg1RsGfy5Wl9K2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6556576',5.5,5316,'en','Monster Party','Three teenage thieves infiltrate a mansion dinner party, unaware that it is secretly being hosted by a serial killer cult for the social elite.','/fF650Hj5CvFyTOS6aDmPjjw7i4Q.jpg','2018-11-02',89,'Released',NULL,'Monster Party',458969,3.6856,5.684,'3PpPPMIHAkc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43588,_binary '\0','/co1ItuquxZjxLqbjjCLwK9ADkS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6556670',6.1,11150,'fr','Qu\'est-ce qu\'on a encore fait au Bon Dieu ?','Claude and Marie Verneuil face a new crisis. The four spouses of their daughters, David, Rachid, Chao and Charles decided to leave France for various reasons. Here they are imagining their lives elsewhere.','/422okWTstVRy1sW5VaAHqONasIU.jpg','2019-01-30',99,'Released',NULL,'Serial (Bad) Weddings 2',505436,4.8983,5.9,'0_m1Y13NjL8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43589,_binary '\0','/twCXJuIQxTsor1fZm4QeAfVeiao.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6556890',5.9,16938,'en','Batman and Harley Quinn','Batman and Nightwing are forced to team with the Joker\'s sometimes-girlfriend Harley Quinn to stop a global threat brought about by Poison Ivy and Jason Woodrue, the Floronic Man.','/v3RP6pp6pfRdvch6QioeQvNdMJs.jpg','2017-07-21',74,'Released','Gotham City\'s heroes need a super-villain to fight for justice.','Batman and Harley Quinn',408648,8.1116,6.2,'fPL8uL1h8FA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43590,_binary '\0','/h7bxDDfCxXy1mbDOuezoZjiZgnv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6557704',5.6,3164,'en','Ultra Low','A Seattle-based filmmaking team struggles to break down the doors of Hollywood.','/cdlKZEFYRF2ZBvb0WzTpXbAVofd.jpg','2018-04-28',117,'Released','Never let go of your dreams.','Ultra Low',442965,1.0865,5,'CoeQ_DUaLqU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43591,_binary '\0','/y64dXLCrhAYYBLJYdpCYyi2ETIv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6559390',6.3,2044,'fr','L\'Apparition','Jacques Mayano, a French journalist who has lived a traumatic experience, is recruited by the Vatican to be part of a task force that must investigate the veracity of a supernatural apparition allegedly happened in a small French village.','/l4TXhyNSipy6ZvkVI7BzzhYW675.jpg','2018-02-14',139,'Released',NULL,'The Apparition',482712,1.6646,6.1,'fPGRmmCl1_8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43592,_binary '\0','/dvISyhsOylrSDWLEcuH8G9ekjHp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6559642',5.7,2521,'tr','Biz Size Döneriz','The only cure of being jobelessness, unhappy and hopelessness is friendship, life is beautiful together.','/xXtco41oFrZy0cuREcbnakrD9iw.jpg','2017-03-31',105,'Released',NULL,'We\'ll Get Back to You',450456,0.8469,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43593,_binary '\0','/de51GG0AQZj8dUm00aQUi4wisBr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6560164',5.8,11443,'en','Sweetheart','Jenn has washed ashore a small tropical island and it doesn’t take her long to realize she’s completely alone. She must spend her days not only surviving the elements, but must also fend off the malevolent force that comes out each night.','/xyPPBPkGbZxfS6U