bing him the \"long-awaited one.\"','/f4oZTcfGrVTXKTWg157AwikXqmP.jpg','2023-07-14',124,'Released','Where death comes to an end, life finds a new beginning.','The Boy and the Heron',508883,16.9738,7.384,'A002-b7IH2M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43614,_binary '\0','/xZKh1dorkkT0N8ClHYLP7ZLMTp5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6587078',6.5,2618,'en','Moonlight in Vermont','After fast-paced New York City high-end real estate broker Fiona Rangely gets dumped by her boyfriend, she escapes to her family’s quaint Vermont Inn for a few days to slow down and evaluate her life. When her ex-boyfriend Nate shows up at the Inn with a brand new girlfriend, Fiona quickly devises a plan to win him back: pretend the handsome and very laid- back head chef Derek is her new boyfriend! Much to the surprise of Derek --and to Fiona herself-- in pretending to be in love, she realizes that she’s been thrown a curveball: sometimes the best things in life are worth the wait.','/wITyFvOffnDi09fqBmORUhE6zS6.jpg','2017-04-08',90,'Released',NULL,'Moonlight in Vermont',446493,2.0996,6.1,'izh-PvGRpYY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43615,_binary '\0','/qsxhnirlp7y4Ae9bd11oYJSX59j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6587640',6.1,33642,'en','Trolls World Tour','Queen Poppy and Branch make a surprising discovery — there are other Troll worlds beyond their own, and their distinct differences create big clashes between these various tribes. When a mysterious threat puts all of the Trolls across the land in danger, Poppy, Branch, and their band of friends must embark on an epic quest to create harmony among the feuding Trolls to unite them against certain doom.','/7W0G3YECgDAfnuiHG91r8WqgIOe.jpg','2020-03-11',91,'Released','Happiest. Movie. Ever.','Trolls World Tour',446893,21.1167,7.2,'08AExF6dETA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43616,_binary '\0','/49NAPNszOrFtKmil2UKbkt42fdu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6588950',5.6,2447,'en',