They Had','A woman must fly back to her hometown when her Alzheimer\'s-stricken mother wanders into a blizzard. The return home forces her to confront her past.','/60aPLuGddsdmSq7fONzvUP1idTH.jpg','2018-10-19',101,'Released','A family united by the past. Divided by the present.','What They Had',451919,4.3737,6.472,'1kBGxsyp__o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43681,_binary '\0','/9CqzJn0nLaDNM6QWfGkuox2Oi93.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6663582',6.1,87960,'en','The Spy Who Dumped Me','A couple of thirtysomething best friends unwittingly become entangled in an international conspiracy when one’s ex-boyfriend shows up at their apartment with a team of deadly assassins on his trail.','/szEKivKPOdRyogROoQIldwbMl.jpg','2018-08-02',117,'Released','They got this.','The Spy Who Dumped Me',454992,9.433,6.366,'CXkUaaVrB_s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43682,_binary '\0','/y0SvH5baUd751Nb4X6MVT32hGH1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6664700',4.3,1287,'en','Extremity','A young woman with a severely troubled past signs up for an extreme haunt called Perdition. She believes that putting herself through Perdition\'s nightmarish trials will help her exorcise her internal traumas, but has no way of knowing just how shocking her ordeal will be-or what dark secrets buried in her psyche will emerge.','/cewpBXCzcBWNrfpwrSs83PxW2Xk.jpg','2018-09-17',103,'Released','Face Your Demons. No matter How Dark, Or Buried They May Be.','Extremity',521509,1.7339,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43683,_binary '\0','/5tJNlzfJGRvuouLxTXCYl7g4KCx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6667360',7.6,1655,'en','Carnage: Swallowing the Past','It\'s 2067, the UK is vegan, but older generations are suffering the guilt of their carnivorous past. Simon Amstell asks us to forgive them for the horrors of what they swallowed.','/vKmmoc3tnhxbfho7oO43BZO7Q7R.jpg','2017-03-19',65,'Released',NULL,'Carnage: Swallowing the Past',447758,2.4042,6.4,'sfUSd