r sexual curiosity starts to blur the lines between right and wrong. As innocence is crushed in depraved games and sexual exploitation, the teenagers soon turn into ruthless predators.','/gwTKiJF57VknDuNCWgoHaJamm82.jpg','2018-07-12',100,'Released',NULL,'We',499546,6.2321,5.349,'OuKQT-gSxes','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43688,_binary '\0','/jBCnv5yicOasoVQ8ysrBv7Z3ar3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6672082',4.2,3259,'en','Requiem for a Fighter','Lucas A former Danish Army Officer has traveled to Derry, Northern Ireland to clear up details of his estranged son\'s death and finds that there was another side to his son\'s life and the people he was partied with. These include Michael who has been fighting in unlicensed boxing matches to raise quick cash, trained by his Father who doesn\'t know Michael is questioning his sexuality. The fights have been building to a final fight against Brian Beru, undefeated King of the gypsy\'s and a wrecking machine, Michael will need Lucas help if he is to survive.','/7GR9aqiFp1e6YVEvHz1W8BQWhBG.jpg','2018-11-12',87,'Released',NULL,'Requiem for a Fighter',556173,0.9941,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43689,_binary '\0','/xcUf6yIheo78btFqihlRLftdR3M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6673612',5.6,80449,'en','Dolittle','After losing his wife seven years earlier, the eccentric Dr. John Dolittle, famed doctor and veterinarian of Queen Victoria’s England, hermits himself away behind the high walls of Dolittle Manor with only his menagerie of exotic animals for company. But when the young queen falls gravely ill, a reluctant Dolittle is forced to set sail on an epic adventure to a mythical island in search of a cure, regaining his wit and courage as he crosses old adversaries and discovers wondrous creatures.','/3Nt3v1uzUgfSuVARD1AnI9g9Zl9.jpg','2020-01-02',101,'Released','He\'s just not a people person.','Dolittle',448119,15.1836,6.6,'FEf412bSPLs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43690,_binary '\0','/t4YhlPbrloOjukZLKol9dhfDyxS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6673840',7.2,8790,'ru','Время первых','March 1965. In the heat of the Cold War, the USA and the USSR are competing for supremacy in space. What both superpowers aim for in this race, is to be the first to have a man walk in outer space. To accomplish that, no price is too high and no risk is too great. Now it’s up to the unlikely duo of a seasoned war veteran and a hot-headed test-pilot to fulfill this mission. Two men in a tiny spaceship, without proper testing, facing the complete unknown. They were supposed to do what no man has done before—and no man imagined what would happen next.','/hDNVRmrprxI9NQ0zc2Uu03p65Fw.jpg','2017-04-06',140,'Released','So far from home, so close to disaster','The Spacewalker',440642,3.6884,6.997,'RxXJJeuRfZw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43691,_binary '\0','/qBR2L2hpQ8lgslpRiT4gU8IqFnv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6675244',6.9,13046,'de','Transit','In an attempt to flee Nazi-occupied France, Georg assumes the identity of a dead author but soon finds himself stuck in Marseilles, where he falls in love with Maria, a young woman searching for her missing husband.','/3YLOCnokMMSIOCvA0kCnkhpTD79.jpg','2018-04-05',102,'Released',NULL,'Transit',471853,2.9594,6.687,'R15ekRCq-eY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43692,_binary '\0','/zpxTXdOzRBcGWOhK2coF9E672qc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6675400',4.8,1274,'en','Con Man','The story of Barry Minkow, a young and charismatic figure in business who reaches CEO status by lying and scheming his way to the top.','/lNjm6BQXZGs4xCyztrzwCbtjNQ0.jpg','2018-03-02',100,'Released','America\'s most creative criminal.','Con Man',454648,1.8358,4.7,'6E5EQbKDuKE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43693,_binary '\0','/urNu24LU7S0nlMewRjMEmWeGatj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6676028',5.5,3669,'en','In a Relationship','Long-term couple Owen and