-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6680312',6.5,1500,'en','Who We Are Now','Recently released from prison, Beth is working with her public defender to get her son back from her sister, who was awarded legal custody while Beth was incarcerated for ten years. Soon after, Beth forms an unlikely alliance with Jess, an idealistic young protégé of the public defense team, who decides to take on Beth\'s cause whether she likes it or not.','/kxTfAC1pCHjLYDqAoiUVul5Hor3.jpg','2018-05-25',101,'Released',NULL,'Who We Are Now',466410,2.714,5.7,'As9b6ROukSM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43698,_binary '\0','/sZExPrCdCIpdQFx7PKHowAj1hf9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6680730',6,1388,'ml','സ്ട്രീറ്റ് ലൈറ്റ്','The story of Street Lights is based on the life of a Crime Branch police officer, James, who in his pursuit to solve a certain mystery, crosses path with several people and encounters various thrilling events. Will James succeed or fail in his mission and how will he react to the outcome, forms the crux.','/vL5VVz0NGnLWV5MzhTV86dVKaJw.jpg','2018-01-26',129,'Released',NULL,'Street Lights',495890,1.5287,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43699,_binary '\0','/bnm8GSDuk1geHEKFtS8EgLmFYiL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6682134',6.8,1736,'en','Murder, She Baked: Just Desserts','Hannah Swensen is thrilled when she is chosen as a guest for the first Eden Lake Dessert Bake-Off, but when fellow judge, Coach Bishop is found murdered, Hannah once again takes it upon herself to find the killer.','/s9B67nXWHR7fwv9tZwEeriSn2II.jpg','2017-03-26',84,'Released',NULL,'Murder, She Baked: Just Desserts',436401,2.7296,6.9,'Ykkoxz25epw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43700,_binary '\0','/fp7P88mD34Ie6yLyzuLC8qFjmRJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6682484',7.4,1659,'en','Pennywise: The Story of ‘It’','Thirty-plus years after its release, the popular two-part miniseries \"It\" and its infamous villain Pennywise live on in the minds of horror fans around the world. This documentary captures not only the buzz the \"It\" saga generated in 1990 but also the lasting impact it has had on an entire generation and the horror genre at large. Several years in the making, the film features exclusive interviews with many of the cult classic\'s key players, from cast members Richard Thomas, Seth Green, and Tim Curry, who portrayed the notorious monster clown Pennywise, to director Tommy Lee Wallace and special effects makeup artist Bart Mixon. The documentary also boasts a wealth of archival material and never-before-seen footage.','/z6LfGKuA19tt0ckc8UN91rAmJF8.jpg','2021-10-15',126,'Released','The making of a monster.','Pennywise: The Story of ‘It’',512356,2.2838,7.4,'czdap4pM0kg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43701,_binary '\0','/gzmKA50LtpHSDYC7lKjUqLtK7Kn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6684714',5.3,14164,'en','Acts of Violence','When his fiancee is kidnapped by human traffickers, Roman and his ex-military brothers set out to track her down and save her before it is too late. Along the way, Roman teams up with Avery, a cop investigating human trafficking and fighting the corrupt bureaucracy that has harmful intentions.','/x6sBKpLa86CodgTkIK2r8Hnp07m.jpg','2018-01-12',86,'Released','Protect what\'s yours.','Acts of Violence',479040,5.6028,5.6,'6jISB8YXBR8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43702,_binary '\0','/gIkqcEqz0rj6rK1knYAOoXpwA3y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6684884',6.8,9937,'en','Ladies in Black','Adapted from the bestselling novel by Madeleine St John, Ladies in Black is an alluring and tender-hearted comedy drama about the lives of a group of department store employees in 1959 Sydney.','/sIC0Y0dGLnxbdCksftZ38FZ2c61.jpg','2018-10-18',109,'Released',NULL,'Ladies in Black',483411,4.454,6.7,'rd7aD7F2QCg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43703,_binary '\0','/bhuIo7qlpJLPgx0sqd6hNV40vel.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6684976',3.4,2805,'en','Black Garden','Set on Christmas Eve, eight days after the war ends, survivor Kate discovers a mysterious radio signal and befriends the voice. As she embarks on a journey to find its origins, Kate encounters the isolation and horror of a nuclear war and the failed hope of those who survived.','/4xk4AYnEEgWENWbdmyVRYk2PXbA.jpg','2020-04-07',90,'Released',NULL,'Black Garden',553641,1.0371,3.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43704,_binary '\0','/5zMbZhHL3bhjGJpxDSexyEMmQjl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6685476',6.5,3234,'en','Moon Rock for Monday','Set in Sydney, 1999, after an unlikely encounter at a train station, a young girl befriends a fugitive teenage boy and they travel to visit a moon rock that the girl believes will heal her.','/9ruEB21XxH0vTOCbqDwXqZr8ByQ.jpg','2021-05-06',100,'Released','Sometimes the middle of nowhere finds you','Moon Rock for Monday',748994,1.753,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43705,_binary '\0','/lyHmhoRj3zXSdeCYbs2oOXLCF4K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6685538',6.6,7400,'uk','Мавка: Лісова пісня','Mavka, a Soul of the Forest, faces an impossible choice between love and her duty as Guardian of the Heart of the Forest when she falls for a human, a talented young musician named Lukas.','/eeJjd9JU2Mdj9d7nWRFLWlrcExi.jpg','2023-03-02',99,'Released',NULL,'Mavka: The Forest Song',459003,6.1945,7.161,'WZ1je_JJTv8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43706,_binary '\0','/yGQZe1nYj1iNcOuQwjqZypk1VFs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6686700',5.8,2263,'de','Steig. Nicht. Aus!','Taking his kids to school with the car, Berlin real estate developer Karl gets a call from a blackmailer: If he doesn’t pay up, the car will blow up. A deadly race against time begins.','/uJUXS785Mpvbqejj0hRWcleM83O.jpg','2018-04-12',105,'Released',NULL,'Don\'t. Get. Out!',497223,2.7726,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43707,_binary '\0','/k2fAJ7LazXL9OGWIplv9XqD3Zct.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6688022',6.5,3437,'en','After Everything','When Elliot, a brash 23-year-old living carefree in New York City, meets the sensible Mia and receives a damning diagnosis all in the same week, his world is turned completely upside down. But as their love blossoms amidst the chaos of his treatment, they discover that Elliot\'s illness is not the real test of their relationship – it\'s everything else.','/5fwosV84f3BOV2h4kqcbpQplFLY.jpg','2018-10-12',94,'Released','Love is sick.','After Everything',448557,3.0122,6.5,'feOPCrORwdw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43708,_binary '\0','/7BAy0m2E8Cz93GUNwjLrzKHCU73.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6688136',5.9,4960,'de','Expedition Happiness','A German couple and their dog travel across North America in a school bus searching for a state of pure bliss.','/lS09wiv0IF3n3lONGOtZo5EXqac.jpg','2017-05-04',95,'Released','Two free spirits, one dog. Traveling the vast spaces of an enormous continent in search of something more.','Expedition Happiness',455918,1.7394,6.5,'PKRvZLjkRJA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43709,_binary '\0','/8cVVsfV1YwM55q4pQxhnTXoua1m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6688354',4.8,2762,'en','The Field Guide to Evil','A feature-length anthology film. They are known as myths, lore, and folktales. Created to give logic to mankind’s darkest fears, these stories laid the foundation for what we now know as the horror genre.','/pWAniWWeBf2qGAYuCPvnvYGs7pM.jpg','2019-12-19',117,'Released','A global anthology into dark folklore','The Field Guide to Evil',436549,2.6583,5.559,'FvbR3q1dDAs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43710,_binary '\0','/p9zvs64aKVtqbk2e5azr8VEPHeF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6689014',6,10334,'en','She Came to Me','Composer Steven Lauddem is plagued by a creative block which leaves him unable to finish the score for his big comeback opera. When his former therapist-turned-wife Patricia suggests he rekindle his creativity by getting lost in the city, Steven sets out in search of inspiration. His epiphany comes after he meets a spirited woman named Katrina and discovers his life has much more potential than he bargained for, or ever could have imagined.','/2lG18RqCK8qTk7R5jA1L7ZRMWXu.jpg','2023-10-06',102,'Released','Sometimes you need to get lost.','She Came to Me',503417,4.9142,6.053,'EdfEv2ZwrFs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43711,_binary '\0','/yAhvYxF9J9P4lqGdznkxoN1pbF5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6690004',6.6,3267,'fr','Première année','Antoine is about to start his first year of medical school… for the third time. Benjamin, just out of high school, will make his first try. He soon realizes it\'s not exactly a walk in the park. In a fiercely competitive environment, with nights dedicated to hard studying rather than hard partying, the two freshmen will have to adapt and find a middle ground between despair for the present and hope for the future.','/jlPYKV4Pav3ee9Kf1tw5acMZofU.jpg','2018-09-12',92,'Released',NULL,'The Freshmen',463858,1.8055,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43712,_binary '\0','/qWT7netzO6sxyPLUgpLdpmKFss8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6690234',6.1,3033,'tr','Sonsuz Aşk','Sparks fly when a humble housekeeper crosses paths with a wealthy surgeon, but a devastating truth puts their relationship to the test.','/dnVrVJT1Ek0jHyOjHtUnUW6SSrg.jpg','2017-03-24',114,'Released',NULL,'Endless Love',468261,2.857,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43713,_binary '\0','/jlNR5Xcw9EWsezxxrXOUvrjVa7r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6692264',3.8,1731,'en','One Winter Night','An Orthodox Jewish mother and her daughters fall prey to the malevolent forces that preside over a rural community.','/zivEeRopKwjvkvpYFDDs13Ndc5J.jpg','2019-12-13',130,'Released',NULL,'One Winter Night',644009,0.8969,3.3,'e4wTv69dW1s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43714,_binary '\0','/hB6ROJ36qUKARCRl1mHyMcHWtsh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6692354',7.2,17394,'hi','इत्तेफ़ाक़','Police officer Dev investigates a double murder case that has only two witnesses - an acclaimed writer Vikram and a young homemaker Maya, who also happen to be the prime suspects in the case. He finds himself being torn between their own version\'s of what happened on the fateful night, and takes it upon himself to figure out the real story and capture the real murderer.','/riEnSoGJ1WubamfrNpj4N0wVdoW.jpg','2017-11-03',107,'Released','It Happened One Night','Ittefaq',464458,1.8229,6.8,'mvfvoCdPrII','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43715,_binary '\0','/20iZxgEwqRkJuHNSgnowLm9r7fo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6695212',7.3,2274,'ar','واجب','After years abroad in Italy, Shadi returns to his native Nazareth. But this is no spectacular homecoming. He\'s back somewhat begrudgingly to honour his \"wajib\" (or duty) to hand out invitations to his sister\'s wedding with his father. The simmering tension between the two — who are often stuck in a car, more often than not in traffic — builds, exposing the sometimes-comic chasms that exist between men who live in different worlds but share an unshakable bond.','/7yzu2DQmBkYpqYTm303WcSCySVJ.jpg','2017-08-20',107,'Released',NULL,'Wajib',467263,1.189,7.2,'ozvKJrSo2WE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43716,_binary '\0','/xwBMzAq3JFO4U7aSvAng9jcoZyH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6697582',6.9,42087,'tr','Arif V 216','After 8 years, Arif\'s old friend 216 from planet GORA pays a visit to Earth.Together they go on a quest where they\'ll be visiting 60\'s.','/3meMMp53LR3kWiRQm7mhS2pt4f4.jpg','2018-01-05',125,'Released',NULL,'Arif V 216',450720,1.2537,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43717,_binary '\0','/apAPJShy8FTct2JEAwK1Gx57Ggt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6699114',6.1,1619,'en','Runaway Romance','When she’s written out of her show, her relationship and her seemingly perfect life, reality TV star Ann Stanway leaves Hollywood and finds herself marooned in Amish country. But when Ann is taken in by the owner of a nearby Inn, and meets a handsome young architect, she discovers that the reality she left isn’t nearly as perfect as the one she’s found.','/tEhxcrIJpfG4DmZGY8kGsR7uPir.jpg','2018-08-04',90,'Released','Can a runaway, famous reality star find love in the most unexpected places?','Runaway Romance',495386,3.4731,6.8,'G0ZjJwrPtwo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43718,_binary '\0','/g5R8klL1IY12urrcj9Gq8MELU4a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6699860',5,3525,'es','Solo','After falling off a cliff and suffering substantial injures, for 48 long hours a young surfer must face a merciless nature and his own physical and mental agony to try to survive.','/67hdBNRmCeKYrEvBU5flH6aUt3G.jpg','2018-08-03',100,'Released',NULL,'Solo',518880,1.1678,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43719,_binary '\0','/j1uA9K21Dhu86mqyys8vqGgAB3u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6700846',7.8,7755,'en','AlphaGo','The ancient Chinese game of Go has long been considered a grand challenge for artificial intelligence. Yet in 2016, Google\'s DeepMind team announced that they would be taking on Lee Sedol, the world\'s most elite Go champion. AlphaGo chronicles the team as it prepares to test the limits of its rapidly-evolving AI technology. The film pits man against machine, and reveals as much about the workings of the human mind as it does the future of AI.','/zDxZwTCX22gYREAy73wiibzu9H6.jpg','2017-09-29',90,'Released',NULL,'AlphaGo',455008,1.5243,7.7,'8tq1C8spV_g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43720,_binary '\0','/ljZOlqLtMa6gnTHcYn9y9lP0bK3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6704776',6.8,14288,'es','El fotógrafo de Mauthausen','Spanish photographer Francesc Boix, imprisoned in the Mauthausen-Gusen concentration camp, works in the SS Photographic Service. Between 1943 and 1945, he hides, with the help of other prisoners, thousands of negatives, with the purpose of showing the freed world the atrocities committed by the Nazis, exhaustively documented. He will be a key witness during the Nuremberg Trials.','/6b4L0uLVgFsDfqPx0sFZbCRwIKH.jpg','2018-10-26',111,'Released','Based on an incredible real story','The Photographer of Mauthausen',528949,3.5572,6.933,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43721,_binary '\0','/kQBYfm2kUXqaLOLD6f0Myk14xrq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6704880',6.6,3052,'fr','Les Filles du soleil','Bahar, the commanding officer of the Daughters of the Sun, a battalion made up entirely of Kurdish female soldiers, is on the cusp of liberating their town, which has been overrun by ISIS extremists.','/fgVoQyioqX2Q78lnBO7CYqQ8eOZ.jpg','2018-02-14',111,'Released','Women. Life. Liberty.','Girls of the Sun',479520,2.6209,7,'FKxCXMIG3Xg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43722,_binary '\0','/nMPKcVt0tSGUjpA2W4UsPCyZRPe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6704894',6.6,1230,'en','Montford: The Chickasaw Rancher','A Chickasaw man survives great hardships and tragedy to establish a vast ranching empire along the famous cattle highway of the American West.','/tbWZaazxbhg01ogswfBSvYkjgdW.jpg','2021-11-01',96,'Released',NULL,'Montford: The Chickasaw Rancher',471342,1.7931,6,'237G0w7FvRM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43723,_binary '\0','/yxfWuiH3qfAiV4GSHEhXz7uC8sk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6704898',6.7,6745,'es','Elisa y Marcela','The film tells the true story of Elisa Sánchez Loriga and Marcela Gracia Ibeas, two women in 1901 Spain who fell deeply in love. To overcome societal and legal barriers to their relationship, Elisa assumes a male identity, enabling the pair to marry in secret. Their daring act makes them the first recorded same-sex couple to marry in Spain, but their love is tested as they face relentless persecution and sacrifice.','/zOd1CB3TgV1RLtnCHtDSPeC9tId.jpg','2019-05-24',118,'Released',NULL,'Elisa & Marcela',535356,2.3859,7.3,'zU9aZo8EdjI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43724,_binary '\0','/eKUr7XDgzt1pEfND71g7qAa1s2I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6704974',6.2,1392,'fr','Les Confins du monde','Indochina, 1945. While the French are harassed by both the Japanese army and the Vietnamese rebels, private Robert Tassen, driven by the memory of a tragedy of which he is the only survivor, embarks on the search for the mysterious and cruel Võ Bình Yên, one of the leaders of the insurrection.','/kBk0cHzLeNBm4UpiIMUzHLugMKU.jpg','2018-12-05',99,'Released',NULL,'To the Ends of the World',478508,2.8644,6,'yd9xtN43Rqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43725,_binary '\0','/7PZlpdoIOyyFurOyfyBAfYelDFQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6705162',4.6,7501,'en','Cheaper by the Dozen','This remake of the beloved classic follows the raucous exploits of a blended family of 12, the Bakers, as they navigate a hectic home life while simultaneously managing their family business.','/qNRsouZh5zmhaE3n4QpLDXzy1gQ.jpg','2022-03-18',107,'Released','Make room for family.','Cheaper by the Dozen',691683,8.3546,6.289,'Wq8Nsc5r2So','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43726,_binary '\0','/vNCum9wLyBpohCT47F8caDKvj8p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6705612',6.6,1224,'pa','ਮੰਜੇ ਬਿਸਤਰੇ','While getting prepared for his sister\'s wedding, a young man attempts to woo a girl whose marriage to another man has already been fixed.','/m7YpsaBbcTpYPPQXlzFGaSnUIN3.jpg','2017-04-14',137,'Released',NULL,'Manje Bistre',452394,0.9559,6.1,'bFzb1pBCRSg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43727,_binary '\0','/3qdHH6aE5rt0XW561tGa3EYffTh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6705640',4.7,3995,'es','Trauma','Four friends visit a rural locality of Chile, are brutally attacked by a man and his son. After not finding help in the town, they decide to confront these men with the help of a pair of policemen. But in this way, they will discover that their attackers have in their blood the direct legacy of the darkest period of Chilean history and will have to face the most brutal enemy.','/wbtU44cXUa57LV4rCIVuFBSBRql.jpg','2017-12-25',106,'Released','Evil requires loyalty','Trauma',469722,2.5337,5.494,'4-FNYrcCI60','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43728,_binary '\0','/2jLMu0YVunwb2RgYqY6Ewbgw86y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6705860',6.7,1765,'en','Diane','Diane is a devoted friend and caretaker, particularly to her drug-addicted son. But as those around her begin to drift away in the last quarter of her life, she is left to reckon with past choices and long-dormant memories.','/vQsWX0B6G5wajvCiUh4tmMHd1I8.jpg','2019-03-28',96,'Released',NULL,'Diane',510034,1.3821,6.1,'Yl1WJA0T5II','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43729,_binary '\0','/s4PuusidubLjEubD6E3KfYKE9ia.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6707906',5.2,4320,'ml','ഒടിയന്‍','With the arrival of electricity in the region under the British rule, the Odiyan clan that possesses the supernatural powers to assume animal form find it difficult to survive as they are ruthlessly captured and killed by the British. How the last Odiyan tries to save his clan with his stealth attacks, forms the crux.','/hNDxMa9EfNIjOrdQHysJyprrwPd.jpg','2018-12-13',167,'Released',NULL,'Odiyan',461166,1.6362,5.435,'GOJsWfC52QI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43730,_binary '\0','/kn9mkIS9Wawan5F18RpHl2lQer3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6708044',5.8,3262,'es','La tribu','A cleaner woman with vocational street dancer tries to recover her long-stranded son that she gave for adoption, a former CEO who lost everything, including his memories.','/pASeM9pyZtqDqTkXD1mNvqqh9hK.jpg','2018-03-16',90,'Released',NULL,'The Tribe',504345,1.4881,6.316,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43731,_binary '\0','/sWPxNdAgKfTIeZ3H17EheDAsci6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6708116',7.2,6837,'fr','Mauvaises herbes','Wael, a former street child, makes a living from small scams with his adoptive mother and partner-in-crime Monique. When this unconventional duo swindles the wrong guy, Victor, an old acquaintance of Monique now in charge of a support organization for troubled teens, they have no choice but to become his interim secretary and educator in order to redeem themselves.','/sJJWdXTi7ybxLd3mSILD7XxwYzh.jpg','2018-11-21',100,'Released',NULL,'Bad Seeds',498249,2.2378,7.6,'ZiOIYs-Z-s4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43732,_binary '\0','/dls6cXimFZwM5Ts3Ft7Ox5C7jfY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6708668',5.7,29110,'sv','Svart krabba','To end an apocalyptic war and save her daughter, a reluctant soldier embarks on a desperate mission to cross a frozen sea carrying a top-secret cargo.','/mcIYHZYwUbvhvUt8Lb5nENJ7AlX.jpg','2022-03-18',109,'Released','Hope burns brightest in the cold.','Black Crab',760868,6.1171,6.2,'fmjKsL_-rfw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43733,_binary '\0','/5oJb47JNlvU1p0PDA55vr3Nhpr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6710214',6,1756,'en','Liberated: The New Sexual Revolution','A documentary about today\'s young adult hookup culture and the stories in pop-culture that influence it.','/kmsT3BEmUgZMvFBKYO69ajiDZJR.jpg','2017-04-22',84,'Released',NULL,'Liberated: The New Sexual Revolution',502298,0.9893,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43734,_binary '\0','/fIwiFha3WPu5nHkBeMQ4GzEk0Hv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6710474',7.7,661253,'en','Everything Everywhere All at Once','An aging Chinese immigrant is swept up in an insane adventure, where she alone can save what\'s important to her by connecting with the lives she could have led in other universes.','/u68AjlvlutfEIcpmbYpKcdi09ut.jpg','2022-03-24',140,'Released','The universe is so much bigger than you realize.','Everything Everywhere All at Once',545611,36.9127,7.713,'wxN1T1uxQ2g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43735,_binary '\0','/s30qeq9lamHfP7GH14DiIJdpbpw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6710826',3.9,3443,'en','The Jurassic Games','In the near future, 10 death row convicts are forced to compete in a virtual reality game that pits them against dinosaurs and each other.','/vjcoKGhJ5KR1lNoMsMzHeQ8xefo.jpg','2018-05-21',86,'Released','Win the games. Win your freedom.','The Jurassic Games',504982,3.2807,4.7,'94CozNqV0Zk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43736,_binary '\0','/klihgytIMudjmc73E8LAtUu5GV5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6711660',6.8,2759,'hi','बाबूमोशाय बन्दूकबाज़','Two contract killer from Uttar Pradesh, Babu Bihari and Banke Bihari who are often paid to bump off the same game, cross each other\'s path and end up fighting with each other.','/nmqyewAS2fbpXUKKEl5VehuxdfA.jpg','2017-08-25',122,'Released',NULL,'Babumoshai Bandookbaaz',461809,1.3436,6.304,'8Bakp3UKa3c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43737,_binary '\0','/FrsPIFcWMD8mpwYLbH1mXqhkjx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6712014',6.5,6988,'hi','फुकरे रिटर्न्स','A year after the first movie, the four friends are enjoying their lives to the fullest, get in trouble once again with Bholi, who is released from prison earlier than expected and is broke.','/AclYkwVFwS8yxMWj4riYqRaE0w0.jpg','2017-12-07',135,'Released',NULL,'Fukrey Returns',454776,1.5759,6.468,'f-UzOpuKOVY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43738,_binary '\0','/hidddIpkh1oIE57ECaJ19VPYxI7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6712026',7.1,3057,'ta','கவண்','A budding journalist passionate about ethical, noble, hard-hitting journalism understands the more flourishing ghetto of sensationalism &amp; news fabrication that the Entertainment TV Channel he belongs to, thrives on. When caught in a dilemma of whether to hold for a while or rise in protest, a situation forces him to make a decision that puts him out of work but… there begins his work.','/hqePCECNlXBRMAJz9cd5VoP25Lf.jpg','2017-03-31',160,'Released',NULL,'Kavan',449742,1.2837,7.083,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43739,_binary '\0','/1FSEt4HNET6m0pTaU55dqNR0M4C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6713802',4.7,1353,'en','Neverknock','In 1986, three teens were brutally murdered after knocking on the door of 59 Oakwood Lane. The killer was never found. Over the next forty years, rumors turned to legend, and while few will admit to believing the stories, kids are still warned never knock on the door of 59 Oakwood Lane for fear of what may answer. On this Halloween night, Grace and her friends are going to wish they’d heeded the warnings and never knocked…','/q8zBaiGFagwxKoQKhjg0irpgBax.jpg','2017-10-15',90,'Released','They should’ve listened to the warnings…','Neverknock',480405,1.3938,4.6,'IEqfkmQi03Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43740,_binary '\0','/9p3bwHTpX5Axpyp4gxqmDxWaau0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6714432',6,3617,'en','The Loud House Movie','The Loud family travel to Scotland and discover they are descendants of Scottish royalty as they move into their giant ancestral castle.','/7dM5DILTl9ddpjvnJhs2nA1U9Ru.jpg','2021-08-20',83,'Released','The Louds are about to rule.','The Loud House Movie',410113,5.1114,7.232,'A-JGwOahwms','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43741,_binary '\0','/5IOXYjR4kQcGXVT9Pyd2fhOOqZJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6714534',7.3,8000,'en','Get Me Roger Stone','From his days of testifying at the Watergate hearings to advising recent presidential candidate Donald Trump, Roger Stone has long offended people on both sides of the political fence as a force in conservative America. Outspoken author, pundit, ahead of his time election strategist, this is his story.','/n0FXjHHG4a0apw3X4zggpIC5fih.jpg','2017-04-23',100,'Released','Let\'s get this party started.','Get Me Roger Stone',448448,2.305,7.1,'5IPyv4KgTAA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43742,_binary '\0','/9n2tJBplPbgR2ca05hS5CKXwP2c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6718170',7,302380,'en','The Super Mario Bros. Movie','While working underground to fix a water main, Brooklyn plumbers—and brothers—Mario and Luigi are transported down a mysterious pipe and wander into a magical new world. But when the brothers are separated, Mario embarks on an epic quest to find Luigi.','/qNBAXBIQlnOThrVvA6mA2B5ggV6.jpg','2023-04-05',93,'Released','Not all heroes wear capes. Some wear overalls.','The Super Mario Bros. Movie',502356,33.9998,7.591,'KydqdKKyGEk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43743,_binary '\0','/6JRaX5GAHkhi4zORy4LdWkT5xra.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6718730',7.3,3191,'ar','ولد ملكًا','A coming-of-age story set in 1919 about 14 year old Faisal, an Arab prince who is dispatched from the deserts of Arabia to London by his warrior father, Prince Abd Al-Aziz, on a high stakes diplomatic mission to secure the formation of his country.','/hx3aLmbP9mBDaS5gQpO1fssMOC6.jpg','2019-04-25',103,'Released',NULL,'Born a King',501591,1.3545,7.4,'aUvMWO8ubqQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43744,_binary '\0','/5B9VsZwhulX88aj1VZfe41h2ykY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6719524',2.9,2140,'en','5-Headed Shark Attack','A beautiful island is home to thousands of species of aquatic life. Now there is a new species: the 5-Headed Shark is all heads and teeth. Shaped like a demented starfish, this monster terrorizes the open ocean before invading the beaches of Puerto Rico, endangering the once peaceful island paradise.','/yh1zWtaScdbseIzzuiDld9Aw917.jpg','2017-07-10',90,'Released','YOU CAN\'T SURVIVE THE FIVE!','5-Headed Shark Attack',460218,2.7547,4.2,'MEsjdSf4l8A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43745,_binary '\0','/uC5NGN6aS7YBYJ7FCLfblDsIsYb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6720618',6.8,2828,'ja','家族のレシピ','Masato is a young ramen chef in Japan. When he finds his late mother\'s journal after the sudden death of his emotionally distant father, he takes it with him to her native country, Singapore, hoping to piece together the story of his family and his life.','/n3PF0LTjWHTRASdfoj5mU9UiwHp.jpg','2018-03-29',90,'Released','When food is love…','Ramen Shop',500890,2.3751,6.8,'oB8PpdeSXRQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43746,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6720680',6.6,1367,'en','PACmen','This observational documentary follows the men behind the Super-PACs that persuaded Dr Ben Carson to run for President. Believing Carson can save the Republican Party, they successfully draft him to run, raise millions of dollars and catapult him to the top of the polls. However, as Carson\'s political inexperience begins to show, his constant media gaffes make fundraising increasingly difficult. Donors and voters abandon Carson\'s campaign as wallets close, hearts open and faith is tested. As Trump inexplicably rises, the campaign descends into chaos and the PACmen begin to wonder - did they pick the wrong savior?','/nAHFyhCt3l4IOyTPT4BY8vHLVwI.jpg','2017-05-02',82,'Released','Political fundraising... it\'s not brain surgery.','PACmen',451435,0.8108,6.3,'PP2XXYHx_0Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43747,_binary '\0','/rlXjT3c62EUM4w7hX3u8cnZGaeK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6720802',7.3,10668,'ml','ട്രാന്‍സ്','A disheartened motivational speaker gets hired by a corporate to become a preacher until his live stint on television puts him and his service under the scanner.','/jur8vAsFMtwxqyAngXeXKZnqMSe.jpg','2020-02-20',170,'Released',NULL,'Trance',590077,1.6611,6.75,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43748,_binary '\0','/vPNt2hXlVaoK4Tczroo5MBLZIcD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6721848',5.8,6680,'tr','Kolonya Cumhuriyeti','Peker Mengen wins the post of mayor in a remote town with the promise of a visit by the prime minister and making the town a province. When the people do not forget his promise, Mengen ends up persuading the prime minister to visit the town with his idiosyncratic methods. After consulting with his advisors, Peker prepares a grandiose welcome ceremony, but when the ceremony gets out of his control, the town of 5000 people suddenly ends up becoming a country, one that is at war with America. As Peker Mengen, his unwillingly married wife Mualla and his advisors try to keep America at bay and struggle with the difficulties of establishing a new country, they even get the help of an alien to achieve their goals.','/yVQAN2mWVdwsvKFbvF3zS39bS7K.jpg','2017-02-20',105,'Released',NULL,'Overnight Republic',453596,1.6843,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43749,_binary '\0','/kyegg1r5oxRCZgqU7anHYD2TJap.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6722030',5.6,22119,'en','The Intruder','A psychological thriller about a young married couple who buys a beautiful Napa Valley house on several acres of land only to find that the man they bought it from refuses to let go of the property.','/p9xKyetr0ihJ2K6HJMeXzc4IwEv.jpg','2019-05-03',102,'Released','Your House. His Home.','The Intruder',524247,6.3526,6,'aKXvex7b1Ew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43750,_binary '\0','/zX0q1hPRon0SAIcRmTum06Khjll.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6722400',6,30929,'en','Fast Charlie','When his aging mob boss is whacked, Charlie Swift, a loyal friend and hired gun, will stop at nothing to destroy the upcoming crew that took him out.','/3y72ffwYRUPOj4yOQbiTaN897Tm.jpg','2023-12-08',90,'Released','Keep your friends close and your enemies dead.','Fast Charlie',945937,7.1086,6.246,'geZ-0zEHx60','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43751,_binary '\0','/s2ZyF0BbPb6KNyYrQUD74UXfz33.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6722726',7.1,5274,'en','Come As You Are','Three young men with disabilities embark on a road trip to a brothel in Montreal catering to people with special needs to lose their virginity and embrace their independence.','/gDSPfrlVNRsrafcL1p594DmoXo.jpg','2020-02-14',107,'Released','Everyone has needs','Come As You Are',576568,3.3116,6.6,'s29hTB7c8GA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43752,_binary '\0','/1KpCjh3hedCEX8mvxtldU0Z2IiE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6722802',5.4,15126,'en','Marlowe','Private detective Philip Marlowe becomes embroiled in an investigation involving a wealthy Californian family after a beautiful blonde hires him to track down her former lover.','/vjAMj81oYBryzGBhJk4gcK0M636.jpg','2023-02-15',109,'Released','Los Angeles 1939. Outside the spotlight lies a city of secrets.','Marlowe',844417,6.5411,5.716,'brVF7t8VYuM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43753,_binary '\0','/hMdI1zx5x9qDy0gwVsWfU33OBub.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6722976',7.8,2652,'en','The Elephant Queen','Embark on an epic journey of family, courage, and coming home in this feature-length documentary. Join Athena, the majestic matriarch, as she leads her elephant herd across an unforgiving African landscape filled with vibrant wildlife.','/26hkYwRR6VsdjoelsOLpB5Cx1HD.jpg','2019-10-18',97,'Released','Embark on an epic journey of family, courage, and coming home.','The Elephant Queen',541572,6.9654,7.284,'e8TsCQmngFk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43754,_binary '\0','/mQOUyqDybTqxl73hO5LujCZsM1o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6723592',7.3,710527,'en','Tenet','Armed with only one word - Tenet - and fighting for the survival of the entire world, the Protagonist journeys through a twilight world of international espionage on a mission that will unfold in something beyond real time.','/aCIFMriQh8rvhxpN1IWGgvH0Tlg.jpg','2020-08-22',150,'Released','Time runs out.','Tenet',577922,22.5998,7.172,'AZGcmvrTX9M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43755,_binary '\0','/prQE97Ds6ElKtTuemJRCvGJFlZz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6725014',8.3,10660,'sv','Scener ur ett äktenskap','Johan and Marianne are married and seem to have it all. Their happiness, however, is a façade for a troubled relationship, which becomes even rockier when Johan admits that he\'s having an affair. Before long, the spouses separate and move towards finalizing their divorce, but they make attempts at reconciling. Even as they pursue other relationships, Johan and Marianne realize that they have a significant bond, but also many issues that hinder that connection.','/ArKEdvJesIktFX8OAhcdKAOLl6I.jpg','1974-09-15',169,'Released',NULL,'Scenes from a Marriage',133919,3.8979,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43756,_binary '\0','/km1qUafSpJ7iNfi0dXd547D4s2w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6725484',6.8,1235,'tl','Can\'t Help Falling in Love','Gab de la Cuesta is a high-strung career woman who got recently engaged to her longtime boyfriend. Her well-planned life suddenly becomes complicated when she discovers that she is actually married to a total stranger.','/bWTG8X1rd4b4UEhQkWx8WXtmGEd.jpg','2017-04-15',119,'Released',NULL,'Can\'t Help Falling in Love',452196,2.0812,7.5,'s3xyjzfj-Wo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43757,_binary '\0','/nKSklcYvr2jDFPPHVBr6zB700gq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6727296',6.9,3655,'te','భాగమతి','Accused of murdering her husband, IAS officer Chanchala, is taken to a haunted house called Bhaaghamathie Bungalow, where police and CBI officials interrogate her to dig up dirt on a politician she had worked under. As she\'s left alone in the haunted house, spirits take control of her and IAS Chanchala transforms into an unrecognisable person. How this impacts her and everyone around her forms the crux of the story.','/quGwnd4DjXOX25aLwuuRJJ5YmlS.jpg','2018-01-26',142,'Released',NULL,'Bhaagamathie',485789,1.4971,6.061,'oM8rMC3OwKo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43758,_binary '\0','/v5PEwCwbNWd81iYboTlQO8Y5I7d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6728096',5.9,7337,'en','The Breaker Upperers','Two women run a business breaking up couples for cash but when one develops a conscience their friendship unravels.','/7DtpXhqpS4okrnZvgTgf7PQjTgZ.jpg','2018-03-10',82,'Released','Breaking up just got easier','The Breaker Upperers',502143,2.288,5.2,'qKVhDbe9VOo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43759,_binary '\0','/xMsn2d2MfoMqtUrR2mMlfchKzOF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6728390',7.7,4731,'ja','劇場版 黒子のバスケ LAST GAME','Kuroko reunites with the \"Generation of Miracles\" when former rivals are humiliated in an exhibition game against a notorious street basketball team.','/mXJQbwxA0joNv9rGy25rFrm5N1r.jpg','2017-03-18',90,'Released','Last game, Last stand','Kuroko\'s Basketball the Movie: Last Game',428707,6.2172,7.6,'DadWQihpBeo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43760,_binary '\0','/z22FWo8LDQnIc1Aqg0aKBvyiots.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6729000',5.5,1725,'en','Tyrel','Tyler joins his friend on a trip to the Catskills for a weekend birthday party with several people he doesn’t know. As soon as they get there, it’s clear that (1) he’s the only black guy, and (2) it’s going to be a weekend of heavy drinking. Although Tyler is welcomed, he can’t help but feel uneasy in “Whitesville.” The combination of all the testosterone and alcohol starts to get out of hand, and Tyler’s precarious situation starts to feel like a nightmare.','/9VhpCORIbxeLq5dU9yGLQ9Zy461.jpg','2018-12-05',86,'Released','When you\'re the only one','Tyrel',454312,1.6933,5.1,'QQiSXQdfQBM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43761,_binary '\0','/7XaNNkK38s16WFsKQCs8Gw13Bbf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6730898',6.3,3688,'en','Lazer Team 2','After Woody goes missing while working on secret alien research, the former members of Lazer Team must come together to rescue their lost friend.','/yBtyoFTLSv0nEq32BlGrIGVNyxk.jpg','2017-11-13',86,'Released','Deep space is about to be probed.','Lazer Team 2',472054,1.3748,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43762,_binary '\0','/fiSlTGaaQsktasb