 down memory lane to figure out if love only exists when it\'s practically gone. As he\'s trying to pick up the pieces, he begins to realize what makes this current society so confused, which gives us a highly subjective view of Hungary\'s present.','/2F4ZJdpvY9ZKfWsWQIYBBa08t24.jpg','2018-12-27',97,'Released','There is no future without the past!','Bad Poems',553036,1.9105,6.5,'MoLms3xqlS8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43796,_binary '\0','/9ofDNn7KXe8xBGYExqEydIT5rGd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6755892',5.8,2720,'en','The Neighborhood','A brash group of hoodlums have been doing minor crime jobs in their neighborhood since they were kids until they step on the wrong toes and get caught up in a war with an old-school mafia king pin and their lives soon become hell on earth.','/bTS9OwYuHtfqNdsV67m791QSVUH.jpg','2017-08-18',107,'Released','Tell me who you hang around with and I\'ll tell you who you are.','The Neighborhood',466912,2.2395,3.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43797,_binary '\0','/aglDqWUMXJdLbFwgGVDOZd5Owdd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6759380',6.6,2021,'en','A Song for Christmas','Pop superstar Adelaide Kay is so fed up with her controlling manager that she sneaks off the tour bus after their latest squabble. Though exhilarated to be free, she finds herself stranded in the freezing cold of a Pennsylvania winter, with no money and no plan. A local family, the Lapps, take her in. They know the true meaning of the season, even if they’re close to losing their tree farm. No one in the family recognizes Adelaide except Dillon, the oldest son.','/4PjXNuqhkrhcMYUJTzsPQmRnXgN.jpg','2017-11-11',84,'Released',NULL,'A Song for Christmas',479613,2.0631,6.3,'GfppdyIdvrk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43798,_binary '\0','/pVoegvd3t6xwfrLoNnixyrCpWA9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6760562',6.7,2020,'en','A Bundle of Trouble: An Aurora Teagarden Mystery','Aurora Teagarden and her boyfriend Martin are thrilled when they get an unexpected visit from his niece and her new baby. Their excitement is short lived when his niece disappears and the baby is left behind. Once again, Aurora finds herself drawn into a deadly investigation as she risks it all to help Martin reunite with his family.','/5855wwOnhlfK2cBHwA46KCwVFva.jpg','2017-05-21',84,'Released',NULL,'A Bundle of Trouble: An Aurora Teagarden Mystery',455034,3.1911,6.9,'CnnnYu02dwM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43799,_binary '\0','/sOy92H9RdKfsC4OY4umZi2rPrur.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6760876',5.9,13123,'en','Wasp Network','Havana, Cuba, 1990. René González, an airplane pilot, unexpectedly flees the country, leaving behind his wife Olga and his daughter Irma, and begins a new life in Miami, where he becomes a member of an anti-Castro organization.','/fzjbeyEwmlpxu5CMzmFz8IDVELm.jpg','2020-01-29',128,'Released','Traitors or heroes?','Wasp Network',451184,5.1538,6,'taMNuQDTUr4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43800,_binary '\0','/1HscyOaJKZNxZI2CQHRiYGcV6vb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6763252',7.3,24474,'de','Der Hauptmann','Germany, 1945. Soldier Willi Herold, a deserter of the German army, stumbles into a uniform of a Nazi captain abandoned during the last and desperate weeks of the Third Reich. Newly emboldened by the allure of a suit that he has stolen only to stay warm, Willi discovers that many Germans will follow the leader, whoever he is.','/jdUSP7svZ3DOgCnB0upT1yiueUY.jpg','2018-02-02',118,'Released','Follow the leader','The Captain',475094,4.6027,7.2,'09AojeeIpdE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43801,_binary '\0','/Ajclsb4s0awZB4LpLZH5HT3eI8h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6763778',6.2,1751,'en','Holler','In a forgotten pocket of Southern Ohio where American manufacturing and opportunity are drying up, a determined young woman finds a ticket out when she is accepted to college. Alongside her older brother, Ruth Avery joins a dangerous scrap metal crew in order to pay her way. Together, they spend one brutal winter working the scrap yards during the day and stealing valuable metal from the once thriving factories by night. With her goal in sight, Ruth finds that the ultimate cost of an education for a girl like her may be more than she bargained for, and she soon finds herself torn between a promising future and the family she would leave behind.','/7pqE8HeWv7Mqrjqi0QHTTfP1tvC.jpg','2021-06-11',91,'Released','Her time is now.','Holler',665886,1.6441,6,'4-CFpCQbIek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43802,_binary '\0','/fjqYTbfajZADLexZbTmgftAvMIQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6764496',6,1223,'en','The Spruces and the Pines','A Romeo and Juliet romance takes place among two feuding New England Christmas tree lot families. Against their families’ wills, Julie Pine and visiting-from-Texas Rick Spruce fall in love, but are forced to hide their Yuletide relationship.','/5R2OzGh59q8qn5mjgYwn2NnTKLh.jpg','2017-12-03',90,'Released',NULL,'The Spruces and the Pines',487055,1.7781,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43803,_binary '\0','/mgfxkCJLvudtnTOJml5mFbHWbk0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6768578',7.2,31918,'it','Dogman','Marcello, a small and gentle dog groomer, finds himself involved in a dangerous relationship of subjugation with Simone, a former violent boxer who terrorizes the entire neighborhood. In an effort to reaffirm his dignity, Marcello will submit to an unexpected act of vengeance.','/eaZq1G8sJHv9f9a5IzioQlS3REX.jpg','2018-05-17',103,'Released',NULL,'Dogman',483184,3.5036,7.5,'ewh0lBcEb2U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43804,_binary '\0','/il036klfxddKrHHZPpxvWc0L5Kr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6769280',5.8,10612,'en','Time Freak','Stillman, a heartbroken physics student, builds a time machine when his girlfriend breaks up with him. Going back in time, he attempts to save their relationship by fixing every mistake he made—while dragging his best friend along in the process.','/oSDctngY0Oiq6l2LcJDk8k6smvg.jpg','2018-11-09',104,'Released','If at first you don\'t succeed, build a time machine.','Time Freak',451925,4.8551,6.697,'TWQz0p550Do','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43805,_binary '\0','/3eEtOooEzdpIA9hf0V4b5DFqyjd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6769508',7.1,7264,'ko','강철비','Amid a coup, a North Korean agent escapes south with the country\'s injured leader in an attempt to keep him alive and prevent a Korean war.','/zCXpkcMAUxtOp55bWMpBZjpHr5g.jpg','2017-12-14',139,'Released','The Coup Arose In The North.','Steel Rain',435841,3.1593,7.058,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43806,_binary '\0','/dAWoR2TMUJHzpEEuxSmElsRO1av.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6772524',5.8,4474,'en','Trouble','A pampered dog named Trouble must learn to live in the real world while trying to escape from his former owner\'s greedy children and must learn how to survive on the big-city streets.','/yfTXk9T3iNxuOcnA72AirzueLxL.jpg','2019-08-08',88,'Released','From the silk sheets... to the mean streets...','Trouble',570480,6.0511,6.6,'vfIOnOz0ERQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43807,_binary '\0','/kCqWQ24m7TjA0RllQMn0JYrcy4a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6772802',6.7,61928,'en','Hillbilly Elegy','An urgent phone call pulls a Yale Law student back to his Ohio hometown, where he reflects on three generations of family history and his own future.','/aA0D6DKIfLtXYNy94Qq2IW5NiGR.jpg','2020-11-09',117,'Released','Inspired by a true story three generations in the making.','Hillbilly Elegy',592984,6.491,6.67,'KW_3aaoSOYg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43808,_binary '\0','/yxmfjj4YiFcJipn9nYVBRxeCvo9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6772804',4.4,19680,'en','Escape Plan: The Extractors','After security expert Ray Breslin is hired to rescue the kidnapped daughter of a Hong Kong tech mogul from a formidable Latvian prison, Breslin\'s girlfriend is also captured. Now he and his team must pull off a deadly rescue mission to confront their sadistic foe and save the hostages before time runs out.','/r15SUgzjL8bablcdEkHk9T7TSRl.jpg','2019-06-20',97,'Released','This time it’s personal.','Escape Plan: The Extractors',480042,6.0205,5.441,'9QX_HA97hOk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43809,_binary '\0','/4UreNo3ASpycKg4LDP7r9n37pFF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6772874',6.7,2069,'zh','喜欢你','Lu Jin is a handsome, wealthy hotel executive whose drive for perfection is matched only by his taste for fine cuisine. When he checks into the Rosebud, he\'s dissatisfied with everything he sees and is ready to take action... until flamboyant female sous chef Gu Shengnan creates the perfectionist what may be a perfect meal. Now, these bitter rivals find themselves brought together in the kitchen in this light-hearted romantic comedy, infused with fun and flavors to create a delicious dish that foodies around the world wouldn\'t dare to miss.','/jO6lZr0i65zOAjqSj6sy8khD6G4.jpg','2017-04-28',106,'Released',NULL,'This Is Not What I Expected',452413,1.8247,6.844,'h5rUEzKfuOk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43810,_binary '\0','/JM3IUFRp7KUNAcVlGJ54lAZfcs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6772946',3.2,2062,'en','The Campus','Robert Wainwright dies after breaking his deal with the Devil, passing that debt onto his estranged daughter Morgan. She soon finds herself in a never-ending cycle of terror as she is brutally murdered then resurrected over and over again, each time losing a piece of her soul. Now she must discover why this is happening and break the deadly cycle in order to escape.','/gEgb80VJPC4StB2I4AYnzq3bPZJ.jpg','2018-01-26',84,'Released','Make a Wish...To Survive','The Campus',517015,1.1631,3.8,'zkOa65niU7M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43811,_binary '\0','/eQ5xu2pQ5Kergubto5PbbUzey28.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6772950',5.3,75443,'en','Truth or Dare','A harmless game of \"Truth or Dare\" among friends turns deadly when someone—or something—begins to punish those who tell a lie—or refuse the dare.','/ei2waWQAG8NP244WShIFgGu9IOu.jpg','2018-04-12',101,'Released','First you play the game, then the game plays you.','Truth or Dare',460019,10.1687,5.9,'BjRNY3u3bUw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43812,_binary '\0','/rcMj3ynkcoJxJBnTiBAbDjfXhYz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6774092',5.4,2648,'ml','മാസ്റ്റർപീസ്','Edward Livingston, an English professor at the Travancore Maharaja College. As the defiant students continue to split into warring factions, Livingston sets out to restore order and make the campus a better place for everyone.','/pHzk3brr9iyictR4GsMsPZubNX2.jpg','2017-12-21',160,'Released','Master of the masses','Masterpiece',495009,1.448,3.773,'1vOck2Nguso','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000');
INSERT INTO `movies` VALUES (43813,_binary '\0','/xVzebxhBXGhaVSu9Gf6rGktywIJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6774106',5.1,1356,'ml','പുള്ളിക്കാരന്‍ സ്റ്റാറാ','Rajakumaran, a talented teacher and also a trainer for other teaching staff. His way of communication and the method he adopts while teaching, makes him everybody\'s favorite. The story takes a turn when two women from two different generations come across his life and change it for the better or worse.','/mNTRZkMZR0NY969BHDz7F947RqG.jpg','2017-09-01',135,'Released',NULL,'Pullikaran Stara',470443,0.9013,4.563,'hez3gYfnra4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43814,_binary '\0','/n6E3kXEHjrvaVBulBSKTrribmWa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6774212',5.3,5614,'hi','अय्यारी','An Indian Army officer is compelled to chase down his protege when the latter turns rogue and threatens to disrupt the country’s government and army.','/1lfpxWPKRN9GOCdad5XhdxWuS3U.jpg','2018-02-16',157,'Released',NULL,'Aiyaary',493620,1.3313,5.725,'KcWXKmnZZVo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43815,_binary '\0','/m3GdsmJ7uZA4ywDTymwG142UIGS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6774420',6.8,1637,'ml','ക്വീന്‍','The story starts with the inauguration of the first-ever Mechanical batch in an engineering campus. The batch consists of boys only. Later in the second year of the department, a girl joins and becomes the only girl to be a part of their batch. As the story evolves, the girl grabs all their love and attention and becomes the QUEEN of the batch.','/h8Hqloge0eDaGD0F460Vbza7w2H.jpg','2018-01-12',160,'Released',NULL,'Queen',465024,0.9331,6.237,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43816,_binary '\0','/13Ih5lmFmJrsMbAgmfS6aABfCf7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6774786',4.5,15949,'en','Occupation','Town residents must band together after a devastating alien invasion. As they struggle to survive, they realize they must stay one step ahead of their attackers and work together for a chance to strike back.','/hr7MFQAmP30IJZP2FXKhPKbe8IW.jpg','2018-07-12',119,'Released','The conquest begins.','Occupation',503346,4.1133,4.7,'95GAw9LptFE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43817,_binary '\0','/8gEy8zrnaubHdSn2f7sdmdiNrkg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6775942',6.9,1342,'en','The King','A cultural portrait of the American dream at a critical time in the nation’s history. Set against the 2016 American election, The King takes a musical road trip across the country in Elvis Presley\'s 1963 Rolls Royce.','/Tgv0kLi8obD2bfiGyErp4BJMeH.jpg','2018-06-22',107,'Released','The rise of a king, the fall of an empire.','The King',452226,1.5592,6.3,'csXtdjsqYLM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43818,_binary '\0','/xpvjxEJbB1IsaKFaJhB5fXvmJqB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6776106',7,3803,'is','Andið eðlilega','At the edge of Iceland’s Reykjanes peninsula, two women’s lives will intersect – for a brief moment – while trapped in circumstances unforeseen. Between a struggling Icelandic mother and an asylum seeker from Guinea-Bissau, a delicate bond will form as both strategize to get their lives back on track.','/wYoOX37zNCHWZMg6s0dRpVrkyU.jpg','2018-08-17',95,'Released',NULL,'And Breathe Normally',489982,1.7281,6.661,'WEpY2TRzpAI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43819,_binary '\0','/rJcXijeQkyiLXRodR2gsHIzMje7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6776462',7.2,3193,'fa','لرد','Reza, residing in the wilderness with his wife and son, lives a retired life and devotes himself to freshwater fish farming. A private company that has targets on his land is ready to do anything to force him to sell.','/meIOwiPGMAYsRQzsgdAkeU0qCpu.jpg','2017-12-06',117,'Released','A film of immense courage and defiance.','A Man of Integrity',452013,1.8053,6.791,'mKVMxuYiwL0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43820,_binary '\0','/3p6mI2PM4vDS3mcOpj1dp0wXfds.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6776572',7.1,2987,'ar','على كف عفريت','When Mariam, a young Tunisian woman, is raped by police officers after leaving a party, she is propelled into a harrowing night in which she must fight for her rights even though justice lies on the side of her tormentors.','/bv8EAeWoIlwVwUVFwIkBQUt0jk4.jpg','2017-10-18',100,'Released',NULL,'Beauty and the Dogs',452010,2.5902,7,'fdAGBnOyGyo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43821,_binary '\0','/nbggZoZHJLOUdwAHUQ7Ce2aOHsd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6777056',6.8,3495,'ru','Теснота','1998, Nalchik. A Jewish family is in trouble: the youngest son and his bride do not come home, and in the morning, a ransom note arrives. The ransom is so high that the family is forced not only to sell its small business, but also to seek help from its fellow tribesmen.','/2in3p9uaX6ClqkMS8Oci69LCsXP.jpg','2017-08-03',118,'Released',NULL,'Closeness',452008,1.293,6.7,'_OmXazQPVMA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43822,_binary '\0','/f8xOxhUifgZVtclccpiHRP20Zkw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6777170',6.8,2551,'fa','۲۴ فریم','A collection of 24 short four-and-a-half minutes films inspired by still images, including paintings and photographs. An experimental project made by filmmaker Abbas Kiarostami in the last three years of his life.','/oWHZdSSWiclgMUjVg3eYDBCbiAL.jpg','2018-02-02',114,'Released','The final film from Abbas Kiarostami','24 Frames',377269,1.5289,6.5,'FNSlQ9mmJ4M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43823,_binary '\0','/labMpUVoAqNlHTKiu7KsoZT0v9d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6777338',6.6,18843,'ko','악녀','Honed from childhood into a merciless killing machine by a criminal organization, assassin Sook-hee is recruited with the promise of freedom after ten years of service. However, secrets from her past destroy everything she’s worked for and now she embarks on a roaring rampage of revenge.','/tJlOV2SU6qTxR540H9VtoCAOVm.jpg','2017-06-08',129,'Released','An endless vengeance begins.','T