l boyfriend, superstar baseball player Chase Taynor, returns to town, she finds the inspiration to reinvent her struggling diner… and revisits the past to find something even better for the future.','/wLO64np21v6uKlHSMUGsRDG16II.jpg','2017-04-22',84,'Released',NULL,'The Perfect Catch',450679,1.7897,6.3,'dazKLWHgBHk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43828,_binary '\0','/l3Fj1diIUBOOTf3FnKfCWaejxql.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6785292',7.5,1605,'fr','L\'Extraordinaire Voyage de Marona','Marona, an innocent and empathetic little female dog, remembers the life she has shared with different masters, whom she has loved unconditionally.','/4r3EKD3v2q9vx9nGj5ziq8oUtfp.jpg','2020-01-08',92,'Released','Happiness is a small thing.','Marona\'s Fantastic Tale',568381,2.5054,7.4,'DweZRx-h588','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43829,_binary '\0','/pEwzek8hWzdwm5Miud1u1o7DOTh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6787076',7,1887,'nl','Niemand in de Stad','A coming of age story of three young friends during their student years in Amsterdam.','/bSVcYWupySkG1Dw5ylCvN7aclcd.jpg','2018-10-04',102,'Released',NULL,'Open Seas',531737,1.5242,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43830,_binary '\0','/gOgBpD5NivnWIqZYTBFSmAtziuJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6788942',7.6,25808,'th','ฉลาดเกมส์โกง','Lynn, a brilliant student, after helping her friends to get the grades they need, develops the idea of starting a much bigger exam-cheating business.','/g1gW6DQ7QFocDn24QBOZqoYpd3O.jpg','2017-05-03',130,'Released','Genius students with one mission... Turning exam answers into millions.','Bad Genius',455714,4.1931,7.862,'CLdhN4oMxCQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43831,_binary '\0','/eAoIoHHXm4civCrJmrAMG3L1gJr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6789174',4.4,1594,'ml','വെളിപാടിന്റെ പുസ്തകം','Michael Idikkula, a professor in a college, tries to develop a healthy relationship between the students and teachers and raise 