y dictatorship, surviving members of the Tupamaro guerillas are imprisoned and tortured. They must find a way to endure the coming 12 years.','/k1SEABHjk34flsBQigm9ygMuUM4.jpg','2018-09-20',122,'Released','Endless darkness. Limitless courage.','A Twelve-Year Night',514575,3.1499,7.3,'QEGVTj7Mjko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43839,_binary '\0','/weaONWEyKX0OmFwcB2SWsNXeP8Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6793280',5.3,4916,'en','The Devil\'s Doorway','In the autumn of 1960, Father Thomas Riley and Father John Thornton were sent by the Vatican to investigate a miraculous event in an Irish home for \'fallen women\', only to uncover something much more horrific.','/mOFn9lYmI8SAi15nhht37rhwxzT.jpg','2018-07-13',76,'Released','\"Sin is crouching at the door\" - Genesis 4:7','The Devil\'s Doorway',524789,2.3261,5.6,'p2QoTwVkTZY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43840,_binary '\0','/syrW1fn2Zk7lfJkhvhZwskFIV41.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6793470',6,1917,'ar','هروب إضطراري','Follows the escape journey of 4 complete strangers who were accused of a murder they did not commit.','/cMkv60619K8vA3Fmjw5H01kmPLB.jpg','2017-06-25',120,'Released',NULL,'Forced Escape',462003,0.9064,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43841,_binary '\0','/8s231Ufkl9jF2JVnoZtQUxPXsSl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6793580',7.2,13175,'es','Campeones','A disgraced basketball coach is given the chance to coach Los Amigos, a team of players who are intellectually disabled, and soon realizes they just might have what it takes to make it to the national championships.','/m5z4Ud6Ya5EY3Eg3OBbVBaDKWK.jpg','2018-04-06',124,'Released','When winning isn\'t everything','Champions',456929,3.2063,7.517,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43842,_binary '\0','/nUJJmfsksZQ3ETWfhVbQRwa9cph.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6794380',6.2,1749,'en','A Gray State','In 2010 David Crowley, an Iraq veteran, aspiring filmmaker and charismatic up-and-coming voice in fringe politics, began production on his film Gray State. Set in a dystopian near-future where civil liberties are trampled by an unrestrained federal government, the film’s crowd funded trailer was enthusiastically received by the burgeoning online community of libertarians, Tea Party activists and members of the nascent alt-right. In January of 2015, Crowley was found dead with his family in their suburban Minnesota home. Their shocking deaths quickly become a cause célèbre for conspiracy theorists who speculate that Crowley was assassinated by a shadowy government concerned about a film and filmmaker that was getting too close to the truth about their aims.','/lN3oLLYfOlNkxmbMK6enKsdupSn.jpg','2017-08-07',93,'Released',NULL,'A Gray State',455963,1.4332,6.5,'kNv9ipjU5Pw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43843,_binary '\0','/lj79NEheTtAqHXjNvWaIPjd7ERe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6794424',8.2,7431,'en','LA 92','Twenty-five years after the verdict in the Rodney King trial sparked several days of protests, violence and looting in Los Angeles, LA 92 immerses viewers in that tumultuous period through stunning and rarely seen archival footage.','/oT7OmkAoVnYDa8XbGipCEj6PVmN.jpg','2017-04-28',114,'Released','The past is prologue','LA 92',450875,1.9155,7.8,'DcFuY_lPwh8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43844,_binary '\0','/gkkBhctHPGg8hrmtWbO3ySZoj4z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6802308',5.3,38259,'en','The 15:17 to Paris','On Aug. 21, 2015, the world watches in stunned silence as the media reports a thwarted terrorist attack on a train that\'s bound for Paris -- an attempt prevented by three young Americans traveling together through Europe. The heroic and courageous actions of Anthony Sadler, Alek Skarlatos and Spencer Stone help to save the lives of more than 500 passengers on board.','/3NtkRNmvMrQIOtyWTaOKVNJyP1W.jpg','2018-02-07',94,'Released','In the face of fear ordinary people can do the ext