f ruthless drifters takes him and his family on a nightmare road-trip.','/ubDpUo7z5Kz8HMz2qv2bS66Y9uo.jpg','2021-08-12',93,'Released','All that evil requires is for good men to do nothing.','Coming Home in the Dark',711963,3.1442,5.739,'kvj24PTQa7Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43943,_binary '\0','/8ypE0JJGSsMLTTMGrrMBEJe1WCR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6874964',7.8,4392,'en','Jesus Christ Superstar Live in Concert','The award-winning show is re-imagined as a live concert event, featuring an all-star cast of recording artists, set during the last week of Jesus\' life as he deals with betrayal, love and jealousy, and told from the perspective of Judas.','/yMiksvlWCdUFpX9ZVrU2SyJF7ZC.jpg','2018-04-01',100,'Released','A live musical recounting the final days of Jesus Christ and those around him.','Jesus Christ Superstar Live in Concert',495029,2.3959,7,'NKQPh8HpYFo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43944,_binary '\0','/npEUveGYH2H7VTlM8k6xH6Jcvqr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6875374',5.8,2161,'en','Adventures of a Mathematician','The warmhearted story of Polish immigrant and mathematician Stan Ulam, who moved to the U.S. in the 1930s. Stan deals with the difficult losses of family and friends all while helping to create the hydrogen bomb and the first computer.','/j2QwbzBQNEw0Wx8ijiCqDZv3TVP.jpg','2021-06-11',102,'Released','When science lost its innocence.','Adventures of a Mathematician',684281,2.6262,6.1,'SZ2YupFolFA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43945,_binary '\0','/7AUhg7SWNFRLnYh7Jv1lEQg0CxV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6875952',5.7,1579,'en','Carmen','A young and fiercely independent woman, Carmen, is forced to flee her home in the Mexican desert following the brutal murder of her mother. She survives an illegal border crossing into the US, only to be confronted by a lawless volunteer border guard. When the border guard and his patrol partner Aidan become embroiled in a deadly standoff, the pair is forced to escape together.','/oc07MMSumgytiBT1fVTuEMDjUQA.jpg','2023-04-21',117,'Released','A one-of-a-kind cinematic vision.','Carmen',763261,2.0784,6.2,'7bbaqQhXrCQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43946,_binary '\0','/yWz3UE8oHy1tUBjbCXvGiLB2BmC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6876854',5,1907,'en','Edge of Extinction','15 years after a global apocalypse, mankind is on the verge of extinction. Civilisation no longer exists, food is scarce and most eke out a living by stealing and killing. One boy clings onto life in the desolate British countryside, where staying away from others has been key to his survival. But this self-imposed isolation comes to an abrupt end when he crosses paths with another group of survivors and faces an enemy far more savage than any of them could imagine.','/nPQwTtppe0nzbFLSAMaqMnL8e4c.jpg','2022-01-18',136,'Released','Every day is a fight for survival','Edge of Extinction',701369,1.3742,6.5,'ZB7WlhR4eXI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43947,_binary '\0','/eJ2hWXIjNjlgxtQm04Pg3fkVgGu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6877164',5.3,1783,'hu','Valami Amerika 3','Brothers Tamás, Ákos and András find themselves in deeper trouble than ever after swindler Alex drains them into a chase for a priceless stolen stamp. With both the police and rival mafia crews, Baláék and Toniék, on their tail, they’re joined by Eszter and Timi as everyone races against the clock. Their fortunes, and perhaps their lives, depend on whether they can outwit both friends and enemies, and escape unscathed.','/ishosvARTiOaI3rH9Etdi4TWI8D.jpg','2018-02-15',103,'Released',NULL,'A Kind of America 3',499091,0.7603,6,'whxCGPV6-XU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43948,_binary '\0','/dbXjTu5J00kCggPnQlDpVZmDBil.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6878038',7.9,39210,'ko','택시운전사','May, 1980. Man-seob is a taxi driver in Seoul who lives from hand to mouth, raising his young daughter alone. One day, he hears that there is a foreigner who will pay big money for a drive down to Gwangju city. Not knowing that he’s a German journalist with a hidden agenda, Man-seob takes the job.','/iXVaWbxmyPk4KZGZk5GGDGFieMX.jpg','2017-08-02',138,'Released','Based on true events, an untold story of a taxi driver.','A Taxi Driver',437068,6.758,8,'bB7z4Xn5oNA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43949,_binary '\0','/oyBZyY5GdzZdofVVsDda49QmvFP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6878306',6.8,102145,'en','News of the World','A Texan traveling across the wild West bringing the news of the world to local townspeople, agrees to help rescue a young girl who was kidnapped.','/fYQCgVRsQTEfUrP7cW5iAFVYOlh.jpg','2020-12-25',118,'Released','Find where you belong.','News of the World',581032,9.0473,6.9,'zTZDb_iKooI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43950,_binary '\0','/hp4PssT8aYm7EMSvZ07bklF657w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6878378',6.1,17921,'ta','விவேகம்','A group of counter-terrorism agents are brought in to track down a man who was once the head of their squad, and is believed to have gone rogue.','/o31Fh66VeAmLWQ3HNObzTjbrWMH.jpg','2017-08-24',149,'Released','BElieve in YOUrself','Vivegam',438731,1.4429,4.9,'yJdHR8nCYWk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43951,_binary '\0','/ArccbTKFk8fMp5JnHuxoW8xU0iJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6878820',6,11149,'en','Z-O-M-B-I-E-S','Two star-crossed freshmen – a zombie, Zed and a cheerleader, Addison – each outsiders in their unique ways, befriend each other and work together to show their high school and the Seabrook community what they can achieve when they embrace their differences.','/6S9O5U7Ietqh6zTtZhGbhbA3Pze.jpg','2018-02-16',94,'Released','At Seabrook High, it\'s Zoms vs. Poms.','Z-O-M-B-I-E-S',483980,7.3193,7.2,'VSC7AjafRPA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43952,_binary '\0','/zYWgVYAI7elv6lpnXCyUtIkSOpM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6878882',6.6,8739,'zh','红海行动','A squad of the Jiaolong Commando Unit - Sea Dragon, a spec ops team of the Chinese Navy, carries out a hostage rescue operation in the nation of Yewaire, on the Arabian Peninsula, and fiercely fights against local rebel groups and Zaka, a terrorist organization.','/6ctXBO0o5fKQvGdSJsPc8TAYCvp.jpg','2018-02-16',138,'Released',NULL,'Operation Red Sea',460555,5.4973,7.366,'7anA-z_2MsY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43953,_binary '\0','/hld8bMSwbjLGTLTgMKai6OfSSwJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6879446',5.4,22498,'en','Hidden Strike','Two elite soldiers must escort civilians through a gauntlet of gunfire and explosions.','/zsbolOkw8RhTU4DKOrpf4M7KCmi.jpg','2023-07-06',103,'Released','There is a plan. They just don\'t know what it is.','Hidden Strike',457332,9.5371,6.881,'l_jEicE6KyQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43954,_binary '\0','/jO9gxKzxeAIe5h8W6r4KjwWrXeN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6881490',7.1,2654,'en','Sound of Hope: The Story of Possum Trot','Led by Donna and Reverend W.C. Martin, 22 families from a rural Black church in the small East Texas town of Possum Trot adopt 77 of the most difficult-to-place kids in the foster system and kickstart a movement in the process.','/47kytyhKjdY2fwuYR15bBNUUFLb.jpg','2024-07-04',130,'Released','The fight for kids begins.','Sound of Hope: The Story of Possum Trot',1242526,3.481,7.2,'-nyh9tcGFcI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43955,_binary '\0','/lOluf3TgHgB9Uuw95dJGfCjwuNP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6881890',4.8,1697,'en','A Christmas Story Live!','A live broadcast of the Broadway hit \"A Christmas Story: The Musical\" in which Ralphie wishes for nothing more than a Red Rider BB Gun for Christmas.','/du010f2eoKOXqZ8Uo1h5zlke6Sf.jpg','2017-12-17',131,'Released','The most beloved Christmas movie becomes the biggest live holiday musical event.','A Christmas Story Live!',485517,1.8767,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43956,_binary '\0','/sgChfxPlXKekJwjkG8b6eKsgBq1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6881910',6.3,2163,'en','Rent','The story of several friends in New York City facing financial poverty, homophobia, AIDS, and, of course, rent.','/9fxpcJ5a1MwLmdfMrIAqtVCRpud.jpg','2019-01-27',135,'Released',NULL,'Rent',557648,2.3196,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43957,_binary '\0','/u9YEh2xVAPVTKoaMNlB5tH6pXkm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6882604',6.4,30344,'en','Archive','2038: George Almore is working on a true human-equivalent AI, and his latest prototype is almost ready. This sensitive phase is also the riskiest as he has a goal that must be hidden at all costs—being reunited with his dead wife.','/hmz9ySdCqW9FiHpM9JdSCkjQzFA.jpg','2020-08-13',109,'Released','Death is not the end','Archive',606234,8.9463,6.4,'m0J0BwIzURI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43958,_binary '\0','/71jMxuBVda5BnTCJtIEnRk3gTaV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6882872',7.8,2236,'pa','Lahoriye','Lahoriye is the story of love. The love which does not see boundaries, the love which does not see nations. Kikar Singh (Amrinder Gill) is a clerk at DTO office and his family holds a piece of land which is right at the LOC. The people living in Border areas are familiar with the situation. Right across the land in Pakistan is a Kinnow farm where Ameeran (Sargun Mehta) works and live with her family. Kikar falls for Ameeran and slowly slowly even Ameeran falls for Kikar. What follows next is a tale of romance which is worth watching on the big screen.','/nWRhVSejbIV708nOBwgRAVi50wA.jpg','2017-05-12',140,'Released',NULL,'Lahoriye',457497,0.7892,5.3,'0owS3euUNtk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43959,_binary '\0','/xW4zzuSXKfchPTWDAI4N5ptHmYz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6883152',4.6,2786,'en','The Devil and Father Amorth','William Friedkin attends an exorcism with Father Gabriele Amorth, as he treats an Italian woman named Cristina for the ninth time. Prior to filming, Cristina had purportedly been experiencing behavioural changes and “fits” that could not be explained by psychiatry, and which became worse during Christian holidays.','/de5VAk2YiONqmoXzyOO80QyM0Xa.jpg','2018-04-20',68,'Released','In 1973, he brought us the film classic. 45 years later, director William Friedkin brings us the real thing.','The Devil and Father Amorth',457775,1.8822,5.1,'jpjRQokeQNo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43960,_binary '\0','/lJEjRnwWagVVJBVGOvHWj21Ff5D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6884200',5.6,4157,'en','A Kid Like Jake','On the eve of the admissions cycle for New York City kindergartens, Alex and Greg Wheeler have high hopes for four-year-old Jake. The director of Jake\'s preschool encourages them to accentuate Jake\'s gender expansive behavior to help him stand out. As Alex and Greg navigate their roles as parents, a rift grows between them, one that forces them to confront their own concerns about what\'s best for Jake, and each other.','/xb0lsEUyytspi7fo1ggDybRvZVK.jpg','2018-06-01',92,'Released',NULL,'A Kid Like Jake',467917,3.1363,6,'VTMGI2s5VNs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43961,_binary '\0','/9bHWqLeKf2W5dyjWSNig5GudZxZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6886080',6.2,2274,'en','To the Stars','Under small-town scrutiny, a withdrawn farmer’s daughter forges an intimate friendship with a worldly but reckless new girl in 1960s Oklahoma.','/8dShiH3owumOPVvNPRPQWmMsZA0.jpg','2019-01-25',109,'Released','It takes courage to find yourself','To the Stars',513111,2.934,5.9,'fpp_MnGqTR8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43962,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6887248',5.8,3575,'en','Bros.','Tanner and Matt are two Midwest men in their late twenties savoring the scotch and entertainment of their beloved hometown of Waterloo, Iowa. Tanner has to decide to accept a job offer in Chicago, or remain in his hometown. Matt has to pull himself out of the slump of female rejection that has never fallen on this hyper heterosexual man.','/inlTDtIWcWFVlo2bv6uNTVN0klJ.jpg',NULL,82,'Released',NULL,'Bros.',1452754,0.8296,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43963,_binary '\0','/mR0FxUh6ghmR3gZTyq3gFtQtXmy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6888938',4.4,1688,'en','White Chamber','The United Kingdom. Soon. Civil war rages. A woman wakes up in a blindingly white cuboid cell. Using its sophisticated functionality, her captor tortures her for information; information she claims not to have - or does she?','/yZjmCwmfHMjCE2ojON2dgeTkvDP.jpg','2018-04-05',89,'Released','Post-Brexit. Post-Trump. Post-Mortem.','White Chamber',514547,1.3272,4.5,'NmLcb1FvBBM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43964,_binary '\0','/5OsBNjBJyzIKiI78yNaQZEOjphr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6889032',6.7,5425,'sv','Tårtgeneralen','Set in 1984, Hans Pettersson (Hasse P.) decides to create the largest sandwich cake ever made in order to put his home town, Köping, on the map.','/4gByqiKKoJ7rI9GI4ndZVJOQtt7.jpg','2018-03-07',101,'Released','Anyone can be a hero','The Cake General',471706,1.0013,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43965,_binary '\0','/c40ImKnzDUGugt1kCco4Bt2XAU8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6889042',6.9,2466,'en','Count Me In','An exhilarating celebration of the art of rock drumming, featuring some of the best drummers ever to have graced the drumkit. The viewer is taken on a uplifting journey through some of the most iconic music ever created, focusing on the women and men with the sticks, their passions, culture and awe-inspiring energy.','/zIlGGBGKdgG8qb9IJylHCEzM6fu.jpg','2021-08-24',81,'Released','You can have rhythm without music but you can\'t have music without rhythm.','Count Me In',783820,1.8061,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43966,_binary '\0','/bqZrVGzygjnggv5AeZkSxPKGsCs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6890376',6.8,3459,'ko','하루','Three years ago, a father saved his daughter\'s life. After she\'s involved in a car accident, it looks like he\'ll have to do it again, no matter how many attempts it takes.','/1Tgtamqk3Kp9iwflrDWRRTjGjXB.jpg','2017-06-15',90,'Released','Two men trapped in the dreadful title loop, and their endlessly efforts to save their beloved ones.','A Day',459073,2.6925,7.7,'YWQbotXdEa8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43967,_binary '\0','/53rHETjQOfCSajPki5HGfd3FQtG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6890582',6,6951,'ko','염력','An ordinary guy suddenly finds he has superpowers he can use to help his spirited daughter and the people around them, but he also runs into trouble in the process.','/tyTAYYWHyfDcAXYmNa0ifm1JrD.jpg','2018-01-31',101,'Released',NULL,'Psychokinesis',452015,2.92,6.3,'1EkIWVjBBc0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43968,_binary '\0','/mUoRmzM8HOQVPUpHgSG3cO92rJH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6892206',5.7,3303,'it','Napoli velata','In a Naples suspended between magic and superstition, madness and rationality, a mystery envelops the existence of Adriana, overwhelmed by a sudden love and a violent crime.','/8fAHWAowDiG9jxTrPmLGZvadtmR.jpg','2017-12-28',113,'Released',NULL,'Naples in Veils',485894,2.1836,6.2,'NLykCGAuWog','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43969,_binary '\0','/ioEpDm0sIYG2MRUKajY4RSYKOWP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6892340',6.2,2126,'it','Sono tornato','Benito Mussolini resurfaces in Rome 72 years after his death, as if not a single day had passed. Finding a country still full of problems, both old and new, his firebrand rhetoric wins him once again the hearts and minds of millions of Italians — who see him as a wacky reenactor who speaks inconvenient truths to power.','/2R4rcoQaQSRpN5vtFnc9z8FsPkJ.jpg','2018-02-01',92,'Released',NULL,'I\'m Back',495766,1.4271,5.9,'WmR_RhbrEZE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43970,_binary '\0','/tB9L7FmEeWiWWjCUjKW1Zu7IfQD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6892400',6.8,14886,'it','La ragazza nella nebbia','A gripping and chilling thriller that brings us to a hazy mountain village where an enigmatic detective is investigating the sudden disappearance of fifteen-year-old girl.','/fuJApAPgHrur08y6icGB5k5Umzo.jpg','2017-10-26',128,'Released',NULL,'The Girl in the Fog',468202,4.8272,6.8,'WyQw7Y6t36E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43971,_binary '\0','/53zIvdaAX29FRPxUG5LNprasJ9O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6892446',6.8,2138,'it','La terra dell\'abbastanza','Mirko and Manolo are best friends and live in the suburbs of Rome. They both live in poor conditions with their single parents, are still in school and struggle with occasional odd jobs to make ends meet. Together they share dreams of women, of sex and money, of a better life to come. Then, after killing a man in a hit-and-run one night, they get involved with the local mafia and their lives change dramatically.','/rZpkx4mEqglDaOEQvJMJ6hBKIUF.jpg','2018-06-07',95,'Released',NULL,'Boys Cry',500849,1.6383,6.948,'wpUG_W2M5ZE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43972,_binary '\0','/mr5rhvpOnursGgUjBQ3MiRHOUvp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6892462',6.3,5278,'fr','Le Monde est à toi','To escape his life of crime, a Paris drug dealer takes on one last job involving Spain, unhinged gangsters, his longtime crush and his scheming mother.','/b8l0pdMuVgqIYXBvNUr4TXdpmFj.jpg','2018-08-15',94,'Released',NULL,'The World Is Yours',504603,4.2165,6.714,'WRFwJS7pu80','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43973,_binary '\0','/v7JZK5EY1595RgZYS4xnPLNJ6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6893836',7.4,5706,'en','They\'ll Love Me When I\'m Dead','As his life comes to its end, famous Hollywood director Orson Welles puts it all on the line at the chance for renewed success with the film The Other Side of the Wind.','/h7YHg3BOEjlZSCJ41FBHyeQkoUG.jpg','2018-08-31',98,'Released','