f Dreams','A Mexican teenager whose dreams of becoming a soccer star are disrupted when his mother dies. He\'s smuggled across the border with the promise of a better life but is instead sold to a sweatshop in downtown LA.','/luLEW0CdazydTonGCOzygzWk5LK.jpg','2024-08-29',114,'Released',NULL,'City of Dreams',901059,2.149,6.6,'KdiAg4DtHTQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43979,_binary '\0','/r2FXILO1vUKXGS9xnPva4kkjdHo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6900448',7,20087,'ja','未来のミライ','Four-year-old Kun struggles with jealousy after his newborn sister, Mirai, begins receiving most of his family’s attention. Retreating to the garden, he encounters Mirai as a teenager from the future and embarks on extraordinary journeys across his family’s past, gradually discovering new perspectives on love, belonging and what it means to become an older brother.','/b9XvI4Nehzi0nXyNVD6DtT39P6l.jpg','2018-07-20',98,'Released','I have met the future.','Mirai',475215,5.5423,7.157,'6d-lsJZgmJs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43980,_binary '\0','/p85Pusyrh8GjrVFCB522a79aAUc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6901252',6.1,1796,'fr','Tueurs','Frank Valken, high-flying robber, has just made a final masterful break. At least that’s what he believes… Ideal suspects, Valken and his gang find themselves involved in a criminal case of thirty years. It seems that the crazy killers are back.','/2hayP9WM9F00lbBykZ0wSBzfrUU.jpg','2017-12-06',86,'Released',NULL,'Above the Law',468212,2.4829,5.862,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(43981,_binary '\0','/5Zv5KmgZzdIvXz2KC3n0MyecSNL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6902332',5.7,49710,'en','The Marksman','Jim Hanson’s quiet life is suddenly disturbed by two people crossing the US/Mexico border – a woman and her young son – desperate to flee a Mexican cartel. After a shootout leaves the mother dead, Jim becomes the boy’s reluctant defender. He embraces his role as Miguel’s protector and will stop at no