00000'),(44003,_binary '\0','/vNeEaRg6WWDSOGOwXuaZ2UziMWY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6914122',6.6,10263,'en','Resistance','The story of mime Marcel Marceau as he works with a group of Jewish boy scouts and the French Resistance to save the lives of ten thousand orphans during World War II.','/As22MQ8G3ILsdzsSIv1u9qEz6hE.jpg','2020-03-27',120,'Released','The best way to resist is to survive.','Resistance',491926,5.6852,7,'B48hwisZvEI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44004,_binary '\0','/kIORtumDUNUzdR84TD6jicOi6YG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6914542',6.2,4229,'ko','마약왕','Busan, South Korea, 1970s. Lee Doo-sam is a small-time smuggler. After helping a drug gang to smuggle meth, he falls into the dark crime world. Quick-witted and full of ambition, he eventually takes over the drug underworld and starts to lead a double life: a good community leader during the day but an infamous drug lord during the night.','/d3n0mUGIqISBjke1hrGVkF7P6CZ.jpg','2018-12-19',139,'Released','He who was a criminal and a patriot.','The Drug King',497370,3.2021,6.256,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44005,_binary '\0','/o76CvxEtH80FXbGc4E8o05uoQ1W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6914742',6.6,1684,'en','The Art of Us','Harper Higgins is determined to land a tenured position at Boston Art College, and she’s counting on curating a big art gallery at the university to do so. But when she loses her showcase artist and can find no one else, she turns to her recently-hired dog walker who, unbeknownst to anyone, is a skilled painter.','/fVHIM0NfqRRITcTK9RXKjFxzjU.jpg','2017-05-20',86,'Released',NULL,'The Art of Us',456213,2.4853,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44006,_binary '\0','/lUVRn6CC3voutG905c8qTIAa7QL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6915100',6.7,2771,'en','Pope Francis: A Man of His Word','Pope Francis responds to questions from around the world, discussing topics including ecology, immigration, consumerism and social justice.','/4pGMnjyebbDY33AkWqaJbvC5eEo.jpg','2018-05-18',96,'Released','Hope is a universal message.','Pope Francis: A Man of His Word',505205,2.5915,7.2,'MOmY8i-uBcY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44007,_binary '\0','/m5DxRZhJO7aluDyHW40M8cEBZAv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6915208',7.4,1810,'ja','映画 中二病でも恋がしたい! -Take On Me-','Yuuta and Rikka are in their third year of high school. One day in Spring, Touka declares that she will take Rikka to Italy with her, as her job has stabilized there and thinks they should migrate together as a family. Touka is also worried about Rikka not being competent enough to advance to universities in Japan. The gangs from the club suggested Yuuta, who doesn\'t want to be separated, to elope with Rikka!! A runaway drama throughout Japan begins.','/kGceYWj3oKCfEiMdaYbwovgvOnY.jpg','2018-01-06',94,'Released',NULL,'Love, Chunibyo & Other Delusions! Take On Me',460399,3.6104,7.8,'Nmwo4TOuyPQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44008,_binary '\0','/cWmknHr6VVNInXw6BmauPaldMnP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6915596',7.6,3807,'ml','മായാനദി','A shady money deal goes wrong and in the aftermath Mathan ends up killing a police officer. Meanwhile in Kochi, his old flame Aparna an aspiring actress is struggling to prop up her career. Mathan meets up with Aparna and tries to rekindle the past, even as the police hunt for him gets intense.','/mNxAgWdHPWOAUVcI4kEuXvpo97j.jpg','2017-12-22',135,'Released',NULL,'Mayaanadhi',458741,1.5866,7.563,'RYYxyNxr_4E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44009,_binary '\0','/f7oKFJRJmenbvBKcyB2Crt264np.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6915770',4.3,19965,'hi','एक प्रकार की मछली जिस को पाँच - सात बाहु के सदृश अंग होते है','A skilled commercial diver in Malta, Tara Salgaonkar is a mystery to everyone around her. A strong girl who defies social conventions, she is trying to come to terms with her dark past.','/u40Z9wxSeQR5e7QVHkLVJ2TOBPS.jpg','2023-11-24',119,'Released',NULL,'Starfish',1099967,0.9104,3.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44010,_binary '\0','/9lOtDZY6oy6qUlYH78fJ27RMkLP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6916362',7.4,22609,'da','Journal 64','Copenhagen, 2018. A frightening discovery is made in an old apartment. The subsequent investigation of Department Q leads them to an infamous institution for girls that was suddenly closed in the early sixties.','/uTdaeGpznkLfyhAzLlrdssD621R.jpg','2018-10-04',118,'Released',NULL,'The Purity of Vengeance',479226,6.2606,7.1,'jfVTL2FxsDY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44011,_binary '\0','/rcG48uDirrCy2chTc6UcgE40z3X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6916502',2.7,2310,'hr','General','During the Croatian War of Independance, former French Foreign Legion operrative Ante Gotovina offers his expertise to the newly founded Army of the Republic of Croatia, quickly gaining the favour of the country\'s higher ups and becoming one of the conflict\'s most recognizable faces, loved by his troops and feared by his enemies.','/pkizLaWafmdhwAP1aSFZ6wnKnIe.jpg','2019-08-05',145,'Released',NULL,'The General',1074175,1.3323,1.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44012,_binary '\0','/fDChFJ7jkVlsVbhT9CuRCL7vnWO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6917210',5.7,1395,'en','Buffalo Boys','Betrayed by the Dutch colonial forces, Arana manages to escape along with his nephews Jamar and Suwo, the newborn sons of Hamza, one of the last Indonesian sultans fighting against foreign tyranny. In 1860, after wandering for years on the plains of the American Wild West, Arana and the two brothers return to Indonesia to avenge their dead loved ones and punish the evil man who caused their misfortune.','/o1Bn2zlIDJSnM5aOljbOPTM6Kf9.jpg','2018-07-19',103,'Released',NULL,'Buffalo Boys',493488,1.3408,6.5,'9eqAgAFNMpg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44013,_binary '\0','/qa30od5JMSCxYe21Wza82kPrf2V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6917242',5.8,1401,'it','Made in Italy','Riko is an honest and hardworking man who can count on a group of real friends and a loving wife. Things change after he loses his job and experiences a midlife crisis.','/zHg1w0EUDKLUhM7abNaTgddkCE1.jpg','2018-01-25',100,'Released',NULL,'Made in Italy',500268,1.3497,6.1,'PvJGJPoNCoI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44014,_binary '\0','/9h93OngWRuPRsW0jP93rhGNjI6E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6917290',5.8,1394,'it','Puoi baciare lo sposo','A father, who calls himself \"open\" and tolerant and fights against any form of discrimination, reveals himself as not so liberal when his son announces the engagement to his partner. Overwhelmed by the news, he regresses into the most fierce opponent of same-sex marriage, and tries to undermine his son\'s happiness with a series of embarrassing situations.','/vjiX79FqxONv0qVixtyfusIbKYp.jpg','2018-03-01',90,'Released',NULL,'My Big Gay Italian Wedding',486103,2.2171,5.734,'RDDRM3kbXz4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44015,_binary '\0','/szFXrSlTRVU5LbAAdB0ayGVyZXx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6917314',5.8,1538,'it','Io sono Tempesta','To avoid jail, a tax-dodging businessman is sentenced to a year of community service in a homeless shelter.','/qlYY3pk7JJ3iDkXzyCU4OvgFhCV.jpg','2018-04-12',97,'Released',NULL,'Io sono Tempesta',514266,1.5414,5.813,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44016,_binary '\0','/yOguxIfv8a7M50Psbjc5HcYSMYk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6918220',6.5,3383,'fr','Les Crevettes pailletées','Matthias Le Goff, an Olympic champion at the end of his career, makes a homophobic statement on TV. His punishment: coach the Shiny Shrimps, a flamboyant and amateur gay water-polo team. They have only one thing in mind: to qualify for the Gay Games in Croatia where the hottest international LGBT athletes compete. It\'s the start of a bumpy and joyful ride - Faster, Higher, Stronger.','/oExGmLjMuy4jkOPum1DmU0HFqZX.jpg','2019-05-08',103,'Released',NULL,'The Shiny Shrimps',532938,2.1445,6.6,'FiybSd4J0Gs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44017,_binary '\0','/wYtEvBmpBRXPdwGgr1gcWiwJSI7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6920084',5.2,73432,'en','Resident Evil: Welcome to Raccoon City','Once the booming home of pharmaceutical giant Umbrella Corporation, Raccoon City is now a dying Midwestern town. The company’s exodus left the city a wasteland…with great evil brewing below the surface. When that evil is unleashed, the townspeople are forever…changed…and a small group of survivors must work together to uncover the truth behind Umbrella and make it through the night.','/bArhvjRHl535XMaSh9VjInF2mSZ.jpg','2021-11-24',107,'Released','Witness the beginning of evil.','Resident Evil: Welcome to Raccoon City',460458,125.8444,5.931,'4q6UGCyHZCI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44018,_binary '\0','/kIu6aYaUxBUUfJ0l0sLNW1qh45u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6920356',6.4,15787,'en','The Souvenir','A shy but ambitious film student falls into an intense, emotionally fraught relationship with a charismatic but untrustworthy older man.','/2Nj04HsZ0lNkv07JnfBZ0bAIECn.jpg','2019-05-17',120,'Released','The past never stays in focus.','The Souvenir',473019,4.0509,6,'t9Al2nC0vzY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44019,_binary '\0','/1ng4YX9cv6JiIByQuCYZxn3imWL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6921496',6.4,2180,'en','A Bluebird in My Heart','An ex-con\'s attempts to live a quiet life are derailed when the daughter of the woman sheltering him is the victim of a vicious attack.','/M5P2XCmEkXVPZ58J4g4Yh0aSlW.jpg','2018-03-10',86,'Released','A Film By Jérémie Guez','A Bluebird in My Heart',478308,2.1478,5.887,'rOgDe-m-RwI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44020,_binary '\0','/qw6nuv56NW1JqzMoONlM84Iciwz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6921996',6.2,91894,'en','Johnny English Strikes Again','Disaster strikes when a criminal mastermind reveals the identities of all active undercover agents in Britain. The secret service can now rely on only one man - Johnny English. Currently teaching at a minor prep school, Johnny springs back into action to find the mysterious hacker. For this mission to succeed, he’ll need all of his skills - what few he has - as the man with yesterday’s analogue methods faces off against tomorrow’s digital technology.','/tCBxnZwLiY1BOKw3tH6AxHZdqPh.jpg','2018-08-30',88,'Released','His licence renewed. His intelligence restricted.','Johnny English Strikes Again',463272,10.8464,6.286,'-Qv6p6pTz5I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44021,_binary '\0','/pXer5O4a7Ruomc5h1FiOA7h7IfA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6922972',6.6,2503,'ar','بنك الحظ','Fueled by anger after getting fired from his bank job, a lazy banker (Mohamed Saleh) joins forces with his co-worker (Amr) and their weird friend (Ze\'ro) by turning to robbery in order to fulfill their dreams. But, when they turn their master scheme to rob the bank into action, things take an unexpected turn. Little did they know that a plan is only as clever as the brains behind it.','/prR2GMScKZaMJkQ2J4yv2YEorDY.jpg','2017-04-05',122,'Released',NULL,'Monopoly (The Bank of Luck)',463752,1.3697,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44022,_binary '\0','/4UVxhr7ajHl7ZKdSmNIZiZ73Qfh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6923462',7.3,5089,'hi','मंटो','In Bombay\'s seedy-shiny film world, Manto and his stories are widely read and accepted. But as sectarian violence engulfs the nation, Manto makes the difficult choice of leaving his beloved Bombay. In Lahore, he finds himself bereft of friends and unable to find takers for his writings.','/63Ar6C4ZyHALlxrc2nDR9fR2kmn.jpg','2018-05-24',112,'Released',NULL,'Manto',517975,1.5561,7.352,'0dolUz5OH24','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44023,_binary '\0','/vnGvJZG5WGrsbGfrR7TVi0VY31k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6923840',5.9,1305,'fr','Normandie Nue','At the Mêle sur Sarthe, a small Norman village, farmers are affected by a crisis. Georges Balbuzard, the mayor of the city, is not one to let them down and decides to try everything to save his village...','/18PbqXl0PKTTptyuKd7PQciXdry.jpg','2018-01-10',105,'Released','It takes a village.','Normandy Nude',492550,2.0764,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44024,_binary '\0','/5xegGPhCSVMKbyh6zeT6Th0BWLB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6924650',6.7,106886,'en','Midway','The story of the Battle of Midway, and the leaders and soldiers who used their instincts, fortitude and bravery to overcome massive odds.','/hj8pyoNnynGeJTAbl7jcLZO8Uhx.jpg','2019-11-06',138,'Released','One battle turned the tide of war.','Midway',522162,13.9225,7.1,'Z_7eN5iloyk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44025,_binary '\0','/4v64DRdMtx8fQGUZ7hE1R2iChCr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6925902',5.5,4978,'es','Donde caben dos','Multiple stories about the oscillating world of couple relationships and how difficult it can be to separate sex from love.','/uShw8wJ7K4ySrPtUWjGe8wwJ5fj.jpg','2021-07-30',112,'Released','A comedy with a happy ending.','More the Merrier',763152,4.2236,6.625,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44026,_binary '\0','/q2GVqKhThjaoLvt9pzq57s4H4LO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6926486',6.4,2283,'hi','Daddy','This is the gritty and sensational true story of Arun Gulab Gawli, a mill worker’s son who grew up in Mumbai’s impoverished Dagdi Chawl, to become an infamous don, politician and chief rival of the most powerful crime boss of the day, Dawood Ibrahim. Daddy realistically charts Mumbai’s true crime history from the 1970s and 1980s until 2012, when Gawli was finally sentenced to life imprisonment.','/hnpO5xuVOFhEgZ30B6xomYt4tiF.jpg','2017-09-08',134,'Released','The Only One Who Did Not Run','Daddy',461816,1.1451,5.8,'1zqp_ufmX3o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44027,_binary '\0','/ylXU65OCcyXU3tZ00CCeTfwGFja.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6927152',6.4,5599,'ko','창궐','Ancient Korea, 17th century. While the paranoid King Lee Jo of Joseon, vassal of the Qing dynasty, feels surrounded by conspirators and rebels, a dark evil emerges from the bowels of a merchant ship and the exiled Prince Lee Cheung returns to the royal court, ignoring that he will have to lead the few capable of defeating the ambitious humans and the bloody monsters who threaten to destroy the kingdom.','/88F0FLFknAIdnPfXxWuSqnICD4W.jpg','2018-10-25',122,'Released','A darkness looms over the kingdom.','Rampant',537190,3.4124,6.789,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44028,_binary '\0','/1tvMYPIB2tM3fAb5cdLb0SQj995.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6928060',6.2,2699,'en','My Favorite Wedding','Potential Northwestern fellow Tess Harper lasers through her best friend\'s wedding planning like the star doctor she hopes to soon become. In fact, Tess puzzles through any problem - provided it\'s not her own. When she meets divorce lawyer and groom\'s best friend, Michael, Tess maneuvers around him like a gurney in the emergency room until she discovers this best man has a few moves of his own.','/tnrjUwRVzKriT3dKHRVQutfzYH3.jpg','2017-06-24',90,'Released',NULL,'My Favorite Wedding',463252,3.0124,6.886,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44029,_binary '\0','/3fwoJ2KvqWHpdVW6HC6x0DpDEpJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6929642',6.5,11698,'ta','காலா','Karikaalan consistently fights to keep the people of Dharavi, a slum in Mumbai, safe from the clutches of mighty politicians and the land mafia don, Hari Dhadha.','/xVAZZN4Av3e6YxwLgUWTYDNtta1.jpg','2018-06-07',166,'Released',NULL,'Kaala',459008,1.9802,6.4,'mMCEvr3VWqQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44030,_binary '\0','/oGe84ddxe2R90hFwvCDxOINE8qL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6931414',7,6967,'ko','안시성','Kingdom of Goguryeo, ancient Korea, 645. The ruthless Emperor Taizong of Tang invades the country and leads his armies towards the capital, achieving one victory after another, but on his way is the stronghold of Ansi, protected by General Yang Man-chu, who will do everything possible to stop the invasion, even if his troops are outnumbered by thousands of enemies.','/gv5ByLHZfn7MUKpjJovRTr5URGg.jpg','2018-09-19',135,'Released','Fight to the death.','The Great Battle',535389,4.3517,6.743,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44031,_binary '\0','/8voS6nJU5DdKSfFsKIMTTlDssM9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6931658',6.7,7291,'ko','헌트','After a high-ranking North Korean official requests asylum, KCIA Foreign Unit chief Park Pyong-ho and Domestic Unit chief Kim Jung-do are tasked with uncovering a North Korean spy, known as Donglim, who is deeply embedded within their agency. When the spy begins leaking top secret intel that could jeopardize national security, the two units are each assigned to investigate each other.','/tDe5eLxAbeK7sYckUn5aH3ngWnn.jpg','2022-08-10',131,'Released','Two rivals, a hidden truth.','Hunt',727340,4.9173,6.721,'xJUOIKg4Bic','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44032,_binary '\0','/ePX6qi0us8cvZYkRgQqh5nTBppH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6932818',7.3,4974,'nl','De Dirigent','United States, 1926: Dutch 24-year-old Willy Wolters has immigrated to the American continent with her parents as a child. She dreams of becoming a conductor, but this is an ambition that no one takes seriously. Unbeknownst to her, she\'ll also become Antonia Brico.','/lMND7RVCyke2m2TCZeTviKbBIki.jpg','2018-10-25',137,'Released','The heart of a woman, the soul of an artist','The Conductor',541611,2.5254,7.596,'MAk8JIygrEI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44033,_binary '\0','/yBov7O4eXDcBLDpZrOHZzFr8rIl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6932874',5.8,27444,'en','The Boss Baby: Family Business','The Templeton brothers — Tim and his Boss Baby little bro Ted — have become adults and drifted away from each other. But a new boss baby with a cutting-edge approach and a can-do attitude is about to bring them together again … and inspire a new family business.','/aQ7huOn3F0iJCJrFezS8p9WEsri.jpg','2021-07-01',107,'Released','Playtime is over.','The Boss Baby: Family Business',459151,14.8229,7.323,'-rF2j6K5FoM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44034,_binary '\0','/8lbj7ye0U60NU5BIjrQocO6ha75.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6933454',6.7,9610,'en','Puzzle','After years of caring exclusively for the needs of her husband and children, Agnes, a devoted housewife living in a small town near New York, has found something she really enjoys doing: solving puzzles.','/7CfijsjOsPKzz2Dd1zoMF5VPmZo.jpg','2018-07-27',103,'Released',NULL,'Puzzle',492998,3.0407,6.418,'iLjNW_e4EHw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44035,_binary '\0','/qog4HOEh8NHH5pC2dRFM0Sa05Lh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6937070',6.3,2040,'en','Love at the Shore','Single mom Jenna Thompson only five weeks to deliver her next teen novel to her publisher. So, this year\'s annual beach vacation with her kids will be a working vacation. Upon arrival, the family soon meets their new next-door neighbor, confident, devil-may-care surfer Lucas McKinnon.','/q6t7odhFFQuWwDDNVuEqyXihhVC.jpg','2017-08-05',90,'Released',NULL,'Love at the Shore',465381,2.7184,6.3,'9V6WJo7-wSs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44036,_binary '\0','/6AkrzbZ0ohrM9geOtTbAmJwcwNl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6937368',7.2,3188,'en','The Lift Boy','A coming of age story of a 24-year-old vagabond who is forced to work at a posh building in Mumbai as a Lift Boy when his bread-winning father falls ill.','/iikLBXIVNTF0pRFi7mmhWhEfp5I.jpg','2019-01-18',107,'Released',NULL,'The Lift Boy',603562,0.6993,6.2,'YGDDIT4pTKE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44037,_binary '\0','/xyxhjAGSdYVVtohQfhzbRL8TopL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt6938828',6.9,44981,'en','At E