es” decide to play some wicked tricks on the one house in a suburban cul-de-sac that is not celebrating Halloween. They terrorize a young couple in their home and these tricks become increasingly more sinister as the night progresses, finally ending in a Halloween the entire neighborhood will never forget.','/sasH9EeTPBsJ9xW5PIG7i9Jy3Ou.jpg','2018-02-06',85,'Released','Rotten to the core','Bad Apples',497269,1.4982,4.3,'wyNrf2e73Vw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44205,_binary '\0','/h9YlRHAZWOWtGonllmj6JJg1FrE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7093904',5.8,2369,'es','Guardiana de dragones (Dragonkeeper)','Set in Han Imperial China, the plot follows the adventures of enslaved girl Ping with ancient dragon Long Danzi. Dragons had been banished from the kingdom. Ping, an orphan, finds one of the last remaining dragon eggs. Palace guards force Ping to run away in order to return the dragon egg to the ocean and save all dragons from extinction. Ping discovers that she is a true Dragonkeeper.','/ggZGnJLzO3BTu7ysuuIzou3Oex5.jpg','2024-04-11',99,'Released','Everybody just saw a girl.','Dragonkeeper',588648,10.9546,7.6,'64V_Drr_3v0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44206,_binary '\0','/rWlxVEbNd4tiLdWvNdq2R3LiWfa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7094488',6.3,9322,'hi','संदीप और पिंकी फरार','Sandeep, a bank executive & Pinky, a suspended cop, are marked for a kill. Phones tapped, accounts blocked, they escape but escaping is not freedom.','/4SgBOvxCApH0T4zdsKzEGQoQ60U.jpg','2021-03-18',126,'Released',NULL,'Sandeep Aur Pinky Faraar',534081,1.5882,6.543,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44207,_binary '\0','/7YrxNIXRXyg5EnckSQaBHuLKEOv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7095054',7.3,1331,'az','Nar Bağı','Inspired by Anton Chekhov\'s The Cherry Orchard, the film follows a prodigal son who returns after 12 years. His reappearance at the family home in rural Azerbaijan significantly alters their way of life.','/wUxNIQlULHe