IS forces through her experience in a refugee camp on the Turkish-Syrian border.','/4341Djx0LNHOuRdSDIMjOmeOiDH.jpg','2017-04-03',73,'Released','How could we live without a homeland?','Resistance Is Life',483094,0.9326,5.8,'popy43ZNd2c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44212,_binary '\0','/eENEf62tMXbhyVvdcXlnQz2wcuT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7097896',5.9,311396,'en','Venom: Let There Be Carnage','After finding a host body in investigative reporter Eddie Brock, the alien symbiote must face a new enemy, Carnage, the alter ego of serial killer Cletus Kasady.','/pzKsRuKLFmYrW5Q0q8E8G78Tcgo.jpg','2021-09-30',97,'Released','You are what you eat.','Venom: Let There Be Carnage',580489,20.6572,6.728,'-FmWuCgJmxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44213,_binary '\0','/gsKNlRSAjR7oZQyvGBfU110VeC2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7098658',7.7,37801,'hi','राज़ी','An Indian spy is married to a Pakistani military officer during the Indo-Pakistani War of 1971.','/l9VJoRj0CYBURsnetvazq73FOfz.jpg','2018-05-10',138,'Released','An Incredible True Story','Raazi',491629,1.9734,7.261,'YjMSttRJrhA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44214,_binary '\0','/lRJNEdKlA47JVo3DcDd3jXrQepe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7099280',5.4,2473,'en','Needle in a Timestack','Nick and Janine live in bliss until her ex warps time to try to tear them apart by using Nick\'s old girlfriend. As Nick\'s memories and reality disappear, he must decide what he\'s willing to sacrifice to save -- or let go of -- everything he loves.','/rjGYOszxlaUAe6EC5yZ4Q8l3aVL.jpg','2021-10-15',111,'Released','Love is drawn in the form of a circle.','Needle in a Timestack',452019,3.1686,5.3,'ZPKL9aSgbCw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44215,_binary '\0','/9kAKaGPydPIhtY7X3n4rF1bchmS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7104984',6.4,4609,'es','La sombra de la ley','Barcelona, ​​Spain, 1921. A tough cop from Madrid arrives in the city to locate, under the suspicious scrutiny of corrupt local police officers, a significant amount of military weaponry stolen from a train, allegedly by revolutionary anarchists.','/4NHhkMHXROCiPMb8gjmRI6AMX4I.jpg','2018-10-11',127,'Released','1921. Some dream of a better world.','Gun City',529210,3.3193,6.318,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44216,_binary '\0','/cJ5phZK0Ufu0ufYM44yf30e2D3F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7105944',6.1,3641,'it','A casa tutti bene','An extended family reunites on an idyllic island to celebrate their grandparents\' 50th wedding anniversary. However, a storm causes them to get stuck in there longer than expected, causing secrets and long-held grudges to break out.','/j92GNi6ooPKEDj44VdrkVM6rV1f.jpg','2018-02-14',103,'Released',NULL,'There\'s No Place Like Home',486101,3.1542,6.2,'M67bFCfk7ZQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44217,_binary '\0','/zBSW6eICfpwcvPeBP0p0ZgROnCf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7109900',7.9,3707,'kn','ಕವಲುದಾರಿ','The story follows two Bangalore cops as they investigate an old case. Anant Nag plays Muthanna, a retired inspector while Rishi is Shyam, a sub-inspector working in the Traffic Police. Their search leads them across trails that will put their wit, resolve and morals to the test.','/gDA8IXXHzvDACfZHhmCV6uJSA0V.jpg','2019-04-12',145,'Released',NULL,'Kavaludaari',594028,1.1682,6.923,'5w1vgMoPMRA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44218,_binary '\0','/yl4hyGhOhAAGNExBEfFVOlE7XEE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7111402',5.2,2205,'fa','اکسیدان','Aslan\'s fiance Negar is going abroad the country illegally and without informing him at all. Now he is after a way to get a visa and go gets her back.','/c5CUmt5ckLKrjYOhHpuYqRzJ3QV.jpg','2018-01-17',90,'Released','Oxidan','Oxidan',499159,1.7289,3.9,'1FCRb9uGO6s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44219,_binary '\0','/qDKmkuJhxJDLJFuUacWLdmya5TN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7112154',7.1,6282,'ja','寝ても覚めても','Asako lives in Osaka. She falls in love with Baku, a free-spirit. One day, Baku suddenly disappears. Two years later, Asako now lives in Tokyo and meets Ryohei. He looks just like Baku, but has a completely different personality.','/nqwfB2GMMjrjAJnQj1hxD97sQXF.jpg','2018-09-01',120,'Released',NULL,'Asako I & II',487850,3.0451,6.8,'J66nBB4khSI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44220,_binary '\0','/k3ev3hvWTG6hrPLRufjX1JzI709.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7115500',3.4,1540,'en','Die In One Day','Richard is desperate: he must try to get back his daughter taken away from him by his ex-wife who reduced him to poverty. When he meets Sasha, an aspiring actress, he believes he has found a way out. The girl, in fact, convinces him to participate in a 24-hour theater game with a rich cash prize. Richard, however, does not know that he is about to take part in a bloody show...','/r9Afm0v1dkRUNdMcskU8Sgaf0eo.jpg','2017-10-30',79,'Released',NULL,'Die In One Day',541071,1.3319,3.4,'JNK3lmV4oGg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44221,_binary '\0','/aFK4vzhhtz6P4N4yojKHM5DyzUB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7115920',7.5,1764,'es','Muchos hijos, un mono y un castillo','Julita expressed her three greatest wishes shortly after getting married: lots of children, a monkey and a castle she can call her own. That all of these wishes have become a reality is probably down to the immense stubbornness of this charismatic and equally hilarious matriarch who has a weakness for collecting crazy objects. When financial circumstances force the family to sell their castle, her adult children are left sifting through a lifetime of peculiarities in search of a few lost bones… Spanish actor and neo director Gustavo Salmerón paints a deliciously absurd family portrait that just happens to reveal a lot about Spain, Catholicism and the economic crisis.','/1IXufNFOPhRvOnng1f3ElkwxGCp.jpg','2017-07-06',91,'Released',NULL,'Lots of Kids, a Monkey and a Castle',473176,0.9817,7.3,'e9UOfSCjHBo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44222,_binary '\0','/2uPgZW9cgDMFoE7WYlpUO73QXm2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7116248',5.2,1474,'en','Afterburn/Aftershock','Businesswoman Gia Rossi is determined to be successful in her new job, but when her ex lover Jax Rutledge waltzes back into her life, their passionate connection ignites not only in the boardroom, but the bedroom.','/tj6VwGIeuPXP2PWNFSSZqcBXe4U.jpg','2017-11-03',100,'Released',NULL,'Afterburn/Aftershock',487284,1.4881,6.141,'L5hrRVyfjaw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44223,_binary '\0','/r8yngtY39e7lXGGE9HDxXmBfKrg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7116712',6.5,1443,'en','Truly, Madly, Sweetly','Natalie, the owner of a San Francisco food truck business selling cupcakes, and Eric, a finance manager and divorced dad are brought together when Eric’s aunt, also a longtime customer of Natalie’s, passes away and leaves them a building which happens to be the site of a once-famous bakery. Forced into this new partnership, they discover selling the building won’t be easy because it has been declared a historical site. Romance blooms as they spend time together in the process of renovating the old bakery. However, Natalie’s desire to keep things strictly business could put an end to the partnership before the grand opening.','/gVb2zfMW4uwMJDrgGiHMHA8Bx02.jpg','2018-09-22',85,'Released',NULL,'Truly, Madly, Sweetly',543338,1.765,6.5,'gpESBLIwgjg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44224,_binary '\0','/daDjGXeRlxgHEwO8RSAkZQo1NVq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7117352',6.5,1597,'ja','斬、','In mid-19th century Edo period, a masterless rōnin named Mokunoshin Tsuzuki resides in a peaceful village among those he helps. However, as the prevalent peace and tranquility are sure to be replaced by war and conflict across the land, the swordsman feels restlessness creeping upon him.','/9YZkePtrSaAsL509v0mBwve2c7n.jpg','2018-10-08',80,'Released','Why must I kill?','Killing',531753,1.8405,7.1,'Rx3vWm6Xx94','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44225,_binary '\0','/vVIb3Dvc8QXEYUSLwl3fsbFXCBu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7117594',6,1274,'en','To Dust','Shmuel, a Hasidic cantor in Upstate New York and distraught at the untimely death of his wife, struggles to find religious solace, while secretly obsessing over how her body will decay. As a clandestine partnership develops with Albert, a local community college biology professor, the two embark on a darkly comic and increasingly literal undertaking into the underworld.','/cA3xIKurFGewWXD08sgushdAzvj.jpg','2019-02-08',105,'Released',NULL,'To Dust',514510,1.7537,5.5,'SUnrKohPzpw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44226,_binary '\0','/r4Ob1Z58KUvwMVNtfGhQEKix1e7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7117870',5.2,2086,'ml','ലവ് ആക്ഷൻ ഡ്രാമ','Dineshan is in love with Shoba, but she insists he give up smoking and drinking before marriage. It’s easier said than done, but will love triumph?','/mVqV88crk9evENJB0DeVQzIL94v.jpg','2019-09-06',142,'Released',NULL,'Love Action Drama',624582,2.6272,6.13,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44227,_binary '\0','/lpuehRS74pgVYIQ6ZQ2fIAaoAvo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7121252',7.3,10961,'it','Sulla mia pelle','The incredible true story behind the most controversial Italian court cases in recent years. Stefano Cucchi was arrested for a minor crime and mysteriously found dead during his detention. In one week\'s time, a family is changed forever.','/rwPgE6fLxuJmPWi8fFjgENJMAjr.jpg','2018-09-12',100,'Released','The last seven days of Stefano Cucchi','On My Skin',538362,2.0912,8,'tI9wa-Y9O8s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44228,_binary '\0','/jj5PFvnd5Y2QyqtBDZGrlgsUM0E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7123974',6.3,1942,'en','The Christmas Cure','A doctor returns home for Christmas to find that her father has decided to retire from his own practice. After reuniting with her high school sweetheart, she wonders if she should stay and take over her father\'s practice.','/q5lRVUm0qFUUP4Ffo7z6kAHflBL.jpg','2017-07-15',90,'Released',NULL,'The Christmas Cure',465501,1.9874,5.9,'gx5utfQNXlQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44229,_binary '\0','/2immffS9jFnNtij8rTjIBqsbTZd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7124092',3.8,2175,'en','Ghost in the Graveyard','A small town comes under the thumb of Martha, a ghost who returns to haunt the children who witnessed her death during a \"game\" of Ghost in the Graveyard as young children.','/kU5vF1HWs2bhECAFz9VO3GQPvxC.jpg','2019-11-05',92,'Released','Martha wants to play...','Ghost in the Graveyard',479424,2.0424,3.5,'9nZ5KZpMH1Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44230,_binary '\0','/sKK1fb08uCcTc0w6PlVsx3BXJdg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7125774',7.5,15165,'de','Ballon','Two families attempt a daredevil plan to escape the GDR with a homemade hot air balloon, but it crashes just before the border. The Stasi finds traces of this attempt to escape and immediately starts investigations, while the two families are forced to build a new escape balloon. With each passing day the Stasi is closer on their heels – a nerve-wracking race against time begins.','/nRs8A0zp0jU211j8Zay3ApIzlpx.jpg','2018-09-27',125,'Released','One of the most daring escapes of the Cold War.','Balloon',483983,5.9941,7.511,'95LBIwTOR7Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44231,_binary '\0','/9QKt21sUUrcNmlCkLKDFUaTodCh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7125860',7.1,55481,'en','If Beale Street Could Talk','After her fiance is falsely imprisoned, a pregnant African-American woman sets out to clear his name and prove his innocence.','/qhUIOTSi3kr4290tKrVyeriyvrv.jpg','2018-12-14',120,'Released','Trust Love All The Way','If Beale Street Could Talk',465914,7.9307,6.9,'N4m3t3G3Zqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44232,_binary '\0','/hnFln3IyJkw1J1j1EoyCuNUPTpq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7126746',5,5981,'en','Truth or Dare','Eight college friends head to a \"Haunted Rental\" in a remote town for Halloween weekend. There, they play the game rumored to have caused the deaths of seven teenagers decades earlier, Truth or Dare. What starts out as vodka-fueled fun quickly turns serious when the dares become sickeningly dangerous and the truths threaten to tear the group apart. When players attempt to refuse the increasingly challenging tasks, they\'re met with deadly consequences, quickly discovering: you must do the dare, or the dare does you. As the death toll mounts, the remaining players must race against the clock to outrun, outsmart and outlast the simple game of Truth or Dare.','/l5Dyos3xViHP5ROuCi01P9Q6nZA.jpg','2017-10-08',90,'Released','Do the dare.','Truth or Dare',480210,2.5084,5.3,'PoP0QokQNH0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44233,_binary '\0','/egg7KFi18TSQc1s24RMmR9i2zO6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7126948',5.3,314929,'en','Wonder Woman 1984','A botched store robbery places Wonder Woman in a global battle against a powerful and mysterious ancient force that puts her powers in jeopardy.','/8UlWHLMpgZm9bx6QYh0NFoq67TZ.jpg','2020-12-16',151,'Released','A new era of wonder begins.','Wonder Woman 1984',464052,17.7038,6.3,'EMgbWouN4wE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44234,_binary '\0','/ydIDe0XFblpC4FfJiO1QQuHXXAr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7127184',4.5,2566,'en','Useless Humans','A thirtieth birthday -- and the survival of mankind -- are left hanging in the balance after a mysterious creature crashes the party, forcing four childhood friends to save the night.','/ukzAwb2beKkwGzDPC1czbCHzYkC.jpg','2021-02-25',77,'Released','Humanity\'s last hope is completely hopeless.','Useless Humans',723270,1.3288,4.9,'rXrw_y74ZIc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44235,_binary '\0','/tCQPhmlqquipDYPHIRsWHa9i3o5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7127700',4,3682,'en','Bonehill Road','A young couple become stranded in the woods where they encounter a werewolf and a house of horrors.','/m7kQTZErzgq3JaxfgXuDFC4MJA3.jpg','2017-10-20',84,'Released','Stranded... but not alone.','Bonehill Road',476131,1.2389,3.9,'F56ArzBbDKk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44236,_binary '\0','/aP3Gq3RcZ4BOeXfT5UXznHH08NL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7128042',5.5,1231,'pl','Listy do M. 3','Centered around a group of individuals, who come to experience magical moments over the course of one day. Full of the power of family, love and the spirit of forgiveness. Each individual comes to realize that Christmas, more than any other time of the year, is full of wonder and surprises.','/UhH62lZPluNCXLWXYJK41RWKL9.jpg','2017-11-10',100,'Released',NULL,'Letters to Santa 3',480973,1.5555,6.344,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44237,_binary '\0','/rhVJtxk8fhvlwc9WWrutVei2RB1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7128254',6.5,1302,'te','గౌతమ్ నంద','Goutham is a billionaire and his father gives him a year’s time to enjoy his life to the fullest. The deal between the two is that after a year, he’ll take over his father’s businesses. The catch is that, beneath his seemingly perfect life, Goutham is clueless about what happiness or hunger feels like. On the other hand, Nanda, who hails from a lower-middle class background, wants to die rich and his father keeps criticising his aspirations.One fine day, Goutham and Nanda bump into each other, and since both of them are quite vexed up with their respective lives & they decide to swap their places to lead a new life for 30 days.','/eCetl5Ze6kezwl8Ibs3FKUTLtqA.jpg','2017-07-27',155,'Released',NULL,'Goutham Nanda',465378,1.3307,6.476,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44238,_binary '\0','/ma5vLo6Ohg3K7d9xpZTQGLDwZln.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7128732',6.6,1679,'es','Temblores','A family man torn between the love for his family, the boundaries of religion and the freedom to choose whom to love.','/6OAt4SFuhlV3BVMLWx4KY4BGTN2.jpg','2019-02-08',107,'Released',NULL,'Tremors',515357,1.5186,6.4,'fadL1LhbrPI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44239,_binary '\0','/e3kIlnC9BB14esIUELGdZlX7yNS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7129926',6.3,4273,'it','Come un gatto in tangenziale','The story of an encounter between a bourgeois man and a poor woman, because their teenage children fall in love.','/xfIfo2JTPpLL06njlaRBxWVH9kN.jpg','2017-12-28',99,'Released','They can\'t last. Longer than a cat on a highway.','Like a Cat on a Highway',492282,2.086,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44240,_binary '\0','/a8mU1qBEfYVSM8g5KkvO4g559kz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7130192',3.3,2168,'en','The Demonologist','Detective Damien Seryph investigates a string of murders that connects to a group trying to bring forth the 4 King Demons of Hell. Damien\'s past connects him to those involved and will force him to become \"The Demonologist\".','/exXrPmYOEOpV2ZmZbzuhmhqLF8p.jpg','2019-01-01',100,'Released','The battle never ends','The Demonologist',572000,2.1899,3.4,'6Cmu8rK9tYg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44241,_binary '\0','/9IHZeCusOd7RUaQpUrQJlKqjsUZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7130300',5.8,75675,'en','The Woman in Cabin 10','On a lavish yacht for an assignment, a journalist sees a passenger go overboard. But when no one believes her, she risks her life to uncover the truth.','/4kpdyePOlcELQQJcxXPF5GB1Adw.jpg','2025-10-09',95,'Released','They don\'t want you to believe what she saw.','The Woman in Cabin 10',1290879,7.1588,6.163,'1QbfJzTPY4w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44242,_binary '\0','/pQTdewgNTiHAtg9jWyu3UQVrAr7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7130698',7,1472,'sr','Volja Sinovljeva','In a distant future following a nuclear catastrophe, the West Balkans have become a lawless wasteland where the most valuable currency is the bullet. A mysterious blind fiddler wanders the ruins, singing the legend of the \"Grain People\"—a peaceful community of wheat-growers who refuse to submit to a distant city\'s tyranny. When a young warrior’s family is slaughtered by a deranged warlord, he embarks on a bloody quest for vengeance. Armed only with a blade and a motorcycle, he must navigate radioactive cults and hallucinations to protect the last remnants of civilization.','/gfLdd7DC1zVSDdcb2TgZumTjJLK.jpg','2024-11-28',140,'Released',NULL,'Warriors of the Wasteland',687238,3.0016,6.731,'rCg0Y9iNRJw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44243,_binary '\0','/4aOdox7on2CuHJaEdUAV6L2fQUS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7130916',5.3,4135,'en','Dicks: The Musical','Two self-obsessed businessmen discover they\'re long-lost identical twins and come together to plot the reunion of their eccentric divorced parents.','/8yVGumeBFefa1Yk4Ha5TiR6Fpac.jpg','2023-10-06',86,'Released','We’re Identical Fucking Twins!','Dicks: The Musical',939997,3.8403,4.4,'SQDmT_Cih2Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44244,_binary '\0','/j3A2JrpxRbTFBCy4xpXQHJrpcx4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7131334',6.9,2535,'en','Falling for Vermont','Bestselling author Angela Young needs to get away from the media circus surrounding her book, but her boyfriend/manager Brad is too busy making deals to listen. Determined to take a break, Angela pulls a disappearing act and drives off to see the fall foliage.','/kjgJNg7F6W8xQ3fIzLFVST0F7dS.jpg','2017-09-23',84,'Released',NULL,'Falling for Vermont',475374,2.9503,6.578,'Pcz5qPImWjY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44245,_binary '\0','/kKTPv9LKKs5L3oO1y5FNObxAPWI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7131622',7.6,978370,'en','Once Upon a Time... in Hollywood','Los Angeles, 1969. TV star Rick Dalton, a struggling actor specializing in westerns, and stuntman Cliff Booth, his best friend, try to survive in a constantly changing movie industry. Dalton is the neighbor of the young and promising actress and model Sharon Tate, who has just married the prestigious Polish director Roman Polanski…','/8j58iEBw9pOXFD2L0nt0ZXeHviB.jpg','2019-07-24',162,'Released','In this town, it can all change… Like that.','Once Upon a Time... in Hollywood',466272,36.3573,7.419,'ELeMaP8EPAA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44246,_binary '\0','/mjudUA3QNsJCtuDeXUx55MLzuKM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7131870',5.9,9712,'zh','战狼2','China\'s deadliest special forces operative settles into a quiet life on the sea. When sadistic mercenaries begin targeting nearby civilians, he must leave his newfound peace behind and return to his duties as a soldier and protector.','/87aWrVqaVhXhblhO7sYHLC2y8TT.jpg','2017-07-27',124,'Released',NULL,'Wolf Warrior 2',452557,4.8592,6.486,'Wy4WQdkgxQk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44247,_binary '\0','/fHM3ChEYaoAEcCCpRokQzN2DBYy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7133092',7.7,9194,'en','Spielberg','A documentary on the life and career of one of the most influential film directors of all time, Steven Spielberg.','/2AAvIR2PHoxNITgLDOkXXlWLlua.jpg','2017-10-05',147,'Released','Direct from the heart','Spielberg',467062,3.5278,7.546,'jvleAIPcfAc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44248,_binary '\0','/m1jqHtozru9BioJTrJ1kSZA3JOO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7133554',7.2,3145,'pl','Cicha noc','Adam unexpectedly visits his family house at Christmas after a few years of working abroad. No family member knows about his secret plans and the real reasons of his visit.','/6yQ2ZVmNFCbAXRbDLiFmZikkYtk.jpg','2017-11-24',100,'Released','When it comes to family, things work out best in photos.','Silent Night',478326,1.3317,6.9,'bP0xIVSgu0o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44249,_binary '\0','/iohOuTT3OAuvzkiNPFSL7fUWhD6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7133686',6.6,21364,