terrors stemming from a tragic murder he saw when he was young. After inheriting an old toy shop, he discovers a cursed elf doll sealed inside an ancient chest with a naughty list of his family\'s names written on it. He soon discovers the elf\'s evil secret.','/tzzISeHwvV7WtJjZyzL0xAhQXwi.jpg','2016-02-26',91,'Released','Stay off the Naughty List','The Elf',485906,0.8991,4.2,'mvnsWRMBpus','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44253,_binary '\0','/uPWJAJJwwFuqzsZBsIiQ4vHJ6Ya.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7136896',3.9,1539,'fr','Alad\'2','After freeing Baghdad from its terrible ruler, Aladin delays his marriage to the princess until a new dictator arrives to take over the city.','/dolYOzR2SnRRkNeRV6yE1c3bsxF.jpg','2018-10-03',98,'Released',NULL,'The Brand New Adventures of Aladdin',459616,2.9138,4.8,'Ms55DzeCbRU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44254,_binary '\0','/o2dRMwUUUg601AaFiPXBNwurAhM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7137380',6.2,34103,'en','Destroyer','When Erin Bell was a young cop, she was given an undercover assignment that ended badly and destroyed her life. Years later, she must face her demons in order to make peace with her past.','/sHw9gTdo43nJL82py0oaROkXXNr.jpg','2018-12-25',121,'Released','There\'s nothing to lose when you\'ve already lost everything','Destroyer',471507,4.6552,5.913,'bqHaLUoiWZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44255,_binary '\0','/aEitmeLoFACS2hUEJSo1cDyWosn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7137846',5.5,18493,'en','Breaking In','Shaun Russell takes her son and daughter on a weekend getaway to her late father\'s secluded, high-tech vacation home in the countryside. The family soon gets an unwelcome surprise when four men break into the house to find hidden money. After managing to escape, Shaun must now figure out a way to turn the tables on the desperate thieves and save her captive children.','/nuCxJwcQOEKYoiHTgcf4em8TxWv.jpg','2018-05-05',88,'Released','Payback is a mother.','Breaking In',497814,4.765,5.9,'DsDVOt3M7OM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44256,_binary '\0','/eLGnLVpKN9FeIPtnZ4XDqc3d8Ji.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7139936',6.4,59126,'en','A Rainy Day in New York','Two young people arrive in New York to spend a weekend, but once they arrive they\'re met with bad weather and a series of adventures.','/z4A6mFOLTMZAhCSPRyrtzG0SPbd.jpg','2019-07-26',92,'Released',NULL,'A Rainy Day in New York',475303,0.88,6.473,'yIVRldiVDL8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44257,_binary '\0','/POMn1uS32ttu6sVAqKOoj91VnX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7142506',7.7,9819,'hi','Monsieur (Sir)','A prosperous young Indian man falls in love with his servant, a widow with the dream of becoming a fashion designer.','/1xlh1jh9Lxz4OzusFKeljqoRxjL.jpg','2018-09-20',99,'Released','Is Love Enough?','Sir',518497,3.9754,7.075,'7vD70_5Xadc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44258,_binary '\0','/eQlEPgmcjfwHnLxv4yOzuNcbGoI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7144296',2.9,1551,'en','Kiss and Kill','A reckless night of indiscretion and lust leads a woman into the dark world of blackmail and murder. When revealing photos of her sexual tryst unexpectedly surface, Katy is forced to submit to whatever her tormentors desire.','/5QdNwga65k5iCE7fsghSdBmyVld.jpg','2017-08-08',81,'Released',NULL,'Kiss and Kill',460229,0.8596,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44259,_binary '\0','/AfvIjhDu9p64jKcmohS4hsPG95Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7144666',6.9,271887,'en','The Black Phone','Finney Blake, a shy but clever 13-year-old boy, is abducted by a sadistic killer and trapped in a soundproof basement where screaming is of little use. When a disconnected phone on the wall begins to ring, Finney discovers that he can hear the voices of the killer’s previous victims. And they are dead set on making sure that what happened to them doesn’t happen to Finney.','/p9ZUzCyy9wRTDuuQexkQ