is a battleground under attack on two fronts: the harsh techniques of their new coach, which threaten to incapacitate more than one player, and the infighting between leaders Manel Estiarte and Pedro Aguado. Can the team stay united and overcome their personal differences? Will reaching sporting glory be possible in the face of such adversity?','/w1a5m7wCEeLqAVZ1TpUynmh9rj6.jpg','2022-09-02',106,'Released','An impossible challenge. A legendary team.','The Final Game',913988,1.3323,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44264,_binary '\0','/Klfe4c9DLMhhB648SuWDTkSGH6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7149066',5.3,1867,'en','The Sonata','After a gifted musician inherits a mansion after her long lost father dies under mysterious circumstances, she discovers his last musical masterpiece riddled with cryptic symbols that unravels an evil secret, triggering dark forces that reach beyond her imagination.','/iiL3AWKPx6GIZN6AmmSq7pbtyc.jpg','2018-11-15',88,'Released','Play at your own risk.','The Sonata',477036,2.2549,4.8,'afdy7scrYgk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44265,_binary '\0','/rMVOJRc7tkefISzQH6dQiWhFJaH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7149336',5.2,1511,'en','The Unicorn','An engaged couple is forced to visit Palm Springs for a weekend to celebrate her parents’ 25th wedding vow renewal and discover the apparent secret to their happy marriage — threesomes. Determined to properly celebrate their own “re-engagement,” they set out on a wild night in search of a threesome of their own but the experience takes an intense turn, exposing deeper relationship problems and threatening their future together.','/61EeWnW1fcq2N056C2JGgMhC4lZ.jpg','2019-02-01',88,'Released',NULL,'The Unicorn',483351,2.115,4.4,'VbtI9vsJtMo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44266,_binary '\0','/kmbpYvhUsEdJFBqcDy7ESoXmknX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7149730',6.3,38947,'en','The Silencing','A reformed hunter becomes involved in a deadly game of cat and mouse when he and the local sheriff set out to track a vicious killer who may have kidnapped his daughter years ago.','/dnN1ncxEOO1TY0gYL2FWxJqlhlL.jpg','2020-07-18',93,'Released','It takes a hunter to catch a killer.','The Silencing',603119,6.5139,6.503,'v1rQOLis1P0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44267,_binary '\0','/iEYTv8SfaNO3sjiHBBtNpR9UMXv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7149916',4.5,3487,'en','Edge of Fear','After being stabbed in the heart by ruthless home invaders, a man is left for dead. Now weak, outnumbered, and knife sticking from his chest, he attempts to do the impossible: save his wife from these murderers before he bleeds to death.','/lrnoF2jQIq6WaccKqaX8VdCMwcL.jpg','2018-08-01',91,'Released',NULL,'Edge of Fear',539619,2.5624,4.678,'MBlZjbmxJQ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44268,_binary '\0','/bi5X5qcuiSuhEunkRVVynpbetDI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7150512',7.1,1534,'en','2040','A three year self-described labour of love, 2040 takes the form of a visual letter from the filmmaker to his four-year-old daughter Velvet, showing her what the year 2040 could look like “if we simply embraced the best solutions that exist today.”','/kW4X9rbF6gROGh5iS4pBDbOI7PU.jpg','2019-05-23',92,'Released','Join the regeneration','2040',575788,1.7907,6.7,'p-rTQ443akE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44269,_binary '\0','/iNH5rwMRBE8TLBalrnwcEe3VodE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7153488',4.5,7308,'en','Army of One','Out hiking, Special Forces Brenner Baker stumbles onto a Cartel\'s compound. Her husband\'s killed and she\'s left for dead. The Cartel made two mistakes, killed her husband and left her alive. They won\'t live to make another.','/oswZEJav9ymqIc9B1cjA9Pz2tj1.jpg','2020-12-14',87,'Released','They left her for dead. Big mistake.','Army of One',768939,3.449,5.64,'7p-bwF1c7PQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44270,_binary '\0','/5u0ImRdr8Z6uyDfmSWcThXEb8cl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7153766',6.4,54538,'en','Unsane','A woman is involuntarily committed to a mental institution where she is confronted by her greatest fear.','/wdaUssQhZDOgegkJZx7NfY75HRX.jpg','2018-03-22',98,'Released','Is she or isn\'t she?','Unsane',467660,5.7515,6.3,'u7KZrt_cHH0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44271,_binary '\0','/acge3po1C8ZkSTNBLPlsQWf8r3R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7155170',6.3,2080,'ja','ミスミソウ','The story follows Nozaki Haruka, a middle school student who transfers to a new school in a small town because of her father\'s work. Unfortunately, she becomes a victim of horrific bullying, but since the school will be closing in 2 months after graduation, no one is willing to help her.','/4YmCpOIlBr9gvPnHNqQfzSlcbOY.jpg','2018-04-07',114,'Released','In a snow-covered village, my family was burnt to death.','Liverleaf',498934,2.7705,6.087,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44272,_binary '\0','/xKRabniEC8StlveeKrNbozNb6On.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7156144',6.1,1738,'fr','Jalouse','A divorced teacher suddenly becomes jealous of everyone, including her daughter, friends and neighbors.','/pabH4OR4VTNeAnGjt44Na2Zntw6.jpg','2017-11-08',102,'Released',NULL,'Jealous',463861,1.6097,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44273,_binary '\0','/isvZHZa4cKySbnVqUCAZPHjMKRB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7156222',6.7,6324,'fr','Au poste !','Louis just found the corpse of a man in front of his apartment building. Taken in for custody by Captain Buron, he finds himself on the wrong end of a surreal interrogation. But how can you prove you are innocent when the cops are crazy?','/zfq8FfMbaYL3fHVgrIsFBaDhRPC.jpg','2018-07-04',73,'Released',NULL,'Keep an Eye Out',474331,2.3064,6.7,'-T5JBgFbxT8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44274,_binary '\0','/4tOYcEXHXclnD1B7EpVDw4guJoH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7156436',5.4,1661,'ko','PMC: 더 벙커','On the day of the U.S. presidential election in 2024, a team of elite mercenaries embark on a secret CIA mission to abduct North Korea\'s politician in an underground bunker below the Korean Demilitarized Zone. However, they get caught in the crossfire which causes tensions to escalate to the brink of World War III.','/fl9VBbIGHUoBY6Ixzt9lEGjhxzs.jpg','2018-12-26',124,'Released','Stateless. Honorless. War for Money.','Take Point',557972,2.5528,6.9,'lhn090icbpM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44275,_binary '\0','/fqYJVFsmd1QVWQqUfr5A7k45T6M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7156898',6.9,1825,'en','County Lines','A powerful drama about a mother and her fourteen year old boy who is groomed into a lethal nationwide drug selling enterprise, a \'County Line\', which exploits vulnerable children and traffics them across Britain.','/odYS1rnUj1K60rRmfAl1MJC9nP6.jpg','2020-12-04',90,'Released',NULL,'County Lines',623238,1.17,6.6,'kYcTPZpgrx0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44276,_binary '\0','/dhdby4wEnYL5VwP4onSfdwVaTyI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7157146',4.8,1744,'en','The Curse of Audrey Earnshaw','A devout community suffering from a plague is torn apart by a beautiful young woman and the forces of witchcraft, black magic, and possession.','/kMVxPRyDuod7479mTykw4SPHMQN.jpg','2020-09-30',93,'Released','There\'s a new witch in town.','The Curse of Audrey Earnshaw',688343,2.4226,5.4,'PxlJgRft2fE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44277,_binary '\0','/6XznuR5s363S8ZqrqEFO0qXl7V5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7158430',6.9,12547,'en','Hearts Beat Loud','In the hip Brooklyn neighborhood of Red Hook, single dad and record store owner Frank is preparing to send his hard-working daughter Sam off to college while being forced to close his vintage shop. Hoping to stay connected through their shared musical passions, Frank urges Sam to turn their weekly jam sessions into a father-daughter live act. After their first song becomes an internet breakout, the two embark on a journey of love, growing up and musical discovery.','/h1wKptD8iXJbtAUSz9OlXS3q4Co.jpg','2018-06-08',97,'Released','Music runs in the family','Hearts Beat Loud',470333,2.6402,6.834,'PXNOg_SK7Vs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44278,_binary '\0','/qOSKLtZSNuXWybsBoFHaUuE44YZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7158582',7.2,1438,'ar','التقارير حول سارة وسليم','The affair of a married Palestinian man and a married Israeli woman in Jerusalem takes a dangerous political dimension when they are spotted in the wrong place at the wrong time, leaving them to deal with more than their broken marriages.','/wkIkeadOsytJfcGPDzbxge1bzJH.jpg','2018-03-15',127,'Released',NULL,'The Reports on Sarah and Saleem',498517,1.6539,6.9,'Dc_ms3hptvM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44279,_binary '\0','/uhocyH2bWslI0rsb57W59EmDQEm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7158686',5.1,1512,'es','No dormirás','In an abandoned psychiatric hospital, a theatre group experiments with insomnia for the preparation of a stage play. With the passage of days without sleep, they reach new thresholds of perception that expose them to the secrets of the place and the energies that inhabit it. When Bianca, a young, promising actress, joins the cast, competing for the lead role, she must survive not only the intensity of the work and her cast mates, but the unknown force that is pulling them towards a tragic outcome.','/a6sGMxkOeaUiltWQcmtFuIqXfno.jpg','2018-01-11',106,'Released','Your fear will keep you awake','You Shall Not Sleep',496212,2.4234,5.6,'6MVkyQ6Qb-I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44280,_binary '\0','/kITotL1eL9vWpDpCNmR6jzuP37s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7159382',7.4,6740,'te','ఫిదా','Two young people embark on a winding and rocky path to love after meeting at a wedding.','/cvpwHdJuUzm544lvleBIAxGdzBB.jpg','2017-07-20',145,'Released',NULL,'Fidaa',467649,2.0043,7.364,'NrnyxMdIOpU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44281,_binary '\0','/eLLSKwptC0T8iKKQfgOGIAaQlVn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7159566',3.9,2423,'en','Transference: Escape the Dark','Joshua must protect his twin sister, Emma, who possesses supernatural abilities and keep her safe from an unstoppable secret agent hunting them for an experiment in a classified government program.','/wxFa0pQUTasf6AZIPZ0faCvp10b.jpg','2020-10-02',88,'Released',NULL,'Transference: Escape the Dark',680398,1.4974,4.6,'iKiyVGobFvQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44282,_binary '\0','/wyv2Y9vXYJwJzF6cNVuVwVOsOUj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7160070',7.2,22595,'ko','신과함께-죄와 벌','Having died unexpectedly, firefighter Ja-hong is taken to the afterlife by 3 afterlife guardians. Only when he passes 7 trials over 49 days and proves he was innocent in human life, he’s able to reincarnate, and his 3 afterlife guardians are by his side to defend him in trial.','/gJSvIsI6oQfFim0PGyuuiCYfqKs.jpg','2017-12-20',139,'Released','Fate continues even after death.','Along with the Gods: The Two Worlds',397567,8.0579,8.061,'dyh_OY1DgqU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44283,_binary '\0','/yWAixjgr2U8JQsm0zWxCbT6iqUL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7160176',6.8,4210,'ko','남한산성','Ancient Korea, 17th century. The powerful Khan of the Jurchen tribe of Manchuria, who fights the Ming dinasty to gain China, becomes the first ruler of the Qing dinasty and demands from King In-jo of Joseon to bow before him; but he refuses, being loyal to the Mings. On December 14th, 1636, the Qing horde invades Joseon, so King In-jo and his court shelter in the mountain fortress of Namhan and prepare to defend the kingdom.','/ww0h7mVg9AdPEMjRJKAic1w3ELa.jpg','2017-10-03',140,'Released','The fate of the nation is in their hands','The Fortress',437081,3.5778,6.78,'EYsv-rSW3n0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44284,_binary '\0','/pnTSOKcYnvdpQNQElAtJM1rWOxH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7160372',7.3,192657,'en','The Zone of Interest','The commandant of Auschwitz, Rudolf Höss, and his wife Hedwig, strive to build a dream life for their family in a house and garden next to the camp.','/hUu9zyZmDd8VZegKi1iK1Vk0RYS.jpg','2023-12-15',105,'Released','The life we enjoy.','The Zone of Interest',467244,12.7627,7.011,'GFNtVaAuVYY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44285,_binary '\0','/tcyX5DP4CCqE8Qkg7p5M9z5V5P1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7161122',7.6,3258,'ta','மீசைய முறுக்கு','A passionate youngster who dreams of making it in the music industry is on the verge of losing his love. What will happen to his career and romance?','/51YxNae9DC5BG39IgCjsKkTIOdV.jpg','2017-07-21',136,'Released',NULL,'Meesaya Murukku',424336,1.6196,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44286,_binary '\0','/dze068iVyTADUG4WyUxL3H1k2XA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7162390',4.4,2054,'ru','Русалка. Озеро мертвых','An evil Mermaid falls in love with Marina\'s fiancé Roman and aims to keep him away from Marina in her Kingdom of Death under water. The Mermaid is a young woman who drowned a few centuries ago. Marina only has one week to overcome her fear of the dark water, to remain human in the deathly fight with the monsters and not to become one herself.','/gGFZ84plg0TPM737j8ccpseh96l.jpg','2018-07-12',87,'Released',NULL,'The Mermaid: Lake of the Dead',516850,3.2693,6.1,'koBvnxSBqk4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44287,_binary '\0','/gOz8M6u6Fwv30hz2yBqKrGskfZo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7162758',5.2,1336,'hi','पल्टन','A war drama based on the Indo-China War of 1962, JP Dutta\'s \"PALTAN\" focuses on the hard-hitting truth of India\'s relations with China, and how it is important to acknowledge that China, an enormous power in world politics, poses to be a huge threat to India.','/nQ9G7JjxM2NWyOrWfhgsTA6mBM7.jpg','2018-09-07',123,'Released','1967 A True Story That Was Never Told','Paltan',540612,1.3106,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44288,_binary '\0','/fPCJgTkVnSKI7qAbKtUbamqjqlQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7163824',6.5,1882,'sr','Teret','Vlada works as a truck driver during the NATO bombing of Serbia in 1999. Tasked with transporting a mysterious load from Kosovo to Belgrade, he drives through unfamiliar territory, trying to make his way in a country scarred by the war. He knows that once the job is over, he will need to return home and face the consequences of his actions.','/1vVk4Frbkkl9DNS5P79HAJABRkH.jpg','2019-03-21',96,'Released',NULL,'The Load',519116,0.9617,6.3,'WM9gXCoZU-E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44289,_binary '\0','/zhEWuu6H6Gzv5weG7znoL6J8GtZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7169514',6.8,1344,'fr','Dilili à Paris','With the help of her delivery-boy friend, Dilili, a young Kanak, investigates a spate of mysterious kidnappings of young girls that is plaguing Belle Epoque Paris. In the course of her investigation she encounters a series of extraordinary characters, each of whom provides her with clues that will help her in her quest.','/zhbSs7eruoT68NZcSkmtPYWHkU5.jpg','2018-10-10',95,'Released',NULL,'Dilili in Paris',421456,2.155,6.6,'TmBcSoz86vA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44290,_binary '\0','/pDQvWtaF4ujUooN4lojronauIFU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7170950',6.1,24759,'en','Like Father','When a workaholic young executive is left at the altar, she ends up on her Caribbean honeymoon cruise with the last person she ever expected: her estranged and equally workaholic father. The two depart as strangers, but over the course of a few hilarious adventures, a couple of umbrella-clad cocktails and a whole lot of soul-searching, they return with a renewed appreciation for family and life.','/xPN8iFewcLAdonUec76qrAEnHm6.jpg','2018-08-03',103,'Released','There are some journeys you can\'t take alone.','Like Father',518452,4.3366,6.216,'_bfqsNh6U7c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44291,_binary '\0','/d7seFwkDmc6xQxMzu1vG2ZSOJGK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7171442',6.4,1768,'zh','从21世纪安全撤离','Three friends discover that they have the power to travel back and forth 20 years with a sneeze. However, the future is not as good as they hope, and they need to take on the responsibility of saving the world.','/6jgXcjisegB0XBzIvIiKo0aLFc.jpg','2024-07-18',98,'Released',NULL,'Escape from the 21st Century',1242372,2.0747,6.8,'IkmP1aPiUns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44292,_binary '\0','/riD6TjIKgZujzqWdB6PQSg0MHrP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7174134',6.5,1381,'nl','Nr. 10','A stubborn stage actor navigates single fatherhood, a strenuous theatre project, an adulterous love affair, and the confounding dreams awakened by a puzzling street encounter with a mysterious stranger.','/zbekRqTIW8KX0NKDxHMqTsslDbY.jpg','2021-09-30',100,'Released',NULL,'No. 10',718012,1.1097,6.222,'PsnMnPZQmdE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44293,_binary '\0','/b9ecj3M8ejGmtYebRq3ZELl2ULg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7175968',6.6,2755,'en','My Neighbor Adolf','South America, 1960. A lonely and grumpy Holocaust survivor convinces himself that his new neighbor is none other than Adolf Hitler. Not being taken seriously, he starts an independent investigation to prove his claim, but when the evidence still appears to be inconclusive, Polsky is forced to engage in a relationship with the enemy in order to obtain irrefutable proof.','/Aa0wBvNVpawluKM8QRAVnP3QNbg.jpg','2022-11-03',96,'Released','Know our enemy and he will reveal himself.','My Neighbor Adolf',997669,2.0492,6.5,'Ii47Auvhls4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44294,_binary '\0','/mq31oGhJbvz5jvCDHkYoeX3qWRg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7175992',6.4,3402,'fr','L\'Heure de la sortie','Pierre Hoffman joins a prestigious school as a substitute teacher and soon notices, among some of his students, an unjustified hostility and a spark of violence in their eyes. Is it because the unspeakable tragedy they have just experienced? Is it because they seem to be extraordinarily gifted children? Is it because they have lost all hope for the future? From curiosity to obsession, Pierre will try to unlock their secret.','/2aaIB3qOIe1QucA1qO1TbhJ7veS.jpg','2018-08-31',100,'Released',NULL,'School\'s Out',475928,2.6968,6.1,'4zZjzpTzlWs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44295,_binary '\0','/egonBOHhHBhXiigeiNth2x1YSTm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7176054',4.7,2878,'ru','Вратарь Галактики','Cosmoball is a mesmerizing intergalactic game of future played between humans and aliens at the giant extraterrestrial ship hovering in the sky over Earth. A young man with enormous power of an unknown nature joins the team of hot-headed superheroes in exchange for a cure for his mother’s deadly illness. The Four from Earth will fight not only to defend the honor of their home planet in the spectacular game, but to face the unprecedented threat to the Galaxy and embrace their own destiny.','/eDJYDXRoWoUzxjd52gtz5ODTSU1.jpg','2020-08-27',115,'Released',NULL,'Cosmoball',517096,3.633,6.3,'bjro8NmhXHw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44296,_binary '\0','/qk3cGYKrHqjNmUyaQpenbE6LR7o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7177720',6.1,1622,'es','Re loca','A 36-year-old meek woman realizes that there’s younger people trying to outpace her doing much less, so she makes a risky change by removing her filter.','/xKT9Mv1SB7pW9TLOcmhcm9BH4Pc.jpg','2018-07-04',90,'Released','It\'s time to send everyone to hell','Super Crazy',513399,2.2002,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44297,_binary '\0','/jqojZIpJBQz08Vip3Ul5nzcUyCf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7178226',7.5,3117,'en','The Cave','Deep beneath the surface in the Syrian province of Ghouta, a group of female doctors have established an underground field hospital. Under the supervision of paediatrician Dr. Amani and her staff of doctors and nurses, hope is restored for some of the thousands of children and civilian victims of the ruthless Syrian civil war.','/2Zb8U2EXBv36DGG9jaEESNEeJv9.jpg','2019-10-18',107,'Released','Hope Shines in the Darkest Places','The Cave',621729,1.329,7.2,'TaZkwBWuN2A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44298,_binary '\0','/nxIqVM8Kqp6Ej21WiOncTwKzoG1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7178640',5.5,14909,'en','Superintelligence','When an all-powerful Superintelligence chooses to study the most average person on Earth, Carol Peters, the fate of the world hangs in the balance. As the A.I. decides to enslave, save or destroy humanity, it’s up to Carol to prove that people are worth saving.','/podzoGfamoxObotrMMoH2WIc8nj.jpg','2020-11-26',106,'Released','Single. Unemployed. Likes James Corden.','Superintelligence',521007,4.9738,5.9,'XN6JawOGvpM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44299,_binary '\0','/wXAEc8kBBGDE6mXtD6acNdpWchS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7179714',7.3,1570,'ta','இரவுக்கு ஆயிரம் கண்கள்','Three strangers, who were cheated by a three-member fraud gang, hatch plan to take revenge on their leader, and go to his home around same time. All of them get the shock of their life when they find someone murdered at the home.','/1gtw3n7dCYvwga4Kid3a7UJLkp7.jpg','2018-05-11',121,'Released',NULL,'Iravukku Aayiram Kangal',495503,1.1772,6.711,'qmUkTtEa_nc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44300,_binary '\0','/157E1KUsuxILoLsZ7psc4BURV3N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7179784',7.6,6295,'ta','இரும்புத்திரை','Kathiravan, a major in the Indian army with anger management issues, is compelled by circumstances to borrow a loan from a bank with false documents. When the entire money in the account vanishes, Kathiravan tries to track down the scamsters, and it leads him to White Devil, a master hacker.','/5yDCAvDtgJ9q7Fgs7Jy94nhRbV4.jpg','2018-05-11',160,'Released',NULL,'Irumbu Thirai',487593,1.6799,6.804,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44301,_binary '\0','/A6qDUM0KJPcQKh7wf14xseGBphy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7180544',8,9639,'hi','मुक्काबाज़','A low caste boxer, Shravan, trains at a gym controlled by a local Don, Mishra. Shravan falls for Mishra\'s niece, Sunaina. Mishra does not approve of this match. Shravan strives to win Sunaina\'s hand in marriage and become a successful boxer while trying to avoid retaliation from Mishra.','/fnedX8qCbRfDnbVTdrPZZ5xf7ID.jpg','2018-01-12',145,'Released',NULL,'Mukkabaaz',470641,1.2985,7.5,'fl3gun0J8XM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44302,_binary '\0','/1yktYsxkmUtUFTUnCAUaqG6FEiz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7181546',6.8,162758,'en','Ballerina','Taking place during the events of John Wick: Chapter 3 – Parabellum, Eve Macarro begins her training in the assassin traditions of the Ruska Roma.','/2VUmvqsHb6cEtdfscEA6fqqVzLg.jpg','2025-06-04',125,'Released','Vengeance has a new face.','Ballerina',541671,29.5053,7.27,'0FSwsrFpkbw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44303,_binary '\0','/s7i9dyKp4YKwbJ9AW7Inc3ajSan.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7183578',6.8,5733,'cn','無雙','The Hong Kong police is hunting a counterfeiting gang led by a mastermind code-named \"Painter\" . The gang possesses exceptional counterfeiting skills which makes it difficult to distinguish the authenticity of its counterfeit currency. The scope of their criminal activities extends globally and greatly attracts the attention of the police. In order to crack the true identity of \"Painter\", the police recruits a painter named Lee Man to assist in solving the case.','/aJv81P9fEsArYmEL1IGYNTYQLni.jpg','2018-09-30',130,'Released',NULL,'Project Gutenberg',531384,5.3986,7.1,'PAbPK2zNoQU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44304,_binary '\0','/pGbeVDqwxvjD2R63dGeQRiDwbK1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7186092',6.7,2231,'it','Nico, 1988','Approaching age 50, singer/songwriter Nico leads a solitary existence, far from her days as a Warhol superstar and celebrated vocalist for the Velvet Underground in the 1960s. Her life and career on the fringes, Nico\'s new manager convinces her to hit the road again and tour in Europe to promote her latest album. She longs to rebuild a relationship with her son, whose custody she lost long ago.','/x3krhl7ZC1oaIWZXvmVkwvqFx3w.jpg','2017-10-12',93,'Released',NULL,'Nico, 1988',473262,1.2363,6.7,'AWvUNABT8sg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44305,_binary '\0','/3r5ALuBZak2zx3NZr698B8OLFPd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7188868',7.8,4069,'en','Diana: In Her Own Words','Using home videos recorded by her voice coach, Diana takes us through the story of her life.','/9AvP1lvt8lZemhsdQ71Y0cwwaB8.jpg','2017-08-06',113,'Released','I like to be a free spirit. Some don\'t like that, but that\'s the way I am.','Diana: In Her Own Words',469980,2.1825,7.602,'UfaTLTo3250','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44306,_binary '\0','/7cco0isB97IQKIc25J1kmezHmv7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7188978',5.4,3054,'en','Lifechanger','A murderous shapeshifter sets out on a blood-soaked mission to make things right with the woman he loves.','/ocNctwT6ePRtzWPi3Tqqog5h7NM.jpg','2018-10-01',84,'Released','It becomes you','Lifechanger',532645,1.4538,5.8,'KCqeJLvSqSI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44307,_binary '\0','/w33ulTx4eXUsgHX83XjoaHukCac.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7190460',7.6,6268,'ta','துப்பறிவாளன்','Detective Kaniyan Poonkundran is hungry for a challenging case to investigate and the mystery of a murdered dog leads to a rival who could be the match for him.','/jG10W7dT4tHb4dqJ9sB2miClGP7.jpg','2017-09-14',159,'Released',NULL,'Thupparivaalan',410481,1.522,7.189,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44308,_binary '\0','/eau194gnLB5QGlfki0qGRFV7f2z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7193362',7,1463,'en','Where\'s My Roy Cohn?','Roy Cohn personified the dark arts of American politics, turning empty vessels into dangerous demagogues - from Joseph McCarthy to his final project, Donald J. Trump. This thriller-like exposé connects the dots, revealing how a deeply troubled master manipulator shaped our current American nightmare.','/kLLsinqf2a6dC7HcYPY3oiL9s1N.jpg','2019-09-20',97,'Released','If you were in his presence, you knew you were in the presence of evil','Where\'s My Roy Cohn?',565531,2.4924,5.6,'lTrHL7Vo_SQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44309,_binary '\0','/jrlUhWTQy3Dpmsexlp4RvUgaZwz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7200946',4.8,9966,'en','Oh, Ramona!','Oh, Ramona! seeks the transformation of Andrew from a teenager into an adult who lives candidly and selflessly his first love story, innocent and uninvolved, alternating with the second, intense and insane story, incapable of making a choice.','/mscdZrk8k6VTVOgbVF5IpsaA8sK.jpg','2019-02-14',109,'Released',NULL,'Oh, Ramona!',582186,2.1432,5.811,'wQYLp_iftiI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44310,_binary '\0','/mstA9h9M9CadVmcuITuKPlx4dzu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7201744',6.1,1320,'en','As I Am','Set in the rolling hills of the English countryside, one week of school remains for Kai, an aspiring writer, and his friends. How they choose to spend this time will cost one of them their life and leave them all changed forever.','/lw7DSPOre4XBevvZIpU3sJy7KVd.jpg','2019-10-13',125,'Released',NULL,'As I Am',631998,2.0213,5.6,'PiF7IP2N4Is','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44311,_binary '\0','/flqONlzGNUkGCJr9BfBhGNLYo6B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7201846',7.3,4112,'fr','Edmond','Paris, France, December 1897. The young playwright Edmond Rostand feels like a failure. Inspiration has abandoned him. Married and father of two children, desperate and penniless, he persuades the great actor Constant Coquelin to perform the main role in his new play. But there is a problem: Coquelin wants to premiere it at Christmas and Edmond has not written a single word.','/9Y1VxSfJdu8fqQqgX0x6OObxvUw.jpg','2018-11-10',113,'Released','He\'s got three weeks to write a masterpiece…','Cyrano, My Love',544510,3.8591,7.5,'TfhnPSQ73F0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44312,_binary '\0','/nSmsaUAN1G8kYh91Me8lB6S8eTd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7203412',4.2,2613,'fa','آینه بغل','Accidentally, a poor couple and a rich one meet each other. These young couple have some difficulties.','/6aGqNisJ0t1gL2mpccIw16dmS8Y.jpg','2017-12-06',102,'Released',NULL,'Wing Mirror',511455,0.6247,3.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44313,_binary '\0','/264l5unkfbaHeUEv0J4HbaUUyxJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7203520',6,1779,'pl','Wilkołak','Summer of 1945. A temporary orphanage is established in an abandoned palace surrounded by forests for the eight children liberated from the Gross-Rosen camp. Hanka, also a former inmate, becomes their guardian. After the atrocities of the camp, the protagonists slowly begin to regain what is left of their childhood but the horror returns quickly. Camp Alsatians roam the forests around. Released by the SS earlier on, they have gone feral and are starving. Looking for food they besiege the palace. The children are terrified and their camp survival instinct is triggered.','/egSBfZCPeZvaSx4IKXKRqhH8DIg.jpg','2019-03-29',88,'Released','Liberation was just the beginning...','Werewolf',500915,1.416,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44314,_binary '\0','/4xcZkjdkPZ0iJ53AyBJ9b9SdSDD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7204006',6.6,1385,'it','Ammore e malavita','A Mafia boss fakes his own death aiming at a fresh start, but a nurse happens to see him alive and well after the funeral. A hitman is promptly sent to get rid of her, only to find out she\'s his first and unforgotten love.','/gjgTPRxVWpqHBa1dNRSfaiVDxWp.jpg','2017-08-01',140,'Released','True love only comes once and never dies','Love and Bullets',468302,1.6586,6.6,'_KJwY9vrYRA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44315,_binary '\0','/gRxlzFYDKdzNnhu8OFIKm3i9b6f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7204348',6.9,12494,'es','El Ángel','Buenos Aires, Argentina, 1971. Carlos Robledo Puch is a 19-year-old boy with an angelic face, but a vocational thief as well, who acts ruthlessly, without remorse. When he meets Ramón, they follow together a dark path of crime and death.','/hKtxOC2Mx9v4vx5TNJprzrFiy7.jpg','2018-08-09',115,'Released','Inspired by true events.','El Angel',507505,2.9969,7.368,'nJ9hnMPQKwY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44316,_binary '\0','/mrJ9JFLviq89wmK5TAqySqhVAqK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7205208',7.1,2723,'zh','嘉年华','In a small seaside town, two schoolgirls are assaulted by a middle-aged man in a motel. Mia, a teenager who was working on reception that night, is the only witness. For fear of losing her job, she says nothing. Meanwhile, 12-year-old Wen, one of the victims, finds that her troubles have only just begun. Trapped in a world that offers them no safety, Mia and Wen will have to find their own way out.','/kpATMFID3lzxoLUyqZa65634vet.jpg','2017-12-24',107,'Released',NULL,'Angels Wear White',468208,1.0716,7.014,'z-t0YbdzKdw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44317,_binary '\0','/mwyO0J1pwaqqKygU0gnIyRP1cFN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7205316',4.9,8184,'fr','MILF','Three childhood friends - Elise, Sonia and Cecile - leave for a summer in the South of France to help clear Cecile’s holiday house before it is put up for sale. There, they soon become the prime targets of three horny young men, for whom these single forty-year-old women are much more attractive than girls their age.','/qBU82NPKF1LOAD9D3jLUqypyEdL.jpg','2018-05-02',96,'Released',NULL,'MILF',499726,5.1476,5.7,'f3WBCV0ybNU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44318,_binary '\0','/uWEexHYDa5lWhc4JD7mOtLw616q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7205630',5.9,1542,'fr','I Feel Good','He’s lived for too long off his parents. It’s time for 40-year-old slacker Jacques to get by on his own. One-time gigolo and a borderline bum, he knows what he wants – to become rich and famous. He even has a business plan: tourism combined with cheap plastic surgery. Jacques moves in with his older sister, Monique, who manages an Emmaus village in the south west of France. And before long, the smooth-talking chancer has convinced a group of workers to pool their meagre funds and set out on a trip to a clinic in Bulgaria, where all their dreams of a brighter and more beautiful future will all come true. If only…','/20EEuatA2h690yhlMTdbkoBVln4.jpg','2018-09-26',103,'Released',NULL,'I Feel Good',495671,1.2586,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44319,_binary '\0','/sTah9Lzt5g88ksXbvhgFyEsFaQf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7205778',7.6,1263,'ro','Secretul Fericirii','For two friends there is only one secret to happiness, that is easy to understand, but, perhaps, difficult to accept.','/gTB31e5f5q4xf9Y75BwEs2P8m17.jpg','2018-10-19',90,'Released',NULL,'The Secret of Happiness',546109,1.4605,6.6,'ktQgF373y3k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44320,_binary '\0','/wP8JpHSlehkqFgXJZAHr1OPCXmu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7205942',7.2,2250,'de','Gundermann','The real life story of East German singer and writer Gerhard Gundermann and his struggles with music, life as a coal miner and his dealings with the secret police (STASI) of the GDR.','/xSzDtOeCVqPIZM80fgvlgwyNFR7.jpg','2018-08-23',128,'Released',NULL,'Gundermann',484735,1.1228,7.2,'rNd9Xp4lGcE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44321,_binary '\0','/bNRKlh05MdlDECJUaA6Nzw5t9UA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7207238',7.8,6341,'en','Jane','Drawing from never-before-seen footage that has been tucked away in the National Geographic archives, director Brett Morgen tells the story of Jane Goodall, a woman whose chimpanzee research revolutionized our understanding of the natural world.','/lasO6v47evkx4JfRqf4Rhqp8FZd.jpg','2017-12-28',90,'Released','It took a woman to unlock the secret of early man.','Jane',470819,1.7463,7.468,'FRlUJrEUn0Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44322,_binary '\0','/e4eeJjON17Cv7Cio3QEyC4xv5uZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7208564',5.4,7640,'en','Blood Fest','Fans flock to a festival celebrating the most iconic horror movies, only to discover that the charismatic showman behind the event has a diabolical agenda.','/iy6mJ8EvVQrrSrSblK7GRYFq1Mp.jpg','2018-08-17',93,'Released','Love horror movies? Try surviving one.','Blood Fest',472226,1.9684,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44323,_binary '\0','/g2C0ar1P5G5BoNi0vOWYE9R7B79.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7209472',4.1,12879,'en','Wrath of Souls','A neighborhood is plagued by mysterious tragedies when a young man becomes the conduit for an unknown spirit, the \"Aiyai,\" which lures victims to their chilling fates.','/d4i7eJDNE88Ktv07kTCnZMgSuvH.jpg','2020-02-28',84,'Released','Once you see them nothing can save you.','Wrath of Souls',721927,1.4595,5.2,'qL6nPpdx_gE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44324,_binary '\0','/mpEWbXtfwI5GoFY6e9gkQmthb9x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7209510',5.5,5898,'en','Glossary of Broken Dreams','Puppets! Pixels! Anime! Live action! Stock footage! Lumpennerd Johannes Grenzfurthner gives an ideotaining cinematic revue about important political concepts. Everyone is talking about freedom! Privacy! Identity! Resistance! The Market! The Left! But, yikes, Johannes can\'t tolerate ignorant and topically abusive comments on the \"Internet\" anymore! Supported by writer Ishan Raval, in this film, Johannes explains, re-evaluates, and sometimes sacrifices political golden calves of discourse. Not to be used with false consciousness or silicone-based lubricant.','/iDI7V7Djubtti5bJ08s3W4Reh6P.jpg','2018-03-16',98,'Released','A film paved with good intentions','Glossary of Broken Dreams',516065,1.5097,6.8,'hFSigTAQTgI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44325,_binary '\0','/dWtD17tPMHkclUGWMxVQAJZGlGg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7210426',6.9,2478,'fr','Sauver ou périr','Franck is a firefighter in Paris. He saves people. He lives at the station with his wife, who is about to have twins. He’s happy. During a call out to a fire, he puts himself in danger, to save his men. He’s going to have to learn to live again and accept to be the one being saved, this time.','/mt9Knw6Cau64d9JZJwOM3LtlXW2.jpg','2018-11-28',116,'Released',NULL,'Through the Fire',484751,2.8976,7.3,'lk5mvHlJMzc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44326,_binary '\0','/vJtR3ywVFDlTaQRamu1NZIgK65d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7211648',4.1,1346,'en','Shook','When Mia, a social media star, becomes the target of an online terror campaign, she has to solve a series of games to prevent people she cares about from getting murdered.','/oa6hI8m0fcQCUXHkgYy7UpYsJ5e.jpg','2021-02-18',88,'Released',NULL,'Shook',786627,2.0955,5.4,'k6mpX9QEb9E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44327,_binary '\0','/fGYTO7BJzKdgLB2CSjNvYISjZtE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7212726',5.5,23982,'hi','सिंम्बा','A corrupt police officer enjoys all the perks of being an immoral and unethical police officer until an event which transforms his life completely and forces him to choose the righteous path.','/3jUuzSymG3uzYM1cUaERsFSZT58.jpg','2018-12-27',159,'Released',NULL,'Simmba',496524,2.5479,6.1,'PtFY3WHztZc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44328,_binary '\0','/gSEfNnQHSi5sMf3RqnXfyCPWnAE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7212754',7.6,46528,'hi','लूडो','Ludo is about the butterfly effect and how, despite all the chaos and crowd of the world, all our lives are inextricably connected. From a resurfaced sex tape to a rogue suitcase of money, four wildly different stories overlap at the whims of fate, chance and one eccentric criminal.','/zWq4HzuIcvoFss4BDkILYZqceuw.jpg','2020-11-12',150,'Released','Ludo is life and life is ludo','Ludo',658412,2.1687,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44329,_binary '\0','/ro5WQZrjuDZpoZ0FaYjNVtFDpzu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7213936',7.4,6443,'no','Hva vil folk si','Sixteen year-old Nisha lives a double life. At home with her family she is the perfect Pakistani daughter, but when out with her friends, she is a normal Norwegian teenager. When her father catches her in bed with her boyfriend, Nisha\'s two worlds brutally collide. To set an example, Nisha\'s parents decide to kidnap her and place her with relatives in Pakistan. Here, in a country she has never been to before, Nisha is forced to adapt to her parents\' culture.','/3aUuot6sJCQqk1bK4UYPs8omMId.jpg','2017-10-06',106,'Released','Sent to a country she\'s never known… she must risk everything to break free.','What Will People Say',469651,2.3006,7.302,'b8_dBOzufWQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44330,_binary '\0','/8xvB5hKnAoJktPgRIVlzTTV9Tmc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7214470',4.2,2384,'de','Heilstätten','Group of Youtubers enter an abandoned surgery ward for 24-hour challenge, hoping to go viral. They will soon learn that they\'re not welcome.','/6BjiB3kju34PRhTHiJD5MTJHTrk.jpg','2018-02-22',89,'Released',NULL,'Haunted Hospital: Heilstatten',455605,2.5991,5.6,'yR1Jc0NVbb4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44331,_binary '\0','/5ORjzDMq26GI82COSnJngXm5Kww.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7214762',7.6,29199,'en','Jim & Andy: The Great Beyond','Offbeat documentarian Chris Smith provides a behind-the-scenes look at how Jim Carrey adopted the persona of idiosyncratic comedian Andy Kaufman on the set of Man on the Moon.','/kKzopOFXz9YfsCTqg3XpF0GoypX.jpg','2017-09-05',93,'Released',NULL,'Jim & Andy: The Great 