ng his journey to recovery; for the first time ever discover the true man behind The King.','/hh8PTJdrYKX5wo50DOipH5yvxYR.jpg','2018-06-22',93,'Released',NULL,'Ronnie Coleman: The King',532944,1.9855,6.7,'HqV1nhrtEOw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44340,_binary '\0','/A3xIs6QYgOOiOK0vqT7boxlAJll.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7218518',7.8,33107,'hi','Pad Man','Upon realizing the extent to which women are affected by their menses, a man sets out to create a sanitary pad machine and to provide inexpensive sanitary pads to the women of rural India.','/guI9SEqpZ6A0mhYpngb1gwAy6N2.jpg','2018-02-09',140,'Released',NULL,'Pad Man',447856,1.9681,7.47,'V4lCZg3GR9c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44341,_binary '\0','/UhZ3uu9J0pnogkWsrHq7PeK7OE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7218732',4.8,5089,'tr','Cingöz Recai','An ex-thief returns for the revange of his father\'s murder makes an intelligent plan to reach the killer, a godfather named as Ghost. During his robbery operations, he plays with the police chief who is trying to stop him. In his final robbery, he finds something different than what he expects, something bigger.','/nCLIYFDgmgohaEsBuGYx7G2XU8k.jpg','2017-10-13',111,'Released',NULL,'Cingöz Recai',474716,1.7136,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44342,_binary '\0','/4Z0gk2tSVQXCdbRc0dqebhlCT8w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7218812',8,1314,'sr','Друга страна свега','For Serbian filmmaker Mila Turajlic, a locked door in her mother\'s apartment in Belgrade provides the gateway to both her remarkable family history and her country\'s tumultuous political inheritance.','/yyViuuxsyPq6YD3xjrdEd411kpu.jpg','2017-09-11',104,'Released',NULL,'The Other Side of Everything',475317,0.9313,7.9,'dlvMsqpC7os','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44343,_binary '\0','/mDU05aMf6kRDm908PDnmhLX489j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7219324',6.5,1939,'fr','La Villa','By a little bay near Marseille lies a picturesque villa owned by an old man. His three children have gathered by his side for his last days. It’s time for them to weigh up what they have inherited of their father’s ideals and the community spirit he created in this magical place. The arrival, at a nearby cove, of a group of boat people will throw these moments of reflection into turmoil.','/gwBFXdxxh3CWtWgPlfT8MxnfApz.jpg','2017-11-29',107,'Released',NULL,'The House by the Sea',468207,1.7045,6.5,'OSB15CJsjBU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44344,_binary '\0','/yBA1EyEzEqZWhZQDJsO12ENAiUg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7220640',6.5,1238,'fi','Oma maa','Anni, a daughter of a wealthy family and used to secure life, falls in love with Veikko, a war invalid of the Continuation War. Anni leaves her past behind her and starts leading the life of a pioneer, in the wild forests of northern Karelia, in a settlement farm. After a rosy start, the fate crushes Anni’s dreams and her love for Veikko is put to a test.','/ee95n13gpoyhFZEakO4jYjfBtrr.jpg','2018-10-26',108,'Released',NULL,'Land of Hope',489138,2.1964,6.9,'DDZblCr6J8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44345,_binary '\0','/8ZK4WYNREjsKMb2KlUujeajNedn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7220696',6.7,1237,'fi','Suomen hauskin mies','Parikka, the actor once called the Funniest Man in Finland, and his troupe are about to be executed for the atrocities committed during the Civil War in Finland. Jaeger Lieutenant Nyborg, an admirer of Parikka, suspects a definite miscarriage of justice. He wants to save the actors. The forthcoming visit of the German General von der Goltz to the prison island provides him with a suitable opportunity. Nyborg suggests that the actors prepare a comical performance for the visitor and not be shot. Instead, they will be given a new trial. Preparing a comedy in the horrible circumstances, in the midst of hunger and death, seems quite an overwhelming task. Only a handful of real actors are still alive, the rest of the troupe consists of stagehands. Parikka has to use all his inventive skills to be able to produce something funny.','/7L0QhTjs5dmOxbPUt5GCsrn0OF1.jpg','2018-03-16',103,'Released','Humor is a matter of death','Laugh or Die',487635,1.0295,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44346,_binary '\0','/paGzFsaSKhzRtYLL7X2MYkQn1iM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7220754',7,12966,'fi','Hevi reissu','Turo is stuck in a small village and the best thing in his life is being the lead vocalist for the amateur metal band Impaled Rektum. He and his bandmates have practiced for 12 years without playing a single gig. The guys get a surprise visitor from Norway -- the promoter for a huge heavy metal music festival -- and decide it\'s now or never. They steal a van, a corpse, and even a new drummer to make their dreams a reality.','/owdppgwOYuuXAXHHY7YvvS0rOJs.jpg','2018-03-09',92,'Released','Better shit thighs than eternal constipation.','Heavy Trip',460048,2.6841,6.9,'XkAAAGEyFS8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44347,_binary '\0','/tayuKWmSxIWqIYttWAc4WNXswlE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7221634',7.2,4597,'ta','மாயவன்','A series of murders are happening in the city, and a cop realises that they are all eerily similar. Can he find out the link and capture the murderer before it is too late?','/5vxSo81VDsCN8QEA11hSA1vcypL.jpg','2017-12-15',129,'Released',NULL,'Maayavan',408927,1.4089,6.706,'_N5OQxa4500','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44348,_binary '\0','/bs3hu2Qi3QEAGbYFhdbWdT2QRLU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7221772',5.3,3582,'en','Seized','Hiding out with his son Taylor on the Mexican coast, Nero hopes to put his violent Special Forces career behind him. But after Nero’s home is attacked and Taylor is abducted, the mysterious Mzamo orders Nero to slaughter the members of three rival crime syndicates. If he fails, Taylor will die. Now, with bullets flying and bodies dropping as Nero completes his mission, he races to find Mzamo’s hideout and seek revenge.','/5YtWsBAv3HvdeTXidyvAsiP4sVu.jpg','2020-10-13',85,'Released','They kidnapped his son. Big mistake.','Seized',572751,4.999,6.714,'kNyEosZQJiA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44349,_binary '\0','/aktrkzeDDt98CV87PyRqDt6IF6W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7221896',1,40073,'tr','Cumali Ceber: Allah Seni Alsın','Funny character \"Cumali Ceber\" goes to a vacation with his unclever friends. The fun saga continues during the holiday.','/pW8BnBaaePoh3CaXrnPuzrsW88V.jpg','2017-08-09',100,'Released',NULL,'Cumali Ceber: Allah Seni Alsın',470121,1.205,1.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44350,_binary '\0','/yksoTTL7o5224cZMFv3oKBVVAkK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7222976',7.8,1268,'kn','Operation ಅಲಮೇಲಮ್ಮ','Purmy\'s life turns upside down when gets framed for kidnapping John, the schoolgoing son of a businessman, after he picks up an abandoned luggage, lying on the street. With the ongoing investigation, a number of twists and turns make the police suspect everyone, including their own kin.','/yC8YpwnvvCzmDAqaitZmHx4IV6Z.jpg','2017-07-21',138,'Released',NULL,'Operation Alamelamma',468269,0.6594,8.143,'_5CcksSThA4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44351,_binary '\0','/UVAmU63ORkBRVtUuT3HK0EP1BU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7225386',7.2,6591,'de','25 km/h','A road movie about two very different brothers who have not seen each other for 20 years: city manager Christian and cabinetmaker Georg, who never left their hometown and took care of their father until his passing. After their fathers funeral, the brothers decide on a whim, and with some help from the alcohol, to fulfil their old dream: travel trough Germany together on their mopeds.','/gux7726i4VdKCGZFyeN6lL4Rvr3.jpg','2018-10-31',116,'Released',NULL,'25 km/h',480736,1.8652,6.8,'VMod_ez5DBY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44352,_binary '\0','/hltwDG1SWl1BqjORA619hIJb4Ui.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7230422',4.7,3259,'en','The Occupant','Desperate to save her sister, Abby takes a dangerous job in the remote Georgian wilderness. Stranded in the mountains after her helicopter crashes, she finds hope through John, a mysterious helper radioing from nearby. As he guides her through the harsh conditions, Abby struggles to survive, and her grip on reality falters until she is faced with an impossible choice.','/hIhJcFP7QhL85ag401W2eJw9ukL.jpg','2025-08-07',104,'Released','Stranded. Isolated. Not alone.','The Occupant',1280444,3.0274,5.5,'1ekDq7HCpKA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44353,_binary '\0','/mjf3c6oWvsaEOipue79mAA31Ic1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7230750',7.3,6301,'en','The Velvet Underground','Experience the iconic rock band\'s legacy in the first major documentary to tell their story. Directed with the era’s avant-garde spirit by Todd Haynes, this kaleidoscopic oral history combines exclusive interviews with dazzling archival footage.','/9uRF6vERWfhlSZKc1sAJTTdG2Ix.jpg','2021-10-15',121,'Released',NULL,'The Velvet Underground',543836,2.1331,6.8,'hWq7a8Tin8g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44354,_binary '\0','/7GZ8JfiUZlbjL6cpfgcDd0Q5k9P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7231194',8.2,4352,'ml','ഈ.മ.യൗ','Set in Chellanam, Kochi, the story revolves around the death of Vavachan Mesthiri in a coastal village. It showcases the events that unfold between two evenings and looks at death from different perspectives.','/8NfC32RyRkgAFzQuW42PW3TigDv.jpg','2018-05-04',120,'Released',NULL,'Ee.Ma.Yau.',490078,1.0764,7.667,'SweKJ8VVXCU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44355,_binary '\0','/TuUQjErEChd9JLlJTYHP7YE3cv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7231342',6.9,4620,'fr','La chute de l\'empire américain','A shy and insecure delivery driver arrives on the scene of a robbery-gone-wrong and picks up two bags of cash and hides them in his truck. He is interrogated by two tough police detectives and manages to evade suspicion but he is warned that whoever owns the money will be looking for it. Only the help of a prostitute and a former biker recently released from jail might get him out of trouble.','/mStaOzKKMOODJGhiQsrhCvIOPmt.jpg','2018-06-28',127,'Released','After the decline...','The Fall of the American Empire',515047,2.4627,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44356,_binary '\0','/7PLVIRnWS7RXc6OODIWjesE5uv8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7231546',6.8,4264,'ml','കായംകുളം കൊച്ചുണ്ണി','The life of Kayamkulam Kochunni, a famed highwayman who robbed from the rich and gave to the poor during the British Raj in the early 19th century Central Travancore.','/abWGyIHAh4hki56tTmVTQ3ZfZDk.jpg','2018-10-11',122,'Released',NULL,'Kayamkulam Kochunni',497294,1.3799,6.306,'0XO03BdZi2Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44357,_binary '\0','/me4zuRMb5pbtqCDrfARVr0CPHEX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7231572',6.2,3213,'en','Not Cinderella\'s Type','Indy lives with her aunt and uncle and believes her life is fine until an accident brings a new guy into her life. Bryant Bailey is not Indy\'s type - she\'s never been into guys like him. But then again, she\'s never really known anyone so stubborn and caring that can also help her discover who she is and what she\'s worth. A modern telling of Cinderella, based on the novel by Jenni James.','/xi9L5tFIKvYehUQQHigbtrjB75I.jpg','2018-02-20',97,'Released',NULL,'Not Cinderella\'s Type',486753,1.9657,6.8,'1jSDMYMRdc8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44358,_binary '\0','/869dEUnuAQJ1sh1PjocaHVoUjQC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7232438',5.9,1430,'th','เพื่อน..ที่ระลึก','Ib and Boum decide to commit suicide together in Bangkok in 1997. After reneging on the promise, the vengeful ghost of Ib returns 20 years later to haunt Boum and her 15 year old daughter, Bell.','/cYJDjGUBvCtJFdlmna6EKgjNon0.jpg','2017-09-07',113,'Released','We promised each other, We would be together forever.','The Promise',470719,2.0982,6.8,'_M4xjmRA0XQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44359,_binary '\0','/91rCHR1bT9rhzxThevgKXyFE65v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7233726',6.7,1759,'ko','국가부도의 날','Only one week left until South Korea will go under sovereign default. Han Shi-hyun is a leader of the monetary policy team at the Bank of Korea. and is assigned to a crisis team.','/nDNLJUIHJEQQ3zMYWbN92R4Fqc5.jpg','2018-11-28',114,'Released','A week before the national bankruptcy.','Default',554137,2.7025,6.8,'u7R3zjLXSp4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44360,_binary '\0','/hdrbEwrE99mq7ZauRSDeFs7PNqI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7233828',4.4,3026,'en','The System','Vastly different lives and perspectives become intertwined after a police officer suffering from reoccurring PTSD mistakenly shoots a deaf African-American kid, exposing layers of racial tension and corruption within the political, judicial and prison system.','/oIhvm79DJcbYmmBjLPbpirBhy3T.jpg','2018-09-28',92,'Released','the system isn\'t broke, it was built this way.','The System',567681,0.7716,4.8,'DPe55B0NOwY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44361,_binary '\0','/khUNaX84khVwij5vKlBblyBqIv7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7235038',3.5,1512,'en','Boo!','A torn suburban family refuses to heed the warning of an innocent prank left upon them which causes an unknown supernatural force to wreak havoc.','/5Lnt9yuLlPwmYW3LLzWmQQWrUmK.jpg','2019-02-28',91,'Released','You\'ve been chosen','Boo!',550273,2.065,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44362,_binary '\0','/YLyORLsYIjC0d1TFBSpJKk7piP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7236034',8.1,38327,'ja','君の膵臓をたべたい','After his classmate and crush is diagnosed with a pancreatic disease, an average high schooler sets out to make the most of her final days.','/qpV8kvRfAntV7D4aOOsLIz7OdPc.jpg','2018-09-01',108,'Released','This is a sto