rden and tell his secrets to the bees, as she once did. The new friendship between the boy and the bee keeper brings his mother Lydia into Jean\'s world.','/Rj6zpHhMU1zFW3v28U4PSRSRgP.jpg','2019-05-03',106,'Released','Some secrets are too powerful to keep.','Tell It to the Bees',475888,5.0925,7.5,'X7nhkNAfHtw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44367,_binary '\0','/d3m59GlnJQdb4taaHYTGVT7c3RJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7242142',7.4,34494,'en','Blindspotting','Collin must make it through his final three days of probation for a chance at a new beginning. He and his troublemaking childhood best friend, Miles, work as movers, and when Collin witnesses a police shooting, the two men’s friendship is tested as they grapple with identity and their changed realities in the rapidly-gentrifying neighborhood they grew up in.','/x4DRZfTqOlmzNWAvy4vcKWkgEGL.jpg','2018-07-20',95,'Released','Change the way you see.','Blindspotting',489930,3.9566,7.3,'-9-HBqVbtTo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44368,_binary '\0','/mh1iPHgPHIBgzGHtbyMjtv0wUz6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7243076',6.7,2029,'en','All of My Heart: Inn Love','Brian and Jenny are preparing for the grand opening of their bed and breakfast, Emily\'s Country Inn, when a big storm hits Buck County. Brian agrees to go back to Wall Street to boost their funds, while Jenny scrambles to keep the opening on track.','/wrAH2x1qPKXzCyBV0gV3sRSvN8I.jpg','2017-10-07',84,'Released',NULL,'All of My Heart: Inn Love',478210,2.6434,6.818,'Ni2y3IRQRZY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44369,_binary '\0','/u5s3cOI19iRIzXXp0xYywCJrh3N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7243686',6.6,2741,'ko','꾼','A group of swindlers unite to hunt down an infamous con man who was known dead, amid their hidden motives and deception.','/wzxsCW4chkwXzfJPLXImpEpjtV.jpg','2017-11-22',117,'Released','Are you in or out?','The Swindlers',478187,2.4618,6.673,'uarm88E9pmg','YouTube','Trailer','20