dship over 45 years.','Cuba and the Cameraman',474433,1.9633,7.5,'lsZ8hDutkeM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44457,_binary '\0','/xjuXNabmOUQwOMEDsMEiXkZY8Lm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7321356',5.7,1562,'es','Tiempo después','Planet Earth, 9177. The remains of humankind live in a post-apocalyptic environment divided into only two social classes: the ruling king and the oligarchs who inhabit the Representative Building and the poor of the world who hardly survive in the slums built around it.','/IMX8OZzL712HLaTUkDBvvHEsvZ.jpg','2018-12-28',96,'Released','It seems never seen, but this is the real apocalypse (which is great!)','Some Time Later',533981,1.4008,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44458,_binary '\0','/vNPY4oCSUp7CxbHkKJNRx1fmCl0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7322224',7.2,220296,'en','Triangle of Sadness','A celebrity model couple are invited on a luxury cruise for the uber-rich, helmed by an unhinged, alcoholic captain. What first appears Instagrammable ends catastrophically, leaving the survivors stranded on a desert island in a struggle of hierarchy.','/k9eLozCgCed5FGTSdHu0bBElAV8.jpg','2022-09-18',147,'Released','Welcome aboard.','Triangle of Sadness',497828,10.7645,7.005,'VDvfFIZQIuQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44459,_binary '\0','/to7WjssA2uAp0bGb5ChfIrgvfU7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7322816',6.4,1694,'te','ఉన్నది ఒకటే జిందగీ','The solid friendship between two men takes a beating when a woman enters their lives.','/kxinY0WuTqZsEVHTPDCwuL5KiHw.jpg','2017-10-27',149,'Released',NULL,'Vunnadhi Okate Zindagi',483839,1.1413,5.538,'FaS_dMl72Qc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44460,_binary '\0','/7Yozxyv12TebzwePC9ym4fzR0zs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7322850',6.3,2736,'te','రాజా ది గ్రేట్','Raja is a blind man who\'s trained by his head constable mother to use his disability to his advantage. Lucky is the pampered daughter of a police officer a