',86,'Released','Based on a True Story','Outback',614626,2.8514,5.9,'yxCtPKqw5Ac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44476,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7336242',6.2,1747,'ml','അനുഗ്രഹീതൻ ആന്‍റണി','A happy-go-lucky Antony disappoints his Dad who was a teacher, so his Dad brings home 2 puppies to insult Antony and show him how thankful Dogs are. Antony despises the Dogs and never leaves any chances to trouble them','/8MNVm3Nitdqv4wCRdpBNehR1e2C.jpg','2021-04-01',120,'Released',NULL,'Anugraheethan Antony',661080,0.7947,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44477,_binary '\0','/f7JX6IbXFsLo66RvAx9bQFZdfQr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7336446',6.3,1675,'tr','Direniş: Karatay','In the middle of the 13th century, following the death of \"The Iron Sultan, Alaeddin Keykubat,\" Mongols attack Anatolian Seljuks to destroy the last power against \"The Great Khan\". Allegiance or independence turns into an issue of debate among the Seljuk statesmen. A secret resistance is possible. A new and stronger state is not a dream. Emir Celaleddin Karatay, Vizier of Seljuks is to sparkle a nationwide resistance. His way is not predictable.','/7lS6qggUjTByMRNl5hyQDQdjiuU.jpg','2018-03-09',118,'Released',NULL,'Resistance: Karatay',499468,2.0131,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44478,_binary '\0','/gdeieUkjFTLP1qfQWzSP9loGVS5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7336470',7.1,2656,'es','Buñuel en el laberinto de las tortugas','Paris, 1930. Luis Buñuel is penniless after the scandal surrounding the release of his last movie. Sculptor Ramón Acín, a good friend, buys a lottery ticket and promises Buñuel that he will pay for his next movie if he wins the prize.','/oHYRYgEcpjD6tXRxMr5xisjJCU4.jpg','2019-04-18',82,'Released',NULL,'Buñuel in the Labyrinth of the Turtles',510318,2.6518,7.004,'__DLy5M3cas','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44479,_binary '\0','/5MyjGUa2piiEyNH4UcLp3YV9cwo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7336572',6.3,4222,'zh','大師兄','A soldier-turned-high school teacher uses unusual methods to reach to a class of poor students, while dealing with a greedy entrepreneur and his gang of fighters as well as the government.','/z6Y6uQn2fORr7o43EggQrTsp08o.jpg','2018-08-16',111,'Released','Friend. Teacher. Protector.','Big Brother',504056,6.2469,7.6,'7Fm6WFrhRKs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44480,_binary '\0','/cUkpSTVt0iUbIVFDxvUGs747OMW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7339248',6.6,44186,'en','The Art of Self-Defense','Casey is attacked at random on the street and enlists in a local dojo led by a charismatic and mysterious Sensei in an effort to learn how to defend himself. What he uncovers is a sinister world of fraternity, violence and hypermasculinity and a woman fighting for her place in it.','/bTq793Qwl3tCXb94zrDPAwppbsC.jpg','2019-07-12',104,'Released',NULL,'The Art of Self-Defense',480001,5.4268,6.585,'7Bms6Hba-3A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44481,_binary '\0','/h22RbWCKXoFGpAcdbBPGpIkG75H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7339792',5.8,3795,'en','Unbroken: Path to Redemption','Zamperini returns to California where he wound up marrying Cynthia Applewhite while wrestling with untreated PTSD, suffering constant nightmares, angry, bitter and deeply depressed, his wife convinces Zamperini to attend the 1949 Billy Graham Crusade.','/oD5RxDJGdJgpX8X61QMX0qNyYYu.jpg','2018-09-14',98,'Released','When the war ended, the battle began.','Unbroken: Path to Redemption',506680,4.3615,6.7,'7CI9-LYwUZ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44482,_binary '\0','/5nkKy7eEDsXqsxFLJy3GxZhE90J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7339826',7.4,11273,'ja','さよならの朝に約束の花をかざろう','Fleeing the war, the immortal Maquia, graced with eternal youth, finds a baby abandoned in the forest and decides to raise it as her own child, sparking a moving story between a mortal and a being who does not age.','/hL3NqRE2ccR4Y2sYSJTrma