 Tsoi. Together with friends, they will change the destiny of rock’n’roll in the Soviet Union.','/4rOkRmIhoPoyKUa5kDrIPizcglk.jpg','2018-06-07',126,'Released',NULL,'Leto',502897,2.712,7.388,'0FFqgEFtwmI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44487,_binary '\0','/k09W6niO9wXlKaj5G1HLQXzMxxa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7343574',5.8,1318,'fr','Break','Lucie, a young dancer suffers an accident. When she wakes up from a coma, she and her partner start training for a dance show. On the way, she starts looking for her estranged father, a path that might lead her to life-changing love.','/qwK4PMUppMKlm2CwspO8EKuhj7y.jpg','2018-07-18',96,'Released',NULL,'Break',525938,1.5513,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44488,_binary '\0','/56EPAmrflwjPA3LnoSlmeVs9Eff.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7343732',6.4,1752,'pl','7 uczuć','Fear, anger, sadness, joy, disgust, envy, shame. Adaś Miauczyński goes back to his childhood days when, like most of us, he used to find it problematic to name the emotions that accompanied him. To improve the quality of his adult life, he decides to return to that time – which proves not so carefree after all – to learn how to experience the seven basic emotions. This extremely unpredictable journey into the past features an abundance of hilarious, even comical, situations but is also filled with lots of touching moments and food for thought.','/ac1DIjgHV8ogmuXvDqO2wsG2XLq.jpg','2018-10-12',116,'Released','We are all badly educated','7 Emotions',548762,1.4675,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(44489,_binary '\0','/yqMKxloKPFDXFo1FxiPZ0Or7wp4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt7343740',6.6,3088,'en','Days of the Bagnold Summer','Sue works in a library. Daniel eats crisps and listens to Metallica. This was the summer Daniel was due to spend with his father and his father\'s new wife in Florida. But when they cancel his trip at the last minute, Sue and Daniel suddenly face the prospect of six long weeks