st after a breakup. Tara, a spunky barista, dreams of a life beyond the coffee shop. Awkward Garrett pines for Tara while trying to keep his adopt-a-dog business afloat. Dax is a man-child and leader of the aspiring rock band Frunk. Grace and Kurt anxiously await the arrival of their adoptive daughter, Amelia. Walter, an aging, lonely widower, loses his dog Mabel when she runs off. The beloved canines in their lives soon start to influence their careers, friendships, and romantic relationships in funny and unexpected ways.','/g6bzaEu7wpNu5PPczMqzOBw05TQ.jpg','2018-08-10',112,'Released','It\'s going to be off the leash.','Dog Days',477510,4.9965,6.619,'fAfqqHwgI1U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44512,_binary '\0','/9s30XbfHZB9gcoQpm1P3i1hcGgH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7367960',7.1,7787,'da','Ternet Ninja','A possessed Ninja doll teams up with a teenage boy to avenge the murder of a poor child factory worker.','/dzN5xbp73TI7pjEqZ66ECNxdWJl.jpg','2018-12-25',83,'Released',NULL,'Checkered Ninja',523536,4.1274,7.5,'3V1CKYQRS40','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44513,_binary '\0','/3kDL6wsIAk8IdyNg0QoQtwSjeI3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7369550',3.9,2136,'en','Spy Intervention','When the world\'s greatest spy meets the woman of his dreams, he abandons his adventurous existence and settles into the security of suburbia.','/srS8rvH1SwKcpeYuzUqSNBU1llH.jpg','2020-02-14',93,'Released',NULL,'Spy Intervention',663255,1.7504,4.7,'4DBeCeZd59s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44514,_binary '\0','/7NUyoeR4UffRt206c9B9On9bkzV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7369722',4.3,1997,'en','The Sandman','A monster from a little girl\'s nightmares comes to life and attacks anyone who would harm her.','/iak7mWZNIoYYS6KI4bzcIKONX2w.jpg','2017-10-14',90,'Released','Don\'t Fall Asleep','The Sandman',480410,2.1714,5.6,'rVwaKymb-6Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44515,_binary '\0','/yVs8AUOIQ2ymKc