10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44589,_binary '\0','/axa5Xj124VTDoeOzOsQAlSEkdEP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7453138',4.6,1225,'en','Her Name Was Christa','Stephen is a socially awkward, middle-aged telemarketer and is desperately alone. At the suggestion of a co-worker, he goes out into the night to find a prostitute for \"The Girlfriend Experience.\" He meets Christa, a streetwise call girl who\'s happy to fulfill his needs, and something unexpected happens. What starts as a business agreement blossoms into true love. But what happens when death enters the picture? How far would you go to keep the one person you\'ve always wanted?','/87PYkUm7Oi85BuyzCQG7iv3t0f7.jpg','2020-02-14',120,'Released','Love Conquers All.....Sometimes Even Death.','Her Name Was Christa',619926,1.3986,5.2,'Va0xxeLVYU0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44590,_binary '\0','/1PiZCvIXL0AgeRcUuO9CegSvrG6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7453418',5.6,4421,'en','Nekrotronic','A man discovers that he is part of a secret sect of magical beings who hunt down and destroy demons in the internet.','/zT0G9rNziv26mx5Q2QS1ecwzaQ6.jpg','2018-10-01',99,'Released','Evil gets rebooted','Nekrotronic',506775,2.8799,5.861,'Gj2YypZFkfs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44591,_binary '\0','/cPZMjrWmuQa5h2FxoftAPA5YHDq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7455076',6.5,2889,'en','Benjamin','Benjamin, a rising star filmmaker, is on the brink of premiering his difficult second film No Self at the London Film Festival when Billie, his hard drinking publicist, introduces him to a mesmeric French musician called Noah.','/gtcbJTGIGya6vRvSeIasRPGTaMC.jpg','2019-03-15',85,'Released','It\'s about my inability to love. But I\'m fine now.','Benjamin',545567,1.591,6.1,'2X-Z1N4sI2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44592,_binary '\0','/xqHgdHqW2zYKP5loe1o7ScccebV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7455754',7.8,22688,'en','The Game Changers','From the UFC Octagon in Las Vegas and the anthropology lab at Dartmouth, to a strongman gym in Berlin and the bushlands of Zimbabwe, the world is introduced to elite athletes, special ops soldiers, visionary scientists, cultural icons, and everyday heroes—each on a mission to create a seismic shift in the way we eat and live.','/eufF3xEif5EZ1gTjdubw3KWh9xU.jpg','2019-09-16',88,'Released','Armed with the truth','The Game Changers',463088,4.3349,7.3,'bMQ1rzz9t5w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44593,_binary '\0','/xavGKawUyXPWAa6JTUkFzaRXMPF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7456310',6.7,109665,'en','Anna','Beneath Anna Poliatova\'s striking beauty lies a secret that will unleash her indelible strength and skill to become one of the world\'s most feared government assassins.','/2U0oAVAE0lDRhNmJPPYhDW9kQ8t.jpg','2019-06-19',119,'Released','Never make the weapon the target','Anna',484641,15.3542,6.7,'oZSMV-NDH4w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44594,_binary '\0','/cGUxPXVZF5n5P09dnlhWC8bLVp7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7456312',4.4,17662,'en','The Last Thing He Wanted','At the turning point of the Iran-Contra affair, Elena McMahon, a fearless investigative journalist covering the 1984 US presidential campaign, puts herself in danger when she abandons her assigned task in order to fulfill the last wish of her ailing father, a mysterious man whose past activities she barely knows.','/4mDbGqi8mloDdxkviq13SKCfuFH.jpg','2020-02-14',116,'Released',NULL,'The Last Thing He Wanted',505225,5.7186,4.9,'KmrU6gMc1Lc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44595,_binary '\0','/18OyxPrTmz7YQoWTjY8qXGSdRz1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7456468',7.1,1220,'ja','あさがおと加瀬さん。','Yamada may be shy and rather clumsy, but the flower gardens at her school have always brought her happiness. Suddenly, a different sort of beauty catches her eye—the vivacious track star, Kase-san. Although the two girls don\'t seem to have much in common, they soon start a romance where each must learn an important lesson in tending their budding relationship. Can the two girls, so different from each other, learn how to make their first love blossom?','/yUWhMaXRFTPxR0QClWEUxVeHrzj.jpg','2018-06-09',58,'Released',NULL,'Kase-san and Morning Glories',515295,2.3698,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44596,_binary '\0','/mF9H2ivdBL1wg5NrvCaTvpWaHof.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7456534',5.8,2595,'en','The New Romantic','In order to escape her looming post-graduation fate that includes student debt and zero romantic prospects, Blake Conway becomes a sugar baby. As the aspiring journalist and hopeless romantic documents the adventure, she sets out on a quest to figure out if society is right to judge these women and if her own self worth comes with a price.','/qh6oz3RoKwTIqvcFLQ1dEqNWCCB.jpg','2018-10-19',82,'Released',NULL,'The New Romantic',497864,2.4943,6.352,'9nwUFUOfigk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44597,_binary '\0','/ujd2rMIVb0Z8orWrEbMWdJsBRYd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7458762',6.9,24566,'fr','Le Chant du loup','Shown from the perspective of a young submariner with unusually sensitive hearing and uncannily precise sound recognition. The fate of many often depends on his ability, and one time, whilst highly stressed, he makes a incorrect call which put his entire crew in mortal danger. Trying to regain the confidence of his comrades, he conducts an unauthorised investigation of an apparent plot which, it turns out, risks escalating into a nuclear apocalypse. Suddenly working under pressure with the fleet admiral, they must do whatever is necessary, even the unthinkable, to prevent a nuclear war, since a confirmed nuclear strike order cannot be countermanded.','/8bxIzp9w9l9ZzGVwNaIKOaem05A.jpg','2019-02-20',116,'Released',NULL,'The Wolf\'s Call',484468,7.3392,7.517,'a9Gz7Bg07u8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44598,_binary '\0','/k7GNUAh4YjVIT1xlqKjdyT4HQLD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7459182',5.3,1828,'es','Ola de crímenes','Leyre lives a quiet and comfortable life which ends abruptly when an act of rage of her teenage son leads her to protect him by any means necessary.','/6iK0eUBcBVT2LkcFXVpMB8gz92e.jpg','2018-10-04',98,'Released',NULL,'Crime Wave',529207,1.5366,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44599,_binary '\0','/nSLlOUplaeDz1rkohDSK8A6kXYo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7460806',5.8,8359,'en','The Festival','After Nick\'s girlfriend dumps him, his best mate Shane has the perfect antidote to his break-up blues: three days at an epic music festival.','/zokQMbuBst9z0dP5UKi9EkCSSnV.jpg','2018-08-14',98,'Released',NULL,'The Festival',502385,2.7839,5.9,'3grSzHB0jm0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44600,_binary '\0','/ibNQu25Rz1fZuw6WHm4StII2TkR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7461200',5.7,5233,'en','The Oath','In a politically-divided United States, a man struggles to make it through the Thanksgiving holiday without destroying his family.','/kHB7Nq93pQxGOit1Lyz1ELfUvy0.jpg','2018-10-12',93,'Released','Nothing is more American than family drama','The Oath',520596,2.8323,5.6,'4I8x79pgqok','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44601,_binary '\0','/4AT2EM0wOkDB6kuClleU6ElIHyl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7461272',6.5,7546,'en','Call Jane','A married woman with an unwanted pregnancy lives in a time in America where she can\'t get a legal abortion and works with a group of suburban women to find help.','/hXm5yZO67InzxS9FPfulmxfPrCE.jpg','2022-10-27',121,'Released','You are not alone.','Call Jane',579496,5.1045,6.5,'U-1pUnTsSQc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44602,_binary '\0','/f6WSV0lsuOub8lgPBHrFlOhTGUk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7461372',3.3,4916,'en','The Dawn','Following the murder of her family at the hands of her father in the wake of World War I, a young woman is sent to live in a convent. However, the demons that plagued her father follow, reawakening the nightmares of her past.','/3gxznVkacYCFlaYTNbUBvyxg6bf.jpg','2019-09-27',90,'Released',NULL,'The Dawn',662821,1.6096,5.9,'lhGFU2mRGlM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44603,_binary '\0','/djE6IF5IPJPmeNsQnxpKxlrtpD7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7461686',6.7,16827,'en','Daddio','A woman taking a cab ride from JFK airport engages in a conversation with the driver about the important relationships in their lives.','/dyrCsHUhOfpuci51lHcdAnO3db0.jpg','2024-06-27',100,'Released','Never forget where you came from.','Daddio',843416,4.6669,6.3,'PJrr2amlFyc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44604,_binary '\0','/64GBB3Qp1sG9AJZediJKEjUkUwI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7463730',5.6,2573,'hi','जंगली','A veterinarian returns home to his father\'s elephant reserve where he encounters and fights an international poachers\' racket.','/d5Jw6eXO3Qv9qu8oy5V4WCDDvki.jpg','2019-03-29',115,'Released',NULL,'Junglee',560964,2.0508,6.752,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44605,_binary '\0','/iQ0YoGb4EE411qfofLvcZZ2vnZS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7464158',7.5,1673,'ar','فوتوكوبي','Mahmoud is man in his late 50s, who owns a photocopying store. When he comes across a topic about dinosaurs, he becomes obsessed with searching for the causes of its extinction, which leads him to rediscover love, friendship, paternity and the real meaning of life.','/4MN25Eh01uVHiualNhqjmZVuqcN.jpg','2017-12-20',91,'Released','Why dinosaurs became extinct?','Photocopy',483389,1.3486,7.3,'qF_13qTiV5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44606,_binary '\0','/97NFoAp9JdgXqBQG6aoUprF6zbS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7464188',6.1,15771,'en','In Fabric','A haunting ghost story set against the backdrop of a busy winter sales period in a department store, following the life of a cursed dress as it passes from person to person, with devastating consequences.','/puGJX5Ko9KUMWM5cGqPZ5