 smuggle illicit cargo to save her brother from a deadly prison gang. With FBI operatives hot on her trail, Sally\'s conscience is challenged when the final package turns out to be a teenage girl.','/2ahZgaFAbWoKMfJHhmhZDrdStgD.jpg','2022-07-29',115,'Released',NULL,'Paradise Highway',939979,7.2203,5.874,'wXp-lj9luJU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44614,_binary '\0','/uhKzFHO5DkZNuTQU6oDDdHBETdc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7470414',4.3,3765,'ml','നീരാളി','A pleasant road trip takes a nightmarish turn for gemologist Sunny George when he meets with an accident. As his life hangs in the balance on the edge of a cliff in the middle of nowhere, Sunny must not only contend with the great adversity he is in, but the adversaries lurking in the shadows as well.','/vrhB420zPmWvxKHLVRa44WzISnA.jpg','2018-07-13',128,'Released','Grasp of the octopus...','Nieraali',502963,1.1148,4.214,'6CL8RdmcYwQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44615,_binary '\0','/x6Xqzy05My10v1PPtmxixLrstq6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7471004',6.7,3086,'ta','அவள்','Two families have a tough time dealing with a revenge-seeking spirit, which is strangely connected with one of its members','/rMaUdHC6NzpYSis0YTSVc0gPtVM.jpg','2017-11-02',136,'Released',NULL,'Aval',480308,1.6003,5.767,'Ft1KvQNteYY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44616,_binary '\0','/qjLkeDuzGO6GxKyUHFq0UsDTK7M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7472352',7.3,6040,'en','Shirkers','In 1992, teenager Sandi Tan shot Singapore\'s first indie road movie with her enigmatic American mentor Georges – who then vanished with all the footage. Twenty years later, the 16mm film is recovered, sending Tan, now a novelist in Los Angeles, on a personal odyssey in search of Georges\' vanishing footprints.','/spd1fZNePSQFRhNam66jx3ZMoxF.jpg','2018-01-21',97,'Released','There are movers, there are shakers, and there are shirkers.','Shirkers',489994,1.2124,7.2,'u3wPWCj2L6I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44617,_binary '\0','/wPkXmwJLqxtDEKpawrvKFiBWtBH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7473716',4.2,2753,'en','The Gallows Act II','When Auna Rue transfers to a prestigious new acting school, she encounters a malevolent spirit after participating in a viral challenge.','/j6Nx0wyGb07FH9d8ETW7bNLY3uy.jpg','2019-10-25',100,'Released','Evil chooses you.','The Gallows Act II',505060,2.4699,4.9,'J0zlstQTq-g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44618,_binary '\0','/rxYjrlnDWTE8OdhthCfUrEHpUBe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7473890',6.2,4860,'en','King Lear','An aging King invites disaster, when he abdicates to his corrupt, toadying daughters, and rejects his loving and honest one.','/dHd0YS1PGxjfZCVbYi9Hetg7zZd.jpg','2018-05-28',115,'Released',NULL,'King Lear',513427,5.0116,6,'ETNWHHczj1w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44619,_binary '\0','/6ZIx11OQh6nrMRBNeVZuqLRNhqq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7475206',5.9,1756,'it','Non ci resta che il crimine','In the present day, three friends to make ends meet invent a \"criminal tour\" for the places which were scenes of the Banda della Magliana criminal acts, even with vintage clothes. Suddenly they are catapulted in the 1982, during the Spain World Cup, facing the real Banda della Magliana, which at that time had the control over illegal bets.','/aDGL90fBZs0vNDdl0qPxmCMlkW.jpg','2019-01-10',98,'Released',NULL,'All You Need is Crime',563907,1.523,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44620,_binary '\0','/uuL8fJmcWgsz7TmqU5ylK3Hxq5W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7475540',7.3,1492,'en','The Price of Everything','Featuring collectors, dealers, auctioneers and a rich range of artists, including market darlings George Condo, Jeff Koons, Gerhard Richter and Njideka Akunyili Crosby, this documentary examines the role of art and artistic passion in today’s money-driven, consumer-based society.','/uadzQutAibRCSuCN53laPmFJX7Z.jpg','2018-11-16',98,'Released','Great art. Mad money. No rules.','The Price of Everything',489987,1.62,7.1,'2mbqcY9g5CM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44621,_binary '\0','/eeEvswxQwXxhAoXBStsTazN6Bi6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7475578',6.8,40252,'en','Munich - The Edge of War','At the tense 1938 Munich Conference, former friends who now work for opposing governments become reluctant spies racing to expose a Nazi secret.','/1SOiUTDnwW9gU4GzSIsOCQUlHJF.jpg','2021-12-31',130,'Released','Secrets. Betrayal. Treason.','Munich - The Edge of War',760336,4.9308,6.9,'AQ7x8odi-OU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44622,_binary '\0','/hljeAZsHfXScqbHsAmxUGqcCx8L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7476116',6.9,13309,'fr','Le Grand Bain','40-year-old Bertrand has been suffering from depression for the last two years and is barely able to keep his head above water. Despite the medication he gulps down all day, every day, and his wife\'s encouragement, he is unable to find any meaning in his life. Curiously, he will end up finding this sense of purpose at the swimming pool, by joining an all-male synchronised swimming team.','/zsGYDF6nRC8RsT1MnQTrH2IMVDC.jpg','2018-10-24',122,'Released',NULL,'Sink or Swim',484482,5.4272,6.922,'OBwb7GuKVgA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44623,_binary '\0','/wXsDDQ4JEdvzL19DUsbsKzlPq9f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7476236',8,11184,'en','Minding the Gap','Three young men bond together to escape volatile families in their Rust Belt hometown. As they face adult responsibilities, unexpected revelations threaten their decade-long friendship.','/uOu2YgrryHD1UlngykzTodAxGdC.jpg','2018-08-17',93,'Released',NULL,'Minding the Gap',489985,1.9194,7.7,'n5Vm_Awe3bw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44624,_binary '\0','/q0uedFYoulQV9roezvB3EQJWjd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7476438',4.7,3869,'en','14 Cameras','When a family of four rent a beautiful house for their summer vacation, the price seems too good to be true. Unbeknownst to them, the lascivious owner has set up a series of spy cams throughout the house, documenting their most intimate moments and live streaming them to the dark web.','/oAwp3GNmrDFjhqO6kAKnyPhh2Ew.jpg','2018-07-13',90,'Released','He’s not the only one watching…','14 Cameras',534235,1.8171,5,'_HqBKYe0DqA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44625,_binary '\0','/aqO2s3YK8eoJdN7WNq9qSWV5tCU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7476524',4,2945,'en','The Drone','A newlywed couple is terrorized by a consumer drone that has become sentient with the consciousness of a deranged serial killer.','/nutNpufkoDvtWLA3KGiq0DTDotj.jpg','2019-11-22',90,'Released','Your Remote Has No Control','The Drone',579091,2.0902,3.8,'L6Q1L-evy9s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44626,_binary '\0','/mSIAnXAmeLki7FnU8YpzGBFwjh9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7476810',6.7,1909,'zh','海上浮城','A pig farmer, a busboy, a salon owner, an expat architect and a jaded rich girl cross paths as thousands of dead pigs float down the Yangtze River toward Shanghai.','/bF6jJa2ChLeEnFoJ1gAcngttQV6.jpg','2018-01-19',122,'Released',NULL,'Dead Pigs',491305,1.8471,6.7,'hOfBVt40Fg4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44627,_binary '\0','/wJYYlHZ2GHgcWo9BX9RtmzhZpC8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7476946',6.2,1220,'ja','リバーズ・エッジ','High schooler Haruna befriends loner Yamada, then is drawn into the tangled relationship between him, a model and the girl who loves him unreasonably.','/bRDRZkZsw3GUspQgjDaTBkFAokl.jpg','2018-02-16',118,'Released','An unknown dead body left by the riverside leads them to sharing a secret and creating a distorted bond.','River\'s Edge',487358,3.9837,6.077,'9xWJfQ-ObF0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44628,_binary '\0','/tUfYCSqZ4efMVd84hEF5Uc2MsBO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7477068',6.5,2342,'de','Der Trafikant','Vienna, 1937, on the eve of the annexation of Austria into Nazi Germany. The young and inexperienced Franz Huchel begins to learn about both the joys and hardships of life by working as an apprentice to the mutilated war veteran Otto Trsnjek in a small tobacco shop, where he meets the famous psychiatrist Sigmund Freud, a regular customer, who will become a valuable friend in times of chaos and uncertainty.','/x7BiptuHXVNYbfMcVSgqtgifWiN.jpg','2018-10-12',109,'Released',NULL,'The Tobacconist',538061,2.3467,6.4,'r_eqtpuEAJE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44629,_binary '\0','/zLWReMiAMwrfqQ3ULq6MK2rZp99.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7477310',7,9550,'de','Der Vorname','The family dinner at Stephan and Elisabeth could have been wonderful. But when Thomas announces that he and his pregnant girlfriend Anna are going to call their son Adolf, the hosts and the family friend René are stuck in the throat.','/uJ8MvRQdlCIvqKiRBwW9Zxxa9N7.jpg','2018-10-18',91,'Released',NULL,'How About Adolf?',514124,1.8346,6.8,'0DchYvIRKR8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44630,_binary '\0','/oD2c58G93gx6NXEiowVsHWUORAb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7478314',6.1,1864,'en','The Pay Day','A broke and frustrated IT technician decides to embark on a one woman heist to steal valuable data worth millions on the black market.','/kJAGFtUoA7ShKviUKCvQBht1Wol.jpg','2022-11-11',93,'Released','Two working class chancers. One big score.','The Pay Day',1033758,1.009,4.2,'5KJngobrehM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44631,_binary '\0','/lVLc3KbXJ2TNrtQ5AyhPjiqnrX8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7479784',7.3,4103,'zh','血觀音','Madame Tang colludes and mediates between the government and the private businesses for the benefits of her all-female family. One case does not go according to plan, and an entire family close to Madame Tang fall victim to a gruesome murder. Ambition, desire and lust eventually change Tang\'s relationships with her own family forever.','/rlhZfsmfNW