3994,'es','Carmen y Lola','Carmen is a gypsy teenager, destined to live a life that is repeated every generation: getting married and raising as many children as possible. But one day she meets Lola, an uncommon gypsy who dreams about going to university, does graffiti and is very different. Carmen quickly develops a complicity with Lola and discovers a world that, inevitably, leads them to be rejected by their families.','/wS5tfqh2vPVaV8PZASZNRYAQgMr.jpg','2018-09-07',103,'Released','Family or love? You can\'t have both...','Carmen & Lola',519091,2.502,7,'iO_PZqilExE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44637,_binary '\0','/htBUhLSS7FfHtydgYxUWjL3J1Q1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7488208',6.3,27434,'en','Over the Moon','Fueled by memories of her mother, resourceful Fei Fei builds a rocket to the moon on a mission to prove the existence of a legendary moon goddess.','/lG0TF0wj1n9p9CPy5xlIUIkF56a.jpg','2020-10-16',95,'Released','Believing is Everything','Over the Moon',560050,5.4518,7.182,'26DIABx44Tw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44638,_binary '\0','/vbQiBFEAffZOjuwF1xe11LPJMl9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7489816',6.8,18831,'fr','Le Jeu','To spice up a dinner party, old friends agree to share every private message that pops up on their phones -- with disastrous results.','/xGCN6PLWaxlRzNoie3WEnnoxlGK.jpg','2018-10-17',93,'Released','No luck, you have a message.','Nothing to Hide',487476,2.9011,6.6,'FbhaeiIb5ss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44639,_binary '\0','/w7dClII2GoesVsGzdfYUp6Esqkr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7490256',4.9,1525,'en','27: Gone Too Soon','Brian Jones, Jimi Hendrix, Janis Joplin and Jim Morrison all died at the age of 27 between 1969 and 1971. At the time, the coincidence gave rise to some comment, but it was not until the death of Kurt Cobain, about two and a half decades later, that the idea of a \"27 Club\" began to catch on in public perception, reignited with the death of Amy Winehouse in 2011. Through interviews with people who knew them, such as music stars, critics, medical experts and unseen footage, the lives, music, and artistry of those who died at 27 are investigated with a bid to find answers.','/q1Wn0HhpsSP70YFHBe2EcrdEH7Y.jpg','2018-03-26',70,'Released',NULL,'27: Gone Too Soon',521669,1.8796,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44640,_binary '\0','/fe1hQtljvzp3xa85AvKGiiFDjQu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7491144',7,3947,'fr','Amanda','David, who gets by doing odd jobs, meets Léna, who has just moved up to Paris, and falls in love. But soon after, his life is brutally interrupted by the sudden death of his sister. Beyond the shock, and the pain, David now finds himself alone with his young niece Amanda to care for.','/eyebNlYE2iV3D0xLrjMTigTuHmN.jpg','2018-11-21',107,'Released',NULL,'Amanda',485166,3.6057,7.046,'cyGC0W8PfoI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44641,_binary '\0','/t8MKoO7g0PiBI3IbvSFnlaSECF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7492998',6.3,1556,'en','I Am Elizabeth Smart','The story of Elizabeth Smart\'s kidnapping and captivity, as told from her perspective.','/uXsHOFJ81VHgNdJ0NqAbGC6907f.jpg','2017-11-18',85,'Released',NULL,'I Am Elizabeth Smart',481847,2.3208,6.9,'Kc7rSJSaPA0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44642,_binary '\0','/euc8eHdZq5tCas9aqPOWoHCGeV3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7493370',6,6491,'fr','Adults in the Room','A universal theme: a story of people trapped in an inhuman network of power. The brutal circle of the Eurogroup meetings, who impose on Greece the dictatorship of austerity, where humanity and compassion are utterly disregarded. A claustrophobic trap with no way out, exerting pressures on the protagonists which finally divide them.','/t6DCAt2SzK7ST26yrt3VheGHoOl.jpg','2019-10-03',124,'Released',NULL,'Adults in the Room',512056,2.9112,6.532,'OHRr06hkmyA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44643,_binary '\0','/xuGXZ8Ban6QxF6djLb2sO18Simp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7500618',4.9,1694,'de','Die letzte Party deines Lebens','Julia and her friends, celebrating their high school graduation in Croatia, find themselves the targets of a masked killer who begins picking them off, one by one.','/4ShNMA2iIjd2BdkVssXu22Md52b.jpg','2018-03-22',90,'Released',NULL,'Party Hard, Die Young',492118,1.8134,4.6,'KBedLpydRu8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44644,_binary '\0','/1IAoK7OVmo5erbrHrch6jMErMJn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7502234',7.2,2097,'fr','Les Chatouilles','Odette is a 8-yr-old girl who loves to dance and draw. Once she has become an adult, Odette realizes she was abused, and immerses herself body and soul in her career as a dancer while trying to deal with her past.','/yDEbvbal7kmap5oxyekJ05EsNdi.jpg','2018-11-14',103,'Released',NULL,'Little Tickles',484747,2.7762,7.371,'2bryzG7bG3c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44645,_binary '\0','/xA2JccuBKVX2NBe6hapI2DbRAUQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7502322',6.4,2461,'ja','マスカレード・ホテル','A serial (3) killer leaves a GPS code of his next target with each victim - this time Hotel Cortesia Tokyo. A detective goes undercover as hotel staff - haircut, manners etc.','/3goiPN2ov4O4FbeBCBndOAIGZDI.jpg','2019-03-21',133,'Released',NULL,'Masquerade Hotel',554808,2.0448,6.7,'SVEvPyOrCeI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44646,_binary '\0','/1GZCV0dwIoAn6jpWPfVAbeMTVC2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7504726',6.7,65101,'en','The Call of the Wild','Buck is a big-hearted dog whose blissful domestic life is turned upside down when he is suddenly uprooted from his California home and transplanted to the exotic wilds of the Yukon during the Gold Rush of the 1890s. As the newest rookie on a mail delivery dog sled team—and later its leader—Buck experiences the adventure of a lifetime, ultimately finding his true place in the world and becoming his own master.','/33VdppGbeNxICrFUtW2WpGHvfYc.jpg','2020-02-19',100,'Released','Based on the legendary novel.','The Call of the Wild',481848,12.0942,7.504,'5P8R2zAhEwg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44647,_binary '\0','/sdL37sfUBth7mdkAolI83bXAl7L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7504818',7.1,46553,'en','Ron\'s Gone Wrong','In a world where walking, talking, digitally connected bots have become children\'s best friends, an 11-year-old finds that his robot buddy doesn\'t quite work the same as the others do.','/plzgQAXIEHm4Y92ktxU6fedUc0x.jpg','2021-10-14',107,'Released','Best Friend Forever* (*battery life may vary).','Ron\'s Gone Wrong',482321,14.6494,7.849,'8I8nMtzN05s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44648,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7505170',4.2,1238,'en','Fragmentary','Ben Sanderson believes he can travel to an alternate reality when he drinks alcohol, to see the love of his life, who was brutally murdered in a home invasion two years prior. As Ben starts to get a hold of his new found ability, a new threat surfaces that may kill him before he can seek the truth.','/kw7CtWBCCqcoWJ0qwbQyPa6LR6n.jpg','2019-10-21',89,'Released','The Problem With Drinking is the Mourning After','Fragmentary',643930,0.7632,3.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44649,_binary '\0','/lbwMolS5IpGE6J99XBpkLLhW9wb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7507924',3.6,1279,'en','Alpha Code','Johana, a woman with no past, is hiding from a UN Agent Bowie a head of secret space program. On her run she meets Martin, and with help of Bowie’s ex-colleague Lance they both help Martin to find his half alien daughter. One of the most important parts of the movie is a demonstration of a real meditation which the main protagonist uses to tune in to a higher frequency, and enables him to use telepathy and more.','/mdqU9Jk3wGpITuFn707JSFTQhxe.jpg','2020-07-01',97,'Released',NULL,'Alpha Code',724315,2.5893,5.4,'ADvZRRY-uFM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44650,_binary '\0','/lfVOlFeX6juf6j3V50g3zkB30MM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7508630',5.3,1231,'ta','கீ','A hacker gets the shock of his life when another hacker tries to destroy his dear ones.','/enMQ5OwSio2uaZBLIWde1B7SlSp.jpg','2019-05-10',133,'Released',NULL,'Kee',412177,1.1843,6.067,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44651,_binary '\0','/twsxsfao6ZOVvT8LfudH603MMi6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7510222',6.2,84604,'en','Despicable Me 4','Gru and Lucy and their girls—Margo, Edith and Agnes—welcome a new member to the Gru family, Gru Jr., who is intent on tormenting his dad. Gru also faces a new nemesis in Maxime Le Mal and his femme fatale girlfriend Valentina, forcing the family to go on the run.','/wWba3TaojhK7NdycRhoQpsG0FaH.jpg','2024-06-20',94,'Released','Things just got a little more despicable.','Despicable Me 4',519182,29.1758,7,'LtNYaH61dXY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44652,_binary '\0','/tYm0Yk9k9W0hb9Xy4coOXqoGfNT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7510346',3.9,17790,'en','The Turning','A young woman quits her teaching job to become a private tutor and governess for two wealthy young kids, but soon starts to suspect there’s more to their house than meets the eye.','/uiMHiHp9eAjJty8rddoUnL9G5fU.jpg','2020-01-23',94,'Released','Watch the children with care.','The Turning',492611,7.4041,5.702,'rl33gU2APIs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44653,_binary '\0','/mkXmBtlWqgm1ULTH08RttMdpB4a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7510798',5.7,4339,'ta','மாரி 2','After falling off the radar for a few years, Maari is back in the fray doing what he does best: taking trouble by the horns and being a total bad-ass. This time around, he is facing off against a formidable opponent named Beeja, who would stop at nothing until he sees Maari\'s downfall.','/tThalcNdwf4RLwMis5RMXebtQzI.jpg','2018-12-21',150,'Released',NULL,'Maari 2',493178,1.6351,5.378,'ORZltL9glEA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44654,_binary '\0','/aaITaV1leLj2qXBaMwVWo2SK7b8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7511008',4.7,2607,'fr','Paradise Beach','A team of former robbers arrived at Paradise: Phuket, southern Thailand. Now traders, they are happy days. Until the day when the devil arrives: Mehdi, sentenced to 15 years in prison during the robbery, comes to recover his share of the cake.','/h0q0ATqmFWmh5MpIOvE2ZBc321n.jpg','2019-02-20',93,'Released',NULL,'Paradise Beach',571650,2.8155,5.2,'zv1TknopvBY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44655,_binary '\0','/bdhQGVMOKv60q72KZMxoSL1AgIK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7512492',3.7,2933,'en','36 Husbands','36 Husbands is a mystical, musical, Kung Fu spy comedy starring 3 powerful women - and a bunch of husbands. Krista, top spy and Kung Fu master, has extraordinary powers and she puts them in action on her quest to slow down the steady march towards World War III. Together with her Kung Fu disciples, Gina and Nola, (and Frankie, a spy on-loan from MI6) they fight and love their way across the world leaving a trail of broken hearts and sabotaged plans. All the spies and evil-doers are tuning into the Bright Blue Gorilla TV show. Why do they watch? Is it the music, is it the comedy? Maybe you can figure it out.','/1wySKhg6GX2Ljf1Ytn9xnQB3WIZ.jpg','2019-09-05',83,'Released','36 Husbands is a mystical, musical, Kung Fu spy comedy starring 3 powerful women - and a bunch of husbands.','36 Husbands',643717,1.0002,4.7,'bF2Az7hnxRc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44656,_binary '\0','/o7gUdyjexYAkcPWmtncHxy8Xi9Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7512624',5.6,5142,'ta','Oru Nalla Naal Paathu Solren','A tribal leader comes to the city to kidnap the girl whom he has sworn to marry. But a bumbling college boy, whom the girl has a soft corner for, stands in his way.','/dhFSku2wcKTwHZ34d9tJmzqvzL4.jpg','2018-02-02',148,'Released',NULL,'Oru Nalla Naal Paathu Solren',456625,1.1001,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44657,_binary '\0','/wNqytPDXc9DULFbklchOg01tclm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7515456',5.9,5893,'en','Hurricane','Polish pilots overcome prejudice to fight against the Luftwaffe with the Royal Air Force during the Second World War, in the hope of protecting both Great Britain and their own Poland from the German advance.','/mTpmZORhYswd9YinB23wV9QE2cx.jpg','2018-09-07',107,'Released','In foreign skies they fought for their country','Hurricane',506863,3.2223,5.9,'b4lpXne8L0g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44658,_binary '\0','/rVGvbHS8iVrmABi8eDY9sZ8IO17.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7516778',6.1,3919,'te','ఎమ్.సీ.ఏ','Nani\'s brother and his friends are his world. But he shares a love-hate relationship with his sister-in-law Jyothi. What happens when Shiva threatens his family, is what \'MCA\' is all about.','/oYzWaKkNBpqq1EsSWr5BS6BWBbv.jpg','2017-12-21',143,'Released',NULL,'M.C.A',485869,1.8907,5.173,'DM-JS8fbmgA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44659,_binary '\0','/b45hRLs8pT1GKrsVL6kvfhgJDdR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7518466',7.1,6914,'en','Conor McGregor: Notorious','Conor McGregor is the biggest star in the history of Mixed Martial Arts. Filmed over the course of 4 years, Notorious is the exclusive, all-access account of Conor’s meteoric rise from claiming benefits and living in his parents\' spare room in Dublin to claiming multiple championship UFC belts and seven figure pay-packets in Las Vegas.','/xYMVSRk2n4WpzKMw7V6mKz4Psoh.jpg','2017-11-03',90,'Released','If you want it all you have to fight for it','Conor McGregor: Notorious',466485,2.4713,6.9,'syOgWwz2fiE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44660,_binary '\0','/h2mMP0V8HSbVKYgCWZlhGRtL3aP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7518786',7.5,43420,'hi','83','On the 25th of June 1983, the Lord’s Cricket Ground witnessed one of the biggest underdog stories in the history of sports. Fourteen inspired players - led by a man\'s self-belief and conviction - fought against all odds and orchestrated India’s greatest sporting triumph by beating the two-time World Champions West Indies.','/gTOMTFUbMxSApPRTuECMrl5RyQ2.jpg','2021-12-23',160,'Released','The team that defied all odds. The game that united the country.','83',601337,2.2869,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44661,_binary '\0','/hOryMZ4I8QGjTjsqGAkrLYwDMj8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7519174',7.3,2904,'de','Of Fathers and Sons – Die Kinder des Kalifats','Talal Derki returns to his homeland where he gains the trust of a radical Islamist family, sharing their daily life for over two years. His camera focuses on Osama and his younger brother Ayman, providing an extremely rare insight into what it means to grow up in an Islamic Caliphate.','/9nY0ef1kCwu1fUG0mjBq3wWghu1.jpg','2017-11-15',99,'Released',NULL,'Of Fathers and Sons',488740,2.3287,7,'Zd0bRdYb8AI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44662,_binary '\0','/rlNyzG1OSEgTfmwignW6fkAnW81.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7520274',6.2,1776,'en','Love Struck Café','Megan Quinn, an aspiring architect, faces multiple tasks – developing her hometown lake into a commercialized entertainment center, forcing Mrs. Frances Figgins, her childhood mentor, out of her family’s home, and helping out at her family café after her father breaks his leg, all while also dealing with the return of her childhood sweetheart, Joe, who broke her heart.','/nqQBK4QvBXHuemPfuY22S7V0MP7.jpg','2017-10-14',84,'Released',NULL,'Love Struck Café',479048,2.2142,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44663,_binary '\0','/gRB9BgVS63RiHBFE2am17CDGhby.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7520568',5.2,2312,'en','The Hyperions','In 1960, Professor Ruckus Mandulbaum invented the Titan badge - a device that enables humans to have a particular super power. He took in three down-on-their-luck youths, creating an unusual family of superheroes and they quickly rose to fame and prestige. Over time, however, the commercial family fractured and the Professor replaced the team with a new set of super hero teens. Cut to 1979, when two of the original superheroes are all grown up and wanting their Titan badges back, even if it means robbing the Professor\'s museum and taking a few hostages accidentally.','/45ySjyM2aB0RXSTjGKu06VOjMJl.jpg','2022-11-24',96,'Released','Take back your power.','The Hyperions',568271,4.429,4.7,'zJHl7hOsTJU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44664,_binary '\0','/2dxL3lq5lTJyYPouO3OCD2gCYwW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7521040',7.8,1568,'en','George Michael: Freedom','This documentary covers the span of George Michael\'s entire career, concentrating on the formative period in the late Grammy® Award winner’s life and career, leading up to and following the making of his acclaimed, best-selling album “Listen Without Prejudice Vol. 1” and his subsequent, infamous High Court battle with his record label that followed, while also becoming poignantly personal about the death of his late partner and first love, Anselmo Feleppa.','/bqtlxKX8T9nlu99W4KzMPMlrrUs.jpg','2017-10-16',86,'Released',NULL,'George Michael: Freedom',476517,1.6784,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44665,_binary '\0','/60w5MmaN69s3FAkKTkbz60EKjQk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7521214',5.4,5672,'en','Scare Package','Chad Buckley is super crazy about horror movies, but also very lonely. He mostly spends his days in his small movie shop having wild discussions with his only returning customer, Sam.','/gRf46QmAsSKoHPKNTnCdyPIo1bG.jpg','2019-10-04',106,'Released','7 directors. 7 tales of terror. 0 working cell phones.','Scare Package',636891,2.744,5.57,'ubG-TH7YuW8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44666,_binary '\0','/jxyEUugg60UpFirBRCmXdXxmVHW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7521990',5.5,1574,'cn','黃金兄弟','A group of former mercenaries reunite to plan an epic heist: boosting a truck full of medicine held by a foreign intelligence agency to supply a refugee camp in need. But when they find the truck is actually filled with stolen gold, the band of brothers realize they’ve been double-crossed by one of their own - and putting the situation right will be all out war.','/66mlGssgzn6ZCJBPYf1zCmJSHhu.jpg','2018-09-20',100,'Released',NULL,'Golden Job',531380,2.8459,6.1,'rvHi2S9moOE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44667,_binary '\0','/8Jye1W68b6xkXUB5yr20IzYyhLV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7523010',7.6,3198,'ml','കൂടെ','Following the loss of his sister, a young man is forced to reflect on his childhood and reassess his future. However, he finds support and courage from unexpected quarters.','/smOMGiWAcjedVQvHsSXtYWAEPLg.jpg','2018-07-14',155,'Released',NULL,'Koode',531723,1.0634,7.153,'8sdapbEs4pY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44668,_binary '\0','/eCcnLmmFjCPayKKZa3yaM7PYFKC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7523180',6.8,1765,'da','Før frosten','A struggling farmer in 19th-century Denmark must go against his morals and make a deal with a wealthy neighbour in order to secure his family’s survival over a harsh winter.','/cg31OdcRWfJSfTyfTFEAuc5z3uR.jpg','2019-01-10',104,'Released',NULL,'Before the Frost',498162,1.8771,6.2,'CLJNjZxV-mE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44669,_binary '\0','/z5dvDa9LYH7du3aaaOQvQ4YNUP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7524414',7.1,5169,'en','Beats','Summer 1994, Scotland. Johnno and Spanner are best mates, but Johnno’s family are moving him to a new town and a better life, leaving Spanner behind to face a precarious future. In pursuit of adventure and escape they head out on one last night to an illegal rave before parting ways indefinitely.','/ePdzn7taDXD1cR8uZjYF8qRT3IR.jpg','2019-05-17',100,'Released',NULL,'Beats',493141,2.2869,6.583,'Sl3MaCxHleM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000