n.','/nybzhRKbQMvvPwvoB81SUSLf87J.jpg','2017-10-20',95,'Released',NULL,'Friends of the Groom',474718,1.7144,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44674,_binary '\0','/fmLzfT4IHgdNJg20y1UnmzbnVja.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7526414',7.4,1293,'en','Demi Lovato: Simply Complicated','A personal and intimate look into Demi Lovato\'s life as not only a regular 25 year old, but also one of the biggest pop stars in the world.','/nNiuGvaKDRRifiAuCqXli5v5Mzv.jpg','2017-10-17',78,'Released',NULL,'Demi Lovato: Simply Complicated',481850,1.9154,7.6,'bpDylTwwunc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44675,_binary '\0','/p8kP0lbFWogxICDhP9g3tfwVvkZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7527082',7.7,1494,'hi','Hamid','Eight year-old Hamid learns that 786 is God\'s number and decides to try and reach out to God, by dialing this number. He wants to talk to his father, who his mother tells him has gone to Allah. One fine day the phone call is answered.','/35QHuEC4cUP1R7O0XtPIfRPF4mz.jpg','2019-03-15',108,'Released','Have you ever spoken to God?','Hamid',559673,1.3592,7.107,'AbLtdPmKyL4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44676,_binary '\0','/k04zgSF389g7pIYNpdzsPprMZrM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7527538',5.5,1262,'es','Jefe','Cesar is \'the boss\', the one everyone hates, the one some flatter and the one nobody tells the truth; the great successful businessman is on the edge of the precipice. One night his actions crumble down, his partners betray him and his wife kicks him out of the house. Entrenched in his office, he tries relentlessly to recover his company and his life. But he will not do it alone, César will find a very special ally, Ariana, the cleaner of the night shift.','/xR9kYBmJ5JZBdDtS9CIziHdKTSD.jpg','2018-05-04',89,'Released',NULL,'Jefe',517298,1.2352,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44677,_binary '\0','/hGDNYyED9uJVtROtp2K7ukF0jTz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7527682',5.4,8527,'en','Out of Darkness','In the Old Stone Age, a disparate gang of early humans band together in search of a new land. But when they suspect a malevolent, mystical, being is hunting them down, the clan are forced to confront a danger they never envisaged.','/9tG77VE7bP8ve79X86ABwHzDqbb.jpg','2024-02-09',87,'Released','The dawn of man. The birth of fear.','Out of Darkness',823491,3.2676,5.7,'-ZyZU1jphUA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44678,_binary '\0','/6hAj03GZmHfiERrOsxrJPfEU2qE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7527694',5.4,1394,'es','Pickpockets: maestros del robo','An aspiring teen thieves learn what it takes to be successful pickpockets on the streets of Bogotá','/7JYpjCTvWRRcBF5pRO5ZQONsGgg.jpg','2018-03-03',100,'Released','Masters in stealing','Pickpockets',517829,1.9423,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44679,_binary '\0','/jgQED5493r0dTgSzYdu6PKho3k2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7527912',5.6,2915,'en','Wasted Talent',NULL,'/b281hCrIB75fHtRH6fBwDxf2MM7.jpg','2018-07-01',66,'Released',NULL,'Wasted Talent',571551,2.1155,5.8,'lW25N4eTodE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44680,_binary '\0','/AaYfsgRcgU00n0MNVsn1604bfcu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7529298',6.8,17480,'hi','Attack','With the Parliament under siege, India’s first super soldier Arjun Shergill is tasked to get hold of the terrorists in time, save the Prime Minister from their clutches and stop a dirty bomb from exploding and destroying Delhi.','/A9FjibQFfkPVrfQcM3dlY6fkYpJ.jpg','2022-04-01',123,'Released',NULL,'Attack',799155,3.0753,6.8,'KnC-XvFGflM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44681,_binary '\0','/fIl89ylwVEb0JVy4rPPId9kiP3f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7530986',6.8,4320,'fr','Mademoiselle de Joncquières','When a romance between a widow and a notorious libertine takes an unexpected turn, Mademoiselle de Joncquières becomes instrumental to one lover’s plans for revenge.','/bMws6ZcTwEynkst5PU3Z8OD9wiH.jpg',