w4zo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7531990',4.8,2158,'tr','Görevimiz Tatil','Sıtkı, the head of the four-member Mutlu family, is a man known for his stinginess. His wife Türkan is tired of her life and complains about her husband\'s indifference to the family. The couple, who have not been on vacation for years, rent a caravan after their therapist\'s persuasion. As the couple sets off toward Antalya, they encounter some mishaps along the way. Their car breaks down, forcing them to head to Yavaşlar Village. The urban couple, now guests of the villagers, realize there are things they can teach the villagers. This partnership will not only bridge the two cultures but also support a just cause.','/niKQ3ui24dGRt2PY46ro7cXmg2S.jpg','2018-02-23',110,'Released',NULL,'Görevimiz Tatil',507295,1.6108,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44687,_binary '\0','/lB8mrGjgOxVuiGzBNbHfUrFw02d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7533152',7.6,53609,'en','The Boy Who Harnessed the Wind','Against all the odds, a thirteen year old boy in Malawi invents an unconventional way to save his family and village from famine.','/yOr7RxHw15MMXNxGMXSmngDqHyI.jpg','2019-02-14',113,'Released',NULL,'The Boy Who Harnessed the Wind',491480,6.913,7.9,'nPkr9HmglG0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44688,_binary '\0','/wmHUAPW8JhSsCdC9ZitZHMJQbw7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7533846',5.9,6665,'tr','Mutluluk Zamanı','True love is not about perfection, it is hidden in flaws. The movie \'Mutluluk Zamani\' (Time of Happiness) tells the story of Mert (Baris Arduc) who creates his \'perfect\' life without facing his past and Ada (Elcin Sangu) who builds her own way of life based on all of her past experiences.','/8oHmkRLWoKlEdc7VzJobXyNrpOV.jpg','2017-11-10',108,'Released',NULL,'Time of Happiness',474715,1.3512,5.7,'9LcaQA9TkEE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44689,_binary '\0','/urgeqdA6KmSKGjrjb6BhOfqet0J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7533878',5.6,3098,'tr','Sen Kiminle Dans Ediyorsun?','A woman recovering from an attempted suicide meets an aspiring doctor who takes a keen interest in her efforts to move forward in life through dance.','/o3iaaE6SUX7yWoXOSCFWR2zBanl.jpg','2017-11-17',106,'Released',NULL,'Turkish Dance School',477297,1.5514,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44690,_binary '\0','/5DDaEzznWzLUvYcHxkyRvguBt8i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7534054',6.8,4576,'fr','Plaire, aimer et courir vite','At once an intimate chronicle of a romance and a sprawling portrait of life in early 1990s France following the intertwining journeys of Jacques, a worldly Parisian writer, and Arthur, a curious, carefree and much-younger university student who is just beginning to live. Brought together by chance, the two men find themselves navigating a casual fling that gradually deepens into a tender, transformative bond.','/rBPRcBXwmJLsVlVutuWKnYOiWuL.jpg','2018-05-09',133,'Released',NULL,'Sorry Angel',485189,2.8189,6.9,'NmNT2emdUGY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44691,_binary '\0','/gTql1SBpG15fzsoYKQZZtKujSxI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7534068',6.2,4427,'fr','En liberté !','Detective Yvonne is the widow of police chief Santi, a local hero in a town on the French Riviera. When she learns he was in fact a crooked cop, she tries to right his wrongs. Crossing paths with Antoine, a victim of Santi, sets off a series of wild events.','/n8MFhzVkIYhsZYFgzJNnl2wDxmi.jpg','2018-10-06',108,'Released',NULL,'The Trouble with You',519106,2.7293,6.015,'cctKK23rr6Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44692,_binary '\0','/sk2Ipms7JfYkNXBguI6CHCQ41NE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7534096',6,1298,'fr','Gueule d\'ange','8-year-old Elli and her mother, Marlène, live in a small town by the French Riviera where they act out to relieve boredom and hide from social services. When Marlène caves in to yet another night of excess, she chooses to leave Elli behind for a man she just met. The young child must confront her mother\'s demons in order to get her back.','/y9MUiB0prnEtCKTDNmf7Esz8UTP.jpg','2018-05-23',120,'Released',NULL,'Angel Face',489170,2.3536,6.2,'xiCk7_zjW1U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44693,_binary '\0','/ip8BfpLQJ9RKCJcJgAyw8aD28P5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7534102',7.5,3042,'fr','Les Hirondelles de Kaboul','Summer 1998—Kabul under Taliban rule. Zunaira and Mohsen are young and in love. Despite the daily violence and misery, they hope for a better future. One day, a foolish gesture causes life to take an irrevocable turn.','/djd3QU6ThcDSOEGMuUl1h1Am8sN.jpg','2019-09-04',81,'Released',NULL,'The Swallows of Kabul',582881,2.1664,7.7,'e6zyQ7Ek_vk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44694,_binary '\0','/dGCJdSwulQdqSklrqdsPYWMXRlU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7534150',5.9,2373,'fr','Premières vacances','Marion and Ben, thirty years old, meet on Tinder. That\'s about all they have in common; but the opposites attract each other, and they decide in the early morning of their meeting to go on vacation together despite the advice of their entourage. They will finally leave - to Bulgaria, halfway to their dream destinations: Beirut for Marion, Biarritz for Ben. Without a precise plan and, as they will soon discover, with very different conceptions of what a dream holiday should be.','/2QhiQaZIA5dxPZA0zFv7EpydyGW.jpg','2018-09-15',102,'Released',NULL,'Our Happy Holiday',490448,1.9046,5.661,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44695,_binary '\0','/7atlokNf3cC4gxj3Jq0JYaGnMED.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7534314',7.6,2175,'nl','Niet Schieten','In one fell swoop, nine-year old David Van de Steen lost his mother, his father and his sister in an attack by the Brabant Killers in Aalst. His grandfather, Albert, has the well-nigh impossible task of giving David a new perspective on life, a future.','/lMjqg9QFEFvcfJXlDgw09jIZmTt.jpg','2018-10-04',139,'Released',NULL,'Don\'t Shoot',550244,1.9185,7.3,'2gdwzKmc-JQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44696,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7535666',3.5,3686,'en','Retrocausality','At the beginning of the Covid-19 pandemic, Scott a 22-year-old blockbuster actor has to find a girl whom he has a strange connection with before it\'s too late, while his mom catches a new strange virus.','/qSd29gZuV4nGyxSv70dmTppBBb1.jpg','2020-12-25',74,'Released','Is it better to have loved and lost or to never have loved at all?','Retrocausality',779928,1.009,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44697,_binary '\0','/2HnMZrmCspXFdqdosNrv9Tqbtiu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7535756',7.1,2609,'tr','Bölük','The film tells the poignant story of a soldier crossing the roads in a winter. Soldiers from different places should adapt to the military. Those men with dreams, goals, fears, and ambitions will learn to develop themselves in the toughest conditions of their military service, learn what it means to be a soldier, and have to fight with the demons in themselves.','/rDIRBL31LRNU6OMWiPnN2d2oC2E.jpg','2017-10-20',95,'Released',NULL,'Squad',477273,2.1218,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44698,_binary '\0','/wd7Vx3LI8etvsvKibIAPhHfjuV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7535792',6,8755,'tr','Yol Arkadaşım','Days before Eid, a salesman fired from his job drives to meet his girlfriend\'s family, but the trip goes astray due to his zany travel buddy.','/1TZUXLdXusbak3GspmvprQQ0CZo.jpg','2017-10-27',115,'Released',NULL,'My Travel Buddy',477274,2.1563,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44699,_binary '\0','/f4ZEg00CVucyCslrKeQVuJSPEEP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7535868',1.6,7165,'tr','Oha Diyorum','Fırat embarks on misadventures in search of his stolen car, which contains a hard disk of his daughter\'s family photos and videos.','/1AimdTn0JnfboA48GT37IJ01quL.jpg','2017-11-03',90,'Released',NULL,'Oha Diyorum',474723,2.2131,1.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44700,_binary '\0','/fKOtQ6vlTWM7MriUzlLB3j6jjnE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7535964',6,3177,'tr','Acı Tatlı Ekşi','Murat and Duygu are deeply in love and when they graduate from College Murat takes the leap and asks Duygu for her hand in marriage but he doesn\'t get the answer he was looking for. They both agree that if they\'re both single in five years they will tie the knot, but life has other plans for them.','/81kt2NES2LBx485Ftj63zEX6Aml.jpg','2017-12-22',102,'Released',NULL,'Hot Sweet Sour',474720,1.8759,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44701,_binary '\0','/bdIEyO8IJAtCs0s4JD9n9b5f7L5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7537738',5.2,3135,'ml','മാമാങ്കം','Based on the medieval fair called Mamankam, which was celebrated every 12 years between 800 AD and 1755 AD, the story of the film is supposedly about a brave warrior of Malabar and his loyal soldiers.','/7po3zyLyMYcR2r0UVWZ94sb1r4o.jpg','2019-12-12',157,'Released','History of the Brave','Mamangam',569106,1.1265,6.159,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44702,_binary '\0','/4xaSUkSjvojI0mvIMk2Zs881d7I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7538958',6.2,1727,'es','Animal','Antonio Decoud is a conservative family man who is forced by destiny to face an unexpected situation that shakes him to the core, scrambling up his life and his priorities, pushing him to forget his beliefs and his way of understanding life and follow the most basic instinct: the animal instinct.','/dL44SbXxd4arcHeM7KiukuVmeIm.jpg','2018-05-24',112,'Released',NULL,'Animal',499925,1.4769,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44703,_binary '\0','/6CyILXa0BOm6HtV4naOjg5B2RRZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7541106',5.8,17345,'en','1BR','When Sarah lucks into a sweet one-bedroom at Asilo Del Mar Apartments in Los Angeles, she thinks she\'s hit the jackpot. It\'s got plenty of space, friendly tenants, group BBQs and even a cute neighbour next door. All is not what it seems: loud noises start keeping her awake at night; her cat is missing; everyone seems to be a little too helpful and friendly, except for the weirdo, Lester. Soon, Sarah learns she didn\'t choose this apartment — it chose her.','/aiYLasUoJXqOgJ9pnahDMELC9wf.jpg','2019-07-18',90,'Released','Welcome to the neighborhood.','1BR',611605,3.3468,6,'IGzb01GrsxQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44704,_binary '\0','/ytLZ2ZfTV461AlFPwogKb7d5vO9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7541200',6.9,1303,'lt','Trys milijonai eurų','A gambling villager Julius suddenly wins 3 million euros in a lottery and does not know what to do with it.','/kMio7yX7ecSOeexyoOHKHsJPoyX.jpg','2017-10-27',90,'Released',NULL,'Three Million Euros',484063,0.8767,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44705,_binary '\0','/cjFroCHqI2VZhf5UkUMu4OdJuXB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7541720',3.2,9720,'en','Music','Zu, a free spirit estranged from her family, suddenly finds herself the sole guardian of her half-sister, Music, a teenager on the autism spectrum whose whole world order has been beautifully crafted by her late grandmother. The film soon challenges whether it is Zu or Music who has a better view of the world, and that love, trust, and being able to be there for each other is everything.','/xzDXq7ofNkvIovB6Vb8KZpjqkK0.jpg','2021-01-14',107,'Released',NULL,'Music',586101,3.1869,5.2,'tpClynCJu6A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44706,_binary '\0','/qvlToqIqsAY0qcFtGXXK1v2xDFl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7542576',6.2,3458,'en','All About Nina','Nina Geld\'s passion and talent have made her a rising star in the comedy scene, but she\'s an emotional mess offstage. When a new professional opportunity coincides with a romantic one, she is forced to confront her own deeply troubled past.','/qcOV7ALpm0CiIyeTxP3Ncjrc7HA.jpg','2018-09-28',97,'Released','Get your act together.','All About Nina',483435,3.9942,5.8,'mS-BYN5FC1Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44707,_binary '\0','/gJodZMuYN1nVKRhwRXNK7z22CCI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7543908',4.9,1422,'en','Killbird','When a young woman\'s car breaks down in back country Oregon, she finds herself at the mercy of a paranoid conspiracy theorist, who assumes she\'s a government agent.','/UPS58QFIEQGfz4Z9w68VnM1C84.jpg','2019-06-23',84,'Released','The truth can be deadly.','Killbird',706005,2.1846,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44708,_binary '\0','/fozq5WDVQQZ8C1K3rrvgB6IM5O9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7543930',7.2,2996,'fr','Pupille','Théo is given up for adoption by his biological mother on the very day he is born. After this anonymous birth, the mother has two months to change her mind… Or not. The child welfare services and adoption service spring into action… The former have to take care of the baby and support it during this limbo-like time, this period of uncertainty, while the latter must find a woman to become his adoptive mother. She is called Alice, and she has spent the last ten years fighting to have a child.','/andgp8cnHZPAwx3zPUDaZ0pn6Go.jpg','2018-12-05',112,'Released',NULL,'In Safe Hands',489418,3.1262,7.416,'P5_t6-IjI90','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44709,_binary '\0','/xnRDoZo0KVAiaHsTkmfBXKbpToH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7544820',7.7,2187,'en','Too Funny to Fail: The Life & Death of The Dana Carvey Show','It had all the makings of a huge television success: a white-hot comic at the helm, a coveted primetime slot, and a pantheon of future comedy legends in the cast and crew. So why did The Dana Carvey Show—with a writers room and cast including then unknowns Steve Carell, Stephen Colbert, Louis C.K., Robert Smigel, Charlie Kaufman, and more— crash and burn so spectacularly? TOO FUNNY TO FAIL tells the hilarious true story of a crew of genius misfits who set out to make comedy history… and succeeded in a way they never intended.','/daOljc1BMtILw8XYQRcVu0bHObj.jpg','2017-10-20',95,'Released',NULL,'Too Funny to Fail: The Life & Death of The Dana Carvey Show',482004,2.3569,7.9,'rNKL0Om5Muo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44710,_binary '\0','/cH0AXST2dsHcD62qTbS4Cte6Wjb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7545266',4.7,16356,'en','Like a Boss','Two female friends with very different ideals decide to start a beauty company together. One is more practical, while the other wants to earn her fortune and live a lavish lifestyle.','/yce0CZPWd0GGudksRJi8p4gDj1M.jpg','2020-01-09',83,'Released','The world of beauty is about to get ugly.','Like a Boss',526019,6.6074,6.195,'9ESkyRFEso4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44711,_binary '\0','/wFgLR6tJblOm4tyaLlE8eFtXev3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7545524',6.7,25762,'en','Ben Is Back','19-year-old Ben Burns unexpectedly returns home to his family\'s suburban home on Christmas Eve morning. Ben\'s mother, Holly, is relieved and welcoming but wary of her son staying clean. Over a turbulent 24 hours, new truths are revealed, and a mother\'s undying love for her son is tested as she does everything in her power to keep him safe.','/eSPiprXuWqwMGi6t8BkdiTz9Ou3.jpg','2018-12-05',103,'Released','One family. One day.','Ben Is Back',492452,6.0945,6.6,'oXM1MSmWJLA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44712,_binary '\0','/8AXIZeciFJxD7wTJs7qGsfYD54f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7545566',6.8,5263,'en','Skate Kitchen','Camille\'s life as a lonely suburban teenager changes dramatically when she befriends a group of girl skateboarders. As she journeys deeper into this raw New York City subculture, she begins to understand the true meaning of friendship as well as her inner self.','/hrC2F01uzZUcN5QxDCJdkwWRk49.jpg','2018-08-10',106,'Released',NULL,'Skate Kitchen',491474,2.2613,6.7,'iT1izrIxoos','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44713,_binary '\0','/muXYdzOL7DSlzoWYuu6QOCdy7vZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7546096',6.7,1442,'en','The Highway Rat','The tale of a ravenous rat who craves buns, biscuits and all sweet things. Tearing along the highway, he searches for sugary treats to steal, until his sweet tooth leads him to a sticky end.','/dxNKtY0e5pm6BFCdDMP3riRVBTb.jpg','2018-10-10',25,'Released','Give me your buns and your biscuits!','The Highway Rat',494603,3.5652,6.2,'M58eRpW-Y4o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44714,_binary '\0','/vNhLL1FSsTqFcaICQOZXBMdo8U5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7546486',2.2,4239,'tr','Kayhan','After a brawny alum learns how his classmates truly feel about him, he schemes to give them a lesson on payback during a 20-year high school reunion.','/a3qRd14HpfIWxjm8KsjMIy8pARU.jpg','2018-02-09',104,'Released',NULL,'Kayhan: Revenge at the Reunion',499639,1.479,3.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44715,_binary '\0','/uO7oHrSVQ63EDVZS4NCtRnmSEnF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7546978',6.4,1848,'en','Romance at Reindeer Lodge','Molly and Jared have both sworn off holiday events. When they find themselves stuck at a Christmas-themed ranch, they have no choice but to allow their cynical hearts to melt.','/ouwogOw4qPSwPW1sJZQKCIVfS6q.jpg','2017-12-17',84,'Released',NULL,'Romance at Reindeer Lodge',490147,1.9942,6,'BhzNI7Tm84o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44716,_binary '\0','/ltt9yiCGmCQZunmxtkhtPxzmDzx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7547410',6.1,39850,'en','Dora and the Lost City of Gold','Dora, a girl who has spent most of her life exploring the jungle with her parents, now must navigate her most dangerous adventure yet: high school. Always the explorer, Dora quickly finds herself leading Boots (her best friend, a monkey), Diego, and a rag tag group of teens on an adventure to save her parents and solve the impossible mystery behind a lost Inca civilization.','/xvYCZ740XvngXK0FNeSNVTJJJ5v.jpg','2019-08-08',102,'Released','Explorer is her middle name.','Dora and the Lost City of Gold',499701,14.2415,6.613,'gUTtJjV852c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44717,_binary '\0','/fVwYo5dUkGG2UrhKkn8XCFkRVyQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7548570',7.4,1727,'ml','സ്വാതന്ത്ര്യം അര്‍ദ്ധരാത്രിയില്‍','Jacob, a manager at a big financial firm, finds himself behind bars when he tries to save the woman he loves from being involved in a criminal case. The only way for him to survive and to escape was to break out of prison. How he plans and executes the prison break forms the crux of the movie.','/vnM2JLsWK87TtkweKvN2d9wAfdq.jpg','2018-03-31',138,'Released',NULL,'Swathanthryam Ardharathriyil',512295,1.3659,7.075,'_7tWbhAi4L8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44718,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7548732',3.4,1853,'en','The Evil Down the Street','The Ryan family moves into their new dream home having no idea their new home is possessed by a demon. Katie Ryan becomes tormented by the demon and begins to terrorize her family. A Paranormal Horror Thriller inspired by true events.','/9OPM3oszPegI9SzDYVrPDerHeW.jpg','2019-04-30',97,'Released',NULL,'The Evil Down the Street',599781,1.1567,3.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44719,_binary '\0','/5F8EqhMRn9KbLgmTsBCejctVYSk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7549618',4.8,1285,'en','Bernie the Dolphin','A brother and sister who befriend a badly sunburned dolphin separated from his family and uncover a secret plan that could destroy the beach and their new friend\'s home. The kids must devise a clever plan to stop the bad guys, protect the sea life, and, most importantly, save their best friend, Bernie.','/cc2emcyFQVsnCrTwH5MdZiJeRcx.jpg','2018-12-07',88,'Released','Protect the cove. Rescue the dolphin. Save the day.','Bernie the Dolphin',565839,2.1157,5.8,'1Vuz_VuPhuU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44720,_binary '\0','/wCCvFSOlzgWCySJH3HUHcEbAexa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7549892',6.5,31774,'es','Aterrados','Police commissioner Funes and three researchers of supernatural phenomena investigate inexplicable events that are occurring in the suburbs of Buenos Aires.','/eMP4F0POBgrB4icn6XgYeLLIrld.jpg','2018-05-03',88,'Released','They are in your house… Watching you…','Terrified',489430,5.4049,6.712,'KUtd_-3ytlc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44721,_binary '\0','/x3u29Z4fWAeQmsUkgkRTFNgDZig.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7549996',6.8,58946,'en','Judy','Thirty years after starring in \'The Wizard of Oz\', beloved actress and singer Judy Garland arrives in London to perform sold-out shows at the Talk of the Town nightclub. While there, she reminisces with friends and fans and begins a whirlwind romance with musician Mickey Deans, her soon-to-be fifth husband.','/iqJhHjD6k6T07waELjMKDpQJUP.jpg','2019-09-27',118,'Released','The legend behind the rainbow.','Judy',491283,5.0163,6.671,'DZypuwVApJ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44722,_binary '\0','/qVygtf2vU15L2yKS4Ke44U4oMdD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7550000',6,104579,'en','Project Power','An ex-soldier, a teen and a cop collide in New Orleans as they hunt for the source behind a dangerous new pill that grants users temporary superpowers.','/TnOeov4w0sTtV2gqICqIxVi74V.jpg','2020-08-14',113,'Released','What would you risk for five minutes of pure power?','Project Power',605116,8.9879,6.42,'xw1vQgVaYNQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44723,_binary '\0','/epE4VnwJkqWEQIYLvWYxBj277W3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7550014',6.2,40115,'en','No Exit','Stranded at a rest stop in the mountains during a blizzard, a recovering addict discovers a kidnapped child hidden in a car belonging to one of the people inside the building which sets her on a terrifying struggle to identify who among them is the kidnapper.','/5cnLoWq9o5tuLe1Zq4BTX4LwZ2B.jpg','2022-02-24',96,'Released','Who will survive the dead of winter?','No Exit',83342