he prism of his internationally renowned hymn, Hallelujah.','/jvAjJvpu4EYuByjebjKl3QntQ0Z.jpg','2022-07-01',115,'Released',NULL,'Hallelujah: Leonard Cohen, a Journey, a Song',854513,3.0224,7.4,'11IPQYZMXjc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44779,_binary '\0','/1sEtjLhUyM5z3P1fSYTm6eTQdm8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7601480',6.3,15198,'ru','Майор Гром: Чумной Доктор','In present day St. Petersburg, police major Igor Grom, an honest and skilled cop with unconventional methods, pursues a vigilante murderer in the mask of a plague doctor.','/4PsiX8or0QHg3LKLbh4VyF0bLj1.jpg','2021-04-01',136,'Released','Who is your hero?','Major Grom: Plague Doctor',529106,4.3261,6.6,'I-0j-mk3AwI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44780,_binary '\0','/kFh0E3OuBvTTu2RWhQU0TuqIRqA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7604948',6.3,2929,'en','Gutterbug','Homeless and addicted, a crust punk named Bug resolves to go back home, a decision that leads him and his misfit crew down a dangerous path.','/lYbPIpQyyT9NBCcAF3UUj3xYdxx.jpg','2019-04-28',101,'Released','DON\'T BUG OUT!','Gutterbug',594306,1.2366,3.667,'6c9FEitDUC4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44781,_binary '\0','/wIrqeoJHYtZmneqIufPtcOHMjOg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7605074',5.9,39916,'zh','流浪地球','When the Sun begins to expand in such a way that it will inevitably engulf and destroy the Earth in a hundred years, united mankind finds a way to avoid extinction by propelling the planet out of the Solar System using gigantic engines, moving it to a new home located four light years away, an epic journey that will last thousands of years.','/z3MXFdFjrYmoxOEFgE1wuphwo2a.jpg','2019-02-05',126,'Released',NULL,'The Wandering Earth',535167,7.349,6.634,'0TDII5IkI3Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44782,_binary '\0','/lg1kdwKvzTOHaStoWV6cOip0KFU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7605144',4.6,1266,'en','A Royal Christmas Ball','Dateless for the Christmas ball, 39-year-old bachelor, King Charles of Baltania, tracks down his American college sweetheart, only to discover Allison has never been married, yet raised a 17-year-old daughter, Lily, who mathematically might be Charles\' biological princess.','/tJKSEiS7IS6fHopHtgv58wwbLoz.jpg','2017-12-10',85,'Released',NULL,'A Royal Christmas Ball',488067,2.1349,5.7,'09nCxVnIqnw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44783,_binary '\0','/vHJCRXpdNfYePNPm913zglMVlA4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7605922',7.1,8526,'es','Mi obra maestra','Arturo, the successful owner of an art gallery, and Renzo, a talented but decadent painter, are old friends who cannot stop bickering. One day, Arturo comes up with a solution to all their problems, but the plan they concoct turns out to be crazier and riskier than they originally expected.','/lYlCD0fyYlKHQytjsWhFZivaNE1.jpg','2018-08-14',100,'Released','The story of a s̶c̶a̶m̶ friendship','My Masterpiece',535692,3.1675,7.251,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44784,_binary '\0','/dyRE7hpsTAmQ8ZNe2aqpos66M3a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7607940',2.1,3111,'hi','नमस्ते इंग्लैंड','Param and Jasmeet fall in love and they get married. Their perfect romance gets disturbed by Jasmeet’s suppressed ambition however, she has dreams of going to London so that she can pursue her career and build a better life for herself. But Param unable to get a visa and that creates some high drama in their love life.','/ePeHuQT0fBdLrOinaAyDBdgd3AO.jpg','2018-10-19',141,'Released','Love Can Travel Any Distance','Namaste England',543692,1.2777,5.4,'V4tcaoNlcRo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44785,_binary '\0','/aDmXiKzMCrc4uyQifPTWCJ2vBuc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7608028',3.3,39568,'en','The Open House','A teenager and his mother find themselves besieged by threatening forces when they move into a new house.','/7JwdoLcbFWaeUBxKaoFulRVK8Ja.jpg','2018-01-19',94,'Released','You can\'t lock out what\'