w currency.','Parallel Minds',727566,2.0879,5.4,'1fWBgRPDZMI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44822,_binary '\0','/kLboxwnxZokS1OmXCHGdArTCB5G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7642542',6.3,2231,'en','Magical Christmas Ornaments','When Marie begins receiving ornaments from her mother, a new coincidental blessing comes with each one, causing Marie to feel more excited for the holidays than she has in years. Marie’s once-lost Christmas spirit gets another boost when she meets her handsome neighbor Nate and feels a spark with him while celebrating the season.','/tmxjY8lRviPwsTC09AUjINphumi.jpg','2017-12-03',84,'Released',NULL,'Magical Christmas Ornaments',483554,2.1217,6,'TGLXeFZxbyc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44823,_binary '\0','/xKViytxq1J96fe1Ot9kwjtX16tJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7642558',5.9,1640,'en','Four Christmases and a Wedding','When event planner Chloe is hired to plan the local Christmas Festival, she is beyond thrilled to embrace the challenge. Professionally, everything is going great, but much to the dismay of her mother, Chloe confesses she has given up on ever finding Mr. Right. That all changes the night of the opening of the festival when she meets Evan. The two begin a whirlwind romance, but as Christmas Day nears, Chloe learns that Evan is being transferred overseas for work. What follows is three more Christmases where Chloe and Evan cross paths at the annual festival, but each year something - or someone - stands in the way of true love. Will a touch of Santa\'s magic on their fourth Christmas Eve finally bring them together?','/dRv1JbwTsAymNnV5grIDN2NCNlH.jpg','2017-12-02',90,'Released',NULL,'Four Christmases and a Wedding',489204,2.5358,6.3,'cphH3b24FD0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44824,_binary '\0','/xTAEtKYzlgTJJgCJ6XTjJWznTs0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7642818',7.6,29303,'tr','Aile Arasında','When their long-term relationships collapse on the same day, a neurotic man and an eccentric lounge singer cross paths. To help her daughter marry into a conservative, wealthy family, he reluctantly agrees to pose as her dignified police chief father.','/lxA6UjZqRX1LFCQ6kgjpbCCP3JI.jpg','2017-12-01',124,'Released',NULL,'In the Family',477313,1.9091,6.7,'SIR405O6tNE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44825,_binary '\0','/onSuWj3ABjNvXMfoMbRMpznAyma.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7642878',3.7,2894,'tr','Maide\'nin Altın Günü','When a meticulous homemaker hosts a lavish get-together, her family heirloom gets stolen. She teams with her out-of-towner nephew to find the thief.','/nH6dH2E59kzoyLl0QLtXw38ZJLH.jpg','2017-12-08',103,'Released',NULL,'Maide\'nin Altın Günü',477314,1.2569,3.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44826,_binary '\0','/eZgexs88GCfhH7TuvGilN9Rcy7y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7643644',6.5,2243,'en','Rocky Mountain Christmas','Sarah Davis heads to her uncle’s struggling ranch to escape New York and the spotlight from a recent breakup. Returning home for the first time since her aunt passed, complications arise when Graham, an entitled Hollywood star, arrives at the ranch to prepare for his next film. As Sarah and Graham start to bond, Sarah may get more for Christmas than she bargained for.','/314Nw750L4PoQj0ypMB1gKnA0e0.jpg','2017-12-22',84,'Released',NULL,'Rocky Mountain Christmas',491761,2.0939,6.4,'oa1gfLP03II','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44827,_binary '\0','/wc0cHjbhAFOOrGc0IISZpiNjPSF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7645102',2.9,1817,'en','Burial Ground Massacre','A group of college students spend a night at an old, eerie manor, only to realize that a terrifying stalker is watching their every move as he begins plans to repossess an ancient Native American artifact located inside.','/3Uc7SOQSykREi7BSeSONVUGhp8V.jpg','2021-09-03',100,'Released','Unearth the curse.','Burial Ground Massacre',710309,1.6629,2.3,'INBTcMYorAQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44828,_binary '\0','/sjLo8RbshOyglJK2NLGqIfdzPCp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7645122',6.6,20332,'en','Plus One','Longtime single friends, Ben and Alice, agree to be each other\'s respective plus one at every wedding they\'re invited to, during a busy summer of wedding fever.','/4w3bCp5UkLeemdq8MBNlyA3Zl2J.jpg','2019-06-14',98,'Released','10 weddings. 1 summer. No one can survive alone.','Plus One',508101,4.3758,6.821,'RZSeK851vZY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44829,_binary '\0','/pUuaYiqrAchLpEaE0KwIAB1wMD8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7645334',5.9,4611,'en','Landscape with Invisible Hand','Years into a benevolent alien occupation, mankind is still adjusting to its new overlords. Their technology initially held promise for global prosperity, but rendered most human jobs – and steady income – obsolete. When two teenagers discover the aliens are fascinated with human love and will pay for access to it, they decide to livestream their romance to make extra cash for their families.','/cnXvfZrj1azU5Rvbb8D7Fz0wkyt.jpg','2023-08-18',105,'Released','They came for our love.','Landscape with Invisible Hand',777411,3.5901,6,'lAD81wjRnL8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44830,_binary '\0','/hM1M2O7yIInSYsgZk8whQTEDfkI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7645780',5.8,7260,'en','The Wedding Guest','Jay is a man with a secret who travels from Britain to Pakistan to attend a wedding—armed with duct tape, a shotgun, and a plan to kidnap the bride-to-be. Jay and his hostage end up on the run across the border and through the railway stations, back alleys, and black markets of New Delhi.','/sm3PCprf2qrF90OD5vN4iPablMM.jpg','2019-03-01',96,'Released',NULL,'The Wedding Guest',500899,3.1131,5.645,'BO0BDQEslwQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44831,_binary '\0','/nehpjVk7DSh0pw4L4U623Zg1mRs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7646322',4.3,6633,'en','The Devil Below','A group of four amateur adventurers who specialize in exploring remote and forsaken places pay a visit to Shookum Hills, a town in the remote Appalachian Mountains which was abandoned decades ago due to a mysterious coal mine fire.','/bKpkB86oJ2IyIlpGLTF66zBPSDp.jpg','2021-03-05',89,'Released','They\'re not alone.','The Devil Below',760875,3.1075,4.6,'LWLwzYXbFdo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44832,_binary '\0','/dtrq8Ly72AAIxQTZiFBrsSDO39f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7647000',6.7,2517,'en','With Love, Christmas','Advertising execs Melanie Welsh and Donovan Goodwin disagree on a cellphone Christmas commercial they’re pitching. He says his sleek design will win over the client but she knows it lacks holiday spirit.','/4nbTHrFz2hPH1TkG3K92UkYPKyW.jpg','2017-11-22',83,'Released',NULL,'With Love, Christmas',474976,1.8558,6.9,'YWTylMMkSFw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44833,_binary '\0','/xdSy4hVQ1cCqDrdRlp0pNwWkg15.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7647010',6.4,2226,'en','The Mistletoe Inn','When aspiring romance novelist Kim Rossi is unceremoniously dumped by her soon-to-be-published romance novelist boyfriend, Kim takes stock and decides to take a leap. She signs up for a romance writing retreat at a quaint Vermont Inn shortly before Christmas, where a top romance novelist is scheduled to attend and read the work of one lucky writer. Shortly after arriving, she crosses paths with Zeke, whom she initially finds to be intrusive and, naturally, ends up being her assignment partner. Worse yet, her ex is also at the retreat. Despite these bumps in the road, Kim steps outside her comfort zone and plunges into the writing exercises, surprising herself. Equally unexpected is the attraction that seems to be building between her and Zeke that promises to take her down a road she never imagined traveling. Based on the book by Richard Paul Evans.','/AiB08D4fSiM6ZObwVLbGNo5ej9P.jpg','2017-11-23',84,'Released',NULL,'The Mistletoe Inn',475829,1.7,6,'SH6zFydrQM8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44834,_binary '\0','/t0yiHgYS28wr5z9Z28TfUuIP5tt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7647198',7.2,1264,'hi','लव एंड शुक्ला','Shukla, a newly-married rickshaw driver, struggles to connect with his painfully shy bride Lakshmi. Their woes are compounded by his friends’ bad advice and his family’s inability to understand the concept of personal space.','/ngYmvz0U2ZdJOFzf23fgPdZK0lc.jpg','2017-10-13',117,'Released',NULL,'Love and Shukla',486471,1.4735,7,'gfaDDXoT1Ro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44835,_binary '\0','/57apTJLwkykIT5jakxloP4DKwYQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7647840',5.7,1266,'en','Good Posture','A lazy and beautiful young woman uses men to make her life easier, until she pushes one too far, forcing her to discover that she can live a better life by taking responsibility for herself.','/7DOVkm8tmIvKblzTQFmrmVu5rhO.jpg','2019-10-04',92,'Released',NULL,'Good Posture',515725,1.4907,5.2,'0oePXZdY75o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44836,_binary '\0','/tKpKadxhYGhLq5m0Ek5jHVj0dhI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7648416',6.1,1226,'it','Io c\'è','The owner of a dilapidated B&B has an idea: in order to dodge bankruptcy, he has to turn his business into a place of worship—a tax-free activity, where he\'ll host pilgrims in exchange for a generous donation. He joins forces with an unscrupulous accountant and a failed novelist to come up with his new religion.','/kqGjUROxf2nak14rhB1NvPKGpDc.jpg','2018-03-29',100,'Released',NULL,'Just Believe',492355,0.9757,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44837,_binary '\0','/cddaI7SOxbajANPI2Q082109DsX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7649320',6.5,1906,'zh','暴雪将至','Yu, a self-assured factory guard, fancies himself a detective and begins poking his nose into a murder investigation.','/kpFHe37zzrBNIxRcilVhhGHDmCk.jpg','2017-11-17',120,'Released',NULL,'The Looming Storm',487786,1.6099,6.28,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44838,_binary '\0','/wDwQXLDUuiEaaiuWIDBpbqnwYGX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7653254',7.9,375426,'en','Marriage Story','A stage director and an actress struggle through a grueling, coast-to-coast divorce that pushes them to their personal extremes.','/2JRyCKaRKyJAVpsIHeLvPw5nHmw.jpg','2019-09-28',137,'Released','Where there\'s a love, there\'s a way.','Marriage Story',492188,11.7864,7.733,'BHi-a1n8t7M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44839,_binary '\0','/fdoN0vzVXuPQbR0nHWnTYOhf6dZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7654082',6.3,2321,'en','Royal New Year\'s Eve','An aspiring fashion designer falls in love with her socialite client\'s prospective fiance, Prince Jeffrey.','/rNzJ3GZqT1L3uszZMjqsmzuD3L6.jpg','2017-12-30',84,'Released',NULL,'Royal New Year\'s Eve',474979,2.5073,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44840,_binary '\0','/yP8fKBiHljcPJIPAH04hhd1F6zG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7654872',5.5,2079,'fr','Amoureux de ma femme','When Daniel and Isabelle invite Patrick and his new flame, Emma, to dinner, it’s with some misgivings. After all, Patrick has just dumped his ex-wife — their best friend — to run off with a much younger woman. But when the ravishing Emma appears, all of Daniel’s qualms fly out of the window. He’s instantly smitten with the seductive woman...','/5WcVbQA1lT3iOroeLzRhlRpVo9N.jpg','2018-04-26',84,'Released',NULL,'The Other Woman',499722,3.7463,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44841,_binary '\0','/I5yAaGUORfH1xkUgL7HPFmrF5x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7657428',5.2,1272,'en','Snowmance','No man is perfect enough for Sarah Groves, except perhaps the impressive snowmen she sculpts annually with her childhood pal, Nick. In mid-December, her snowman disappears, and in his place, materializes Cole, who seems too perfect for Sarah to be true.','/sXPTx7lelMZMdvRy7EbjaPq9BXX.jpg','2017-11-20',90,'Released','She’s building her perfect man, one snowflake at a time.','Snowmance',487045,2.0117,5.7,'4WeODKICqxA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44842,_binary '\0','/A0gZrxsl2imWwZjg8SQXv8yOQUx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7657462',7.1,3154,'en','A Bramble House Christmas','While settling his father’s estate, Finn Conrad becomes suspicious as to why the man left a nurse $100,000. His dad knew her for less than two months before he died. Just before Christmas, Finn wants what to reclaim what he considers his family’s money, going undercover to investigate the bed and breakfast the nurse has recently taken over. When Finn meets Willa, he discovers she’s not a conniving gold digger at all, but a woman in need who put the money to good use. When she discovers his true identity, will it keep Willa from ever trusting him again?','/dosP338nILsuFDfJuKjNMvaDcbO.jpg','2017-11-19',85,'Released',NULL,'A Bramble House Christmas',479606,2.2091,6.4,'-Wq8-U6HM_8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44843,_binary '\0','/lRbDyjI7HEaXxflFQbYpqHRGFBJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7657566',6.3,215625,'en','Death on the Nile','Belgian sleuth Hercule Poirot\'s Egyptian vacation aboard a glamorous river steamer turns into a terrifying search for a murderer when a picture-perfect couple\'s idyllic honeymoon is tragically cut short.','/kVr5zIAFSPRQ57Y1zE7KzmhzdMQ.jpg','2022-02-09',127,'Released','Murder was just the beginning.','Death on the Nile',505026,20.9676,6.404,'JM1U-Whb-P0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44844,_binary '\0','/ahNMDVoGY4JUzpMs34jQvhMo7t2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7658384',6.1,1442,'es','La quietud','Against the backdrop of a military dictatorship, Eugenia is reunited with her estranged family following her father’s stroke and is forced to confront dark secret.','/8VTB3INNVY3xE72MhKQqN3Yvmjc.jpg','2018-08-30',117,'Released','Sisters be united','The Quietude',482936,2.181,6,'avHAHBxSzMo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44845,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7658610',5.3,1564,'zh','最后的锦衣卫','In the early Qing Dynasty, elite Jin guards infiltrate General Li’s palace and reclaim the legendary Chicken Cup. Three hundred years later, Jin guard descendant He Fan sacrifices his life to protect the artifact from treasure hunter David Wong during a battle at a temple.','/r73kYgAx130I5FmmMHjCwl9qXjJ.jpg','2018-04-14',92,'Released',NULL,'The Final Blade',522928,0.9494,3.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44846,_binary '\0','/cQaKW53dJhAn4ztkstXJkAzWcBa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7660450',5.8,1283,'it','La profezia dell\'armadillo','A 27-year-old suburban slacker entertains daily conversations bordering on paradoxical with his conscience, which manifests itself in the form of a human-sized armadillo. Based on the best-selling graphic novel by Zerocalcare.','/1dHaWQxkm8gmdTuuignUOg5kmx9.jpg','2018-09-13',99,'Released',NULL,'The Armadillo\'s Prophecy',537847,1.3436,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44847,_binary '\0','/2Z1RXaXCzOQUufcKNnLlJDqsCbt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7661396',6.1,1258,'en','Beers of Joy','Medieval monasteries, historic German villages, and breweries from across the world serve as the backdrop for four people immersing themselves in their passion for beer.','/nsHaHGfw9TRtK3C9YNcT8gndzMi.jpg','2019-03-01',118,'Released','Pour with vigor','Beers of Joy',583746,0.7272,6.3,'5-ttVzAcn24','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44848,_binary '\0','/jGuNsL3KpPZCsRE2Um61Pu4gAqH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7662752',6.5,3459,'fr','You Go To My Head','Following a mysterious car accident in the desert, Dafne suffers from post-traumatic amnesia. Jake, the first person she sees when she regains consciousness, tells her he\'s her husband.','/d1eMKTDEz3yOAnjfm6nhc0hPnmT.jpg','2017-10-26',116,'Released','A love story with a twist... and a twisted story with love!','You Go To My Head',508892,1.1418,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44849,_binary '\0','/2shn4Kiq7qInZgKZhqM5BKie1zL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7664504',7.6,45395,'en','Three Identical Strangers','New York, 1980. Three complete strangers accidentally discover that they\'re identical triplets, separated at birth. The 19-year-olds\' joyous reunion catapults them to international fame, but also unlocks an extraordinary and disturbing secret that goes beyond their own lives – and could transform our understanding of human nature forever.','/esPoJNMBsgWXahv8gILIl5K6sFk.jpg','2018-06-29',97,'Released','The most amazing, incredible, remarkable true story ever told.','Three Identical Strangers',489988,3.449,7.3,'uM5TQ4f7ycw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44850,_binary '\0','/zqMDbID9RySRS9wsYAqBBF5AZaR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7665476',7.3,1516,'pt','O Processo','The impeachment and removal from office of Brazilian President Dilma Rousseff in 2016 was triggered by a corruption scandal involving, among others, her then vice-president Michel Temer. Director Maria Augusta Ramos follows the trial against Rousseff from the point of view of her defence team. This is a courtroom drama that unfolds slowly: the appearances of the various parties gradually turn the proceedings into something akin to theatre. Inside the courtroom, grand emotions are played to full effect whilst, on the other side of the doors, lobbyists and supporters pace the corridors. Meanwhile, outside, in front of Brasília’s modernist government buildings, demonstrators are chanting like a Greek chorus. Only the main character, Rousseff herself, remains professional and aloof.','/8fo3dSn0mfu8Pi5a6RTE7WAzpxJ.jpg','2018-05-17',137,'Released',NULL,'The Trial',500833,0.8608,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44851,_binary '\0','/cBmHr3lCEbGxxNX7gQl9HiC1enL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7666250',7,2429,'es','Yuli','Yuli is the nickname given to Carlos Acosta by his father, Pedro, who considers him the son of Ogun, an African god and a fighter. As a child Yuli avoids discipline and education, learning from the streets of an impoverished and abandoned Havana. His father, however, has other ideas, and knowing that his son has a natural talent for dance, sends him to the National Ballet School of Cuba. Despite his repeated escapes and initial poor behaviour, the boy is inevitably drawn to the world of dance, and begins to shape his legendary career from a young age, becoming the first black dancer to be cast in some of the most prestigious ballet roles, originally written for white dancers, in companies such as the Houston Ballet or the Royal Ballet in London.','/hGGbrGNLqB0SSdH9DCuas3mSAv6.jpg','2018-12-14',115,'Released',NULL,'Yuli',537021,1.7026,6.9,'CQVYb5JDwH0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44852,_binary '\0','/qSdUXRX75HJg4FCAUqbK7BUb0KP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7666724',6.5,1640,'es','Esto no es Berlín','Seventeen-year-old Carlos doesn\'t fit in anywhere, not in his family nor with the friends he has chosen in school. But everything changes when he is invited to a mythical nightclub where he discovers the underground LGBTQ nightlife scene: punk, sexual liberty and drugs.','/1aWD6w5VCUOeYx4iYRr0HCE4mxy.jpg','2019-06-21',115,'Released',NULL,'This Is Not Berlin',555795,2.2548,6.9,'xUA1XUNpT8M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44853,_binary '\0','/zS8iep9mn9HEAyjsNolG9I8jgSG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7668724',4.9,1900,'en','The Marine 6: Close Quarters','Jake Carter and another former Marine, Luke Trapper, join forces to rescue a young kidnapped girl from a gang of international criminals.','/ApPQa5MVbHkVXNKrXHpHSXd1puu.jpg','2018-11-02',85,'Released','No one promised them a fair fight.','The Marine 6: Close Quarters',548928,3.3433,6.8,'cnSMaV_Xp0k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44854,_binary '\0','/mLPayvyJWIc6aU0murHgQvYMIrP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7668842',2,56825,'tr','Enes Batur: Hayal mi Gerçek mi?','Enes Batur has to decide between going to college or being a professional YouTuber.','/kVFiaar47pNrkI4HzYRGznCFhs2.jpg','2018-01-19',110,'Released',NULL,'Enes Batur: Imagination or Reality?',495339,1.2563,2.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44855,_binary '\0','/jOqOduY1tLhXgVZo7ypCtDVr0mM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7668870',7.6,195021,'en','Searching','After David Kim\'s 16-year-old daughter goes missing, a local investigation is opened and a detective is assigned to the case. But 37 hours later and without a single lead, David decides to search the one place no one has looked yet, where all secrets are kept today: his daughter\'s laptop.','/yuAPCsCGJGSxA7YOW4elF5JNrzK.jpg','2018-08-24',102,'Released','No one is lost without a trace.','Searching',489999,9.3726,7.565,'1f-nx8OAMVk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44856,_binary '\0','/fsb0hX41lxQqEgnTQRlWAdbAywu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7669768',5.7,4538,'en','A Father\'s Diary','Hassan and Mario are neighbors. They have raised their daughters, Dina and Isabella together, supporting each other through tough times. When Hassan, faces the challenges of modern life, both inside and outside the home, his reactions propel a series of events that threatens everything he holds dear. When his daughter Dina becomes more than good friends, a life partner, with her best friend Isabella, hard decisions have to be made.','/m4q1KyoKeaBa2X0TyAq5yO2cqH0.jpg','2021-01-23',113,'Released','A father\'s love, a daughter\'s truth, and the clash of cultures.','A Father\'s Diary',1242496,1.547,8.5,'7TrRU-NhhTg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44857,_binary '\0','/5CpXLhwcjnupeC5Ll3hMoCMJf1l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7670212',6.7,22661,'de','Der Goldene Handschuh','A serial killer strikes fear in the hearts of residents of Hamburg during the early 1970s.','/tu4PfotoM2Fti033O9gwHt7XpJw.jpg','2019-02-21',110,'Released',NULL,'The Golden Glove',505706,4.8407,6.935,'5KoazD3Lgws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44858,_binary '\0','/zVBsGrA8MIx7DNeo33Ll86dKzZU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7671064',6.8,24132,'en','Brittany Runs a Marathon','Hilarious and outgoing, Brittany Forgler, is everybody’s best friend ― except her own. Her partying, underemployment and toxic relationships are catching up with her. She receives a startling wake-up call when a visit to the doctor reveals how unhealthy she is. Motivated to lose weight, but too broke for a gym and too proud to ask for help, Brit is at a loss, until her neighbor pushes her to run one sweaty block. Soon, she sets an almost unthinkable goal: the New York City Marathon.','/aSWePCEtLpNdD7ykW6OuZqvVhyn.jpg','2019-08-23',103,'Released','You can\'t rush progress.','Brittany Runs a Marathon',529862,4.0375,6.6,'Ks_HSj1UqKI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44859,_binary '\0','/3CRqN7QfY43vp920P3GxBIQwC92.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7671414',3.6,1377,'en','Thriller','Years after a childhood prank goes horribly wrong, a clique of South Central LA teens find themselves terrorized during Homecoming weekend by a killer hell-bent on revenge.','/mliD95nVqBijPGQdZ3xcg8Nsagu.jpg','2018-09-23',87,'Released',NULL,'Thriller',541100,1.5094,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44860,_binary '\0','/ehaZKFWlNV1UudA4DBnFAG6eozT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7672068',6.8,6174,'ru','Папа, сдохни','Andrey, a detective and the world\'s most horrible father, brings together a terrible group of people in his apartment: his resentful actress daughter, an angry thug, and a cheated cop. Each one of them has a reason to want revenge..','/warC8GJApWssmU9vXXZDY7OrU9o.jpg','2018-08-13',94,'Released','Meeting the parents doesn\'t go smoothly…','Why Don\'t You Just Die!',514684,2.5076,6.621,'cjahkMJ8s1I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44861,_binary '\0','/LXjVMkBXu4cDwzcwsaGl9JmkV2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7675404',8,1615,'el','1968','A.E.K., the well-known Greek basketball team founded in 1924 by refugees from Constantinople, after 44 years, beats SLAVIA of Prague and wins the European Cup.','/q2P8e3TF1CWPBuDpT2OULTdviwP.jpg','2018-01-25',93,'Released','They won because they couldn\'t lose','1968',493832,0.7447,7.3,'VZw3UHU2zKs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44862,_binary '\0','/jaeZDZG3gav9G7wURL6xw7CGHmt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7679126',5.8,1857,'es','El mejor verano de mi vida','A father in financial problems takes his son on vacation as he tries to solve his life.','/q3RwcNpLTdum99fTWcMazEwSd4v.jpg','2018-07-12',91,'Released',NULL,'The Best Summer of My Life',519597,1.8597,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44863,_binary '\0','/vGYMPlVUS5ViBTlINn4A1dRiesu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7681824',6.9,4817,'en','We the Animals','Manny, Joel and Jonah tear their way through childhood and push against the volatile love of their parents. As Manny and Joel grow into versions of their father and Ma dreams of escape, Jonah, the youngest, embraces an imagined world all his own.','/pSMcNOpihv6U4JlNAaxfbl2qUj7.jpg','2018-08-17',93,'Released','Us three, us brothers, us kings.','We the Animals',490000,2.0437,6.468,'jTRZsrj28C4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44864,_binary '\0','/yrepQdpreOorLyBJyvZkGn3Izfe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7681902',8.3,28301,'en','Won\'t You Be My Neighbor?','For more than thirty years, and through his television program, Fred Rogers (1928-2003), host, producer, writer and pianist, accompanied by his puppets and his many friends, spoke directly to young children about some of life\'s most important issues.','/8qE8NZjiP2M884baH0VoLF828Vp.jpg','2018-06-29',95,'Released','A little kindness makes a world of difference.','Won\'t You Be My Neighbor?',490003,4.3455,8,'EAwR54HrVW8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44865,_binary '\0','/8w1A6YyblqO3xvyUTrMZDbQ7MMw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7681970',5.4,1868,'en','After Porn Ends 3','After Porn Ends 3 continues to explore whether a career as an adult performer is inherently damaging to the balance of a perfomer\'s life once retired.','/wtbnyrnqpGgrgMZJz5rlv6q6V2c.jpg','2018-10-30',86,'Released','Can you finish on top?','After Porn Ends 3',557635,2.6275,5.4,'RRvmMY_OB-4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44866,_binary '\0','/k8zXEr5qF6y1RvGQUZxNopXFfzK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7682204',5.6,1646,'en','Out of Time','Three mysterious figures emerge from the Mojave Desert and make their way to Los Angeles, leaving a trail of bodies in their path.','/n4BUtXUVMP3ch6gyRyH2qnW0nE1.jpg','2021-08-09',92,'Released',NULL,'Out of Time',816480,1.4751,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44867,_binary '\0','/8B7ZCUeLsTqO72o0uVKMIQXSjOi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7682430',7.5,1709,'en','Howard','Though legendary lyricist Howard Ashman died far too young, his impact on Broadway, movies, and the culture at large were incalculable. Told entirely through rare archival footage and interviews with Ashman’s family, friends, associates, and longtime partner Bill Lauch, Howard is an intimate tribute to a once-in-a-generation talent and a rousing celebration of musical storytelling itself.','/kTMIYVGKeXsIcVumZvyapkhvQiY.jpg','2018-04-22',93,'Released','He gave a mermaid her voice and a beast his soul.','Howard',512191,2.2036,6.8,'8QxEh4iadnw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44868,_binary '\0','/1LTFzAsiDVSWOuv4aRRgtPD5Xfv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7684228',7.8,1709,'te','మళ్ళీ రావా','Karthik and Anjali are childhood sweethearts who fell in love when they\'re fourteen. Despite having immense love for each other, circumstances forced them apart many a time. Will things change when they grow older? Will their love story finally have a happy ending?','/rgFG0l8Aud8QksOg3rdUwdBnSAo.jpg','2017-12-08',128,'Released',NULL,'Malli Raava',492261,1.17,8.176,'DLQlCmwrDtY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44869,_binary '\0','/sKoEKXA2OFdw8oDY6sv5wGygC0N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7688990',7,4242,'en','Christmas Getaway','When a reservation mix-up at a mountain resort forces a newly-single travel writer to share a cabin with a handsome widower and his precocious daughter over the holidays, their lives are transformed by the magic of Christmas and the unexpected power of love.','/ohBJhAI7YJrlYmnr4czCvZj1FW7.jpg','2017-12-23',84,'Released',NULL,'Christmas Getaway',480623,3.5466,7,'xhS8yV0O784','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44870,_binary '\0','/gQP5eRO2h2PZCzDRiP7pQlQwwwU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7689052',4.2,2641,'en','Daphne & Velma','Before their eventual team-up with Scooby and the gang, bright and optimistic Daphne and whip-smart and analytical Velma are both mystery-solving teens who are best friends but have only met online - until now. Daphne has just transferred to Velma\'s school, Ridge Valley High, an incredible tech-savvy institute with all the latest gadgets provided by the school\'s benefactor, tech billionaire Tobias Bloom. And while competition is fierce among the students for a coveted internship at Bloom Innovative, Daphne and Velma dig beyond all the gadgets and tech to investigate what is causing some of the brightest students in school to disappear - only to emerge again in a zombie-fied state.','/zG2DHbo2GNxSmcFWqGkAPgS6hC8.jpg','2018-05-22',75,'Released','Before Scooby-Doo these B.F.F.s had a clue.','Daphne & Velma',489939,2.8429,6.075,'A40-vFz3tc0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44871,_binary '\0','/mfvJQLVu7g3cYMOLmSVpSs3vIdL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7689310',6.6,2981,'de','Die Goldfische','Oliver is a banker and portfolio manager and leads a life in the fast lane, which one day comes to an abrupt end, as he builds a self-inflicted accident on highway with 230 km / h and raced through a guardrail. When he wakes up in the hospital again, he faces a devastating diagnosis: paraplegia. Actually, a rehabilitation stay of several months is planned in the hospital, but Oliver soon falls on his head and ends up in a disabled shared flat with the name \"Die Goldfische\"','/arqU72w8tkCGCIKEul476of8qZE.jpg','2019-02-28',111,'Released',NULL,'The Goldfish',535092,1.8785,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44872,_binary '\0','/4Nm7zZbRLFrNqzaHQB604pQAV3F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7689906',6.1,2935,'en','Monsters and Men','After capturing an illegal act of police violence on his cellphone, a Brooklyn street hustler sets off a series of events that alter the lives of a local police officer and a star high-school athlete.','/u6FtNjPCVF3yRMFGvbzNj56i1Dj.jpg','2018-09-22',96,'Released','One moment can change everything','Monsters and Men',489934,2.0504,5.8,'4AnpybNQ-hU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44873,_binary '\0','/xu6ba6x4yyGWNqejV5b98bnaCWm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7689910',7.8,1465,'en','The Devil We Know','Unraveling one of the biggest environmental scandals of our time, a group of citizens in West Virginia take on a powerful corporation after they discover it has knowingly been dumping a toxic chemical — now found in the blood of 99.7% of Americans — into the local drinking water supply.','/9eLww3wkI2x1RjDqHf0xfyxiNaM.jpg','2018-01-21',88,'Released','The Chemistry of a Cover-up','The Devil We Know',489984,1.6922,7.6,'7cCkADnhRqk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44874,_binary '\0','/nHMDV9T4zlGm1jBbjNCYA3rwgs5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7689924',7.3,1549,'en','Seeing Allred','Gloria Allred overcame trauma and personal setbacks to become one of the nation’s most famous women’s rights attorneys. Now the feminist firebrand takes on two of the biggest adversaries of her career, Bill Cosby and Donald Trump, as sexual violence allegations grip the nation and keep her in the spotlight.','/1qWYAR7xWeiWgTmD8aqkbSTXpFT.jpg','2018-01-21',96,'Released','The powerful have secrets. The powerless have a weapon.','Seeing Allred',490818,1.4475,6.7,'SC8Eg0odTfY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44875,_binary '\0','/pbntfTRWEsJUSqEqk89xtO6LNrB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7689936',7.1,1938,'de','Im Schatten der Netzwelt','A deep dive into the hidden industry of digital cleaning, which rids the Internet of unwanted violence, porn and political content.','/tLA7Lugt1RH1UQphreIhun1Mnuk.jpg','2018-05-17',85,'Released','Who is controlling what we see… and what we think?','The Cleaners',492994,1.3698,7.1,'iGCGhD8i-o4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44876,_binary '\0','/dAM73mT6T8Vci5collkYIhqxj1t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7689958',7.9,3095,'en','Jane Fonda in Five Acts','Girl next door, activist, so-called traitor, fitness tycoon, Oscar winner: Jane Fonda has lived a life of controversy, tragedy and transformation – and she’s done it all in the public eye. An intimate look at one woman’s singular journey.','/lgOfQqfOeMt2dGsD8u0XcBOvfpo.jpg','2018-01-21',133,'Released',NULL,'Jane Fonda in Five Acts',490082,2.2393,7.1,'d4rdvHGMtBE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44877,_binary '\0','/prShXu2j9SWAbeatf1A9AobqE5O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7689964',7.6,15697,'en','RBG','Justice Ruth Bader Ginsburg now 84, and still inspired by the lawyers who defended free speech during the Red Scare, Ginsburg refuses to relinquish her passionate duty, steadily fighting for equal rights for all citizens under the law. Through intimate interviews and unprecedented access to Ginsburg’s life outside the court, RBG tells the electric story of Ginsburg’s consuming love affairs with both the Constitution and her beloved husband Marty—and of a life’s work that led her to become an icon of justice in the highest court in the land.','/vIenhDe9DuvxODJOIpMjBheYlcS.jpg','2018-05-04',98,'Released','Hero. Icon. Dissenter.','RBG',493099,2.7826,7.478,'biIRlcQqmOc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44878,_binary '\0','/1FIK6rehI7ZMVRv3MDY5GHiYa9M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7689966',7.9,10462,'en','Robin Williams: Come Inside My Mind','A funny, intimate and heartbreaking portrait of one of the world’s most beloved and inventive comedians, Robin Williams, told largely through his own words. Celebrates what he brought to comedy and to the culture at large, from the wild days of late-1970s L.A. to his death in 2014.','/ak9DZnzInl9oIUlXxsFsUd37ueh.jpg','2018-01-19',116,'Released',NULL,'Robin Williams: Come Inside My Mind',493100,3.5578,7.9,'caIFNg_JRL4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44879,_binary '\0','/v3Iwpj92YUzOkVomZ2SpjpxEVMe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7690016',6,4786,'en','Never Goin\' Back','Angela and Jessie are best friends intent on taking a wild beach trip, but when their roommate loses all of their money in a drug scam, the girls -- blissfully stoned -- go to increasingly daring and absurd lengths to get it back.','/3ytp5pmHFVvAesnL2SJecxgV8W2.jpg','2018-08-03',87,'Released',NULL,'Never Goin\' Back',490005,4.8609,6.1,'9q7g4zz20Kc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44880,_binary '\0','/9uULFszJOj8j6ByHfSe8U3GzC14.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7690638',7.3,6506,'hi','सूरमा','Soorma, a comeback story of the hockey legend Sandeep Singh is a biopic that chronicles the life and times of the famed hockey player.','/p9s0fTFQbfldhP757ykmidzNyFh.jpg','2018-07-13',131,'Released','The Greatest Comeback Story Of The Hockey Legend Sandeep Singh','Soorma',489852,1.9094,7.221,'pTDjvuk5sMk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44881,_binary '\0','/fJKJXKiRSzDihp50c7j39zb3ILi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7690670',5.3,8145,'en','SuperFly','Career criminal Youngblood Priest wants out of the Atlanta drug scene, but as he ramps up sales, one little slip up threatens to bring the whole operation down before he can make his exit.','/gGk9H5PVpWzbsYkmnBeKevQkwwf.jpg','2018-06-13',107,'Released','Redefine the hussle','SuperFly',500475,4.3074,6.72,'MQIvV800Atk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44882,_binary '\0','/zcTinIK3viPag7sn4XYjO4DzDaN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7690762',5.2,1355,'es','El pacto','Suddenly, Clara, Mónica\'s daughter, falls into a deep coma. With Clara left to die, a mysterious man proposes Monica to make a pact: Clara will be saved if Mónica does something for him.','/7ibI5KJmdEYQnCcuDMk0clCrz1C.jpg','2018-08-17',90,'Released','Evil always reclaims its debt.','The Pact',517320,1.6588,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44883,_binary '\0','/nvVkh27onVgYQLJqRCjko8zyCXC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7691572',7.5,8178,'uk','Кіборги','‘The Cyborgs’ is re-telling the recent history of Ukraine – the legendary fight for Donetsk Airport in 2014 during Russian invasion. The freedom fighters from various divisions of Ukrainian army and volunteer battalions took a 242-days stand against the Russian backed militants until the complete destruction of the airport’s terminal.','/xa0xgL5ykFThoJRVE91W2EYWKoa.jpg','2017-12-07',112,'Released','Heroes Never Die','Cyborgs',484936,1.6786,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44884,_binary '\0','/wZGxmJB1SmjfOP2CaFB5g6I8vFU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7692434',5.8,2712,'ml','18ാം പടി','Students of two schools in Thiruvananthapuram that cater to different economical classes are in a tussle. While one set struggles for survival, the other is busy finding joy in drugs. The two groups keep finding reasons to mess with each other. Will they find the purpose of their lives amid the chaos?','/g1nM5OseZbexzd8VJIiuOxEARHg.jpg','2019-07-05',159,'Released','Some are born heroes','Pathinettam Padi',569109,1.4846,5.269,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44885,_binary '\0','/wq8NiXe0OFbwWyd1tWxDTUQXW4r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7692814',5.3,1276,'en','My Christmas Prince','Samantha, a dedicated teacher in Manhattan, returns to her home town of Maple Falls, Wyoming every year for Christmas. This year, she’s delighted when her boyfriend Alex, a European diplomat from the tiny country of Madelvia, decides to joins her. Samantha later discovers Alex is actually a prince destined for the throne, turning her entire world upside down. Realizing that staying with Alex means spending her life in the constant glare of publicity and giving up the job opportunity of a lifetime, Samantha must decide if she loves Alex enough to make the transition from teacher to royal – or will it be too big a leap','/5qU2aVuBYXiZQ2yXDrqgsaBvtPP.jpg','2017-12-03',90,'Released',NULL,'My Christmas Prince',488063,2.2384,5.8,'O9nQzcd-VRM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44886,_binary '\0','/rsVazwpxN5YDOjy1JIGekqP2znd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7692822',4.9,3641,'en','Driven','Emerson Graham\'s nights as a cab driver are filled with annoyances and inconveniences, but until tonight, never attacks and disappearances. After picking up a mysterious passenger her evening goes from working a job to performing a quest as they must race against the clock to defeat a force of evil. The meter is running.','/ca0URmLciw4rZgjWU6y2nOapyGU.jpg','2019-02-09',89,'Released','A Frighteningly Funny Ride','Driven',587138,2.1035,4.4,'-EachXwlyL0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44887,_binary '\0','/xjscUUYPSJ6i4RDouqCXNWfAq7O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7692966',6.6,2525,'vi','Vợ ba','Though only 14 years old, May is selected to be the third wife of a wealthy landowner. Her new home seems idyllic, her husband favours her, and she quickly becomes pregnant with what she is certain will be the desired male progeny. But trouble is quietly brewing: she witnesses a forbidden tryst that will spark a chain reaction of misfortunes — and stir in May urges that until now had been dormant.','/lU5WzfaCT5WbqNY6JvdNkvf0ngd.jpg','2019-01-11',96,'Released',NULL,'The Third Wife',544812,2.3306,6.522,'P7CSaxXFRkA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44888,_binary '\0','/tY36rkGlREg5m9CaguckR8jZCye.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7693316',6.6,33263,'en','Devotion','The harrowing true story of two elite US Navy fighter pilots during the Korean War. Their heroic sacrifices would ultimately make them the Navy\'s most celebrated wingmen.','/26yQPXymbWeCLKwcmyL8dRjAzth.jpg','2022-11-23',139,'Released','In America’s forgotten war, they made history.','Devotion',653851,5.369,7.1,'-2qpKUExOnE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44889,_binary '\0','/zV0fCFyhKWPODleICO4G4r3NwY1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7696976',6.2,1730,'en','A Joyous Christmas','Just before Christmas, bestselling author Rachel Kennedy returns to her hometown to host an event for her upcoming book. Though being home is difficult since losing her parents and losing touch with her brother, David, she finds strength from unexpected sources, namely her local producer, Jack and a selfless stranger, Joy. Jack and Joy help Rachel connect with the community, reunite with her brother and reevaluate her motivational message. Rachel and Jack develop an undeniable bond, but Rachel is torn between their relationship and career pressure from her manager, Stuart. As the event approaches, Joy reveals a secret from her past that has a lasting impact on Jack, and Rachel must find a message that brings her fans — and herself – lasting joy.','/HepGTcrZXntj9kVbWdtiGhwc9I.jpg','2017-11-26',83,'Released',NULL,'A Joyous Christmas',483551,1.8273,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44890,_binary '\0','/vCvXVmUHaHVL8y4HP9xi4ZZpS1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7697712',6.1,1599,'en','Sharing Christmas','A real estate developer is given the opportunity of his career to transform an old shopping complex into a prime location. Unfortunately, there is one tenant who is holding out—the Christmas shop owner he met by happenstance just days ago.','/rbcQlnr10rmpyqGftTeZvtbKCeq.jpg','2017-12-10',84,'Released',NULL,'Sharing Christmas',483558,2.2149,6.2,'6hJc0OzhP0E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44891,_binary '\0','/udc1W1WEqVrZl4iyddFzYBut54W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7698468',6.7,10067,'en','A Call to Spy','The story of Vera Atkins, a crafty spy recruiter, and two of the first women she selects for Churchill\'s \"secret army\": Virginia Hall, a daring American undaunted by a disability and Noor Inayat Khan, a pacifist. These civilian women form an unlikely sisterhood while entangled in dangerous missions to turn the tide of the war.','/cK5D0ss2LLSZtOZKvgOVTcCdXIE.jpg','2020-10-02',124,'Released','Ordinary women. Extraordinary heroes.','A Call to Spy',589612,4.4369,6.763,'TbZgLKjrdnA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44892,_binary '\0','/6Z3e850z4TNBUo4OviVRfwjK5O3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7700730',7.6,21364,'hi','October','Dan, a 21-year-old carefree boy is always surrounded by a bunch of friends and fellow hotel interns who feed off each other\'s everyday moments, their ups and downs. Shiuli is also an intern working in the same hotel, who at times is at a receiving end of Dan\'s audaciousness. Everything was normal in their life until a sudden turn of events smashes Dan and Shiuli\'s lives together, into a bond.','/nHUBPUwXkHinq2rIXnnCHsPylD1.jpg','2018-04-13',109,'Released',NULL,'October',496527,1.4213,6.9,'7vracgLyJwI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44893,_binary '\0','/hqonfAYYdtaONYn11hxmhfdpktW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7701808',3.8,3056,'en','The Steam Engines of Oz','A century after the Wicked Witch, the Emerald City is at the mercy of a once-revered hero, and salvation comes from the wrench of young Victoria Wright. Rediscover old friends and meet new heroes in this new tale set in the Land of Oz.','/7N33DfWrDy7SnTj9ivn3ck52Her.jpg','2018-05-08',79,'Released','When Dorothy left Oz, the story didn\'t end.','The Steam Engines of Oz',527795,2.0102,5.3,'4jP_5zdzAWI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44894,_binary '\0','/fklgpWtOhm0f57TJ60Gfhi1EeH8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7703924',4.4,3763,'en','Infamous','Two young lovers rob their way across the southland, posting their exploits to social media, and gaining fame and followers as a result.','/q2lkJf1TAjImTHCEO7XvbqPtnPb.jpg','2020-06-12',100,'Released','Viral fame is a dangerous game.','Infamous',703134,2.2836,5.7,'wJtnDjWiQFg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44895,_binary '\0','/rkasXMPBdOXtIEx67KHsOsRlwwS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7704762',6.6,1980,'en','Christmas in Angel Falls','Gabby Messinger, a Guardian Angel who has trouble following the rules and is known for meddling in the love live’s of others, is tasked by the Angel Michael to help the town of Angel Falls find its Christmas spirit again.','/4IgTSlhqoRqAFTl7rumyQ5gy60N.jpg','2017-12-02',84,'Released',NULL,'Christmas in Angel Falls',483548,2.2701,6,'JMdVGy1clfo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44896,_binary '\0','/yueGj3Clb6Ngk8R50ox2k6MJEYl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7705790',7.2,4277,'te','తొలిప్రేమ','Aaditya is an impulsive individual who takes decisions spontaneously and is unafraid to speak his mind. The love of his life Varsha is his extreme opposite — she chooses not to let her emotions control her actions or words. Will these two differing individuals ever make their relationship work?','/txF7kvjr9lAbGCsykvsqhkvD6LI.jpg','2018-02-09',146,'Released','A Jouney of Love','Tholi Prema',500527,1.3661,7.18,'-kFvrsAgp3M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44897,_binary '\0','/20Dlni23gUdJMoRaB1U15JYM3PF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7706168',6.6,1235,'en','The Spy Who Fell to Earth','Based on Dr. Ahron Bregman\'s book, this documentary examines the life and mysterious death of Ashraf Marwan, an Egyptian billionaire and double agent.','/nIc9a0vCG00TmCObDazpmYtiDAs.jpg','2019-04-01',94,'Released',NULL,'The Spy Who Fell to Earth',593060,1.5001,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44898,_binary '\0','/oQb0md9X1S48jwCkYhQzokKzH9z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7707314',5.7,1609,'en','Lionheart','In order to save her father\'s ailing bus company, competent but perennially overlooked Adaeze must find a way to work alongside feckless uncle Godswill.','/ndS2uJ8Sum1qEU0fn5c8tdGAMDe.jpg','2018-09-08',95,'Released',NULL,'Lionheart',543774,1.0226,6.1,'v45GprEyM7U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44899,_binary '\0','/vmdt6nUXYX4mM0Ahcvh4bgHOjUt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7708226',5.8,4297,'en','Beast','MMA legend Patton James, now a commercial fisherman, is pulled back into the cage when his brother is in danger. Reuniting with his old coach Sammy, he commits to one final fight in one championship against the brutal champion Xavier Grau.','/7NrvUI3vnW8H3rD7ExKcTL7KRcQ.jpg','2026-04-10',115,'Released','Legends are made in the cage.','Beast',1292415,14.7209,7.515,'yJN2mJ4uOas','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44900,_binary '\0','/nCJ9Qdt157tLPK0ARP3gN59epJQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7710160',2.5,1255,'en','Breaking Barbi','A Tinder date gone astray leaves famous fitness selfie queen, Barbi, lost in the wilderness trying to survive despite Homeland Security, alien death rays and zero cell service.','/kDmRRbaKgsdWbAqM1LxRysE5CsI.jpg','2019-02-15',90,'Released','STOP THE SELFIES, SAVE THE WORLD','Breaking Barbi',506826,1.2401,2.4,'Fj8c__xXui4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44901,_binary '\0','/6pIOwyiyPmuNVBpn5g2cYln6c2n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7710588',6.8,1401,'es','Esperando a Dalí','In 1979s Spain, Fernando, a talented chef, arrives in the village of Cadaqués , 