.9,2594,'en','Karen Kingsbury\'s Maggie\'s Christmas Miracle','Maggie, a single mom has to balance between her career and her son, Jordan. Jordan finds a tutor named Casey to help him at school, and Casey becomes like a father figure. Will the three of them find happiness and love once again?','/1q171RMGfBIq36kGRwPznaxoKM2.jpg','2017-12-10',83,'Released',NULL,'Karen Kingsbury\'s Maggie\'s Christmas Miracle',480632,2.5665,6.6,'zJ4NSXxQ83g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44906,_binary '\0','/mqdis3xQfRm7epAXYKDGIDyHqBq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7714138',5.8,1500,'en','Christmas Encore','A struggling actress is cast in her last off (off) Broadway show - a modern take on “A Christmas Carol” - before giving up her dream and moving home. Instead, she finds romance with her director and a renewed passion for her craft and the city. But when the historic theater loses its lease and the show is set to fold, she and her cast mates are need of a Christmas miracle.','/oNL3C9ifCxM1eTcBecQxTFxZDNg.jpg','2017-12-23',84,'Released',NULL,'Christmas Encore',475833,2.6222,5.9,'6R5bi75vx5E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44907,_binary '\0','/bG7B1pFU1B0nzmgubE40PFvbU6O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7715070',5.4,3898,'en','Horrible Histories: The Movie — Rotten Romans','Brainy Roman teenager Atti is always coming up with schemes, but one ultimately goes too far, angering Emperor Nero. As punishment, the lad is exiled to the cold wet province of Roman Britain on the fringe of the Roman Empire. Whilst there, Atti is captured by—and eventually befriends—Orla, a feisty Celt. When he\'s returned to his regiment, he\'s horrified to find himself pitted against Orla and her tribe at the Boudican revolt\'s Battle of Watling Street.','/twa7mshWeCDkulOolgh26B0Zxgl.jpg','2019-07-26',92,'Released','Hail Yeah!','Horrible Histories: The Movie — Rotten Romans',553002,3.943,5.22,'ocJqSOU8LnQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(4490