ther, in order to defend their own beliefs.','/gZkRbEvrKDNHo0ttkss1MShdHjP.jpg','2021-10-07',111,'Released',NULL,'And Tomorrow the Entire World',728113,2.1744,6.1,'t0NLP1P54qM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44912,_binary '\0','/7EUM6T7iIxbca9RWKAH06omjAHZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7717440',7.3,1807,'th','๙ ศาสตรา','When the mystical kingdom of Ramathep is besieged by a monstrous army of Yaksa Clan, the faith of the kingdom lies in a young Muay Thai warrior determined to use a sacred weapon -the 9th Satra- to restore peace to the kingdom.','/jp3FSHmYzv85mjgyioO1RvcJ105.jpg','2018-01-11',107,'Released','Once a kingdom built on place and the lost art of muay thai was conquered.','The Legend of Muay Thai: 9 Satra',497536,1.7151,6.5,'4q40_CsS1A8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44913,_binary '\0','/u6JGnIabQslWMzX03hb3weEbvx0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7718100',5.3,2722,'en','Heist 88','A criminal mastermind recruits a group of young bank employees to steal 80 million dollars in one of the largest bank heist in US history.','/4ueFteb6V38fnSWTN4jIbLOlMlM.jpg','2023-10-01',83,'Released',NULL,'Heist 88',1170944,3.1504,6.68,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44914,_binary '\0','/4wCoZDys7zXWZdLqJoxbYVZYiC4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7718114',6.6,1458,'hu','FOMO: Megosztod, és uralkodsz','Gergő and his high-school friends, the “Pack”, live for sex, parties and racking up views on their online channel. As their videos grow increasingly extreme, a house party turns tragic when they single out Lilla as their next victim. In a single night, their reckless game shatters the illusion of invulnerability in Budapest’s youth scene.','/slYwZTLMR4bk4Apql5ezsRcyVgn.jpg','2019-10-10',89,'Released',NULL,'FOMO: Fear of Missing Out',636322,0.8241,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44915,_binary '\0','/yM19JFb4DA52RvbxbUAz8MtmNJE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7719976',7.5,1511,'ta','சர்வம் தா