tains. Noé is a respected artisan and Segundo’s role model. With loving eye for detail, he artfully crafts altarpieces for church and homes, and is preparing his son to follow in his footsteps. But cracks form in their tight bond.','/sb9o4IR5dhRASL3GoQl4cLWBDlO.jpg','2018-12-19',95,'Released',NULL,'Retablo',499394,1.2006,7.367,'NQiv6aFe6M8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44963,_binary '\0','/mp7ryCvT7zCmDH2VcfME3OHF9Z9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7762982',7.4,1774,'pa','ਸੱਜਣ ਸਿੰਘ ਰੰਗਰੂਟ','The film SAJJAN SINGH RANGROOT is based on true story about the Sikh Regiment, serving in the British Indian Army, during World War I. The movie depicts one such war hero Sajjan Singh, who is an officer in the British Army and served on the western front during the WW1 against Germany.','/zlOvO4fgun0b5B7AxPnPVV2TCVt.jpg','2018-03-23',140,'Released',NULL,'Sajjan Singh Rangroot',496324,1.2833,5.8,'n7YddfDo4N0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44964,_binary '\0','/vCIcsaXTo2JFVC4Qevo3GeZOW5A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7763020',6.4,2375,'ru','Довлатов','Dovlatov charts six days in the life of a brilliant, ironic writer who saw far beyond the rigid limits of 70s Soviet Russia. Sergei Dovlatov fought to preserve his own talent and decency with poet and writer Joseph Brodsky, while watching his artist friends got crushed by the iron-willed state machinery.','/gYLev9O4YoK5vwByYcWwAdG15Xa.jpg','2018-02-27',126,'Released',NULL,'Dovlatov',493655,1.6875,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44965,_binary '\0','/cl2PJfdyV1PlmNvzsSEsajUCbHQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7763324',7,1312,'en','Amazing Stories','A feature film edited from three episodes of Amazing Stories (1985): The Mission, Mummy Daddy, and Go to the Head of the Class.','/8XJb9oEnpLtMoOx4Za6JVMA8vqy.jpg','1986-07-10',111,'Released','As one experience ends... another adventure begins.','Amazing Stories',576510,2.6302,6.103,'7c26YC1sIZo','YouTube','Trailer'