M1bMnw0E6yMJMa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7766092',7.4,1424,'en','A Christmas Carol Goes Wrong','The Mischief Theatre Company return as the Cornley Polytechnic Drama Society who are this time determined to ignore a BBC blacklisting by hijacking a live production of Charles Dickens\' famous festive fable. Yet they struggle with studio direction and special effects, and trying to keep a professional cast at bay.','/8hJz0FY6G6PIDDOYe54rBo8hLIF.jpg','2017-12-30',50,'Released',NULL,'A Christmas Carol Goes Wrong',492380,1.4971,7.667,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44971,_binary '\0','/2n7lYEeIbucsEQCswRcVB6ZYmMP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7766378',5.9,87654,'en','The Electric State','An orphaned teen hits the road with a mysterious robot to find her long-lost brother, teaming up with a smuggler and his wisecracking sidekick.','/sI2NiMU8o65hmIMY0JI9CjJ0p7f.jpg','2025-02-24',125,'Released','Rage with the machines.','The Electric State',777443,16.3163,6.469,'KpN98z8Kf5E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44972,_binary '\0','/3VMmc3Verf5gfjeWFbstd4C3Xgk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7766886',6.6,2801,'fr','La Fille au bracelet','Lise (16 years old) is accused of murdering her best friend. As the trial starts, her parents stand right by her side. But once her secret life is revealed in court, the truth becomes indistinguishable.','/vnIQq8R50P7rEwi2UivROxYiJv3.jpg','2020-02-12',95,'Released',NULL,'The Girl with a Bracelet',582923,2.3356,6.5,'MpfmaYD4cGE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44973,_binary '\0','/dkFTYhxOeQP3eIvzjuhcKitCplY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7767866',6,1594,'te','చల్ మోహన్ రంగ','A young man with dreams of making it big in the USA falls in love with an NRI woman residing there. She breaks up with him for reasons unknown to him but serendipity plays cupid.','/qawBFeXKfsUNIfnq4cTJbg1INFK.jpg','2018-04-05',148,'Released','Everything is a sign','Chal Mohan Ranga',508887,1.3359,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44974,_binary '\0','/zQBosNXsl8YG1IBnrdVHEHH4lsd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7768286',6.8,1784,'en','Last Scene Alive: An Aurora Teagarden Mystery','There is excitement in the air when a Hollywood crew comes to Lawrenceton to film a movie about the town’s sleuthy librarian, Aurora Teagarden. However, when the film’s leading lady is found murdered in her dressing room, Aurora enlists her Real Murders Club members to help gather clues. At the same time, she experiences mounting concern that Aida is becoming attracted to the film’s director who, like everyone else working on the set that day, is considered a suspect. And this time around Martin is especially worried about Aurora’s safety after learning that the film’s screenwriter, who has a romantic history with her, emerges as the prime suspect.','/bkNm43jTxBuv46SKUOtIS5enFpA.jpg','2018-01-07',85,'Released',NULL,'Last Scene Alive: An Aurora Teagarden Mystery',494466,2.5296,7.2,'EhnfFGuVYBg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44975,_binary '\0','/qWS2H71NPGNQDokJxEE2l3ShrG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7768720',5.4,1254,'en','Saint-Narcisse','Dominic’s fetish is… himself. Nothing turns him on more than his own reflection. That’s why discovering that he has a twin brother, raised in a remote monastery by a depraved priest, causes him major consternation. Fate brings the two young men back together again, and their fraternal relationship is torn between sex, revenge and redemption.','/osTteBBNxczHt7asRE2KDUk6dRc.jpg','2021-11-25',101,'Released','Love thyself','Saint-Narcisse',608499,1.6188,5.5,'6TAoWlcwrh8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44976,_binary '\0','/bwZO27djdf6ItQt5gNhOTv0Cfoh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7768846',6.1,1227,'en','Pass Over','Moses and Kitch, two young black men, chat their way through a long, aimless day on a Chicago street corner. Periodically ducking bullets and managing visits from a genial but ominous stranger and an overtly hostile police officer, Moses and Kitch rely on their poetic, funny, at times profane banter to get them through a day that is a hopeless retread of every other day, even as they continue to dream of their deliverance.','/jziDDEXUJw4tV1rKVy2D82WRmKb.jpg','2018-01-26',75,'Released','We gotta git off da block.','Pass Over',501154,1.2351,5.8,'5jRqiMLuG-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44977,_binary '\0','/o7HNhPyijZNnGM2fABVOtbuBXMb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7769346',5.4,1649,'hi','Ekkees Tareekh Shubh Muhurat','It is a story of a 55-year-old man Pandit Girdhari Laal Sharma who wants to escape his family legacy of becoming a priest and aspires to become a storyteller instead. His reality is that he is stuck trying to find a date for his daughter\'s wedding. What follows is a series of unfortunate events which land him in jail. His dream starts unfolding in the most unexpected way as his stories find an audience amongst the prisoners.','/xeHDS4t6HNECHOKSE2iItV7iVzn.jpg','2018-11-02',94,'Released',NULL,'Ekkees Tareekh Shubh Muhurat',602613,1.1175,5,'mlAZqEpSix4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44978,_binary '\0','/pfUXjnD8AcZU42AY5lG3B82HRje.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7770192',5.8,1970,'te','కృష్ణార్జున యుద్ధం','Krishna is the hot-blooded, aimless, flirt of a man from Chittoor whose only aim in life is to find a girl who will love him back. Continents away in Prague is his look-alike Arjun, the playboy rockstar who doesn’t have a problem bedding girls at all. But what happens that brings Krishna and Arjun together is what the film is all about.','/eGdiyurOqPeOj7HunxuxcmFyRPP.jpg','2018-04-12',158,'Released',NULL,'Krishnarjuna Yudham',500565,1.3868,5.045,'JwB_qfwFXZY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44979,_binary '\0','/ekPLinSYMT78W42qEURzWrZADQ2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7771454',3.1,1335,'en','Hallowed Ground','A married couple, trying to rebuild their relationship after an affair, travels to a secluded cabin and stumbles into a blood feud between the Native American owners of the property and the neighboring clan, who obsessively guard their land and punish those who trespass on it in terrifying ways.','/w1ppFC4DviW0lSBx2OAaOXy1k92.jpg','2019-06-07',117,'Released','They don\'t forgive their trespassers','Hallowed Ground',608108,1.012,3.3,'T1Nl3SPcciY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44980,_binary '\0','/p7hhwxJmcgbja9Cj3DWPTvKqUrS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7772580',6.2,54375,'en','The Perfection','When troubled musical prodigy Charlotte seeks out Elizabeth, the new star pupil of her former school, the encounter sends both musicians down a sinister path with shocking consequences.','/tPDe68PDsgIGMs6wdJLtcwVVxA7.jpg','2018-09-20',90,'Released','It\'s Time to Face the Music.','The Perfection',529962,3.7899,6.4,'q57D6kF5B1k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44981,_binary '\0','/x4FX4WsadBDbHaxfNuPvIISF8YQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7772582',7.3,29973,'en','Never Rarely Sometimes Always','A pair of teenage girls in rural Pennsylvania travel to New York City to seek out medical help after an unintended pregnancy.','/7yiSyQhhjTFphhfCUcn05tCQxyG.jpg','2020-03-13',101,'Released','Her journey. Her choice.','Never Rarely Sometimes Always',595671,5.0062,7.126,'AKOT56zkRQ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44982,_binary '\0','/dDhquNqaPfbWoJYRiWkzpBqoeh1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7773210',6.7,1741,'fr','Nos batailles','While Olivier, a 39 year-old foreman gives his job everything he’s got, Laura, his wife and the mother of their two children, abandons the family home, leaving Olivier alone to face his responsibilities. Lost and completely thrown, Olivier is going to have to come to terms with his new status as a single father raising his children alone. Because Laura’s not coming back.','/3rbE57ZanoU6cdx1AJdABaPrOUC.jpg','2018-10-03',98,'Released',NULL,'Our Struggles',514577,1.7326,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44983,_binary '\0','/l98xxSREW3yM2hR0bVtDURSXtZR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7773340',4,1379,'zh','素人特工','Extreme sport lover Zhou Feng got involved in an international illegal trade by accident. So he had to follow an international special agent Bruce to Budapest. Together with a crappy police officer Miao Yan, a non-professional scientist Ding Shan and an unemployed doctor LV, they became an amateur unit. In company with the senior agent Bruce, these four rookies started a fight with the terrorists that was both thrilling and hilarious.','/j3vWi7s6WqX66BU6O3wsjSZ4sIT.jpg','2019-07-12',113,'Released','They got the best, she recruited the rest.','The Rookies',546110,2.7042,5.3,'kP_tVPOm5Y8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44984,_binary '\0','/z2uuQasY4gQJ8VDAFki746JWeQJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7775622',8.1,88692,'en','Free Solo','Follow Alex Honnold as he attempts to become the first person to ever free solo climb Yosemite\'s 3,000 foot high El Capitan wall. With no ropes or safety gear, this would arguably be the greatest feat in rock climbing history.','/v4QfYZMACODlWul9doN9RxE99ag.jpg','2018-09-28',100,'Released','Live beyond fear.','Free Solo',515042,6.0007,7.899,'urRVZ4SW7WU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44985,_binary '\0','/vXYnLfn6c5137Dt2UlpSXIPeE1C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7775720',7.4,9930,'en','Spoiler Alert','Journalist Michael Ausiello embarks on a rollercoaster ride of emotions when Kit Cowan, his partner of 14 years, is diagnosed with terminal cancer.','/m6FQtqoIP7JUqc9hRwQQfuYG2kz.jpg','2022-12-02',110,'Released','Love never stops surprising you. Even when you know how it ends.','Spoiler Alert',507903,3.5782,7,'G9qIwkAi_Zk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44986,_binary '\0','/aUvt7GfNrvjWhTyc7coEoBit1RM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7776430',6.4,1774,'de','Alles ist gut','A woman sexually assaulted by her new boss\'s brother-in-law tries to move on as if nothing happened, but the night weighs heavily on her mind and body.','/9ssKuD8wdTvrKUu0SsRxCBwqKd7.jpg','2018-07-01',93,'Released',NULL,'All Good',504859,1.235,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44987,_binary '\0','/5MGX3rJdg7vO0o7CnRw3wfpfIjv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7776838',7.2,2491,'de','Das schönste Mädchen der Welt','17-year-old Cyril is funny, smart and an all-round good guy. Just his somewhat overlarge nose spoils the picture. On a school trip to Berlin with Roxy, a stunning new classmate, Cyril is not the only one taken with her. Benno, the class Casanova has his eye on the girl too and makes a nasty wager. Roxy is more interested in the introverted Rick, who is not only shy but also slow. Cyril hastens with his spoken word skills to Rick\'s aid, and falls head over heels in love with Roxy himself. So whose brave heart will win the fair lady?','/makJhp5wSURUpHtdgaX3K3TkQcx.jpg','2018-09-06',102,'Released',NULL,'The Most Beautiful Girl in the World',517062,1.7775,7.4,'catB4l3etwM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44988,_binary '\0','/oJwXS3kl3eWU7thx9IbilRgpCUg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7777196',5.4,3975,'hi','ठाकरे','Based on the life of Keshav Thackeray, an Indian politician who is also known as Balasaheb Thackeray.','/yfjEuYlASO9xoT8nLp8pVqKCtZN.jpg','2019-01-25',139,'Released',NULL,'Thackeray',570910,0.9934,5.4,'Qqpl_sAcQF8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44989,_binary '\0','/hvfl3SEbYF6S15yqKcdixUnJ5QO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7777974',6.9,1361,'id','Susah Sinyal','A successful lawyer attempts to connect with her teen daughter on an island vacation, where the phone signal is weak and the tension is strong.','/nwq1dbH2fUOGImsGCq6BJ0kA15R.jpg','2017-12-21',110,'Released',NULL,'Susah Sinyal',482629,0.9177,7.7,'XQC1LkEHNy4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44990,_binary '\0','/A6EBzyxAtY7m5FcCf1TXQTCFIQU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7778560',6.2,1957,'kn','ಅಂಜನಿಪುತ್ರ','A small-time businessman who runs a finance business at a local vegetable market enjoys the support of the local vendors and people in the area. All goes well for him until one day, he saves an honest police officer from being killed by a local gangster. Soon, a rivalry ensues between the two.','/onmNHhm3Yf9GJLwVPNRIIpXlS07.jpg','2017-12-21',138,'Released',NULL,'Anjaniputra',512866,1.1924,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44991,_binary '\0','/cuTYUFG7FOupFsn45H44tgu7bmp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7778680',6.8,6814,'hi','फोटोग्राफ','A struggling street photographer, pressured to marry by his grandmother, convinces a shy stranger to pose as his fiancée. The pair develops a connection that transforms them in ways that they could not expect.','/4t8Vgj9UL1TCGmyZHbQxPtSCXrp.jpg','2019-03-15',111,'Released',NULL,'Photograph',514586,2.3093,6.685,'LwOGIlpPqek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44992,_binary '\0','/nv51h2VJjYUgY0GhcJFjcob3m1U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7779590',6.6,1485,'it','Euforia','Matteo is a young successful businessman, audacious, charming and energetic. Ettore instead, is a calm, righteous, second grade teacher always living in the shadows, still in the small town from where both come from. They’re brothers but with two very different personalities. A dramatic event will force them to live together in Rome for a few months, bringing up the opportunity to face their differences with sympathy and tenderness, in a climax of fear and euphoria.','/mRKr08cLd43CnwHCAuFKCq7XtDu.jpg','2018-10-25',109,'Released',NULL,'Euphoria',517940,1.498,6.5,'QKTkIPP5vmI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44993,_binary '\0','/tsGSTBl5H8DBLnHc24Teny0Ppc5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7781432',6.4,16633,'en','The Mortuary Collection','In the phantasmagorical town of Raven\'s End, a misguided young girl takes refuge in a decrepit old mortuary. The eccentric undertaker chronicles the strange history of the town through a series of twisted tales, each more terrifying than the last, but the young girl\'s world is unhinged when she discovers that the final story... is her own.','/5WXeYnezavNI6hXH74aQYv6yFzj.jpg','2020-09-25',108,'Released','Every corpse has a story...','The Mortuary Collection',524216,4.8296,6.708,'EPTsJZ824i4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44994,_binary '\0','/cpmQUPToVBKQk4uajfDEOY5fRxV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7783966',5.9,1219,'en','The Challenger Disaster','On the eve of the Challenger explosion in 1986 one engineer goes to the extreme to stop the launch. This hot-headed engineer makes a desperate race against the clock to call off the billion dollar multi-delayed Challenger launch, convinced the O-ring seals will fail and kill everyone on board. The Company, Marshall Space Flight and NASA made a business decision. He made a human decision.','/rpz442GUtGvMwZY1sgf2gZZg91J.jpg','2019-01-25',98,'Released','The most tragic disaster in American space history... and they saw it coming.','The Challenger Disaster',577826,1.167,5.7,'bvv2-7iOD_8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44995,_binary '\0','/gJbTXKNTL6O7r7PzF6ZRkJGBlPp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7784604',7.3,469493,'en','Hereditary','Following the death of the Leigh family matriarch, Annie and her children uncover disturbing secrets about their heritage. Their daily lives are not only impacted, but they also become entangled in a chilling fate from which they cannot escape, driving them to the brink of madness.','/4GFPuL14eXi66V96xBWY73Y9PfR.jpg','2018-06-07',128,'Released','Every family tree hides a secret.','Hereditary',493922,20.1075,7.297,'MJNR58zaStE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44996,_binary '\0','/l7Q0OziNo3V9fHNxyuG1RJCqzkZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7785106',6.2,1485,'en','Love, Once and Always','When Lucy’s childhood sweetheart plans to tear down the Gilded Age estate and replace it with a golf course, Lucy fights to preserve the historic mansion at all costs. As Lucy and Duncan set out to find a compromise, they learn that embracing the past may be the key to protecting the future.','/uAtDSAVrlx0UIMZV50hKk1opiQF.jpg','2018-03-10',90,'Released',NULL,'Love, Once and Always',501687,2.3034,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44997,_binary '\0','/3Jo1CcDSMZRKOGgQ79u5PnBAUux.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7785866',6.8,1628,'de','Deutschstunde','In a small North German village a drama played out during and shortly after the Second World War about duty versus individual conscience and morality.','/nR478Q3qVSQLMpUcHIjwHf4q5Mz.jpg','2019-10-03',125,'Released',NULL,'The German Lesson',500245,2.0389,6.509,'69Fja3T-BIo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44998,_binary '\0','/x8Kdi1OJbewkeGuijcSmUWrYyk2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7787524',4.8,2886,'en','Henry Danger: The Movie','Henry Hart meets a superfan—eager to fight crime with Kid Danger—who comes into possession of a device that can open up alternate realities. Facing a wild ride, Henry will need his best friend Jasper and his new superfan sidekick to find his way out or be stuck in another dimension forever.','/dFWj2rOGsqSIX1PHFghbCBgpMnk.jpg','2025-01-17',86,'Released','Danger... Like you\'ve never seen before.','Henry Danger: The Movie',926670,7.467,7.6,'Rcc9veq0JgM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(44999,_binary '\0','/kaLpZ8hXiVxfpwMhsKbQ3WQwgnO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7791188',6.6,1335,'de','Vom Lokführer, der die Liebe suchte...','Train driver Nurlan’s heading to Baku for the last time before retirement, but on his fateful journey around the neighborhoods of the city his train snags a blue bra off a washing line. To escape from his lonely existence, Nurlan embarks on the most adventurous journey of his life: to find the owner of this perky piece of underwear. He rents a small room in Baku and begins his quest to find his “Cinderella”.','/bs99POs5bxy5tS7g9s1xipr17iV.jpg','2019-03-07',90,'Released','A modern day Cinderella.','The Bra',498678,2.9535,6,'IqKYAZDfhCU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45000,_binary '\0','/xKO1Xrrn11f7XreEokX3CU5724R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7794052',8.5,2043,'ta','மேற்குத்தொடர்ச்சி மலை','Living on the borders of Kerala and Tamil Nadu, Rangasamy, a laborer just like his fellow sons of soils toils, hard-working at the spice plantations owned by landlords. He lives a happy life and wishes to own a piece of land and earn a living through farming. After years of struggle, his dream finally comes true when Chaako, a local politician helps him buy the land, however, he soon faces tougher challenges as he has to deal with corrupt and wealthy politicians.','/eKIXvlp0h1395TF3FdqWssywipR.jpg','2018-08-24',122,'Released',NULL,'Merku Thodarchi Malai',413136,1.7101,7.472,'DGbchTBSkV4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45001,_binary '\0','/yoQ43SEzNpPmz7Hja6EQsNqPzcr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7794524',6.7,9475,'te','నా పేరు సూర్య','Despite having serious anger management issues, Surya, an Indian Army officer is a brilliant officer but when anger takes control of him he is impossible to subdue. In spite of this issue, he achieves his goal of serving the country by overcoming the hurdles.','/lWXaTnfdGu4qBqpsBCAUcqbRExp.jpg','2018-04-27',168,'Released',NULL,'Naa Peru Surya - Naa Illu India',500494,2.2958,5.813,'50AcUuJbBzc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45002,_binary '\0','/3Lltfcis0LX3MrIMHXJ5HfgUS56.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7797658',7.6,6578,'te','అ!','‘Awe’ charts the journey of a motley of characters that have nothing to do with each other but are yet connected by a single, fragile string. Who are these people and what about their lives connect them to each other is what the film is all about.','/98Dn1D22PWmgwkEx7UEVLtpAPmk.jpg','2018-02-16',115,'Released',NULL,'Awe!',500723,1.3438,7.146,'xOEscQChX7M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45003,_binary '\0','/25xur6csh3XXtQcOq4zx3cyvbEN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7798604',6.1,37382,'en','We Have a Ghost','After Kevin finds a ghost named Ernest haunting his new home, he becomes an overnight social media sensation. But when Kevin and Ernest go rogue to investigate the mystery of the latter\'s past, they become targets of the CIA.','/xo0fgAUoEeVQ7KsKeMWypyglvnf.jpg','2023-02-24',127,'Released','Set your spirit free.','We Have a Ghost',852096,9.7858,6.424,'82I1ErFD63U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45004,_binary '\0','/oJ1MIABA0WF0a7MDVQnnMvBdex8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7798634',6.9,265726,'en','Ready or Not','A young bride\'s wedding night turns into her worst nightmare when her ridiculously rich in-laws force her to play a gruesome game of hide-and-seek.','/oJD9KQFoObZmxAS1je56SIFVNJt.jpg','2019-08-21',96,'Released','A killer game of hide and seek.','Ready or Not',567609,22.8815,7.1,'LBwfO9Hj6oQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45005,_binary '\0','/ao9UJkUs7hcIkqv02BquWxP49RR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7798644',6.1,3241,'en','Judy & Punch','In the anarchic town of Seaside, nowhere near the sea, puppeteers Judy and Punch are trying to resurrect their marionette show. The show is a hit due to Judy\'s superior puppeteering but Punch\'s driving ambition and penchant for whisky lead to an inevitable tragedy that Judy must avenge.','/a0WRxfrVjPNelq7UuRoRnIZWn5A.jpg','2019-11-21',105,'Released','A twisted tale of love, revenge and puppetry.','Judy & Punch',506554,2.6704,6.1,'63NAagrKOcc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45006,_binary '\0','/kU5qE5b6ksL3osaqKCUlMS08Ays.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7798646',6.1,6763,'en','The Photograph','When famed photographer Christina Eames dies unexpectedly, she leaves her estranged daughter, Mae, hurt, angry and full of questions. When Mae finds a photograph tucked away in a safe-deposit box, she soon finds herself delving into her mother\'s early life -- an investigation that leads to an unexpected romance with a rising journalist.','/cdqZqIcWt0Ne2Io2OA9iWqqMuCA.jpg','2020-02-14',106,'Released',NULL,'The Photograph',589049,4.3265,6.3,'BZulYPti89M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45007,_binary '\0','/3RfsWYx2DtF5l5lEKi6Azvb87Rq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7799386',6.8,1848,'fr','Une Intime conviction','Ever since she served on the jury during his trial, Nora has been convinced that Jacques Viguier is innocent, despite him being accused of murdering his wife. Following an appeal by the public prosecutor’s office, and fearing a miscarriage of justice, she convinces a leading lawyer to defend him during his second trial, on appeal. Together, they will put up a tenacious fight against injustice.','/aSiDOaB12twIXNN4tJWnCspwyys.jpg','2019-02-06',110,'Released',NULL,'Conviction',487611,2.0626,6.841,'nNLPx__JNqA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45008,_binary '\0','/hka1m1XehI2pnSi8a0x0yG5ymsE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7802246',6.5,1333,'en','The Last Tree','Femi is a British boy of Nigerian heritage who, after being fostered in rural Lincolnshire, moves to inner-city London to live with his birth mother. Struggling with the unfamiliar culture and values of his new environment, teenage Femi has to figure out which path to adulthood he wants to take.','/x0DHRJfdmdnGdxYVWFZCmQeSboM.jpg','2019-09-27',98,'Released',NULL,'The Last Tree',565386,1.7612,6.3,'yYxRF2IkCtM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45009,_binary '\0','/rRGkK8DE5tl53LGW8nB7L4MzWj2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7805960',5.3,20835,'hi','Torbaaz','At an Afghanistan refugee camp, an ex-army doctor seeks to bring children joy through cricket and soon realizes that the stakes go beyond the sport.','/yj44DlUalvtEKXI9Py6Xz8WypBZ.jpg','2020-12-11',132,'Released',NULL,'Torbaaz',681235,1.4609,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45010,_binary '\0','/1W4RNWR1bGCiD8cEU9I61oSiGf8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7807026',6.1,6196,'es','Tu hijo','Jaime, a doctor who lives in Seville, finds his life radically changed when his son is left fighting for his life after being beaten up during a robbery. The feelings of pain and helplessness soon change to feelings of hate and anger, converting a good dad into a dehumanised man.','/8EmuDLfSLg6kaWFj2wheBxXd8NL.jpg','2018-11-09',103,'Released',NULL,'Your Son',534939,2.151,5.788,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45011,_binary '\0','/bxKivdoJQOQ2ihoGxDGhyR38lxT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7813294',3.2,2678,'en','A Fairy Tale After All','A stubborn teenage girl finds herself confronted by whimsical characters when she is transported into a world of fantasy and fairy tales while attending a school marionette show.','/uXq56XNfgRgBdCW65K6goiMUr3o.jpg','2022-02-18',72,'Released','An adventure beyond your imagination.','A Fairy Tale After All',830027,1.7871,6.1,'bME6kO2KXNk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45012,_binary '\0','/kUmHkRVH6Imv3Z5zqBrYPnvSxAw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7816386',7.2,1889,'ur','جوانی پھر نہیں آنی 2','Now settled into married life, Pervez and Sheikh jump at the chance to travel to Turkey with their wives to visit Pervez\'s well-to-do brother-in-law, Rahat.','/4Ef71qtI78hMdqnsqMcIzZqZ4Aw.jpg','2018-08-21',165,'Released',NULL,'Jawani Phir Nahi Ani 2',544402,1.3039,8.2,'TUM6liPArUE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45013,_binary '\0','/mAWMorHkrbBvsfBv8XiE6qbCY9L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7816392',5.9,7553,'fr','Lukas','A tough nightclub bouncer struggling to raise his 8-year-old daughter is forced to go undercover after an unfortunate event.','/w7rFgyr7rujNYRex9oxzG26Zq6z.jpg','2018-08-22',84,'Released',NULL,'The Bouncer',525554,3.6488,6.2,'nVs00TBIooQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45014,_binary '\0','/1QaQKC7EwF4LT3vUvFH4jxQBtjk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7817348',6.6,2347,'en','One Winter Weekend','Cara, a women’s magazine writer, who gets burned by her boyfriend on New Years’ Eve, decides to go on a dating detox. Challenged by her employer to write about it, she hopes a spontaneous ski getaway with her best friend will spark inspiration. Complicating matters, they discover they’ve double booked their chalet with two eligible men, including Ben, an entrepreneur. When the share-mates get snowed in, Cara and Ben are thrown together.','/kgSG5ZMJG0BOUo0BJG7PIeSTwCy.jpg','2018-01-20',84,'Released',NULL,'One Winter Weekend',491411,2.5078,6.6,'tf7lBZ5iIf0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45015,_binary '\0','/ab2Yq3VoDMy0MoamCUcJq3OIzZY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7818580',6.9,7802,'es','Mientras dure la guerra','Salamanca, Spain, 1936. In the early days of the military rebellion that began the Spanish Civil War (1936-39), writer Miguel de Unamuno supports the uprising in the hope that the prevailing political chaos will end. But when the confrontation becomes bloody, Unamuno must question his initial position.','/pbuMcrQBXngZS7wMOTKRCmQAjCN.jpg','2019-09-27',108,'Released','Sometimes silence is the worst lie','While at War',542921,3.0542,7.056,'h6SAcAled8k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45016,_binary '\0','/pSWxsQsP0regsf96unAl2cscRCz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7820846',3.5,2774,'hi','लव यात्री','Romance blossoms between young Sushrut and Michelle when they meet during the festival of Navratri. When Michelle returns home to the United Kingdom, Sushrut embarks on an adventurous journey through a strange land to win back the woman he loves.','/aq5RNE6L8gPSQwSaueur97IbpFR.jpg','2018-10-05',140,'Released','A Journey Of Love','Loveyatri',549829,1.8518,5.333,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45017,_binary '\0','/wU5t9AvACB2dMPgiH0I90NZkLJR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7822320',7.2,1701,'bn','এক যে ছিল রাজা','Mahendra Kumar Choudhuri, the middle prince of the Bhawal Estate was affected by syphilis and was taken to Darjeeling for treatment. He apparently died in Darjeeling and was cremated there. After 12 years, a Sanyasi shows up at the estate, arousing people’s curiosity and leading to a rumour that he is the lost prince of the Bikrampur Estate.','/bkQAZgdGSynE7CCu057rWzGhw2h.jpg','2018-10-12',147,'Released',NULL,'Ek Je Chhilo Raja',547508,1.2257,7.136,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45018,_binary '\0','/8ubcfIW4O3w8BinAualdsVFl6my.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7822438',8.1,10102,'ta','தடம்','The murder of a youngster creates confusion among a few cops when they find out that the one accused in the crime has a look-alike!','/mR1Rf4ZaE4iDbvYKwZsvmg2mrBN.jpg','2019-03-01',138,'Released',NULL,'Thadam',505971,1.4661,7.053,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45019,_binary '\0','/6gzTl5Mphi7FRVfq2PnzH1LZzx9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7822440',7.6,4190,'ta','காளி','An Indian doctor in the US, haunted by a recurring nightmare, learns that he is adopted, and comes to India to know his real roots. Where does his search lead him to?','/gZvbj1ZeUNi4i96HzSseyWRFWUs.jpg','2018-05-18',113,'Released',NULL,'Kaali',478473,1.1795,5.5,'8msycIZUEdY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45020,_binary '\0','/kvLB6JCVedyyfKfJRKV5fGNt7km.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7822758',7.4,3549,'ta','காடன்','When a wealthy real estate company, backed by a powerful minister decides to build a township in a reserve forest area, it cuts off access to the water body to the elephants living in the area, endangering their lives. An eco-warrior decides to fight for their cause at a time when nobody else would.','/A5vs7Ix6l0YyjlfHd1kvhVlgQot.jpg','2021-03-26',161,'Released',NULL,'Kaadan',672940,1.2092,5.083,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45021,_binary '\0','/ocz7jIgTFfOx2JEN3KWSrf2m3v4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7823906',3.7,1441,'pl','Polityka','Portraying the events that have taken place in Polish politics in recent years.','/dhtelac6i6I61wZh5LiaLq0QVYG.jpg','2019-09-06',135,'Released',NULL,'Politics',617249,1.9167,3.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45022,_binary '\0','/sSHrmOENHB0XDoxlO5HCXD5DA8x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7825208',7.1,48433,'pt','Marighella','Afro-Brazilian poet and politician, the legendary Carlos Marighella. Driven to fight against the erosion of civil and human rights following the CIA-backed military coup of 1964 and the brutal, racist right-wing dictatorship that followed, the revolutionary leaves behind his wife and son to take up arms, becoming a notorious enemy to the power structure.','/9Wdrdooav23KNxOntYYFJ6ddXD7.jpg','2021-01-29',155,'Released','Brazil’s number one enemy','Marighella',500458,2.6144,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45023,_binary '\0','/AbRwcbfie7zOStUN4V2eGIqPBHo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7825514',6.5,2504,'en','Love on the Slopes','NYC-based copy editor, Alex, is sent to Ridgeline Resort, an extreme sports outpost, to write a story for a travel writing competition. At first, she fails at everything – much to the chagrin of Cole, an extreme sports enthusiast who thinks this city girl should head back to New York. But when Alex offers to assist Cole with his local arts festival, he reluctantly obliges to be her guide as she faces her fears doing one extreme sport after the next.','/1YVFAR9EkvVhUrKjg4TsA6nD621.jpg','2018-01-06',84,'Released',NULL,'Love on the Slopes',493762,2.4221,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45024,_binary '\0','/utrwOVJFglRIJFsOhQUZ9fDyaXH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7826276',6.7,8499,'en','Profile','Looking to investigate recruitment techniques of ISIS to lure women into Syria, a journalist creates a Facebook profile of a Muslim convert. When an ISIS recruiter contacts her online character, she experiences the process first hand.','/znkwk7R4wb0JpT0Lc3a0sAPnnD0.jpg','2018-03-11',106,'Released','The connection is virtual. The danger is real.','Profile',493675,2.072,6.911,'DKgW8UcGMNk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45025,_binary '\0','/g9usVFlyVRu8hhK9Rb8snjoZk8S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7830014',5.4,1473,'en','What Breaks the Ice','A coming of age thriller about two 15-year-old girls, Sammy and Emily, who hark from different worlds but strike up a quick and deep friendship. But what should be the best summer of their lives takes an unexpected turn when they become accidental accomplices in a fatal crime.','/f5CafHf4ZEaHtEViJFz7oIMYwAb.jpg','2020-10-03',104,'Released',NULL,'What Breaks the Ice',695513,1.8669,5.1,'wfojGPiNB6k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45026,_binary '\0','/9sCFmRA3nIDpAkiYH19oTFujF14.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7830806',5.3,7826,'en','My Best Friend\'s Exorcism','The year is 1988. Abby and Gretchen have been best friends since fourth grade. After an evening of skinny-dipping goes disastrously wrong, Gretchen begins to act…different, which leads Abby to suspect her best friend may be possessed by a demon. With help from some unlikely allies, Abby embarks on a quest to save Gretchen. But is their friendship powerful enough to beat the devil?','/yIXICkqthsqbNtvtEd6rpIt3cT4.jpg','2022-09-29',96,'Released','True friendship is worth going to hell and back.','My Best Friend\'s Exorcism',816952,3.0593,5.8,'FnXdofVyZTI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45027,_binary '\0','/ArYKUZEubIWRtdbDUXJ24gu9TKD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7831358',5.9,6754,'en','Harpoon','Rivalries, dark secrets, and sexual tension emerge when three best friends find themselves stranded on a yacht in the middle of the ocean under suspicious circumstances.','/36zt0v54vRmgn1Zgvlfw0azQK9h.jpg','2019-01-24',82,'Released',NULL,'Harpoon',574284,1.9766,6.017,'QiEmfI_oNtw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45028,_binary '\0','/tTvht2fWfecG8gcS5DKurxJjZdE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7832124',7.6,21970,'tr','Müslüm','A biopic about the Turkish vocal artist Müslüm Gürses. Born into a poor household, Muslum found his redemption in music from the initial trauma that lingered over his musical and personal life as internalizing the grief. He rose through his ashes of shattered dreams like a phoenix. He walked in darkness, sang songs filled with sorrow which stirred people\'s souls and created a cult following. They were calling him \"Baba\" (The Father).','/cbY2IlnNk85MqaPWgPZyJUD4vnz.jpg','2018-10-26',136,'Released',NULL,'Muslum',528372,1.9179,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45029,_binary '\0','/OvMX5sgJ0vLmKQbIiS5yy7jn5H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7832848',5.6,9339,'en','Inside Man: Most Wanted','An NYPD hostage negotiator teams up with a federal agent to rescue dozens of tourists held hostage during a 10-hour seige at the U.S. Federal Reserve.','/zcDZisqVQK9akfKgyrB9HYzYuVh.jpg','2019-09-24',105,'Released',NULL,'Inside Man: Most Wanted',619278,6.142,6.304,'tlg4BQqhn3I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45030,_binary '\0','/pj0rt9NSwxBIIa9zWfmtwOSTykJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7833952',6.6,1578,'ar','طلق صناعي','Some people will do anything to secure an American visa, as hard as that might be. Some enter lotteries, others beg friends and families to invite them. Others still, just sneak in and hope Mr Trump doesn’t notice they are there. But in this raucous comedy, one Egyptian couple come up with a splendid wheeze. With twin babies due any minute, and all other efforts to secure citizenship fail, the couple decide to storm the US Embassy in Cairo and give birth there. Surely that will mean the babies are born as Americans, right? Well, er, no. As you might expect, things don’t quite go according to plan…','/eCCztYTU9AjQxHDb5DyxOiSVeSc.jpg','2018-01-03',90,'Released',NULL,'Induced Labor',490814,0.8561,6.4,'NJyUODINsCg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45031,_binary '\0','/4i1ofsSpfTuswHXcgPtXbZrSnoe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7838252',8.1,113945,'kn','ಕೆಜಿಎಫ್ ಅಧ್ಯಾಯ ೧','A period drama set in the 1970s, KGF follows the story of a fierce rebel who rises against the brutal oppression in Kolar Gold Fields and becomes the symbol of hope to legions of downtrodden people.','/ltHlJwvxKv7d0ooCiKSAvfwV9tX.jpg','2018-12-20',156,'Released','From The Streets Of Mumbai...To The Bloody Gold Mines Of Kolar','K.G.F: Chapter 1',564147,4.4581,7.5,'3oxo-wacE50','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45032,_binary '\0','/uC2XZnpXfNWflR4IBGAEf4zBqG3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7838494',6,1584,'el','The Waiter','Renos is an old-time waiter with a meticulous routine. He is a loner and an avid collector of information. His repetitive daily routine liberates him from the agony of pursuing the unknown. The unexpected events that invade his life hide many surprises.','/ilceXk07zYyYqBI9fJAFj60DJi9.jpg','2018-11-05',97,'Released',NULL,'The Waiter',555861,0.8009,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45033,_binary '\0','/hyx9Yqp3dgs5Ln16t6n7gojMw7e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7838536',4.8,10610,'en','Awoken','Karla, a young medical student, is trying to cure her brother, Blake, from a terminal sleep illness called Fatal Familial Insomnia, where you are unable to sleep until you die. On her quest to treat him, a more sinister reason for his condition is revealed.','/kUaCqz6dKFmYsZrqdItPO6wkW0v.jpg','2019-12-20',87,'Released','Never sleep again.','Awoken',508330,1.55,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45034,_binary '\0','/2YjUy0HoZ8LqLi8zq0oBUHuSKZ3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7839456',6.7,1371,'fr','La Prière','Thomas is a drug addict. In an effort to put an end to his habit, he joins a community of former addicts who live isolated in the mountains and use prayer as a way to cure themselves.','/78dnETPv7Mcm587KaRo23i8y9e4.jpg','2018-03-21',107,'Released',NULL,'The Prayer',499086,1.7315,6.3,'BEvaqZoOhIc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45035,_binary '\0','/ifAa0cKTTGGLCaHg65FceG5e4d0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7841496',5.7,5662,'es','Perdida','A policewoman whose childhood friend disappeared in Patagonia years ago starts a new search to find answers, and soon finds her own life in danger.','/uzMBxfaRllUwPazFo0wjqlireCm.jpg','2018-04-19',103,'Released','Never stop searching','Perdida',513223,2.0902,6.116,'bdVS8PHjEow','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45036,_binary '\0','/g2GMz7SJa1wc0NKNaaUT0zpD0jX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7843600',6.8,7149,'en','Fyre Fraud','A true-crime comedy exploring a failed music festival turned internet meme at the nexus of social media influence, late-stage capitalism, and morality in the post-truth era.','/jeeHE4gDErwulQ9UJjHeLAzV1TG.jpg','2019-01-14',96,'Released',NULL,'Fyre Fraud',575190,1.4587,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45037,_binary '\0','/2YiCk4kN24f29Uy6X7T9JktUmvn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7843946',7.1,4410,'id','Dilan 1990','At a Bandung high school, charming and rebellious Dilan vies for the affections of shy new student Milea.','/eitRZXfbw6rO0CfP3lPaGgK63qr.jpg','2018-01-25',109,'Released',NULL,'Dilan 1990',492459,1.482,7.513,'X_b-wNkz4DU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45038,_binary '\0','/rjQgngBYhgm9hy2msylBR2U4Suq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7844166',6.2,3014,'ru','Скиф','A new era is about to begin in Eastern Europe. Scythians, the proud warriors, are all but gone and most of the few remaining descendants have become ruthless mercenary assassins. Lutobor, a warrior who becomes involved in intertribal conflicts, sets off on a perilous journey to save his family guided by a captive Scythian.','/lQeYTkq8Joz3hlogYrioCxU7aTo.jpg','2018-01-18',105,'Released','The Blood of Many for the Honour of One','The Last Warrior',458027,2.5834,5.8,'RwDvvWRWmjU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45039,_binary '\0','/2mWvrYAbV0yNzXZJdusVKIbVPDz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7846056',7,5171,'en','Feast of the Seven Fishes','A slice of life story that follows a large Italian family on Christmas Eve as they prepare for the traditional Feast of the Seven Fishes, reminisce about the past and seek love in the future.','/fMHw1PC2nHMicGURcb6ORtc7Zqa.jpg','2019-11-15',99,'Released',NULL,'Feast of the Seven Fishes',635885,3.0098,6.6,'ODfozhutmrM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45040,_binary '\0','/kMe4TKMDNXTKptQPAdOF0oZHq3V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7846844',6.7,255367,'en','Enola Holmes','While searching for her missing mother, intrepid teen Enola Holmes uses her sleuthing skills to outsmart big brother Sherlock and help a runaway lord.','/riYInlsq2kf1AWoGm80JQW5dLKp.jpg','2020-09-22',124,'Released','Mystery runs in the family.','Enola Holmes',497582,13.8278,7.213,'1d0Zf9sXlHk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45041,_binary '\0','/4RsLs77N0q9J3VqwkTiVCMUWlhI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7850334',4.4,1411,'en','Automation','A workplace robot, AUTO, transforms into a killing machine when he discovers he will be replaced by a more efficient model. AUTO fears being terminated and will stop at nothing to prevent his own destruction. The human employees must band together to stop him before it\'s too late.','/beqEtbfjkQiOPJH1mXsyZCr5wuc.jpg','2019-12-03',92,'Released',NULL,'Automation',651720,1.2011,5.4,'es9LjOPfVYo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45042,_binary '\0','/2ggXQWN0tvBIINEkuerfn6AbvYY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7851428',3.3,12176,'en','First Signal','When Air Force Space Command receives a signal from an alien satellite in Earth orbit an