ce him.','/24VMAJjGFwtCbdGuFITklELqQuQ.jpg','2019-02-01',97,'Released',NULL,'Under the Same Roof',555657,1.9321,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45047,_binary '\0','/f1kb20sXU7YkuHUgdecGuRSjzT0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7857374',5.6,2823,'en','Feedback','A radio host is kidnapped on air and forced to tell secrets about his past.','/4ry96PlfzAsO93dZ1Cf1pRmCpNJ.jpg','2019-03-01',97,'Released','Your life destroyed on air.','Feedback',577889,2.1222,5.8,'QJhREJFx3yk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45048,_binary '\0','/s3Mwtw1MtILMYIu5749DjCEOdgt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7858472',6.1,1621,'fr','Sœurs d\'armes','Kenza and Yaël are two young French women who go to Syria to fight alongside the Kurdish forces. There they meet Zara, a Yezidi survivor. Born in different cultures but deeply united, the women-fighters heal their past wounds and discover their present strength, especially the fear they inspire in their opponents. The three young women soon bound together and become true sisters-in-arms.','/6sqF5XvmcawutVXkzzefqrbxlJ4.jpg','2019-10-09',112,'Released',NULL,'Sisters in Arms',618326,2.759,7,'YxkVMfa-jSg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45049,_binary '\0','/yP1O24kB1GRKWlhXoIZcKbJP9IH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7858616',5.4,3463,'de','Luz','Luz, a young cabdriver, drags herself into the brightly lit entrance of a run-down police station. A demonic entity follows her, determined to finally be close to the woman it loves.','/5xLen4n8FYYjW2HhBG2rtvFMUZw.jpg','2019-03-21',70,'Released',NULL,'Luz',498062,0.8706,5.101,'bmzMgBlPZrk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45050,_binary '\0','/zeBNxyqL2b3YLal4V2t47EKbMQ2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7862330',6.8,11238,'tr','Cebimdeki Yabancı','The seven old friends decide to come together for dinner. Everyone is seated at the table, chatting, eating laughing accompaniment. During the meal, it is decided to play a game. The game is pretty simple; everyone will put their phones on the desk, every incoming message and notification will be read aloud. Their relationship begins to deteriorate. The group who thinks they are very close friends for so long are in fact alien to each other.','/1iWCVSE8nXpSZ3EnAGuPz3Bp6WH.jpg','2018-02-02',95,'Released',NULL,'Stranger in My Pocket',497179,1.2095,6.7,'EiDliPTda0s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45051,_binary '\0','/6dn9UqS7VkvCrzIHOA6yGyXoo5q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7863198',6.4,2865,'ru','Я худею','There\'s two great loves in Anya\'s life, her athlete boyfriend Zhenya and food. Zhenya is not happy how Anya has been gaining weight due to her eating habits and decides to dump her. But Anya doesn\'t want to give up and decides to get rid of excess weight with the help of Nikolai, an overweight man obsessed with the healthy living.','/xrfBWqcJyUWjoMZSnSzV5GdwSAx.jpg','2018-03-08',102,'Released',NULL,'I\'m Losing It',497713,1.6116,6.589,'ittLoN39QnQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45052,_binary '\0','/r5pJutRp9L0EM3iVsWMtFn2zDPk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7867076',6.9,1252,'mr','आपला मानूस','Sr Inspector Maruti Nagargoje is investigating a murder case which took place in the house of a couple.Who claim that they weren\'t in the house when the incident happened.Maruti has a different way of working as he doesn\'t consider statement given to police on crime scene as valuable and conducts his own interrogation with suspects.','/w4Q7mTUBHnAuG0KP5kozWitdDaJ.jpg','2018-02-09',138,'Released',NULL,'Aapla Manus',499588,1.3071,5.6,'P5sfLO81dHU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45053,_binary '\0','/tv0w5IaY3nHScDRleV61ZRRpWND.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7867360',4.6,4042,'en','Abduction','A man steps out of a park fountain in Ho Chi Minh City with no recollection of who he is or where he came from. As he wanders through the city, piecing together clues to his past, he is relentlessly pursued by mysterious figures.','/3zeEoWFqz5piolP0TQSIIsm6x8U.jpg','2019-03-20',98,'Released','The clock is ticking for the human race…','Abduction',589594,3.1857,6.1,'mhoZA0HjmjY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45054,_binary '\0','/iRmND7pOOYFib83m6SkPFy6hTou.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7867670',5.6,5972,'ar','122','During a bloody night, a young man and his lover are struggling, not to get to the hospital, but to escape and survive.','/7Y5gnwYVSCnQ1Ne6vK2Mg2lm88k.jpg','2019-01-02',95,'Released',NULL,'122',512959,1.0604,5.8,'GfFrVE8RFKY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45055,_binary '\0','/xuhX5Hh5rgf4Q12NBFEkdIWbhll.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7868082',6.3,3192,'en','Charming the Hearts of Men','A romantic drama set during the politically charged early 60s where a sophisticated woman returns to her Southern home town and discovers her options are limited yet discrimination is plentiful. With the help of a Congressional ally, she inspires historic legislation which allows opportunities and protections never before afforded to women.','/x3R9i4tTHm2pgTzCnbUNzWpfykN.jpg','2021-08-13',107,'Released','A romantic romp thru the time when women became…equal.','Charming the Hearts of Men',693730,2.5949,5.8,'DdN5QtuV1UI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45056,_binary '\0','/c4UbjY6n3YvsRLbAPd8gK04Ag7Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7869070',4.2,13471,'en','The Fanatic','A rabid film fan stalks his favorite action hero and destroys the star\'s life.','/nojx83s8JWyYpI9oeKdQXniWMu6.jpg','2019-08-30',89,'Released','All he wanted was an autograph.','The Fanatic',509853,3.9252,4.432,'YRS6V8RXIKE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45057,_binary '\0','/h0NZTkfmEJosQ52WSnzmN0lDSXG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7870102',6.5,3175,'en','Critical Thinking','Based on a true story from 1998, five Latino and Black teenagers from the toughest underserved ghetto in Miami fight their way into the National Chess Championship under the guidance of their unconventional but inspirational teacher.','/l1OR2xTnOOX95KGrS3dm5YQopy5.jpg','2020-12-18',117,'Released','Chess is the great equalizer','Critical Thinking',665877,2.4918,6.5,'hox3ulTPFbc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45058,_binary '\0','/fGGB0cDA2fiEsgmDpwdpKLzfV8c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7871054',4.8,2708,'hi','मारुढ़र एक्सप्रेस','The marriage of timid Marudhar is arranged with an outspoken woman on the condition that they produce a child within a year of wedlock. With no experience in dealing with women, let alone a wife, Marudhar embarks on an emotional journey as he tries to adjust to love, family, and complicated married life.','/vYJgeABDNFwMO6N4IHTWtthLzrH.jpg','2019-04-12',106,'Released',NULL,'Marudhar Express',592583,0.9232,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45059,_binary '\0','/nGaUTAibDbgeYreBE6z0dDm9Scr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7871636',4.7,3416,'tr','Deliha 2','Zeliha is back: Crazy and candid as ever, and she still gets herself into all sorts of trouble. Seeking love in the first film, Zeliha is now after a career in the sequel, as she dreams of becoming a cook and starts working in a luxury restaurant. Will Zeliha\'s dreams finally come true, or will the real world break her heart and leave her in disappointment? With heartwarming characters and an entertaining story by Gupse Özay, writer of the films Deliha and Görümce, Deliha 2 will once again leave audiences in laughter. The film also marks Özay\'s directorial debut.','/ulVSho2mdZplxuWWBq578p7xePZ.jpg','2018-01-12',106,'Released',NULL,'Deliha 2',496748,1.3912,5.2,'M7LYY2rgP_I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45060,_binary '\0','/2vJewgdaf0N8BnAgHZ8R7y3w5qQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7873348',5.8,9447,'en','Save Yourselves!','A young Brooklyn couple head upstate to disconnect from their phones and reconnect with themselves. Cut off from their devices, they miss the news that the planet is under attack.','/bvNwVJ3Wh6KeE28TMIczJD6OEPm.jpg','2020-10-02',93,'Released','Turning off their phones was the dumbest idea on the planet.','Save Yourselves!',653569,4.0351,5.778,'oIsIjcNdsXc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45061,_binary '\0','/biVtpDmZUcBKLJcDQPECHgCabbw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7874116',6.6,1769,'en','Cooking with Love','Optimistic and cheerful TV producer, Kelly, doesn’t have time for love. Bad boy celebrity chef, Stephen, doesn’t have time for anything besides cooking. Fun with a side of love ensues as Kelly and Stephen are paired on a children\'s cooking show.','/fxV4yA8bQjp6dgjjEpaWtgyGbgA.jpg','2018-10-26',84,'Released',NULL,'Cooking with Love',497515,1.9071,6.5,'AoCCo01s4pA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45062,_binary '\0','/fp5Ptgy0pcwJGzvtOS8LM2m18QX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7874378',6.2,2200,'pl','Pitbull. Ostatni pies','A policeman gets killed and the short-staffed police chief sends for a few experienced officers to support him in his fight with organized crime. Meanwhile, a conflict between local gangster groups escalates.','/tgEI3cOcL23o0gMlvrNS2cfJXYI.jpg','2018-03-15',124,'Released',NULL,'Pitbull. Last Dog',512768,1.5271,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45063,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7874712',6.8,1318,'bn','Glamour','A successful businessman is accused of rape and murder and his ex law school professor and a succesful lawyer is hired to release him of all charges.','/sUmInBa2y5C0lI20Swvt5TYQ2Hs.jpg','2014-12-26',134,'Released',NULL,'Glamour',497856,0.7411,5,'oOmloGfNONc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45064,_binary '\0','/6Kvf4BUux2wRuSkUluGmdEWnPXo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7875464',6.6,3429,'es','Las herederas','After her girlfriend is imprisoned on fraud charges, Chela is forced to face a new reality. Driving for the first time in years, she begins to provide a local taxi service to a group of elderly wealthy ladies. As Chela settles into her new life, she encounters the much younger Angy, forging a fresh and invigorating new connection.','/tS94bbXmDKIDIoLgBrGJn3Jbwgv.jpg','2018-03-15',95,'Released','It\'s never too late to start over.','The Heiresses',499152,2.276,6.442,'E7zELAeLObc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45065,_binary '\0','/3rIocL2KDm8d2sCVmqDI0IEK2vF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7875948',3.4,3155,'en','Lake Placid: Legacy','A group of young explorers discover a secret area hidden from all maps and GPS devices. When they reach the center of the lake, they discover an abandoned facility that houses one of the largest, and deadliest apex-predators known to man.','/eBZXrR5zlGdRAXuugtUQo9D4dCp.jpg','2018-05-28',93,'Released',NULL,'Lake Placid: Legacy',520466,3.6651,4.9,'ZnrQE1sSSQ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45066,_binary '\0','/tNRHOWkBZW6T7fNIKMQNl17kFyI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7876510',7.8,4818,'uk','Мої думки тихі','Twenty-five-year-old Vadym earns a living recording and selling all kinds of different sounds; nevertheless, he’d rather exchange his life in Kyiv for a better future in far-flung Canada. Thus, when he gets a generous job offer which might help him realise his dream, he jumps at the chance; he soon sets off to record the sounds of animals indigenous to Ukraine and also a rare bird native to the Carpathians. The situation proves somewhat more complicated when Vadym’s companion on the trip turns out to be his mother… To the sounds of a synthesized music score, debuting Ukrainian director Antonio Lukich unfolds a visually creative road movie, in which he demonstrates a highly unusual talent for constructing tragicomic situations.','/9DOmWktaCDJtUfXq3hT7RQ8QUkg.jpg','2020-01-02',104,'Released',NULL,'My Thoughts Are Silent',609031,1.4685,7.6,'RPyCUrLqA4M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45067,_binar