Uu9J6K6H4iFCB.jpg','2019-07-19',107,'Released',NULL,'Arjun Patiala',531601,1.0561,4.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45071,_binary '\0','/no67zxKlOpV7zQdT2Atf7ljn4WA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7881542',4.6,1621,'hi','हैप्पी फिर भाग जाएगी','Horticulture professor Happy arrives in Shanghai and the other Happy along with husband Guddu also lands up in the Chinese city at the same time. Gangsters who’ve come to kidnap Happy and her husband, pick up the wrong Happy, while Guddu and his wife Happy are escorted to a university to deliver a lecture.','/6ZGPJgK9qMlQopwfRBeL8t1yltX.jpg','2018-08-24',136,'Released',NULL,'Happy Phirr Bhag Jayegi',538112,0.9486,6.192,'-HlzmWaFcG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45072,_binary '\0','/lNSaNHNdt8ci6o1UNjsauMl35ag.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7881550',7.7,4692,'hi','कामयाब','The human drama is based on an interesting premise of a seasoned character actor who decides to come out of retirement and begin a quest for a record of some sorts, that elusive 500th role, the one for which he shall be remembered forever.','/b2VeikFx112olsivPPzA8D3cTUL.jpg','2020-03-06',109,'Released',NULL,'Kaamyaab',598859,1.1363,6.7,'8KwQkxW1bVc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45073,_binary '\0','/wNDEEXoA5Wmt707lTzT3UeyHdxj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7882104',6,1637,'pt','Os Farofeiros','Things go from bad to worse when four co-workers decide to enjoy the extended holiday at a beach house with their families.','/tSUGsF1GSNLZAEjeePsDlHBhG0a.jpg','2018-03-08',103,'Released','Time for vacation!','The Beachnickers',494493,1.2667,6.891,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45074,_binary '\0','/5ayg658eADu2IehWvTktZNjfzgX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7882250',5.9,1571,'fr','Jusqu\'ici tout va bien','Fred Bartel is the charismatic boss of a trendy Parisian communication agency, Happy Few. After a heated tax audit, he was forced by the administration to relocate overnight his company in La Courneuve. Fred and his team meet Samy, a young suburb who will quickly propose to teach them the rules and practices to adopt in this new environment.','/a2WTpc0HpC2fSIFJu6fLe7oyx2t.jpg','2019-02-27',90,'Released',NULL,'New Biz in the Hood',547388,2.3505,5.844,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45075,_binary '\0','/bDqchWjPhko0XvRBx4pErPMk0Hv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7883022',5.1,2646,'en','Harry & Meghan: A Royal Romance','Examine the history of Prince Harry and Meghan Markle from the moment they met after being set up by friends, through their initial courtship when they were able to keep their romance under wraps, and ultimately the intense global media attention surrounding their relationship and Meghan’s life as a divorced American actress.','/2ODzSaM8EKF28mGjNTH3ptb3BJu.jpg','2018-05-13',120,'Released',NULL,'Harry & Meghan: A Royal Romance',518527,2.512,6.9,'FgUB5wbFq1w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45076,_binary '\0','/nSuZJXgn01roVKt0NaQ4s1rKG9Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7883774',6.2,1987,'de','Kalte Füße','Although he actually just wanted to steal money, the crook Denis finds himself in the position of caretaking for the stroke patient Raimund. When Raimund\'s granddaughter Charlotte turns up, Denis has enough of it and wants to skip. But because of an huge blizzard, escape is unimaginable.','/9v8dhdYwTeXzzw2fDb05TrvhWH1.jpg','2018-11-21',94,'Released',NULL,'Cold Feet',564140,3.4441,6.6,'K6fX1FEIa1M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45077,_binary '\0','/jbvwEXLTcgpRaZf9awZhxl3iq0s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7884228',5.7,2276,'te','NTR కథానాయకుడు','Based on the journey of the legendary Telugu actor, filmmaker and ex-Chief Minister Late Taraka Rama Rao Nandamuri.','/7v5XNFBt7fKNFNfs5vB300wBVu6.jpg','2019-01-09',170,'Released',NULL,'N.T.R: Kathanayakudu',568522,2.0738,5.118,'1-2J7avI9W8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45078,_binary '\0','/zMjI3HqcpOQVcIy9poJQ6vdd2Ds.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7884368',5.3,2407,'en','Destroy All Neighbors','William Brown, a neurotic, self-absorbed musician determined to finish his prog-rock magnum opus, faces a creative roadblock in the form of a noisy and grotesque neighbor named Vlad. Finally working up the nerve to demand that Vlad keep it down, William inadvertently decapitates him. But, while attempting to cover up one murder, William’s accidental reign of terror causes victims to pile up and become undead corpses who torment and create more bloody detours on his road to prog-rock Valhalla.','/jIpjUy6ACDk8Fc8GkynLcIAPP49.jpg','2024-04-26',86,'Released',NULL,'Destroy All Neighbors',974558,2.2497,6.045,'puY9AthRUCQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45079,_binary '\0','/dy0IQ8eiYhIPPeoAN9CAWRl9BK6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7885428',5.4,1560,'en','Chompy & the Girls','A troubled woman meets her father for the first time and their encounter goes from awkward to alarming when they witness a man swallow a little girl whole.','/mEqsGycEVv6kfsIgH8dyQbnCcaw.jpg','2021-09-14',89,'Released','Don\'t bite off more than you can chew!','Chompy & the Girls',671725,1.6406,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45080,_binary '\0','/pCMsY2lIkkNI6L5zaZfsTYXUOJg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7886442',4.5,1658,'en','Death Kiss','A vigilante with a mysterious past becomes a one-man army in a crime-infested town as he takes the law into his own hands, at the same time protecting a young mother and her daughter. He sets his sights on a local kingpin, setting up an action-packed and fateful confrontation.','/i9xTZyMpemikWHZYUWBJwl4QEzO.jpg','2018-05-04',88,'Released','Justice has a familiar face.','Death Kiss',515237,1.7256,5.2,'eoh7JvAwyks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45081,_binary '\0','/jT1hG9WWOchfaLLgIqpD24T2PPM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7886614',4.8,1885,'zh','猫与桃花源','A cat named Blanket lives in the city with his son, Cape. One day, Cape decides to leave home and embarks on an adventure to find the legendary cat\'s paradise. To find his son, Blanket must overcome his fear and reconcile with his past.','/lsZheNTApIa1nrgBWzw90gXdy3Y.jpg','2018-04-05',105,'Released',NULL,'Cats',513386,3.7354,6.6,'41Xw_Q38-Eo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45082,_binary '\0','/8XEJxCmYEIV7BqmXqzo7IVwBTl3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7886848',1.2,97446,'hi','सड़क २','The film follows Ravi, 29 years after the incidents of the first film. The suicidal taxi driver plans to shut shop when a young girl, Aarya, compels him to take her on a life-altering journey to Kailash where she has an encounter with a godman and is out to expose this fake guru running an ashram.','/qYQ2xuujz16HwpDoz2ejOK2nzh7.jpg','2020-10-16',134,'Released',NULL,'Sadak 2',556270,1.1533,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45083,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7886854',7.5,2078,'en','The Window','The Window is a drama about an artist\'s struggle between staying true to his art and giving in to the ruthless reality of life. A talented yet deeply troubled screenplay writer Lekh Kapoor wants to break free from the shackles of conventional storytelling, but ends up taking up the job of rewriting the script of a Tamil blockbuster. Lekh fights with his own demons of angst, arrogance, selfishness, and denial, while not being ready to compromise with the art that cinema is. His life takes a U-turn when a mysterious girl becomes the object of his obsession.','/n9Lm23HEOsyMdXz76dD7ABPjDWq.jpg','2018-02-16',121,'Released','The window','The Window',577115,1.3016,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45084,_binary '\0','/kXwm3nfiLGjlbxdOfYcZ963TWuc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7886936',7,8952,'en','Dating Amber','Eddie and Amber decide to stage a relationship in order to stop everyone speculating about their sexuality. Eddie is keen to follow his dad into the military, while Amber dreams of moving to the liberal hub of London. The plan seems solid, but as their arrangement begins to fall apart, Eddie’s denial gets deeper as Amber realizes that a perilous future awaits her best friend unless she intervenes.','/r9aro2Op31Bjp1DdOT3pfk3t3LR.jpg','2020-07-03',92,'Released','They have their secret.','Dating Amber',635918,3.4662,7,'jVU_e0Kq4A8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45085,_binary '\0','/61MrK5U4w4MVL1vfwoG12zYPJ8B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7888964',7.4,404800,'en','Nobody','Hutch Mansell, a suburban dad, overlooked husband, nothing neighbor — a \"nobody.\" When two thieves break into his home one night, Hutch\'s unknown long-simmering rage is ignited and propels him on a brutal path that will uncover dark secrets he fought to leave behind.','/oBgWY00bEFeZ9N25wWVyuQddbAo.jpg','2021-03-18',91,'Released','Never underestimate a nobody.','Nobody',615457,20.2762,7.863,'wZti8QKBWPo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45086,_binary '\0','/b4iA0RZ4CbPC6AHODm8YxVUpIwA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7890408',5.6,1217,'pt','O Clube dos Canibais','Otavio and Gilda are a very wealthy couple of the Brazilian elite who have the habit of eating their employees. Otavio owns a private security company and is a notable member of The Cannibal Club. When Gilda accidentally discovers a secret from Borges, a powerful congressman and the Club’s leader, her and her husband’s lives are in grave danger.','/hR7v2W9yQ0H6RAtOmj8sUPnGsP2.jpg','2019-10-03',80,'Released','Nothing like a home cooked meal.','The Cannibal Club',499195,1.623,5.5,'zAB7yNbjkgc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45087,_binary '\0','/uD6q7YNLoLFLKKKizl1Pwj9u8Gd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7890550',6,1661,'en','Astronaut','A lonely widower battles his family, ill health and time to win a competition for a golden ticket to space.','/40qqHwwOprysEPummwUVnOqbMAO.jpg','2019-07-26',97,'Rel