Sweat',504114,1.1669,5.8,'LXK1qG8l0VQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45100,_binary '\0','/nXqfQ1W5ga3Ux02dVtFfd281sgT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7901640',7.1,6164,'nl','Gewoon vrienden','Joris is trying to come to terms with his broken family relationships on the 10th anniversary of his father’s death when he meets the free-spirited, Yad. Also dealing with family issues, Yad has returned home to The Netherlands after living on his own. Joris and Yad spark an instant connection and decide they want to be more than “just friends,” but fear their families could threaten their relationship.','/1W75ZH4QGE52B7uOm2p3muAMkmP.jpg','2019-05-25',84,'Released','With benefits.','Just Friends',501902,3.715,7.1,'R-WtYFToGHo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45101,_binary '\0','/AgovvK0kfcUB0U5yznIJyYRKMFH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7901798',7.6,8565,'fa','مغزهای کوچک زنگ‌ زده','The story is about a family of three brothers and a sister in the suburbs of the city\'s poverty. Their elder brother owns a drug-producing kitchen and presides over the group, like a shepherd for sheep.','/ua4QaktLoEHdv59IHjYrEGt99ar.jpg','2018-02-05',120,'Released',NULL,'Sheeple',503112,1.1062,6.1,'NBWziZsBlSg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45102,_binary '\0','/g5QV2F7dMnQ4kmgCs9exTfqfwgB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7902124',6.5,1509,'de','Der Boden unter den Füßen','Lola controls her personal life with the same ruthless efficiency she uses to optimize profits in her job as a business consultant. But when a tragic event forces the past back into her life, Lola\'s grip on reality seems to slips away.','/fvnD9doprRN059HPaM9rJaUCQLW.jpg','2019-03-22',108,'Released',NULL,'The Ground Beneath My Feet',568789,1.8591,5.6,'-q7qHVn8ssY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45103,_binary '\0','/mYU1NFj8U99yX4sXEGcvEGQ7RQG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7903530',5.2,5564,'en','We Die Young','Lucas, a 14-year-old boy inducted into the gang life in Washington D.C., is determined that his 10-year-old brother won\'t follow the same path. When an Afghanistan war veteran comes into the neighborhood, an opportunity arises.','/1rvsmRHfjIalt2LBDrEkyKFOQgo.jpg','2019-05-09',93,'Released','Every life is worth saving.','We Die Young',538207,5.6344,6.8,'EflGhkNvWPM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45104,_binary '\0','/94PXfCDB6TrTx1YwuUjzIpVXT2i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7905466',8.2,41183,'en','They Shall Not Grow Old','A documentary about World War I with never-before-seen footage to commemorate the centennial of Armistice Day, and the end of the war.','/yMGfJeTXUdIjOqjS0jJfjgYEuYC.jpg','2018-11-09',99,'Released',NULL,'They Shall Not Grow Old',543580,3.722,7.8,'D6Do1p1CWyc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45105,_binary '\0','/3TEeKRWEdPwrdfIxiFbBK2HFuMv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7905880',6.6,2398,'en','My Secret Valentine','A young woman takes advice from the chalkboard notes that her mysterious house rental tenant leaves when a slick sales rep arrives with plans to buy her family’s prized winery.','/zk9I9GiznncJXfW9A4WXooi4zHj.jpg','2018-02-03',84,'Released',NULL,'My Secret Valentine',497514,1.4797,6.4,'IFS_02EsRbQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45106,_binary '\0','/qQ1wLZMyEHxzdz11b5hpJl6G0Ly.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7909444',7.2,1632,'bg','Ága','In a yurt on the snow-covered fields of the North, Nanook and Sedna live following the traditions of their ancestors. Alone in the wilderness, they look like the last people on Earth. Nanook and Sedna\'s traditional way of life starts changing - slowly, but inevitably. Hunting becomes more and more difficult, the animals around them die from inexplicable deaths and the ice has been melting earlier every year. Chena, who visits them regularly, is their only connection to the outside world - and to their daughter Ága, who has left the icy tundra a long time ago due to family feud. When Sedna\'s health deteriorates, Nanook decides to fulfill her wish. He embarks on a long journey in order to find Ága.','/gDpr5A44rZ2bxGWfwqd8xb4yNUy.jpg','2018-11-21',96,'Released',NULL,'Ága',500542,1.219,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45107,_binary '\0','/gCAyjWtKlqltudeKNadNyDOMNXM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7910444',5.9,1844,'ru','Гоголь. Вий','A mysterious Dark Horseman slays young girls near the village of Dikanka, and he has already butchered 11 ladies. Nikolai Gogol, a scribe from Saint Petersburg has to take charge of the investigation, but the closer he gets to solving the case, the more fits he has, causing macabre visions. When he learns the next victim is his beloved, Liza, he doubts that he can protect her and resist the murderer. Fortunately, he meets somebody who can help him: Khoma Brut, the witch hunter, martial artist and philosopher. Together they spend three dreadful nights in an old chapel reading the funeral service for Ulyana, the witch, and calling upon the ghastly evil spirit Viy.','/i3ZVkRfqX3cviDOLPOliON9Tkzl.jpg','2018-04-05',99,'Released','Don\'t Leave The Circle','Gogol. Viy',469284,3.0553,6.2,'vTCuprNOF0M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45108,_binary '\0','/mVjtdp1xhG0lRGYOkmdz7F5zzY4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7912470',7.4,1497,'my','ဥပါယ်တံမျဥ်','Min Htet possesses a perfect life which will be envied by a lot. He is rich; owns a gallery and in addition to all that, has a beautiful wife called Zin Mar. He is the epitome of happiness and success. But at one point in his life, he committed a unforgettable sin which destroyed both his marriage and business. After a series of events that nearly destructed his life, he started to realize his perfect life may not be as what he thinks it is.','/gn8O3niMLv1LHFt14laXRU5ZSgt.jpg','2018-01-19',130,'Released',NULL,'Deception',501215,0.7849,7,'9WG7MMRlEz8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45109,_binary '\0','/83QRU9A8n5rHwS4L9xS9ni9y6sE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7913172',6.7,1602,'ko','풀잎들','Ahreum sits in a small café, typing on her laptop. Around her, customers enact various dramas from their lives. Is she writing what she hears or is she hearing what\'s been written?','/22fPEFs3fdJnJuMDBinHaOwnRFx.jpg','2018-10-25',66,'Released',NULL,'Grass',499255,1.4435,6.6,'8WgOlUUrYTM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45110,_binary '\0','/xw8hpRttw101BSvna9kz8JQSiUX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7913934',6.2,2781,'en','The Matchmaker\'s Playbook','After a career-ending accident, former NFL recruit Ian Hunter is back on campus, and he\'s putting his extensive skills with women to work as one of the masterminds behind a successful and secretive dating service. But when Blake Olson requests the services of Wingmen, Inc., Ian may have landed his most hopeless client yet. As Blake begins the transformation from hot mess to smokin\' hot, Ian realizes he\'s in danger of breaking his cardinal rule....','/tpdLAbE4C7AMY77xFNguMX1XIb8.jpg','2018-03-15',90,'Released',NULL,'The Matchmaker\'s Playbook',510938,4.2238,7.186,'9PxSX6WBBO4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45111,_binary '\0','/oslUsPw3PUhDVK7a5soTvCAuaO7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7914416',7.6,36264,'ja','カメラを止めるな！','Real zombies arrive and terrorize the crew of a zombie film being shot in an abandoned warehouse, said to be the site of military experiments on humans.','/rws34k2bqYVo2B5MkhKAbV8925j.jpg','2017-11-04',96,'Released','Don\'t Stop Shooting!','One Cut of the Dead',513434,4.2024,7.6,'Du2XfUDfjN0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45112,_binary '\0','/hXkmblhkyUvZRcB7FFi5gPlSQnv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7915554',6.5,4000,'fa','بمب؛ یک عاشقانه','It’s 1988 and, at the height of the Iran-Iraq War, Tehran is bombed relentlessly. The days that pass are full of foreboding, and yet, love, affection, hope and life itself manage to sweep away the fear of death from those surrounded by it. Love may often be difficult to comprehend, but death is a horrible certitude. ‘Bomb, A Love Story’ shows how, even when faced with the darkness of death, love and hope will find a way.','/nPaSAiNQhW30mnwcYmCPV217g2h.jpg','2018-02-20',97,'Released',NULL,'Bomb: A Love Story',504199,1.0112,6.613,'0qnct88JkeE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45113,_binary '\0','/6RVsEZGdDpwZhZkaptSgF7AznHF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7917178',6,16377,'en','Caveat','A lone drifter suffering from partial memory loss accepts a job to look after a psychologically troubled woman in an abandoned house on an isolated island.','/nbug05AceVU8PMXIONDFxMRtq54.jpg','2021-10-20',88,'Released','You\'ve been warned.','Caveat',744746,5.2538,6.4,'HoOkSYrf8ew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45114,_binary '\0','/ed7rydAjpA7UdYdxA0uADwldj9V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7919680',7.6,20899,'hi','कारवाँ','Avinash, a dejected soul stuck in a dead-end job shares a strange relationship with his father. He holds him responsible for crushing his dreams. However, he is left pondering upon this longstanding hatred when he hears of his father’s untimely demise.','/dS0ZFlqGbGGksSUdqk7niL7rywc.jpg','2018-08-03',125,'Released','3 Lost Souls.. 2 Dead Bodies.. A Journey Of A Lifetime','Karwaan',533237,1.1968,7.1,'IUCeN7kelXs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45115,_binary '\0','/c6zGrPNcZwpixJfI87OgurRREjA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7919810',5.4,1458,'en','The Turkey Bowl','A 30-something urbanite is pulled back to his rural hometown by his high school buddies on Thanksgiving to finish The Turkey Bowl – an epic football game against their cross town rivals that was snowed out fifteen years prior.','/5tKPOLHHoyQ0McYrY6WQAXMHTsJ.jpg','2019-11-15',120,'Released','The biggest game in the history of small towns!','The Turkey Bowl',532893,2.8122,5,'FpzLcPYOuIE','YouTube','