e from home. Six feet underground.','Girl in the Bunker',501624,7.843,7.1,'g-KoklLtL5Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45138,_binary '\0','/ru8Wo0Hu0WRV6UJxrMXvqj3Pnbd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7945236',6.4,1982,'es','El príncipe','Chile, 1970. During a night of heavy drinking, Jaime, a lonely 20-year-old young man, is sentenced to prison. There, he meets “The Stallion”, an older and respected man in whom he finds protection, and from whom he learns about love and loyalty. But as their relationship grows stronger, “The Stallion” faces the violent power struggles within the prison.','/fH0IgQCVRULwceSMB2GBYH4IA4c.jpg','2019-08-29',96,'Released',NULL,'The Prince',574954,2.4093,7.3,'wCB8f6XldT4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45139,_binary '\0','/oJgcdLYsZ5WYKAteH1gwypLcNVM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7945440',5.8,23565,'en','The Lie','A father and daughter are on their way to dance camp when they spot the girl\'s best friend on the side of the road. When they stop to offer the friend a ride, their good intentions soon result in terrible consequences.','/a3c5zUOIEXAFYFf0vyypBCNJepb.jpg','2018-09-13',95,'Released','It was an accident.','The Lie',539649,4.091,6.4,'czIBLZxLlzk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45140,_binary '\0','/pqNt028UkXCsfFue54zkR37xeKW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7945450',6.6,1456,'ar','Notturno','Shot over three years on the borders between Iraq, Kurdistan, Syria and Lebanon, the film depicts the everyday struggles of people attempting to rebuild their lives amongst the devastating effects of civil wars, dictatorships, foreign invasions, and the deadly presence of ISIS.','/ncvrZmFYoLdl9xWnGRNFK5iCg1K.jpg','2020-09-09',100,'Released',NULL,'Notturno',539529,0.8422,6.7,'XUuKnAu_VO4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45141,_binary '\0','/kCjwtijPysg5YRdb0h3nWs2s7OA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7946216',5.6,2245,'en','Depraved','A field surgeon