019-05-03',109,'Released','Your real life is about to begin.','The Last Summer',502292,4.2722,6,'Qe9B8kzlFjM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45152,_binary '\0','/35kYvfK9TUOQ912QVsNoTCnYqlH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7958736',5.6,71987,'en','Ma','Sue Ann is a loner who keeps to herself in her quiet Ohio town. One day, she is asked by Maggie, a new teenager in town, to buy some booze for her and her friends, and Sue Ann sees the chance to make some unsuspecting, if younger, friends of her own.','/6n7ASmQ1wY2cxTubFFGlcvPpyk7.jpg','2019-05-29',99,'Released','Get home safe.','Ma',502416,10.0911,5.817,'eIvbEC8N3cA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45153,_binary '\0','/h51DdjaDD2aPu1fLHsmpJaaJinS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7959026',7,170873,'en','The Mule','Earl Stone, a man in his eighties, is broke, alone, and facing foreclosure of his business when he is offered a job that simply requires him to drive. Easy enough, but, unbeknownst to Earl, he\'s just signed on as a drug courier for a Mexican cartel. He does so well that his cargo increases exponentially, and Earl hit the radar of hard-charging DEA agent Colin Bates.','/vkOfx5meJvFb4qmAJU7j6v8IIpZ.jpg','2018-12-14',116,'Released','Nobody runs forever','The Mule',504172,12.1683,6.872,'0WhaleJ3Zik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45154,_binary '\0','/xEPQxkqAVIXrZKQIQCKqyRHzc1t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7959138',6,2701,'en','10 Lives','A pampered cat takes for granted the lucky hand he has been dealt after he is rescued and loved by Rose, a kind-hearted and passionate student. When he loses his ninth life, fate steps in to set him on a transformative journey.','/r2D7MkNocsqKOqGnnGEQThU26JS.jpg','2024-04-18',87,'Released','9 lives just isn\'t enough...','10 Lives',567811,8.5247,7.7,'RYiN-h_Kbhs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45155,_binary '\0','/w4pUYpFTywnCn40NV9XKy2Wdacv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7959216',7.2,17319,'no','Utøya 22. juli','A teenage girl fights for survival and to locate her young sister during the 2011 terrorist attack at a political summer camp on the Norwegian island of Utøya.','/bpa91Opnvl4XxUCycyNGvhwRWqC.jpg','2018-03-09',92,'Released','The day that changed us forever','Utøya: July 22',500006,4.8522,7.1,'mgF83LnQOOA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45156,_binary '\0','/7Bl98JC4kGe62ORuFIsFtWtcIA2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7959500',3.7,5910,'en','The Farm','The young couple Nora and Alec are on their way back from a long road trip. In a desert town they want to take a break, but when they wake up the next morning, they are no longer in the motel where they had actually checked in. Overnight, the by a group of crazed killers wearing animal masks, have been abducted. What would happen if people were treated like cattle for slaughter? On the farm, this horrific idea comes true. As Nora and Alec soon find out, they are not the only ones locked in cages, fattened up and fed only to be slaughtered, disemboweled and eaten as a delicacy by their torturers. For the young couple begins a fight for bare survival.','/7nPMR3QU5vl7cEmB1LE6O6yliCg.jpg','2019-04-19',80,'Released','They\'re Dying To Meat You','The Farm',517764,3.3154,5.4,'XFUR9J3Blw4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45157,_binary '\0','/6OTRuxpwUUGbmCX3MKP25dOmo59.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7961060',7.7,38073,'ja','ドラゴンボール超 ブロリー','Earth is peaceful following the Tournament of Power. Realizing that the universes still hold many more strong people yet to see, Goku spends all his days training to reach even greater heights. Then one day, Goku and Vegeta are faced by a Saiyan called \'Broly\' who they\'ve never seen before. The Saiyans were supposed to have been almost completely wiped out in the destruction of Planet Vegeta, so what\'s this one doing on Earth? This encounter between the three Saiyans who have followed completely different destinies turns into a stupendous battle, with even Frieza (back from Hell) getting caught up in the mix.','/uMEgkyiPznZP5AiMSWAk2jsj5gC.jpg','2018-12-14',101,'Released','A new adventure to become the strongest begins.','Dragon Ball Super: Broly',503314,3.0124,8,'1GtIJsvIFAQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45158,_binary '\0','/4X7HvsfnwAMWPEoLU8PK2PMQBm9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7962932',5.6,5387,'en','I\'ll Take Your Dead','William has a simple job: he makes dead bodies disappear. His daughter Gloria has become used to rough-looking men dropping off corpses, and is even convinced that some of them are haunting their house.','/bhOtz1wKwXWzhx3Z3IxtvbZFf4o.jpg','2018-10-01',83,'Released','Death is knocking at their door.','I\'ll Take Your Dead',539549,2.513,6.3,'Gre3jcoIERc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45159,_binary '\0','/mr2LvZydvor6CDZhrpJLRYMCcBc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7967302',6.8,8660,'en','The King of Kings','Charles Dickens tells his young son Walter the greatest story ever told, and what begins as a bedtime tale becomes a life-changing journey. Through vivid imagination, the boy walks alongside Jesus, witnessing His miracles, facing His trials, and understanding His ultimate sacrifice.','/ccw7CCIAvcZV431CP7NhHAHuiHR.jpg','2025-04-07',102,'Released','A father\'s greatest joy is raising his son.','The King of Kings',1181107,8.9053,8.3,'HDhet3EVRac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45160,_binary '\0','/bd6NQDFpUoqNWWJ8eBBip3SR2kP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7967412',6.6,9551,'es','Quien a hierro mata','Mario, an exemplary man, lives in a village on the Galician coast. In the old people’s home, where he works as a nurse, everyone appreciates him. When the best known narco in the area, Antonio Padín, recently released from prison, enters the residence, Mario tries to make Antonio feel at home. Now, Padín\'s two sons, Kike and Toño, are in charge of the family business. The failure of an operation will put Kike in jail and cause them to owe a large debt to a Colombian supplier. Toño will turn to the nurse to try to convince his father to assume the debt. But Mario has his own plans.','/3WEJAWFusNeZIJDNYxeIPytuZ1g.jpg','2019-08-30',107,'Released',NULL,'Eye for an Eye',574376,2.5347,6.7,'QsVl5znI7bk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45161,_binary '\0','/riCkU96UaNtWUTrZGzYcojMedlv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7968456',6.2,2013,'kn','ಕುರುಕ್ಷೇತ್ರ','An adaptation of the Mahabharata is mainly told through the eyes of the Kaurava prince Duryodhana & gives insights on how Duryodhana, who could have been one of the greatest warriors and rulers, ends up being manipulated, and eventually meets an untimely end.','/sF28xMc7hyeHdki7f9Snk8UmjBU.jpg','2019-08-09',182,'Released',NULL,'Kurukshetra',620082,1.1521,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45162,_binary '\0','/h5h0IH5iFURX3ahzH4wecVBnwjw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7969836',6.9,1635,'en','The Twentieth Century','Toronto, Canada, 1899. William Lyon Mackenzie King (1874-1950) fervently believes that he is destined to become Prime Minister, but to do so he will first have to fight his personal obsessions and overcome the many obstacles he will encounter on his tortuous path to power.','/q7JE9x0By5AWi8RnIIEX6F8m4Zh.jpg','2019-12-20',90,'Released','Blistering shame! Unbridled passions! Pulse-quickening tribulation!','The Twentieth Century',582871,1.3396,6.4,'mE3dzCpFGWI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45163,_binary '\0','/t4V82jen6LKBjs8WMuMpGxbtFgJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7970348',4.7,4401,'en','The Stand In','When ordered to serve a year in rehab, actress Candy hires her on-set stand-in to take her place. The unassuming woman flips the script and steals her identity, career and boyfriend in this hilarious comedy about trading places.','/twQeFldoNaDnMYXmZNXpm3NHlhP.jpg','2020-12-03',101,'Released','Steal the spotlight.','The Stand In',633908,5.3085,5.308,'b0ZKeBUUtr0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45164,_binary '\0','/cZTVFoWr8teRlVLHSueMycnAJuQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7972012',5.8,7037,'fr','OSS 117 : Alerte rouge en Afrique noire','1981. Hubert Bonisseur de la Bath, aka OSS 117, is back. For this new mission – more delicate, more dangerous and more torrid than ever – he is forced to team up with a young new colleague, the promising OSS 1001.','/8KZun0DjBSVJtAEb7ytNKIKO0SL.jpg','2021-08-04',117,'Released',NULL,'OSS 117: From Africa with Love',604563,3.1108,5.7,'Dbcob9qYivI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45165,_binary '\0','/zDtoAya6AY8YYBcOMOjbNDwX3WX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7972178',6,1467,'es','70 Binladens','Raquel is desperate: a series of unfortunate events have led to her daughter being taken and she needs a large amount of money to get her back, and fast. After a desperate plea to the bank, she manages to secure the loan she needs. The problem is that precisely at that moment, a peculiar couple of robbers enter the branch: the drug-addicted Jonan and his partner Lola, who is a deadly combination of smart and psychotic. But Raquel’s stakes are too high, and she knows she must think carefully to outsmart them, save herself and get her money.','/4gcLReyZd83sPuEPvW6JJwEaaYt.jpg','2019-03-08',105,'Released',NULL,'70 Big Ones',551499,2.644,5.7,'ivTdeN5y5WQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45166,_binary '\0','/n8Vh6cdEvn8XtnmoEeqzomv6SYJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7972570',5.4,2775,'en','Mr. K','Mr. K, a traveling magician, finds himself in a Kafkaesque nightmare when he can’t find the exit of his hotel. His attempts to get out only pull him deeper, entangling him further with the hotel and its curious inhabitants.','/lRpGcAYC7cm1QnInz8P3xHvm7cV.jpg','2025-01-16',96,'Released',NULL,'Mr. K',1242669,2.1612,6.3,'bZ-r19k4WQ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45167,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7973916',3.4,1923,'en','Enter the Wild','On a trek to find the world\'s rarest tree, Dylan and his friends descend into harsh ravines and canyons. As the wilderness closes in on them they come face to face with hard truths about friendship, unrequited love, and the consequences of letting go of the past.','/ywxU4il6TZ1DGs8O4wxpn4ymzOl.jpg','2018-08-17',96,'Released',NULL,'Enter the Wild',527427,1.3297,4,'GC3soxQlBXc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45168,_binary '\0','/n8fzu9irjghl619AJr8PItv8U5R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7974772',3.5,8162,'en','A Sniper\'s War','A Sniper’s War is a story of a sniper, whose anti-US views led him to join the pro-Russian rebels in the ongoing Ukrainian conflict—a primary source of tension between the United States and Russia. When social media becomes a communication platform to schedule sniper duels, Deki’s rival threatens to kill him. The New York-based filmmaker, Olya Schechter, obtains unprecedented access to military bases and front line battles to paint an intimate portrait of the complex and fascinating nature of a man walking the tightrope that often comes to the morality of war: is Deki a solder or a killer?','/pklgIctUQ3n072wZq1GQs4DJ7Lc.jpg','2018-06-28',80,'Released',NULL,'A Sniper\'s War',532622,0.7579,5,'m5wwAfoVD3E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45169,_binary '\0','/5a4yiRsoiSE4efY5FQKKgd9hZWw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7975192',4.2,1327,'en','Hide and Seek','Noah is seeking to reconnect with his outcast brother after the death of their father. He hopes to make amends and share the family\'s fortune, but instead finds himself in a dark underworld that threatens to tear his family apart. As he struggles to maintain his sanity, Noah is led on a terrifying trail to the truth through a series of cryptic clues.','/8vGAAlgJL4BXQVYmwfyMt5nBfjC.jpg','2021-11-19',84,'Released',NULL,'Hide and Seek',801271,3.2781,4.8,'tfl33EHdWAM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45170,_binary '\0','/qgch2rFskIxDMgwrD5lWTaB4nBl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7975244',6.6,325237,'en','Jumanji: The Next Level','As the gang return to Jumanji to rescue one of their own, they discover that nothing is as they expect. The players will have to brave parts unknown and unexplored in order to escape the world’s most dangerous game.','/jyw8VKYEiM1UDzPB7NsisUgBeJ8.jpg','2019-12-04',123,'Released','New places. New faces. Next level.','Jumanji: The Next Level',512200,20.2954,6.867,'F6QaLsw8EWY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45171,_binary '\0','/7OsMTSVI9pfurIsaOrGPW7cxqgk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7976208',2.9,4747,'en','The Haunting of Sharon Tate','Pregnant with director Roman Polanski\'s child and awaiting his return from Europe, 26-year-old Hollywood actress Sharon Tate becomes plagued by visions of her imminent death.','/qzIQjfKmrTKf25y3N3VU88bFn8H.jpg','2019-04-05',90,'Released','Based on a True Story of one of the most Horrific Murders in History','The Haunting of Sharon Tate',503706,2.7517,4.361,'R9JFD50C83Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45172,_binary '\0','/vTIs9gzRkiFbApaCC8JHjurgl4C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7978672',4.6,7901,'en','Black Water: Abyss','An adventure-loving couple convince their friends to explore a remote, uncharted cave system in the forests of Northern Australia. With a tropical storm approaching, they abseil into the mouth of the cave, but when the caves start to flood, tensions rise as oxygen levels fall and the friends find themselves trapped. Unknown to them, the storm has also brought in a pack of dangerous and hungry crocodiles.','/pmAv14TPE2vKMIRrVeCd1Ll7K94.jpg','2020-07-09',98,'Released','Descend into fear.','Black Water: Abyss',522444,5.0861,5.1,'cIbRs6jwU_c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45173,_binary '\0','/3yAoVcQR1i7Zgm7yNxy58i3RzCi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7978758',7.2,13690,'en','Apollo 10½: A Space Age Childhood','A man narrates stories of his life as a 10-year-old boy in 1969 Houston, weaving tales of nostalgia with a fantastical account of a journey to the moon.','/ms3qa9LH9kosaGCSe22NJ7fDPv9.jpg','2022-03-24',99,'Released','A coming of age story.... the way only Richard Linklater could tell it.','Apollo 10½: A Space Age Childhood',664996,4.5827,7,'Dzuz5s_Qk-A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45174,_binary '\0','/eUaCIstB8oLNQd62Krt0hgqrjQg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7979142',5.6,22306,'en','The Night Clerk','Hotel night clerk Bart Bromley is a highly intelligent young man on the Autism spectrum. When a woman is murdered during his shift, Bart becomes the prime suspect. As the police investigation closes in, Bart makes a personal connection with a beautiful guest named Andrea, but soon realises he must stop the real murderer before she becomes the next victim.','/hPWjid7yMatyIDHvku7lCMN7zSi.jpg','2020-02-19',90,'Released','Someone\'s always watching.','The Night Clerk',526007,7.8215,6.2,'flDC7Ar2Deg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45175,_binary '\0','/oYBs3toQC1Gf3JhX13bQ4tU22YP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7979492',3.8,4128,'en','Kim Possible','Everyday teen hero Kim Possible and her best friend Ron Stoppable embark on their freshman year of high school, all while saving the world from evil villains. While Kim and Ron have always been one step ahead of their opponents, navigating the social hierarchy of high school is more challenging than the action-hero ever imagined. With Drakken and Shego lurking in the wings, Kim must rely on her family and Team Possible—Ron, tech-genius Wade, new friend Athena, and Rufus, a Naked mole-rat.','/t37Xa74GFO1R3kebocqSV4hFrPO.jpg','2019-02-15',86,'Released',NULL,'Kim Possible',520720,5.4933,5.5,'TNRQT9ODqDI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45176,_binary '\0','/vsZLf5uog08pAnfsMuDWrsLWUUF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7979580',7.6,144897,'en','The Mitchells vs. the Machines','A quirky, dysfunctional family\'s road trip is upended when they find themselves in the middle of the robot apocalypse and suddenly become humanity\'s unlikeliest last hope.','/mI2Di7HmskQQ34kz0iau6J1vr70.jpg','2021-04-22',110,'Released','Saving the world can be a trip.','The Mitchells vs. the Machines',501929,19.3257,7.824,'9c52Z5sMuTQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45177,_binary '\0','/rXA03j9HBzhcmgjJetcVSjkmwQg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7981492',4.2,2292,'id','Sabrina','A toy manufacturer and his wife are terrorized by a demon after their orphaned niece tries to call her late mother\'s spirit.','/zheAqvuUgk9L2ElLHgYo92WJIdO.jpg','2018-07-12',98,'Released',NULL,'Sabrina',503902,2.3648,5.3,'S6XunixW6_Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45178,_binary '\0','/pgujMfdn33ir7UbBanRWIzV8Xik.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7983794',7.7,7249,'en','Operation Odessa','The stranger-than-fiction true story of a Russian mobster, a Miami playboy, and a Cuban spy who teamed up in the early \'90s to sell a Soviet submarine to the Cali Cartel.','/cvCbbNy5NOTQGfDNFwGyh7NtnJi.jpg','2018-03-10',92,'Released',NULL,'Operation Odessa',502164,1.2397,7.2,'TWQWc0FXkG4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45179,_binary '\0','/gjiiRn9SwtJup0Xe5EIinP7sf6v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7983844',6.3,5893,'en','Take Your Pills','In a hypercompetitive world, drugs like Adderall offer students, athletes, coders and others a way to do more -- faster and better. But at what cost?','/hnYrGNcj1KKE8Vs4FjVvAafXceK.jpg','2018-03-09',87,'Released','What would you take to be the best?','Take Your Pills',502166,1.8021,6.5,'X6Xebo1pngM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45180,_binary '\0','/23wCZgZ3mDtATocmy1lXNLM7pyx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7983894',6.5,27192,'en','Ammonite','In 1840s England, palaeontologist Mary Anning and a young woman sent by her husband to convalesce by the sea develop an intense relationship. Despite the chasm between their social spheres and personalities, Mary and Charlotte discover they can each offer what the other has been searching for: the realisation that they are not alone. It is the beginning of a passionate and all-consuming love affair that will defy all social bounds and alter the course of both lives irrevocably.','/5lx4pUHWZoOKJWsVsvurRRNW9FK.jpg','2020-11-13',118,'Released',NULL,'Ammonite',568467,4.448,6.891,'AnDhlrs3XVM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45181,_binary '\0','/sYLzRuEcwSz0L1Z92wQNrETHU9O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7984734',7.3,309598,'en','The Lighthouse','Two lighthouse keepers try to maintain their sanity while living on a remote and mysterious New England island in the 1890s.','/yAKNmpcUweGH6WMCEWenwU9PsbE.jpg','2019-10-18',109,'Released','There is enchantment in the light.','The Lighthouse',503919,14.8693,7.5,'42_UHhpq530','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45182,_binary '\0','/nOqsmE2tdTDhq4bYawNrtwnpB9a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7984766',7.3,182894,'en','The King','England, 15th century. Hal, a capricious prince who lives among the populace far from court, is forced by circumstances to reluctantly accept the throne and become Henry V.','/8u0QBGUbZcBW59VEAdmeFl9g98N.jpg','2019-10-11',140,'Released','All hail.','The King',504949,8.1508,7.156,'svVykTznk9Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45183,_binary '\0','/2S0J4PWNY95uLodCAfY7rhAVKla.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt7985648',6.3,43887,'kk','Томирис','This is the story of the life of the great queen of the steppe - legendary Tomiris. She is destined to become a skillful warrior, survive the loss of close people and unite the Scythian/Saka tribes under her authority.','/5PJqVblJsq4LfninHPoEzkp1Tuc.jpg','2019-10-01',156,'Released','The queen born to magnify the steppe.','The Legend of Tomiris',64461