e Condor\'s Nest.','/aBAsCMzsbGlFtQFqeWsKWM6hvOE.jpg','2023-01-27',103,'Released','A hidden Nazi empire. A quest for revenge.','Condor\'s Nest',1062482,2.587,5.6,'EijfB_hNvDs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45237,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8032912',7.5,1822,'ur','پرواز ہے جنوں‬','The life story of the brave soldiers of the Pakistan Army, mainly the Pakistan Air Force. Outlining their lives, relationships, duty and hardships.','/nRD8KnEpUoOUCbXExbGmmn5zEKZ.jpg','2018-08-22',130,'Released',NULL,'Parwaaz Hai Junoon',543005,1.1907,9.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45238,_binary '\0','/35XXpNgWQr8BSWjCdR3gjYxomCx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8033428',7.4,1607,'bn','উমা','To please his dying daughter, a father tries to create the Durga Puja festival, usually held in October, during the month of April, in Kolkata.','/q79IpOoKASm2bIbRp2pOjkCH2Ct.jpg','2018-06-08',149,'Released',NULL,'Uma',521130,1.2759,7.833,'6RcZKX_Y5Ws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45239,_binary '\0','/891MRTCJkqnxgkvatKg6ImBRJ8u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8033592',7.4,6525,'zh','后来的我们','Ten years ago, on a train home during the busy Spring Festival travel period, fate brings Xiaoxiao and Jianqing together. Like many young couples, they meet, fall in love, and strive to make it work, but eventually, the harsh realities of life make them drift apart. Ten years later, they run into each other again. Will they make the most of this second chance and rekindle what they once lost?','/45tKwttzp8Ac47DbjtA6NV12F1r.jpg','2018-04-28',120,'Released',NULL,'Us and Them',508747,3.9733,7.556,'-xSs_xsf5sI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45240,_binary '\0','/ae4ImqMQCoatvxG0DMrQwUUVqAZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8033702',6.5,1518,'bn','Naqaab','After an accident, a man finds that he can communicate with the dead and must decide whether to act on their advice.','/qiTGv1f1rGHk4f6QuAKiYmC0j1p.jpg',