.1874,7.8,'4E1-RnpOe8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45256,_binary '\0','/rBD8nvf9K3RvZqlwSM4p9pUiEmh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8046498',5.9,6762,'en','Don\'t Tell a Soul','Two thieving teenage brothers, stealing money to help their sick mom, match wits with a troubled security guard stuck at the bottom of a forgotten well.','/2lla8pP0wNlDAFgV83nZpYMWkeT.jpg','2020-09-08',83,'Released','Some secrets should stay buried.','Don\'t Tell a Soul',572400,5.0709,6.6,'UQxUH4_APyY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45257,_binary '\0','/dpW6UbtM78gaYRxw7WJkiNY079T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8047208',6.8,5010,'te','టాక్సీవాలా','A job monger, Shiva who ends up as a taxiwala only to realise his ride is a beyond what anyone can expect.','/22nSwWSQ0sgo9gJxjWaGRlIJ0Mc.jpg','2018-11-16',150,'Released',NULL,'Taxiwala',520393,1.6262,5.756,'9KN3dbZVRwQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45258,_binary '\0','/zrVqXMxuu7G8spujxp3UbuCdX09.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8051738',6.9,1885,'bn','Bhaijaan Elo Re','Separated at birth, after 28 years Bhai and Jaan grow up to be as different from each other as can be. While Bhai is outspoken and a little bit of a troublemaker a daring costume designer, Jaan is quite shy and timid. After years of being apart, fate brings the two brothers together and things take an interesting turn.','/6JcYE4sr21pGiWcAN3OfpSgxysR.jpg','2018-06-15',160,'Released',NULL,'Bhaijaan Elo Re',548915,0.8127,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45259,_binary '\0','/puUUsAri2UchyJgsbkpO3HZfKiw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8051894',6.7,9918,'en','The Hill','The story of Rickey Hill, who overcomes his physical disability and repairs his relationship with his father in a quest to become a major league baseball (MLB) player.','/e8Dx470lSbIL7OFj7TkFsWAONR5.jpg','2023-08-18',121,'Released','Never give up hope.','The Hill',862557,6.3795,7.6,'wXj7IRAAGb4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45260,_binary '\0','/i41oWDuHKaI8dPlQcfxZj3CNCJu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8053258',5.6,1372,'tr','Gerçek Kesit: Manyak','Riza, a garbage man becomes obsessed in her old mother when he finds a woman\'s corpse in a garbage can. But someday he meets with his new neighbor,a beautiful widow and starts to lose track of reality, stuck between his love and her mother.','/8ZUcyBBlPrpfqKr9nL71FD9uTGM.jpg','2018-03-23',73,'Released','\"Everything is something happened\"','Gerçek Kesit: Manyak',510055,0.9474,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45261,_binary '\0','/e7kMJtCtrVLjaaGaKsjq0kEF1YF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8054066',5.4,1849,'fr','Blanche comme neige','Claire is a beautiful young woman who works at her late father’s hotel, that is now managed by her evil stepmother Maud. Claire unwittingly sparks uncontrollable jealousy in Maud, whose young lover has fallen in love with Claire. Maud decides to get rid of Claire who finds shelter in a farm where she’s allowed to break free from her strict upbringing through encounters with seven “princes.”','/vOo0cXSb5c5B4SJFRJwXosuYpJV.jpg','2019-04-10',112,'Released',NULL,'White as Snow',487437,4.9731,5.1,'zsS8qOzhYjY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45262,_binary '\0','/o1uedRdbC3YYwq91Tk6sjcW7xRz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8054150',6.4,1838,'ru','О чём говорят мужчины. Продолжение','This time Lesha, Slava, Kamil and Sasha go to St. Petersburg. And three of the four do not even know why they go there. But at some point it becomes clear that it does not matter - why. It is important that they go.','/lykCw5QmrvDfWcAgoyEsDFpdpeJ.jpg','2018-02-22',99,'Released',NULL,'What Men Talk About 3',497726,0.8087,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45263,_binary '\0','/2etHdGsw9Y8sP672w3zVxlo36Dp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8054608',6.8,2753,'mk','Господ постои, името ѝ е Петрунија','A Macedonian woman throws herself into a traditionally men-only ceremony, kicking up a ruckus and standing her ground.','/jp8NqAtph3fFHtQpNw1orvoEdmU.jpg','2019-05-01',100,'Released',NULL,'God Exists, Her Name Is Petrunya',574434,1.8983,6.8,'TWPRbaT0Ako','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45264,_binary '\0','/hLZVTMKR2KUOEdc23vsx82PJibW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8055888',7.3,9936,'hi','मर्द को दर्द नहीं होता','Leveraging his ability to withstand pain, a young man trains to follow in the footsteps of his martial arts hero.','/lxHYXswJjaT5k0hPOMmNDRz1EjI.jpg','2019-03-21',136,'Released',NULL,'The Man Who Feels No Pain',541495,1.6792,6.756,'jb0-Mw_V_bA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45265,_binary '\0','/9ZSAFg56HlCsn6OrOhLjxOAzprc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8058874',5.2,13388,'en','We Summon the Darkness','Three best friends attending a heavy-metal show cross paths with sadistic killers after they travel to a secluded country home for an after party.','/g5hx5kepkzUFm1czj1MZse1klX4.jpg','2020-08-28',91,'Released','It\'s going to be one HELL of a party.','We Summon the Darkness',546724,3.6476,5.4,'0cYBnAlROXk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45266,_binary '\0','/yChXbkfXSFPx5mR416s6GYGGM5a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8058904',6.4,1476,'fr','Yao','From his village in northern Senegal, Yao is a 13-year-old boy ready to do anything to meet his hero: Seydou Tall, a famous French actor. Invited to Dakar to promote his new book, the latter goes to his country of origin for the first time. To fulfill his dream, the young Yao organizes his fugue and brave 387 kilometers alone to the capital. Touched by this child, the actor decides to flee his obligations and to accompany him home. But on the dusty and uncertain roads of Senegal, Seydou understands that while rolling towards the village of the child, it also rolls towards its roots.','/jzQRAziC7vkgPlAX35HFc0w1ppj.jpg','2019-01-23',103,'Released',NULL,'Yao',515818,2.4352,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45267,_binary '\0','/8pFm1qJZsGECI50nThbDMbt2lM3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8059654',3.3,1323,'tr','Canavar Gibi: Türk İşi Frankeştayn','Gurbuz, a crook in Istanbul\'s Balat district attempts to defraud a mob leader nicknamed Yellow Kenan and his men and gets killed. But he’s going to be resurrected like Frankenstein, one of the most popular horror figures in horror movies.','/qnWbwMxNuNIi5NWLO55DY23lhJl.jpg','2018-08-03',103,'Released',NULL,'Canavar Gibi',528305,1.8511,3.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45268,_binary '\0','/dPZwKM7dczuK0jApj9KAVv5ruWE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8059926',7.9,2517,'si','ගජමෑන්','Gajaman is a henchman of the local politician Magodisthuma. Gajaman\'s life is turned upside down when Magodisthuma asks him to pick up his daughter and her friend from the airport. The trouble is, Gajaman falls in love with Magodisthuma\'s daughter immediately as he sees her. Magodisthuma becomes furious when he finds out about this. Gajaman is exiled from his village and he tries to sneak back in with the help of his friend Amdan. The movie revolves around the classic Sri Lankan characters Gajaman and Magodisthuma created by Camillus Perera from newspaper cartoons in the 60s.','/7UL6zBrchvv3KNlETkIGPcAeHcQ.jpg','2023-01-20',99,'Released',NULL,'Gajaman',881201,1.3631,7.5,'RlVEqs4-SPQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45269,_binary '\0','/cbJNZeFkiG4ggsNcwzBs6yeCXga.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8060328',5.6,7110,'ru','Вторжение','Two years after the fall of the alien ship, the life of a young woman from Moscow has been changed forever. Her growing powers are now at the focus of both human and celestial investigation: an alien force takes an interest in her, and will stop short of nothing, including an invasion. Can love and compassion save humanity, when faced with a much greater and more demanding test this time?','/eNkewJGOW44OznlnfXA8ewWPPmI.jpg','2020-02-27',129,'Released',NULL,'Invasion',514207,7.2472,6.9,'gIRO1Bwz9f8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45270,_binary '\0','/imIJdptFnmMVfmpxV340TEftUBK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8060408',6.7,2111,'th','น้องพี่ที่รัก','Jane lives with her brother Chut with her being the only one doing everything around the house. But Chut will need to learn to take care of himself when Jane becomes involved romantically with a Japanese coworker.','/o3A2Nqn7rFVr768Jx45kCvWj1dm.jpg','2018-05-10',125,'Released','Love me. Love my brother.','Brother of the Year',512732,1.7343,7.403,'wxgudLt9Cio','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45271,_binary '\0','/u4PhTSMSvlE7dE45I7ktXlje2Ea.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8060774',6.4,3783,'fr','L\'Intervention','February 1976. Somalian rebels hijack a school bus carrying 21 French children and their teacher in Djibouti City. When the terrorists drive it to a no-man’s-land on the border between Somalia and French territory, the French Government sends out a newly formed elite squad to rescue the hostages. Within a few hours, the highly trained team arrives to the crisis area, where the Somalian National Army has taken position behind the barbed wire on the border. The French unit is left with very few options to rescue the hostages. As the volatile situation unravels, the French men quickly come up with a daring plan: carry out a simultaneous 5 men sniper attack to get the children and the teacher out safely. A true story.','/mHXzqCiAmgVhhJscGJIQH94vac0.jpg','2019-01-30',98,'Released',NULL,'15 Minutes of War',484638,3.405,6.787,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45272,_binary '\0','/7RE6kRf7dbXPUIQz4y4SHG9ZtHB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8060978',6,1795,'en','Royal Hearts','Kelly, a hopeless romantic in Montana eager to finish her dissertation, and her father, Hank, a rancher, receive news that he has inherited an estate from a faraway land. When they travel there, they discover that Hank has not only inherited the estate, but the title that goes along with it – KING!','/t6DdClPubkyVSeFMDk8aFGCrG1h.jpg','2018-02-24',84,'Released',NULL,'Royal Hearts',505723,1.9315,6.1,'Rn8xDmCxkWA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45273,_binary '\0','/2DyfhvPB8mbhqBH3PfXWjUeE4Tz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8061070',5.3,2089,'tr','Cici Babam','When three adult siblings meet the offbeat man who their widowed mom fawns over, they take drastic actions to stop them from ever getting married.','/oVF83dIFXCekvR2YoXt5hTHF0DM.jpg','2018-04-20',99,'Released',NULL,'My Step Dad: The Hippie',522828,2.0659,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45274,_binary '\0','/zf31OPmU3br0SOeGPAmLS0G3xul.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8063826',3.1,1622,'en','The Satanic Nun','Aesha goes to an isolated b&b in Kent after her mom books her in so she can get some head space for her studies. In the night Aesha is visited by a nun at the door who will progressively begin to show her true colours as the night unfolds - As the nun continues to bother Aesha at the door, Aesha begins to question her surroundings in this isolated suspense horror.','/bqYUrJjshRiJ0JvB5y7FkdpGIMs.jpg','2018-08-14',91,'Released',NULL,'The Satanic Nun',544986,1.4566,4.2,'wglGO_v1rnc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45275,_binary '\0','/fgGCLyx9PUm94I9mrk9SrDByTf3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8064418',3,2511,'en','Assassin 33 A.D.','When a billionaire gives a group of young scientists unlimited resources to study the science of matter transfer, the scientists unlock the secrets of time travel. But they soon find out that the project is backed by a militant extremist group, and the billionaire plans to go back in time and prove that Jesus never rose from the dead.','/8jDvtdH327I8TgX3UPdkAsZF1dA.jpg','2020-01-24',108,'Released','What if the greatest event in human history was erased?','Assassin 33 A.D.',582306,2.4557,5.2,'Jy8TRN4EZSE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45276,_binary '\0','/6ic9EaJeAaYkXpJ0ZiVpJE3h0KX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8064558',7.1,1990,'en','Responsible Child','Ray, a twelve-year-old boy, must confront the British legal system when he is accused of murder.','/32eFoW7Oudmd0xv8KlFybKvanbA.jpg','2019-12-16',87,'Released',NULL,'Responsible Child',656150,1.9662,6.5,'3FY02INIPmw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45277,_binary '\0','/qxBRwZlXMvXKMCvQAT6eafgTHlb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8066574',6.1,1738,'te','శ్రీనివాస కళ్యాణం','The film highlights the sacred bond with another human being through nuptial rituals and the sanctity of the institution of marriage.','/3yMUEvaSPOK1Feos3bRUL7OqiX8.jpg','2018-08-09',140,'Released','It\'s Not An Event It\'s A Beautiful Moment','Srinivasa Kalyanam',540396,1.0938,5.167,'FUK_nrDQzX8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45278,_binary '\0','/i9WVr01ZerROPpluROAk79Tbqd8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8066940',3.7,17139,'ta','இந்தியன் II: Zero Tolerance','As corruption becomes rampant in the country, a group of idealistic youngsters attract attention of freedom fighter-turned-vigilante Senapathy through social media, who returns to his homeland to finish what he started.','/fPoiIfqmVfNYZRVUtfTSyuAj8Tw.jpg','2024-07-12',178,'Released','Older. Wiser. Deadlier.','Indian 2: Zero Tolerance',552398,3.1436,3.1,'Vt4R3-zXksY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45279,_binary '\0','/usx1FXghKWsvYPAA1H13cixnf8M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8068936',7.6,1311,'en','I Am Paul Walker','Exploring the life and legacy of actor Paul Walker, the Southern California native who cut his teeth as child actor before breaking out in the blockbuster Fast and Furious franchise.','/nTBWHgO4GPpxxDv9vgz9C1Ib2ym.jpg','2018-12-04',93,'Released','\"I surf; I skateboard. I never thought I was going to be an actor. And I never really thought of myself as one.\"','I Am Paul Walker',538161,2.7616,8.2,'0eL_cLqaMX0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45280,_binary '\0','/qDHfaaFORcvd4697RbKphNZIRss.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8071308',6.6,1821,'zh','风中有朵雨做的云','Tang Yijie, the Construction Committee Director, falls off from rooftop and dies in a demolition riot. Yang Jiadong, a young police officer starts his investigation and finds that Tang\'s death is tied up with another case several years ago. Soon he is framed and suspended from duty, but he never gives up.','/kfm4S5DZCh2FwXXdsI4GdjpgXQc.jpg','2019-04-04',129,'Released',NULL,'The Shadow Play',454161,1.7606,6.726,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45281,_binary '\0','/hCm8C6GRM0mGAd2A9qQoYq8vGW1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8072400',7.1,3920,'te','హలో గురు ప్రేమ కోసమే','After a rocky start, a friendship develops between a happy-go-lucky youth and a girl from the city.','/5VqWbyN1EmzvqpFNSzGN7sLJRTj.jpg','2018-10-18',145,'Released',NULL,'Hello Guru Prema Kosame',517508,1.4201,6.32,'8Q4o87KPInY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45282,_binary '\0','/dXI7Q0vUloh7UccnzfItxHibTFj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8074340',6.1,1381,'de','Pelikanblut','Wiebke, a professional horse trainer, faces a unique challenge when she adopts Raya, a five-year-old girl, who is prone to violent outbursts because of her traumatic past.','/tzPM5k6FfpevcwguTjn7NNxAdhZ.jpg','2020-09-24',121,'Released',NULL,'Pelican Blood',495332,2.393,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45283,_binary '\0','/2jHhwTqrOmswuYWxDitlMiAaEkE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8074486',3.4,1906,'en','The Row','A killer stalks and terrorizes a group of sorority girls on a college campus.','/xR2PZ92HTZDFuEpxePJhf0WBCyJ.jpg','2018-07-27',85,'Released',NULL,'The Row',529649,2.3081,4.4,'GmkVlzSiTpY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45284,_binary '\0','/g4L7cBgXk5FSykoCoL4QEGjlIUy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8075016',4.8,12423,'en','The Courier','Ezekiel Mannings, a vicious crime boss, is out to kill Nick, the lone witness set to testify against him. He hires a mysterious female motorcycle courier to unknowingly deliver a poison-gas bomb to slay Nick, but after she rescues Nick from certain death, the duo must confront an army of ruthless hired killers in order to survive the night.','/jE6QFRd48IzAxAubOE9HKB8sTjP.jpg','2019-11-22',99,'Released','Don\'t shoot the messenger.','The Courier',611914,6.9713,5.972,'EcaNxEVqsnM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45285,_binary '\0','/dVRkhmtDn3EiyhX6c9SfL7klCoU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8075192',7.9,96670,'ja','万引き家族','In the outskirts of Tokyo, a poor but close-knit group living on the fringes of society survives through shoplifting and odd jobs. When Osamu and his son take in a neglected young girl, their already fragile existence begins to unravel. As the family grows attached to her, buried secrets surface, forcing them to confront the true meaning of love, belonging, and what makes a family.','/4nfRUOv3LX5zLn98WS1WqVBk9E9.jpg','2018-06-02',120,'Released','Sometimes you choose your family.','Shoplifters',505192,11.3933,7.8,'9382rwoMiRc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45286,_binary '\0','/kxBfZRwklpCq3jcgkrjuSVD5Y5U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8075202',6.2,4815,'fr','L\'Homme fidèle','Marianne leaves Abel for Paul, his best friend and the father of her unborn child. Eight years later, Paul dies and Marianne returns to Abel. However, things have changed for the both of them and feelings of jealousy surround their new relationship.','/3alEKg6RcMnUF8r7OAJFYYMY9AH.jpg','2018-12-26',75,'Released',NULL,'A Faithful Man',529784,3.4844,5.5,'UDaYckxMgpM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45287,_binary '\0','/aVYien6hGy4RQzzepZg1q9cwSzE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8075260',6.2,27836,'en','Someone Great','An aspiring music journalist lands her dream job and is about to move to San Francisco when her boyfriend of nine years decides to call it quits. To nurse her broken heart, she and her two best friends spend one outrageous last adventure in New York City.','/h0nz5lIBXeUZChBNfwL08bLWQaU.jpg','2019-04-19',92,'Released',NULL,'Someone Great',515248,4.9759,6.368,'BBd9gcrj2Wk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45288,_binary '\0','/sqMCPSBgnGytB8wqIZaBTW5gg0d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8076110',5.8,1854,'fr','Énorme','It takes him suddenly at 40 years: Frédéric wants a baby, Claire never wanted one and they agreed on that. He commits the unforgivable and makes a child behind her back. Claire turns into a whale and Frédéric becomes a doting father.','/nu5EjoHfk4oG8RclOqFvJ5TPH9b.jpg','2020-09-02',98,'Released',NULL,'Enormous',640561,1.3498,5,'dIcpHHHBKoI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45289,_binary '\0','/sKCRKnxhk4wNhYJX9AdhBaXpz2e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8076222',8.4,2004,'ro','România neîmblânzită','Untamed Romania provides insight into the stunning natural wonders of Romania, with the Carpathian Mountains, the Danube Delta, and Transylvania as its major areas of interest.','/w5sZNE5Lylv43iVXb7aHTTCbk4R.jpg','2018-04-18',93,'Released','Documentary about Romania','Untamed Romania',521772,2.0722,7.9,'dTZioOwZEew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45290,_binary '\0','/ujNMvDCrKVlVkDMzfaoBCaZJVuE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8076344',7.1,4749,'ja','ペンギン・ハイウェイ','A fourth-grader investigates the mysterious reason behind the sudden appearance of penguins in his village, which is somehow related to a power from a young woman working at a dental clinic.','/wMJJk4kkXfqwP5W7wYHWvDXhTlw.jpg','2018-08-17',118,'Released','A penguin has appeared in my town.','Penguin Highway',508422,4.1198,7.2,'Vs3w1X3GSAg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45291,_binary '\0','/t5Kp02Jzixl0KfpwthHp9ZUex9t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8079248',6.8,187248,'en','Yesterday','A struggling musician realizes he\'s the only person on Earth who can remember The Beatles after waking up in an alternate reality where the group was forgotten.','/9fYka5CQt9nrb6LOtKicysUf9NA.jpg','2019-06-26',116,'Released','Everyone in the world has forgotten The Beatles. Everyone except Jack…','Yesterday',515195,7.7736,6.7,'H3VeHyedL1U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45292,_binary '\0','/wxmehzW4LFfIRQbT5u45mGUCDWU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8080196',6,1442,'fr','Fête de famille','A mother of two gathers her loved ones to celebrate her birthday in her big house near the Loire Valley. The festivities are disrupted by the arrival of her daughter, who is known for her unpredictable outbursts.','/hlU8Cz18uRVp4XKIyNr6qLE05DW.jpg','2019-09-04',95,'Released',NULL,'Happy Birthday',505940,2.1563,5.6,'_gnKWXelU-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45293,_binary '\0','/d1Vu0DRCeJ43YX98UKMi9xJNwrR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8080204',5.5,48162,'en','Hypnotic','A detective becomes entangled in a mystery involving his missing daughter and a secret government program while investigating a string of reality-bending crimes.','/3IhGkkalwXguTlceGSl8XUJZOVI.jpg','2023-05-11',93,'Released','Control is an illusion.','Hypnotic',536437,9.0165,6.187,'XAwpu4rQpeQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45294,_binary '\0','/9c1rYqUGEgee9xGNGiafiX341cN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8080302',7.1,2070,'en','Penguins','The story of Steve, an Adélie penguin, on a quest to find a life partner and start a family. When Steve meets with Wuzzo the emperor penguin they become friends. But nothing comes easy in the icy Antarctic.','/eMSuKJ2e5VgYFr4SwOTLnnl5L15.jpg','2019-04-17',76,'Released','For Steve, his adventure isn\'t all black and white.','Penguins',508802,3.401,7.108,'ZTZgJaw6DF4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45295,_binary '\0','/s6Lv7Md2KvZiqmA8pkKk5kvEoE6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8080418',5.7,5202,'en','Storm Rider: Legend of Hammerhead','Centuries after the Great Flood, riders compete in death races on the water to secure shelter for their people behind the walls of Argos. Rebellious storm riders Neb and Ana look to uncover hidden truths by breaking through the storm.','/uTgR40KTd72HEMbjma7JvIfVxUV.jpg','2026-03-13',105,'Released','Beyond the storm lies freedom.','Storm Rider: Legend of Hammerhead',874860,3.8287,5,'RkGuV03HjPc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45296,_binary '\0','/5Atoipy9FVLfcIdV0Q3RkQEe2sZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8081062',1.8,3916,'zh','厉害了，我的国','Amazing China is a documentary film edited and produced based on the six-episode documentary series \"Brilliant China\" broadcasted on China Central Television (CCTV). The film is a joint production of China Central Television and China Film Co., Ltd. It premiered on March 2, 2018, in major cinemas across the People\'s Republic of China. The documentary highlights the achievements of the Communist Party of China (CPC) led by General Secretary Xi Jinping since the 18th National Congress of the CPC in 2012.','/biZIiyXGYoPNfDo4gspp1dmlTK8.jpg','2018-03-02',90,'Released',NULL,'Amazing China',508685,0.7048,3.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45297,_binary '\0','/JTyAdmSGcgyThVgP5ZgQSgNOpw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8081566',7.1,1861,'ml','വിജയ് സൂപ്പറും പൗര്‍ണമിയും','Vijay and Pournami are two very different sort of people who first meet because of a misunderstanding. Vijay is a lazy engineering graduate unwilling to follow his passions and Pournami is an unlucky bold girl who doesn\'t give up on her dreams. They don\'t seem to find a lot of things in common at first; but as time passes more avenues open up for them to collaborate and learn from each other.','/mYa8IO5GhWy3Lx0gDqUI2XNGpBP.jpg','2019-01-11',135,'Released',NULL,'Vijay Superum Pournamiyum',573409,1.4557,6.711,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45298,_binary '\0','/tdINmzvmq0en7FprqiE3STwM9hQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8083606',6.3,1784,'fr','Rebelles','Sandra, a young woman forced to leave the south of France to flee a violent husband. Without attachment, she returned to Boulogne-sur-Mer, the city of her childhood which she left almost 15 years ago. She finds her mother there and a world she left behind. Without money, she is hired in a fish cannery where she befriends two workers. But one day, one of her colleagues tackles her insistently, she defends herself and kills him accidentally.','/gqzP89ceaMH12yczBNeVUDckuMA.jpg','2019-01-17',87,'Released',NULL,'Rebels',569814,1.4802,6.1,'tFZ82CyqCgA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45299,_binary '\0','/zbPVujc7qIEqpqkG70t2NpNvHOa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8085790',5.6,16274,'en','Little','Jordan Sanders, a take-no-prisoners tech mogul, wakes up one morning in the body of her 13-year-old self right before a do-or-die presentation. Her beleaguered assistant April is the only one in on the secret that her daily tormentor is now trapped in an awkward tween body, just as everything is on the line.','/4MDB6jJl3U7xK1Gw64zIqt9pQA4.jpg','2019-04-04',108,'Released','She woke up like this.','Little',526050,4.0674,6.827,'Qz65no3WnJk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45300,_binary '\0','/rQd4u6JzhxmlmTHBwFELDUTEdFi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8088944',6.6,4082,'ko','반드시 잡는다','After people in his town start turning up dead, a grumpy landlord is visited by a man who recounts an unsolved serial murder case from 30 years ago that may hold the clue to what is happening now.','/dZPJ0b73HhbwMzeyucC56HUOOXh.jpg','2017-11-29',110,'Released','There is a serial killer in our town.','The Chase',488621,2.6245,6.67,'o78FMnJXx7Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45301,_binary '\0','/t0cz6pkGO14e1YwjhjfaOwYy6WG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8090564',6,2593,'en','Monsoon','Kit can’t remember much of his native Vietnam. When he returns to the Land of the Golden Star for the first time in over thirty years, he takes in his local surroundings as any Western tourist would, and the environment is as exotic as the language is incomprehensible. The aim of Kit’s travels – to find a place to scatter his parents’ ashes – thus becomes part of a journey back to his roots and to the discovery of his identity, which external circumstances have rendered ambiguous and complex.','/xIKVeH1iAKJOYYh9lvObD3hYIaf.jpg','2020-09-25',85,'Released',NULL,'Monsoon',605499,1.3986,5.4,'wiKxgGAYU40','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45302,_binary '\0','/vGF9gP0QAFcragfgVtEgtfFfP71.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8090580',7.1,6922,'tr','Nuh Tepesi','Suffering through a mid-life crisis, Omer has to face the angry villagers in order to realize his estranged father\'s dying wish to be buried under the enshrined Noah Tree which his father claims to have planted half a century ago.','/scgsQaX00oYtKQH4FrnnP5kvImk.jpg','2019-09-29',109,'Released',NULL,'Noah Land',588154,0.9396,6.988,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45303,_binary '\0','/Amvdexp1W0uqqSEkWlYjM9nDJfa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8091892',8,4411,'ja','劇場版「Fate/stay night [Heaven’s Feel]」Ⅱ.lost butterfly','Shirou has lost his Servant, Saber, and is no longer a Master in the Holy Grail War. Despite this, he refuses to leave the battle, determined to protect Sakura. Meanwhile, a mysterious shadow engulfs the city, killing Masters and Servants one by one. As Shirou faces new dangers, Sakura is drawn deeper into her own destiny as a mage.','/4tS0iyKQBDFqVpVcH21MSJwXZdq.jpg','2019-01-12',117,'Released',NULL,'Fate/stay night: Heaven\'s Feel II. Lost Butterfly',390634,5.1959,7.1,'EPCIcwMZ9dg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45304,_binary '\0','/tLfQZkB4yBlO1h5WMIFLJgHYcZD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8092118',8,3859,'ja','劇場版「Fate/stay night [Heaven’s Feel]」Ⅲ.spring song','The battle rages on as Shirou continues to protect Sakura, now consumed by the darkness. He joins forces with Rin to end the Holy Grail War, while Illyasviel, who knows the truth behind it, confronts her fate. Amidst the chaos, Zouken plots to manipulate Sakura for his own desires. The final fight begins.','/hIK5kEdFwOHnHTa06ntTVSfG9im.jpg','2020-08-15',120,'Released','We fight to end this fate.','Fate/stay night: Heaven\'s Feel III. Spring Song',390635,4.4785,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45305,_binary '\0','/dw9KDRImNzj3jWYSkTte7wvzamO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8092252',7.7,8590,'ko','지금 만나러 갑니다','Along with his young son, Ji-ho, Woo-jin misses his wife Soo-a, who died after promising to return a year later with the rainy season. Miraculously, they reunite with Soo-a when the rainy season comes around, but she has no memory of her husband and son whom she dearly loved.','/mvstNgM68EyCRWwpArakLhWvvtk.jpg','2018-03-14',132,'Released','A miracle that came with the rain.','Be With You',499028,3.9253,8.134,'s_GBy9vx2PQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45306,_binary '\0','/o15IDkl0D1HgOcjPXwSMG0TrmgP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8092888',7.1,2837,'en','Roll Red Roll','At a 2012 pre-season high-school football party in Steubenville, Ohio, a young woman was raped by members of the beloved high school football team. The aftermath exposed an entire culture of complicity—and Roll Red Roll maps out the roles that peer pressure, denial, sports machismo, and social media each played in the tragedy.','/o5H3Z1DKNQv7uNXRQsBxxldwB2v.jpg','2019-03-22',80,'Released','When social media, “boy will be boys,” and vigilante justice collide, Steubenville, Ohio will never be the same.','Roll Red Roll',509904,1.2107,6.9,'5v1iUSyViyo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45307,_binary '\0','/dOtH7s8gIP6lt3WfeK4ws8udI3E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8093700',6.9,84300,'en','The Woman King','The story of the Agojie, the all-female unit of warriors who protected the African Kingdom of Dahomey in the 1800s with skills and a fierceness unlike anything the world has ever seen, and General Nanisca as she trains the next generation of recruits and readies them for battle against an enemy determined to destroy their way of life.','/438QXt1E3WJWb3PqNniK0tAE5c1.jpg','2022-09-16',135,'Released','Her reign begins.','The Woman King',724495,13.3539,7.555,'3RDaPV_rJ1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45308,_binary '\0','/sd8gzwYSs7Tq8AWWeFgtsz6PTkc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8093952',6.5,1949,'te','పడి పడి లేచె మనసు','A young couple navigates through the highs and lows of a budding relationship.','/r9A3wnHgt9iIOZLGKuitvK9Mevh.jpg','2018-12-21',160,'Released',NULL,'Padi Padi Leche Manasu',566139,1.2199,6.26,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45309,_binary '\0','/yAP4Cjg6kUEaGF2JWBMImEy1jSE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8094252',5.7,5888,'ta','என்ஜிகே','An educated do-gooder is forced to enter politics in order to serve the society. But, will the old guard make way and allow him to do that?','/1gp5SMTcs8KSF2fnv0RBZBRcydL.jpg','2019-05-31',148,'Released','The Rebel','NGK',532869,1.4931,4.861,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45310,_binary '\0','/f1k5jMK6QQ46E4jlwENmEBPf3Hk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8095860',7.2,8988,'fr','Grâce à Dieu','Alexandre, a man in his 40s living in Lyon with his wife and children, discovers that the priest who abused him decades ago continues to work with children. He joins forces with others victims of the priest, to bring justice and “lift the burden of silence” about what they endured.','/qbwcnAdBkfGBIbQ1xdQZtiUg2lf.jpg','2019-02-20',137,'Released',NULL,'By the Grace of God',509364,4.5177,7.146,'qFXLmhbJfXw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45311,_binary '\0','/nHNNKoqQOIWODk5mMyW8CvDisem.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8096832',6.2,26902,'en','Lady and the Tramp','The love story between a pampered Cocker Spaniel named Lady and a streetwise mongrel named Tramp. Lady finds herself out on the street after her owners have a baby and is saved from a pack by Tramp, who tries to show her to live her life footloose and collar-free.','/8wBEye516IKul9sW7JKGcFXVGfV.jpg','2019-11-12',101,'Released','Be loyal. Be brave. Be loved.','Lady and the Tramp',512895,10.5412,7.2,'t6zCp8wIbKs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45312,_binary '\0','/tIw0BWPKJSfkEHcj2tT3EIQNwXx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8096846',6.7,1573,'hu','Műanyag égbolt','2123. Faced with diminishing resources, the human race can only survive through a trade-off: at the age of 50, every citizen is gradually turned into a tree. When Stefan discovers that his beloved wife Nora has voluntarily signed up for donating her own body before her time, he sets out on an adventurous journey to save her at all costs.','/qLQh0vlLZSR5VmFlO3AIuuaekei.jpg','2023-03-30',112,'Released',NULL,'White Plastic Sky',587384,2.7609,6.797,'F5XeXNFNHQA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45313,_binary '\0','/fOy2Jurz9k6RnJnMUMRDAgBwru2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8097030',6.9,177100,'en','Turning Red','Thirteen-year-old Mei is experiencing the awkwardness of being a teenager with a twist – when she gets too excited, she transforms into a giant red panda.','/qsdjk9oAKSQMWs0Vt5Pyfh6O4GZ.jpg','2022-03-10',100,'Released','Growing up is a beast.','Turning Red',508947,25.6705,7.328,'XdKzUbAiswE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45314,_binary '\0','/hCK1V5CNXS9wukjkBfKbZ8ghDtL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8097306',5,8662,'en','Nobody\'s Fool','After serving five years in prison, wild child Tanya looks to her buttoned-up, by-the-book sister Danica to help her get back on her feet. The feisty ex-con becomes suspicious and concerned when Danica tells her that she\'s in a long-distance, online relationship with a mysterious man she\'s never seen. As the polar opposites start to collide, Tanya soon discovers that her sibling\'s picture-perfect life may not be what it seems.','/2VTHRTwLlnFDlNUxc8MEeFwCQTm.jpg','2018-10-31',110,'Released','She shows up. Everything blows up.','Nobody\'s Fool',514619,5.4395,6.1,'MsFbMw9LO5M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45315,_binary '\0','/nH7zQgfQLwkXGapctutLRZ2dEJM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8098480',2.8,2541,'en','The Refuge','A getaway driver finds himself in harm\'s way when he gets caught up in a job involving casino heist money leading to a debt over his head.','/hxrEwGFl38i0ItlBMFo9VpcFRKg.jpg','2019-07-27',98,'Released',NULL,'The Refuge',641852,0.8934,2.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45316,_binary '\0','/anb6GDkC5dOnBDkGehxZdPdUrfr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8098546',6.7,1677,'ja','映画ドラえもん のび太の宝島','Upon hearing about the story of Treasure Island, Nobita dreams of discovering and exploring his own treasure island, despite the fact all of the Earth has been mapped already.','/t1YkpYAxzD1lxNbjoZBpvYWkucO.jpg','2018-03-03',108,'Released','A magical adventure in treasure island.','Doraemon: Nobita\'s Treasure Island',495925,5.1543,7,'ZwzHBOeM4KM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45317,_binary '\0','/51GkNZXh2Rfoml75XIcfgFjnDP5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8098548',5.7,1455,'fr','Larguées','Françoise has just been dumped by her husband for a much younger woman. In order to cheer her up, and to celebrate her 60th birthday, sisters Rose and Alice decide to take their mother to a resort on the tropical island of Reunion so they can relax, work on their tans, and have too many margaritas. But when Rose pays a one-night stand, Thierry, to show her mother a good time, their holiday plans start to unravel.','/aN5kxWVoYsWemJLm7VroXsOFXQM.jpg','2018-04-18',95,'Released',NULL,'Dumped',490445,1.5575,6,'vsw7n4u7gIs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45318,_binary '\0','/mhhzbMnIIdVFOeBzKtLXk66Vbo3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8099236',8,2547,'es','El silencio de otros','The story of the tortuous struggle against the silence of the victims of the dictatorship imposed by General Franco after the victory of the rebel side in the Spanish Civil War (1936-1975). In a democratic country, but still ideologically divided, the survivors seek justice as they organize the so-called “Argentinian lawsuit” and denounce the legally sanctioned pact of oblivion that intends to hide the crimes they were subjects of.','/1mokbbJue9a60PJy1r1lyra8RjD.jpg','2019-01-25',95,'Released','Can democracy be built on forgetting?','The Silence of Others',500850,1.8199,8,'UHNEtSJIep0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45319,_binary '\0','/8ngU7WVjQbzWwxQktii0TlIndB6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8102806',5.5,3881,'fa','آن شب','An Iranian couple living in the US become trapped inside a hotel when insidious events force them to face the secrets that have come between them, in a night that never ends.','/vHoeIopknC6fCUTJfagDGwr6qmf.jpg','2021-04-29',105,'Released','It never ends.','The Night',746781,2.3622,5.6,'F2vsYt_41Co','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45320,_binary '\0','/61KVIvgXNBkdUxpZD9KPwLzmFGP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8103160',5.6,2661,'sv','Britt-Marie var här','Britt-Marie, a woman in her sixties, decides to leave her husband and start anew. Having been a housewife for most of her life and living in the small backwater town of Borg with few jobs available, she soon finds herself fending a youth football team.','/u12KThfDZpBGQ98Qg7ahWvMV9gq.jpg','2019-01-25',98,'Released','It\'s never too late to start living.','Britt-Marie Was Here',554993,0.3053,5.2,'GD4rT3GDlEI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45321,_binary '\0','/yYEOYzgqPB31mkSsuPdCvXH3zHv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8105234',6.8,21862,'en','Flamin\' Hot','The inspiring true story of Richard Montañez, the Frito Lay janitor who channeled his Mexican American heritage and upbringing to turn the iconic Flamin\' Hot Cheetos into a snack that disrupted the food industry and became a global pop culture phenomenon.','/a7KyFMPXj0iY4EoLq1PIGU1WJPw.jpg','2023-03-11',99,'Released','The flavor you know. The story you don\'t.','Flamin\' Hot',626332,10.0231,7.966,'it7sNRloq-A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45322,_binary '\0','/qZNqjsuBgPlXrLk8giFahZagiNh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8106160',6.1,13053,'en','The American Meme','Paris Hilton, the Fat Jew, and Brittany Furlan have all used social media to achieve massive internet fame. But, American Meme explores, is it worth it?','/xibKd8E4WefIqnwujHCJxd3sWBC.jpg','2018-12-07',98,'Released',NULL,'The American Meme',520370,1.2512,5.7,'ms8OdjWJRPY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45323,_binary '\0','/eFw5YSorHidsajLTayo1noueIxI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8106534',6.1,213619,'en','6 Underground','After faking his death, a tech billionaire recruits a team of international operatives for a bold and bloody mission to take down a brutal dictator.','/lnWkyG3LLgbbrIEeyl5mK5VRFe4.jpg','2019-12-10',128,'Released','They say no one can save the world. Meet no one.','6 Underground',509967,14.0027,6.328,'2elnByQVXbg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45324,_binary '\0','/rkPt59lEJyFnMpkmLUH2UAOdJvq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8106568',8.1,1543,'en','Momentum Generation','In the 1990s, a motley band of teen surfers from the north shore of Oahu brought professional surfing to new heights. But as their stars rose, the competition threatened to tear their group apart.','/i9WuKrDlGi4ajvwLZycDZUhVS9S.jpg','2018-04-21',104,'Released',NULL,'Momentum Generation',511548,1.3326,6.9,'rNxI2UPwNh0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45325,_binary '\0','/wfsHBnDsQyqoaFsIoV1f9J784pm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8106570',6.3,2906,'en','The Rachel Divide','Rachel Dolezal became infamous when she was unmasked as a white woman passing for black so thoroughly that she had become the head of her local N.A.A.C.P. chapter. This portrait cuts through the very public controversy to reveal Dolezal’s motivations.','/v52G1noifAdgXHQRR06k9U1pu2R.jpg','2018-04-23',104,'Released','Who does she think she is?','The Rachel Divide',510073,0.6989,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45326,_binary '\0','/nAPl2KIJQIAShcwMQA8tpFleGwa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8106576',7.6,3309,'en','The Bleeding Edge','Each year in the United States, unparalleled innovations in medical diagnostics, treatment, and technology hit the market. But when the same devices designed to save patients end up harming them, who is accountable?','/weWAoaNOWi5VBnnGF5wEDI14LYi.jpg','2018-07-27',99,'Released','What You Don\'t Know Can Hurt You','The Bleeding Edge',511815,1.2803,6.8,'slmilObZl28','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45327,_binary '\0','/6GmJOdbZcObC3EY0UVyBIaMJQtP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8107464',4.1,1464,'te','అమర్ అక్బర్ ఆంటోని','A man with dissociative identity disorder takes revenge on four businessmen for the murder of his family.','/tJz3TAyaFgG06rgusz7WtSwOhrH.jpg','2018-10-26',153,'Released',NULL,'Amar Akbar Anthony',535169,1.2774,4.294,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45328,_binary '\0','/1eMOFu5v9Ho8YQBr8pd0Yzz4OL2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8108034',6.2,3808,'ta','நோட்டா','Sitting Chief Minister Vinodhan, who is facing imprisonment in an illegal assets case, makes his son, Varun the temporary CM until his return. The disinterested young man gradually wakes up to the sorry state of affairs and tries to bring in a change.','/gjmtKSwVTCwhp00Rxg58VauqKG0.jpg','2018-10-05',146,'Released',NULL,'Nota',512534,1.8565,5.613,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45329,_binary '\0','/rSnxS2TGIFGomQ0H9Ji6LVRF0mw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8108164',5.6,5120,'hi','एक लड़की को देखा तोह ऐसा लगा','Sweety has to contend with her over-enthusiastic family that wants her to get married but the ultimate truth is that her love might not find acceptance in her family and society.','/uYevwq0VLai27AvODudalXzE6HM.jpg','2019-02-01',121,'Released','The most unexpected romance of the year','Ek Ladki Ko Dekha Toh Aisa Laga',533148,1.7134,5.554,'pKcamCgBvMo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45330,_binary '\0','/pf5X1OnFWNcqgxpFD2NP095H8g5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8108186',5.5,2697,'kn','ಕೋಟಿಗೊಬ್ಬ-3','Sathya, a philanthropist who now runs an orphanage, has to go to Poland for the treatment of young Janu. While there, an international criminal named Ghost carries out heists. Who is Ghost? And what has Sathya got to do with it all?','/sm1fiwP8ecOIyB5nO5Dc9l7DGd4.jpg','2021-10-14',140,'Released',NULL,'Kotigobba 3',678470,0.9563,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45331,_binary '\0','/lGdeKyHke7PUFaXenNvR4dwlK8P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8108196',5.9,7250,'hi','जजमेंटल है क्या','When Bobby meets her new tenants, a young married couple, their perfectly normal life leaves her really curious. But then a murder takes place and Bobby suspects Keshav has a role to play in the crime.','/eXyTnYhWLjXEggUTOoFqZRCteml.jpg','2019-07-26',153,'Released',NULL,'Judgementall Hai Kya',551688,1.4318,5.5,'LnnUBVe7dFk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45332,_binary '\0','/73aKTjdQ46jpv3InqNVnV76Nl0K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8108198',8.2,118210,'hi','अंधाधुन','A series of mysterious events changes the life of a blind pianist who now must report a crime that was actually never witnessed by him.','/dy3K6hNvwE05siGgiLJcEiwgpdO.jpg','2018-10-05',139,'Released','Every artist has a secret.','Andhadhun',534780,3.7736,7.595,'2iVYI99VGaw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45333,_binary '\0','/fVxbEDd7ci0TE4ljsK13oyNUeW7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8108200',7.9,13701,'hi','सोनचिरिया','A legion of warring bandits terrorizes India\'s Chambal Valley.','/7ygikeDbneOlUFI