 web series travels to an abandoned asylum for a live broadcast, but they encounter much more than expected as they move deeper inside the nightmarish old building.','/fNqlsmu2tiI1bXcpU31yjHPkiJz.jpg','2018-03-28',95,'Released','Experience the horror.','Gonjiam: Haunted Asylum',508642,10.4915,7.246,'BQAt3VAKCfM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45358,_binary '\0','/14EFt5tXRsg2VGuPBjrPflWrXF3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8119844',6,1316,'ko','뺑반','Min-jae, a rookie police officer with a natural born talent for driving, is assigned to the perfect team: the Hit-and-Run Squad. But at the same time, for police detective Si-yeon, it is a place she is unjustly demoted to for doing her job. The two team up to arrest the rich and powerful speed maniac Jae-chul who is suspected of committing crimes for his obsession for speed.','/jGMkLo7FDgQikYwFJSlbc49ewVU.jpg','2019-01-30',133,'Released','A chase between a rookie police officer against a rich and powerful speed maniac.','Hit-and-Run Squad',568320,2.6102,7.134,'ZX4L9VOUIQU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45359,_binary '\0','/bDpMfZ6wf4bBYr0btnCwgeFCVPr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8122018',6.4,2126,'en','Happy New Year, Colin Burstead','Colin has rented a stately country home for his extended family’s New Year celebrations. He’s the centre of attention until his estranged brother David unexpectedly arrives, throwing the family dynamic far off orbit.','/l1RtxOgL3AKb6NY61nWlewmyqpP.jpg','2018-10-11',95,'Released','Party. With family.','Happy New Year, Colin Burstead',497863,1.9143,6.4,'NddnV45hnzY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45360,_binary '\0','/6sRfXsdpQACyd5Gsi4YdvRVvXvz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8123618',6.4,1615,'ko','나를 찾아줘','Jung-yeon receives a tip-off that her son who went missing six years ago is in a fishing village. Local officers get in her way, trying to cover up a secret that might be related to her case.','/vwuyP02WDpJrWNvkNl8UgdDsjfp.jpg','2019-11-27',108,'Released','A search that knows no limits.','Bring Me Home',507773,2.8373,6.721,'g-IiNZSMeT0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45361,_binary '\0','/wwfnykSPnFGs5SusrbQAI27H54.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8125842',7,1287,'no','Blindsone','Blind Spot is a story about the grey zones in mental illness; the blind spots hard to discover, as experienced by a mother realizing her daughter struggling with far worse issues than she realized.','/9XGbCmZQp8lnmkOgBoBgG2n9xM7.jpg','2018-08-24',98,'Released',NULL,'Blind Spot',542038,1.2573,7.3,'pv2p5HFq-mE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45362,_binary '\0','/fj6ssdXesl2rsEKshTnNOG1XTBY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8126390',6.5,2253,'en','The Most Unknown','An epic documentary film that sends nine scientists to extraordinary parts of the world to uncover unexpected answers to some of humanity’s biggest questions. How did life begin? What is time? What is consciousness? How much do we really know? By introducing researchers from diverse backgrounds for the first time, then dropping them into new, immersive field work they previously hadn’t tackled, the film pushes the boundaries of how science storytelling is approached. What emerges is a deeply human trip to the foundations of discovery and a powerful reminder that the unanswered questions are the most crucial ones to pose. Directed by Emmy-nominated and Peabody Award-winning filmmaker Ian Cheney and advised by world-renowned filmmaker Werner Herzog, The Most Unknown is an ambitious look at a side of science never before shown on screen.','/kTzgxB70rE21XKCBIBTvhg9wHVG.jpg','2018-03-16',92,'Released',NULL,'The Most Unknown',519672,1.2283,6.6,'VtUaZk3_Njk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45363,_binary '\0','/8S2tdATwEksYUxWCmsQsKfkIXrw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8128188',6.2,9751,'en','High Flying Bird','When an NBA lockout sidelines his big rookie client, an agent hatches a bold plan to save their careers -- and disrupt the league\'s power structure.','/ccE21xixa1zhkGtWDr4n8ReOp40.jpg','2019-01-27',90,'Released','Play the game on top of the game.','High Flying Bird',510498,3.2628,5.7,'0iL1K_l8Jyo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45364,_binary '\0','/wArldRKTKmy7rhHe95SzQ6Ale9X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8128276',6,5025,'en','Ted K','An exploration of Ted Kaczynski\'s life in Lincoln, Montana in the years leading up to his arrest as The Unabomber.','/wv9VeqVU4FXnG02mHXT2Vz43bQ7.jpg','2021-10-29',120,'Released','In the woods no one can hear you think.','Ted K',660353,3.8662,6,'qKxmdETbxT8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45365,_binary '\0','/4pPReWGKlZE0yDsLOQ34WKyySZK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8129682',3.6,1425,'en','Phobias','Five dangerous patients, suffering from extreme phobias at a government testing facility, are put to the ultimate test under the supervision of a crazed doctor and his quest to weaponize fear.','/zpecci4IooFiwMVGknhm8Jz2FHo.jpg','2021-02-28',86,'Released','What do you fear?','Phobias',793967,1.5195,4.6,'cfXwf-Ibh7I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45366,_binary '\0','/fqb1odEjdxDrwicf6DZVCKZvrAr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8129794',6.3,7814,'de','100 Dinge','Best friends Toni and Paul decide to relinquish all of their belongings for 100 days, whereby they receive one of their items back on each day. During this challenge the two realize, that the only thing they cannot be without is their friendship. A story about contemporary materialism and the quest for the truly important things in life.','/yTfpEmMitPaOOmzRZ3NGvLhamz6.jpg','2018-12-06',111,'Released',NULL,'100 Things',546630,2.6405,6.558,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45367,_binary '\0','/7SGsNmrdb6hLQujKpvuBUrkKmcv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8129806',7.1,19702,'en','To Leslie','A West Texas single mother wins the lottery and squanders it just as fast, leaving behind a world of heartbreak. Years later, with her charm running out and nowhere to go, she fights to rebuild her life and find redemption.','/bFTgfsw4cnNjIZZ2r6P363X2Uk3.jpg','2022-10-07',119,'Released',NULL,'To Leslie',823147,4.5461,7,'D_k63vvm3mU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45368,_binary '\0','/qhRQLTYnGWvI4nYE05DaDjgvCna.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8130518',3.8,4704,'en','Dark Cloud','Following the aftermath of a horrific accident, a woman is voluntarily subjected to artificial intelligence for rehabilitation.','/q1ngkvPCnOYKeyNZjg8QqvaSnuZ.jpg','2022-05-09',81,'Released',NULL,'Dark Cloud',897424,2.396,5.6,'b9bkDPjEcbU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45369,_binary '\0','/4BgeG9jKpSg9hawTZoW8SgpW3lA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8130558',5.1,2794,'hi','One Day: Justice Delivered','A Crime Branch Special Officer Investigates serial disappearances of high profile individuals in a state capital.','/uwIQWPYjk6d742sF4a2T3nkLRQP.jpg','2019-07-05',124,'Released','Every Crime Reveals a Story','One Day: Justice Delivered',613225,1.5629,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45370,_binary '\0','/4gl4fYApxmGHzBwKytQVn6vUU3p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8130904',5.4,5193,'hi','The Body','When the body of a powerful businesswoman goes missing from the morgue, the inspector-in-charge hunts for the truth. When he questions her husband he realizes that there is much more to the case than meets the eye.','/ceEmtlyvbJh1khLpSkPUKAmpPA7.jpg','2019-12-13',101,'Released','Death is the ultimate adventure','The Body',648316,1.2559,5.625,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45371,_binary '\0','/8VshatSiYQX2YGKgSEcbdNFgi0u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8130968',7.8,35280,'hi','बदला','A dynamic young entrepreneur finds herself locked in a hotel room with the corpse of her dead lover. She hires a prestigious lawyer to defend her and they work together to figure out what actually happened.','/eKpzbERuhogYTwI3PwfVsAHXnuO.jpg','2019-03-08',120,'Released',NULL,'Badla',581361,2.4769,7.3,'mSlgu8AQAd4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45372,_binary '\0','/imRVEUDwJdISrfckUllkBQHUkc8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8132700',6.5,11259,'en','Behind the Curve','Meet the growing, worldwide community of theorists who defend the belief that the Earth is flat while living in a society who vehemently rejects it.','/mOJrtSMmUpfFytvxlUEA8hej2At.jpg','2018-04-30',96,'Released','See the world in a whole new shape.','Behind the Curve',520777,2.8762,6.276,'Gnsm81gjo1E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45373,_binary '\0','/9ZLij77nEFCQt84LMkdU6Zc0PYV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8132778',6.5,3133,'fr','La Nuit des rois','A young man is sent to \"La Maca,\" a prison in the middle of the Ivorian forest ruled by its inmates. As tradition goes with the rising of the red moon, he is designated by the Boss to be the new \"Roman\" and must tell a story to the other prisoners. Learning what fate awaits him, he begins to narrate the mystical life of the legendary outlaw named \"Zama King\" and has no choice but to make his story last until dawn.','/lkY6Agn4sucxm2VHrPBk7pQah7m.jpg','2021-02-26',93,'Released','A film about resistance and the power of words in the face of violence.','Night of the Kings',660958,2.6261,6.6,'qeoFQZ6wB8c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45374,_binary '\0','/xqdoDeulDTydU8AF2bLLnZXiZVT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8134742',5.4,20540,'en','3 from Hell','After barely surviving a furious shootout with the police, Baby Firefly, Otis Driftwood and Captain Spaulding are behind bars. But pure evil cannot be contained. Teaming up with Otis’ half-brother Winslow, the demented Firefly clan escape to unleash a whole new wave of murder, madness and mayhem.','/iaURDnsqwTpFdg7RuizUp0nI2I4.jpg','2019-09-16',115,'Released','Murder... Madness... Mayhem.','3 from Hell',489064,5.4257,5.76,'D6zl2hFv1Ig','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45375,_binary '\0','/3u1WbypkQqKQIiozOGIFXBAT5W3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8135494',7.7,8038,'en','Active Measures','Russian president Vladimir Putin attacks the 2016 American Presidential Election in collaboration with The Trump Campaign.','/9Gcf92UWd5k6e0W1K6fTi3x1exV.jpg','2018-08-31',112,'Released',NULL,'Active Measures',521862,1.1958,7.3,'o1srI4FP_VY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45376,_binary '\0','/xwnkTKBREfsU8O2fHNFV5X1SBfU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8135550',6.3,1430,'tr','Görülmüştür','In the heart of Istanbul\'s prison, Zakir controls the letters prisoners receive. His average day is spent between the censorship office, his colleagues and his evening writing class. For a writing assignment, he steals a photo from one of the letters, in which appears Selma, an inmate\'s wife. More than an inspiration, she becomes an obsession for Zakir. He observes her, makes up stories, and imagines the worst to the extent that he puts himself at great risk.','/5hatJuGsPlWTlVdxafdvY7GSwjL.jpg','2019-09-20',96,'Released',NULL,'Passed by Censor',567940,0.8973,6.2,'X-cYFAJClSg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45377,_binary '\0','/cDWqocfBoa65d5WXmQ5kGSgx8iG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8139850',7,1384,'en','Mercury 13','After rigorous testing in 1961, a small group of skilled female pilots are asked to step aside when only men are selected for spaceflight.','/cIH8lHaNRGjSLXlkOzyp1MkE0yk.jpg','2018-04-08',79,'Released','Meet the women who dared to reach for the stars.','Mercury 13',511791,0.8189,6.7,'jpiVx2mQhKI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45378,_binary '\0','/jnrv9y9CQEtcyoftIHN4WNLrxtb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8142672',6.1,2057,'ml','ആട് 3 Part 1','Shaji Pappan and Co. opens a Pandora\'s box of reincarnations and multiple timelines leading to comic chaos of epic proportions.','/3yqreNY1f4iOXX0vBAqY64ZvxiV.jpg','2026-03-19',162,'Released','One Last Ride','Aadu 3 Part 1',1260210,1.6688,6.6,'DQfmKXQqVD0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45379,_binary '\0','/llMc0bO5G8jpkMqqcLNy7Y8LYBf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8143990',6.4,24271,'en','Kajillionaire','Two con artists have spent 26 years training their only daughter to swindle, scam and steal at every turn. During a desperate and hastily conceived heist, they charm a stranger into joining them, only to have their entire world turned upside down.','/fkqJJDb4u9rEyJu8Jm8H1P2mux4.jpg','2020-09-25',105,'Released','Know your worth.','Kajillionaire',541305,4.956,6.275,'NpsnidIR5g8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45380,_binary '\0','/jQYOvDJfEQcaoWwyqOuNheaNZRh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8144778',7.2,1438,'en','The Redeemed and the Dominant: Fittest on Earth','In 2017, the fittest athletes on Earth took on the unknown and unknowable during four of the most intense days of competition in CrossFit Games history. \"The Redeemed and the Dominant: Fittest on Earth\" captures all the drama as the top athletes resembling chiseled Grecian gods descend on Madison, Wisconsin, to face a series of trials. Hercules faced 12; they take on 13. Emotions run high as a throng of Australian athletes rise to the top. By the end of the competition, some learn tough lessons - that all that glitters isn\'t gold, or even bronze - and some learn that they\'re even stronger than they realized. The best among them enter the pantheon of the CrossFit giants and earn the right to call themselves the \"Fittest on Earth\"','/q5nb9yzVYgE9LO9FfMiaj70Uvra.jpg','2018-03-23',119,'Released',NULL,'The Redeemed and the Dominant: Fittest on Earth',504769,1.0125,7.1,'8QeUid89vKw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45381,_binary '\0','/idHYrf8r4a8tX9PCwbsuOFSrKc0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8144834',8.1,21778,'hi','Section 375','A filmmaker stands trial when a costume assistant on his movie accuses him of rape.','/x7rVZ0KiPWxBMJBI8roIwlMvs2c.jpg','2019-09-13',124,'Released',NULL,'Section 375',507941,1.5261,7.5,'UWjxS8EJ4Z8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45382,_binary '\0','/dZnielh8Oi3pxoR4iiMay2UcjOV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8145202',5.2,8028,'en','The F**k-It List','After a prank blows up a studious high school senior\'s life, he shares a list of certain things he wishes he\'d done differently — and maybe still can.','/rYUbFhuHc13cET2PSrevbVC92y8.jpg','2020-07-01',103,'Released','What\'s on your list?','The F**k-It List',598133,6.1552,6,'IaWDH-5aTHg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45383,_binary '\0','/q8jAxDl8PafvKBad0OWZjDZE8Hh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8148018',7.3,3213,'en','The Accountant of Auschwitz','Oskar Gröning, known as the \"Accountant of Auschwitz,\" was charged with the murder of 300,000 Jews. When he took the stand in 2015, at the age of 94, his trial made headlines worldwide.','/4uriaKkq1DgIZcBVRjJcU1xqs7Z.jpg','2018-04-29',78,'Released',NULL,'The Accountant of Auschwitz',520789,1.6708,6.9,'GzwDqFPRSLo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45384,_binary '\0','/rCzYrGstiybMwDPcZlePAN7IWBh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8150814',4.9,23095,'en','There\'s Someone Inside Your House','As the countdown to graduation begins, students at Osborne High are being stalked by a maniac intent on exposing their darkest secrets to the entire town, terrorizing victims while wearing a life-like mask of their own face. With a mysterious past of her own, Makani and her friends must discover the killer\'s identity before they become victims themselves.','/GaPJQscaH4MtYQTbJyWjCUIho8.jpg','2021-09-24',96,'Released','Everyone has a secret to die for.','There\'s Someone Inside Your House',512025,5.957,5.3,'IdZ43OuZXjQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45385,_binary '\0','/5n2jz145P1CRdPfA296MmEZF1sQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8151874',7.2,43334,'en','Honey Boy','The story of a child star attempting to mend his relationship with his law-breaking, alcohol-abusing father over the course of a decade, loosely based on Shia LaBeouf’s life.','/3BZ2rBn31kWER45ZMj7OTe9keMm.jpg','2019-11-07',94,'Released','sweet as honey.','Honey Boy',512263,5.1814,7,'5RR8WTQzwSk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45386,_binary '\0','/dz8gnU8GgTZUwoIfJqorOEXg8lq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8152324',3.6,2601,'en','Wolf','Great Britain. 150AD. When four messengers sent by Rome to a plague infected Caledonia, with a message of peace and help for their King, go missing Rome has no choice but to send ten of their finest across Hadrian\'s Wall to find and bring them back. Led by their Captain, Domitius, (George McCluskey, \"The Zombie King\"), and two of their strongest warriors, Grackus, (Stuart Brennan, \"Risen\") and Nerva, (Mark Paul Wake, \"Plan Z\"), the legion soon realise that what lays in wait for them is something much worse than any plague or army known to man - And with them being picked off one by one on their journey back to the wall by a beast none of them can match, and survival being their only hope, will there be anyone left to warn Rome of the dangers it may now face. Fight For Rome. Fight For Caesar. Fight To Survive.','/82z97hERTx2q6wtcFjLkxKF06p2.jpg','2019-09-13',85,'Released','Fight For Rome. Fight For Caesar. Fight To Survive.','Wolf',549773,1.5893,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45387,_binary '\0','/bdF98wEoQupFimI4bEIbfpVLKM1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8155182',5,6738,'en','Leprechaun Returns','A group of unwitting sorority sisters accidentally awaken the serial-killing Leprechaun after they build a sorority house on his hunting grounds.','/7kToQsV04Jel1ob7VJ471LDz7wD.jpg','2018-12-11',93,'Released','Be careful what you wish for.','Leprechaun Returns',518158,4.5135,6.129,'5PIZEWZvi-I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45388,_binary '\0','/bU1n7bkDviEqwfKFTbjQ8BFrqEN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8155288',6.2,97400,'en','Happy Death Day 2U','Collegian Tree Gelbman wakes up in horror to learn that she\'s stuck in a parallel universe. Her boyfriend Carter is now with someone else, and her friends and fellow students seem to be completely different versions of themselves. When Tree discovers that Carter\'s roommate has been altering time, she finds herself once again the target of a masked killer. When the psychopath starts to go after her inner circle, Tree soon realizes that she must die over and over again to save everyone.','/4tdnePOkOOzwuGPEOAHp8UA4vqx.jpg','2019-02-13',100,'Released','Death makes a killer comeback.','Happy Death Day 2U',512196,10.9332,6.318,'IeXqWDFJZiw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45389,_binary '\0','/nkkd41CGVfIVIE8NcejQdw2QerA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8157074',6.6,2309,'de','Traumfabrik','A romantic drama set in 1961 that follows a young studio extra\'s ambitious efforts to reunite with the French girl he loves after being separated by the construction of the Berlin Wall.','/ue4VNnCtOLw4PY235pvuC72yQ82.jpg','2019-07-04',125,'Released',NULL,'Dreamfactory',570292,2.9067,7.3,'wUonbkF9pGU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45390,_binary '\0','/90kZ8H7qScKHOzWTqWqYUGQfmxR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8160262',5.5,4267,'es','El hijo','Painter Lorenzo\'s life spirals out of control as he fears his wife is trying to isolate him from their infant son.','/c9uWvpFaYevIh3JJgTBi6PN9y2M.jpg','2019-05-02',92,'Released','Do you really know who is caring for your child?','The Son',600881,1.4511,5.4,'oWGTt9LybJA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45391,_binary '\0','/2Xh3Q0LLir3a2Ss0ASuEMgiz4Qv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8160834',5.5,14723,'en','Follow Me','A social media personality travels with his friends to Moscow to capture new content for his successful vlog. Always pushing the limits and catering to a 