ces, seeking revenge.','/nD9zK3nfEUPHKWwFmAaQoLsQYE5.jpg','2021-07-28',125,'Released',NULL,'Raging Fire',513692,6.3279,7.141,'_hL0sAde1DA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45396,_binary '\0','/9SoO0ip0hCgtiYFffxYDTE7xzXh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8168186',7,7397,'fr','Jonas','When Jonas was 14 he met the charismatic but mysterious Nathan. In addition to guiding him in grappling with his sexuality, Jonas soon confronts something dark and even dangerous about his new friend. Now an attractive, sexually assured adult, memories from this time still haunt Jonas.','/i7YGXKORcvY23mVw6ENjZayoBta.jpg','2018-09-13',82,'Released',NULL,'Boys',548537,2.9008,6.8,'HHigllswzSc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45397,_binary '\0','/7kqxdmohL27D086sSScv1htwmMp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8168992',4.5,1898,'en','Do Not Reply','Chelsea, a high school introvert, is abducted through a social media app and is forced to look like other girls Brad holds captive. Chelsea desperately attempts to persuade them to escape before they all become victims in his virtual reality filmed murders.','/ryHaa5HMMOzcDXM9nExW0puZwGN.jpg','2019-09-29',99,'Released','Delete your profile.','Do Not Reply',543412,1.8903,5.7,'Wdgd1CZ-2vc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45398,_binary '\0','/txfEqZ0eT5tcPcWnj1XJ6LLKoAZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8169446',5.5,24982,'en','Wine Country','A group of friends head to the land of oaky Chardonnays and big, bold Cabernet Sauvignons for one member of the squad’s 50th birthday party.','/mi5l29DQFdwrTXxbqM2OLbs830H.jpg','2019-05-08',103,'Released','Friendship is a trip','Wine Country',513083,4.6944,5.5,'aW_0MO-XKog','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45399,_binary '\0','/zN5eohKqT9Rww6m7PQOfyCXPi4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8169552',7.1,2787,'pt','Turma da Mônica: Laços','Fluffy, Jimmy Five\'s pet dog, vanished. He develops an infallible plan to rescue the little dog, but, he will need help from his faithful friends: Monica, Maggy and Smudge. Together, they will face challengers and live incredible adventures to get Fluffy back home.','/mZ9BeuuvvurtCcZpUtwmxUtNK0i.jpg','2019-06-27',97,'Released','An adventure as big as this friendship didn\'t fit only in the comics.','Monica and Friends: Bonds',459670,2.3877,7.7,'ykYlYRjSuMo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45400,_binary '\0','/mGkCPWqHAgRzDomRPKfZjh8wLIs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8170298',3.6,2667,'en','John Henry','Ex-gang member John Henry is a quiet man with a violent past. When two immigrant kids on the run from his former South Los Angeles gang leader stumble into his life, John is forced to reconcile with his past in order to try and give them a future.','/zwtOfT2hUs9TjqOnqj40JyJ71Ke.jpg','2020-01-24',91,'Released',NULL,'John Henry',658199,2.4451,5.2,'R_XQzV8Y798','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45401,_binary '\0','/j7tpKx3CxfNXkeix9LLDHSbEMdP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8170998',3.5,1257,'en','Miami Heat','Yuri, a retired special forces agent, is reluctantly forced into utilizing his old skills when his daughter, Julia, gets kidnapped by a human trafficking conglomerate just days before Christmas in Miami.','/kKFi6BPbXlhvsaywOWg0SvvaKR8.jpg','2021-11-05',85,'Released','They messed with the wrong man\'s daughter.','Miami Heat',896054,3.2705,2.8,'TFTvq_9_DrA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45402,_binary '\0','/yKVbRjnusjEs3jGBPBwgNH38Q1j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8171974',5.9,1437,'fr','La Lutte des classes','As everyone knows, children make no difference between social classes, skin colors or religions. But then why does Corentin, Paul and Sofia\'s nine-year-old son, only have friends like him at Bagnolet\'s school? And when his friends all leave for a private school in Paris, his parents are frightened. From now on, Corentin is the only one in his class. But the only what?','/mHIeGGpbSbtW2pVuap4vdewyhvQ.jpg','2019-04-03',103,'Released',NULL,'Battle of the Classes',570132,1.3754,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45403,_binary '\0','/u4CVC9VVpbfxxFqf8fcaPVegUmZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8173728',7.4,6285,'es','La casa lobo','After escaping from a religious colony in Chile, Maria seeks shelter in a mansion where she’s taken in by two pigs, its only inhabitants. Like in a stop-motion dream, the universe of the house reacts to her feelings. The animals slowly morph into humans and the house into a dark, menacing world.','/kvgch2e25cd6dWhRJ6G8BCJ1Wcq.jpg','2018-11-01',74,'Released','Once upon a time there was a country within a country from where nobody could escape.','The Wolf House',499537,2.6072,7.495,'EEc3R3Pn0FA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45404,_binary '\0','/wsoTfUGy539MtEtYLByjNtdalRx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8174412',6.2,4572,'en','Funny Pages','A teenage cartoonist rejects the comforts of his suburban life in a misguided quest for soul.','/gCgdVvExdHM9Qjtc8yoN7MRrC7x.jpg','2022-08-26',87,'Released','The story of New Jersey\'s next great comic book artist and biggest dick.','Funny Pages',583095,3.0246,5.7,'qXDeAcyt8Ng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45405,_binary '\0','/oggolZEniFfKSkbfR5pOHgexyLn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8176040',5.3,6368,'hi','पानीपट','During 18th century India, the Marathas emerged as the most powerful empire in the nation until the Afghan King Ahmad Shah Abdali plans to take over India. Sadashiv Rao Bhau is brought in to save the empire from the king which then leads to the third battle of Panipat.','/z59Vr7l2ZFQPh76ooSQdXjW3YRo.jpg','2019-12-06',171,'Released','The Great Betrayal','Panipat',577332,1.3764,6.1,'TmH_Owzki_I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45406,_binary '\0','/yt9LXuqEXgUooAaEplUNPw7wJsC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8176054',8.6,20743,'ta','பரியேறும் பெருமாள்','A law student from a lower caste begins a friendship with his classmate, a girl who belongs to a higher caste, and the men in her family start giving him trouble over this.','/78YoIO3gzkZPC1jotfDmolNDmgT.jpg','2018-09-28',155,'Released',NULL,'Pariyerum Perumal',462718,1.0751,8.2,'GMNsUxJe4R4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45407,_binary '\0','/iRB6VKJuFd88bk20hvLqlDzi4kP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8176578',6.6,9806,'zh','肆式青春','The rigorous city life of China, while bustling and unforgiving, contains the everlasting memories of days past. Three stories told in three different cities, follow the loss of youth and the daunting realization of adulthood. Though reality may seem ever changing, unchangeable are the short-lived moments of one\'s childhood days. A plentiful bowl of noodles, the beauty of family and the trials of first love endure the inevitable flow of time, as three different characters explore the strength of bonds and the warmth of cherished memories. Within the disorder of the present world, witness these quaint stories recognize the comfort of the past, and attempt to revive the neglected flavors of youth.','/ueHeH5ergeHx27L4SCI9qlmwczA.jpg','2018-08-04',74,'Released','Three different stories of youth set in different cities of China.','Flavors of Youth',513347,4.1171,6.9,'CKdOr976h3Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45408,_binary '\0','/rhklsYtIITDOdFSmhx2fIH9m9Vn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8178486',6,16514,'en','Earthquake Bird','Tokyo, Japan, 1989. Lucy Fly, a foreigner who works as a translator, begins a passionate relationship with Teiji, a mysterious man obsessed with photography.','/oyKnosHXQ7kkhlGwqsWOvn4RgKR.jpg','2019-11-01',107,'Released','Look beyond what you see','Earthquake Bird',513409,3.5435,5.918,'L50zp0Qu8yI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45409,_binary '\0','/i0Y0wP8H6SRgjr6QmuwbtQbS24D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8178634',7.8,227277,'te','రౌద్రం రణం రుధిరం','A fictional