comic Andrea Singer has stumbled upon the perfect guy. On paper, he checks all the boxes, but is he everything he appears to be?','/hkU2FQNWUEQFgLrDGrpZQ7Y17zx.jpg','2021-06-23',92,'Released','If he checks all your boxes, check again.','Good on Paper',823461,2.5025,5.6,'z_-_hIuE1YA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45452,_binary '\0','/6Rie2qP3R7DCnexj87XGaeCFb70.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8233874',6.4,12874,'en','Extra Ordinary','A driving instructor must use her other-worldly gifts to save a lonely man’s daughter from a rock star looking to use her for Satanic purposes.','/z3IRiGKXx2eMhxtV8GktKwvWkhm.jpg','2019-09-13',94,'Released','Putting the normal in paranormal.','Extra Ordinary',538227,3.1516,6.353,'x1TvL5ZL6Sc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45453,_binary '\0','/A2eSBZ1mMoOyfyCpIQ5NeCCGTtn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8234892',5.2,1251,'en','Knives and Skin','In the wake of a high school student\'s mysterious disappearance, a collective awakening seems to overcome the town\'s teenage girls, gathering in force until it can no longer be contained.','/u80rybIz75SZ862YcYU2ZRXGvFm.jpg','2019-11-20',111,'Released','Have you seen Carolyn Harper?','Knives and Skin',575730,1.4467,5.2,'OX2qohJ0BzA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45454,_binary '\0','/y97wn0oP8x2I4HwAVFTJqUVyPm8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8235296',1.6,2860,'en','The Trump Prophecy','The true story about fireman and public servant Mark Taylor who heard a special message from God about change in our nation. When Mary Colbert, a networker and connector of Christian ministries, heard Mark\'s message she felt called to start a national prayer movement which grew to thousands of people across our nation praying together for the leadership of America and a return to the Godly principles we were founded upon. The Trump Prophecy tells the story of Mark Taylor and Mary Colbert through the election of 2016 followed by a reflective time hearing from leaders in various sectors of faith, business, finance, military, and world affairs who respond with their perspective on what it takes to make America great again.','/nO7tl2spcOu7zKWIZTIN9rVHTAr.jpg','2018-10-02',120,'Released','One man\'s journey to find healing.','The Trump Prophecy',548887,0.9545,2.5,'eKZGIvLQD9I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45455,_binary '\0','/3uZeqHTS18d8huhgsV8Yn9ZQR7u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8235660',2.8,2940,'en','Megalodon','A military vessel on the search for an unidentified submersible finds themselves face to face with a giant shark, forced to use only what they have on board to defend themselves from the monstrous beast.','/hES2eVAbVt08JJTqgu3jmI34Yxx.jpg','2018-08-10',90,'Released','Danger Is Rising!','Megalodon',523931,3.2647,5.7,'MPr3BleeXC0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45456,_binary '\0','/fnTrZiCRXCk3I6mnYvJwiMZf6pF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8236336',7.2,57712,'en','The Report','The story of Daniel Jones, lead investigator for the US Senate’s sweeping study into the CIA\'s Detention and Interrogation Program, which was found to be brutal, immoral and ineffective. With the truth at stake, Jones battled tirelessly to make public what many in power sought to keep hidden.','/sG5NI6TMNR9ftOdTIXmG0hrBYSY.jpg','2019-09-12',119,'Released','Truth matters','The Report',524348,6.7861,7,'ul5GFfMAvtg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45457,_binary '\0','/y2WqsZYVI0yVdC0hgDmYvzfJzqr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8236366',4.9,3304,'en','The Shed','The story of Stan, an orphaned teenager stuck living with his abusive grandfather and tasked with routinely protecting his best friend from high school bullies. When Stan discovers a murderous creature has taken refuge inside the tool shed in his backyard, he tries to secretly battle the demon alone until his bullied friend discovers the creature and has a far more sinister plan in mind.','/aV9n5MyLZQsoXNfbZG5OOf16IkP.jpg','2019-10-25',98,'Released','Beware the evil within.','The Shed',551994,2.5422,5.9,'DisPpGUI1UM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45458,_binary '\0','/ai7xP2p2zYxLFmcLQJaDkEBgY7E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8237172',6.1,6290,'id','Gundala','Sancaka has lived on the streets since his parents left him. Living a hard life, Sancaka survives by thinking about his own safety. When the condition of the city gets worse and injustice rages throughout the country, Sancaka must decide whether he continues to live to look after himself or rise to become their oppressed hero.','/wZCo5qUz3IdIhs6466B9PpFglXU.jpg','2019-08-29',123,'Released','This nation needs a patriot.','Gundala',516700,1.7443,6.221,'8rauD1vxMCw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45459,_binary '\0','/cb3xdCXws4OLcXNNqQmZHDfAKCY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8237272',5.9,2833,'en','Marionette','A therapist loses her grip on reality when a ten-year-old boy claims he can control her future.','/wNNAGw2TsYW4c3if252c6Il1fEc.jpg','2020-09-28',108,'Released','Who is really pulling the strings?','Marionette',662659,1.6256,6.3,'nObwABpmHgI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45460,_binary '\0','/pFKUaIkbqu03ScfVi9FSvcs7HQo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8239806',6.1,1729,'cn','掃毒2 天地對決','A financial tycoon, once a triad member, tries to eradicate the drug market while an old accomplice aims to be Hong Kong\'s first drug lord.','/ja9oIIP33Pgm9295Gn67zBz8Vjy.jpg','2019-07-04',100,'Released',NULL,'The White Storm 2: Drug Lords',512731,2.9269,6.414,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45461,_binary '\0','/l0YKBu3LaehIFzBNjseLjx7MbaN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8239946',8.2,77485,'hi','तुम्बाड','India, 1918. On the outskirts of Tumbbad, a cursed village where it always rains, Vinayak, along with his mother and his brother, care of a mysterious old woman who keeps the secret of an ancestral treasure that Vinayak gets obsessed with.','/vzjZAKozbDplHWcQXbXo0APKxst.jpg','2018-10-12',113,'Released','A Tale of Greed Beyond Fear.','Tumbbad',538858,3.6714,7.6,'ZjuhALyNgss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45462,_binary '\0','/4I0InjLCK2LgYceYyxLN8w13LdJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8240250',5.8,1859,'da','De frivillige','Celebrity financier and jet-setter Markus Føns has been taken into custody. Following a brutal assault by a gang of bikers in connection with some of his more shady dealings, Markus opts for voluntary solitary confinement among the prison\'s weakest inmates; the rapists and the pedophiles. This ward has a prison choir, of which the inmate Niels is the unofficial and self-proclaimed leader. Markus decides to join the choir and before long has his sight set on reaching the top of its hierarchy. This battle is not fought with muscle, but with cunning, tyranny and canonical Danish songs!','/nKPRitMQSwrNii7C4q0eak3etfB.jpg','2019-06-13',89,'Released','A prison power play','Out of Tune',573657,1.2776,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45463,_binary '\0','/yd2xws5wVT2Ss6f0Q0oTkdYtiQE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8241000',5.5,4137,'en','Extinct','Op and Ed, two adorable donut-shaped animals - flummels - accidentally time-travel from 1835 to modern-day Shanghai. There they discover traffic, trans fats, and worst of all, that flummels are now extinct. It\'s up to this bumbling pair to save themselves and their species...and, just maybe, change the course of history.','/9cnHvJPXNNxhnxHdDWHIEmxoilF.jpg','2021-02-11',84,'Released','The end is just their beginning.','Extinct',664236,5.8659,6.194,'4ulFkSR75po','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45464,_binary '\0','/2ITFFpDaKBa0zmjENtY1SMJkieu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8241872',6.7,2667,'pt','Vitalina Varela','A Cape Verdean woman navigates her way through Lisbon, following the scanty physical traces her deceased husband left behind and discoverin