-23',97,'Released','Don\'t look up.','Dark Encounter',612515,2.3242,5.4,'6nyY65FL4jQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45492,_binary '\0','/iPKoEwpH6kHycI2Jelzc2aVqnm7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8269248',6.9,13056,'te','వకీల్ సాబ్','A retired lawyer with a troubled past returns to the courtroom to fight for three young women falsely accused in a high-profile assault case.','/jiIKf2tXZJDnpeDxEsA5UnH6DID.jpg','2021-04-09',155,'Released',NULL,'Vakeel Saab',673732,1.2043,6.548,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45493,_binary '\0','/p2qPNlGEa8TEcXg14vNvClBkHrD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8269552',7,5643,'fa','سه رخ','Filmmaker Jafar Panahi and actor Behnaz Jafari travel to a tiny village after receiving a plea for help from a girl whose family has forbidden her from studying acting. Amusing encounters abound, but they soon discover that the local hospitality is rivaled by the desire to protect old traditions.','/clpmeXLRg65zGGP1zoyYOLIakQG.jpg','2018-06-06',100,'Released',NULL,'3 Faces',517731,1.6999,6.8,'KrBKSxpTG0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45494,_binary '\0','/eagUiXSwD08WJhe4xqFxi4jgG5i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8269566',5.3,1686,'sv','En del av mitt hjärta','Isabella (35) is a driven business woman in Stockholm’s finance world. When she goes home to the small town she grew up in to celebrate her father’s sixtieth birthday, she feels like a winner, the only one in her old school gang that things have really gone well for. Isabella’s selfconfidence falters when she realizes that Simon, her great love from her teen years, is going to marry Isabella’s childhood friend Molly, and that she isn’t invited to the wedding. Isabella is accustomed to getting what she wants, and it disturbs her to see Simon so happy with someone else. Unfortunately, there are some feelings that never go away.','/GA43RUoQfIywXck31n69FHYxxH.jpg','2019-12-25',112,'Released','A romantic musical comedy.','A Piece of 