ase camp in Kashmir, India takes the fight to the enemy, in its most successful covert operation till date with one and only one objective of avenging their fallen heroes.','/yNySAgpAnWmPpYinim9E0tUzJWG.jpg','2019-01-11',138,'Released','Ye Naya Hindustan Hai','Uri: The Surgical Strike',554600,3.5157,7.054,'Cg8sbRFS3zU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45511,_binary '\0','/o1JapnInSBCgedfWnj15ytjGC70.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8291806',7.5,67741,'es','Dolor y gloria','Salvador Mallo, a filmmaker in the twilight of his career, remembers his life: his mother, his lovers, the actors he worked with. The sixties in a small village in Valencia, the eighties in Madrid, the present, when he feels an immeasurable emptiness, facing his mortality, the incapability of continuing filming, the impossibility of separating creation from his own life. The need of narrating his past can be his salvation.','/cMlueArJXXwZbeLpb4NhC3pxmBk.jpg','2019-03-22',114,'Released','Pain, Glory, Love, Art, Cinema','Pain and Glory',519010,7.8309,7.371,'2jIh5JP9ajc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45512,_binary '\0','/bx2T82h61HJkXu7rER507JN1sZa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8294204',6.7,1547,'en','A Dangerous Son','Documentary following three families each coping with a child affected by serious emotional or mental illness. The families explore treatment opportunities and grapple with the struggle of living with their child\'s condition.','/8pkfH7vAE9rt85w9fBl5rnRJGZy.jpg','2018-05-07',90,'Released','When the system fails, where do you turn?','A Dangerous Son',522773,1.2828,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45513,_binary '\0','/dDcimMQyNL0cTXGcxJD9XHI4xdn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8295976',5.9,1720,'en','A Very Nutty Christmas','Hard-working bakery owner Kate Holiday, has more cookie orders than she has time to fill this holiday season, and when her boyfriend suddenly breaks up with her, any shred of Christmas joy she was hanging onto, immediately disappears. After Kate hangs the last ornament on the tree and goes to bed, she awakens the next morning to a little bit of Christmas magic. She gets the surprise of her life when Chip, a handsome soldier who may or may not be the Nutcracker Prince from Tchaikovsky’s “The Nutcracker,” appears in her living room.','/dZsYTYA4YvZ727UbfXGshqwmygk.jpg','2018-11-30',80,'Released',NULL,'A Very Nutty Christmas',550651,2.2081,5.7,'Q5OhUl2db_A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45514,_binary '\0','/qEYcteWFxQjfyjMrZCWcaLfHSe1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8296030',6.4,14155,'mk','You Won\'t Be Alone','In an isolated mountain village in 19th century Macedonia, a young feral witch accidentally kills a peasant. She assumes the peasant\'s shape to see what life is like in her skin, igniting a deep seated curiosity to experience life inside the bodies of others.','/qVRADANU3JpMyapKjV3eM41VlDG.jpg','2022-04-01',108,'Released','It\'s a wicked thing this world.','You Won\'t Be Alone',883083,6.0827,6.6,'6-G39n2sCVU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45515,_binary '\0','/kLpPzSiNNfZPxe6oMgmW3iZUoJL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8296660',5.4,1585,'es','Lo nunca visto','The residents of an isolated town look to revive their home\'s identity when a group of foreigners unexpectedly arrive, bringing culture shock with them.','/aepBkIFxNYZaGZsRIzC1jw1rA15.jpg','2019-07-12',93,'Released',NULL,'A Remarkable Tale',542930,1.6279,5.486,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45516,_binary '\0','/86shpqprk2FICfsPqjvKnYdvr3x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8299654',8,3732,'en','At the Heart of Gold: Inside the USA Gymnastics Scandal','A look inside the USA gymnastics sexual abuse scandal that shook the sports world in 2017 depicting a landscape in which women spend their youth seeking victory on a world stage, juxtaposed against a culture where abuse prevails and lives are damaged forever.','/a3t1RktaXBTfNmwzuIoTC4rpuJj.jpg','2019-05-03',88,'Released','They are more than champions. They are survivors.','At the Heart of Gold: Inside the USA Gymnastics Scandal',557800,1.4956,7.1,'9eaX405ph0g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45517,_binary '\0','/fsM6AB85cptuiG142s6ZQS17mjr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8299768',6.4,13721,'en','Blow the Man Down','While grieving for the loss of their mother, the Connolly sisters suddenly find they have a crime to cover up, leading them deep into the underbelly of their salty Maine fishing village.','/AgxDU9Vp0R6RIV6jpmQ4JrTcZzv.jpg','2019-04-26',90,'Released','Small town. Big secrets.','Blow the Man Down',586451,3.8523,6.232,'uWM1U_kd0rE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45518,_binary '\0','/vpHrLUXqFF2DEcxREDDlZtnNZI3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8300034',6.2,1998,'en','Dirty John: The Dirty Truth','John Meehan created a terrifying trap of seduction, deceit and betrayal for countless victims. The illuminating revelations into his backstory showcase a series of events that flipped switches to create a monster wired for psychopathy. Goffard exposes John’s troubled background that built the foundation for his ominous fantasy world of lies and manipulation. In addition to hearing the Newell family’s terrifying tale, John’s first wife Tonia Bales and her daughters Emily and Abigail Meehan speak out, along with other women from his past who were caught in his web of lies.','/ye4XXk8SZeQYhq1RsdMx3kyPHEA.jpg','2019-01-14',120,'Released',NULL,'Dirty John: The Dirty Truth',575169,1.2098,5.8,'l4oQoQMSwgM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45519,_binary '\0','/wuaTXlujIi1K5EfLetWIz66rcDk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8300786',6.6,1925,'en','It\'s Christmas, Eve','Interim school superintendent Eve Morgan finds herself in a tough spot when she is assigned to shut down a school\'s failing music program and must come to terms with her musical past.','/pEDSCMBX1dgEtPZQEWkHF1aunzi.jpg','2018-11-10',90,'Released',NULL,'It\'s Christmas, Eve',535807,2.5229,6.1,'8j1aEWp4-jg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45520,_binary '\0','/8c8ue83QX0mTEUNHmLmHcMfy8be.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8302382',6.9,7920,'te','క్రాక్','Pothuraju Veera Shankar is a hot-headed circle inspector from Andhra who doesn’t like to hear the word ‘background’. Wherever he is appointed in the state, he brings all the notorious gundas to their knees with his signature policing style. When Shankar is appointed in Ongole, the brutal Katari commits a spine-chilling murder and angers Shankar. How the rivalry between Pothuraju Veera Shankar and Katari turns worse is what Krack is all about.','/fMHGXVgtU9Vfb9Xg6S9SWShmRDz.jpg','2021-01-09',154,'Released',NULL,'Krack',784572,1.4604,5.875,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45521,_binary '\0','/hOHZ4j0iUBH7DuxwoTIuo1ycRP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8302918',5.5,4503,'ta','காத்து வாக்குல ரெண்டு காதல்','Rambo who lives a double life as a cab driver and bouncer falls in love with two women with contrasting personalities. What happens when he is forced to make a choice?','/4CUPYqFD0uzt5RGG4Nk5jqoXL8j.jpg','2022-04-28',159,'Released',NULL,'Kaathuvaakula Rendu Kaadhal',752943,2.1662,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45522,_binary '\0','/4uSkLpsGnD7xExBRzuV3IH8fT3O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8303612',6.1,1382,'ta','ஆதித்ய வர்மா','A brilliant and short-tempered young surgeon goes down a self-destructive path when the love of his life is forced to marry another man.','/eIMrAFd7Ei0dzEnzGJZgiM4Depv.jpg','2019-11-21',168,'Released',NULL,'Adithya Varma',585561,0.9883,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45523,_binary '\0','/imULJA72jTUh4xUIduZrFieDgOI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8304276',5.8,1773,'ru','Кислота','They have been abandoned in a world adorned with concepts such as family, friendship, love, and opportunities. In search of answers to their questions, they devour themselves like a chemical substance that corrodes the world around, in order to eventually learn not to listen but to hear, not to look but to see. And to find their way.','/lBQYlzay3MV48lKMPyFqpBFEhWN.jpg','2018-10-04',98,'Released',NULL,'Acid',516696,1.6158,4.8,'uexvu2GNgZc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45524,_binary '\0','/oiJHjdpNI38iGku04FGgyFSTu93.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8304386',4.4,2927,'hi','The Zoya Factor','An advertising agency executive Zoya Singh Solanki meets the Indian cricket team and ends up becoming their lucky charm at the 2011 Cricket World Cup.','/ytLpoqycSAhMo5W7eHJyCXn8E2n.jpg','2019-09-19',134,'Released',NULL,'The Zoya Factor',604195,1.3851,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45525,_binary '\0','/1GGeJLU8Q0aL5nZ9KiznpVe1uWv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8305116',7.1,2595,'ru','Айка','A young Kyrgyz immigrant tries to eke out a living in Moscow after abandoning her newborn and fleeing the hospital.','/7jdtAkYV5WO2zr27VZey52lxVh3.jpg','2018-02-14',100,'Released',NULL,'Ayka',519185,1.3893,6.841,'PsKZzGWvJW4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45526,_binary '\0','/fsk85AMr3j5scWAp2Iv78Cwtl8M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8305372',6.9,1257,'en','Chronicle Mysteries: Recovered','Alex McPherson returns to the small town in Pennsylvania where she spent her summers as a girl to record the next episode of her true crime podcast, about the disappearance of a childhood friend 20 years prior. However, after teaming up with the local newspaper editor, who reluctantly agrees to help her retrace the girl’s last steps, Alex not only uncovers the shocking truth behind the girl’s disappearance, but also a decades-old murder and its cover-up.','/hUeovGYuCTTlZLnu2TgEDqkvduS.jpg','2019-02-17',85,'Released',NULL,'Chronicle Mysteries: Recovered',582623,1.2467,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45527,_binary '\0','/kLzWLoGDpfhE5vVUj9nD4rLoxAE.jpg','2026-10-06 1