- അറബിക്കടലിൻ്റെ സിംഹം','‘Marakkar Lion of the Arabian Sea’ portrays the courageous life-events of a rebellious naval chief, Kunjali Marakkar the fourth, who fought against the Portuguese in the ancient times. He was the fourth naval chief of the Calicut Zamorin. The film revolves around him who was also the first Indian Naval Commander and Indian freedom fighter for the war against the Portuguese. He is said to have won 16 such battles with his impeccable strategies and fighting skills.','/dKylmkXLLgPYER5wq9ChsFFCSbG.jpg','2021-12-01',182,'Released','Lion of the Arabian Sea','Marakkar: Lion of the Arabian Sea',617405,2.1944,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45576,_binary '\0','/gcTElS41PRRZj8elcdyQ1PUEwfl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8347960',4.8,6348,'en','Breath','Lara Winslet is an expert geologist in volcanology. She is together with her team of work on a volcano to conduct surveys. One day Lara decides to stay a little longer to finish an exam and she remains alone. Returning, she has an accident, falling inside a hole in the ground and remains blocked inside there, where no one can neither see nor hear her.','/6ulGhOy34ecIa6tVrc8EroNHMin.jpg','2022-01-10',106,'Released','The will to survive is mighty','Breath',876079,2.2278,3.7,'N_ptMbzHcRM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45577,_binary '\0','/zj2ht8vSssgXZxGHIVScu33T9Bj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8348022',4.1,3676,'en','Skin Walker','When her grandmother is brutally murdered, Regine, a fragile young woman must return to the countryside she has struggled to escape in order to engage with the family guilt she’s tried to shut out of her life - and to connect with the brother she has never known.','/Aqbr6U2tvQvvSIEQjoKJNKeOok0.jpg','2019-11-11',89,'Released',NULL,'Skin Walker',634550,2.3049,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45578,_binary '\0','/jB98SrdXAYSbiprjIwc7WfVCuCV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8350360',5.9,104204,'en','Annabelle 