er','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45624,_binary '\0','/cJNsnbaQnR3Be86gXbwm1oFmH5V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8372298',6.5,32876,'en','Swallow','Hunter, a newly pregnant housewife, finds herself increasingly compelled to consume dangerous objects. As her husband and his family tighten their control over her life, she must confront the dark secret behind her new obsession.','/40Zrwud1EVxNvcjQkotZo7jmr4L.jpg','2020-01-15',95,'Released','Open Up.','Swallow',586461,5.1794,6.6,'auVZKcxV7XQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45625,_binary '\0','/5pNH4IvHu4A0Fhbtecklw3QFYyY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8373206',5.8,19753,'en','About My Father','Encouraged by his girlfriend Ellie, Sebastian and his Italian immigrant father, Salvo, spend the 4th of July weekend with her wealthy and exceedingly eccentric family. The gathering soon develops into a culture clash, allowing father and son to discover the true meaning of family.','/eHcXyH207gLJCMLECRlBtXDK12X.jpg','2023-05-25',90,'Released','Feathers will be ruffled.','About My Father',829051,7.2031,6.047,'txLSE7tpgr0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45626,_binary '\0','/gAFeWgE0nPj6T5r6RgBqK1Bdr0F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8374266',6.8,1419,'bn','গুপ্তধনের সন্ধানে','Subarna Sen, an Oxford University professor, travels to India after the death of his maternal uncle. He learns that his uncle\'s palace has a hidden treasure and decides to find it.','/y5UsFPvv8TyFUWG2F2wEgfmkIs5.jpg','2018-04-27',133,'Released',NULL,'Guptodhoner Sondhane',532362,1.2607,6.75,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45627,_binary '\0','/39f8uDnF3O7njJPaTQYnKubp4Ug.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8374436',5.9,1983,'en','The Racer','Summer 1998 - the opening stages of Le Tour de France are relocated to Ireland. Belgian rider Dom Chabol (late 30s) has been one of the best “Domestiques” (support riders) on the Tour for the last 20 years. It’s a sacrificial role – setting pace, blocking wind, and providing support to enable the team’s sprinter to victory - winning is not an option. But Dom secretly harbours a desire to wear the yellow jersey - just once before his career is over. At the start of what will likely be his last Tour, Dom is unceremoniously dropped from the Team he has dedicated his life to. His best mate Sonny, the team masseur, fails to reassure him about his future. But a chance liaison with Lynn, a young Irish doctor, softens the blow, and Dom starts to accept - and even enjoy - the idea of civilian life. But as he gears up to go home and to face his estranged sister, a massive doping error knocks another teammate off the Tour and Dom is thrown back in the saddle…','/rwhlCAW285XyDdN0PRlKYxzp68g.jpg','2020-09-09',95,'Released','The race is won by the one who suffers the most','The Racer',305937,2.0219,5.9,'7sIQIwczfE4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45628,_binary '\0','/5HjzYTihkH7EvOWSE7KcsF6pBMM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8376234',6.2,17439,'en','Peter Rabbit 2: The Runaway','Peter Rabbit runs away from his human family when he learns they are going to portray him in a bad light in their book. Soon, he crosses paths with an older rabbit who ropes him into a heist.','/cycDz68DtTjJrDJ1fV8EBq2Xdpb.jpg','2021-03-25',93,'Released','The garden was just the beginning.','Peter Rabbit 2: The Runaway',522478,9.5316,7,'PWBcqCz7l_c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45629,_binary '\0','/nWjgEXFKezBuMWVF99iyLsWZD30.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8377736',3.5,1581,'fa','تگزاس','The story of two friends Sasan and Bahram. Sasan is living in Brazil and Bahram wants to join him too but they face many different challenges and adventures in between.','/d1A7ay2V1Ob7y5Bul60LYiebhYc.jpg','2018-04-18',88,'Released',NULL,'Texas',531681,0.8227,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45630,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8378068',5.5,2121,'en','Mykonos: The Soul of an Island','Award-winning feature length documentary about the most controversial island in the world.','/k9rHcr4fmonCMww6OkSkeuvTgcI.jpg','2018-03-06',77,'Released',NULL,'Mykonos: The Soul of an Island',1233775,0.6776,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45631,_binary '\0','/e5lxpaVyazQX723A3svR17WxckP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8378126',7,17374,'da','Dronningen','Anne, a brilliant and dedicated advocacy lawyer specialising in society’s most vulnerable, children and young adults, lives what appears to be the picture-perfect life with her doctor-husband, Peter, and their twin daughters. When her estranged teenage stepson, Gustav, moves in with them, Anne’s escalating desire leads her down a dangerous rabbit hole which, once exposed, unleashes a sequence of events destined to destroy her world.','/dfFVDIgovEfQZn53VRKLV2JQnRJ.jpg','2019-03-27',127,'Released',NULL,'Queen of Hearts',519465,12.2551,6.9,'kJmMCVN_6fw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45632,_binary '\0','/vGtP84BJCb7Hl9UwocWIeyIPDJP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8380776',4.7,6522,'en','Grand Isle','Walter and his neglected wife lure a young man into their Victorian home to escape a hurricane. When the man is charged with murder by Det. Jones, he must reveal the couple\'s wicked secrets to save himself.','/8mcXb3km7hZ8aJKpxxgnvvxt9gW.jpg','2019-12-06',97,'Released','A storm is coming','Grand Isle',560192,5.1051,5.363,'kMZA9aafu18','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000');
INSERT INTO `movies` VALUES (45633,_binary '\0','/bjIPzixuWnOzxDG25WaXKuy9lYZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8385148',6.1,121250,'en','Hitman\'s Wife\'s Bodyguard','The world’s most lethal odd couple – bodyguard Michael Bryce and hitman Darius Kincaid – are back on another life-threatening mission. Still unlicensed and under scrutiny, Bryce is forced into action by Darius\'s even more volatile wife, the infamous international con artist Sonia Kincaid. As Bryce is driven over the edge by his two most dangerous protectees, the trio get in over their heads in a global plot and soon find that they are all that stand between Europe and a vengeful and powerful madman.','/6zwGWDpY8Zu0L6W4SYWERBR8Msw.jpg','2021-06-14',117,'Released','Hit me baby, one more time.','Hitman\'s Wife\'s Bodyguard',522931,13.7994,6.6,'9C0l31YcahQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45634,_binary '\0','/f8bXJR7R9RCHM7muG0pqoRzHBD3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8385420',6.5,7100,'tr','Çiçero','Ilyas Bazna works as a butler in the British Embassy in Turkey during WW2. After Bazna starts to work as a German spy he is going to experience a series of unexpected events.','/kRKL8tCx6pUyE8ae04eWyTa2c5G.jpg','2019-01-18',120,'Released',NULL,'Operation Cicero',577114,1.141,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45635,_binary '\0','/i109vzdCkG7W3H9FxHmfpZjgh61.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8385474',7.5,33704,'en','A Dog\'s Journey','A dog finds the meaning of his own existence through the lives of the humans he meets.','/wquJChp0NpoqthYdE3YjXNNxvVC.jpg','2019-05-03',109,'Released','Some friendships transcend lifetimes.','A Dog\'s Journey',522518,9.5876,8.045,'A2FrrSyyKfA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45636,_binary '\0','/k5Fx3sJF3gFyW6HFWleGYNZNZJf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8386654',5.1,1623,'en','Torn: Dark Bullets','A raw and unapologetic look into a police shooting, racism, and the connections they share.','/tlLrmWmwiJsSTAZwu0efjow4G7i.jpg','2020-04-20',96,'Released',NULL,'Torn: Dark Bullets',696610,1.2229,6.7,'HS8PWqqB4rk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45637,_binary '\0','/5LaDTSQ8It5NPxTO8pmgDGGnpbz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8386898',6,3492,'nl','Instinct','Nicoline, a criminal psychologist, begins work at a prison where one of her new cases, Idris — an apparently reformed sex offender — is preparing for release after five years of confinement. Despite her professional misgivings, she becomes infatuated with her charismatic, manipulative patient.','/i5Ai5Sr8UIHq4IbVnO45fm2RpVf.jpg','2019-10-03',98,'Released',NULL,'Instinct',530743,3.2354,5.1,'0OIetiMoseA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45638,_binary '\0','/vlcib6bsJCQiOrZfsCu7stq0RZ1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8386958',5.8,2131,'da','Kød og blod','Following a car accident, which kills her mother, 17-year-old Ida moves in with her estranged aunt and her aunt’s grown sons. The home is filled with physical tenderness and love, but outside of the home, the family leads a violent and criminal life.','/25TLEK4DUinIhgqM4kpn0haPEl2.jpg','2020-05-28',89,'Released','Family Comes First','Wildland',522893,1.937,5.6,'_RmkKiHlx4A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45639,_binary '\0','/c7HEAKgSKs6hd6niJySPvQ5jHen.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8387464',3.5,2208,'en','House Shark','When Frank finds his happy home under attack by a dangerous but largely unknown breed of shark, he’s enlists the aid of the world’s only “House Shark” expert and a grizzled former real estate agent to embark on a desperate quest to destroy the beast and claim back his life.','/fi1K34wsh7CRFpFQc9d7PIjQgeh.jpg','2017-10-21',112,'Released','Yes, It’s Jaws in a house!','House Shark',482974,1.301,3.6,'hLQXcnNfulA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45640,_binary '\0','/e9WggtqsDr2jRfLEyRxTXaxVZ8c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8387918',6.5,1348,'pl','Zabij to i wyjedź z tego miasta','Fleeing from despair after losing those dearest to him, the hero hides in a safe land of memories, where time stands still and all those dear to him are alive.','/xDMfChYB9GNDgrdefRt46JBFx1z.jpg','2020-11-27',88,'Released',NULL,'Kill It and Leave This Town',664594,1.5904,6.3,'L3rdjjJ_gwM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45641,_binary '\0','/sSoMpYjqECgC74a3HAwdBVxFs6H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8388508',7.3,11814,'te','డియర్ కామ్రేడ్','A hot-blooded student union leader falls for a state-level cricketer but his anger management issues and violent streak threatens to derail their love story .','/wEDh02aLl2fkCXi25V4MOOuEuWF.jpg','2019-07-25',122,'Released','Fight for What You Love!','Dear Comrade',563604,2.0609,6.779,'x_NEfuXTR1c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45642,_binary '\0','/1VaEAFDo0ar1GIaY0PChxZgIV9Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8390612',6.5,1818,'is','Héraðið','A widowed farmer begins a new life on her own terms by fighting against corruption and injustice in her community.','/pFZgCf26kZd8KPldErMToDjxp1R.jpg','2019-08-14',92,'Released',NULL,'The County',575559,2.0896,6.2,'6xalJXBc82s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45643,_binary '\0','/vjnS4iu0SdwXm2LLqZGNCfpId9t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8391976',7.3,2923,'ja','文豪ストレイドッグス DEAD APPLE','A large scale catastrophe is occurring across the planet. Ability users are discovered after the appearance of a mysterious fog, apparently having committed suicide, so the Armed Detective Agency sets out to investigate these mysterious deaths. The case seems to involve an unknown ability user referred to as \"Collector,\" a man who could be the mastermind behind the incident. Trust and courage are put to the test in order to save the city of Yokohama and ability users across the world from the grip of Collector where the Armed Detective Agency forms an unlikely partnership with the dangerous Port Mafia.','/gCfN6xWPyxphtgtLuDxT5s0eSoq.jpg','2018-03-03',90,'Released','An underworld is rising.','Bungo Stray Dogs: Dead Apple',483455,4.6472,8.1,'6ySfGSAbNc0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45644,_binary '\0','/tr0QbJHWjI3pWhY75oTNl3o9lcC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8393332',5.4,6819,'es','El silencio de la ciudad blanca','Vitoria-Gasteiz, Basque Country, Spain, 2019. Two corpses appear in the crypt of the Old Cathedral. Police officer Unai López de Ayala, an expert in criminal profiling, must hunt down the ritual murderer who has been terrorizing the city for two decades.','/xOA4MbyJZVJHGZ38wC4LPpruBBX.jpg','2019-10-25',110,'Released',NULL,'Twin Murders: The Silence of the White City',542917,3.4645,5.658,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45645,_binary '\0','/Am6u2Qoev4fJNSYX7DudujJE7Kr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8396128',7.2,4941,'hi','पटाखा','In a dusty Rajasthan village, two sisters, Badki and Chhutki, are constantly at each other\'s throats over trivial matters. Their father, a widower, struggles to keep them from tearing each other apart. Their meddling neighbour, Dipper, enjoys stirring up trouble between them. But when marriage takes them to different worlds, they discover how much they need each other.','/kG9T9y7eN8FGBK9jESJNlmuRdyR.jpg','2018-09-28',134,'Released','The Battle Begins','Pataakha',542460,0.988,6.846,'cDsfX4CK9EY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45646,_binary '\0','/n0nA5IUiqsgvS91HvVo9W084xFi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8396238',8.1,1939,'mr','फर्जंद','Maharashtra has a very well known history and in that, the period of Shivaji Maharaj is of pride to us all. Adilshah from Bijapur was the strongest enemy of Shivaji Maharaj and the ruler of Konkan and Maharashtra. Shivaji established Swaraj in these parts and set the people free from Adilshah\'s slavery. And hence, he became Shivaji\'s biggest enemy. Adilshah later, declared a war against Shivaji Maharaj and captured the Panhala fort. After several attempts for recapturing the fort, Shivaji Maharaj failed. Adilshah, being a tricky politician, appointed the brutal Beshakh Khan as the guardian of the fort. The illegal and immoral acts of Beshakh Khan was against Swaraj and a hurdle for the coronation of Shivaji Maharaj. To stop him and capture the fort of Panhala was now an issue of prestige for Shivaji Maharaj. Farzand is the movie about Shivaji Maharaj\'s 60 great warriors lead by Kondaji Farzand, which portrays their great achievements in capturing Panhala fort.','/7ImVIuDZbTpueg0yxG9WvzKPEwF.jpg','2018-06-01',141,'Released',NULL,'Farzand',586552,0.7119,6.5,'n5tcTFTUDH8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45647,_binary '\0','/jkT48BVib90GwExSQ01jqxzROWT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8396294',4.9,2632,'en','Darlin\'','Found at a Catholic hospital filthy and ferocious, feral teenager Darlin’ is whisked off to a care home run by The Bishop and his obedient nuns, where she’s to be rehabilitated into a \"good girl\" as an example of the miraculous work of the church. But Darlin’ holds a secret darker than the \"sins\" she is threatened with, and she is not traveling alone. The Woman who raised her, equally fierce and feral, is ever present in the shadows of Darlin’s psyche and is determined to come for her no matter who tries to get in her way.','/tOuEt2m2YpHwQVybfxdSFq6s1Cy.jpg','2019-09-11',101,'Released','Don\'t mess with mother\'s nature.','Darlin\'',529149,2.407,5.277,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45648,_binary '\0','/ots5VKDJ8CXOaL7NzMj4afFj0Gh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8396480',6.8,1457,'ru','Пальма','The film is inspired by an incredible story of a shepherd dog named Palm who was inadvertently left in the airport by her owner. She befriends nine-year old Nicholas whose mother dies leaving him with a father he barely knows - a pilot who finds the dog at the airport. It\'s a story of amazing adventures, true friendship and unconditional love.','/rxc6ducVrgUWLat8WwUVLvr2GRR.jpg','2021-03-18',110,'Released','A True Story Of Unconditional Love','A Dog Named Palma',583833,3.9357,8.1,'9yhhTYK2Rm4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45649,_binary '\0','/60lM0vQZdalDSvDdZnaplJGZy6v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8398928',3.3,1683,'en','The Heiress','Claire and Anna are cousins who share a mysterious connection to a dark family secret. Following the death of Clare’s grandmother, ancient spirits are unleashed and the women must do battle with ‘Lilith’, a malevolent female spirit who has returned to claim possession of Anna’s unborn child.','/ssAFPlqms8ofF2ExnWH1qF4pVXb.jpg','2021-03-15',83,'Released','The curse runs through her veins.','The Heiress',794783,0.8814,4.5,'WUp_DwsD6Ks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45650,_binary '\0','/nvTD2DO96mEwOga34lQZgBKpdEQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8399288',6.4,12985,'es','Memoria','After hearing a loud \'bang\' at daybreak, a Scottish woman begins experiencing a mysterious sensory syndrome while traversing the jungles of Colombia.','/mkJl2dVJnPgWAALCuIXJ61TlwHf.jpg','2021-09-30',136,'Released','In here, time stops.','Memoria',511819,3.1822,6,'IluUJF4_WCk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45651,_binary '\0','/fVpgUymenj6anrHCSsAkoPbLIwB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8399658',5.9,3200,'en','Dalíland','In 1973, a young gallery assistant goes on a wild adventure behind the scenes as he helps aging genius Salvador Dali prepare for a big show in New York.','/4RE6PmgeE6Kz0fur2oiiYZ50R0c.jpg','2022-09-29',97,'Released','The journey into excess starts with a moustache.','Dalíland',522925,3.4842,5.9,'e0OCVku_Rlg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45652,_binary '\0','/n4NKnzaLwGhBMNjYQTLhPVpE8je.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8399664',7.2,20875,'en','Babyteeth','A terminally ill teen upsets her parents when she falls in love with a small-time drug dealer.','/aINpljdt3VVMrCLtJW4BektwYOp.jpg','2020-06-15',118,'Released',NULL,'Babyteeth',522098,3.5358,6.9,'4qgayhcNRyg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45653,_binary '\0','/oa3c6xhLVB612dfD5rD4s5CJ8x8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8399690',7.2,2254,'en','Anthropocene: The Human Epoch','Documentary on psychedelic potash mines, expansive concrete seawalls, mammoth industrial machines, and other examples of humanity’s massive, destructive reengineering of the planet.','/1jkKn1lMLjAIYwYh9QKWgnmje2Y.jpg','2018-09-28',87,'Released','A shift in consciousness is the beginning of change','Anthropocene: The Human Epoch',539757,2.6374,7,'44RYqgKwfSQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45654,_binary '\0','/wuEiqcDu4Y0kQO6nXGVarKJGLtG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8399720',7.9,6759,'en','TINA','Tina Turner overcame impossible odds to become one of the first female Black artists to reach a mainstream international audience. Her road to superstardom is an undeniable story of triumph over adversity. It’s the ultimate story of survival – and an inspirational story of our times.','/swU4ohKgD5sSGpQkRF6VbKT0Os0.jpg','2021-08-20',118,'Released','Her life. Her story.','TINA',773736,3.7912,7.7,'w9IkVtLvflU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45655,_binary '\0','/kOUZcN5qDPmDszKpNq4uxUeHA6v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8400584',5.3,3949,'en','The Perfect Find','After a high-profile firing, everything is at stake for 40-year-old Jenna: her career, her ticking biological clock, and her bank account. Her fashion career comeback hits a snag when she falls for a charming, much younger coworker — who happens to be her boss’s son. As sparks fly, Jenna must decide if she’ll risk it all on a secret romance with the one person who could destroy her comeback.','/fZXturIugHYCl7T6oLeMj1AWm7p.jpg','2023-06-23',99,'Released','Find love. Find success. Find yourself.','The Perfect Find',561717,3.2202,6.149,'n4tjqqGgky8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45656,_binary '\0','/ahNBewkTuhp1ckP42MkKSit0ajX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8400758',4,9952,'en','Killers Anonymous','A failed attempt to murder a Senator is connected to a group meeting secretly to discuss their darkest urges—to take lives.','/wpFabJf2J82j4qJyYIMFexmJ8BT.jpg','2019-06-27',95,'Released',NULL,'Killers Anonymous',535265,3.6728,4.586,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45657,_binary '\0','/pnNe60SWY0BhHuppD5G4A4eYk1z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8402090',1.2,10590,'tr','Cumali Ceber 2','Cumali spends his time preparing to ask for a girl\'s hand in marriage for his son Cevher. Just then, he receives some shocking news. The land where his grandfather\'s retirement home stands has been sold, and a shopping mall will be built in its place. To convince his grandfather to change his mind, Cumali must first reconcile with him. Believing that giving his grandfather the family heirloom watch will lead to reconciliation, Cumali sets out to retrieve the watch from his brother-in-law Çetin. Along the way, Cumali finds himself caught up in an unexpected love story and adventure.','/cdR5ya9nONK6K35ZuclK81GMeJN.jpg','2018-06-08',100,'Released',NULL,'Cumali Ceber 2',587245,1.0194,1.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45658,_binary '\0','/2OFg5p9yarI5zZsUWKCRgBgPctj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8404256',5.4,49118,'en','Snake Eyes: G.I. Joe Origins','After saving the life of their heir apparent, tenacious loner Snake Eyes is welcomed into an ancient Japanese clan called the Arashikage where he is taught the ways of the ninja warrior. But, when secrets from his past are revealed, Snake Eyes\' honor and allegiance will be tested – even if that means losing the trust of those closest to him.','/uIXF0sQGXOxQhbaEaKOi2VYlIL0.jpg','2021-07-22',121,'Released','Every warrior has a beginning.','Snake Eyes: G.I. Joe Origins',568620,10.0617,6.4,'VHg_UAfUgjA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45659,_binary '\0','/qHC2eMB57aXcY8JHDhWsC25NZ0e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8404272',6.4,1408,'zh','超时空同居','Gu Xiaojiao, a young girl from 2018 and Lu Ming, a man from 1999, discover that they have both woken up in the same bed at the same space-time. More surprisingly, they realize that they can time travel by exiting the bedroom door. The fun begins when they start to plan a number of changes within these two eras. However, they do not know that their destiny is in the hands of a mysterious person.','/ud0N7ot24votfoMAu6BxjPGXqOV.jpg','2018-05-18',101,'Released',NULL,'How Long Will I Love U',522921,1.674,6.6,'mjqNH6ud4rM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45660,_binary '\0','/bOPessdyd0dChHy70FM8Om7CgDg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8404614',7.6,148071,'en','The Two Popes','Frustrated with the direction of the church, Cardinal Bergoglio requests permission to retire in 2012 from Pope Benedict. Instead, facing scandal and self-doubt, the introspective Pope Benedict summons his harshest critic and future successor to Rome to reveal a secret that would shake the foundations of the Catholic Church.','/4d4mTSfDIFIbUbMLUfaKodvxYXA.jpg','2019-11-27',125,'Released','Inspired by true events.','The Two Popes',551332,7.1271,7.47,'T5OhkFY1PQE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45661,_binary '\0','/zyRHkfUtplslMEVA6TKOX0CO3vm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8405810',6.7,2956,'es','El amor menos pensado','It tells the story of Marcos and Ana, who have been married for more than 25 years, but enter into an existential crisis that leads them to separate. The life of singles seems fascinating and exciting at first, but soon it also becomes monotonous for her and nightmarish for him.','/qN0ODPC5w6mhEBqlLcWAMyMlmyd.jpg','2018-08-02',136,'Released','A comedy of conscious uncoupling.','An Unexpected Love',535683,2.2057,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45662,_binary '\0','/e7k3Gbeq7TjFP22AOzDI7kVwaUE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8406660',4.3,3589,'en',