's empowerment and an alcohol-free society.','/uGTHNhmxx39btrMQ5BYN0qY5ayt.jpg','2018-02-07',136,'Released',NULL,'SP Chauhan',581118,0.9101,8.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45666,_binary '\0','/ezLKRd0uhoCAEnkXKopuVd2t3E9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8411144',6.2,7082,'ta','காப்பான்','A Special Protection Group officer has to identify the threat to the prime minister, who he is protecting, and also the nation.','/vfw7EO15wqhzf9pWrVhjqn53YKg.jpg','2019-09-19',166,'Released',NULL,'Kaappaan',533885,1.6264,5.413,'j_eduSGN3RQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45667,_binary '\0','/8i8ml0LRdFT6LSaTMUG3gLzJfEq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8413338',8.5,22198,'ml','കുമ്പളങ്ങി നൈറ്റ്‌സ്','Four brothers living in the fishing hamlet of Kumbalangi share a love-hate relationship with each other. Their relationship progresses when Saji, Boney and Franky decide to help Bobby stand by his love.','/lJ3RvIirE2C7gdBKvPRaoQ3iCo2.jpg','2019-02-07',135,'Released',NULL,'Kumbalangi Nights',575351,1.2613,8.1,'3P4BFBSafF0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45668,_binary '\0','/4iwHATla3Dc2jfFKfL8d0G6IHOp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8415352',2.6,2073,'en','The Murder of Nicole Brown Simpson','In 1994 Nicole Brown Simpson and her friend Ronald Goldman were brutally murdered in her Los Angeles home by whom most believe to be O.J Simpson. But what role did Glen Rogers, also known as the Casanova Killer play in their death?','/pfTrRimCd5mDnb8qpTZovD5ZIsl.jpg','2020-01-10',86,'Released','What if he didn\'t act alone?','The Murder of Nicole Brown Simpson',527534,2.5116,4.3,'txkFJoFQjAE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45669,_binary '\0','/2EHwNBnzz48p1v7DXqAc9S2ylLc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8418652',5.6,1281,'it','Moschettieri del Re - La penultima missione','In 17th-century France, the Queen brings the Three Musketeers — Athos, Porthos, Aramis, and an aging d\'Artagnan — back from retirement for one last job: saving her son Louis and the whole kingdom.','/dR249tNy0JNAMvG3P3oSSWTPhTq.jpg','2018-12-27',109,'Released',NULL,'The King\'s Musketeers',565413,1.8018,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45670,_binary '\0','/ggHEdlGBoUxdKpFbcsyBU9MoRga.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8419594',5.4,1652,'en','Rare Beasts','Mandy is a mother, a writer, a nihilist. Mandy is a modern woman in a crisis. Raising a son in the midst of a female revolution, mining the pain of her parents\' separation and professionally writing about a love that no longer exists, she falls upon a troubled man, Pete, who’s searching for a sense of worth, belonging and ‘restored’ Male identity.','/fnxlaEzzFe1dJPqcgOjGS1oM2dJ.jpg','2021-05-21',92,'Released',NULL,'Rare Beasts',616827,2.2615,5.4,'1mopsKvtXf0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45671,_binary '\0','/tsdc6u73hAiljB8TRxizXsrozrC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8420670',5.9,1261,'en','Last Vermont Christmas','When widowed mom Megan returns home for Christmas, she and her two sisters Audrey and Bethany are surprised to learn their parents are selling their childhood home, making this their last Christmas together in Vermont. Megan is even more surprised to discover that the buyer is her high school sweetheart, Nash, who plans to use the house as an investment property.','/3MEE0NKgHfL5iyxU1LDl240EYzz.jpg','2018-11-19',90,'Released',NULL,'Last Vermont Christmas',555183,1.3823,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45672,_binary '\0','/11rsalbxZk7USUvalHpKMZ9yLtz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8425034',4.9,1738,'en','Bit','A transgender teenage girl on summer vacation in LA fights to survive after she falls in with four queer feminist vampires, who try to rid the city\'s streets of predatory men.','/9SlKmu0a1G1eihI29WMQogBWgzr.jpg','2019-05-24',94,'Released','Let MEN be the ones who are afraid to jog at night','Bit',533985,1.5094,5.2,'12zJ4ZVmsrU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:2