3294,'en','Porno','When a group of naive teens working at a movie theater in a small Christian town discover a mysterious film hidden in its basement, they unleash an alluring succubus who gives them a sex education…written in blood.','/cnmR5lXN8xLDvvtqMviuRaKavnU.jpg','2019-06-28',98,'Released','If you use it, you\'ll lose it...','Porno',576004,9.2837,6,'-JiWnGQgKNk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45731,_binary '\0','/911kCT2YwGBhFz1CNDfb0La8ybG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8488126',7.2,16727,'en','The Inventor: Out for Blood in Silicon Valley','With a magical new invention that promised to revolutionize blood testing, Elizabeth Holmes became the world’s youngest self-made billionaire, heralded as the next Steve Jobs. Then, overnight, her 10-billion-dollar company dissolved. The rise and fall of Theranos is a window into the psychology of fraud.','/u21ImPnHHX2SFgkdHIjwlpEwRux.jpg','2019-01-24',119,'Released','Visionary. Billionaire. Fraud?','The Inventor: Out for Blood in Silicon Valley',566228,5.3548,7,'wtDaP18OGfw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45732,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8489384',3.3,2765,'en','Hollywood.Con','Every hot production company in Los Angeles is in a race to make the next big Mayan movie: hurry quick, sell out your company, and do whatever it takes.','/xN2mIDMgQ4o78VTun1FeQpo3QMB.jpg','2021-01-29',101,'Released','Because they could... And so they did!','Hollywood.Con',735476,1.6156,3.6,'x92EqQtQ5_U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45733,_binary '\0','/piTY2rMVV3kq5ZACTej0x0EXi7y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8490686',6.8,1696,'en','Aurora Teagarden Mysteries: The Disappearing Game','Crime-solving librarian Aurora Teagarden leaps headfirst into Lawrenceton’s latest murder investigation when her nephew Phillip and his college roommate go missing after the roommate’s girlfriend is found dead. Enlisting the help of her Real Murders pals, and the handsome