en Abraham Lincoln\'s presidency and the presidency of Donald Trump. Not since 1860 have the Democrats so fanatically refused to accept the result of a free election. That year, their target was Lincoln. They smeared him. They went to war to defeat him. In the end, they assassinated him.','/ayUSOpmiPZOARCklJdDnIWPa2QE.jpg','2018-08-03',108,'Released','Can we save America a second time?','Death of a Nation',532868,1.5658,4.2,'OI1tkuhvpdE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45792,_binary '\0','/7OdsvVwS3ejlaCDZjZH1UFibh98.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8567342',6.3,1825,'en','Take Me Somewhere Nice','A teen raised in the Netherlands by her single mother travels to their native Bosnia to visit the father who left them, as he’s been admitted to a rural hospital. Joined by her cousin and his best friend, they hit the road.','/gOnMrDfk1dFic2V2ilJHByoE2Oq.jpg','2019-05-23',92,'Released',NULL,'Take Me Somewhere Nice',572979,0.9943,5.7,'1EbN9URc8Uk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45793,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8569206',3.6,3180,'hi','Little Baby','Little Baby is a story of unconditional love between a father and daughter. Sasha is a 19 year old girl who loves to experiment with her life and in this, she forgets she has a loving father and a mother.','/jtJpWhS4HXXXKNjkPg3W1TZciA5.jpg','2019-09-27',105,'Released',NULL,'Little Baby',690480,1.2119,0,'EvcypI92o4M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45794,_binary '\0','/ezEa5VOltyQqqrz5OcuNx0CoPNx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8569578',5.4,1394,'en','She Never Died','Lacey, a socially detached loner is cursed with immortality and a never-ending tedium of existence. In her attempts to keep her compulsions in check, she seeks out the darkest souls humanity has to offer. Lacey must now face her own inner demons while simultaneously finding her next meal.','/AqYBxQn8huCutt0yokas4Z5SsvZ.jpg','2019-10-10',89,'Released',NULL,'She Never Died',609919,