ders',628468,1.1606,4.5,'79CYf9yiSK4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45803,_binary '\0','/57SB156vTF6NfthrwJKYr92TgLI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8587650',6.4,2302,'en','Christmas Joy','Joy Holbrook, is a corporate market researcher, gunning for a promotion within her firm. Just as her company\'s CEO is taking notice, Joy finds out her Aunt Ruby has broken her ankle and will be undergoing surgery. Despite the less than opportune timing, Joy makes her way back home to Crystal Falls, NC to be with her Aunt. Stars seem to be aligned as Joy sees her former crush, Ben Andrews, while at the hospital. At first, Joy is focused solely on helping her Aunt heal; even taking over her position as chair of the local Cookie Crawl competition. Eventually, she begins to let Ben in and remembers there\'s no place like home for the holidays. The pair work together on the Cookie Crawl to make the event a success.','/nyBL0NqfIgMrtAGTp7W2ilosvpz.jpg','2018-11-03',84,'Released',NULL,'Christmas Joy',535812,1.6434,6.5,'JLCS7lyNG_U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45804,_binary '\0','/8qbklu2BQUCnMEiOZFZZlPfLmE7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8587730',6.5,1237,'en','Love Under the Rainbow','Lucy wasn\'t sure if she would find true love, until Jack moves to town with his daughter Sophie. Together they teach her it\'s never too late to start chasing rainbows!','/iW8qQHNnjfCl91rtHCr1zoZNmbA.jpg','2019-03-09',90,'Released',NULL,'Love Under the Rainbow',581316,2.6797,6.2,'9HdK4hABTvo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45805,_binary '\0','/2Cpg8hUn60PK9CW9d5SWf605Ah8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8589698',7.2,79272,'en','Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Mutant Mayhem','After years of being sheltered from the human world, the Turtle brothers set out to win the hearts of New Yorkers and be accepted as normal teenagers through heroic acts. Their new friend April O\'Neil helps them take on a mysterious crime syndicate, but they soon get in over their heads when an army of mutants is unleashed upon them.','/gyh0eECE2IqrW8GWl3KoHBfc45j.jpg','2023-07-31',100,'Released','Heroes aren\'t born. They\'re mutated.','Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Mutant Mayhem',614930,14.5045,7.223,'E4Kz4tZ6RcA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45806,_binary '\0','/vcS3WAWzqG34xu7nokuXKSmZSaT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8589788',7.2,1610,'en','All of My Heart: The Wedding','Brian and Jenny are planning their wedding at the Inn where they fell in love. When a distant relative arrives and stakes their claim to the Inn, Brian and Jenny must find a way to save their beloved Inn or risk having to sell.','/1n8xrAuu8la18SXw852tzy46lNO.jpg','2018-09-29',84,'Released',NULL,'All of My Heart: The Wedding',543342,2.3881,7.4,'lPrARpdy408','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45807,_binary '\0','/2pJ9xW1mA7zRfrg9On9e8AekrQM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8590896',7.7,18050,'te','గీత గోవిందం','Vijay Govind, a young college lecturer who dreams of marriage falls for Geetha, a level-headed woman who\'s wary of strangers and isn\'t easy to convince. While things seem to go smoothly, Vijay makes a terrible mistake which not only derails any hope for his love story, but also potential repercussions with his family.','/sTreb0ajewXqeIqAyZ0IWtafoB5.jpg','2018-08-15',148,'Released',NULL,'Geetha Govindam',540468,1.5644,6.884,'qHqWRCxhcOk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45808,_binary '\0','/jai2IePHlNTKwCNoOM5HQgMVUaj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8591526',6.9,4400,'en','Fremont','Donya, a lonely Afghan refugee and former translator, spends her twenties drifting through a meager existence in Fremont, California. Shuttling between her job writing fortunes for a fortune cookie factory and sessions with her eccentric therapist, Donya suffers from insomnia and survivor\'s guilt over those still left behind in Kabul as she desperately searches for love.','/wJZovPXB3SWL1BL1GyLrCRrk4z9.jpg','2023-08-25',92,'Released',NULL,'Fremont',1048522,2.3954,6.343,'Bo7LfFmllVs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45809,_binary '\0','/j6r1jukdoJsOZ15RknTJ6wrACT1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8591792',5.7,2257,'hi','भवई','The story is about the dream of Rajaram and its impact on the society. Rajaram an enthusiast by nature had only one dream of becoming an actor since his childhood. Being a village resident, he was deprived of that chance to live his dream. Will the duo be able to survive the obstacles or become a victim and succumb to the blind beliefs of the society? Who is the real Ravan, Rajaram or We \"The Society\"?','/iCzb2KKEAeGuT37kh7gNw5BnVtl.jpg','2021-10-22',114,'Released',NULL,'Bhavai',826178,0.9073,0,'c8khvkkbZss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45810,_binary '\0','/76UStctac8TlnkaoYjAUKMgPvf6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8593538',4.1,1315,'tr','Aşk Bu Mu?','Umut has been a thief since he was a kid. He constantly seeks the opportunity of his life and his family. He can\'t find either. Gülüm is a young girl who has no problems in her life, who has completed her schooling on time and is only a step away from her dreams. But before she takes that step towards her dreams, she hangs and falls. It is understood that Gülüm has liver failure. She\'ll die if she doesn\'t have a liver transplant. The fate of Umut and Gülüm merge at this point. Umut found the opportunity he had waited for the rest of his life. But this opportunity drags Umut into very difficult situations, and finds itself in a position that risks the lives of all loved ones. For Umut to come out of this vortex, he has to make very serious decisions. And love is worth everything? Is this love?','/2C4KmYpWOagIXHvHGbR8RwFxAuf.jpg','2018-12-14',103,'Released',NULL,'Is This Love?',613976,1.339,6.8,'ny8H9eJ0pOs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45811,_binary '\0','/gGkm2TDZjXQjtcLy8F5V0lrhYNw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8593824',5.6,11828,'en','The Old Way','An old gunslinger and his daughter must face the consequences of his past, when the son of a man he killed years ago arrives to take his revenge.','/8HCCYAIocXxMKn7J9yQfDX1vBM5.jpg','2023-01-06',95,'Released','You can outnumber him. But you can\'t outfight him.','The Old Way',872954,6.1482,5.743,'eWakq9qQ6Ik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45812,_binary '\0','/fFDapFaawMLjLOoYFNg3aqkIQg6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8593904',6.1,10959,'en','Rifkin\'s Festival','The story of a married American couple who go to the San Sebastian Film Festival. They get caught up in the magic of the festival, the beauty and charm of Spain and the fantasy of movies. She has an affair with a brilliant French movie director, and he falls in love with a beautiful Spanish woman who lives there.','/5kTkLEheDmXdnHHRJiAkd4Vuato.jpg','2020-10-01',92,'Released','A romance... but most of all, it\'s a mystery','Rifkin\'s Festival',606876,4.7503,6.105,'d11-NLbjT3M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45813,_binary '\0','/gTOmU65Fr3UPSXW65fkHzFVNCjz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8594376',5.8,5820,'it','L\'uomo del labirinto','When a kidnapping victim turns up alive after fifteen years, a profiler and a private investigator try to piece together the mystery.','/tWcN7ZjeOBzuwNtx7viKb1w2UOj.jpg','2019-10-30',130,'Released',NULL,'Into the Labyrinth',602545,3.5456,6.4,'eFSx22lLxlA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45814,_binary '\0','/dtToqWaHqrjp9qIKb81t9n3NMiJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8595016',7.1,2017,'en','My Old School','In 1993, 16-year-old Brandon Lee enrolled at Bearsden Academy, a secondary school in a well-to-do suburb of Glasgow, Scotland. What followed over the next two years would become the stuff of legend.','/9NjklXrjM8rBabTO1GWV7pHuMui.jpg','2022-03-10',104,'Released',NULL,'My Old School',913867,1.5599,7,'DDazGVIs9C0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45815,_binary '\0','/4G77fFsEcl7RSlJSBREEzVDpszj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8595586',5.9,1678,'it','Il signor Diavolo','In 1950s Italy, a government official arrives in a rural town to investigate a grisly child murder. The culprit is a young boy who claims he acted in order to kill the Devil itself.','/nRmPaVH1wuKWk2A66xYORVr3Y7.jpg','2019-08-22',87,'Released',NULL,'Mr. Devil',602518,1.5635,6.023,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45816,_binary '\0','/a3Vh4fWzoKO1s3kgNzgeUfncaSC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8595774',6.4,1378,'en','Bajkonur, Terra','Over the centuries only few caravans dared to cross the northern route of the silk road that today lies in the territory of Kazakhstan. In this portion of Asian desert there was no place to build a majestic city nor anything else worth fighting for. Until in 1955 the Soviet government realised that those lands, far as they may be from the rest of the World, were just one step away from the Universe.','/muOFjN9q9S2laqA8FL2HDV4dLQM.jpg','2019-06-16',74,'Released','Far from the rest of the world. Just one step away from the universe.','Baikonur, Earth',552127,1.6485,5.8,'0i88aOcUI_M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45817,_binary '\0','/bNONEBTUolRsTBbksgyaEFKAczr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8597594',4.2,16285,'en','Adverse','In order to save his sister, a ride-share driver must infiltrate a dangerous crime syndicate.','/e2rzzyY2qNJNGE0jhBkTFTjiFpm.jpg','2021-02-12',94,'Released','How far would you go to protect those you love?','Adverse',661020,2.2936,4.8,'_AlFtnQ3dho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45818,_binary '\0','/axVvt8MjHF3RiMW4OSQS7dBNtJL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8599746',6,1733,'fr','Let\'s Dance','After his crew breaks up, a gifted but insecure hip-hop dancer teaches at a top ballet school in Paris, where he falls for an aspiring ballerina.','/x38vQCzCpWZWlWJhSVPFWhmTadu.jpg','2019-03-27',109,'Released',NULL,'Let\'s Dance',532620,1.9429,6.5,'iY-8qtNwTFA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45819,_binary '\0','/vysmtlEg2cuKQO8RILPy82gdsYk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8602654',8.7,3469,'kn','ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ ಹಿ. ಪ್ರಾ. ಶಾಲೆ ಕಾಸರಗೋಡು','In Kasargodu, Kerala is a normal school until a big problem comes in its way.','/5pTtrf60IKt2ZfqJFpf2pYKLIBc.jpg','2018-08-23',147,'Released',NULL,'Sarkari. Hi. Pra. Shale Kasaragodu',544891,0.8406,7.7,'oA-U1rR3pNc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45820,_binary '\0','/jMH6VkqkUdBPPIiTmOv2VpmrH2L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8609660',6.8,7893,'en','My Penguin Friend','A lost penguin rescued from an oil spill transforms the life of a heartbroken fisherman. They become unlikely friends, so bonded that even the vast ocean cannot divide them.','/65ll0fwaCMDHuD5XMJk4f4Olc5b.jpg','2024-08-07',98,'Released','Inspired by the true story of an extraordinary friendship.','My Penguin Friend',1159799,5.9649,7.333,'BE0kfDCiod0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45821,_binary '\0','/3njpnE3SUxqjtzbSmEsBl1vF9lR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8610036',3.6,4676,'en','Captors','Alys - a human trafficking victim who narrowly escaped her captors ten years ago - confronts her traumatic past when a relative leaves her his remote, snowbound mansion. Although the new house first presents the promise of a new chapter in her life, Alys is soon besieged by strange hallucinations and deadly adversaries and must fight to survive while keeping her sanity intact.','/uw2F92plA1brk5CFZrhzJ6VrY8R.jpg','2020-10-05',94,'Released','Don\'t lock the door. The demons are inside.','Captors',634301,2.1683,4.1,'oIH-lHQjdfs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45822,_binary '\0','/8elBDylFThvAsuwYdBAsCQC9l0Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8610436',7.7,6646,'en','The Sparks Brothers','Take a musical odyssey through five weird and wonderful decades with brothers Ron & Russell Mael, celebrating the inspiring legacy of Sparks: your favorite band’s favorite band.','/e8jtG3WS0Ku7Dh4fBne1rgriXZt.jpg','2021-06-18',140,'Released','50 years. 25 albums. 345 songs. Unlimited genius.','The Sparks Brothers',776485,4.818,7.394,'9_PGv4DGMvg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45823,_binary '\0','/ivJ5UzT6IzucLVfbZwCCwiJJoBz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8613070',8,130203,'fr','Portrait de la jeune fille en feu','On an isolated island in Brittany at the end of the eighteenth century, a female painter is obliged to paint a wedding portrait of a young woman.','/2LquGwEhbg3soxSCs9VNyh5VJd9.jpg','2019-09-06',121,'Released','Don\'t regret. Remember.','Portrait of a Lady on Fire',531428,16.2702,8.1,'Bn_-YoG69Sw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45824,_binary '\0','/e0TNO1ZqAhKFFZfwpLeWzIS9597.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8613876',4.9,7229,'de','Kidnapping Stella','Snatched off the street and held for ransom, a bound and gagged woman uses her limited powers to derail her two masked abductors\' carefully laid plans.','/Vs89HqchcSoksB7No3ZBugGTVK.jpg','2019-06-29',89,'Released',NULL,'Kidnapping Stella',611468,2.9166,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45825,_binary '\0','/jsQrUWNeJkeoRZeslC07wNI36Tb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8613908',6.7,4010,'en','The Christmas Contract','It’s Jolie’s first time going back home to Louisiana since her devastating break-up with Foster Burke. Seeing him is inevitable as their parents run the town’s annual Christmas Market together, but when she discovers Foster is bringing home a new girlfriend, Jolie cannot bear the thought of going home alone and seeing them together. Her best friend Naomi suggests that Jolie bring her flaky brother, Jack, home for Christmas as he has no plans this year. Jolie, a professional web designer, is hesitant; so, Naomi, a lawyer, creates a Christmas contract to give them both something they want—a buffer for those awkward moments around Jolie’s ex and a website to help sell Jack’s upcoming novel. Unbeknownst to them, the Christmas contract proves to be so much more than what they signed up for.','/cmDrqhmb6lBytw7HepNfHOMdKiG.jpg','2018-11-22',88,'Released',NULL,'The Christmas Contract',550655,2.2104,6.5,'LcS3QR5VzUQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45826,_binary '\0','/kZ4JWimEd6yRklFV7fvTDMlw9Ih.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8614536',7.8,1234,'en','Farmlands','Lauren Southern’s distubing documentary about the violence against Boer farmers in South Africa.','/1jNS4DoNh7aalZrLioa7BVjoZna.jpg','2018-11-01',73,'Released',NULL,'Farmlands',532170,1.2663,6,'ONs1gpwkCrk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45827,_binary '\0','/dUBfcpXkD75WD8ZFgDfUauqFINh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8615136',5.8,1951,'it','Hammamet','The last years of Bettino Craxi, one of the most important and controversial italian leader of the 1980\'s.','/l6uLqpGkxBfmdS1qZLWukgmysOX.jpg','2020-01-09',127,'Released',NULL,'Hammamet',590869,1.3126,5.9,'lNGvbo8CKwI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45828,_binary '\0','/vhCoKNu3HkVCFCV2E2SNqxbOC3z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8615732',6.1,1458,'ru','Братство','1988-1989. The end of the Soviet-Afghan war. The USSR begins its withdrawal from Afghanistan. Soviet General Vasiliev\'s son - a pilot named Alexander gets kidnapped by the mujahideen after his airplane crashes. As a result the 108th motorized infantry division\'s long awaited return home gets put on hold for one last mission: bring the General\'s son back. Based on true events the previously untold story of the courageous and tragic withdrawal campaign (through the Salang pass) reveals the danger the horror and the complexity of human nature during wartime.','/3DNZnzuLzUCIcfQZZz4gT7epvx7.jpg','2019-05-10',112,'Released','The war is over. Not their mission.','Leaving Afghanistan',512954,1.5334,6.6,'yk8m9SKMMqM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45829,_binary '\0','/xG8MoAb91jRGi01iwU0UMpXNlvK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8615822',4.7,16070,'en','Occupation: Rainfall','Two years into an intergalactic invasion of Earth, survivors in Sydney, Australia, fight back in a desperate ground war. As casualties mount by the day, the resistance and their unexpected allies, uncover a plot that could see the war come to a decisive end. With the Alien invaders hell-bent on making earth their new home, the race is on to save mankind.','/vpq8XjZ3ZalcbqWOYIdqcV7FbIJ.jpg','2020-10-30',128,'Released','Take a stand.','Occupation: Rainfall',688258,3.9338,6.2,'OP1iQdp1ZB0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45830,_binary '\0','/n8IlbxbfK34s3bjAcVjcgNZpBrd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8618118',6,6232,'pl','Plagi Breslau','Every day at 6 pm a serial killer kills another person. Police officer Helena Rus thinks the killings are done by one man only and decides to reveal the killer\'s identity by getting back in 18th century history of the city.','/hcLCLWYuLJFHrN4y23YxHTlZVsV.jpg','2018-11-29',93,'Released',NULL,'The Plagues of Breslau',557336,2.5656,6.256,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45831,_binary '\0','/qcPvoQOTekrKgXdBIYvuxtFWebC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8618654',8.1,8245,'en','Kiss the Ground','Sheds light on an alternative approach to farming called “regenerative agriculture” that could balance our climate, replenish our vast water supplies, and feed the world.','/a1fUwIQpJPOYNcDeFzX1o7Gd6J9.jpg','2020-09-22',85,'Released','The solution is right under our feet.','Kiss the Ground',737157,5.0793,7.7,'K3-V1j-zMZw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45832,_binary '\0','/5McQn3WUJCBVf58nKi6pf3i4q6o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8619812',6.5,2062,'pt','Minha Vida em Marte','Fernanda is married to Tom, with whom she has a five-year-old daughter, Joana. The couple is in the midst of wear and tear caused by living together for many years, which generates constant friction. Who helps Fernanda to overcome the crisis is her partner Aníbal, inseparable partner during the arduous journey between saving the marriage or putting an end to it.','/tJHWvQOdOj7G52wMKwq7heRUrkj.jpg','2018-12-27',95,'Released',NULL,'Minha Vida em Marte',564427,1.5455,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45833,_binary '\0','/knIKsAsf3dz5I9kpJxkBZwVZSk3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8620154',6.5,1473,'de','Das Vorspiel','Violin teacher Anna Bronsky detects remarkable talent in a student, Alexander. Anna becomes obsessed with mentoring him, neglecting her family and spiralling under mounting pressure. As her fixation overtakes her, all is staked on exam day.','/v7igFXZt0Uk6Z4h9HAXZdn5FEuB.jpg','2019-11-06',99,'Released',NULL,'The Audition',575563,2.7736,5.9,'gGTxe3WGxwM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45834,_binary '\0','/l2iiSqwUYzM5l9sA0fAPZxdTyhr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8620646',4.9,2682,'en','An Affair to Die For','A weekend get-away for two lovers turns into a nightmare of psychological mind games when their infidelity is discovered.','/Vo4vUGaE081biscSRiacl9agmE.jpg','2019-02-01',83,'Released','Be careful what you lust for','An Affair to Die For',574883,3.676,5.782,'VkvmdLoO4Wk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45835,_binary '\0','/qIjyBgsMDbpeEO3CJx7vxVn4KO8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8623904',6.5,107171,'en','Last Christmas','Kate is a young woman who has a habit of making bad decisions, and her last date with disaster occurs after she accepts work as Santa\'s elf for a department store. However, after she meets Tom there, her life takes a new turn.','/kDEjffiKgjuGo2DRzsqfjvW0CQh.jpg','2019-11-07',103,'Released','Who doesn\'t have a little Christmas baggage?','Last Christmas',549053,8.5573,7.2,'z9CEIcmWmtA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45836,_binary '\0','/ftODZXaXpWtV5XFD8gS9n9KwLDr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8629748',6.2,107690,'en','Spenser Confidential','Spenser, a former Boston patrolman who just got out from prison, teams up with Hawk, an aspiring fighter, to unravel the truth behind the death of two police officers.','/fePczipv6ZzDO2uoww4vTAu2Sq3.jpg','2020-03-06',110,'Released','The law has limits. They don\'t.','Spenser Confidential',581600,7.2335,6.5,'bgKEoHNi3Uc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45837,_binary '\0','/vBhFCHx3gMQfAdqJTyIiQK3IckS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8632862',7.2,21631,'en','Fahrenheit 11/9','Michael Moore\'s provocative documentary explores the two most important questions of the Trump Era: How did we get here, and how do we get out.','/k2G8IO5oGHezde70Xv7falXhuWC.jpg','2018-09-10',128,'Released','Tyrant. Liar. Racist. A hole in one.','Fahrenheit 11/9',532908,4.0489,7.103,'fnQ8VU0uQXI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45838,_binary '\0','/kc20ajqICqsLjvgbfHNnWhDVc85.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8633296',1.8,1267,'en','Alien Predator','A black ops reconnaissance team is sent to investigate the crash of an unidentified aircraft. When they arrive, they find strange markings and residue visible only in infrared. As the team gets deeper in and tries to figure out the source of the markings, they discover that they are being hunted by an alien expedition to Earth.','/jxHWPPNXhegzZHCUSgjlPwnuQ2C.jpg','2018-09-11',87,'Released','Join the hunt','Alien Predator',548257,3.0863,4.2,'7tfDLFqVyVk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45839,_binary '\0','/awElIr61fFpbudzlCfobIpbwEro.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8633462',8,42406,'sr','Quo Vadis, Aida?','Bosnia, July 1995. Aida is a translator for the UN in the small town of Srebrenica. When the Serbian army takes over the town, her family is among the thousands of citizens looking for shelter in the UN camp. As an insider to the negotiations Aida has access to crucial information that she needs to interpret. What is at the horizon for her family and people – rescue or death? Which move should she take?','/eQy2Tgvmx0FkK8vMMqMW4aX5UXQ.jpg','2021-02-26',104,'Released',NULL,'Quo Vadis, Aida?',728118,3.8299,7.6,'ErLD8P4VUjY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45840,_binary '\0','/2kj6FOo0B9NtCen1Ta7LoaPW9wG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8633464',6.6,26729,'en','After Yang','When his young daughter\'s beloved companion — an android named Yang — malfunctions, Jake searches for a way to repair him. In the process, Jake discovers the life that has been passing in front of him, reconnecting with his wife and daughter across a distance he didn\'t know was there.','/s2Zaj1WFKiP7Y7GHp57b5KbKG8f.jpg','2022-03-04',96,'Released','The future has never looked so human.','After Yang',585378,7.3474,6.4,'Kwp32zLc08c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45841,_binary '\0','/rLchzndbDRy41J9X363pMePbV5x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8633478',6.7,115376,'en','Run','Chloe, a teenager who is confined to a wheelchair, is homeschooled by her mother, Diane. Chloe soon becomes suspicious of her mother and begins to suspect that she may be harboring a dark secret.','/ilHG4EayOVoYeKqslspY3pR4wzC.jpg','2020-11-20',90,'Released','You can\'t escape a mother\'s love.','Run',546121,8.6183,7.2,'z_v0icKzgw0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45842,_binary '\0','/96eEEdk0IT5g8BnBHSR8HdpytWG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8633560',5.5,1343,'en','Lazy Susan','Susan has always been the self-centered oddball in her family who lazily skated through life with their begrudging support until one day she wakes up to realize she’s middle-aged with no job, no relationship, and an increasingly estranged family. She finally decides to take charge and turn things around, but never having done anything herself before, the struggle is real (and hilarious) as Susan becomes the woman she always wanted to be, all on her own.','/bhqyLiVBYamoSG5U04uPGckYRWo.jpg','2020-04-03',90,'Released','Doing nothing is exhausting','Lazy Susan',668627,1.7789,4.5,'yvvuxbX8nR4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45843,_binary '\0','/2GhyI4g28OoT3QtaQL3S2FDSWtZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8633748',6,1261,'en','The Opening Act','The film follows Will Chu whose true life passion is to become a stand-up comedian. He is given the opportunity to emcee a comedy show, opening for his hero, Billy G. Chu has to decide if he wants to continue the life he has set up or to pursue his dream, the life of a comedian.','/dLzrhDvKXT7KVIDTglnTOhz19cW.jpg','2020-10-16',90,'Released','To get to the top, you have to start at the bottom.','The Opening Act',664184,2.1047,5.2,'KNDWz__KThs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45844,_binary '\0','/5IseU9V6zu6T3ZQrPdTjke2WNbz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8633950',6.6,1768,'fr','Les Invisibles','Following a city councils decision, a women\'s shelter will soon be closed and social workers have only three months to accommodate the residents.','/kn0uHQLJ7YdlBbRfOSMYSqXvYW4.jpg','2019-01-09',102,'Released',NULL,'The Invisibles',501633,2.0583,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45845,_binary '\0','/b7zEbfBCg5WP77ST8qh7Hv89fer.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8634192',6.2,2712,'en','Pride, Prejudice and Mistletoe','Darcy has always worked hard to prove herself and be successful on her own terms, even choosing to start her own company, rather than work with her father. Returning to her hometown for Christmas, Darcy reconnects with an old rival, restaurant owner Luke, and they are forced to plan a charity event together. As Darcy spends time with her family and Luke, she starts to realize what matters most in life and sets out to mend her relationship with her father, and possibly fall in love.','/bEZ0Sd1Jy22gKij2LONgitlRmNV.jpg','2018-12-23',83,'Released',NULL,'Pride, Prejudice and Mistletoe',535810,2.6439,6.1,'_DOGwVI8PkI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45846,_binary '\0','/rToVdkhRishbanfsw0QbTMAyA3T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8634202',6.6,3546,'en','A Shoe Addict\'s Christmas','As Christmas approaches, a department store worker whose life lacks fulfillment meets her guardian angel, who offers her a chance to change her circumstances by magically transporting her to Christmases past whenever she tries on a new pair of shoes.','/xAMSWUBSG8rhXuU9JmQItWNmn4U.jpg','2018-11-25',90,'Released',NULL,'A Shoe Addict\'s Christmas',535809,3.0928,6.2,'1LP_J6_EGxk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45847,_binary '\0','/sBOXMndYdg6CPO6hF0tuZH2BoHL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8635092',6.6,8270,'en','Everybody\'s Talking About Jamie','Jamie New is 16 and doesn’t quite fit in—instead of pursuing a \"real\" career he dreams of becoming a drag queen. Uncertain about his future, Jamie knows one thing for sure: he is going to be a sensation. Supported by his loving mom and his amazing friends, Jamie overcomes prejudice, beats the bullies and steps out of the darkness, into the spotlight.','/wsCHo64bJ8lMhKv8LtOKEn1kjsH.jpg','2021-09-10',115,'Released','The true story that became a musical sensation.','Everybody\'s Talking About Jamie',624899,3.7892,6.17,'AXhpTZeG4eg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45848,_binary '\0','/q9iRcxfJG4Sas1bch5dadeAVEEK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8636456',3.2,1423,'en','The Haunting of Molly Bannister','A chilling tale of a family at odds against a sinister evil that they don\'t understand. The Origin of Molly Bannister is here and its more terrifying than you could have imagined.','/1DmRUwQ5Tq1zWN7rtnqIrXaUrwK.jpg','2019-01-20',75,'Released','Playtime is Over!','The Haunting of Molly Bannister',572443,1.258,5.5,'EAs2rUHu73I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45849,_binary '\0','/5INPBiKVRsyp9kgHfsC0cTfvKFH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8637428',7.5,76132,'en','The Farewell','A headstrong Chinese-American woman returns to China when her beloved grandmother is given a terminal diagnosis. Billi struggles with her family\'s decision to keep grandma in the dark about her own illness as they all stage an impromptu wedding to see grandma one last time.','/7ht2IMGynDSVQGvAXhAb83DLET8.jpg','2019-07-12',100,'Released','Based on an actual lie.','The Farewell',565310,6.5653,7.412,'RofpAjqwMa8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45850,_binary '\0','/vHvVt2Lovn4G6of9u3pHEQE2CxI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8637438',4.3,3203,'en','Night Patrol','An L.A. cop discovers a local task force is hiding a secret that puts the residents of his childhood neighborhood in danger.','/rNqLzACU9ez2ehDalTFDPjZiC4G.jpg','2026-01-16',104,'Released','Defang the police.','Night Patrol',1323625,5.4598,4.9,'8J_pMGZScB8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45851,_binary '\0','/7O4FQBE5QNmSODvTgQov6DtoExm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8637440',6.7,5646,'en','The Climb','Kyle and Mike are best friends who share a close bond — until Mike sleeps with Kyle’s fiancée. A stormy but enduring relationship ensues between Kyle, with limitless patience, and Mike, who only lives his life by sowing discord in that of others, across many years of laughter, heartbreak, and rage.','/x6f60UzIXfkFNofg7GTzMygegFc.jpg','2020-07-29',94,'Released',NULL,'The Climb',595931,2.592,6.1,'Mr4MKhV5QVw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45852,_binary '\0','/jDjmnEuNUfWHg8rbW6u8mylkcO0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8637498',5.8,8178,'en','The Monkey King','A stick-wielding monkey teams with a young girl on an epic quest for immortality, battling demons, dragons, gods — and his own ego — along the way.','/i6ye8ueFhVE5pXatgyRrZ83LBD8.jpg','2023-07-30',92,'Released','The legend has arrived','The Monkey King',832502,7.734,6.5,'-Ao79QJNE-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45853,_binary '\0','/eQNlRh69W9HVw46znLOhyMe7dsN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8637504',8.1,6531,'en','Disclosure','An investigation of how Hollywood\'s fabled stories have deeply influenced how Americans feel about transgender people, and how transgender people have been taught to feel about themselves.','/2MB2FPNxdSlykbH7ghBltoBYnTH.jpg','2020-06-19',108,'Released','Trans lives on screen','Disclosure',653610,2.6481,7.8,'4-sPqFMBK1o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45854,_binary '\0','/meKULXDyJlAdjk55k7MsFK8Zx7S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8638420',8.1,1774,'en','Strokes of Genius','The film intertwines Roger Federer and Rafael Nadal\'s lives with their famed 2008 Wimbledon championship - an epic match so close and so reflective of their competitive balance that, in the end, the true winner was the sport itself.','/kMCGF04uYqd6adllY3Tg8194ViX.jpg','2018-07-01',98,'Released','Long live rivalry.','Strokes of Genius',533743,1.5938,7.8,'q2UYQJmMIxc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45855,_binary '\0','/bOX1sdZJpq3Nty9apbdOnpmaHpr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8638524',3.4,2221,'en','President Evil','Days before the November mid-term Elections, three young girls who are a Muslim, Mexican and Haitian, are stalked by a deranged killer dressed as the POTUS.','/eZQK5Ze8s0cF3dtnVD6R9MDNlAy.jpg','2018-10-18',81,'Released','The Boogeyman came home...to 1600 Pennsylvania Avenue','President Evil',558305,2.0666,2,'gvFUyO4kt-c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45856,_binary '\0','/nY1Wt3F7nySV7PSFP12aYsBe8xH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8638640',7.4,4002,'ml','ജൂൺ','The life story of a girl named June from 16 years of her age until she turned 26, thereby giving an insight into those ten years of her life.','/A5uFEcI9j26cPgjzoEP9DsNEVLL.jpg','2019-02-15',141,'Released',NULL,'June',580896,1.1095,6.69,'kP4vEzIv2lI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45857,_binary '\0','/niZPYxb9Vy96pxAZ1FgdZhCIcoI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8639136',6.8,7800,'nl','De Oost','A young Dutch soldier deployed to suppress post-WWII independence efforts in the Netherlands’ colony of Indonesia finds himself torn between duty and conscience when he joins an increasingly ruthless commander’s elite squad.','/lcn9tfKLfvDGpZgUJw48eN0XCCA.jpg','2021-08-13',137,'Released','A war between duty and conscience.','The East',633503,3.0008,6,'kJza8T9_EiE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45858,_binary '\0','/zSIM1UOHCAsPWTJOCkoEWVdtas5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8639326',3.7,1798,'en','Roe v. Wade','Drs. Bernard Nathanson and Mildred Jefferson square off in a national battle in this untold conspiracy that led to the most famous and controversial court case in history.','/ua3UIPn5IT07P73BaP1daVhIFDt.jpg','2021-04-02',112,'Released','The truth comes out','Roe v. Wade',565470,2.2415,5.6,'HUkEpm8kPyQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45859,_binary '\0','/vLI1uQuvk3lUnTWER0bJ9RSRnKM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8647310',6.2,9820,'en','Buffaloed','Set in the underworld of debt-collecting, homegrown hustler Peg Dahl will do anything to escape Buffalo, NY.','/7ecianrsS9xYzqoAtVIW8tMcbIX.jpg','2020-02-14',95,'Released','You can\'t always take what you want','Buffaloed',547012,3.5871,6.628,'LrQZpeMcM5g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45860,_binary '\0','/cREnFE1ib97ARR2K5uMg1C0Y7jY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8647400',6.5,11352,'hi','De De Pyaar De','A 50-year-old single father faces disapproval from his family and his ex-wife when he falls in love with a 26-year-old woman.','/lKxbegRPahPDeOYeaDHhsNJDZU8.jpg','2019-05-17',135,'Released',NULL,'De De Pyaar De',590401,1.9959,6.1,'iZ2HBssYX20','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45861,_binary '\0','/pQQAmsRCoFZXsJYC68NKLD8Gp5Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8647924',7,1636,'ru','Свидетели Путина','Russian Federation, December 31, 1999. After President Boris Yeltsin\'s unexpected resignation, Prime Minister Vladimir Putin becomes acting president of the country. From that day and for a year, Vitaly Mansky\'s camera documented Putin\'s rise to power. The story of a privileged witness. The harsh explanation of the reason why politics is the art of possibility of achieving the best with the support of many, but also of giving the worst in return.','/zvrk4IK00pMqrzusZr9SBBmd08a.jpg','2018-11-08',103,'Released',NULL,'Putin\'s Witnesses',527251,1.6792,6.3,'Ws94ryKSvC0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45862,_binary '\0','/hXeGcCmExxJuhZtC7SP2jeURWRN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8648880',6.8,1910,'hu','Valan - Az angyalok völgye','Peter returns to his Transilvanian hometown, Valan, where a dead body was found in the snow-capped mountains. The investigation about his 22 years missing sister leads him to the maze of grave sins of present and the past, where he has to fight not only with local criminals but his own demons too.','/tldKkvLFevOlavkadtPUCE6yPQc.jpg','2019-11-21',97,'Released',NULL,'Valan: Valley of Angels',650264,2.4586,7.2,'u_ofXc1HrS8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45863,_binary '\0','/sVWUcBHwq2LQtDeqwXzI1uMpA3h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8649186',7.7,24417,'pl','Boże Ciało','A pious 20-year-old juvenile delinquent is sent to work at a sawmill in a small town; on arrival, he dresses up as a priest and accidentally takes over the local parish. The arrival of this young, charismatic preacher is an opportunity for the local community to begin the healing process after a tragedy that happened a year prior.','/6VZlm8sEwxkE3L5nXxz17QLj1sF.jpg','2019-09-10',116,'Released','Sinner. Preacher. A Mystery.','Corpus Christi',471707,4.7572,7.6,'0dnOJnJVjyk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45864,_binary '\0','/bG8DuJcd9BqEaHB2lhAyu2NF9k9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8649190',5.7,1971,'en','Here Before','Haunted by the death of her young daughter, a distraught woman develops an all-consuming obsession with a girl she believes is her reincarnated child.','/q7zlzoBX51NtWiNAO1MdhN