 the Border',576379,3.0104,5.5,'cMLF8uFomRg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45869,_binary '\0','/jQ06O9JAFN0VfDS4ezE09pfoj2h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8652728',7.5,39196,'en','Waves','A controlling father’s attempts to ensure that his two children succeed in high school backfire after his son experiences a career-ending sports injury. Their familial bonds are eventually placed under severe strain by an unexpected tragedy.','/3xbjL0z8iH8e8L3USyeKGQrBfuZ.jpg','2019-11-15',136,'Released','Love is patient.','Waves',533444,5.982,7.369,'EhnNf9PDCUs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45870,_binary '\0','/wGwSWDG3LIQxchg2M8HV7bDqYKU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8652818',8.3,15223,'ja','劇場版 ヴァイオレット・エヴァーガーデン','As the world moves on from the war and technological advances bring changes to her life, Violet still hopes to see her lost commanding officer again.','/bajajkoErDst0JxdFyBkABiF9rW.jpg','2020-09-18',140,'Released',NULL,'Violet Evergarden: The Movie',533514,9.8874,8.3,'BUfSen2rYQs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45871,_binary '\0','/580aO5umsOX5FAFmD6ObYvVuk6p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8655470',7.4,12583,'fr','Hors Normes','For twenty years, Bruno and Malik have lived in a different world—the world of autistic children and teens. In charge of two separate nonprofit organizations (The Hatch & The Shelter), they train young people from underprivileged areas to be caregivers for extreme cases that have been refused by all other institutions. It’s an exceptional partnership, outside of traditional settings, for some quite extraordinary characters.','/zJziqrnSOzKiV0TrNVZ3AS0NMKI.jpg','2019-10-23',114,'Released',NULL,'The Specials',579245,6.2589,7.766,'gRLC6syOqDE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45872,_binary '\0','/d5UVq69fZ627qPCqfy13Wiwgs8t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8655574',6.2,1852,'fr','Venise n\'est pas en Italie','Emile is fifteen. He lives in Montargis, between a sweet-crazy father and a mother who has always dyed his hair blond, because, it seems, he is more beautiful like that. When the girl who pleases him more than anything invites him to Venice for the holidays, he is overjoyed. Only problem, his parents decide to accompany him - This is the story of a teenager born into an unclassifiable family, the story of a first love, miraculous and fragile. This is the story of an initiatory and incredible journey where life often takes unawares, but where Venice, it will be at the rendezvous.','/1avy6VRZv6UV9E8QMihm3npM9dJ.jpg','2019-05-29',95,'Released',NULL,'Venice Calling',570260,2.2479,5.9,'zKfRyGhKKv8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45873,_binary '\0','/5evLrpac7KFrAcyGp6Hi4mfCJuR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8655738',3.4,3468,'en','Eternal Code','A researcher\'s family is kidnapped after she leads efforts to withdraw her company from a collaboration. With everything on the line, only her teenage daughter can save the family with help from a suicidal veteran and a prostitute.','/k2BotDix7KZtgFqswfaZifiBDfC.jpg','2019-09-06',105,'Released','Would you kill to live forever?','Eternal Code',622761,1.1958,4.3,'2BN-F-8LSXQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45874,_binary '\0','/oKqsZr4Jq1Y3fPZ0ufgzUs2ToK2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8656686',5.5,9560,'en','Run Sweetheart Run','A woman runs for her life though the streets of Los Angeles after her blind date suddenly turns violent.','/bDkdcKOFSUaeQLgX3HuDXmxaq1d.jpg','2020-01-27',104,'Released','A first date from hell.','Run Sweetheart Run',532870,9.4833,5.536,'ZtoU_eAc1No','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45875,_binary '\0','/eepfrC6eZCyyYpBF24ftSv4Lz8h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8659750',5.1,1271,'en','Hometown Holiday','Krista is starting this New Year with a new business and a resolution to be more selective with who she dates. When Krista meets Ryan Rourke, an entertainment lawyer from LA, the two really hit it off. Ryan is in her hometown to sign a local rancher turned viral signing sensation as his new client. Now with Krista also in Rust Creek, maybe there is more of a reason to stick around. Both are holding onto things from their past and are forced to make some decisions if they truly want to be together.','/w3bGT5QJFO34axxboOOYyWMjt5V.jpg','2018-11-09',84,'Released',NULL,'Hometown Holiday',561297,1.4025,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45876,_binary '\0','/prGiKWlfqNt3dW4ujS1s6Wf66Z6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8660788',6,1638,'it','10 giorni senza mamma','A stressed-out mom takes off on a 10-day solo vacation, sending her family into chaos as the dad tries to take over the household duties.','/6u8c7EveXTjBIEtf4atScpQah8H.jpg','2019-02-07',95,'Released',NULL,'When Mom Is Away',575100,2.4753,6.497,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45877,_binary '\0','/i0srCVSNJX1QK3dL5d8JyKw6rnL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8661814',6.6,3091,'te','దేవదాస్','A sincere doctor Das works at a private clinic, where he meets the dreaded don Deva who arrives injured. After the treatment, Das and Deva form a deep friendship until Deva\'s mafia background and gruesome history causes a rift in their bond.','/gKXUai8TVBIwkMCNIXSF6f7K6WG.jpg','2018-09-27',124,'Released',NULL,'Devadas',550864,1.5944,5.913,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45878,_binary '\0','/A0mXUpING0nUWrk41f3yak9RmUg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8663446',3.4,1582,'en','Halloween at Aunt Ethel\'s','Everyone in town knows the story of Old Aunt Ethel. It\'s said she makes Halloween candy and pumpkin pie out of the kids that trick-or-treat at her house. This Halloween, the neighborhood teens are going to find out the truth.','/8GZr0fq8Vx5h6ytkGsRFFnOicYK.jpg','2019-01-02',80,'Released','Trick or treat.','Halloween at Aunt Ethel\'s',558294,1.459,3.4,'PngsfnBtKvQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45879,_binary '\0','/vHse4QK31Vc3X7BKKU5GOQhYxv6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8663516',5.7,61096,'en','Child\'s Play','Karen, a single mother, gifts her son Andy a Buddi doll for his birthday, unaware of its more sinister nature. A contemporary re-imagining of the 1988 horror classic.','/rpS7ROczWulqfaXG2klYapULXKm.jpg','2019-06-19',90,'Released','More than a toy... he\'s your best friend.','Child\'s Play',533642,11.0776,5.961,'PeHNLikDiVw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45880,_binary '\0','/4phMeITqEnShF5C3ZD0Q8YQFMAB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8664988',6,12560,'ru','Аванпост','Contact between most towns on Earth has been severed. A small ring-like area in Eastern Europe still has electricity, and maybe even life is being reported from space. What military forces find outside the ring is shocking.','/avl9MEQhtvokNnzoWepkmHBZ2ss.jpg','2019-11-21',127,'Released','Who\'s going to save you when the world falls into darkness?','The Blackout',574982,2.8001,6.5,'hrHIbnPZ96Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45881,_binary '\0','/yQFYXXfbFw2xmvDFtud8rMiPh2s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8665624',8.3,1385,'bn','হ্যাপি পিল','A medical student has to drop out of college due to unfortunate circumstances and starts running a sweet shop. However, his boring life encounters a sudden twist when he claims to have discovered the formula for a pill that can make people happy.','/fVxvd6KdYjrD3E7jeYbrIPOuews.jpg','2018-07-20',122,'Released',NULL,'Happy Pill',838647,1.5589,5,'hkfLXnspllY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45882,_binary '\0','/2xGLHs36AAPl2OdTujPkQgUcn6R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8665634',8.1,3839,'pa','ਕਿਸਮਤ','Shiva is just looking to sow some wild oats before settling down, until he falls in love with his beautiful neighbor.','/nlvV8hF1YCVazGg8PiLO004I2of.jpg','2018-09-21',140,'Released',NULL,'Qismat',552436,1.0074,7.1,'xgQcYRakbms','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45883,_binary '\0','/yxr