ircle','The Invoking 5: Phantoms',561504,1.5497,5.6,'pVgJdh2xxUI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45890,_binary '\0','/aVlBErsn8N3vdQPPSBtZFx8Wg05.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8672856',6,30898,'hi','तू झूठी मैं मक्कार','To earn extra cash, Mickey helps couples break up — but life gets complicated when he falls for Tinni, a career woman with an independent streak.','/zHLtNP4KP0GMi6p1ACf2QvVnBvI.jpg','2023-03-08',164,'Released',NULL,'Tu Jhoothi Main Makkaar',611359,2.4346,6.3,'JzGGF4JPFIQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45891,_binary '\0','/s7NC2kntiPB3WltWj9bnNTkoqUp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8675288',5,2126,'en','Fearless','A teen gamer is forced to level up to full-time babysitter when his favorite video game drops three superpowered infants from space into his backyard.','/5oQJ6HeNGWnEtP9Qyt5IZjuKI7j.jpg','2020-08-14',89,'Released',NULL,'Fearless',726664,2.8562,5.866,'jxnQFP47SzY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45892,_binary '\0','/k0DRuGYGHFMLklHMXh73b5JcoL0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8675532',5,1338,'en','The Fear Footage','On April 19th, 2016, Deputy Leo Cole vanished. The next morning, his body camera was found.','/j9rsEwoa8yO9wtLZ5h01pVLoOVi.jpg','2018-07-20',71,'Released','Expect nightmares.','The Fear Footage',551412,0.8763,6,'YzZL4yrZHfs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45893,_binary '\0','/8jCdOxVWbL0eQLRfV6CADuHFSZR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8676426',6.6,3487,'ja','ザ・ファブル','The Fable is a legendary yakuza hitman equal to none—but his boss orders him and his sultry associate to lay low and learn how to live a \"normal life\" in Osaka.','/zILJ5Dzx1NTu2ATalKQrZgTi2mS.jpg','2019-06-21',123,'Released',NULL,'The Fable',532267,2.2077,6.728,'mmio9qs8NG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45894,_binary '\0','/5zQZOjqgn1SauRZyuNYj6oUVQsO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8681422',6.7,2024,'ja','旅のおわり、世界のはじまり','A young Japanese woman named Yoko finds her cautious and insular nature tested when she travels to Uzbekistan to shoot the latest episode of her travel variety show.','/8xpueztJlNihvAnMyxqc15iYanv.jpg','2019-06-14',120,'Released',NULL,'To the Ends of the Earth',539524,2.2968,6.3,'UgKaKPP1554','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45895,_binary '\0','/3pMU7OGlcksMb7YkMthj5A1Y08B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8688634',6.7,81821,'en','21 Bridges','An embattled NYPD detective, is thrust into a citywide manhunt for a pair of cop killers after uncovering a massive and unexpected conspiracy. As the night unfolds, lines become blurred on who he is pursuing, and who is in pursuit of him.','/kDlmrGZROewneCoSwPjKx6Qfown.jpg','2019-10-24',100,'Released','The only way out is through him','21 Bridges',535292,10.0165,6.8,'Mmr3kD3Q0u0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45896,_binary '\0','/g9InC2gQmzD9EBeRXoKGKQw9lgB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8688912',7.7,2684,'te','చి ల సౌ','While Arjun doesn\'t want to get married, his parents set up a blind date for him at his place. The story revolves around Arjun, how he falls for the girl he\'s about to meet, why and how he changed his decision to get married.','/56JobIOa39A2VtJfpSbCHnx0yCb.jpg','2018-08-03',135,'Released',NULL,'Chi La Sow',540215,1.2701,7.737,'02XMyxyY3AI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45897,_binary '\0','/tAbKCQMx7Lv16KNgrIMVCQaMQYW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8689290',4.4,5066,'en','The Alpines','The Alpines is a psychological thriller that follows seven friends coming together for a weekend getaway after several years of little to no contact. They\'ve grown apart. They\'ve moved on with their lives. But the secrets of their past have come back to haunt them. This time with a very real threat ready to expose every last one.','/1feX13pcVFUOxUc3VUXQVZ4Gd6K.jpg','2021-01-19',93,'Released',NULL,'The Alpines',853566,1.3854,4.3,'m1EEc6ZjUOE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45898,_binary '\0','/7HK0A6JbdAay1DvCXOk5LGiqyyX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8693770',7.7,1253,'en','The Cold Blue','A meditation on youth, war and stunning bravery, featuring footage, taken from the National Archives, from the documentary filmed in 1943 by legendary Hollywood director William Wyler about the famous Memphis Belle flying fortress and the gripping narration from some of the last surviving B-17 pilots.','/QWiFPiyGGO5nz8pUGGKPPc9IQi.jpg','2018-05-23',74,'Released','They flew. They fought. They died. They won.','The Cold Blue',523818,1.1937,6.7,'GaynFMDdNsk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45899,_binary '\0','/4zAcbWUBuHSb4LtmFeMffAlHn4t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8694228',5.1,1925,'ml','മിഖായേൽ','A school kid commits suicide after a humiliating incident at school. All hell breaks loose as his brute businessman dad gets obsessed with finishing off all responsible for the same.','/hkwaQkUIsbevxjh7iFaX9nEPqFV.jpg','2019-01-18',150,'Released','Guardian Angel','Mikhael',573257,1.3683,4.588,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45900,_binary '\0','/kOGvlOHb4OS6C53yUNohUPOOxba.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8694374',5.8,1884,'en','Christmas at Graceland','Laurel, a Chicago-based business executive, travels to Memphis to secure one of the city\'s oldest family-owned banks. While in Memphis, Laurel reunites with old flame Clay, a local music promoter with loftier aspirations. Though Laurel tries to keep her eye on the prize of the business acquisition, Clay is very persuasive reminding her of the days when they were a performing duo on the brink of stardom. Now Laurel\'s focus turns to the home of the Blues and dreams of making music again.','/1KhJ3cxhMbgsIudXpG0coqnftLn.jpg','2018-11-17',90,'Released',NULL,'Christmas at Graceland',535808,1.8363,5.8,'aScrsfIi9Qc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45901,_binary '\0','/jBhbc2H6Xqj6wYSXKMMU9j87etp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.0