n the commanders of the Polish Home Army and the Polish Government in Exile in London. He must return quickly to Warsaw to transmit orders from the Polish PM to the Home Army\'s commander-in-chief before the start of the Warsaw uprising.','/4uWOX6yAQLHzgoX3VtZwZIVGeNk.jpg','2019-03-15',114,'Released','Every man fights his own war.','The Resistance Fighter',582494,2.9309,6.2,'RrWRSzUEcig','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45910,_binary '\0','/8X2ldTImcNyBAnFs0JSDaetNnCz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8707374',5.4,10718,'en','Hell House LLC II: The Abaddon Hotel','Eight years after the opening night tragedy of HELL HOUSE LLC, many unanswered questions remain. Thanks to an anonymous tip, an investigative journalist is convinced that key evidence is hidden inside the abandoned Abaddon Hotel. She assembles a team to break into the hotel in hopes of discovering the truth. But the source of the tip and the secrets of the Abaddon Hotel are more horrifying than any of them could have imagined.','/sFPkQLUq8wmNOL2XMow4WF5tOpu.jpg','2018-09-14',89,'Released','EIght years following the tragic events at the Abaddon Hotel, an investigation news team went searching for answers. The truth was more terrifying than they every imagined.','Hell House LLC II: The Abaddon Hotel',532973,5.74,5.736,'KlnABPwORWc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45911,_binary '\0','/mpHUz9wz3C5MNWcVVHPYOJ6bbqi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8707922',5.4,23443,'en','Can You Keep a Secret?','Emma Corrigan, a girl with a few secrets, thinks she’s about to die on a turbulent plane ride. She spills them all to the handsome stranger sitting next to her. At least, she thought he was a stranger. But then, her company’s young and elusive CEO, arrives at the office. It’s him. And he knows every single humiliating detail about her.','/uNWk5HZfVBHpARcV1z9cwUAbtpF.jpg','2019-09-13',94,'Released','The pitfalls and pleasures of telling the truth.','Can You Keep a Secret?',537739,6.7138,6.348,'3IM1vSNJw3Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45912,_binary '\0','/gxSMmT42wcJJpfuo5wGc7Xc0et1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8708304',4.8,3748,'en','I Trapped the Devil','A man descends into paranoia after trapping what he believes to be the devil in his basement, but things take a dark turn when his family unexpectedly arrive for Christmas.','/95ioOrJWlUTKskXpGLDlOpahu8.jpg','2019-04-26',84,'Released',NULL,'I Trapped the Devil',537476,2.1545,4.9,'Jae48OiyIyY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45913,_binary '\0','/3CFCXJeCtmMZlLBy6K41u1JAkrO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8708802',6.7,1416,'ja','アルキメデスの大戦','It is the early 1930s and the command of the Japanese Imperial Navy determines to construct the world\'s biggest and most formidable battleship, Yamato. One of the admirals, Yamamoto Isoroku, disagrees. He recruits the upstart and mathematics\' expert Tadashi Kai who discovers there are discrepancies between the official cost estimates and the actual figures. They soon find out that they have stumbled upon a conspiracy.','/A9Xd4wa2FdkONYv0BVdmcgxFRUS.jpg','2019-07-26',130,'Released',NULL,'The Great War of Archimedes',605389,1.9977,6.7,'jGhRxsYaYvM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45914,_binary '\0','/8oybDLEOvFdUprK8BkFLN2ZwBC1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8709036',5.4,13061,'en','A Christmas Prince: The Royal Wedding','A year after Amber helped Richard secure the crown. The two are set to tie the knot in a royal Christmas wedding — but their plans are jeopardized when Amber finds herself second-guessing whether or not she\'s cut out to be queen, and Richard is faced with a political crisis that threatens to tarnish not only the holiday season but the future of the kingdom.','/2bLQTbFWrsunSVQsvOWZAAGACbf.jpg','2018-11-30',92,'Released',NULL,'A Christmas Prince: The Royal Wedding',525041,2.8832,6.374,'Y6U-eMDmMoc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45915,_binary '\0','/3r4WLvWPGgc2fbdmoSoJOsyzh9c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8710596',6.2,8263,'en','Jungleland','Stanley manages his boxer brother Lion but when a devastating loss in the ring leaves the pair in debt, an opportunity to recoup the cash leads to a series of misadventures that threaten to break the bond between them.','/34jYoAAlkZnfyJiJWpjmrDc9zFR.jpg','2020-11-06',90,'Released',NULL,'Jungleland',556501,3.3824,6.398,'iLXtENg8xKo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45916,_binary '\0','/1GYIRo2gAjVCjafgl2Lc0VGwhl3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8712750',3.9,2085,'en','A.M.I.','A seventeen year old girl forms a co-dependent relationship with an artificial intelligence on her phone and goes on a murderous rampage.','/w0cKsuHniet8s8FLkbCAKwfV9N0.jpg','2019-07-02',77,'Released','Evil has a new friend.','A.M.I.',612587,1.357,4.5,'tSRBugiu78Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45917,_binary '\0','/hdg43qLc48v5RA3se6ca74tbOJf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8716334',8.5,2578,'en','Springsteen on Broadway','Bruce Springsteen shares personal stories from his life and acoustic versions of some of his best-known songs in an intimate one-man show.','/ng9F8AbD82ldwwdZpCvTAUAQ0rr.jpg','2018-12-15',153,'Released',NULL,'Springsteen on Broadway',563708,1.6246,7.86,'M1xDzgob1JI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45918,_binary '\0','/3tt3tp81aGboViMplQItugAI2RO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8716800',4.7,1613,'pt','Cinderela Pop','Cintia is modern princess, she\'s connected, decided and loves music. This \"pop\" princess used to live with their parents in a huge castle with a nice view to the city. Every night she looked through the window and watch the view dreaming with a prince she didn\'t met yet. But one day her castle crumbles with everything around her, after her parents divorce she went to live with her aunt and stops believing in love. What she didn\'t knew was that there was a charming prince in her history, that wanted to break the ice around our modern day cinderella.','/rhEMGSlmtfvUYdGuE3M1dB0SmOA.jpg','2019-02-28',94,'Released',NULL,'DJ Cinderella',553608,1.9078,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45919,_binary '\0','/pqkfLWVKNER4KMGiDmRMhVlzLIk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8717446',6.6,6746,'en','Blackbird','A terminally ill mother invites her family to their country house for one final gathering, but tensions quickly boil over between her two daughters.','/c4GpcTZjX8zIU9RbG7j6w7OJFua.jpg','2019-09-06',98,'Released',NULL,'Blackbird',536396,4.8505,6.8,'I9kb6ZJre78','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45920,_binary '\0','/lghWedsBBl3lPlIs4EpZpP64mUT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8718158',6.2,36491,'en','The Hating Game','Resolving to achieve professional success without compromising her ethics, Lucy embarks on a ruthless game of one-upmanship against cold and efficient nemesis Joshua, a rivalry that is complicated by her growing attraction to him.','/prbZxJxGcy07y60eq8lCGMciTYz.jpg','2021-12-09',102,'Released','He\'s the one she loves to hate.','The Hating Game',603661,10.0713,7.3,'a9toRWhKaqk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45921,_binary '\0','/jm2kJQZRmYRzHJzB07oOOVDiQD1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8718300',4.8,8065,'en','Proximity','A young NASA JPL scientist is abducted by extraterrestrials but when no one believes his story he becomes obsessed with finding proof which leads him on a journey of discovery.','/nto7dx8vmqESDU484huGoSt4o48.jpg','2020-05-15',119,'Released','They have arrived.','Proximity',693158,4.9997,6.8,'vakNakzL25A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45922,_binary '\0','/rKe3MR2u4ZZ0y9uKivzKJRrqBCe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8721424',7.5,130210,'en','tick, tick... BOOM!','On the brink of turning 30, a promising theater composer navigates love, friendship and the pressure to create something great before time runs out.','/DPmfcuR8fh8ROYXgd