927,_binary '\0','/qPTEsaY7MIg2OJyrO2xEG6lxG4X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8723216',4.7,3049,'tl','Eerie','The unexpected and gruesome death of a student threatens the existence of an old Catholic school for girls. Pat Consolacion, the school guidance counselor, involves herself with the students in the hopes of helping them cope, and at the same time uncover the mysteries of the student’s death. Most students suspect of the strict and borderline abusive Mother Alice, who also threatened Pat’s tenure in the school because of her continuous meddling with the case. But Pat’s unusual talents lead her to knowing Eri, a former student who\'s been watching the whole school for years. Piece by piece, Pat uncovers the secret of the school and the monster that it nurtured for the past century.','/duEI37Qjtt1WaiOzZzVlkI6JO2z.jpg','2019-03-27',101,'Released',NULL,'Eerie',522246,1.3327,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45928,_binary '\0','/vsJhllg03dDAB4LkXelRI1xozDT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8725958',6.7,1880,'ko','강변호텔','An aging poet summons his estranged sons to the hotel he is staying at because he feels his death is near; meanwhile, he encounters two women staying at the hotel.','/aJTWDnOjD7BDQmWnhFb7LPHlk0I.jpg','2019-02-15',96,'Released',NULL,'Hotel by the River',535550,2.3547,6.4,'3x0aZS6uY7E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45929,_binary '\0','/8eb9A1sI7Gfu2xn9R7vxOvU5gWt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8726098',6.4,1504,'es','Tarde para morir joven','During a very dry summer in an isolated community far from the city. Sofia, Clara and Lucas face their first loves and fears, while preparing the New Year\'s party, without knowing that nature threatens them.','/ezypWqGmkhtRt9I9LpLUwzZNfC3.jpg','2019-03-19',110,'Released',NULL,'Too Late to Die Young',515929,1.6719,5.943,'DeKTP516Iuc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45930,_binary '\0','/irIuILtKW7ySj7QUkAvSsA6Jy3O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8726116',6.2,1665,'zh','幻土','A cop in Singapore investigates the disappearance of a Chinese migrant construction worker who spent sleepless nights playing a mysterious video game.','/9SDdIlpQ3dkhBFy6se2STiWvujZ.jpg','2019-02-06',95,'Released','Land. Labour. Love. Loss.','A Land Imagined',537526,1.7288,5.891,'c-kwmYRVMyU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45931,_binary '\0','/x2QAsHlrtL8DdsXqrtvQWBZ1olM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8726180',5.8,1570,'en','นางนอน','When a youth football team of 12 boys, aged 11-16, and their 25-year-old coach is trapped deep inside a cave in Northern Thailand, thousands of volunteers and soldiers from around the world unite in a race against time to find them.','/f33covTdn10G4IE7fJ0RbDU9l7K.jpg','2019-11-21',103,'Released','Based on the incredible true story that captivated the world.','Cave Rescue',547090,2.6277,5.9,'Bfd3tbhPAbg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45932,_binary '\0','/oLxuAGR58NMBYRiMtaXRnkWY4c2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8727582',7.1,5264,'en','Circus of Books','For decades, a nice Jewish couple ran Circus of Books, a porn shop and epicenter for gay LA. Their director daughter documents their life and times.','/y19U39IccjFpn70UmYIET9B3dBV.jpg','2019-04-26',92,'Released','Neighbourhood entrepreneurs, local heroes','Circus of Books',597594,1.483,6.8,'Cxksd8ytFJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45933,_binary '\0','/ni4ejIhMkBvdUNA5i1Eo2qYOuMO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8732914',6.7,2585,'en','Road to Christmas','Los Angeles television producer Maggie Baker unwittingly falls for Danny Wise, the son and former producer of his mother’s popular annual Christmas special Julia Wise Lifestyle. When Maggie’s secret plan to reunite Danny and his two brothers with Julia during the live broadcast in Vermont goes awry, Maggie is reminded that above all, it is the love for family and friends that makes the merriest of Christmas.','/7F46Dl9oHsVjd