who are attempting to organize a wedding party, but soon find everything going wrong.','/qYXepvYtI1DHtCyZTff3UbHFhzg.jpg','2019-10-02',96,'Released','A recipe for disaster','Axone',627072,0.9814,6.083,'jAW1U8PLwY0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45956,_binary '\0','/xh4NhfDVjAK55qWdX1VWDg91ucN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8747560',8.4,2227,'ta','கே.டி.','As his children plot his death to claim their inheritance, an aging patriarch leaves home, befriending a spunky boy who adds direction to his life.','/7xwBhwz89UtTgp8KiCbwz7QP2Xs.jpg','2019-11-22',119,'Released',NULL,'K. D.',589964,0.9425,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45957,_binary '\0','/53gm0xVFw6pxXs0suzLiXb5VXMW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8748256',5.8,4498,'tr','Yol Arkadaşım 2','Onur and Seref have become both housemates and colleagues within a year. Seref is not successful in managing the song career of Onur.','/mAaT4gqrvwGpvZ29dvpgkb8esTf.jpg','2018-10-12',116,'Released',NULL,'My Travel Buddy 2',549650,1.4999,5.7,'Y9pQ_6Lfa7U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45958,_binary '\0','/B4ZhigHvuOj0LRIbDQBWn7EF60.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8748608',5,3813,'tr','Deliler','The true story of 7 oddly dressed fearless men of ottoman army fight against cruel Vlad.','/cSCuvcNM4SvMK5hUNDD94V0NjRP.jpg','2018-11-23',121,'Released',NULL,'Vlad the Impaler',540841,2.4085,5.7,'xu7mqgkoN9k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45959,_binary '\0','/zXKZsSPrd8jRnt97nxxx5t7SZbR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8749074',7.1,1386,'en','Friedkin Uncut','An introspective insight into the life and artistic journey of William Friedkin, an extraordinary and offbeat director of cult films such as The French Connection, The Exorcist, Sorcerer, Cruising, To Live and Die in L.A. and Killer Joe. For the first time Friedkin opens up, guiding the audience on a fascinating journey through the themes and the stories that have influenced his life and