ts set on invading Themyscira, Wonder Woman’s paradise home. The battle will be epic, because if there\'s one thing an Amazon knows, it’s war!','/w1SBqj0fn1j72ST5i1jauWo3swT.jpg','2019-10-04',83,'Released','Her greatest fight will be the one to get home.','Wonder Woman: Bloodlines',537055,5.9673,6.8,'6ljM52nZTAs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45969,_binary '\0','/jG6bfsahRPUQhXJcBrJrnWnK2BQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8753438',6.3,1981,'no','Askeladden - I Soria Moria slott','When the King and Queen are poisoned, brothers Per and Pål get arrested, suspected of being behind it. Younger brother Espen \"Ash Lad\" and Princess Kristin set out on a quest to find the mythical Soria Moria castle, which is said to be built of pure gold. In Soria Moria, there sits a well containing the Water of Life; the only thing that can cure Kristin\'s parents. But some wicked Danes are also on the hunt to find the castle. If Espen and Kristin fail, it will spell the end for the brothers, the kingdom - and perhaps the entire world.','/5LVjFm8tGRtpapvexWi6RaXEHOC.jpg','2019-08-23',99,'Released',NULL,'The Ash Lad: In Search of the Golden Castle',561557,2.9892,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45970,_binary '\0','/cyAiY7pBfkEwzL5EVIxCDTNE1eK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8753660',5.6,1917,'pt','Exterminadores do Além Contra a Loira do Banheiro','A group of three youtubers who call themselves experts in supernatural beings decide to win public recognition once and for all. For this they plot a plan to capture a being known to all. It is the spirit of a light-haired woman who died in an unknown way and who haunts the bathrooms of schools across the country: the blonde in the bathroom.','/jXChjh6YQFNDH5mUd0A2Fs7DjFE.jpg','2018-11-29',103,'Released',NULL,'Ghost Killers vs. Bloody Mary',560491,2.1904,5.698,'IgG_ncWc3js','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45971,_binary '\0','/bVbOOjbtvlMShUNfrVQxPmZiII2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8755316',6.2,2237,'zh','一出好戏','A cataclysmic event causes a man, who dreams of winning the lottery, to become stranded on an island with his co-workers.','/gHCKsCcjGwERPGvZa4JUrfKbi2F.jpg','2018-08-10',134,'Released',NULL,'The Island',535170,2.5792,6.655,'lLtNiDDb5yk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45972,_binary '\0','/rVyaYSUr9K9BxpRj748Ceft3MYK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8758086',4.9,4300,'en','Mercy Black','A woman is sent to a mental institution after stabbing her classmate in an attempt to conjure an evil spirit called, Mercy Black. Fifteen years later she\'s released, and must save her nephew, who has become obsessed with the phenomenon.','/6e0eblwQS11J5ZBb5PNoigCKWGB.jpg','2019-03-24',87,'Released','She\'ll take away your hurt if you promise her your pain.','Mercy Black',590164,2.3273,6,'CvhcxbHl7pg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45973,_binary '\0','/ufe8htgu6gr1Bozs272jZFJsjNi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8758548',7.5,2796,'en','The Great Buster: A Celebration','A celebration of the life and career of one of America\'s most influential and celebrated filmmakers and comedians—Buster Keaton—whose singular style and fertile output during the silent era created his legacy as a true cinematic visionary.','/4quZfHND8eOqdYXbCKeRG4wc5VI.jpg','2018-10-05',102,'Released',NULL,'The Great Buster: A Celebration',539199,2.5096,7.2,'HsffUJBYya0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45974,_binary '\0','/lIIbPJcItE8OLXhWDspo51DND7j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8759834',5,1436,'en','Selah and the Spades','Paloma, the new girl at an esteemed prep school, is drawn into the daily aggressions of warring senior class factions. She joins the Spades and becomes friends with the Spades’ leader, an enigmatic and scheming cheerleader named Selah.','/1RVmMc4q2eulNma9vPetRAohdjE.jpg','2019-01-27',97,'Released','Private school, hard knocks.','Selah and the Spades',543727,2.442,5.2,'-nK6WFgdchM','Y