umour in check. He eats properly, exercises and lives properly, but all of this self-consciousness makes him more and more depressed. When he realises that his beloved wife plans to leave him, he decides to take his own life.','/g8eXWirzPtjRG5n8JHcuqSN30ch.jpg','2019-11-21',90,'Released','You can check out but you can never leave.','Exit Plan',538715,2.8453,5.9,'NKi4dJd5X0c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45983,_binary '\0','/27xckIk5qdMina9WEtnMjp3oJHX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8767908',6.8,10453,'fr','Matthias & Maxime','Two childhood best friends are asked to share a kiss for the purposes of a student short film. Soon, a lingering doubt sets in, confronting both men with their preferences, threatening the brotherhood of their social circle, and, eventually, changing their lives.','/j3DI3UjYBRqIbO1keUU1Bzn5qG6.jpg','2019-10-09',120,'Released','Best friends forever.','Matthias & Maxime',519141,4.4657,7.069,'BJ-5OujmDEw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45984,_binary '\0','/83upwwmrPHzIDVfmdXusNAUSAks.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8769032',6.9,3228,'tl','The Hows of Us','A young couple dream of growing old together as they deal with the struggles of being in a long-term relationship.','/2O3SS7Gh2OuKdzxi2bEOi7zNVue.jpg','2018-08-29',117,'Released','I may not have found a reason to stay, but I found a reason to come back.','The Hows of Us',543688,1.8116,6.8,'9C5w28q6JgA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45985,_binary '\0','/wuAC0SCkaxIMi7Uf7DfZRYCR4lF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8769146',5.2,1840,'ru','Союз спасения','Russian troops occupied Paris. Russia became the first power in the world. Now everything seems possible. Young winners, guards officers, are sure that equality and freedom will come - here and now. For this they are ready to sacrifice everything - position, wealth, love, life ... and the country itself.','/AhxKrNJE0Gt2BPWAOLqRS5Syhu9.jpg','2019-12-26',130,'Released','We left, we can not return.','Union of Salvation',517034,2.0711,6.2,'dHpaNjLWoDU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45986,_binary '\0','/vJ1zEudAE2p5TIpEiNk929ZWPnl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8769300',5.6,2437,'en','Rise of the Footsoldier 4: Marbella','Fresh out of prison, Pat Tate steps right back into his Essex nightclub business. But although the money is good, he can\'t stop brooding about the man who had him put away. It\'s not long before he\'s off to Marbella to find Frank Harris and seek his revenge.','/dG6tYDZMZaQIpOHzA44GlpVn2v5.jpg','2019-11-08',85,'Released',NULL,'Rise of the Footsoldier 4: Marbella',570614,2.5375,5.5,'Pr7IkS3IgXY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45987,_binary '\0','/aY15qmHdkkHat8ew54BJ2iA5HMu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8769848',5.9,2690,'en','The Tomorrow Man','Ed Hemsler spends his life preparing for a disaster that may never come. Ronnie Meisner spends her life shopping for things she may never use. In a small town somewhere in America, these two people will try to find love while trying not to get lost in each other’s stuff.','/7YVxf3nUxrJ2xX4SU7Efp7LqPZ5.jpg','2019-05-22',94,'Released',NULL,'The Tomorrow Man',565391,2.8015,5.8,'WKzLjjYnWnU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45988,_binary '\0','/aAM3cQmYGjjLQ24m0F0RWfjKQ57.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8772262',7.1,497753,'en','Midsommar','Several friends travel to Sweden to study as anthropologists a summer festival that is held every ninety years in the remote hometown of one of them. What begins as a dream vacation in a place where the sun never sets, gradually turns into a dark nightmare as the mysterious inhabitants invite them to participate in their disturbing festive activities.','/7LEI8ulZzO5gy9Ww2NVCrKmHeDZ.jpg','2019-07-03',147,'Released','Let the festivities begin.','Midsommar',530385,21.2893,7.144,'1Vnghdsjmd0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(45989,_binary '\0','/7TxeZVg2evMG