y the greatest hunter in the world, but also one of its most feared.','/1GvBhRxY6MELDfxFrete6BNhBB5.jpg','2024-12-11',127,'Released','Villains aren\'t born. They\'re made.','Kraven the Hunter',539972,33.4773,6.4,'hR1-ihzff3I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46001,_binary '\0','/gXzct3iJ0R3msugeNUw8ylLBuPw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8795582',6.8,2893,'sl','Posledice','After being sent to a youth detention centre, 18-year-old Andrej has to fight for his place within the group of inmates while getting closer to Željko, their informal leader, and struggling to keep his repressed secret in the dark.','/v2VE7f5addFwBcUhHSciJSVr22E.jpg','2018-10-18',93,'Released','Everyone has secrets.','Consequences',539504,1.7763,6,'Cjz0467GtkA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46002,_binary '\0','/ks7PNbmkcxBoSLxF4bBbqiEofHP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8800266',6.7,10071,'es','Ema','Ema is a magnetic and impulsive dancer in a reggaeton troupe. Her toxic marriage to choreographer Gastón is beyond repair, following a decision to give up on their adopted child Polo. She sets out on a mission to get him back, not caring who she’ll need to fight, seduce or destroy to make it happen.','/9p78EwUeo7NkFFCIBzU8jwxC867.jpg','2019-09-26',107,'Released','She has a plan.','Ema',540709,2.6218,6.7,'3xVGjzPaV6s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46003,_binary '\0','/koiGz0q1Ept2r1NB6BkwBH6s2QO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8800384',5.9,2194,'hr','Posljednji Srbin u Hrvatskoj','Croatia, seven years after bankruptcy. There is a fight going on in the world - water has become more precious than oil. In order to get hold of it, the powerful are ready to start wars, conquer, destroy, and even plant a zombie-virus. Mico, a bon viveur from Zagreb, whose daily routine includes massage parlours, restaurants and cinemas, where he watches a movie series featuring his favorite actress Franka Anic, is caught completely off guard by the zombie-epidemics. Nevertheless, he boldly embarks on an Odyssey accompanied by his movie heroine, with one highly unattainable, goal: to survive.','/fmtObslYunXEr0wffiCHDKsm49P.jpg','2019-02-28',86,'Released',NULL,'The Last Serb in Croatia',582732,1.6205,5,'VtP0bQgu7Og','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46004,_binary '\0','/6G0cdDkI0D7xgPXW8TcVcee6aNW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8801584',5.8,2142,'en','Sunrise in Heaven','A true love story that spans a lifetime but eventually results in a painful loss of love. Jan is the daughter of an overly protective militant father, but that doesn\'t stop her from falling love with Steve, a young GI in the Air Force.','/a8cOgXD0v1RHP9g4ODYIHX0slOY.jpg','2019-04-09',85,'Released',NULL,'Sunrise in Heaven',593911,1.9679,6.4,'dtYC0ShD8lI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46005,_binary '\0','/pOCS7XWZ2gD53EaEiLU2br1DK4h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8801666',6.8,2291,'sv','Världens vackraste pojke','In 1971, due to the world premiere of Death in Venice, Italian director Lucino Visconti proclaimed his Tadzio as the world’s most beautiful boy. A shadow that today, 50 years later, weighs Björn Andrésen’s life.','/hNlnSwj34gemONfbBxaG8Trd1vR.jpg','2021-07-30',93,'Released',NULL,'The Most Beautiful Boy in the World',730028,4.3031,7.3,'movf4weZq30','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46006,_binary '\0','/b5kpxmzIXMhccMxWZkeRvgi1TJF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8804580',3.2,6805,'en','Attack of the Unknown','A SWAT team transporting a vicious crime syndicate boss must fight their way out of a county detention center during a catastrophic alien invasion.','/c5wDSjzstchAAN3cnVEhAlo10eC.jpg','2020-08-28',103,'Released','They\'re here for blood','Attack of the Unknown',733006,2.5491,4.2,'VuVOiQyE1JY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46007,_binary '\0','/wCLbSw3hSQBB0iwruUzuDvMq37D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8805150',2.8,2528,'en','Frenzy','A group of friends run a popular travel vlog that helps fund their adventures. The leader of the group brings along her younger sister for the next scuba diving trip to an isolated cove. But when their plane crashes, the two sisters must use their strength, resourcefulness and immense courage to survive a pack of great white sharks.','/kkTLgg5BkDFIuiRVESg8rRpsRbh.jpg','2018-08-15',85,'Released','Survival is her only option','Frenzy',542787,2.1803,3.8,'nZ3t3FBrc0E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46008,_binary '\0','/oKXLdkWsva7SoXF7KjKwn6weBdM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8805486',5.4,2660,'ar','البدلة','The events revolve around Akram, who receives an invitation to attend a masquerade party. He decides to wear police uniforms, which causes him to suffer a crisis as a police officer, while looking for a particular file.','/qYmdApNCqwDN6Q09NQeJBQPUAFs.jpg','2018-08-21',96,'Released',NULL,'The Suit',532108,1.4403,5.8,'Yh9L0ZGAB-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46009,_binary '\0','/oCi1Qk3jhmxHZ333ckJE52Cpcq3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8806104',5.8,4156,'en','The Dead Center','When a mysterious \"John Doe\" wakes up in a morgue and wanders into a psychiatric ward, a devoted doctor and curious medical examiner must slowly uncover dark and sinister secrets about the man that reveal a more horrifying truth than they could have ever imagined.','/cMvuo4DianPqhp6rvuvTkiICTCS.jpg','2019-10-11',93,'Released',NULL,'The Dead Center',549859,1.9602,5.77,'4bgkq5IwRvY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46010,_binary '\0','/jL745VTojxtLCVBYGWlyQ2HRjCf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8806768',5.6,2152,'es','Lo dejo cuando quiera','Pedro, Arturo and Eligio are three college professors who lost their job because of economic crisis. Accidentally they find a solution for all of their problems; a multi-vitamin that allows them to party all night long without any side effects. The three professors will be launched into the world of nightclubs and the shady business, in order to market the merchandise. Of course, it seems that they are not as prepared for it as they thought.','/k5LP414yqZSaRAZf9uVh1ufO2mN.jpg','2019-04-12',98,'Released',NULL,'I Can Quit Whenever I Want',574370,1.6446,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46011,_binary '\0','/1EjNuIgHThvAkB5y6SxNCECIpLR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8806886',7,1297,'de','Label Me','Sex is power, and Waseem, a Syrian gay-for-pay hustler seeking asylum in Cologne, wields it like a shield. Keeping his johns at an emotional arm’s length while satisfying their most carnal desires in order to eke out a living, he meets his match in Lars: a kind, affluent professional with a growing personal interest in Waseem. This gripping tale of transactional identity explores the tactical exchange of trust and intimacy in a partnership, and the divisions between immigrants and their host countries in contemporary Europe.','/60ujqiAv0d6Sah9Ys3RmEYlQFCp.jpg','2019-01-15',60,'Released',NULL,'Label Me',612429,1.8906,5.9,'btQW0PCtkjw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46012,_binary '\0','/srwaTADIofF5jGrG3izgQqES5WY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8809652',3.7,4776,'en','10 Minutes Gone','Crime boss Rex hires Frank and his crew to steal a priceless jewel stash — but the job goes wrong when someone tips off the cops. After Frank suffers a blow to the head, he wakes up to find the jewels gone and no memory of his attacker. Now, Frank must confront his team members one by one to find the traitor — before Rex covers his tracks by having Frank murdered.','/i8lVYRplWdCEqYOutxpxeCtaD2a.jpg','2019-09-30',96,'Released','Keep your enemies close','10 Minutes Gone',552865,4.7106,5.2,'0y64uVFTi4c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46013,_binary '\0','/7BI6JkFoXPud0x5upjI2XXdZ0U0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8809750',6.9,1490,'ja','ラストレター','It is only at their sister\'s and mother\'s funeral when a woman meets her niece after many years. The niece is now a grown girl. The sister takes on the task of informing the deceased\'s friends of the death while the daughter cannot bring herself to symbolically accept the demise of her mother. In the midst of all this an old flame messages the sister to say he is still in love with her, but is he messaging the living sister or the dead one?','/ow3bl4VyCdpUd4hLgkkZJVMfgax.jpg','2020-01-17',120,'Released',NULL,'Last Letter',542807,1.8626,7,'ORfRliWCV08','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46014,_binary '\0','/rza0gAHK8KvsuqVyoSGj3duwP9V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8811382',7.2,3019,'en','Meeting Gorbachev','Mikhail Gorbachev, former president of the Soviet Union, sits down with filmmaker Werner Herzog to discuss his many achievements. Topics include the talks to reduce nuclear weapons, the reunification of Germany and the dissolution of his country.','/9Xdr25dhbCVSeoht6SdZO2AKgMS.jpg','2019-05-03',95,'Released',NULL,'Meeting Gorbachev',541576,1.6431,6.5,'ZcTWadiv6vI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46015,_binary '\0','/heZQmyNvkH236ha2M3JckdUQQqb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8814476',5.8,97884,'en','Supergirl','When an unexpected and ruthless adversary strikes too close to home, Kara Zor-El, aka Supergirl, reluctantly joins forces with an unlikely companion on an epic, interstellar journey of vengeance and justice.','/uhzRnTW4DM13UQBvZP3eVNzQTuz.jpg','2026-06-24',108,'Released','Truth. Justice. Whatever.','Supergirl',1081003,67.173,6.67,'YqdAEdkHrwo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46016,_binary '\0','/xsMqT1i7V5qmUluCDk547pZmNgN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8814500',4.1,3143,'en','Cryo','Five scientists awake from a cryogenic sleep and find themselves trapped in an underground facility. With no memory of who they are or how long they\'ve been asleep, they begin to realize they may have been part of a scientific experiment gone wrong. After a series 