trait of resilience, Alex Holmes chronicles the unprecedented journey of 24-year-old Tracy Edwards and the first all-female sailing crew to enter the Whitbread Round the World Race.','/19rEZWy1c8vv9ZALuMr0DNXMvF6.jpg','2019-03-08',93,'Released','They were told no because they were women. This is the true story that proved everyone wrong.','Maiden',543093,1.0907,7.5,'OMBM10cBhIs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46054,_binary '\0','/7NaxCPvv43Th6WltOlmkFlU9iz5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8880922',4,4243,'sv','Se upp för Jönssonligan','Following a failed heist, Charles-Ingvar ‘Sickan’ Jonsson ends up in prison. Once released, his gang have become law-abiding citizens and Sickan has to continue on his own. Crime broker Anita tasks him with a simple burglary, but it turns out to be something a lot bigger than Sickan thought it was. Now he needs the help of his past accomplices to carry out the most difficult heist in the history of the gang.','/yt5ufod5cHe4GK4Uaxu5Evvxo9S.jpg','2021-10-07',116,'Released','Disorganized Crime','The Jonsson Gang',574095,2.0359,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46055,_binary '\0','/eEF2L9hfUh25g7Vd4AVEhwxLxGr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8881102',5.8,1243,'de','Sweethearts','It\'s double trouble when fate and an ill-executed diamond robbery throw Mel and Franny together in a race and chase against time.','/wETpfUcZhtGYbW98zJspC3ush7s.jpg','2019-02-14',107,'Released',NULL,'Sweethearts',573042,1.8056,5.932,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46056,_binary '\0','/maxRhndtC4BJABvqRPvYNu69CHA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8883486',5.9,15247,'en','Medieval','The story of fifteenth century Czech icon and warlord, Jan Zizka, who defeated armies of the Teutonic Order and the Holy Roman Empire.','/eeUNWsdoiOijOZAMaWFDA5Pb1n8.jpg','2022-09-08',126,'Released','For honor. For justice. For freedom.','Medieval',551271,5.3481,6.9,'HNFk6FY5MRw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.00000