ir school bus after an encounter with a mysterious creature on the road. Amid constant threats from the creature, the teen\'s anxiety increases while their survival chances decrease.','/miO9vSJsONyQAjkALVp74dCSbYX.jpg','2020-09-25',80,'Released','Not every road leads you home','Shortcut',684684,2.9443,5.3,'3TJrPwpEpIM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46124,_binary '\0','/gRBToD4AcpWJhHQraA69CeMLNXu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8960382',5.2,33666,'te','రాధే శ్యామ్','Vikramaditya, a world-renowned palmist, believes love does not exist in his stars, until he meets Prerana. But when destiny tries to pull them apart, will love prevail?','/szAa23SWNIgJHsvSRyQrvyFT8ef.jpg','2022-03-10',138,'Released','It\'s all written in the stars.','Radhe Shyam',673392,2.3567,5.174,'GGmK2iW9ZgM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46125,_binary '\0','/7xnfYbmBNWt48RpLtR7XsY6hF6i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8963708',7.6,15833,'ka','და ჩვენ ვიცეკვეთ','Merab, a devoted dancer, has been training for years with his partner Mary for a spot in the National Georgian Ensemble. The arrival of another male dancer, Irakli, sparks both an intense rivalry and romantic desire that may cause Merab to risk his future in dance as well as his relationships.','/zP8Gg0wLJuqXGlrrD3mEu0M4kMa.jpg','2019-09-13',113,'Released',NULL,'And Then We Danced',597088,3.1586,7.2,'GmjDLJ7dkHg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46126,_binary '\0','/4Va2wodBY6pi8lzJFwkGDePlp80.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8964540',5.6,11161,'en','Stream','As the Keenans try to bring their family closer together, they unwittingly enter themselves into a game of life or death. With four deranged killers patrolling the halls of their hotel and competing for the most creative kills, the odds are definitely stacked against them.','/az0k8pzdeqrrEO9iu8vL081bjA0.jpg','2024-08-21',123,'Released','Blood on the ground, points on the board.','Stream',806731,2.7265,5.4,'fE2xsAN43