diction after his intense relationship with his girlfriend turbulently ends.','/iHPF4rt8HTuDZzNH1L2FCiPzN48.jpg','2019-06-20',172,'Released',NULL,'Kabir Singh',577328,1.8697,6.332,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46149,_binary '\0','/9oxnEX2n45E2JvFokWAdTGeG0lx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8983218',6.2,1221,'pa','Shadaa','Amidst pressures from his parents to hurry up and wed, a young man seeks his perfect match. After many failed attempts with matchmakers, his parents are delighted when their son finally meets the woman of his dreams but things do not go as planned.','/saZ5hon73b7BgbRWNpUC0h6uQM6.jpg','2019-06-21',129,'Released',NULL,'Shadaa',613032,1.4653,5,'ti94DXKnmkE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46150,_binary '\0','/gQ2WBHNzOfXD0vMoIM0kzH5gh8o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8983220',3.3,6938,'hi','हंगामा २','A farcical comedy involving two families. Kapoors are headed by Colonel, who stays with his younger son, while Tiwaris are a childless couple. The lives of Kapoors and Tiwaris were as neat and perfect until one day a woman shows up at the door with an illegitimate child. Who is the father of this child?','/1cB0Zml2lfsbeGrLo1YoFpu5HdH.jpg','2021-07-23',156,'Released','Confusion Unlimited','Hungama 2',658075,1.5792,4.421,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46151,_binary '\0','/dVUjVIaxHFqTKhTAAUhFln8heo3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8983228',7.4,26284,'hi','झुंड','A retired sports teacher transforms a bunch of teenage slum goons into disciplined football players against all odds.','/A5rzrjzdzEuPX7Gcc4KphutBejj.jpg','2022-03-04',178,'Released','Not \'Jhund\'! Call it a team','Jhund',665685,1.0504,6.769,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46152,_binary '\0','/mssCqICnOv70yv0JHsCgaFvMAMe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt8983230',6,2646,'pl','Broad Peak','After climbing Broad Peak mountain, Maciej Berbeka learns his journey to the summit is incomplete. 25 years later, he sets out to 