w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46197,_binary '\0','/rH60D4bS64CYGBIXps9OgSDl3RT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9023964',5.7,11462,'en','Silent Zone','In a zombie-ravaged world, a resourceful teen and her protector fight for survival, facing relentless dangers and testing the limits of hope and loyalty.','/7YZ0JRRD7mt8Ov9eIEGWMbDybx2.jpg','2025-03-07',118,'Released','The dead are listening.','Silent Zone',1419229,3.173,6,'lueXEoYVlNg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46198,_binary '\0','/qus9J3gLXDc1U2czHKtKvxhJtrJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9024106',5.5,12180,'en','Unplanned','As one of the youngest Planned Parenthood clinic directors in the nation, Abby Johnson was involved in upwards of 22,000 abortions and counseled countless women on their reproductive choices. Her passion surrounding a woman\'s right to choose led her to become a spokesperson for Planned Parenthood, fighting to enact legislation for the cause she so deeply believed in. Until the day she saw something that changed everything.','/tvCtAz8z5tF49a7q9RRHvxiTjzv.jpg','2019-03-21',109,'Released','What she saw changed everything.','Unplanned',576071,2.0605,6.8,'2Vyqzevw97c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46199,_binary '\0','/es0N3A6vkLz2EmJavnM2M4urOEO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9024562',4.6,1469,'en','Saint Clare','In a small town a solitary woman is haunted by voices that lead her to assassinate ill intended people and get away with it, until her last kill sucks her down a rabbit hole riddled with corruption, trafficking and visions from the beyond.','/aE0q4awk7zto3Eql4cAeJuVAns9.jpg','2025-07-18',92,'Released',NULL,'Saint Clare',1026222,2.2446,5.1,'nwTKf9niMIU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46200,_binary '\0','/ihqU4YHveA0XKnKw5V4o1KTOXog.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9026184',4.7,11918,'en','Girl on the Third Floor','Don Koch tries to renovate a rundown mansion with a sordid history for his growing family, only to learn that the house has other plans.','/gm5JXIMPxRMFNeEtzso3VUDXQSs.jpg','2019-10-25',93,'Released','Home is where hell is','Girl on the Third Floor',580630,2.7975,5.2,'AGXg3-eo8yE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46201,_binary '\0','/yXd502k4b4hsrLobBZgJaVUMNfK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9026524',5.9,6520,'en','Bliss','In need of creative inspiration, a professionally stagnant and hard-partying Los Angeles artist recklessly indulges in a series of drug binges. As the narcotics fly out of control, so does her newfound and inexplicable, yet unquenchable, craving for blood.','/7RNSpMb6UfujkEy4fKgubbeXx6j.jpg','2019-09-27',80,'Released',NULL,'Bliss',586586,2.744,5.666,'OI8fjr4Va7Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46202,_binary '\0','/xlRj6Bitk7eInieVAjyHgYD1iMT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9028784',6.3,1739,'en','Christmas at Grand Valley','Burned out from the hubbub of the Chicago gallery world, artist Kelly returns home to the picturesque Grand Valley just in time for Christmas. Leo, businessman and all-star dad to his children, struggles to balance his time this holiday season. When he is assigned to review a hotel in Grand Valley for its value, he sees this as the perfect opportunity for a Christmas family vacation. It isn’t long until Kelly and Leo’s worlds collide.','/R8O6BlBD2J8N0Z5EI6fjuWQTDS.jpg','2018-12-22',84,'Released',NULL,'Christmas at Grand Valley',550024,2.6888,6.4,'JKJwcslxNqQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46203,_binary '\0','/m8OoI9YgG27uxbMyYYqRWRY87VI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9028802',6.3,1305,'en','Christmas Everlasting','Christmas is fast approaching and years of long workdays employed at New York’s top corporate law firm are about to pay off now that Lucy Toomey will be made partner after the New Year. However, when Alice, her older sister with special needs, unexpectedly passes away, Lucy returns back to Nilson’s Bay, Wis., to attend the funeral and handle her estate. While Lucy dreads returning to her childhood home, she also feels real sorrow that she was too busy to take her sister’s last call. Once back in Nilson’s Bay, Lucy meets Peter, her old high school sweetheart and Alice’s former attorney, who informs her of the terms of Alice’s eccentric will that states in order for Lucy to inherit the family home, she must live there for 30 days through the holidays.','/w72W4gj27NvMnTsw7aw1cwUFnC1.jpg','2018-11-24',84,'Released',NULL,'Christmas Everlasting',549319,1.4594,5.8,'sSrLepiNTXw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46204,_binary '\0','/jG1BseaXCcQeXPKY3tk9p1RiGDY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9028856',5.9,3774,'en','Christmas Wonderland','Heidi, who initially left her small town of Pleasant Valley with the dream of one day becoming a successful painter, has put her own art on hold to excel as an art gallery curator. Now, a week before the gallery’s big Christmas party, she must return home to watch her niece and nephew. She comes face to face with her high school love, Chris, now a teacher, and offers to help him find a new last-minute location for the Christmas dance.','/3QwvhdOZSNJdHbHcL9aIwp3l9mD.jpg','2018-12-02',90,'Released',NULL,'Christmas Wonderland',550032,2.051,6,'1mNSSEdll90','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46205,_binary '\0','/6BKgqHM9VzsXXJjwACQrv56Oztg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9028872',6.1,1267,'en','Entertaining Christmas','Candace, daughter of lifestyle mogul Liz Livingstone, has never lived up to her mother’s standards. When a young girl posts a video begging Liz to help arrange a special Christmas party, Candace is sent in her place. As she struggles to prove herself worthy of running the company, Candace meets—and begins falling for—the girl’s uncle, a reporter writing an expose on her.','/9XC1hug2bGP1d6kIKKSFILTdJzf.jpg','2018-12-15',84,'Released',NULL,'Entertaining Christmas',550034,1.5991,6.1,'ZZ3X3ujOII0','