s an adventure against which he pits himself with characteristic stoicism, wit, and determination.','/opW54LHRP551oPFoF1MCTKJTLsQ.jpg','2021-09-24',93,'Released','Life is a journey.','East of the Mountains',810015,2.4591,5.6,'CzFuzXkVZAw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46222,_binary '\0','/xWHkCdglHjFpRvjoaGayBCsES1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9044128',5.5,1282,'id','Suzzanna: Bernapas Dalam Kubur','Satria\'s employees intend to rob his house when he is out of the country but their robbery turns into murder when they find Suzzanna in the house as they bury her body in the backyard.','/6I7oy8S9gwSGMuXdY6YJMcWV6o.jpg','2018-11-15',125,'Released',NULL,'Suzzanna: Buried Alive',551300,1.5074,5.2,'4m5yC1BPNpw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46223,_binary '\0','/737yEOtwAASjjMSPvlMa8cMnzwi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9044418',3.4,1587,'bn','মাসুদ রানা: ধ্বংস পাহাড়','Elite Bangladeshi CIA agent Masud Rana – codename MR-9 – teams up with an American CIA operative to bring down an international criminal organization headed by a ruthless businessman.','/yF2g3MDacpZTMywh97qghW6Y0H4.jpg','2023-08-25',107,'Released','The world dies tomorrow.','MR-9: Do or Die',1016346,3.587,6.304,'EpI8--h_czU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46224,_binary '\0','/zSDb4AA6Lf8L8uh6qXPFp59mK2w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9046548',6.9,1890,'en','ReMastered: Who Shot the Sheriff','In 1976, reggae icon Bob Marley survived an assassination attempt as rival political groups battled in Jamaica. But who exactly was responsible?','/lgOHOZftmTka2hVQn0iBci3aJSq.jpg','2018-10-12',57,'Released',NULL,'ReMastered: Who Shot the Sheriff',553539,1.4259,6.828,'MbRamkuMUHI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46225,_binary '\0','/23DjeAXEbhQEPmiCDllLFqPI4Gv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9046556',7.1,1854,'en','ReMastered: Tricky Dick & The Man in Black','This documentary chronicles Johnny Cash\'s 1970 visit to t