,'tt9053416',3.4,1712,'ta','Mr. லோக்கல்','A happy-go-lucky guy lands in trouble after he locks horns with an egoistic lady.','/vbqcjryEgTNZFys3taYQJJkMIfl.jpg','2019-05-17',157,'Released',NULL,'Mr. Local',582759,2.1648,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46242,_binary '\0','/4t8T9NCte10R5CAXVhHDnmkPd3X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9054192',6.4,30134,'en','Queenpins','Bored and frustrated suburban homemaker Connie and her best pal JoJo, a vlogger with dreams, turn a hobby into a multi-million-dollar counterfeit coupon caper. After firing off a letter to the conglomerate behind a box of cereal gone stale, and receiving an apology along with dozens of freebies, the duo hatch an illegal coupon club scheme that scams millions from mega-corporations and delivers deals to legions of fellow coupon clippers. On the trail to total coupon dominance, a hapless Loss Prevention Officer from the local supermarket chain joins forces with a determined U.S. Postal Inspector in hot pursuit of these newly minted “Queenpins” of pink collar crime.','/p5Uz76EOwj9rAsdGxYL8IZGPV2B.jpg','2021-08-26',110,'Released','Couponing goes criminal.','Queenpins',628914,6.9554,6.472,'XFKrYzs65no','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46243,_binary '\0','/j1Iictz3NaKnNuYs2hWHQyathct.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9054970',6.6,19719,'hi','डॉक्टर जी','Uday Gupta, a medical college student wanted to specialise in Orthopaedic, but is stuck in an all-female class of Gynaecology. Will he change his department, or will the department change him?','/ojQbYD4pHKBrnxrG0FBdqGCHhlq.jpg','2022-10-14',124,'Released','Inki toh lag gayi ji','Doctor G',778625,1.3997,6.279,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46244,_binary '\0','/yroX00jccBkKwIZ2oXRDcx0NIal.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9056192',5.9,2843,'fr','Zombi Child','Haiti, 1962: A man is brought back from the dead only to be sent to the living hell of the sugarcane fields. In Paris, 55 years later, at the prestigious Légion d’honneur boarding school, a Haitian girl confesses an old family secret to a group of new friends - never imagining that this strange tale will convince a heartbroken classmate to do the unthinkable.','/hCm2mO44BRTGdUrnywzqHUJfNpM.jpg','2019-06-12',103,'Released',NULL,'Zombi Child',554311,2.7251,6.1,'6pjl9TmewLo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46245,_binary '\0','/75w7mMP0mRXquMqIgXidJz2IjJH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9056818',7.6,8954,'en','Last Breath','A commercial diver is stranded on the seabed with only five minutes of oxygen supply, but with no chance of rescue for more than 30 minutes. With access to amazing archival footage, this is the true story of one man’s impossible fight for survival.','/zfTNsILhmDiChJJ7Zxxl8IUvkUM.jpg','2019-04-05',85,'Released','One man\'s impossible fight for survival.','Last Breath',570973,1.741,7.5,'mSJL57Gq2OQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46246,_binary '\0','/kTkAdzFxj4wSJW6j43sV9QHpkuB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9056822',6.5,1259,'fr','The Man in the Hat','The Man In The Hat sets off from Marseilles in a small Fiat 500. On the seat beside him is a framed photograph of an unknown woman. Behind him is a 2CV into which is squeezed Five Bald Men. Why are they chasing him? And how can he shake them off? As he travels North through France, he encounters razeteurs, women with stories to tell, bullfights, plenty of delicious food, a damp man, mechanics, nuns, a convention of Chrystallographers and much more, coming face to face with the vivid eccentricities of an old country.','/hYLhSAbVW1Wa9mRX05DGCL5X20w.jpg','2020-09-18',95,'Released','Nothing is harder to find than lost love','The Man in the Hat',737195,2.995,6.2,'aqKpAFdpuyI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46247,_binary '\0','/mXtd7vfBayB4WDa0Ek1Eq3i84PZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9056824',4.4,1283,'tr','Aslı Gibidir','An aspiring actress is admitted to a prestigious conservatory but must pay her tuition by working as a performer for an unusual company.','/11rXKsHUs917KKng8FbY2V3iHob.jpg','2019-01-25',95,'Released',NULL,'Stunt School',584556,0.9139,4.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46248,_binary '\0','/iM44QKZklRsfcZdOGBWHNKGRXMz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9057808',7.2,1384,'es','Los lobos','Max and Leo are 8 and 5 years old and have just immigrated to the US with their mother. Their days pass inside a tiny apartment, while they wait for their mother to come back, as they hold on to the hope of traveling to Disney.','/7XRbBZXuTHD01SkUqwM42KbLul4.jpg','2020-06-19',95,'Released',NULL,'The Wolves',586351,1.1162,7.3,'mgxGwtGA1xw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46249,_binary '\0','/cOPonfWB5T2jE8eo10OSHQNSRXr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9058654',7.5,17479,'en','Dinner in America','An on-the-lam punk rocker and a young woman obsessed with a local band go on an unexpected and epic journey together through the decaying suburbs of the American Midwest.','/t63UhnHaWQGcuE3pViuW3LSjBJj.jpg','2020-05-27',108,'Released',NULL,'Dinner in America',653664,4.2754,7.7,'QIf2SbZqtTE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46250,_binary '\0','/rko9Scr6jQ8McmBWwRuq8nC85Dt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9058820',5.6,2525,'en','My Christmas Inn','With the holiday season in full swing, Jen Taylor is about to score a big promotion at the San Francisco ad agency where she works. But her life is unexpectedly turned upside down when she inherits a cozy inn in Alaska from her aunt. When she goes to inspect the property and meets handsome town attorney Steve Anderson, she\'s surprised to find that nothing is what she expected. The small town community is full of fun and festive Christmas traditions and soon, Jen starts wondering if the inn might just be the place she belongs, and if Steve could be the Mr. Right she has been waiting for.','/dSsJ68MHxtmnMOIaqafPm9SvfDa.jpg','2018-11-21',88,'Released',NULL,'My Christmas Inn',551603,1.6842,6,'tmQYt9bvd5w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46251,_binary '\0','/3H1yUIL1KxIuIMRwNMSL9cvifby.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9059704',5.7,30127,'en','An American Pickle','An immigrant worker at a pickle factory is accidentally preserved for 100 years and wakes up in modern day Brooklyn. He learns his only surviving relative is his great grandson, a computer coder who he can’t connect with.','/8ziUp2q71vCmMgYY2MRCwI3mSs5.jpg','2020-08-06',89,'Released','A story of self preservation','An American Pickle',628917,5.3962,5.8,'tHsqU8yK3Nc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46252,_binary '\0','/bedJLAIR7dxP423YMIpTXhrFCvH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9063106',6.5,3483,'ms','PASKAL: The Movie','The true events of Lieutenant Commander Arman Anwar of PASKAL, an elite unit in the Royal Malaysian Navy, and his team\'s mission to rescue the MV Bunga Laurel, a tanker which was hijacked by Somalian Pirates in 2011.','/oAI8whpvqWxxucVGJdDiGOfCjMB.jpg','2018-09-27',115,'Released','Between Family and Country','Paskal',546230,1.4824,7.6,'MElVXaHhbCk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46253,_binary '\0','/mjSypIJlFYrxUZJNllPZ2edSs0c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9063902',7.2,7733,'es','Vivir dos veces','A retired academic teacher tries to find the love of his youth after being diagnosed with Alzheimer\'s.','/AhxpEQ0C1UGqMWHBucw0Fj7S3mD.jpg','2019-09-06',101,'Released',NULL,'Live Twice, Love Once',613090,2.036,7.464,'s1gr3KGxUjc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46254,_binary '\0','/imLqj1YdhxPSCeinP0AKYwC6IZc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9067182',7.4,5935,'en','Rocks','15-year-old Rocks fears that she and her little brother Emmanuel will be taken into care and forced apart if anyone finds out that their mother has left them. Against all odds, and with the help of her loyal friends, she evades the authorities and navigates the most defining days of her young life.','/8Mg4ew6drIax6ZmeY22dxM8ujBk.jpg','2020-09-09',94,'Released',NULL,'Rocks',575773,1.6512,6.6,'CqXhMYjasHM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46255,_binary '\0','/iGtlsFJWFj7Ja7FOO71x39XqmbJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9068100',6.3,1532,'fr','Répertoire des villes disparues','It is a small village somewhere in Quebec with only 215 inhabitants. When young Simon Dubé dies in a car accident, the villagers’ tranquil and regulated existence is thrown out of step. People are decidedly reluctant to talk about the accident. Time seems to lose all meaning. Snowy, frosty winter days stretch out into infinity. Mysterious figures emerge from the fog and commit strange acts. But what seems strange is sometimes more familiar than one might suspect.','/aEOM10uq1SkAeFVcSxVShjg9fBH.jpg','2019-02-15',97,'Released',NULL,'Ghost Town Anthology',568790,1.9303,6.2,'FTWLFlWJEWs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46256,_binary '\0','/hIVEEYNldtJWj1Y75a0QrMj8Uyx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9070824',4.2,1594,'en','Deep Hatred','A young woman named Cindy returns to her family home after the death of her father and soon realizes that the house holds a terrible secret that puts her and her friends in danger.','/1HJAn6zzi02VsB4yPKWlCUpN7iZ.jpg','2022-03-04',74,'Released','At all costs, protect your soul.','Deep Hatred',945093,1.9161,3.9,'zVePB7VRJGA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46257,_binary '\0','/jRqHItD7rORpbB0lx2ke8StSntb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9071322',7.6,123449,'en','Dark Waters','A tenacious attorney uncovers a dark secret that connects a growing number of unexplained deaths to one of the world\'s largest corporations. In the process, he risks everything — his future, his family, and his own life — to expose the truth.','/bzvzaHqKBSuGIIWhinTQPHvT0zf.jpg','2019-11-22',127,'Released','The truth has a man on the inside.','Dark Waters',552178,14.2975,7.529,'RvAOuhyunhY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46258,_binary '\0','/tkbiKQeizzkSFV2hvalcdc8e8Kn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9071456',5.8,12752,'en','The People We Hate at the Wedding','A dysfunctional family that can\'t seem to get along and get it together reluctantly reunites for a family wedding. As their many skeletons are wrenched from the closet, it turns out to be just what this singular family needs to reconnect.','/kQZKw9jetOInPPdSZgbKFxJALHc.jpg','2022-11-17',99,'Released','Save the d̶a̶t̶e̶ hate.','The People We Hate at the Wedding',802372,4.1919,6.3,'mXeS6ELErIs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46259,_binary '\0','/gPW90IPq6Go8hlT0n7Es3cFl7ly.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9072202',7.2,19655,'en','Believe Me: The Abduction of Lisa McVey','On the night she plans on taking her own life, 17-year-old \'Lisa McVey\' is kidnapped and finds herself fighting to stay alive and is raped. She manages to talk her attacker into releasing her, but when she returns home, no one believes her story except for one detective, who suspects she was abducted by a serial killer. Based on horrifying true events.','/qbJEzCzEKDHPZDiRvSSBiYEKaAH.jpg','2018-09-30',87,'Released',NULL,'Believe Me: The Abduction of Lisa McVey',550776,7.1766,8.028,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46260,_binary '\0','/beNLniUH5DLbLbiqQgAJkiIlgpw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9072352',6,33555,'en','Relic','When elderly mother Edna inexplicably vanishes, her daughter rushes to the family\'s decaying home, finding clues of her increasing dementia scattered around the house in her absence.','/3wZ0gxLqsPleneFSTZILmM3BE8Q.jpg','2020-07-03',89,'Released','Everything Decays.','Relic',539181,4.6395,6.1,'XWhZDQkq0bw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46261,_binary '\0','/f556lJkate0rPHiJJvIcHo5N6pF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9072746',5,3351,'en','Simmer','When Chef finds out his family will be deported if he doesn\'t pay government imposed fees, he turns to his boss who offers him an opportunity as a black market driver to earn the money.','/8fpVtk1Q8qu1t66WHA8cdd9ngYB.jpg','2020-01-31',96,'Released','There\'s only one rule ...','Simmer',790231,1.6758,4.5,'LqetNR8zfOs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46262,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9074318',6.8,2535,'hi','Son Rise','SON RISE is filmed in rural Haryana, a strongly patriarchal state, bordering India\'s capital, New Delhi. Illegal, yet rampant female foeticide, has led to the eerie absence of girls in hundreds of villages, giving the region the notorious title \'The land of Daughter Killers\' (kuri mar khshetar). er','/nGXlPOSW725ioGDetHVnFCqtp1e.jpg','2019-07-19',120,'Released',NULL,'Son Rise',652416,1.2293,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46263,_binary '\0','/mOUP5xyrfmlXTdQea4HtZpob7LD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9074574',6.7,8250,'fi','Koirat eivät käytä housuja','A grieving heart surgeon struggling with the loss of his wife drifts through an emotionally detached life while raising his teenage daughter. His chance encounter with a dominatrix awakens feelings he thought were gone, drawing him into a dark and unconventional world where pain and desire intertwine.','/7lTQrvsJOD16Hffiv0xv71txRod.jpg','2019-11-01',105,'Released','You take my breath away.','Dogs Don\'t Wear Pants',524780,3.3149,6.9,'2K5sRggO8Qo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46264,_binary '\0','/qYx4BseTh8Mqp8gIryt8RdDCBpd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9075008',7.1,3977,'de','Effigie - Das Gift und die Stadt','1828 in the German port city of Bremen: Two very different women collide in an age that has no place for either of them. One strives for a career in law, at a time when women aren\'t even admitted to universities. The other has lived life outside the law and may now have to pay the tab. One of them needs to get her head together – while the other would do anything not to lose hers. -- Based on a true story.','/umH1lioweUHKwKv7hg0Bj47NOrx.jpg','2020-10-09',85,'Released','1828 in the German port city of Bremen: A female law clerk tries to prove her worth during the investigation of a series of poisonings.','Effigy: Poison and the City',572735,1.3671,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46265,_binary '\0','/ylob1axAunw2NW06Drd5jfjMASK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9075612',6.8,1623,'fr','Les plus belles années d\'une vie','They knew each other long ago: a man and a woman whose dazzling and unexpected romance captured in the now-iconic film revolutionized our understanding of love. Today, the former race car driver seems lost in the pathways of his memory. In order to help him, his son seeks out the woman his father wasn’t able to cherish but whom he constantly revisits in his thoughts and dreams. Anne reunites with Jean-Louis and their story picks up where they left it…','/41jZAOJvZRj4e1jshl3sFzKqHnR.jpg','2019-05-22',90,'Released',NULL,'The Best Years of a Life',582887,2.4543,6.6,'G6TyH_5OROk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46266,_binary '\0','/eZ8eK0moqUo6Vwq08OK1POfyUF5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9076562',6.3,25007,'en','Irresistible','A Democratic political consultant helps a retired Marine colonel run for mayor in a small, conservative Wisconsin town.','/hUpYDriYa5YkwwxeafUsowTweBg.jpg','2020-07-01',102,'Released','Send in the clowns.','Irresistible',595148,5.0868,6.03,'0vhaAoSm1NY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46267,_binary '\0','/nFUZQqghlWnvfpePtXTFZoXsAIa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9077038',6.7,2997,'ta','மான்ஸ்டர்','A compassionate man faces a test of his faith from a rat that shows no sign of leaving his home.','/rimsU3RY7PpiDC7uG0iUUI3M6tv.jpg','2019-05-17',139,'Released',NULL,'Monster',562696,1.0624,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46268,_binary '\0','/lSzXCaUV4yACtvKpN5j6HuCXhFG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9077528',5.4,1280,'te','ఎన్టీఆర్: మహానాయకుడు','A follow up to NTR: Kathanayakudu which was based on N.T. Rama Rao\'s life and acting career. This movie focuses on his political career.','/65PgvZv20xSJZWVTJspGpU5FtcQ.jpg','2019-02-06',128,'Released',NULL,'N.T.R: Mahanayakudu',676542,1.2045,4.333,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46269,_binary '\0','/vBR1IVCsRLVrW33OwfjoeYNdk5w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9077876',3.9,1533,'en','13 Fanboy','An obsessed fan stalks his favorite actors from the Friday the 13th films and beyond, mirroring his idol Jason Voorhees.','/8nB3kkT10hJMyERJDz0jdlqi6ZE.jpg','2021-10-22',99,'Released','Some fans love you to death.','13 Fanboy',582292,1.7112,5.1,'vdBFKLgEE_k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46270,_binary '\0','/7x9SfVDfKki2Oax7Fiz4UMcCqU3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9081472',7.5,1487,'ml','Aickarakkonathe Bhishaguaranmaar','A traditional physician wishes his children to be doctors of modern medicine, but they turn to Ayurveda, homeopathy and nursing. The film is about these physicians of Aikkarakkonam and how their medical practices impact the lives of the village.','/9wkrSstQaHs3fGDPFlH43EnHTL2.jpg','2018-10-05',144,'Released',NULL,'Aickarakkonathe Bhishaguaranmaar',553095,0.5699,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46271,_binary '\0','/gQgJ6AImfwNDmf299K1Ut6iFWNT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9081558',7.2,2041,'hu','Akik maradtak','After surviving the Holocaust, a grieving man who lost his wife and two young boys connects with a teenage girl who lost her parents and little sister. Knowing each other\'s emptiness, they become like father and daughter. It is the beginning of a profound love the world doesn\'t understand.','/t3YXnx6Qnbdc45KVYn1bDHFcwks.jpg','2019-06-20',83,'Released',NULL,'Those Who Remained',597290,2.0256,7.24,'pTCZ0Jl0u4c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46272,_binary '\0','/6IfdkHqpvv0t2I1FMY9tI876ej.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9081562',6.2,1500,'zh','比悲傷更悲傷的故事','A terminally ill man sets up his best friend, whom he has loved since high school, so that she will not be lonely after he passes away.','/bIaZMyV7F6cVulZZ16iEL3L1lOm.jpg','2018-11-30',106,'Released',NULL,'More Than Blue',554493,1.6689,5.6,'aQSSjYm8Aws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46273,_binary '\0','/ob8w7gQNV4uL43fCGbD6y89rpDn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9082020',4.7,7748,'en','Cold Blood','A legendary but retired hit man lives in peace and isolation in the barren North American wilderness. When he rescues a woman from a snowmobiling accident, he soon discovers that she\'s harboring a secret that forces him to return to his lethal ways.','/uGMIxhhMvQEE0mNlATXpEAG4mgl.jpg','2019-05-15',91,'Released','You can\'t outrun the past','Cold Blood',595985,4.4408,5.273,'XKev4lpHMcE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46274,_binary '\0','/i8PCU4JeBSHQ83Cdjp7hA6iNGM7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9083646',6.2,1630,'en','Christmas on Honeysuckle Lane','Emma Reynolds returns to Oliver\'s Well to celebrate Christmas for the last time with her siblings in the home they grew up in. After their parents recently passed, the siblings reluctantly agree to sell the family home on Honeysuckle Lane after the New Year, leaving Emma in charge of its belongings. While antiques expert Morgan Shelby appraises Emma\'s mother\'s collection, they find a hidden surprise in an antique desk that takes them on a journey to discover the power of love and family during the holidays.','/yEEXq5VYP0gvaCYRiyag4BvZcTx.jpg','2018-11-24',90,'Released',NULL,'Christmas on Honeysuckle Lane',553798,2.2103,5.9,'srnwmedKNG4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46275,_binary '\0','/gh3jJBbB5wAyilg39xzfJqLWLWp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9085008',4,1360,'en','Human Resources','After starting a job at an eerie hardware store, an anxious young man uncovers a shocking mystery that leads to a fight against terrifying forces that lurk just behind the walls.','/m2x2GIHgAFszwaqnMG7jngcitVY.jpg','2021-08-14',108,'Released','No one knows when to quit.','Human Resources',858159,3.1926,4.6,'evSbtT_1_jM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46276,_binary '\0','/en1XAePgWqNSXb82luUMmo5u3cF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9086228',5.6,39983,'en','Gretel & Hansel','A long time ago in a distant fairy tale countryside, a young girl leads her little brother into a dark wood in desperate search of food and work, only to stumble upon a nexus of terrifying evil.','/mBBBXseq4k4dI63k06XIrsc02j8.jpg','2020-01-30',87,'Released','A grim fairy tale.','Gretel & Hansel',542224,8.3702,6,'NiMNMpMo-gQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46277,_binary '\0','/nCG3zOQlS2IrFWdJNTlKIwjBGA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9087578',7.3,3090,'en','Once Upon a Christmas Miracle','Told she would have less than a few months to live without a liver transplant, Heather Krueger’s time was running out when a kind stranger, Chris Dempsey, heard of her plight and discovered he was a perfect match. The two met and before long a friendship developed into romance. The movie follows Heather and Chris’ journey over three Christmases as his selfless gesture leads to a Christmas miracle for everyone involved. Based on a true story.','/aSY8EsGoo9GmQrzOm0dEbQ3BYHX.jpg','2018-12-02',90,'Released',NULL,'Once Upon a Christmas Miracle',552004,2.5333,6.6,'ZClwIJZI_tc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46278,_binary '\0','/e6CnfsN7wnhZEMqh5EnCfTDXQ7g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9089294',7,6480,'ja','劇場版 七つの大罪 天空の囚われ人','Traveling in search of the rare ingredient, “sky fish” Meliodas and Hawk arrive at a palace that floats above the clouds. The people there are busy preparing a ceremony, meant to protect their home from a ferocious beast that awakens once every 3,000 years. But before the ritual is complete, the Six Knights of Black—a Demon Clan army—removes the seal on the beast, threatening the lives of everyone in the Sky Palace.','/63NOOAkaZAK8h93Sg7Ucq6XLJGP.jpg','2018-08-18',99,'Released',NULL,'The Seven Deadly Sins: Prisoners of the Sky',507569,1.0024,7.537,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46279,_binary '\0','/dk4F4eWeGvnmdlCB6Ow5afebaBV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9093130',6.7,2121,'en','Time for Me to Come Home for Christmas','Famous musician Heath and small-town girl Cara are each traveling back to Oklahoma for the holidays when they get stranded in Chicago. Despite his fame, she has no idea who he is, but they hit it off—and she even ends up providing some inspiration for the Christmas song he\'s writing.','/jM6szxRXdVepT3Kw48pDWySlCnM.jpg','2018-12-15',90,'Released',NULL,'Time for Me to Come Home for Christmas',554282,2.0199,6.6,'AiznX5Qq8yk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46280,_binary '\0','/vXbyInzU0d8vQ6fOH4RCJhXthf9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9095324',7.9,3632,'en','Coldplay: A Head Full of Dreams','An in-depth and intimate portrait of Coldplay\'s spectacular rise from the backrooms of Camden pubs to selling out stadiums across the planet. At the heart of the story is the band\'s unshakeable brotherhood which has endured through many highs and lows.','/fx7A8TRYL8JJ9fg0eJLk80RZOkf.jpg','2018-11-14',104,'Released','The Inside Story. Filmed Over 20 Years.','Coldplay: A Head Full of Dreams',554152,2.6962,7.8,'Lhzu6bQxFo4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46281,_binary '\0','/eY7J2ODZvumLIsUJAc6hVWQhS9O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9095526',6.7,1370,'fr','Mon frère','Because he wanted to protect his little brother, Teddy, a young man without a history, is accused of the murder of his father and sent to a closed educational center, waiting for his trial for parricide. He then plunges into a brutal universe of which he does not know the rules.','/tMW0B2Hou4nXnZGCPkucRSgI3U0.jpg','2019-07-31',96,'Released',NULL,'Brother',570137,2.2963,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46282,_binary '\0','/jqs961rtnMydKmZIk7KjYeGb18Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9097270',4.9,1993,'en','Wrinkles the Clown','In Florida, parents can hire Wrinkles the Clown to scare their misbehaving children.','/ifH9eohqttl6TlpAPHM3BoZrgjt.jpg','2019-10-04',75,'Released','He\'s just a phone call away.','Wrinkles the Clown',619262,0.9615,5.6,'sSOt0Ks97_E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46283,_binary '\0','/wwKTCPDgaq5nWs76Oitq9flUYvN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9098454',6.2,2343,'en','The Girl Who Believes in Miracles','When Sara hears a preacher say faith can move mountains, she starts praying. Suddenly people in her town are mysteriously healed! But fame soon takes its toll – can Sara’s family save her before it’s too late?','/fBhM7HadGVfVyUp7UaEsutCEtYu.jpg','2021-04-02',100,'Released','From her lips to God\'s ears.','The Girl Who Believes in Miracles',805195,3.5153,7.4,'aH6b6P18D34','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46284,_binary '\0','/gOBKWe6lHlt8srk11TFlDuBtl0H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9098872',8.3,23973,'en','The Rescue','The enthralling, against-all-odds story that transfixed the world in 2018: the daring rescue of twelve boys and their coach from deep inside a flooded cave in Northern Thailand.','/kC7fVtCkJACwPBaRr2hlj2whfKX.jpg','2021-10-08',107,'Released','Courage runs deep.','The Rescue',680058,6.7685,7.961,'_-Kw5kAPSbk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46285,_binary '\0','/715DRti7Dfe6PCNkmDeZKvVIz5s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9098928',7.4,1275,'en','The Reason I Jump','Based on the book by Naoki Higashida, filmmaker Jerry Rothwell examines the lives of five non-speaking, autistic youngsters.','/kWbwt0wnE00JH9R4RRmbDxUkIHC.jpg','2020-01-23',82,'Released',NULL,'The Reason I Jump',653758,2.7524,7.2,'J9ZxvR_cm94','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46286,_binary '\0','/1bta7JZyZYOeYVDgawXdFLzkVXa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9098938',7.4,13873,'hi','शर्माजी नमकीन','Late Rishi Kapoor in his swansong plays B. G. Sharma, a 58-year old middle-class widower living in West Delhi. After being laid off from the company he has worked for his entire life, Sharmaji struggles to deal with the beast called retirement. His struggle to stay relevant in front of his two sons finally ends when he rekindles his love for cooking through a kitty party. A bunch of merry women rekindle in Sharma, a passion for cooking and chutzpah in general, that help him find his true calling.','/xve92SlbFCl4eEESx78eutq6rjo.jpg','2022-03-31',119,'Released','There is no age to coming of age','Sharmaji Namkeen',870387,1.2733,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46287,_binary '\0','/ihHM7zTME1Ua98gvciIdFxPswwH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9099102',5,5900,'en','No Escape Room','A father and daughter check out a small town escape room and discover there is something sinister about the place.','/yP0mfM0MafLVMD36kgbvZpr9gbz.jpg','2018-10-06',86,'Released','Solve to survive.','No Escape Room',552660,2.0098,6.2,'0UjJSpu1XJ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46288,_binary '\0','/tp8EnB5W9aAv0nw3t1ltA1Jyg5t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9099800',6.2,2235,'en','Savage','Inspired by the true stories of New Zealand\'s street gangs across 30 years, we follow Danny at three defining moments in his life as he grows from a boy into the violent enforcer of a gang.','/1XixAUZcBhdqxqkDAimbZQcLnHE.jpg','2019-10-11',101,'Released',NULL,'Savage',627076,1.5033,6.731,'NK3eDfkXBzg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46289,_binary '\0','/sx9dBw5dvbXtXIx2mO9VyzujgS2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9099938',6.8,5495,'ja','キングダム','Set in Qin Dynasty during the warring states period in ancient China. Shin was a war orphan. He has a dream of becoming a great general Shin has a fateful encounter with young King Eisei. King Eisei aims to unify all of China.','/psMD1c4puVlU38LUKDUH6kRtxNy.jpg','2019-04-19',133,'Released',NULL,'Kingdom',554805,3.7306,7.253,'aMTiFyDZmfc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46290,_binary '\0','/nYDPmxvl0if5vHBBp7pDYGkTFc7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9100018',5.9,47418,'en','Cobweb','Eight year old Peter is plagued by a mysterious, constant tapping from inside his bedroom wall—one that his parents insist is all in his imagination. As Peter\'s fear intensifies, he believes that his parents could be hiding a terrible, dangerous secret and questions their trustworthiness.','/cGXFosYUHYjjdKrOmA0bbjvzhKz.jpg','2023-07-19',88,'Released','Sooner or later, family secrets creep out.','Cobweb',709631,8.882,6.4,'hGY0icwlDGY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46291,_binary '\0','/959lvxUgZejsR2DpiOwvy60paBH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9100028',4.9,1518,'es','La pequeña Suiza','The discovery of the tomb of William Tell’s son in a town in the Basque Country spurs the village\'s cantankerous citizens to lobby for Swiss annexation.','/ji3iTy8Cwwk2G1coxNiKoZSBHJc.jpg','2019-04-26',86,'Released',NULL,'The Little Switzerland',574374,1.2184,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46292,_binary '\0','/6jRHaYJyje5RNS3L353udrPU3ME.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9100054',6.6,82793,'en','The Lost Daughter','A woman\'s seaside vacation takes a dark turn when her obsession with a young mother forces her to confront secrets from her past.','/t1oLNRFixpFOVsyz1HCqCUW3wiW.jpg','2021-12-15',122,'Released','Being a mother is a crushing responsibility.','The Lost Daughter',554230,9.0502,6.4,'bOORjqHVjvo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46293,_binary '\0','/7jSwGrYznvjym1tyct9SeYtYB2O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9101480',6.7,2048,'en','A Christmas in Tennessee','Allison Bennet, along with her daughter Olivia and mother Martha, run a bakery in the small mountain town of White Pines, Tennessee. When Matthew, a charming real estate developer, tries to buy the town for a corporate ski resort, Allison and the townspeople must work together to prevent that from happening. And just when the Bennet ladies seem out of luck, an unexpected visitor – with a well-known sweet tooth for cookies and milk – comes to the bakery and may in fact be the key to solving everything.','/sUQMRLWeM2QEnvZQjwqzO5Ms1kc.jpg','2018-12-09',90,'Released','hallmark','A Christmas in Tennessee',552016,2.2135,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46294,_binary '\0','/mmBuMncejw8TCb9njBsgqwujiW1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9101540',3.6,2399,'ml','ബിഗ് ബ്രദർ','After getting released for serving a double life sentence, Sachidanandan returns to connect and live with his family until his past catches up to him, forcing him to protect his loved ones.','/e7E9mFsCwm6s5k0akviOIuVIKIU.jpg','2020-01-16',162,'Released',NULL,'Big Brother',627342,1.2557,3.107,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46295,_binary '\0','/dENidWmoRRkFMwXwjddz9EZZvnu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9101692',6.6,2027,'en','Christmas Around the Corner','Claire (Alexandra Breckenridge), a savvy venture capitalist from New York City, escapes to a quaint town in Vermont for the holidays and becomes a guest of the Fortenbury Bookstore. Upon arrival, Claire finds Christmas celebrations have been canceled by the town after a flood and the bookstore is in a dire state of disrepair. She immediately takes on the challenge to revitalize the store, but clashes with the owner, Andrew (Jamie Spilchuk), who initially rejects all her proposed improvements. Eventually, sparks fly as the two begin a budding romance, and Claire’s infectious optimism inspires Andrew to join her in reviving the yuletide spirit. But everything comes to a screeching halt when Claire discovers that Andrew is planning to sell the bookstore in the New Year. Will the spirit of Christmas be enough to change Andrew’s mind and encourage him to follow his heart?','/2KJ087yxOh31WYEgkTbMhdyvWbK.jpg','2018-12-14',90,'Released',NULL,'Christmas Around the Corner',552017,2.4308,6.4,'nvN8gXzcBP0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46296,_binary '\0','/hYfm6bESA5cahGIOOD4gH0L4pQf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9102084',5.6,3571,'en','Fried Barry','Barry is a drug-addled, abusive bastard who - after yet another bender - is abducted by aliens. Barry takes a backseat as an alien visitor assumes control of his body and takes it for a joyride through Cape Town. What follows is an onslaught of drugs, sex, and violence as our alien tourist enters the weird and wonderful world of humankind.','/iQ2TCB6nszgFHnF1QeHJujvBIzn.jpg','2020-03-06',99,'Released','Sex, drugs, and extraterrestrials.','Fried Barry',718558,1.6964,5.226,'MCu6ge0LLto','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46297,_binary '\0','/zNUmOf9vOk0f146jQBrBkdmrZyH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9103028',6.1,2631,'en','Return to Christmas Creek','As Christmas approaches, Amelia Hughes, a career-focused Chicago app developer lacking in holiday spirit, returns to her small hometown of Christmas Creek to rediscover the meaning of Christmas. There, she reunites with her childhood best friend Mike and her estranged uncle Harry, whose mysterious rift with Amelia’s father divided her family during the holiday season when she was a child.','/gCdjZCWM9x9vAbtkvZiIIYL7tOB.jpg','2018-11-18',90,'Released',NULL,'Return to Christmas Creek',554279,2.5329,6.5,'USkhJ5lq9dY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46298,_binary '\0','/uzoiJMEPGXb1oeJOZZwN1qx1eU1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9103602',7.1,2772,'en','A Veteran\'s Christmas','Captain Grace Garland, a decorated U.S. veteran, returns home after two tours of Search and Rescue in Afghanistan. After being separated from her beloved K9 partner, Grace must rediscover the magic of Christmas. When she finds herself stranded in the town of River’s Crossing a couple weeks before Christmas, the local judge, Joe Peterson, offers her a place to stay on his property and takes it upon himself to show Grace everything she has been missing; Christmas, family, community, and love.','/k3TNeyevlA5GHPtQaAzmaQcbinC.jpg','2018-11-11',90,'Released',NULL,'A Veteran\'s Christmas',551863,2.229,6.5,'_r_2_VeNY6Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46299,_binary '\0','/5DGn5HwIvTyY2bfv6V12dasN9GW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9104736',3.3,19103,'hi','हाउसफ़ूल 5','A father writes his will — his son \"Jolly\" is going to get it all. But who is Jolly? The comedy unfolds as different people pose as the \"real\" Jolly on a cruise celebrating the father\'s birthday — where a murder takes place.','/iGvGkVOfsooO0ZBrhN5i6zXYUCy.jpg','2025-06-05',163,'Released','A Killer Comedy','Housefull 5',1146210,2.6504,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46300,_binary '\0','/vklo3RkM15epMVw41JrqYtGBzwr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9105014',7.1,3807,'hi','Notebook','An ex-army officer, Kabir, becomes a teacher in Kashmir in a school that is in a miserable condition. Things take a turn when Kabir finds a notebook, left behind by the previous year\'s teacher Firdaus.','/xWGuyAriV4h3vzSSplITsJlIUSX.jpg','2019-03-29',115,'Released',NULL,'Notebook',582375,1.3005,5.804,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46301,_binary '\0','/n1AvnrJZ6F6hRoDhpTB1K9s19dF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9106672',7,3893,'de','Als Hitler das rosa Kaninchen stahl','In 1933 in Berlin. Anna is only nine years old when her life changes from the ground up. To escape the Nazis, her father Arthur Kemper, a well-known Jewish journalist, has to flee to Zurich. His family, Anna, her twelve-year-old brother Max and her mother Dorothea, follow him shortly thereafter. Anna has to leave everything behind, including her beloved pink rabbit, and to face a new life full of challenges and privations abroad.','/k9GJufkrzJkvWmgLNHeVc3wz3T6.jpg','2019-12-25',119,'Released','A Family\'s Escape. A Childhood Lost.','When Hitler Stole Pink Rabbit',581518,3.6366,7.036,'IW9ufaChP50','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46302,_binary '\0','/tHNF0C72wQzzJ5GVxNeHljHmpJu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9107368',5.7,7033,'en','Bob Lazar: Area 51 and Flying Saucers','Area 51, flying saucers from another world - and the program to create a fierce technology. Bob Lazar remains the singular most famous and controversial name in the world of UFOs. The reason you know about Area 51 is because Lazar came forward and told you about it. His disclosures have turned his life upside-down and he has tried to stay out of the spotlight. For this reason, he has never let any filmmaker into the private world of his daily life - that is - until now. Corbell’s film explores Lazar’s claims through the lens of thirty years - providing rare and never before revealed footage - guaranteed to alter the landscape of the debate.','/9ibnQLtq3BUXQPEjOUsIhyDDvS8.jpg','2018-11-01',97,'Released',NULL,'Bob Lazar: Area 51 and Flying Saucers',522320,2.6763,6.188,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46303,_binary '\0','/3I9ffSjCX74barf5JyTX8qAugn5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9108892',7.3,1633,'hi','हरामी','An orphan teenage pickpocket working the trains of Mumbai along with his gang, embarks on a life-altering journey when faced by the daughter of one of his victims who\'s committed suicide after being robbed.','/5fLd31wBLZWbPYbDvfJrwR3l9l2.jpg','2021-06-30',100,'Released',NULL,'Harami',741397,2.9346,7.6,'A9OhuhR3-zc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46304,_binary '\0','/wyp4QygcdDcLim2F9D3y4gxbW4g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9109306',4.3,7842,'en','The Final Wish','Following the passing of his father, Aaron Hammond returns to his hometown to help his devastated mother and to confront his past demons. Sifting through his father’s belongings, Aaron comes upon a mysterious item that is far more than it seems.','/181zwXeXcRrBWkF5OFt3d1GhDpW.jpg','2019-01-24',95,'Released','On