s, everything falls','Andhaghaaram',759216,1.2719,7.276,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46309,_binary '\0','/pyR9sMmWC3kq4o6DGXzw2S4aOVK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9110902',7.2,2522,'ro','Maria, Regina României','Devastated by the First World War and plunged into political controversy, Romania\'s every hope accompanies its Queen on her mission to Paris, to lobby for its great unification\'s international recognition at the 1919 Peace Talks.','/jI9ZyNPNUwkR6OHVy0GSdpBQOkL.jpg','2019-11-08',110,'Released',NULL,'Queen Marie of Romania',648207,1.2934,7.1,'dIjfdGLullk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46310,_binary '\0','/3E7SmCwoSbpBn7cfp10hQjsGk2U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9110904',6.4,3590,'it','Tre Piani','Follows the lives of three families who live in a three-story building in a Roman neighbourhood.','/59kVQe8wrHp845gBR9TDHzNwfeQ.jpg','2021-09-23',119,'Released',NULL,'Three Floors',608980,2.8134,6.3,'Y0t8M3-RqhM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46311,_binary '\0','/2zdC38kTkb3MLDcAaLkW1mcTkcn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9112712',6.7,3799,'en','Breaking Fast','Mo, a practicing Muslim living in West Hollywood, is learning to navigate life post heartbreak. Enter Kal, an All-American guy who surprises Mo by offering to break fast with him during the holy month of Ramadan.','/4RoiHMzCeWXqL0kvM1UP6UxU9nb.jpg','2020-03-07',92,'Released','A Ramadan Rom-Com.','Breaking Fast',680880,1.7668,6.48,'qCtpAPF75Nk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46312,_binary '\0','/6NVcVcq5ZcZXahMOE6YfXAMjxYw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9114124',6,1679,'it','Cambio tutto!','A woman seeking treatment for her stress, suddenly finds herself unable to filter herself when she speaks.','/5OaT8xxEtKqR2vAQtNNxbQ7xcMm.jpg','2020-08-06',90,'Released',NULL,'Say It Loud',648619,1.4047,5.941,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46313,_binary '\0','/83H0C66AcvkwpG2738VCTHMY9uv.jpg','2026-10-06 