337,_binary '\0','/pfgIFToEcoXkOg83Cpx5lUct3qV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9148706',6.4,11904,'en','Misbehaviour','A group of women involved in the Women\'s Liberation Movement hatched a plan to invade the stage and disrupt the live broadcast at the 1970 Miss World competition in London, resulting in overnight fame for the newly-formed organization. When the show resumed, the results caused an uproar and turned the Western ideal of beauty on its head.','/o1SoYYvxG4bWTXp4wNWt5sKQf1E.jpg','2020-03-12',107,'Released','Miss World 1970: The launch of a revolution','Misbehaviour',567965,4.2679,6.367,'ZUa0Mtdv1HQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46338,_binary '\0','/cjMrwXhlNIPB3ChN23SFUks0KKu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9149982',4.3,1582,'en','Killer Under The Bed','New to town, a bullied teenager discovers a doll, riddled with pins, in her backyard shed. She soon comes to believe that the doll holds supernatural powers.','/AfbjQG0Bzj5Zp6E7H3HIjAUCEdt.jpg','2018-10-20',90,'Released',NULL,'Killer Under The Bed',555252,2.3891,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46339,_binary '\0','/fTrQsdMS2MUw00RnzH0r3JWHhts.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9150192',5.7,81796,'en','A Working Man','Levon Cade left behind a decorated military career in the black ops to live a simple life working construction. But when his boss\'s daughter, who is like family to him, is taken by human traffickers, his search to bring her home uncovers a world of corruption far greater than he ever could have imagined.','/6FRFIogh3zFnVWn7Z6zcYnIbRcX.jpg','2025-03-26',116,'Released','Human traffickers beware.','A Working Man',1197306,28.5025,6.7,'f84Le2NWt3A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46340,_binary '\0','/ensZ2nLvJEtFEioRFE6GJN9JPRI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9150970',5.4,5957,'es','A pesar de todo','Sara, Lucía, Sofía and Claudia are sisters, 4 modern women with very different personalities, who come together at their mother\'s funeral, after which they discover the man they\'ve all called \"dad\" throughout their lives is not really their father. They embark on a quest to discover who their real fathers are, discovering more about themselves, their mother, and their lives.','/jeclnbGov6lbHu8o1ugcOBCUBlU.jpg','2019-03-16',75,'Released',NULL,'Despite Everything',588001,3.047,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46341,_binary '\0','/aQ7444JX7gefPhGJTlvilj3zG2S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9151704',8.5,4582,'ko','번 더 스테이지: 더 무비','Burn the Stage: the Movie is the first movie from BTS, going behind-the-scenes of the BTS WINGS TOUR to reveal the full story of the band’s meteoric rise to fame. This unmissable film provides an intimate look at what happens when the most successful global boy band of all time breaks down barriers and invades the mainstream music scene. Exclusive tour footage and brand-new one-on-one interviews with BTS members give fans an unprecedented glimpse into their lives and an opportunity for everyone to celebrate together worldwide.','/pJKy1yvnKh8UjcuYeG3Rt35xHFA.jpg','2018-11-15',85,'Released','From the deserts to the seas, we were always together.','Burn the Stage: The Movie',553512,3.3224,8.3,'g_6FoBgps9Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46342,_binary '\0','/miuRDcFwkml4S2jNpXnYA6rA4ye.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9154566',6,1366,'en','A Christmas Switch','Christmas works its magic in this body-switching holiday tale about two very different moms who find that help is where you least expect it, and most need it. When struggling singer Audrey and wealthy record executive Julia collide at the mall, they wake up in each other’s lives the next morning. Audrey finds that, though Julia’s life is full of luxury, she’s missing the chance to connect with her family in any real way while Julia finds that, though she gets plenty of family time, Audrey can’t say no to anyone giving her no time for herself. As Christmas looms closer, the two women rush to figure out how to both help each other and switch back before they miss Christmas morning with their own families!','/g71k3gbOUBL5PXhMwOhoTHrRXE4.jpg','2018-11-04',86,'Released',NULL,'A Christmas Switch',559337,1.7753,6,'xyb9SyVXdnY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46343,_binary '\0','/4KTuSuWPZphbJOFFceU55YXXIVT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9155512',5.8,2228,'fr','Le Visiteur du futur','In a devastated future, the apocalypse threatens the Earth. The last hope lies with a man capable of time travel. His mission: to return to the past and change the course of events. But the time police hunts him down in every era. A race against time begins for the Visitor from the Future...','/bsMIi4W3MvLChEUk8tiiHffyhQm.jpg','2022-09-07',102,'Released','Here\'s what\'s going to happen...','The Visitor from the Future',810389,2.808,6.3,'XQw7PUvt2yI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46344,_binary '\0','/fAjkoPcoCSCEsc9nwE5LlSWvjlH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9165332',7.1,2994,'te','చిత్రలహరి','Vijay is a down-on-luck mechanical engineer who’s looking for that big break in life. Both his personal and professional lives are a mess; will he ever catch a break?','/dm23DtVFdWBMKwp1q81igUh98lZ.jpg','2019-04-13',131,'Released','Bar and Restaurant','Chitralahari',590012,1.1114,6.958,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46345,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9165634',1.4,3820,'id','Hanum & Rangga: Faith & The City','Hanum had an opportunity to attend the program in the Global New York TV station which was her dream. Her husband sacrificed his dream for Hanum.','/xeV4CN5UatwEFH46AGAtW2sI1j7.jpg','2018-11-08',95,'Released',NULL,'Hanum & Rangga: Faith & The City',552385,1.1205,1.7,'tWG3rHpqN5E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46346,_binary '\0','/bbXkDYnZEpEUD6MN0KcJJ2s85NH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9165664',6.1,1310,'en','Love You to Death','Inspired by a true story, this film tells the shocking tale of a mother and daughter who are nothing like they seem, their tumultuous relationship ending in a brutal murder.','/42Y8lRpaNZBMvzz1Rnv7RSQfqNs.jpg','2019-01-26',86,'Released',NULL,'Love You to Death',574151,2.9668,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46347,_binary '\0','/4Q227yMDHWmbzDc5ussmG2luV1y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9165806',4.2,1616,'ml','ഇട്ടിമാണി: മെയ്ഡ് ഇന്‍ ചൈന','The son of a popular martial arts expert, Manikkunnel Ittymaani is an impulsive man who keeps landing into trouble.','/xSLHrDL7aSe6ske5p3t2aqVTQ0y.jpg','2019-09-06',158,'Released',NULL,'Ittymaani: Made In China',606943,1.4338,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46348,_binary '\0','/tX3PN76x4zRwZyYeNJI9uNXmkKz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9165824',5.7,1570,'en','The Show','A man goes on a mission to locate a stolen artifact for a client, which leads him to a haunted town full of vampires, sleeping beauties, and Voodoo gangsters.','/iZJ3IEJ5rvWgxbVbkAF4uU6ZIo.jpg','2021-08-26',115,'Released','Enter a town where fantasy is reality.','The Show',567910,1.6395,5.4,'4J2JQCx0VzI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46349,_binary '\0','/x4dSE6eA52tFu5jOJQYPwuXVuQd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9168384',6.5,1788,'en','Jingle Around the Clock','Elle decides to reunite her college friends for Christmas, but her plans are thwarted by an opportunity at work to spearhead a Christmas campaign relaunch. She\'s forced to team up with ad campaign \"fixer\" Max, who has a completely different take on the holidays. As the two work together, they find themselves falling for each other. With the help of a little Christmas magic, will Elle pull off the perfect Christmas reunion and find the love she’s been searching for?','/dz6Fp3TpIsmGughXqKy5iJW35me.jpg','2018-12-22',90,'Released',NULL,'Jingle Around the Clock',551701,2.1638,6.8,'nkBrJmw3uHM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46350,_binary '\0','/As0eyHzF4dGhSBsVHAX8nLZxzCe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9168416',6.8,2365,'en','Small Town Christmas','Author Nell Phillips’ first book has become a surprise best-seller of the Christmas season. Nell’s last stop on a nationwide book tour takes her to the town of Springdale, the hometown of Emmett Turner, a young man she met over five years ago while both were junior copy editors at a New York publishing company. Nell was hurt when Emmett stood her up for a dinner date and then disappeared from New York without any explanation. As Nell is quick to admit, Emmett’s colorful, nostalgic anecdotes about Springdale inspired her to write this book that is shaping her life and especially this holiday season.','/1ofOSade5htAKST44j1q8oXqOFv.jpg','2018-12-22',84,'Released',NULL,'Small Town Christmas',555277,1.8993,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46351,_binary '\0','/ckNsQR0NcjQVEw1eJEmRjzT00sv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9169036',6.6,2951,'en','White Lie','Katie Arneson is faking cancer. A university dance major, Katie\'s falsified diagnosis and counterfeit fundraising have transformed her into a campus celebrity surrounded by the supportive community she\'s always dreamed of. But now dependent on a bursary for sick students to maintain her ruse, Katie learns the funding is in jeopardy unless she can provide copies of her medical records within the week.','/c36SFlCl8wxDNWjsPNZyTUvvTBv.jpg','2019-09-07',96,'Released',NULL,'White Lie',578671,1.8429,6.5,'6146a_vM0HU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46352,_binary '\0','/wtHejZOVkAZtZ8L8o1g3KNE56xJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9169764',6.7,1421,'en','Iron Fists and Kung Fu Kicks','The fantastic story of how an ancient martial art, Chinese kung fu, conquered the world through the hundreds of films that were produced in Hong Kong over the decades, transformed Western action cinema and inspired the birth of cultural movements such as blaxploitation, hip hop music, parkour and Wakaliwood cinema.','/1t0SsQqmfYVuD3MBCIB4muGllAP.jpg','2019-08-14',108,'Released','How Hong Kong kicked off a cinematic revolution','Iron Fists and Kung Fu Kicks',600014,2.8721,6.7,'vkZRq147OK8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46353,_binary '\0','/6LtEzA3Umx9mc0lq1g8xOfluGPx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9170516',7.3,19447,'da','Skyggen i mit øje','On March 21st, 1945, the British Royal Air Force set out on a mission to bomb Gestapo\'s headquarters in Copenhagen. The raid had fatal consequences as some of the bombers accidentally targeted a school and more than 120 people were killed, 86 of whom were children.','/jCKvbH3a4V5IPoRAG85eDaniNqO.jpg','2021-10-28',107,'Released',NULL,'The Shadow in My Eye',650031,5.1423,7.8,'_yBnTjcAJDY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46354,_binary '\0','/sfoaAbgEQlQI8dBFJsiIdXiLI7x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9172422',7.4,22142,'fr','La Belle Époque','Victor, a disillusioned 60-something whose marriage is on the rocks, opts to relive the week of his life when, 40 years earlier, he met his true love through a company that allows customers to return to the time period of their choosing.','/eHojoVxYRyqGABgoiTYyfkYqTra.jpg','2019-11-06',115,'Released','If you could live your own life again, would you do it?','La Belle Époque',595975,5.6186,7.4,'1fUovd1thLk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46355,_binary '\0','/gnbc5drrjXoyYlSEqtdOl1I9TLi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9172840',5.8,3496,'hi','मोतीचूर चकनाचूर','A woman whose single purpose in life is to marry a foreign-settled groom decides to marry a 36-year-old Dubai-returned professional who is desperate for a bride.','/9viHDkVC1Xl08jmau6ikudz7eH8.jpg','2019-11-15',150,'Released',NULL,'Motichoor Chaknachoor',643438,1.1521,6.389,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46356,_binary '\0','/cu4q2X6PI3eukfBtCADVzRC68Re.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9172960',5.1,1634,'en','Follow Her','An aspiring actress responds to a mysterious classified ad and finds herself trapped in her new boss\'s twisted revenge fantasy.','/gjUVNAuJjKJoBNIV4OLI2IsKIld.jpg','2022-09-30',95,'Released','You want to be famous, right?','Follow Her',943919,3.4646,4.9,'Y-kFhmq9ZgA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46357,_binary '\0','/7z5MJGJ9CObnu770ZubDQye7DKD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9173154',4.7,6834,'en','Separation','A young girl finds solace in her artist father and the ghost of her dead mother.','/jNJ8vKNKT75EW4cvpiWCMvg5TFS.jpg','2021-04-30',107,'Released','It won\'t let go.','Separation',760195,3.3588,5.627,'dkDDTNTXhNw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46358,_binary '\0','/po4p0AfL0NrjQ5S219L6XOEUywn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9173264',6,6658,'fr','Sibyl','Sibyl, a jaded psychotherapist, returns to her first passion: writing. But her newest patient Margot, a troubled up-and-coming actress, proves to be a source of inspiration that is far too tempting. Fascinated almost to the point of obsession, Sibyl becomes more and more involved in Margot’s tumultuous life, reviving volatile memories that bring her face to face with her past.','/9W4pznUF8Np6qHExgclaRHVHzom.jpg','2019-05-24',101,'Released',NULL,'Sibyl',559401,4.1217,5.668,'N3HczgfHh8U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46359,_binary '\0','/jeiVmutYPZyQRSYk7OvyWENGIrA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9173418',4.7,22939,'en','Brahms: The Boy II','After a family moves into the Heelshire Mansion, their young son soon makes friends with a life-like doll called Brahms.','/swTC1DSZcvdxTOzmAKrtoUUPiDW.jpg','2020-02-20',87,'Released','He\'s made a friend.','Brahms: The Boy II',555974,7.5777,5.9,'ECPfXUW0zt8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46360,_binary '\0','/vRl2GlAx1MWdnTYf3VGCKnbDx6i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9174334',6.2,2437,'ko','동네사람들','A gym teacher and his female student look for her missing friend. But as they investigate, they find that her disappearance is a part of a larger conspiracy.','/pox2kO29D3NAem5dnAuJEioMEBm.jpg','2018-11-07',99,'Released','Do not trust anyone.','Ordinary People',549590,2.8964,7.5,'SA7ne5H2Jxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46361,_binary '\0','/zkPheFJAk0xjGW9IC3rAxjNuDSB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9174358',5.2,1715,'en','Monster Hunter: Legends of the Guild','In a world where humans and fearsome monsters live in an uneasy balance, young hunter Aiden fights to save his village from destruction by a dragon.','/nQnsD1u1n2aFq8qfu4dQrhLzaUp.jpg','2021-08-12',58,'Released','Hope. Fear. Pleasure. Pain. Fight. Survive.','Monster Hunter: Legends of the Guild',851281,3.1369,5.722,'PqFjjs_qNn4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46362,_binary '\0','/1MROljBHRhNZJ4ynyLMdYoYTwmi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9174420',6.2,1377,'kn','Seetharama Kalyana','Arya, the son of an influential man in the city, falls in love with Geetha, an innocent girl from a small town. He thinks his life is set but fate has more than a little trouble in store for him.','/vf1RQLn1rOknH67g1iL9cBvCCyD.jpg','2019-01-25',155,'Released',NULL,'Seetharama Kalyana',577745,0.6057,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46363,_binary '\0','/99TjHpVoTXiMN6LRF828MlDaPpn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9176086',4.5,4450,'hi','साइना','Champion. Olympic Medallist. The Doyen of Indian Badminton. Saina Nehwal is all of this and much more. This biopic chronicles the inspiring story of a gifted youngster\'s ascendance to the pinnacle of the Badminton World through sheer passion and perseverance.','/fdZZDmeO0lybBrxdudwdQmbmxJq.jpg','2021-03-26',133,'Released',NULL,'Saina',801831,1.3944,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46364,_binary '\0','/f6isxFwOuPLNTEIUN3aicwz1DJA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9176136',5.8,1602,'pa','High End Yaariyaan','High End Yaariyaan is a tale of 3 friends Ranjit Bawa, Jassie Gill, and Ninja who lives abroad. The story narrates how their friendship has evolved over a period of time and the struggles they each go through while living away from their homeland.','/pZyrzwRjx95tsNqMMQdh4fKCTYs.jpg','2019-02-22',140,'Released',NULL,'High End Yaariyaan',584050,0.8854,7.5,'Khe2Nl6P-Yc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46365,_binary '\0','/Ad604TQ5rqXShdjY92BpHpSmLy9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9176296',5.2,8046,'hi','डॉली किट्टी और वो चमकते सितारे','A disillusioned Delhi wife (Dolly), and her new-in-town cousin (Kitty), navigate damning secrets, dreams and their thorny dynamic on their respective roads to freedom.','/jGXdE7Qe2Sgth64GVgnhnMF79NJ.jpg','2020-09-18',120,'Released',NULL,'Dolly Kitty and Those Twinkling Stars',639414,1.1261,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46366,_binary '\0','/hldPY45usHEt6Zv73oxe1yKyUa0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9177040',5,5270,'en','Trick','A detective tries to track down a masked killer who reappears every Halloween to wreak bloody havoc.','/vxo4qqrhz61SnAUtlHIbYPzZoBU.jpg','2019-10-18',101,'Released','Always choose treat.','Trick',628707,4.2777,5.864,'DSi6U2j3V2U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46367,_binary '\0','/dPPjBf74W1j8va6KvDGePaJcqm7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9177882',7.3,11148,'en','Constantine: City of Demons - The Movie','A decade after a tragic mistake, family man Chas Chandler and occult detective John Constantine set out to cure his daughter Trish from a mysterious supernatural coma.','/tZIMe2pYug1cS9e7AZnd1bTTidM.jpg','2018-10-04',90,'Released','To stop a devil, you must summon a bigger one.','Constantine: City of Demons - The Movie',539517,5.1888,7.668,'Tgujmtdj_3c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46368,_binary '\0','/ruXHUA3KiiLEjCwvSqKuxe9O6ZQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9178402',4.4,3862,'en','The Pale Door','The Dalton gang escape to a nearby town after a train robbery goes south, but they are met by a coven of witches with sinister plans for the unsuspecting outlaws.','/jkAZb9jteax1XRnEFlCU9Oer1YJ.jpg','2020-08-21',96,'Released','It was the perfect score. But hell was their reward.','The Pale Door',610201,1.8417,5.2,'2CLqzKWDyxg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46369,_binary '\0','/2iOWzL6dManoWwzGEbe0mHkcdpm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9179096',7.2,25262,'en','Minamata','War photographer W. Eugene Smith travels back to Japan where he documents the devastating effect of mercury poisoning in coastal communities.','/tjn9yxa5QNFsV2mFPsaWdqOOk2g.jpg','2020-03-13',115,'Released','Let truth be the prejudice.','Minamata',560008,4.079,6.9,'Hgy3IQkd_dY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46370,_binary '\0','/wYYxCxep4AAtoq98zQCrKx0cFBY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9179230',7.6,5722,'da','Ser du månen, Daniel','HELD FOR RANSOM tells the true story of Danish photojournalist Daniel Rye who was held hostage for 398 days in Syria by the terror organization ISIS along with several other foreign nationals including the American journalist, James Foley. The film follows Daniel’s struggle to survive in captivity, his friendship with James, and the nightmare of the Rye family back home in Denmark as they try to do everything in their power to save their son. At the center of this crisis, we find hostage negotiator, Arthur, who plays a pivotal role in securing Daniel’s release.','/uUmXSyhZzq3Yd5n6615mhfMgy6B.jpg','2019-08-29',138,'Released',NULL,'Held for Ransom',607528,3.2926,7,'kX_CpUXFJFQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46371,_binary '\0','/5Dw7hINHK5RKhNVtbBO3A8uKFit.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9179426',6.3,1322,'hi','Satellite Shankar','Indian Army soldier Shankar gets injured in cross-firing at the border. Senior Officer suggests he take 8 days to rest after consultation with doctors. Shankar requests for leave instead of rest, officers agree and tell him to report to duty on the morning of the 8th day. While traveling, he helps citizens and ends up missing his train. Online news reporter covers his story without acknowledging him. The story later revolves around how he reaches his home and then back to duty in a short span of time.','/tGyHwFAgCGNTqz2VpSlcx6Uyf82.jpg','2019-11-08',130,'Released',NULL,'Satellite Shankar',628566,1.0036,7.375,'xFAhZvM0lRQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46372,_binary '\0','/dkIX4dSMuVqjfrPGunBJUR7K3LQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9179430',8.3,91109,'ta','விக்ரம்','Amar is assigned to investigate a case of serial killings. When Amar investigates the case, he realizes it is not what it seems to be and following down this path will lead to nothing but war between everyone involved.','/774UV1aCURb4s4JfEFg3IEMu5Zj.jpg','2022-06-02',174,'Released','Once upon a time there lived a ghost...','Vikram',743563,3.842,7.632,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46373,_binary '\0','/eTHuVXsUMGGSCCvYdMxpS6KNurZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9179974',6.6,2346,'de','Dem Horizont so nah','Jessica knows exactly what her life is supposed to look like and where it takes her. But then she meets Danny. He has a complicated past and could confuse all their plans. Jessica has to decide.','/c8K79975Xtoy0i715QLZVpIoPDe.jpg','2019-10-10',117,'Released',NULL,'Close to the Horizon',594634,4.7127,7.8,'ULXKZB5g7YQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46374,_binary '\0','/k7hTCPFCBT9wwqNE1qUuEnSQVa9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9182964',4.9,4297,'en','The Reckoning','In the aftermath of the Great Plague and amidst the subsequent witch-hunts against women, a young widow grapples with the tragic death of her husband in a society completely consumed by fear and death. Because she rejects the advances of her landlord, she is falsely accused of being a witch and thrown in jail for a crime she didn’t commit. She must endure physical persecution at the hands of England’s most ruthless witch-hunter and face her own inner demons as the devil himself starts to work his way into her mind.','/i7P5DqW1wDNpX2Ug0kAFKJSL7bX.jpg','2021-02-05',111,'Released','Fear spreads like The Plague.','The Reckoning',587130,3.0196,6.425,'xR0Dj3jcCOM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46375,_binary '\0','/ujL5e6S2PSkPE3FNSNrPGlB2haF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9183978',4.6,4014,'en','Arctic Void','When the power mysteriously fails, and almost everyone vanishes from a small tourist vessel in the Arctic, fear becomes the master for the three who remain. Forced ashore, the men deteriorate in body and mind until a dark truth emerges that compels them to ally or perish.','/tNsiUYvnPdzue9stFpqSAcXwuMe.jpg','2022-01-14',85,'Released','You are the experiment.','Arctic Void',919873,1.9264,5,'_uCzX57-J1I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46376,_binary '\0','/lu4Jm34oKuknQsvg4H6LyJLYXzj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9185066',5.7,9538,'en','Human Capital','Ian begins a relationship with Drew\'s daughter, who works in the financial sector. The couple gets involved in a tragic accident that will change their lives forever. At the same time, the accident has a major impact on both their families who, despite the class difference, cross paths.','/fgpui5bN3zbpmgIIPPiZ3i1u8pv.jpg','2020-07-17',95,'Released','Every life has a price.','Human Capital',569711,4.4286,5.7,'s_X35NgQTAk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46377,_binary '\0','/qNmLEOGZy37vKAPqcTuZ47uCOS9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9185206',7.3,39275,'en','Are You There God? It\'s Me, Margaret.','When her family moves from New York City to New Jersey, an 11-year-old girl navigates new friends, feelings, and the beginning of adolescence.','/yb6UB4WC3znlwU0L4AqMnjR9G9S.jpg','2023-03-29',106,'Released','Discovering who you are is a journey that lasts a lifetime.','Are You There God? It\'s Me, Margaret.',555285,7.2005,7.145,'LzRzojHC3iE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46378,_binary '\0','/pgpOc0sGOiZ59omUh6xLMpbghiz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9185316',6.6,3305,'en','I Am Woman','In 1966, Helen Reddy landed in New York with her three year old daughter, a suitcase, and $230 in her pocket. Within weeks, she was broke. Within months, she was in love. Within five years, she was one of the biggest superstars of her time and an icon of the 1970s feminist movement who wrote a song which galvanized a generation of women to fight for change.','/gpAkNeMzrSTJX2YIYcuwfqBrEqS.jpg','2020-08-28',116,'Released','The Helen Reddy story and the song that inspired a revolution','I Am Woman',531033,2.4679,6.2,'6WLMz8Qeg4A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46379,_binary '\0','/aXLcNxJI2JDdASNL6ZaNI0jWl2s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9185816',7.6,2168,'en','Woodstock','50 years after the legendary fest, Barak Goodman’s electric retelling of Woodstock, from the point of view of those who were on the ground, evokes the freedom, passion, community, and joy the three-day music festival created.','/ejPrzjG17UrYHjUn8xE3EAYnoDl.jpg','2019-05-24',106,'Released','Three Days that Defined a Generation','Woodstock: Three Days That Defined a Generation',588226,1.7395,7.3,'WEaMka89dM4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46380,_binary '\0','/nIXiHzPjrV6GKzNcXXynKndZ9OT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9187214',7.3,2511,'es','Los fuertes','Lucas travels to visit his sister to a remote town in southern Chile. In front of the ocean and the fog, he meets Antonio, a boatswain in a local fishing boat. When an intense romance grows between them, their strength, their independence and their adulthood become immovable in front of the tide.','/s53aBDGTA6Db6I2msWo46VLes2X.jpg','2020-03-12',98,'Released','A story of love and bravery at the end of the world.','The Strong Ones',637860,1.9539,7.6,'dY95t44cZxU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46381,_binary '\0','/78ycoJaCgjtB0YbDIHaObFwJkvG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9191844',4.6,1490,'en','Fear PHarm','Four people enter a corn maze for Halloween and are picked off one by one by the twisted family who own the scare attraction.','/mSlmVGukZquWwiw3Bv2sArX5UmE.jpg','2020-09-11',79,'Released','Step into your worst nightmare.','Fear PHarm',743022,1.3619,5.2,'fHJQ8nCJQBI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46382,_binary '\0','/vooRKLGVvFRFmx9swcMh26uYZSf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9193612',6.9,5559,'ja','きみと、波にのれたら','Hinako is a surf-loving college student who has just moved to a small seaside town. When a sudden fire breaks out at her apartment building, she is rescued by Minato, a handsome firefighter, and the two soon fall in love.','/byoY2stdullEcVjlaWs1ENXyrDm.jpg','2019-06-21',95,'Released','True love knows no boundaries.','Ride Your Wave',530079,5.0025,7.6,'Cl1AI-3zcnk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46383,_binary '\0','/6j2g4fEAmjJqAclzprIpvz9Gaw4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9196192',3.6,33390,'fr','Mignonnes','Amy, an 11-year-old girl, joins a group of dancers named “the cuties” at school, and rapidly grows aware of her burgeoning femininity—upsetting her mother and her values in the process.','/ow3OA6OC0rjgbMVaLn2drwjvqZE.jpg','2020-08-19',96,'Released',NULL,'Cuties',582885,2.6032,5.1,'M0O7lLe4SmA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46384,_binary '\0','/90IcDDC47Rck4D2fyZbpZ1rbFZW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9198364',6.7,73923,'en','Three Thousand Years of Longing','A solitary scholar discovers an ancient bottle while on a trip to Istanbul and unleashes a djinn who offers her three wishes. Filled with reluctance, she is unable to come up with one, so the djinn tries to inspire her with his stories.','/nS7DNl4A7XnDncZX70UJ8ALAihF.jpg','2022-08-24',108,'Released','What would you wish for?','Three Thousand Years of Longing',556694,10.4676,6.878,'TWGvntl9itE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46385,_binary '\0','/yQS4QB3JDa6zIrn9b6SNAELJGwb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9201772',6.7,2287,'en','Mending the Line','A Marine wounded in Afghanistan returns to a VA hospital in Montana where he meets a Vietnam vet who teaches him fly fishing as a means to coming to terms with his physical and emotional trauma.','/BBgXPj3crSX1gidLhdw3gGVrK.jpg','2023-06-09',117,'Released','For some, the path starts on the river.','Mending the Line',863858,2.9457,6.5,'tSkv_sEyPSc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46386,_binary '\0','/8O3kBLSjYr2oLRT3bXUS8e3ZiUM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9202096',6.4,1986,'en','Christmas Bells Are Ringing','Samantha, a freelance photographer, is returning to Cape Cod for the first time since the death of her mother years earlier. She’s going to celebrate her father’s Christmas Eve wedding but is anxious to revisit past memories. On a deadline for a big Christmas spread that could ignite her career, she enlists the help of her childhood friend, Mike, to show her around. In the time she spends in Cape Cod, she realizes that Christmas is wherever your family is.','/bJV4HVbYZMblIEa1bqk6mSHQ5YJ.jpg','2018-12-23',90,'Released',NULL,'Christmas Bells Are Ringing',555281,2.0302,5.6,'g2MPR8lWArA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46387,_binary '\0','/tFOGNL5e7IcOmifu57PTsJMlGl6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9202550',5.3,3562,'en','The Toll','A socially awkward driver and a weary passenger try to make it to their destination while being haunted by a supernatural threat.','/q6vV6sSWz9cytmc8L9IEBjjyFmV.jpg','2020-07-13',81,'Released','You gotta pay the troll toll','The Toll',638045,3.5531,5.439,'GvEfAPRBjOM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46388,_binary '\0','/gUcoXuZoc7Z1RTQxgBXEsLQXjW8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9203190',5.3,4929,'zh','天·火','Tianhuo Island is as beautiful as a paradise. It almost makes people forget that it is located in the \"Ring of Fire\" the world-famous Pacific Rim volcanic belt. The volcano erupts, and the fates of the people on the island are entangled.','/dDf8M1yMwvBVe8VtOKxCpOog8CF.jpg','2019-12-12',93,'Released','The mountain is waking up','Skyfire',604872,4.2997,6.3,'Tc-1zrJSy6k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46389,_binary '\0','/cBFkBnfnVed0ufGgPzdtd9QcJSo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9203586',6.8,1509,'en','Cryptopia: Bitcoin, Blockchains & the Future of the Internet','Cryptopia: Bitcoin, Blockchains and the Future of the Internet takes a deep dive into the crypto ecosystem and blockchain technology to discover the good, the bad and the ugly of this controversial industry, its major narratives, conflicts and the major players behind it. Can blockchain technology be used to create a new, fairer, decentralised and uncensored web3.0 where we can control our data and protect our online identities? Or will the potential be squandered as mega corporations once again compete for dominance in this new field. With his unrivalled and exclusive access, award-winning filmmaker Torsten Hoffman (Bitcoin: The End of Money as We Know It) takes us on a journey into the heart of this brave new world.','/o3dGOQ5PsfKvtv9ew8Ee3S6A5JR.jpg','2020-12-10',86,'Released',NULL,'Cryptopia: Bitcoin, Blockchains & the Future of the Internet',702738,1.0421,7,'M6GgU08rxyg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46390,_binary '\0','/cBGQMVohebbWfmEGdezjyOdW7MO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9203694',5.7,57596,'en','Stowaway','A three-person crew on a mission to Mars faces an impossible choice when an unplanned passenger jeopardizes the lives of everyone on board.','/eFyRjhJfhNgM565U2mwEp5YUUOv.jpg','2021-06-24',116,'Released','Millions of miles from home, survival comes with sacrifice.','Stowaway',559581,5.12,6.023,'A_apvQkWsVY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46391,_binary '\0','/dk56abIpSm48mZ8oeluV2b0qvLR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9203832',6.9,4255,'en','Fireball: Visitors from Darker Worlds','This remarkable journey across our planet and universe explores how meteorites, shooting stars, and deep impacts have awoken our wonder about other realms—and make us rethink our destinies.','/x9VHW8gHJGLXuEtOLrocH89dzeo.jpg','2020-09-10',98,'Released','Explore the meaning of falling stars, meteorites and deep impacts.','Fireball: Visitors from Darker Worlds',574082,4.914,6.5,'K4X9fQsiAOQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46392,_binary '\0','/u6GALns99aM7nDdcY4Cxf6sACdC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9204164',5.8,4314,'en','Bigfoot Family','Bigfoot, Adam\'s father, wants to use his fame for a good cause. Protecting a large wildlife reserve in Alaska sounds like the perfect opportunity! When Bigfoot mysteriously disappears without a trace, Adam and his animal friends will brave anything to find him again and save the nature reserve.','/vn7sNO6CD8FBHBEVcOiNv08mjy1.jpg','2020-07-23',97,'Released','The truth is out there… and it’s big!','Bigfoot Family',702525,9.5241,7.075,'YewYuPqakzw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46393,_binary '\0','/jnq1lg6Fd8b6pn5ud5hVFS2hSyf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9204204',5.8,10125,'en','Little Joe','Alice, a single mother who is more dedicated to her work as a genetic engineer than to her teenage son Joe, develops a new variety of flower that is supposed to have the ability to make its owner happy thanks to its special chemical properties.','/q4VMyavCoXxN9U8AONE2YryQDVz.jpg','2019-11-01',106,'Released','Happiness is a business','Little Joe',504585,3.7354,5.741,'9DnB00P10UU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46394,_binary '\0','/2fAnbhiwqPiu0XHA98nZrPckPgv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9204328',5.5,10675,'en','Dark Harvest','In a small Midwestern town, a deadly annual ritual unfolds when the mythical nightmare, Sawtooth Jack, rises from the cornfields and challenges the town’s teenage boys in a bloody battle of survival.','/sFBDjWdw8gHSI2dMivP7H52iwvp.jpg','2023-10-11',96,'Released','Evil stalks.','Dark Harvest',675531,7.2481,6.059,'Pge4NmBzdkE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46395,_binary '\0','/bhTMwf7XO4mbk4plgvFjq7tzoWt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9205538',5.6,1770,'de','Je suis Karl','An explosion sends fear and terror through Berlin. Young Maxi\'s home is reduced to rubble and ashes, burying her mother and little brothers. Only she and her father survive the terrorist bomb attack. When she happens to meet the charismatic Karl, who tells her about a conference for young people in Prague, she seizes the opportunity to flee Berlin and her grieving father. The political movement behind the meeting claims to be working for a better Europe. Maxi has no idea how close the murderers really are to her family.','/gQJcTlIfLJayp5TdlvFzwh9gtMp.jpg','2021-09-16',126,'Released',NULL,'Je suis Karl',683641,2.2761,5.3,'Pzg_nWktMAs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46396,_binary '\0','/7htEgZpTc1YOsAZkzXShas2grtd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9206562',7.9,3590,'en','Make Us Dream','Steven Gerrard became perhaps the greatest player in the history of Liverpool FC, but did so when success and trophies were declining. It became his personal mission to lift the famous club back to the top. That loyalty raised him to God-like status with Liverpool fans, but was an unbearable burden, bringing with it a profound sense of responsibility to live up to their and his own expectations.','/ikuKQxE1tfVMCIZVsMyePaZlNEy.jpg','2018-11-15',104,'Released',NULL,'Make Us Dream',561894,1.3551,7.5,'0IrHv6wrcRs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46397,_binary '\0','/xLE1WRF15ItCO0whHdgze8NC0kd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9206798',6.3,6137,'en','All Is True','London, June 29th, 1613. The Globe Theater, ran by the famous playwright William Shakespeare, accidentally burns to ashes. Seriously affected, he stops writing and returns to his hometown, where his wife Anne and daughters Judith and Susanna get surprised to hear he intends to stay there definitively, after two decades working in the capital, neglecting his sincere affections for them.','/yae0QoZuPQ6yC8HleRYXXfttPLh.jpg','2018-12-21',101,'Released','The final act of the world\'s greatest playwright','All Is True',558095,3.1105,6.05,'1I5cKmiONDI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46398,_binary '\0','/5nRyaVklxyA9OkxqZaPv1KBRqpd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9207700',6,12986,'en','Made in Italy','A bohemian artist travels from London to Italy with his estranged son to sell the house they inherited from his late wife.','/dKjD3DTZjRI3Ipkf7Oz5zAILnwD.jpg','2020-07-09',94,'Released',NULL,'Made in Italy',659991,5.3164,6,'tJHcv0Pm0RU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46399,_binary '\0','/ummzpRlgm6iSP4wIsTmEZHHlkrG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9208444',5.7,7837,'en','Impractical Jokers: The Movie','The story of a humiliating high school mishap from 1992 that sends the Impractical Jokers on the road competing in hidden-camera challenges for the chance to turn back the clock and redeem three of the four Jokers.','/kTHzM6pPIjs4LHX33thyZpnKiOP.jpg','2020-02-21',92,'Released','10 challenges. 3 tickets. 1 wild ride.','Impractical Jokers: The Movie',566927,3.3254,6.5,'IQQ8_VVR4TA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46400,_binary '\0','/hLz8Uf0XHuJiMaEVBRbuxZIKcWA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9211804',6.7,5081,'sv','Quick','A true and captivating story about the biggest legal scandal in Swedish history, the story about the reporter who questioned an entire legal system. Hannes Råstam was dedicated to proving the innocence of Thomas Quick and unmask the legal chaos which sentenced Quick to a life in psychiatric prison.','/jLMTdvygnav436Y9TQ3aFcYCcCG.jpg','2019-09-20',110,'Released','The Making of a Serial Killer','The Perfect Patient',606146,2.7624,6.28,'oJ_WqkUj-qc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46401,_binary '\0','/prQlhl1jZnXKGG1GCcbthk5jqxO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9212666',5.7,1611,'en','Mr. 365','When workaholic reality TV producer Sophie starts working on a holiday-season show about Will, a wildly sexy guy who celebrates Christmas every day of the year, she finds herself falling for her mysterious, unlikely new star, renewing her long-lost faith in Xmas in the process.','/2dKEhn6fgWJELr3IZP1KpEixDY2.jpg','2018-10-15',90,'Released',NULL,'Mr. 365',569982,2.1094,6.2,'goeJ1IDvgB0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46402,_binary '\0','/kUfhJUEa4Djx9yCxYCkuEcJFE12.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9213244',4.9,5899,'en','Antrum','Rumored to have been lost, Antrum appears as a cursed film from the 1970s. Viewers are warned to proceed with caution. It’s said to be a story about a young boy and girl who enter the forest in an attempt to save the soul of their recently deceased pet. They journey to “The Antrum,” the very spot the devil landed after being cast out of heaven. There, the children begin to dig a hole to hell.','/20de4Rcmy4B0L5zyOc3Nc5F7c0D.jpg','2018-10-14',94,'Released','The deadliest film ever made','Antrum',412546,3.334,5.7,'faQ828XMCc4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46403,_binary '\0','/iM2nGYS8oz2LqShBFpmQKd9pTgg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9213932',6.1,1992,'pt','Kardec','The story of Allan Kardec, from his days as an educator to his contribution to the spiritist codification.','/gDfki2cMZnwHOUKNfVNWiRNMGht.jpg','2019-05-16',110,'Released','The story behind the name','Kardec',600335,1.8327,6.574,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46404,_binary '\0','/9NSXdVHeSfSHUv49OzLispFcpz1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9214772',6.8,101478,'en','Monkey Man','Kid is an anonymous young man who ekes out a meager living in an underground fight club where, night after night, wearing a gorilla mask, he is beaten bloody by more popular fighters for cash. After years of suppressed rage, Kid discovers a way to infiltrate the enclave of the city’s sinister elite. As his childhood trauma boils over, his mysteriously scarred hands unleash an explosive campaign of retribution to settle the score with the men who took everything from him.','/4lhR4L2vzzjl68P1zJyCH755Oz4.jpg','2024-04-03',122,'Released','One small ember can burn down everything.','Monkey Man',560016,10.574,6.862,'aqa3YTtwvaU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46405,_binary '\0','/42gqGeyXh4caHP19Tqf8DMRgc7r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9214832',6.7,73224,'en','Emma.','In 1800s England, a well-meaning but selfish young woman meddles in the love lives of her friends.','/uHpHzbHLSsVmAuuGuQSpyVDZmDc.jpg','2020-02-13',125,'Released','Love knows best.','Emma.',556678,9.2669,7.006,'qsOwj0PR5Sk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46406,_binary '\0','/84y04aFAB3vGJd2hrkbqV9rm39w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9214844',5.9,1284,'ja','十二人の死にたい子どもたち','A group of boys and girls, twelve in total, gather at an abandoned hospital to die for various different reasons. There, they find the body of a dead boy. The group of twelve attempt to find the person who killed the boy. During their search, the reasons why they want to die are revealed.','/h5yAnJxRuiLPabIrwinqGbCGetQ.jpg','2019-01-25',118,'Released','What does it mean to want to die?','12 Suicidal Teens',566387,2.2504,6.359,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46407,_binary '\0','/wrA6f75Mhs1nU4LFwzNKa7VdxVP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9217296',5.7,3130,'en','Donny\'s Bar Mitzvah','Donny Drucker\'s 1998 Bar Mitzvah VHS Tape.','/g1AsusfQZlPrQKD6Twf8OKwHhRz.jpg','2021-03-23',79,'Released',NULL,'Donny\'s Bar Mitzvah',797884,1.8109,6.2,'uOIP5Ch0Z9Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46408,_binary '\0','/tTMVEbdV5OAQLvD0MovZ2HHM3N2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9217716',6.8,4929,'en','Click & Collect','To save his daughter\'s Christmas, Andrew goes on a road trip with Dev, his neighbour from hell, to buy an elusive Sparklehoof the Unicorn Princess.','/rCAZcvvbHtI9M3EQ2qGXTjdBrLQ.jpg','2018-12-24',53,'Released',NULL,'Click & Collect',566565,2.0552,6.556,'UxHgsgBtYLc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46409,_binary '\0','/wZSfEsbvtB0ICogQDKeQt3fi7NX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9217772',5.3,1255,'en','A Wedding for Christmas','Haley Foster built a big city life in Los Angeles as a top wedding planner at an elite and powerful company run by Ms. Reynolds. When her sister, Angela, insists on getting married Christmas Day on the tree farm in their old hometown of Truxton, Haley is resigned to make her sister’s dreams come true and her parents happy.','/hht0P0qrFlSrITwNH77nWmaCqmO.jpg','2018-11-25',90,'Released',NULL,'A Wedding for Christmas',564637,2.0967,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46410,_binary '\0','/tOqIwliWMovSIZ9DyvHcHI7p2im.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9218128',6.4,312908,'en','Gladiator II','Years after witnessing the death of the revered hero Maximus at the hands of his uncle, Lucius is forced to enter the Colosseum after his home is conquered by the tyrannical Emperors who now lead Rome with an iron fist. With rage in his heart and the future of the Empire at stake, Lucius must look to his past to find strength and honor to return the glory of Rome to its people.','/2cxhvwyEwRlysAmRH4iodkvo0z5.jpg','2024-11-13',148,'Released','Prepare to be entertained.','Gladiator II',558449,25.6381,6.592,'4rgYUipGJNo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46411,_binary '\0','/2H2C4OGjbeHeybAZvSErSDth1pU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9220966',5.4,1583,'de','The Trouble with Being Born','Elli is an android and lives with a man she calls her father. Together they drift through the summer. During the day they swim in the pool and at night he takes her to bed. She shares his memories and anything else he programs her to recall. Memories that mean everything to him but nothing to her. Yet, one night she sets off into the woods following a fading echo… The story of a machine and the ghosts we all carry within us.','/qwGRTBVfUTEnNBQNg14S1Hrjzfi.jpg','2020-12-03',94,'Released',NULL,'The Trouble with Being Born',664589,1.4023,5,'ykWO1FhqTfo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46412,_binary '\0','/8mWJ3dq6LEum3menVc25vp5sRzd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9222962',7,2377,'te','ఏకమ్','Based on Lord Shiva, the current society, and the concept of oneness. Five people who are in stark contrast with one another, their natures symbolized by the five elements of nature – fire, water, wind, earth, and sky.','/iI4kkdtyRwDYaczwrSfirRkY2vu.jpg','2021-10-29',125,'Released','The Journey of Jobless God','Eakam',925256,1.0085,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46413,_binary '\0','/5mzr6JZbrqnqD8rCEvPhuCE5Fw2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9224104',5,105225,'en','Meg 2: The Trench','An exploratory dive into the deepest depths of the ocean of a daring research team spirals into chaos when a malevolent mining operation threatens their mission and forces them into a high-stakes battle for survival.','/4m1Au3YkjqsxF8iwQy0fPYSxE0h.jpg','2023-08-02',116,'Released','Back for seconds.','Meg 2: The Trench',615656,30.3149,6.356,'dG91B3hHyY4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46414,_binary '\0','/9eYrq3NZq3WsCuYQS0q9zPr1eMf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9224288',5.1,6700,'en','Mainstream','A young woman thinks she’s found a path to internet stardom when she starts making YouTube videos with a charismatic stranger – until the dark side of viral celebrity threatens to ruin them both.','/9vTf02WXyldeKN4kfwZRwwI4XbG.jpg','2021-05-07',95,'Released','Like him. Or not.','Mainstream',557950,2.7105,6.4,'Rlpm36Vi-3U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46415,_binary '\0','/3XPgvbWGlEJfgmEBzQHLtcEZfLt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9225192',6.6,7218,'ko','성난황소','Dong-chul and Ji-soo are a happily married couple. One day, Dong-chul comes home to find his house in disarray and his wife missing.','/csle64zkLObsdRoabreC6bBRxLI.jpg','2018-11-22',116,'Released','A human trafficking ring faces their doom when they kidnap an ex-gangster\'s wife.','Unstoppable',554972,5.2453,7.657,'1oJIU7QqFyU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46416,_binary '\0','/nWUjEWytw4mr9BEkiPhIxof4034.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9226154',1.1,1321,'ru','Крымский мост. Сделано с любовью!','A Russian propaganda film about the Crimean Bridge being built in Kerch. Dima, a young and daring builder, has a hobby: from every change of female students-archeologists choose the most beautiful and win it. And this time would have happened the same, if not for Moscow PR man. He brought to the construction of television crews from America, and, of course, it is he, a luxurious careerist on a white convertible that will win the Varya\'s heart. While the two contenders charm her, the hot Caucasian Bernard Is trying to realize his dream to marry an American and go to Hollywood.','/j97EPjQj6APoWbLxDkykN2m78wK.jpg','2018-11-01',102,'Released',NULL,'Crimean Bridge. Made With Love!',556485,1.4185,2.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46417,_binary '\0','/rz0rXiUtrPnksJOfGsEPrJMSgtv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9228950',5.2,1904,'en','Malibu Rescue','When a long list of shenanigans lands Tyler in hot water, he’s forced to suit up and spend his summer training for an elite junior lifeguard program.','/7pWOciZg6BsZytgV63oReKoHbWs.jpg','2019-05-13',69,'Released',NULL,'Malibu Rescue',576040,2.3364,6.1,'PliMsBQSefU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46418,_binary '\0','/8P3qur5Xh6dsH6xmZ1O2XS7vnc2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9231040',7.1,24848,'en','First Cow','In the 1820s, a taciturn loner and skilled cook travels west to Oregon Territory, where he meets a Chinese immigrant also seeking his fortune. Soon the two team up on a dangerous scheme to steal milk from the wealthy landowner’s prized Jersey cow—the first, and only, in the territory.','/yS41crZ1i0fFxCQbuL7I1Y1VBwm.jpg','2020-03-06',122,'Released','A simple western about the origin of the American Dream.','First Cow',558582,5.8696,7.032,'SRUWVT87mt8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46419,_binary '\0','/y3LLicmL259XSw33wkw4KiSOAfX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9231140',8,4415,'id','A Man Called Ahok','An indonesian biopic movie on the controversial former Jakarta governor Ahok.','/zjPBCY9MEYT3PbL6VMdiQyPENl8.jpg','2018-11-11',102,'Released',NULL,'A Man Called Ahok',554731,1.3545,7.6,'HgLhHaJLvkA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46420,_binary '\0','/eZGfcExvsCHX0Vv7p1fRwpKlXoW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9234450',6.6,2984,'fr','Madre','Ten years have gone by since Elena\'s six-year old son has disappeared. The last thing she heard of him was a phone call he gave her, saying that he was lost on a beach in France and couldn\'t find his father. Nowadays, Elena lives on this same beach and manages a restaurant. She is finally beginning to emerge from this tragic episode when she meets a French teenager who strongly reminds her of her lost son. The two of them will embark on a relationship which will sow chaos and distrust around them.','/44t2duQH0gHCWTBtQRuZsrTS1Xo.jpg','2019-11-11',128,'Released',NULL,'Mother',594692,2.3628,6.716,'HHwIjmFT_Mk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46421,_binary '\0','/wqpTrmGiqMJ6onAq3zrBhfomIJl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9239552',7.8,7605,'ja','映画 この素晴らしい世界に祝福を！紅伝説','After receiving a warning that Yunyun\'s hometown is in danger, Kazuma\'s party is relieved to discover it\'s only a joke...until it isn\'t. The Demon King\'s general has just arrived to obtain The Mage Killer, a weapon with world-ending power.','/6hdIiFKf504I2uAMk7sXh6mATPy.jpg','2019-08-30',90,'Released','We will definitely return alive. Go back to that place.','KONOSUBA – God\'s blessing on this wonderful world! Legend of Crimson',532067,5.0979,8,'5h4rQY9bpgE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46422,_binary '\0','/hc4BCGpYjEtq1VP5gqV59tAIL7X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9239882',5.6,2508,'ta','கடாரம் கொண்டான்','Vasu, a doctor, rescues KK, a criminal, from getting murdered in the hospital. However, when Vasu\'s wife gets kidnapped, he is asked to get KK out in exchange for his wife\'s safe return.','/5iQxWYv6PE1KibL4rBFnAphhh6.jpg','2019-07-19',122,'Released',NULL,'Kadaram Kondan',561295,1.3341,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46423,_binary '\0','/anwkM7d5eh8QBTixutDcgfXXVxG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9239888',6.2,7578,'it','Lo spietato','Milan, Italy, 1967. Santo Russo, a boy of Calabrian origin, arrives north with his parents and younger brother to find better living conditions. Due to an absurd misunderstanding and his father\'s contempt, Santo ends up in prison, where he gets a “true education.” In 1978, he and his friends Slim and Mario embark on a 15-year criminal career, a successful and ruthless spiral of robberies, kidnappings, murders and heroin smuggling.','/tlm4Jtl8WJfoW2jg52f5ewKQWym.jpg','2019-04-08',111,'Released','In Milan, the thirstiest wins.','The Ruthless',571495,2.2367,6.261,'lYtmxZ1f_gk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46424,_binary '\0','/2X7BAu7x2oMB3cTMF38uJhGSqoB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9242528',6.7,7401,'en','The Survivor','Harry Haft is a boxer who fought fellow prisoners in the concentration camps to survive. Haunted by the memories and his guilt, he attempts to use high-profile fights against boxing legends like Rocky Marciano as a way to find his first love again.','/oZWJ20tGWZ5xO9CrTCVavmDRy7J.jpg','2022-04-07',129,'Released','Some fight to win. He fought to live.','The Survivor',606870,6.7066,6.8,'2pfB1esUR5c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46425,_binary '\0','/kIQc0kkqIYTo65x5XjlKgq