r no one','Rattlesnake',560362,2.8662,5.259,'LhklHFwmBYw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46441,_binary '\0','/gZbPevGesqHLzpzUBnEq5uLO7gT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9260446',5.9,1685,'it','Ma cosa ci dice il cervello','Paola, a modern woman used to the hardships of modern life, takes her chance to make things right for herself.','/bvkz0vDtvE18G3OzKEWk1Cpimjk.jpg','2019-04-18',102,'Released',NULL,'Don\'t Stop Me Now',592336,1.973,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46442,_binary '\0','/cc14e095w0ri6ppoLxSEl7iUqHs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9260636',6.7,27592,'ta','பிகில்','A do-gooder don wants his footballer son to uplift the life of his people by becoming a champion, but fate draws the youngster into a life of violence. Will he be able to fulfill his father’s dream when an opportunity comes his way seven years later?','/bk6x3PHpTC3zpVHedGFfygHxbll.jpg','2019-10-17',177,'Released',NULL,'Bigil',563309,1.6579,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46443,_binary '\0','/jbtPcqZgRdjX3CQjUUUbwK2WBqt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9261218',6.4,7506,'en','Uncorked','Elijah must balance his dream of becoming a master sommelier with his father\'s expectations that he carry on the family\'s Memphis BBQ joint.','/neUgCuBhafxYQyXTKxwjQejqqa7.jpg','2020-03-27',104,'Released','Some dreams can\'t stay bottled up.','Uncorked',660609,2.047,6.1,'s0sZtjE2MXg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46444,_binary '\0','/nkdXBPZmX7i2Dt8MKSYjmPPF7ov.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9263550',8.6,62653,'ta','Rocketry: The Nambi Effect','The story of the great Indian rocket scientist, Shri Nambi Narayanan\'s life, a true patriot, who was turned into a villain in the blink of an eye after being falsely accused of treason.','/o7A1agEoXvwyyOmIbHnUhfnC34j.jpg','2022-07-01',154,'Released',NULL,'Rocketry: The Nambi Effect',607145,2.2797,7.672,'E3s-w-G4R_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46445,