 Park',560981,1.5288,6.1,'mLw_CYP02lg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46449,_binary '\0','/zwHCbRtJy1qGhZVgoUFAIedFAmu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9271164',4.7,4027,'en','Only Mine','Tormented and left for dead by a scorned lover, a woman finds the strength within herself to recover and retaliate against her abuser.','/1EbeDRaqYTpkw35ntQGlskuak1c.jpg','2019-01-15',87,'Released','Once his, always his.','Only Mine',575923,2.5309,5.2,'GZTbXEkOW_c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46450,_binary '\0','/gpoWk9xWG9pj8jQDCJKbJBeL4YD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9271408',8,4456,'ml','ഉയരെ','An aspiring pilot fights for her future -- and justice -- after surviving an acid attack from her abusive boyfriend.','/q29OsG9w1pLNHXEuEPYSA6pYWEO.jpg','2019-04-26',125,'Released',NULL,'Uyare',594712,1.1015,7.375,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46451,_binary '\0','/7dm64SW5L5CCg47kAEAcdCGaq5i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9271672',5.4,21400,'en','Prey for the Devil','In response to a global rise in demonic possessions, the Catholic Church reopens exorcism schools to train priests in the Rite of Exorcism. On this spiritual battlefield, an unlikely warrior rises: a young nun, Sister Ann. Thrust onto the spiritual frontline with fellow student Father Dante, Sister Ann finds herself in a battle for the soul of a young girl and soon realizes the Devil has her right where he wants her.','/iCvgemXf2Kpr2LvpDmt5J9NhjKM.jpg','2022-10-23',93,'Released','It wants in.','Prey for the Devil',676547,8.8253,6.837,'OkEnG6inG4c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46452,_binary '\0','/14CUYVEfnen8V3tMrfd71UnwbB4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9271850',4.7,3617,'en','The Inheritance','Billionaire Charles Abernathy, on the eve of his 75th birthday, invites his four estranged children back home out of fear that tonight someone – or something – is coming to kill him. To ensure his family will help protect him from whatever’s coming, Abernathy puts each of their inheritances on the line – they’ll get nothing if he’s found dead by dawn.','/3qQok7BPKVcM0DA9Zu5OeMzzmk6.jpg','2024-07-12',84,'Released',NULL,'The Inheritance',821499,3.0456,5.703,'-LZ8oktImDo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46453,_binary '\0','/5xGZ8NGjgsKU9xHFniI8NBZdYXm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9272198',4.4,1315,'no','De dødes tjern','A small group of friends battle to survive in the middle of the forests and fjords of Norway. The story is based on Norwegian legend thought to be innocent folklore.','/i0ZEIl3OwwE3QrSzaB6g067Y2U9.jpg','2019-11-01',94,'Released','You never wake up from some nightmares','Lake of Death',612882,2.1299,3.9,'Ox2JVAu6uaA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46454,_binary '\0','/i7mK8CmRFT0Lg7yzqxC6DtZ7sF3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9272572',6.1,2155,'nl','Penoza: The Final Chapter','The Black Widow is not dead ... Drug Queen Carmen van Walraven is hiding in Canada and leads an anonymous life there. One evening a colleague is harassed and Carmen helps her. In self-defense, she kills the perpetrator, is arrested and extradited to the Netherlands. While her children are in shock that their mother is still alive, there are also some people who still have to settle something with Carmen. Everyone is again dragged into an emotional rollercoaster. Carmen will now have deal with her past to save her family.','/aqRXm3OXSVWuGp3bl8YO4szmos3.jpg','2019-11-28',116,'Released','The Black Widow is not dead ... and she have to deal with her past to save her family.','Penoza: The Final Chapter',551115,2.4047,6.7,'wffnOZ6kEb8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46455,_binary '\0','/6oVyb2vnpXbc3fD47Hepe0HJ9uw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9274670',4.7,6921,'en','13 Minutes','As a new day begins in the small American town of Minninnewah, the residents start their day as ordinary as the next. Mother Nature, however, has other plans for them. Inhabitants have just 13 minutes to seek shelter before the largest tornado on record ravages the town, leaving them struggling to protect their loved ones and fighting for their lives. Left to deal with the aftermath, four families must overcome their differences and find strength in each other in order to survive.','/oKng4fEr4QgS869UuWLSjAsR2rz.jpg','2021-10-29',109,'Released','Every second counts.','13 Minutes',787723,8.634,5.8,'YiEFZLRyRQo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46456,_binary '\0','/s9lJnFq30uvZm3noZFE05qmPMWp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9282616',6.9,2233,'zh','无名之辈','Two criminals hide in the apartment of a quadriplegic woman after a failed robbery attempt. Her brother, a disgraced officer, exploits the situation to return to the police force.','/xhXIJFaCgnnNxmMc2wWz9J11sey.jpg','2018-11-15',108,'Released','Life is a Drama. Smile and Live with it.','A Cool Fish',554205,1.649,6.995,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46457,_binary '\0','/3eGj3Jcp7eP4yDh7LccmV6XwW6v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9284430',6.7,2714,'fr','Le Meilleur reste à venir','Following a huge misunderstanding, two friends always decide to tackle everything to make up for lost time.','/mSAJYJbPqrmJP5eucSHtRvymMXw.jpg','2019-12-04',117,'Released',NULL,'The Best Is Yet to Come',582206,3.7137,6.8,'VFz93pHYPss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46458,_binary '\0','/zbLbjvbDph2eTYhAWWH1rbM0cP5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9285882',6.3,9758,'en','Blue Story','Blue Story is a tragic tale of a friendship between Timmy and Marco, two young boys from opposing postcodes. Timmy, a shy, smart, naive and timid young boy from Deptford, goes to school in Peckham where he strikes up a friendship with Marco, a charismatic, streetwise kid from the local area. Although from warring postcodes, the two quickly form a firm friendship until it is tested and they wind up on rival sides of a street war. Blue Story depicts elements of Rapman\'s own personal experiences and aspects of his childhood.','/qI4Rw83LxKq07xIjM3RcbKcWpAM.jpg','2019-11-22',91,'Released','Their bond made them brothers. The streets made them enemies.','Blue Story',621191,3.8423,7.265,'9H7hy7jZII0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46459,_binary '\0','/mbzazDP5XmMxxWn1q9daPVYNSdk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9286908',6.6,3050,'en','High Ground','In a remote corner of the wild country, a bloody war rages. Travis is a bounty hunter with one last hope of redemption. Gutjuk is a young Indigenous man trying to save the last of his family. Together they embark on a manhunt, which unravels a secret that ultimately pits them against each other.','/qtjaGXS9Aa0ksUNInuzkVIVua9c.jpg','2021-01-28',104,'Released','Australia\'s untold history','High Ground',522466,2.8698,6.401,'WL-G4oCoDF0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46460,_binary '\0','/qkhDU02pjig9FUzEyf9uliRq6xd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9287492',6.5,2272,'en','Winter Castle','When Jenny attends her sister’s winter wedding at an ice hotel, her heart melts over the best man, the problem is he unexpectedly brings a “plus one,” seemingly dashing her hopes for a wintery romance.','/2th61cu88aJld83u1dEiuSW1107.jpg','2019-01-05',84,'Released',NULL,'Winter Castle',570186,2.3453,6.8,'uO4PiMliZvA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46461,_binary '\0','/wUwizGzbTk5CTiKBnE4Pq1MONwD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9288046',7,66496,'en','The Sea Beast','When a young girl stows away on the ship of a legendary sea monster hunter, they launch an epic journey into uncharted waters — and make history to boot.','/9Zfv4Ap1e8eKOYnZPtYaWhLkk0d.jpg','2022-06-24',115,'Released','Hit the high seas.','The Sea Beast',560057,13.2597,7.328,'P-E-IGQCsPo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46462,_binary '\0','/ae25gpphxDPEYGUxvAGmR07oQqC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9288692',6,29764,'en','Werewolves Within','When a proposed pipeline creates hostilities between residents of a small town, a newly-arrived forest ranger must keep the peace after a snowstorm confines the townspeople to an old lodge. But when a mysterious creature begins terrorizing the group, their worst tendencies and prejudices rise to the surface, and it is up to the ranger to keep the residents alive, both from each other and the monster which plagues them.','/5CGgbgyvmE39Yoqa80GKsgClbQm.jpg','2021-06-25',96,'Released','A whodunnit with teeth.','Werewolves Within',800497,5.4399,6,'X0WzPQNIBJ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46463,_binary '\0','/4a5OaHgAEWWM7mFAszUeuz6hn8M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9288726',6.3,4015,'fr','La Daronne','A translator working for the police gets involved in the other side of drug dealing.','/ykXCevEZyEjiT8dMg8a8DDPrN3e.jpg','2020-09-09',104,'Released',NULL,'Mama Weed',575463,2.7342,5.9,'VxJ64hB0G_I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46464,_binary '\0','/e98GcbKdFmq7mjxAh5zmPGCOQyk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9288740',3.9,2021,'en','Dear David','Shortly after comic artist Adam responds to Internet trolls, he begins experiencing sleep paralysis. As he chronicles increasingly malevolent occurrences in a series of tweets, Adam begins to believe he is being haunted by the ghost of a dead child named David.','/kT5tsoIWnXlLBaeOfkoso11dUgB.jpg','2023-10-13',94,'Released','Going viral is a nightmare.','Dear David',609768,2.4539,4.7,'cjgL1lYk7VE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46465,_binary '\0','/gJESrIalQkXe7bh9ckyQvgCSlhq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9288748',6.5,4310,'en','My Father\'s Dragon','Struggling to cope after a move to the city with his mother, Elmer runs away in search of Wild Island and a young dragon who waits to be rescued. Elmer’s adventures introduce him to ferocious beasts, a mysterious island and the friendship of a lifetime.','/6hgEe1w0An5fKi3ZqIUBwOyIN2y.jpg','2022-11-04',99,'Released',NULL,'My Father\'s Dragon',560052,6.548,6.96,'0giW36Fb69c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46466,_binary '\0','/jIAyjJMrEIDjojxQDdZemDwqr82.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9288776',7,6540,'zh','白蛇：缘起','One day a young woman named Blanca is saved by Xuan, a snake catcher from a nearby village. As they set off an a journey to discover her real identity, the pair develop feelings for each other.','/30SLnoKmYNyRPkKCYowsrGLRnJA.jpg','2019-01-11',99,'Released','The legend begins.','White Snake',573699,5.3183,7.689,'FCY7E0oHW6Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46467,_binary '\0','/hJN3ZaueIDWFO5FfxoXdiP6Y4oH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9288822',6.6,50393,'en','The Wonder','Haunted by her past, a nurse travels from England to a remote Irish village in 1862 to investigate a young girl\'s supposedly miraculous fast.','/wZvZgA7IkDX78UilzqBGh0QTQvC.jpg','2022-11-02',108,'Released',NULL,'The Wonder',823766,6.7919,6.6,'htybz7XscIY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46468,_binary '\0','/aPtmEOZt3NGsuOuG3NrEWpVL0d1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9296590',4.1,1541,'en','Alpha Rift','When a magic helmet thrusts Nolan Parthmore into a world of modern-day knights fighting supernatural evil, he\'s forced to become the hero he was destined to be.','/cz3TmNx3S8zLVqWaMtdlckys8yF.jpg','2021-11-19',94,'Released','Do you believe in destiny?','Alpha Rift',786798,1.3938,4.8,'vwfz_4jj5Tw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46469,_binary '\0','/mtL75354lbOyxxeXbsX0B3lhJ4L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9296808',7,1762,'is','Bergmál','Through 56 independent scenes, Echo draws a portrait, both biting and tender, of modern day Iceland during the often turbulent but also exciting time of the Christmas holidays.','/neVtg1VneYYK9Qew6ftX8RSdWGQ.jpg','2019-12-12',79,'Released',NULL,'Echo',582903,0.9113,6.6,'GfKjSpd5CKA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46470,_binary '\0','/vCQFdqOYhRdSdLl5wqKXSDUchwA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9303756',7.3,2076,'en','The Snail and the Whale','A half hour animated film for all the family based on the much-loved book written by Julia Donaldson and illustrated by Axel Scheffler. The Snail and the Whale is the much loved classic that shows us a restless young snail who has ambitions to travel the world. The other snails think she should stay put, but she puts out a call for a “Lift wanted around the world”. Eventually her call is answered by a great big grey-blue humpback whale! She sets off with him across the seas. On their journey the snail and the whale discover towering icebergs and far-off lands, fiery mountains and golden sands. The snail is delighted by the wonderful world around her, until she realises how small it makes her feel.','/qWsqdJ6XUvwimqxwlplIazKjpve.jpg','2020-10-21',26,'Released','\"How I long to sail!\" said the tiny snail.','The Snail and the Whale',655424,3.5967,6.598,'dmLnraxsKpM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46471,_binary '\0','/aHbt7zFLCbt8zjiRD1V3LlZLuhl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9303772',5.4,1559,'fr','Divorce Club','Ben is devastated when his wife asks for a divorce. While everyone chooses her side, Ben comes across Patrick, an old friend from college, recently divorced. Patrick invites him to crash at his place. The two roommates are soon joined by other divorced, separated and single people looking for a refuge.','/q0FE1o5SUJzImwV4Q099uAq018U.jpg','2020-07-14',108,'Released',NULL,'Divorce Club',665488,3.8685,5.7,'_8ghcgqRyaE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46472,_binary '\0','/nVMR1dKbIMz4aNiyfTKnYrGjgSK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9304360',6.1,1504,'ta','அயோக்யா','When a corrupt cop gets embroiled in a heroic brawl, he has no idea how it would eventually lead him to a shocking rape case and change his life forever.','/gXBPfX7or3KCapbyuYemjTR7ZPS.jpg','2019-05-11',150,'Released','A story for current society','Ayogya',581104,1.1513,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46473,_binary '\0','/vAGRUbouiHUQh1JTI09dKvzc6nu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9305634',6.2,4378,'en','Surge','A man goes on a bold and reckless journey of self-liberation through London. After he robs a bank he releases a wilder version of himself, ultimately experiencing what it feels like to be alive.','/tR68Qbd0ETPXGDtC6HZtTmliX1G.jpg','2020-06-17',100,'Released',NULL,'Surge',653584,2.2932,5.4,'iThnRwLexGo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46474,_binary '\0','/3fs6Encf71ChabAKV6VrnpQRrjV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9308022',5.4,2090,'en','Driver\'s Ed','A group of teens hit the road in a stolen driver\'s ed car, racing against time to help a lovesick high school senior track down his college-freshman girlfriend and win her back.','/hHbzSzjJnmcq02l2razSScBEVBf.jpg','2026-05-14',102,'Released','Follow you heart... and the rules of the road.','Driver\'s Ed',1398050,7.0554,6.9,'NTwuzdjmfTo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46475,_binary '\0','/xw2Qyos3clcRz87xS5fkoagL506.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9308382',6.4,14752,'en','The High Note','Set in the dazzling world of the LA music scene comes the story of Grace Davis, a superstar whose talent, and ego, have reached unbelievable heights. Maggie is Grace’s overworked personal assistant who’s stuck running errands, but still aspires to her childhood dream of becoming a music producer. When Grace’s manager presents her with a choice that could alter the course of her career, Maggie and Grace come up with a plan that could change their lives forever.','/yHsu8swJSgqDrsPiu7adBjOPLlp.jpg','2020-06-10',113,'Released','You\'ve got to start at the bottom before you take it from the top.','The High Note',606679,8.8991,7,'qpWJugM99FI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46476,_binary '\0','/uOte7sBlsbBfeEVP2PuYVf7JjiG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9308390',6.6,3955,'da','Margrete den første','1402. Queen Margrete I has gathered the Nordic kingdoms in a union, ruled through her adopted son, Erik. But a conspiracy is in the making and Margrete finds herself in an impossible dilemma that could shatter her life\'s work: The Kalmar Union.','/vurl6gQWmoDAWp0kYSBs2W0Z5WQ.jpg','2021-09-16',120,'Released',NULL,'Margrete: Queen of the North',659370,3.282,6.5,'-7OCX98JgGk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46477,_binary '\0','/nAG9VFWwsUXUGjKnTi4aQmU6hjU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9310280',8.3,2824,'mr','मुळशी पॅटर्न','A stark portrayal of the hardships faced by farmers, Mulshi Pattern tackles some of the raging issues of our times. The film lays bare the deep flaws of the system which turns the farmer into a criminal and a social outcast.','/rIpi5rI94kizH7hIe7oPkUBRkbJ.jpg','2018-11-23',155,'Released',NULL,'Mulshi Pattern',572931,1.4075,6.813,'M5iBVasSFQc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46478,_binary '\0','/x6Dxc9Z17Yt9gtq7Dq6uCPbPcxD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9310328',6.4,7625,'ja','オルタード・カーボン：リスリーブド','On the planet Latimer, Takeshi Kovacs must protect a tattooist while investigating the death of a yakuza boss alongside a no-nonsense CTAC.','/vlIYzx7cc4Wvaoh7ShjF2HZG45.jpg','2020-03-18',75,'Released',NULL,'Altered Carbon: Resleeved',665251,3.739,6.562,'HmDxxoFslzs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46479,_binary '\0','/veDYoJ0izmvaj24LNhWvG418xrH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9311062',6.2,1424,'ja','サムライマラソン','When feudal lord Itakura Katsuakira decides to prepare his samurai troops for the onslaught of modernization by having them compete in a marathon, his independent-minded daughter Yuki secretly joins the race.','/yusSNvTIKItyVgAZFUmSqAd5o1k.jpg','2019-02-22',105,'Released',NULL,'Samurai Marathon',578514,2.4148,5.95,'81TtJ7sgKXY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46480,_binary '\0','/lQ7OF8zoLMOh1rxL0iwWXr28jk0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9314984',5.5,6655,'en','The Power','London, 1974. As Britain prepares for electrical blackouts to sweep across the country, trainee nurse Val arrives for her first day at the crumbling East London Royal Infirmary. With most of the patients and staff evacuated to another hospital, Val is forced to work the night shift, finding herself in a dark, near empty building. Within these walls lies a deadly secret, forcing Val to face both her own traumatic past and deepest fears.','/s0aVEjT1DWopUrJehACWZyqpO99.jpg','2021-06-03',93,'Released','The darkest place is within...','The Power',760919,2.8136,6,'0ZfRRB8XUNM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46481,_binary '\0','/2ah5Zq3eZg7zhyBHJkd0ZR55Fpc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9315438',6.2,2174,'kn','Yajamana','The film revolves around a hardworking man Krishna who lives in Hulidurga and is famous for traditional oil extraction. He is torn apart from being the rightful owner with the entry of business tycoon Devi Shetty. Will Krishna fight against all odds to bring justice to his people? Who will become the real `Yajamana` is what forms the crux of the story.','/6kofOjD0JsyjTBvEFSBR8SL2TU4.jpg','2019-03-01',164,'Released',NULL,'Yajamana',586574,1.2532,4.444,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46482,_binary '\0','/5A0iLE0Wt7sf3Fsdq5NVQ9EYuPV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9316022',7.9,4858,'en','Struggle: The Life and Lost Art of Szukalski','Artists in LA discover the work of forgotten Polish sculptor Stanislav Szukalski, a mad genius whose true story unfolds chapter by astounding chapter.','/2kQTN26M1IfK1M3rh3PKgSQmUF3.jpg','2018-12-20',104,'Released','The greatest artist you\'ve never heard of.','Struggle: The Life and Lost Art of Szukalski',565255,2.0342,7.506,'sPkoW4cmqT8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46483,_binary '\0','/xEcdiZOjjaihkmCxKRQcjeSxv26.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9318280',7.2,7617,'en','Driveways','Eight-year-old Cody is spending the summer in an unfamiliar setting with his mom Kathy. Though he can\'t relate to the neighbourhood kids, things take an unexpected turn when he develops an unusual friendship with the widowed old man from next door.','/4kxgyi84VkgRyyPl6hQih0uCMCB.jpg','2020-12-17',83,'Released',NULL,'Driveways',568994,2.0861,6.942,'0-j1p-U7nKw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46484,_binary '\0','/xO5xgYnV3M8Ll290htiW7hGTL7t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9318772',6.1,3941,'ja','Fukushima 50','Workers at the Fukushima Daiichi facility in Japan risk their lives and stay at the nuclear power plant to prevent total destruction after the region is devastated by an earthquake and tsunami in 2011.','/o1656SdGsUcnHYQmuNw7jL0JtsT.jpg','2020-03-06',122,'Released','In the darkest hours, courage prevails.','Fukushima 50',563067,6.1393,6.5,'ppDZpNIoqnU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46485,_binary '\0','/mtVslNLqPNOazmZTlGvRrmjNKsE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9319812',6.5,7905,'hi','Hum Chaar','The story of the film revolves around four college friends went their own direction in life, but remained inseparable from each other.','/7ro9ZdzaTYa0pPwbhRr3ASzeeo.jpg','2019-02-15',143,'Released',NULL,'Hum Chaar',584206,0.6564,5.7,'kZQCWdvmV6E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46486,_binary '\0','/w66CTEcXBNgtLS6j8S2YWr1PXch.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9319826',7.2,6015,'hi','Jungle Cry','12 boys from Kalinga Institute with no clue about rugby, trained hard to master this beautiful sport. Not only that, within just 4 months, they became the roaring The Jungle Cats of India and went on to win the 2007 Under-14 Rugby World Cup.','/e5FtkxJad6gKErNhYZJwHL8SO9w.jpg','2022-05-20',117,'Released',NULL,'Jungle Cry',855485,1.278,7.4,'fHuUDF_NfPs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46487,_binary '\0','/opPHZ5zxFG0NSsoIDpEiF79BW8b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9319874',7.5,4472,'ta','மாறா','When Paaru sees a fairy tale she 