95,_binary '\0','/8MZOEnXcB2YJDcHRLWWn6TW2fWH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9340916',5.5,3863,'en','She Will','Veronica, an aging film star, retreats to the Scottish countryside with her nurse Desi to recover from a double mastectomy. While there, mysterious forces give Veronica the power to enact revenge within her dreams.','/cbN1YWgBmwqGzqF6ZTsM96dub4r.jpg','2022-07-15',95,'Released','Unleash the past.','She Will',852485,1.9449,4.8,'GG6fp2hHjV0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46496,_binary '\0','/dbJo2Mwjt8MDLf2zehKpNRZfcOx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9343754',7.2,1928,'hi','Eeb Allay Ooo!','Hired as a monkey repeller upon moving to Delhi, a young man struggles to find his footing in his unenviable job and his place in the unforgiving world.','/hpQk0DGreEmOhYNRrP7LRBPFbgZ.jpg','2020-12-18',97,'Released',NULL,'Eeb Allay Ooo!',638665,0.9301,7.455,'EW3Em8VT3CM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46497,_binary '\0','/9BfKS8tA0rpMxTW99masRde1bIV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9345754',6.4,21881,'es','Hogar','An unemployed executive is forced to sell his apartment. When he discovers that he still has the keys, he becomes obsessed with the family that now lives there and decides to recover the life he has lost, at any price.','/pNM2VmqS2FBL92EJ0fUPLgoij8x.jpg','2020-03-25',103,'Released',NULL,'The Occupant',674944,2.6005,6.4,'DsHcN40GhCI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46498,_binary '\0','/g1cMEQnEptUJ7Sv8SRjWBTTHyMv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9347730',5.9,84509,'en','Candyman','A Chicago artist\'s sanity starts to unravel, unleashing a terrifying wave of violence when he begins to explore the macabre history of the Candyman.','/dqoshZPLNsXlC1qtz5n34raUyrE.jpg','2021-08-25',91,'Released','Dare to say his name.','Candyman',565028,7.831,6,'TPBH3XO8YEU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46499,_binary '\0','/29j0ngytRwO9HK74wi2G3MFNZ0F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9347750',4.1,1517,'en','Final Kill','A mercenary is hired to protect a couple hiding out in Central America from a ruthless crime family. In his final assignment as a protector, it quickly turns deadly as a group of mafia henchman descend on the tranquil Costa Rican village. Soon the agent learns that the job is far more than it seems and it will take all of his experience to get them out alive.','/bFmNeWhnTKYXlatHT7v4LKcEBUA.jpg','2020-09-21',80,'Released',NULL,'Final Kill',675431,1.7258,4.8,'Rh2vaCny-Us','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46500,_binary '\0','/q1r9fd7j9zvHHxR6lQ60aCKpMGf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9348296',7.3,3638,'te','ఓ! బేబీ','A 70-year-old woman transforms into her 24-year-old self after she\'s photographed at a studio, changing her life and those of the people around her forever.','/3dXjxNtK3c5xFXJnTe8cnOBLqqp.jpg','2019-07-04',157,'Released',NULL,'Oh! Baby',607091,1.3953,6.6,'kgnJFZZV728','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46501,_binary '\0','/3G0xVewAccMul25pPQxbmfOIS4J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9351746',8.1,1976,'en','Love, Antosha','From a prolific career in film and television, Anton Yelchin left an indelible legacy as an actor. Through his journals and other writings, his photography, the original music he wrote, and interviews with his family, friends, and colleagues, this film looks not just at Anton\'s impressive career, but at a broader portrait of the man.','/AntNP1sX7qKBT7hSYM4248RKMaL.jpg','2019-08-02',92,'Released','The extraordinary and unfinished life of Anton Yelchin','Love, Antosha',565276,2.9664,7.427,'hzrFqZcosI0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46502,_binary '\0','/9U3AszNHOXKUiHaiyllDGpGAsJB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9351856',4.4,1320,'en','Holiday Twist','With help from a Salvation Army Santa and a little holiday magic, a workaholic executive tries to let go of her painful past to become the twinkling light that both her community and family need.','/yVTTUUJ6KMfVQEexxY4TZ3ptiud.jpg','2023-12-01',105,'Released',NULL,'Holiday Twist',1203695,1.708,6.6,'_egb8PhsFVM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46503,_binary '\0','/vzmUkbi07g2dKVL6YCr8FX3LFgn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9351980',7.4,25221,'en','American Factory','In post-industrial Ohio, a Chinese billionaire opens a new factory in the husk of an abandoned General Motors plant, hiring two thousand blue-collar Americans. Early days of hope and optimism give way to setbacks as high-tech China clashes with working-class America.','/7jH3dQOJ3CHMrp9tWsI3rRCDiaD.jpg','2019-08-21',110,'Released','Cultures collide. Hope survives.','American Factory',565716,5.7379,7.2,'m36QeKOJ2Fc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46504,_binary '\0','/8WcJLcbzSEGLvKdDIV4MPk5qvrh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9352178',5.8,1531,'en','The Primevals','Deep in the Himalayas, a group of sherpas kills a gigantic humanoid creature. Convinced that it is the legendary Yeti, Dr. Claire Collier organizes an expedition with her former student Matt Connor and hunter Rondo Montana, among others, to search for more specimens. But what awaits them is something that none of them could have imagined. A colorful fusion of real image and stop-motion that is reminiscent of fantastic films from the 1980s.','/mGfRWFJEybNVxxJUa9hYk8VQJFC.jpg','2023-07-23',91,'Released','A Civilization Lost in Time... Invaded One Million Years Ago','The Primevals',632995,1.8154,6.2,'ySPyuXToFIk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46505,_binary '\0','/kryYpNFiYyPUVC7SXrHk2pjRj4y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9352356',4.8,5402,'en','The Djinn','A mute boy is trapped in his apartment with a sinister monster when he makes a wish to fulfill his heart’s greatest desire.','/yk0XkUc3kz6Mrnk9y7o7weSOpO0.jpg','2021-05-14',82,'Released','What is done cannot be undone.','The Djinn',797946,3.0667,5.629,'Vi3hyzmo7iU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46506,_binary '\0','/iy1CD1E7C1PD9Sf8V074qL1s0ji.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9352780',7.5,2993,'en','Cold Case Hammarskjöld','Ndola, Northern Rhodesia (currently Zambia), September 18, 1961. Swedish economist and diplomat Dag Hammarskjöld, Secretary General of the UN, dies mysteriously in a plane crash. Decades later, Danish journalist and filmmaker Mads Brügger and Swedish researcher Göran Björkdahl investigate the case in search of definitive closure.','/x6Vw8sPXv51qrtd6lek9h2svM7M.jpg','2019-02-07',129,'Released','Some things have been hidden too long','Cold Case Hammarskjöld',566061,1.68,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46507,_binary '\0','/mrH2HxDl0p7evhNqSGN7SIYpVRG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9352926',5.8,1723,'en','The Sound of Silence','A successful \"house tuner\" in New York City, who calibrates the sound in people\'s homes in order to adjust their moods, meets a client with a problem he can\'t solve.','/dXkv8lkX9gdJyUxxrulJ2PWzidI.jpg','2019-09-13',87,'Released',NULL,'The Sound of Silence',565341,3.7022,5.8,'ejZ75QFesgE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46508,_binary '\0','/9LsJP9OuIBmBUxZpmVKtUUjF0PA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9354842',6.1,55113,'en','To All the Boys: P.S. I Still Love You','Lara Jean and Peter have just taken their romance from pretend to officially real when another recipient of one of her love letters enters the picture.','/maib5VlmEqp5xlN8lptnBSftp2o.jpg','2020-02-03',102,'Released','Follow your heart like never before.','To All the Boys: P.S. I Still Love You',565426,7.8103,6.821,'JUmZ3NfiHDI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46509,_binary '\0','/s5mWOQ4rc90hhRebpBHdW0f1gix.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9354944',6,33995,'en','Jexi','Phil\'s new phone comes with an unexpected feature, Jexi...an A.I. determined to keep him all to herself in a comedy about what can happen when you love your phone more than all else.','/sizYjc8lAFStRZXtI1uRBDsOTt6.jpg','2019-10-10',84,'Released','She had him at “hello”','Jexi',620725,5.5534,6.7,'EtpBbRsNr-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46510,_binary '\0','/dBOHnvQxiONQslgiE3tJIPxnOh0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9355194',6.9,2386,'en','The Booksellers','What once seemed like an esoteric world now seems essential to our culture: the community of rare book dealers and collectors who, in their love of the delicacy and tactility of books, are helping to keep the printed word alive. D.W. Young’s elegant and entertaining documentary, executive produced by Parker Posey, is a lively tour of New York’s book world, past and present, from the Park Avenue Armory’s annual Antiquarian Book Fair, where original editions can fetch hundreds of thousands of dollars; to the Strand and Argosy book stores, still standing against all odds; to the beautifully crammed apartments of collectors and buyers. The film features a litany of special guests, including Fran Lebowitz, Susan Orlean, Gay Talese, and a community of dedicated book dealers who strongly believe in the wonder of the object and the everlasting importance of what’s inside.','/qGi8ZCxoy0z7yO4ByT5hAksmErK.jpg','2020-03-06',99,'Released',NULL,'The Booksellers',629704,1.3268,7,'ymcRRt3Ix04','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46511,_binary '\0','/dxe4F1ZOiwNNIiHBZNhgOZ2jNhJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9355200',5.7,3093,'sv','Koko-di Koko-da','As a couple goes on a trip to find their way back to each other, a sideshow artist and his shady entourage emerge from the woods, terrorizing them, luring them deeper into a maelstrom of psychological terror and humiliating slapstick.','/eNHpioGHmg1d8EFsEH0KAbRNUGm.jpg','2019-08-23',86,'Released',NULL,'Koko-di Koko-da',565373,1.5362,5.9,'2YPDhAyt2LM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46512,_binary '\0','/gTNCO9iTeOq9m4pyUZwNoMCvdGf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9356952',6.4,8570,'en','The Death of Dick Long','Dick died last night, and Zeke and Earl don’t want anybody finding out how. That’s too bad though, cause news travels fast in small-town Alabama.','/vURitOcmtcH8Dr1bWryTvfkeyJX.jpg','2019-09-27',100,'Released',NULL,'The Death of Dick Long',565383,3.9214,6.1,'dGBe8xsWGlo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46513,_binary '\0','/anl65DJYFyp2m0lXaFvlCrSOT8E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9357050',6.1,21311,'en','Dear Evan Hansen','Evan Hansen, a high schooler with social anxiety, unintentionally gets caught up in a lie after the family of a classmate who committed suicide mistakes one of Hansen’s letters for their son’s suicide note.','/83pobg0tx4r4JeLenCAemanpnS2.jpg','2021-09-24',137,'Released','An honest and original story for those lost and then found.','Dear Evan Hansen',567690,8.4519,6.2,'CjA50VxlxAw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46514,_binary '\0','/5hLKTJrwZ8F6c2xLAaWrUdCP2Zi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9358044',7.3,8647,'en','Hail Satan?','The story of The Satanic Temple, a controversial movement that combines religion and activism with the apparent purpose of questioning the basic foundations of US society.','/lwP8CMOfPJhkMyxELgX2D2aDZfy.jpg','2019-04-17',91,'Released','The Devil\'s work is never done.','Hail Satan?',565719,2.1569,7.04,'27RtJp-rhHk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46515,_binary '\0','/ir82hjPYepPfCxVD6ecX8ZMCXNj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9358052',7.4,10581,'en','Knock Down the House','In 2018, a young bartender in the Bronx, a coal miner’s daughter in West Virginia, a grieving mother in Nevada and a registered nurse in Missouri join a movement of insurgent candidates challenging powerful incumbents in Congress. Without political experience or corporate money, these four women are attempting to do what many consider impossible.','/uAfixuZIFVbWIsWytzROJDY85D7.jpg','2019-01-27',86,'Released',NULL,'Knock Down the House',565312,1.8477,7.1,'_wGZc8ZjFY4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46516,_binary '\0','/30MzWIV7zjFDAf5TaM5flDyyQSE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9358084',6.5,1787,'en','The Amazing Johnathan Documentary','What begins as a documentary following the final tour of a dying magician - \"The Amazing Johnathan\" - becomes an unexpected and increasingly bizarre journey as the filmmaker struggles to separate truth from illusion.','/gduS1BqSJ2Jg6XiG9HvR1IAtu60.jpg','2019-08-16',94,'Released','Magic. Meth. Mayhem.','The Amazing Johnathan Documentary',568693,2.5468,6.1,'zSRoKfecdXE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46517,_binary '\0','/aEnzSeXt3zMAnT7NtGot5gZHmAP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9358192',7.1,1581,'en','Halston','From Iowa to Studio 54, this investigation into the rags-to-riches story of America’s first superstar designer uncovers the cautionary tale of an artist who sold his name to Wall Street.','/8BrUiQ8W2YbjoRh1PtBbY7yuhbj.jpg','2019-06-07',105,'Released','High Fashion. High Finance. High Life.','Halston',566227,1.3639,5.6,'Z_npgDEPQsM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46518,_binary '\0','/uYGPb4urXjn1mdY7x6h6mGu9DCW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9358196',7,2356,'en','Marianne & Leonard: Words of Love','A story of enduring love between Leonard Cohen and his Norwegian muse, Marianne Ihlen. The film follows their relationship from their early days in Greece, a time of \"free love\" and open marriage, to how their love evolved when Leonard became a successful musician.','/vB0gEuF1uqSHCA7IUrLYiSm1zLr.jpg','2019-07-05',98,'Released',NULL,'Marianne & Leonard: Words of Love',566230,1.9072,6.3,'LB6nIzPf9r8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46519,_binary '\0','/8DkUS55g5HVw2FMu2shJq0ckUmh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9358228',6.7,3401,'en','Untouchable','The inside story of the rise and fall of Harvey Weinstein reveals how, over decades, he acquired and protected his power even when scandal threatened to engulf him. Former colleagues and accusers detail the method and consequences of his alleged abuse, hoping for justice and also to inspire change.','/qT8tDeH7xuj3zAhRoyiEPBqmTZy.jpg','2019-06-20',98,'Released','Hear the voices that power could not silence.','Untouchable',566236,3.0258,6.5,'b-1fKna9l38','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46520,_binary '\0','/ck7S9WpBOMLPIeZwqFZhLap8ySF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9359344',5.9,4100,'es','Te quiero, imbécil','Marcos\' life turns upside down after he loses the same day his girlfriend and his job. Marcos\' life turns wild after to meet Raquel.','/ceKh9Qd00EZg5uT2OnLOskL94kr.jpg','2020-01-24',87,'Released',NULL,'I Love You, Stupid',613096,1.9058,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46521,_binary '\0','/i0q9Cb0L0eoHa9WdMbqlDiSH6C9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9362492',6.1,3619,'cs','Bod obnovy','It’s 2041 and the gaps in social and economic inequality have left the world on the brink. A breakthrough in science has given humanity the ability to bring victims of a violent crime back to life by backing up their brain every 2 days. This allows an ambitious, young detective the opportunity to solve a case of a murdered couple when the restoration team is able to bring one of them back.','/qxFqu8foXkq2AQTaFUIk7SwhCkd.jpg','2023-09-09',114,'Released','Have you backed up today?','Restore Point',1071815,3.4049,6.1,'s1xfhUVvuSE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46522,_binary '\0','/kVd3a9YeLGkoeR50jGEXM6EqseS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9362722',8.5,552877,'en','Spider-Man: Across the Spider-Verse','After reuniting with Gwen Stacy, Brooklyn’s full-time, friendly neighborhood Spider-Man is catapulted across the Multiverse, where he encounters the Spider Society, a team of Spider-People charged with protecting the Multiverse\'s very existence. But when the heroes clash on how to handle a new threat, Miles finds himself pitted against the other Spiders and must set out on his own to save those he loves most.','/8Vt6mWEReuy4Of61Lnj5Xj704m8.jpg','2023-05-31',140,'Released','It\'s how you wear the mask that matters.','Spider-Man: Across the Spider-Verse',569094,52.7461,8.35,'BbXJ3_AQE_o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46523,_binary '\0','/dEkFlZzj2cb5F7SShvqkL54E4lr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9362736',6,49221,'en','Die My Love','After inheriting a remote Montana house, Jackson moves there from New York with his partner Grace, and the couple soon welcome a child. As Jackson becomes increasingly absent and rural isolation sets in, Grace struggles with loneliness, creative frustration, and unresolved emotional wounds. What begins as an attempt at renewal gradually turns into an intense psychological descent, placing strain on their relationship and exposing the fragile balance between love, identity, and motherhood.','/kajpShbFhOdpl6yCrLezMrr9tB4.jpg','2025-10-06',119,'Released','Everything. Is. Fine.','Die My Love',1033148,12.572,6.1,'2jzXHW6Qe70','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46524,_binary '\0','/bVyFGnX8kt0XtJXdx2F1HyOkIic.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9362930',5.9,119763,'en','Blue Beetle','Recent college grad Jaime Reyes returns home full of aspirations for his future, only to find that home is not quite as he left it. As he searches to find his purpose in the world, fate intervenes when Jaime unexpectedly finds himself in possession of an ancient relic of alien biotechnology: the Scarab.','/mXLOHHc1Zeuwsl4xYKjKh2280oL.jpg','2023-08-16',128,'Released','Jaime Reyes is a superhero whether he likes it or not.','Blue Beetle',565770,15.6407,6.617,'4wxyy8Rcz4k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46525,_binary '\0','/dJayvScnUhOcY6uUg3zo02qmBP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9363208',6.5,1708,'ar','الضيف','A young man is invited for dinner with the family of Dr. Yehia Hussein Al-Tijani at the invitation of Yehia\'s lovestruck daughter. But Yehia is under a lot of pressure ever since his bold opinions put a target on his back, which turns the dinner into a stirring debate between Yehia and his guest.','/rzQLKYRTsxI4us4z0NKQsgeodD8.jpg','2019-01-06',99,'Released',NULL,'The Guest',560707,1.0764,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46526,_binary '\0','/iOitnfBMq68Q0ynGbK4nDjtpNN4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9364684',1.5,4831,'tr','Borç Harç','After his engagement falls through, Murat finds himself knee deep in debt and accepts an enticing, ghastly offer from his boss at the TV station.','/7c2AHwVme4xbNb5lPrvMVbIwtVP.jpg','2019-01-18',93,'Released',NULL,'Debt Fees',608165,1.1412,2.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46527,_binary '\0','/nKdCl2roOng0DiLRgk4W3P4RTSi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9365800',3.3,2645,'en','Slayers','A group of superstar influencers are drawn to a reclusive billionaire\'s mansion only to find themselves trapped in the lair of an evil vampire. The only way out is to be saved by a famous online gamer and an old school vampire hunter.','/ymb6GhQy1rQuKvPXyitNdr6hoKl.jpg','2022-10-21',88,'Released','Vengeance bites back.','Slayers',888097,2.4589,4,'RhtKPrQTGP8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46528,_binary '\0','/rnJLCK70wbKGo3hyqXBUNKWQR4T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9367402',4.8,1217,'en','Dead Dicks','After Becca receives a distressing call from her suicidal brother Richie, she rushes over to his apartment and finds him alive and well - surrounded by copies of his own dead body.','/fwOXjMaL4tk1Zr0XFI8UVwjgg8L.jpg','2019-07-25',83,'Released',NULL,'Dead Dicks',611639,1.3436,5.469,'4SN8zUOV8B4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46529,_binary '\0','/qMHwNcX5AXSuniwWF1qQwNkPk0Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9368628',6.1,2098,'zh','新喜劇之王','A young female actor dreams of becoming famous and building a successful career despite being a stand-in and extra on most sets.','/wc2VgNh2l0PpprMd543jMX4C3hw.jpg','2019-02-05',90,'Released',NULL,'The New King of Comedy',575138,2.3316,5.6,'nr-ErwHSEKk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46530,_binary '\0','/1htJZ4guQUGO6RoQbnLzGJ3ocAX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9369620',7.1,1274,'fr','Un frère','15-year-old Tom is going to spend another calm summer with his parents and younger sister at their summer house. But by fate, another family comes to spend some time with them, with their 17-year-old son Félix. In the unforgettable summer, Félix will introduce Tom to new things...','/dbcOBz0R9TrYnAuRbU3EGagnmBz.jpg','2018-11-15',82,'Released','Two boys meet during the summer vacation.','A Brother',565492,1.8215,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46531,_binary '\0','/uMClfgmBx89A3Exd83bpyhQHGcL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9373688',4.8,7012,'en','Settlers','Remmy and her parents, refugees from Earth, have found peace on the Martian outskirts until strangers appear in the hills beyond their farm. Told as a triptych, the film follows Remmy as she struggles to survive in an uneasy landscape.','/tBUYDwiJVDcnjPneOitVetJk2Rt.jpg','2021-07-23',104,'Released','How far would you go to build a new life?','Settlers',791568,3.1622,4.954,'bGW_uswcZso','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46532,_binary '\0','/r7K6Xt0RX4Mw0cAbZVw5cyb1Tux.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9376612',7.3,501724,'en','Shang-Chi and the Legend of the Ten Rings','Shang-Chi must confront the past he thought he left behind when he is drawn into the web of the mysterious Ten Rings organization.','/9f2Q0U3IOsLgrI2HkvldwSABZy5.jpg','2021-09-01',132,'Released','You can\'t outrun your destiny.','Shang-Chi and the Legend of the Ten Rings',566525,25.3972,7.485,'8YjFbMbfXaQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46533,_binary '\0','/6U7RorSCnqYj6VUGrDY9nq3k0mZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9378416',5.7,1551,'ta','மாயோன்','An archaeology team lead by Arjun Manimaran a curious and intelligent man, is on a quest to break down the myths of an ancient temple, which might put their lives at risk, whilst their work continues other conflict arises which threatens to destroy the temple\'s relics and antiquity.','/bdfmTnEyGDN46o6q1gUxuNdoQv8.jpg','2022-06-24',130,'Released',NULL,'Maayon',613037,1.0196,4.8,'yb-ZPxUV0t4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46534,_binary '\0','/9QFPy1uf1sbrILsfiDbRcwlqSnb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9378672',7.3,1386,'en','Brian Wilson: Long Promised Road','Join The Beach Boy\'s Brian Wilson on an intimate journey through his legendary career as he reminisces with Rolling Stone editor and longtime friend, Jason Fine. Featuring a new song written and performed by Wilson and interviews with Elton John, Bruce Springsteen, Nick Jonas, Linda Perry, Jim James, Gustavo Dudamel and Al Jardine.','/kSZiUQtBeQjiCn7v51d6poTXqli.jpg','2021-11-19',95,'Released','The genius behind The Beach Boys and the California sound.','Brian Wilson: Long Promised Road',590387,1.8489,6.5,'6BqrMWxMnnw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46535,_binary '\0','/l9gyf42WgkpBK2KLGCp5mMfyV4X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9378950',3.8,1695,'hi','घोस्ट','The story of the film follows Karan Khanna, a politician of Indian origin in the United Kingdom, who is accused of killing his wife. He tells his lawyer that a spirit committed the murder and should be tried.','/tPzw28qOSVU5kfyczbcOJkInqxF.jpg','2019-10-18',130,'Released',NULL,'Ghost',640402,0.9671,5.6,'_DKVthzKjY8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46536,_binary '\0','/6H1D7eAHNae6omWLGJBcUtoEkXo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9381682',5.9,4691,'it','Diabolik','1960s, the city of Clerville. The forthcoming visit of heiress Eva Kant, who\'ll be bringing a famous pink diamond with her, catches the attention of Diabolik, the infallible and elusive thief whose real identity is unknown: while trying to steal the jewel, he finds himself bewitched by Eva\'s charm, a feeling she may be reciprocating. But the police, led by relentless Inspector Ginko, is rapidly closing in on him...','/9bOwV2V9r6LikmKHMDgmu9jcE92.jpg','2021-12-16',133,'Released',NULL,'Diabolik',593395,3.0987,6.1,'wGRtIp735iY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46537,_binary '\0','/jHHaLH1ZFNaIjIQqZDN1f6hq12K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9381998',6.3,6322,'en','Agatha and the Truth of Murder','England, December 1926. Although her personal life is in tatters, the famous writer Agatha Christie decides to leave everything behind to help unravel an unsolved murder committed on a train six years ago, unable to imagine the disproportionate consequences that such a selfless act will cause.','/c9RzNEpejLkEBVH7cGNekpec8hS.jpg','2018-12-23',93,'Released','Some people have a taste for murder…','Agatha and the Truth of Murder',570352,3.8796,6.4,'2apnlrZmv28','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46538,_binary '\0','/1g2TVkVWn6qqeaBiFUfmOKisTFc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9382596',4,1385,'en','The Car: Road to Revenge','In a dilapidated cyberpunk city plagued by crime and corruption, an unscrupulous District Attorney is savagely murdered and tossed out of a building onto his brand new car. Mysteriously, the District Attorney and his car come back to life as a single being with a thirst for vengeance. The eerie driverless car embarks on a vicious rampage, exacting revenge on the criminals who murdered him...','/czynIdEiHjpGhUWMnoax7Q3lMAE.jpg','2019-01-08',89,'Released',NULL,'The Car: Road to Revenge',573560,3.5091,6.4,'x3FTwrG5WRA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46539,_binary '\0','/3ombg55JQiIpoPnXYb2oYdr6DtP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9387250',4.8,10411,'en','Skylines','When a virus threatens to turn the now earth-dwelling friendly alien hybrids against humans, Captain Rose Corley must lead a team of elite mercenaries on a mission to the alien world in order to save what\'s left of humanity.','/2W4ZvACURDyhiNnSIaFPHfNbny3.