 Dead',1090323,2.4451,5.74,'wwONaI7UKq4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46637,_binary '\0','/6pqgrpjMJVQpRExb9N6hW7ixUmj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9567548',7.5,2305,'en','Horror Noire: A History of Black Horror','Delving into a century of genre films that by turns utilized, caricatured, exploited, sidelined, and finally embraced them, this is the untold history of black Americans in Hollywood through their connection to the horror genre.','/iTNvR1IwF9v3a7e9MVooT3ZR1GG.jpg','2019-02-07',83,'Released',NULL,'Horror Noire: A History of Black Horror',574109,1.93,6.8,'BmyueIwsMlo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46638,_binary '\0','/tTcDNgjfDFMJJyc5wJUPMuUpkkk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9568230',5.3,2124,'en','Night Raiders','The year is 2043. A military occupation controls disenfranchised cities in post-war North America. Children are property of the State. A desperate Cree woman joins an underground band of vigilantes to infiltrate a State children’s academy and get her daughter back. Night Raiders is a female-driven dystopian drama about resilience, courage and love.','/wCjGxpp6jGtaef0PNGy66Vdoco0.jpg','2021-10-08',101,'Released',NULL,'Night Raiders',795778,2.6587,4.9,'Bg4B2smJPKU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46639,_binary '\0','/oYS8CgjoMXoYtLm6mg1TF1c4NAV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9569096',5.9,5144,'en','Sharp Corner','A dedicated family man becomes obsessed with saving the lives of the car accident victims on the sharp corner in front of his house – an obsession that could cost him everything.','/nuYg70w27rSgcE14NW9pPRDRXY6.jpg','2025-05-09',111,'Released','Obsession is a dangerous road.','Sharp Corner',1244890,3.2609,5.8,'U-CyQZR7NAw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46640,_binary '\0','/rcrhJz9ysoJHOoLrAgg6nDGzuQQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9569610',7.3,9992,'hi','काग़ज़','Kaagaz (transl. Paper) is a biographical drama about a farmer, Lal Bihari\'s 19-year struggle to make himself come alive again when he is declared dead in Government records by interests keen to take over his assets.','/wZq7tsSORRtIGAlf2QieWznXpeC.jpg','2021-01-07',109,'Released','A True Success Story of a Dead Man','Kaagaz',776303,1.1294,6.75,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46641,_binary '\0','/7ePBarrHy9RoyKMEyUXpXRvqa4V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9573180',7.1,1489,'no','Barn','During a break in school 13 year-old Lykke, the daughter of a prominent Labour Party member, seriously injures her classmate Jamie, the son of a high profile right-wing politician.','/f7NjsjZim9kc4gs3vfOOyX0METD.jpg','2019-09-13',157,'Released','When do you really grow up?','Beware of Children',576328,1.1954,7.3,'bqY42wdkfzI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46642,_binary '\0','/4MYtYsSGzQUUYQqHGWBNeEkT91s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9577852',7.5,8748,'en','Rolling Thunder Revue: A Bob Dylan Story by Martin Scorsese','Part documentary, part concert film, part fever dream, this film captures the troubled spirit of America in 1975 and the joyous music that Dylan performed during the fall of that year.','/ixxELBgYj9OH8hz0XCrcZOJpIx9.jpg','2019-06-11',142,'Released',NULL,'Rolling Thunder Revue: A Bob Dylan Story by Martin Scorsese',574638,3.1401,7,'PS4gsWDSn68','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46643,_binary '\0','/vw3zNfzvnVNF7nIjpiEgcdznfeC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9580138',7.4,21558,'en','Mortal Kombat Legends: Scorpion\'s Revenge','After the vicious slaughter of his family by stone-cold mercenary Sub-Zero, Hanzo Hasashi is exiled to the torturous Netherrealm. There, in exchange for his servitude to the sinister Quan Chi, he’s given a chance to avenge his family – and is resurrected as Scorpion, a lost soul bent on revenge. Back on Earthrealm, Lord Raiden gathers a team of elite warriors – Shaolin monk Liu Kang, Special Forces officer Sonya Blade, and action star Johnny Cage – an unlikely band of heroes with one chance to save humanity. To do this, they must defeat Shang Tsung\'s horde of Outworld gladiators and reign over the Mortal Kombat tournament.','/iBvo3qOPcmhlqAaJcXcQHtx2qLk.jpg','2020-04-12',80,'Released',NULL,'Mortal Kombat Legends: Scorpion\'s Revenge',664767,8.1971,8.092,'P87QXvvav7Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46644,_binary '\0','/qTdShbHwAUdPQ5o7y0VP7GKNnti.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9581076',7.7,6194,'zh','地久天长','Two married couples adjust to the vast social and economic changes taking place in China from the 1980s to the present.','/jGTDkdY7wFP2lIC0aqC1fjNIhhV.jpg','2019-03-15',185,'Released','We\'re waiting to grow old.','So Long, My Son',493899,2.9321,7.7,'GbJi3YstBzE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46645,_binary '\0','/jwQBAmJMIz5RKdHBpZAXFD7njn8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9585676',6.3,4325,'en','Body Brokers','Utah and his girlfriend Opal, are drug addicts living on the streets in rural Ohio. After getting recruited by body broker Wood and offered treatment in Los Angeles, Wood takes Utah under his wing and introduces him to treatment center mogul Vin. Wood and Vin bring Utah in on their lucrative and illegal dealings, where saving lives comes second to the bottom line.','/fNQUUrtlN79pDIMAPigX8NUvNW2.jpg','2021-02-19',111,'Released','Drugs. Rehab. Profit.','Body Brokers',656940,4.4914,6.2,'j8T0GIpfxr0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46646,_binary '\0','/putsivYODgbKrhvwl9n4OqhPOkO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9586294',7.6,17591,'zh','少年的你','A bullied teenage girl forms an unlikely friendship with a mysterious young man who protects her from her assailants, while she copes with the pressures of her final examinations.','/csVZ2ZQCj98XdZoCuW1aixMYJ0W.jpg','2019-10-25',135,'Released','You protect the world. I\'ll protect you.','Better Days',575813,6.7491,8.1,'mXYifqtNj38','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46647,_binary '\0','/zDI8OZTmLbzNgKi060u3bk5UPV0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9592496',3.5,10547,'kn','ಪೊಗರು','Shiva, a ruffian, is the terror of his area in many ways, but still has a heart of gold. He has just one wish, for his mother to love him wholly like the way he does.','/9zay0yF4MbU0K6gD32e5TsRDwsf.jpg','2021-02-19',160,'Released',NULL,'Pogaru',788106,1.7874,3.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46648,_binary '\0','/smCOdLvDR54fDRStUXnxZrP9I7B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9597190',6.3,3075,'zh','飞驰人生','Zhang Chi, a hubris and dominating six-time racing champion, falls from grace following a crisis. After a five-year suspension from the motorsport, the now single-father to a six-year-old boy throws down the gauntlet once again.','/kBKD2ZbtwNkNGWJiUj9ojKNytm7.jpg','2019-02-05',98,'Released',NULL,'Pegasus',575219,2.6723,6.635,'Ue3dLlHPWiY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46649,_binary '\0','/e753bpQO1RCg6TJkX9YquOygOml.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9597838',6.5,3360,'cn','拆彈專家2','After suffering life changing injuries in the line of duty, bomb disposal officer Fung turns his back on the police. But when a devastating series of bombings sweep Hong Kong, the police suspect their former ally may be involved after he is found unconscious at a crime scene. Now faced with memory loss and recalling only fragments of his former life, Fung sets out to uncover the truth and find out who he really is.','/5eMEnVKFDXKjlxIKKqkXIStI1Tz.jpg','2020-12-24',120,'Released',NULL,'Shock Wave 2',559974,3.3108,7.054,'TqJD3ZyZULM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46650,_binary '\0','/vlyHjiyNbZcEQ7O8TXVWaprldu8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9598172',5.5,1569,'ru','Спасти Ленинград','September, 1941. In a turn of events, young lovebirds Kostya and Nastya find themselves on board a barge that will evacuate people from the sieged Leningrad. At night the barge gets into the storm. When it starts sinking, enemy planes — but not