er living the dream, until she runs into her ex-childhood best friend and is invited away on her bachelorette weekend. Suddenly, Sissy finds herself stuck in a remote cabin with her school bully... and a taste for revenge.','/vQ0Dd4epB7meJtRxdLfqbRklQjd.jpg','2022-11-03',102,'Released','#triggered','Sissy',934207,3.0225,6.1,'BQHU-cj4VMY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46655,_binary '\0','/6cIqHe9qBoXgdSXXK5ztIsWcYmf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9602544',6.4,1603,'en','The Story of Us','Small town bookstore owner Jamie Vaughn learns that hers and other struggling local businesses face closure by a powerful Portland property developer, led by architect and former flame Sawyer O\'Dell. As Valentine\'s Day approaches and closure seems imminent, Jamie must not only hatch a heartfelt plan to save her beloved bookstore, but she must also sort out her past feelings for Sawyer.','/aH4kDrlgVgmokxskWJ7M0aewa4E.jpg','2019-02-09',84,'Released',NULL,'The Story of Us',576583,2.4216,5.7,'jk18rafdTX4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46656,_binary '\0','/3SOunz2Z0qcOVlrkYFj20HquziB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9603060',3.8,19318,'en','Star Trek: Section 31','Emperor Philippa Georgiou joins a secret division of Starfleet tasked with protecting the United Federation of Planets and faces the sins of her past.','/fNu6P4jYU55Cb3CC2SndtAKvois.jpg','2025-01-15',96,'Released','To protect the light, they fight in shadow.','Star Trek: Section 31',1114894,8.3229,4.7,'5yyQsFwjNvc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46657,_binary '\0','/538U9snNc2fpnOmYXAPUh3zn31H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9603208',7.1,240930,'en','Mission: Impossible - The Final Reckoning','Ethan Hunt and team continue their search for the terrifying AI known as the Entity — which has infiltrated intelligence networks all over the globe — with the world\'s governments and a mysterious ghost from Hunt\'s past on their trail. Joined by new allies and armed with the means to shut the Entity down for good, Hunt is in a race against time to prevent the world as we know it from changing forever.','/iKPsC9EFUafRP9SrUznI61getVP.jpg','2025-05-17',170,'Released','Our lives are the sum of our choices.','Mission: Impossible - The Final Reckoning',575265,38.0787,7.174,'G1VBfMCZVkw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46658,_binary '\0','/628Dep6AxEtDxjZoGP78TsOxYbK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9603212',7.6,332920,'en','Mission: Impossible - Dead Reckoning Part One','Ethan Hunt and his IMF team embark on their most dangerous mission yet: To track down a terrifying new weapon that threatens all of humanity before it falls into the wrong hands. With control of the future and the world\'s fate at stake and dark forces from Ethan\'s past closing in, a deadly race around the globe begins. Confronted by a mysterious, all-powerful enemy, Ethan must consider that nothing can matter more than his mission—not even the lives of those he cares about most.','/NNxYkU70HPurnNCSiCjYAmacwm.jpg','2023-07-08',164,'Released','We all share the same fate.','Mission: Impossible - Dead Reckoning Part One',575264,25.562,7.5,'2m1drlOZSDw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46659,_binary '\0','/wFb6t9ly8EwAKJwUCYexeWYna5r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9605894',4.3,7411,'te','నిశ్శబ్దం','Seattle PD is investigating the murder of a man and Sakshi, a deaf and mute artist, and her husband Antony, a renowned cello player, are related to it.','/uadBKw7qfUTxZXsOedOZQJPOdMH.jpg','2020-10-02',126,'Released',NULL,'Nishabdham',648705,1.8467,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46660,_binary '\0','/7FQHLt4iNh2TZ58cAAYrZK0xogg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9606374',6.4,40211,'en','On the Rocks','Faced with sudden doubts about her marriage, a young New York mother teams up with her larger-than-life playboy father to tail her husband.','/fcijRCmB7yTtloh4Pumy9b1rkwU.jpg','2020-10-02',96,'Released','Love, suspicion, and one very opinionated father.','On the Rocks',575417,8.6334,6.084,'Xn3sK4WiviA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46661,_binary '\0','/tlnu7qpEeyh4mgS7w2BIH6daPsA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9608818',7.3,18422,'en','Our Friend','After learning that his terminally ill wife has six months to live, a man welcomes the support of his best friend who moves into their home to help out.','/vg9C5LttsKBqoLuqeQvOXaeBGiD.jpg','2019-09-04',124,'Released',NULL,'Our Friend',583903,5.6839,7.181,'GTWqGLnOxtA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46662,_binary '\0','/7c4Am9Io2v0NctjetwTbB1hwwk4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9610262',8.7,1934,'gu','ચાલ જીવી લઈએ!','In his quest to become successful, Aditya Parikh puts life on the back burner, including his Father Bipin Chandra Parikh. Infuriated and heartbroken, the father persuades his monotonous son to take an unplanned journey of a lifetime for a much needed appreciation that life deserves. Their trip to bliss soon turns into a nightmare when they meet a backpacker named Ketki Mehta. An enigma in her own way, she takes the father-son duo on a voyage that turns out to be more than they bargained for. The escapade turns out to be an experience as more surprises and realizations wait their way to happiness, opening new doorways to the meaning of life. Directed by Vipul Mehta, Produced by Rashmin Majithia and soulful Music by Sachin-Jigar, Chaal Jeevi Laiye is a film that\'s all about living life to the fullest.','/t7DjdSQbpfFV7WJAnmOcvoduXYq.jpg','2019-02-01',140,'Released',NULL,'Chaal Jeevi Laiye!',582316,1.0047,7.8,'y1NoFZPVTr0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46663,_binary '\0','/hCGJALYoyTMksdpmXX8e5OfKUfI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9610354',3.8,1987,'te','నిన్ను తలచి','Abhiram (Vamsi Yakasiri) is a happy-go-lucky guy, who falls in love at first sight with a girl named Ankitha tries very hard to explain his feeling to her. On the other hand, she loves someone who doesn\'t guarantee their relationship is meant to be. Things upside-down when Abhi knows the truth. It is now up to Abhi to convince Ankitha to change her mind. Will Ankitha change her mind? Will they reunite? And how this can lead to their lasting relationship?','/9w2hXT5xqXvfS07PLkycKwTCFzF.jpg','2019-09-27',150,'Released',NULL,'Ninnu Thalachi',640550,0.5976,8,'0VYsj9l661E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46664,_binary '\0','/zgkmvarRACKU1NyAoaqVPobi8ID.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9612680',7.7,1787,'en','Human Nature','The biggest tech revolution of the 21st century isn’t digital, it’s biological. A breakthrough called CRISPR gives us unprecedented control over the basic building blocks of life. It opens the door to curing disease, reshaping the biosphere, and designing our own children. This documentary is a provocative exploration of CRISPR’s far-reaching implications, through the eyes of the scientists who discovered it, the families it’s affecting, and the genetic engineers who are testing its limits.','/yoxj5yHwoXZTwKvYwfeNmAYp48a.jpg','2019-03-12',107,'Released',NULL,'Human Nature',576692,1.2637,6.8,'_1UkCfDnn6c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46665,_binary '\0','/irt864W6U11ziNhfBRo7oG0dsPZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9612982',4.3,2274,'en','The Assent','After a series of disturbing supernatural events in his home, Joel a young single father, comes to suspect that his young son may be possessed. Soon Joel receives a visit from Father Lambert, a controversial exorcist in town whose last patient died during his treatment. As increasing chilling occurrences begin to unfold, the priest informs a resistant Joel that unless he can successfully perform an exorcism, the devil will soon take full control of his boy.','/bHVy3bKsfi8AbVwzelliNBt3SUG.jpg','2020-01-09',89,'Released','It feeds on the darkness within.','The Assent',632309,2.289,5.8,'nrlkOpIrqRI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46666,_binary '\0','/mBk8i2aLMEqfxmJCSLpq4T0qaLF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9613316',6.3,1249,'en','Frances Ferguson','Frances Ferguson is discontent. Like a lot of us, she does a bit of “acting out” and pays the price —an arrest, a trial, incarceration. And then a new identity, one that’s not terribly comfortable.','/7o6Rrp4Y7WuKxn88YM8OZQfKnpl.jpg','2019-03-10',74,'Released','The worst decision of her life was only the beginning.','Frances Ferguson',576674,1.8459,6.1,'-Ado1HKL9dU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46667,_binary '\0','/4ThKH1ryo7eVSElXkKaAOydXjLc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9614440',6.7,1966,'en','Mickey and the Bear','In Anaconda, Montana, a strong-willed teenage girl navigates a loving but volatile relationship with her veteran father. In a desperate search for independence and her own identity, she risks family, heartbreak, and her standing in the only place she can call home.','/30ZXfZJeqfmo2lkycFbDod9XMqd.jpg','2019-11-13',90,'Released',NULL,'Mickey and the Bear',575958,2.1079,6.3,'Vnu57WLP2u8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46668,_binary '\0','/wfIZaLEC1scbb9VD10GotLRFKW4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9614452',5.6,17115,'hi','द बिग बुल','Inspired by events from the late \'80s and the early \'90s that shook the country\'s financial fabric, The Big Bull tells the story of the biggest hustle in the stock market.','/j0R4hvkS5KNkChVz0UZTDkrdKzo.jpg','2021-04-08',154,'Released','The man who sold dreams to India','The Big Bull',660042,1.7633,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46669,_binary '\0','/tin1INh9lDVJWUZl0Mx0GpWdftT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9614460',5.4,28262,'hi','छपाक','A true story based on acid attack survivor Malti\'s grueling and glorious journey from her medical treatment, court proceedings leading to her emotional healing.','/cr5KqiolMMRUEJxrNLWESxyVVeU.jpg','2020-01-09',123,'Released',NULL,'Chhapaak',590404,1.2811,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46670,_binary '\0','/hpK3TFzp8yKderCqpPOjDr0xEKz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9614988',7.9,2212,'ta','சில்லுக்கருப்பட்டி','An anthology of four romantic stories across four age groups connected by that magical thread called love.','/zMrLXaRbbdSmRiQZo2byeVMmvzU.jpg','2019-12-26',138,'Released',NULL,'Sillu Karuppatti',659086,1.2073,7.05,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46671,_binary '\0','/qU8GVfTUbKBFhXmjYc0Vn1bUESD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9615020',6.4,1358,'ta','நட்பே துணை','Prabakaran, an international hockey player who choose to leave the sport picks it up again only to save the ground of a local team.','/5CL4HpQGiYPD7sv1eQMHOArkSlU.jpg','2019-04-04',156,'Released',NULL,'Natpe Thunai',590548,1.093,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46672,_binary '\0','/bwXvBFejQFaoXa2TBkZuKPgSjeA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9616700',6.8,5828,'es','Adú','In a desperate attempt to reach Europe and crouched before an airstrip in Cameroon, a six-year-old boy and his older sister wait to sneak into the holds of an airplane. Not too far away, an environmental activist contemplates the terrible image of an elephant, dead and fangless. Not only do you have to fight against poaching, but you will also have to meet the problems of your newly arrived daughter from Spain. Thousands of kilometers to the north, in Melilla, a group of civil guards prepare to face the furious crowd of sub-Saharan people who have begun the assault on the fence. Three stories linked by a central theme, in which none of its protagonists know that their destinies are doomed to cross and that their lives will no longer be the same.','/tigbVfTJ4mJccucmov2UThgOQbJ.jpg','2020-01-31',119,'Released',NULL,'Adú',588009,1.7717,6.857,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46673,_binary '\0','/hiqB5fFZ230MeFAGLPahoy06UOE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9617456',8.5,13895,'en','For Sama','A love letter from a young mother to her daughter, the film tells the story of Waad al-Kateab’s life through five years of the uprising in Aleppo, Syria as she falls in love, gets married and gives birth to Sama, all while cataclysmic conflict rises around her. Her camera captures incredible stories of loss, laughter and survival as Waad wrestles with an impossible choice– whether or not to flee the city to protect her daughter’s life, when leaving means abandoning the struggle for freedom for which she has already sacrificed so much.','/mDna51F8QfrJFZOgPGQUz3VKqsB.jpg','2019-07-26',100,'Released','An intimate and epic journey into the female experience of war.','For Sama',576017,4.0863,8.2,'bT_Agp-ZXAk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46674,_binary '\0','/Amp8FamnKw8jUFptKHOXRL4VseU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9617716',7.5,4402,'en','Everybody’s Everything','The story of artist Lil Peep from his birth in Long Island and meteoric rise as a genre blending pop star & style icon, to his death due to an accidental opioid overdose in Arizona at just 21 years of age.','/wbMkjkNX8VylPVLmQ2Dp6i5iayY.jpg','2019-11-12',116,'Released',NULL,'Everybody’s Everything',576712,4.0201,8.4,'nV7qfPcyaXQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46675,_binary '\0','/1xQtvgay8rDwSaZPwyhcecqV8UD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9619798',5.8,51558,'en','The Wrong Missy','A guy meets the woman of his dreams and invites her to his company\'s corporate retreat, but realizes he sent the invite to the wrong person.','/A2YlIrzypvhS3vTFMcDkG3xLvac.jpg','2020-05-13',90,'Released','There’s no untexting her now.','The Wrong Missy',582596,6.8336,6.127,'2Cwaneq2w-4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46676,_binary '\0','/uIpJPDNFoeX0TVml9smPrs9KUVx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9619824',6.7,171757,'en','Final Destination Bloodlines','Plagued by a violent recurring nightmare, college student Stefanie heads home to track down the one person who might be able to break the cycle and save her family from the grisly demise that inevitably awaits them all.','/6WxhEvFsauuACfv8HyoVX6mZKFj.jpg','2025-05-14',110,'Released','Death runs in the family.','Final Destination Bloodlines',574475,23.723,7.035,'KnWzz0n60pE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46677,_binary '\0','/dJIpkqn83zV5FW2DWOMa7XgDsiv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9619902',5.9,1261,'en','Waltzing with Brando','The story of how Marlon Brando plucked Bernard Judge, an obscure but idealistic Los Angeles architect from his stable existence and convinced him that he should build the world’s first ecologically perfect retreat on a tiny and uninhabitable Tahitian island.','/iCMOHK9k8MIm95xCCKFwdIZkNc6.jpg','2025-09-19',104,'Released','He left everything to feel something.','Waltzing with Brando',574452,1.6058,5.6,'Iox_OxwgNVE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46678,_binary '\0','/ljCKYCSRMNyZNyke5Lc1I8nW5b2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9620288',7.5,193669,'en','King Richard','The story of how Richard Williams served as a coach to his daughters Venus and Serena, who will soon become two of the most legendary tennis players in history.','/vjpMd1dsEsVBoUhq6iVHXwwFj9n.jpg','2021-11-18',144,'Released','Venus, Serena and a plan for greatness.','King Richard',614917,10.6008,7.598,'BKP_0z52ZAw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46679,_binary '\0','/gESm6yc2MZpSXakgqLF0OlLaRn1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9620292',7.5,259072,'en','Promising Young Woman','A young woman, traumatized by a tragic event in her past, seeks out vengeance against those who crossed her path.','/2h4EkRxy36zSsBDkijXSUMJFDaz.jpg','2020-12-13',114,'Released','Revenge never looked so promising.','Promising Young Woman',582014,11.0383,7.4,'7i5kiFDunk8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46680,_binary '\0','/z0ddbGOTvoVmGiFY8G8u4unyVec.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9621284',6.5,2260,'en','The Last Right','Daniel Murphy is lumbered with a corpse that has the same last name as his, who dies on his flight from Boston to County Cork. Travelling back to Ireland to attend his mother’s funeral, Daniel also checks on his autistic brother. What follows is an unconventional road trip with his brother and the mortuary assistant as they take the coffin from Clonakilty to Rathlin Island.','/fqF8pFU4BghrKJ69kVuI0T0vOqt.jpg','2019-12-06',106,'Released',NULL,'The Last Right',641336,1.8272,6.1,'mjOExsPFg_0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46681,_binary '\0','/3UycMWDvEIEyKakpmExSzM1814h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9624470',6.6,1657,'ru','Громкая связь','Gathered together in a country house, seven friends play an entertaining game, in which participants have to read aloud all of their incoming text messages, and can only answer their calls using loudspeaker mode. They can’t even imagine what stunning surprises about each other they will discover.','/4CBaUCPsjXgQUsaoQngb1zLrRrm.jpg','2019-02-14',96,'Released',NULL,'Loud Connection',570657,1.0026,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46682,_binary '\0','/an4UrbuWK7TEOeur9TesuMzqSYC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9624766',2.9,11504,'en','Jiu Jitsu','Every six years, an ancient order of jiu-jitsu fighters joins forces to battle a vicious race of alien invaders. But when a celebrated war hero goes down in defeat, the fate of the planet and mankind hangs in the balance.','/eLT8Cu357VOwBVTitkmlDEg32Fs.jpg','2020-11-20',102,'Released','From the darkness, the ultimate fighter rises.','Jiu Jitsu',590706,3.5157,4.727,'fwkpeUMROXw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46683,_binary '\0','/ifBIpsuutQlul3Mexjw2QdkFXG4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9625664',4,12229,'en','Trauma Center','Lt. Wakes is a vengeful police detective determined to solve the murders of his partner and an informant, and joins forces with a witness injured during the shootings. After the killers pursue the witness across the abandoned floor of a hospital, she confirms Wakes\'s worst fears.','/8K73wvCTBA3XKgZTtOZWgENUnis.jpg','2019-12-06',87,'Released','The enemy is closer than you think.','Trauma Center',641790,5.3371,5.404,'bGUFoLX55gc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46684,_binary '\0','/qDBmY1cd8aAZMLL1gAlm3EtkFsZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9632590',5.6,6735,'fr','Une fille facile','Naïma has just turned 16. This summer, she will have to decide what she wants from life if she doesn’t want to miss out. Then her cousin Sofia arrives, with an amazing body and a dangerously seductive lifestyle. Naïma desires only to follow her own path, so long as it leads upwards… Despite the warnings of her best friend Dodo, she and Sofia will live through unforgettable encounters during a long summer that will mark them forever.','/9AhB1u1vUXoumoHbcGhw7VnS0L2.jpg','2019-08-28',92,'Released',NULL,'An Easy Girl',575479,4.1102,5.5,'yvFGs-Ob8OA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46685,_binary '\0','/lx8wZ87wLoAwx1PyAizaf8iJ4tj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9633480',6.5,4715,'te','ఉప్పెన','Aasi has been in love with Bebamma since their childhood. But it is more than her father Rayanam that threatens to form a chasm between the lovers.','/qO5ofw2mTJgDEguKBadZ7HyOyn.jpg','2021-02-12',147,'Released',NULL,'Uppena',606718,1.2912,5.571,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46686,_binary '\0','/8WtaU1fpr9pqQV544PDoldP97lp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9635540',5.9,8558,'ta','தர்பார்','Aaditya, the commissioner of Mumbai Police, sets out to catch Ajay, a drug peddler. However, he uncovers a deeper controversy linked to an international drug lord and must mete out justice.','/39kVh9CWrY8cE6rIzRqwo6Dn1cZ.jpg','2020-01-08',159,'Released','To battle monsters, become a monster.','Darbar',594139,2.0506,5.905,'FQX9jN_vpvs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46687,_binary '\0','/sQRCUYtT1G3Yexnv1MuavzMJMbx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9635