s embark on an enchanting journey deep into a mysterious forest to discover the village\'s legend of the Tale-teller.','/7nynvfK3keDyQsvCZjhPExd8qev.jpg','2020-02-04',70,'Released',NULL,'The Adventures of Açela',694292,0.8833,10,'SZ5UxlVuu1k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46695,_binary '\0','/h9xzx7FteH3kFcED51qYjeHHUHD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9647768',6.7,8715,'zh','南方车站的聚会','A gangster ends up making a mistake that causes every gun on both sides of the law to point at him. While on the run, he comes across a mysterious woman who might get him out of trouble or make things worse.','/w49o4vmNFpCt4VFJp7ip6tjHh3x.jpg','2019-11-27',113,'Released',NULL,'The Wild Goose Lake',575428,2.8728,6.643,'-oCq5oa8Wzg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46696,_binary '\0','/zmIcouKMZNpHvTev6TCZrDy7w9V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9648672',3.8,8590,'hi','Street Dancer 3D','Two rival dance groups from India and Pakistan who are always competing against each other, join forces when it comes to competing at an international dance competition.','/mnsoKSS6EZNB7y2kEzXHdLm1U0E.jpg','2020-01-24',146,'Released',NULL,'Street Dancer 3D',644712,1.8597,6.554,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46697,_binary '\0','/3vSdq8fHmEHATKL4bsOlUDszsQ9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9648886',6.3,4376,'fr','Un divan à Tunis','Selma, a psychoanalyst, deals with a cast of colorful new patients after returning home to Tunisia to open a practice.','/c8UoHYXLRClZcesFIdBGx22lH0X.jpg','2020-02-12',88,'Released',NULL,'Arab Blues',582897,2.9274,6.091,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46698,_binary '\0','/p6b37HcXfZhNfQzUHEVtqSrSm8Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9648942',6.5,1740,'id','Dilan 1991','Dilan\'s involvement in the motorbike gang imperils his relationship with Milea, whose distant relative returns from Belgium.','/jvhtHrO4g767iInsfLm9USy47mH.jpg','2019-02-28',118,'Released',NULL,'Dilan 1991',577970,1.0998,6.929,'nw