e war of angels has come to earth.','The Devil Conspiracy',296271,4.9742,6.429,'6im3vt5yZoY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46706,_binary '\0','/rtqizjjHMGXlzfOdCdP5QkGLQgN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9663702',6.5,3398,'ar','نادي الرجال السري','Adham helps a group of his friends join a getaway club for men called “The Secret Men’s Club”. But Adham\'s own marriage is in trouble as his wife of ten years starts following him to find out what he is keeping from her, which results in many funny situations.','/5hlAZ5F91buvY3bpV606zd8KN5j.jpg','2019-01-23',99,'Released',NULL,'The Secret Men Club',575198,1.5095,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46707,_binary '\0','/bckxSN9ueOgm0gJpVJmPQrecWul.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9663764',5.6,121817,'en','Aquaman and the Lost Kingdom','Black Manta seeks revenge on Aquaman for his father\'s death. Wielding the Black Trident\'s power, he becomes a formidable foe. To defend Atlantis, Arthur (Aquaman) forges an alliance with his imprisoned brother. They must protect the kingdom.','/7lTnXOy0iNtBAdRP3TZvaKJ77F6.jpg','2023-12-20',124,'Released','The tide is turning.','Aquaman and the Lost Kingdom',572802,23.2256,6.496,'4cSkHPW-MPE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46708,_binary '\0','/yPiCixZDLeBXF8xO4xpw8SJlaKn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9663896',6.1,9499,'en','Asphalt City','A young paramedic is paired with a seasoned partner on the night shift in New York revealing a city in crisis. Discovering the chaos firsthand, he is tested with the ethical ambiguity that can be the difference between life and death.','/qXcd7wY7MmRs36fQt83iSMJelvV.jpg','2024-03-28',120,'Released','Welcome to the frontlines.','Asphalt City',628922,5.2136,6.2,'2qgc4ihhuGc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46709,_binary '\0','/oIZNzQyeM9yNANvextLaDZcSzht.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9664078',5.9,7920,'en','American Son','Time passes and tension mounts in a Florida