me immediately turns into a tragicomedy.','/eUwpfbOIYr9dpjG45pNkiqob9mC.jpg','2019-10-25',112,'Released',NULL,'You\'ve Got Murder',629500,1.3547,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46716,_binary '\0','/dJMk2MvTdhsqpm6ntLupkHWj5Nw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9675464',7.6,5489,'te','నాని\'స్ గ్యాంగ్ లీడర్','A crime novelist is approached by a group of bereaved women to help them plot revenge against those responsible for the loss of their loved ones.','/ejXpzRk1jyZenFhYANehhk4vGcD.jpg','2019-09-13',155,'Released','Revengers Assemble','Nani\'s Gang Leader',612402,1.3142,7.075,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46717,_binary '\0','/5Zh5A40XttoWVLmC73Q8dpPqv91.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9675716',7.7,11436,'ta','நேர்கொண்ட பார்வை','When three young women are harassed and implicated in a crime they didn\'t commit, a bipolar lawyer sets out to help them clear their names and prove it to everyone that a woman\'s consent matters.','/8Ttg8jI3rOG6RSAj195MwdXlnc1.jpg','2019-08-08',158,'Released',NULL,'Nerkonda Paarvai',586291,1.3115,6.919,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46718,_binary '\0','/27fhLCU9legulEBg44ggMPWdmW5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9679608',7.1,3546,'en','Mystery 101','When a college student is found dead, English professor Amy uses her crime fiction expertise to unravel the case faster than detective Travis, who ends up working with Amy to catch the killer.','/uC8yqYQsylFEqB2OGDIGmspBw2i.jpg','2019-01-27',84,'Released',NULL,'Mystery 101',577091,1.7794,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46719,_binary '\0','/p9S3ViHA0DzNdV7fnrsNw49VRSV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9680136',5.8,9453,'hi','पति पत्नी और वो','Chintu Tyagi is an ordinary, middle-class man who finds himself torn between his wife and another woman.','/9sAegdBnkfucqhrsocR47zCKcez.jpg','2019-12-06',115,'Released',NULL,'Pati Patni Aur Woh',590350,1.5309,6.096,'L7a1JSeqaXk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000')