owever, a dark secret from the home\'s past soon unleashes a malevolent force that drags the family into the depths of inescapable terror.','/gSkfBGdxdialBMM7P02V4hcI6Ij.jpg','2024-01-03',98,'Released','Everything you fear is under the surface.','Night Swim',1072342,11.0496,5.5,'2qxsSGQz-zs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46724,_binary '\0','/8YSpQBdGvuvSj9pLsY2yoUb9fZn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9683478',6.9,48062,'en','The Half of It','Shy, straight-A student Ellie is hired by sweet but inarticulate jock Paul, who needs help wooing the most popular girl in school. But their new and unlikely friendship gets tricky when Ellie discovers she has feelings for the same girl.','/jC1PNXGET1ZZQyrJvdFhPfXdPP1.jpg','2020-05-01',104,'Released','A different kind of love story.','The Half of It',597219,6.2563,7.1,'B-yhF7IScUE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46725,_binary '\0','/96AM2owWlcRz0oWLWRzFJV27QGM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9684220',6.5,29467,'en','Bad Trip','In this hidden-camera prank comedy, two best friends bond on a wild road trip to New York as they pull real people into their raunchy, raucous antics.','/A1Gy5HX3DKGaNW1Ay30NTIVJqJ6.jpg','2021-03-25',87,'Released','Friendships run deep.','Bad Trip',578908,4.2189,6.1,'OsXyNcckpwM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46726,_binary '\0','/vnH8IHc0202E8h2UtdpEe2ILjF0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9685342',6.2,5171,'zh','刺杀小说家','Lu Kongwen is the author of a fantasy novel series following a heroic teenager, also named Kongwen, on a quest to end the tyrannical rule of Lord Redmane, under the guidance of a Black Armor. But through a strange twist of fate, the fantasy world of the novel begins to impact life in the real world, leading Guan Ning to accept a mission from Tu Ling to kill the author.','/7hEhhmAF8Tr7g95fkbuxDpeR27b.jpg','2021-02-12',130,'Released','Rewrite the reality.','A Writer\'s Odyssey',611698,4.9617,7.1,'7Khk9dSEZnA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46727,_binary '\0','/bK2NadJBzYBLr0JZp5m7l1hU9Do.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9686154',7,2905,'ar','ستموت في العشرين','Shortly after Muzamil was born, the village\'s holy man predicts that he will die at age 20. Muzamil\'s father can\'t stand the curse and leaves home. Sakina raises her son as a single mother, overly protective. One day, Muzamil turns 19.','/hZjpqUFs3ffevZoLJsvoutpEIrd.jpg','2020-02-12',103,'Released',NULL,'You Will Die at Twenty',617710,1.5866,7,'7iLFHmCwZHQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46728,_binary '\0','/5rwcd24GGltKiqdPT4G2dmchLr9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9686708',7.1,83010,'en','The King of Staten Island','Scott has been a case of arrested development ever since his firefighter father died when he was seven. He\'s now reached his mid-20s having achieved little, chasing a dream of becoming a tattoo artist that seems far out of reach. As his ambitious younger sister heads off to college, Scott is still living with his exhausted ER nurse mother and spends his days smoking weed, hanging with the guys — Oscar, Igor and Richie — and secretly hooking up with his childhood friend Kelsey. But when his mother starts dating a loudmouth firefighter named Ray, it sets off a chain of events that will force Scott to grapple with his grief and take his first tentative steps toward moving forward in life.','/zQFjMmE3K9AX5QrBL1SXIxYQ9jz.jpg','2020-07-22',137,'Released',NULL,'The King of Staten Island',579583,9.0102,7,'azkVr0VUSTA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46729,_binary '\0','/zGoZB4CboMzY1z4G3nU6BWnMDB2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9686790',5.5,43414,'en','Shotgun Wedding','Darcy and Tom gather their families for the ultimate destination wedding but when the entire party is taken hostage, “’Til Death Do Us Part” takes on a whole new meaning. Now, Darcy and Tom must save their loved ones—if they don’t kill each other first.','/t79ozwWnwekO0ADI