y selective ski club whose aim is to train future professional athletes. Taking a chance on his new recruit, Fred, ex-champion turned coach, decides to make Lyz his shining star regardless of her lack of experience. Under his influence, Lyz will have to endure more than the physical and emotional pressure of the training. Will Lyz’s determination help her escape his grip?','/qAXJ1Z3wkXGYYk0mcEh8JiAfXz6.jpg','2020-10-17',92,'Released',NULL,'Slalom',585744,2.0123,6.663,'EPP4PVV5R08','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46742,_binary '\0','/jHILyT8ZQ4w1YFJ2RY8KdsLHrbH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9699028',4.2,1718,'it','Chiara Ferragni: Unposted','Chiara Ferragni, the first fashion influencer in the world, reveals how the digital revolution has changes business world, communication, fashion, culture, through a portrait in which she\'s the protagonist, both as a woman and as digital entrepreneur.','/aJaJrgexnUjL1dEGMJQoLIvBjuu.jpg','2019-09-17',85,'Released',NULL,'Chiara Ferragni: Unposted',618253,1.5133,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46743,_binary '\0','/oMnJhVFr0xVfxy4HPBt1LDKoFgV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9701940',6.7,92569,'en','Fear Street: 1978','In 1978, two rival groups at Camp Nightwing must band together to solve a terrifying mystery when horrors from their towns\' history come alive.','/5dNTxhoGDTHHGqUTdxcr4H1dqlU.jpg','2021-07-08',111,'Released','Find the truth.','Fear Street: 1978',591274,9.8624,7.169,'UyUuzCGblqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46744,_binary '\0','/jLeOzQLZJEpmAMDnfKMmORFGuV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9701942',6.6,77313,'en','Fear Street: 1666','In 1666, a colonial town is gripped by a hysterical witch-hunt that has deadly consequences for centuries to come, and it\'s up to teenagers in 1994 to finally put an end to their town\'s curse, before it\'s too late.','/rmEPtz3Ufzol2VWUAZYzOFaBio3.jpg','2021-07-14',115,'Released','End the curse.','Fear Street: 1666',