eam house in Malibu with exclusive designer fashions, fast cars, and exquisite jewelry. She has no need for a man except to satisfy her natural serial killer instinct, literally. When Tyler, a petty thief, responds to her online roommate ad, he thinks he\'s struck gold. But he has no idea that after a night of partying and passion, he is really just on her menu to be her next victim… until real romance gets in the way.','/l48b4R6m9VZ1ArvlFHtlDJnz7PE.jpg','2021-02-12',97,'Released','She\'s making a killing','Me You Madness',706646,1.3352,4.9,'8TBBE3FyHlI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46764,_binary '\0','/dKuzMV0htkMBxUr5t3cpgsz2viF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9737688',7.2,3514,'th','Friend Zone ระวัง..สิ้นสุดทางเพื่อน','A woman decides to try moving her best guy friend out of the friend zone. Will the result be happiness – or a disappointing end to their friendship?','/ifJLg5uc0KQVrp8heSHwOFpBRK1.jpg','2019-02-14',118,'Released','Besties wait here. do not cross, no matter how close!','Friend Zone',582681,2.6557,7.204,'4S81gZQ68LE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46765,_binary '\0','/ogFIG0fNXEYRQKrpnoRJcXQNX9n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9737876',6.6,21215,'no','Kampen om Narvik','April, 1940. The eyes of the world are on Narvik, a small town in northern Norway, a source of the iron ore needed for Hitler\'s war machine. Through two months of fierce winter warfare, the German leader is dealt with his first defeat.','/iTqTgxTNs1AIaSmxh0zD3RMaFNn.jpg','2022-12-25',108,'Released','Hitler\'s First Defeat','Narvik',619930,4.1838,6.8,'EXl7aVH4IOM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46766,_binary '\0','/qkymqmJW6IdZBIRWD66Ns4HHGJq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9738716',6.4,13320,'en','The World to Come','In 1856, two women forge a close connection despite their isolation on the American frontier.','/6GJQXJ96FUbXtB01VXAdp854qOt.jpg','2021-02-12',105,'Released',NULL,'The World to Come',506281,6.2