 Baluchestan province and that they are doing illegals. Faezeh decides to escape with her husband to Pakistan but there they meet Abdolhamid\'s brother Abdolmalek Rigi who is a terrorist.','/g7AIMhLBWcaK6ev7mhLRfDvwjaH.jpg','2019-06-05',131,'Released',NULL,'When the Moon Was Full',583790,1.0548,5.8,'G-shDrNJMK0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46852,_binary '\0','/ubn9Em9G2aFNtogNGCR6IoDBqM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9817070',7.7,21404,'fa','متری شش و نیم','Samad is nobody’s fool. The narcotics officer has seen his share of a drug dealer’s lies and games, and his patience has come to run thin. While searching for the infamous drug baron Nasser Khakzad, he and his colleague Hamid scour the streets of Tehran, turning an overcrowded prison on its head. With his rough and dubious approach, Samad finally manages to find the criminal’s whereabouts – but things do not quite go according to plan...','/ujNhy2Vu7S1FHuwePMIYMkIbGTj.jpg','2019-03-17',134,'Released','Who are trafficking all these drugs for 6.5 million addicts?','Law of Tehran',583794,2.5394,7.192,'ILO-1U03eYA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46853,_binary '\0','/oQyslJlBRYOHSZEn255BFNt9q4S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9817308',6.5,1356,'fr','Antoine Griezmann : Champion Du Monde','With heart and determination, Antoine Griezmann overcame his small stature to become one of the world\'s top soccer players and a World Cup champion.','/sYiqPgDM6KYpRVkjOZi6kgnalR3.jpg','2019-03-21',60,'Released',NULL,'Antoine Griezmann: The Making of a Legend',589116,1.8805,7.1,'by2gw8LshqQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46854,_binary '\0','/vdS9DrbC5dqUYIq2PPwQ9H7mG4u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9820352',5.9,4814,'en','Villain','After 10 years, Eddie Franks is out of prison and trying to stay on the straight and narrow, but his drug-mule brother, Sean has other ideas. Rival gangster brothers demand Sean repay his debt to them, causing Eddie to get tangled in the crossfire, and he ends up using his life savings to calling in favours with mobster friends to try and help.','/kc5AdZ0DJqrnAye8xGbXgtABh4E.jpg','2020-02-28',97,'Released','Crime runs in the blood.','Villain',660549,2.3061,5.554,'1AeQu474tV4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46855,_binary '\0','/nz8xWrTKZzA5A7FgxaM4kfAoO1W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9820556',2.9,21035,'en','Breach','A hardened mechanic must stay awake and maintain an interstellar ark fleeing the dying planet Earth with a few thousand lucky souls on board... the last of humanity. Unfortunately, humans are not the only passengers. A shapeshifting alien creature has taken residence, its only goal is to kill as many people as possible. The crew must think quickly to stop this menace before it destroys mankind.','/13B6onhL6FzSN2KaNeQeMML05pS.jpg','2020-12-17',93,'Released','Deep in space they are not alone.','Breach',651571,4.1908,4.1,'AG7ml1G2lI4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46856,_binary '\0','/d2dxTPPkwY2RAUS2L451JsQTCmC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9822706',6.8,1741,'zh','热带雨','Wet Season revolves around the life of Ling, a schoolteacher who deals with infertility while having to take care of her infirm father-in-law at home. One of Ling\'s students, Kok Wei Lun, develops a crush on her during remedial Chinese classes. The two become closer as Wei Lun embraces Ling\'s extra tutoring.','/iyqqHPkF7EoNGlqDJ2aDchRxfnq.jpg','2019-11-22',103,'Released',NULL,'Wet Season',584242,3.6243,6.4,'2AmITBssvg8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46857,_binary '\0','/uzTilAtx7ShPSvzG7SujpnimDL4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9824114',5,8151,'en','Original Gangster','The stoic chronicles of Castor, orphaned as a child, forced to survive in the wild and his colorful journey through the criminal underworld of London.','/dNnmaGIjy5PyfjpRMx0opPEsMaP.jpg','2020-12-01',110,'Released','Hero or menace? You decide ...','Original Gangster',778844,1.853,5.6,'f2CUaiFcosw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46858,_binary '\0','/q5LAvX97FVgzd8YwAGss6waQwJH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9827834',6.8,6984,'en','Sylvie\'s Love','When a young woman meets an aspiring saxophonist in her father’s record shop in 1950s Harlem, their love ignites a sweeping romance that transcends changing times, geography, and professional success.','/48P3lTdsg19OfmrD5av0VJYcjLM.jpg','2020-01-27',114,'Released','Sometimes the right love comes at the wrong time.','Sylvie\'s Love',584288,4.0379,6.3,'SbjakuJZgww','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46859,_binary '\0','/g5ZCG8coC1bfB81anxL52l30uDe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9828918',6,1595,'fr','#JeSuisLà','Stéphane lives a quiet life as an eminent French Chef but when he decides to visit Soo, a mysterious Korean lady he fell in love with on Instagram, he\'ll embark on an adventurous journey full of discoveries.','/yxHDlr90ww0XZt3U26W95JNExf3.jpg','2020-02-05',100,'Released',NULL,'#Iamhere',605734,1.9141,5.5,'NUeR9UyMtkA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46860,_binary '\0','/gEeM0ya0UDkdn7EgP5ivabZ754v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9831136',5.1,5390,'en','The Banana Splits Movie','A boy named Harley and his family attend a taping of The Banana Splits TV show, which is supposed to be a fun-filled birthday for young Harley and business as usual for Rebecca, the producer of the series. But things take an unexpected turn - and the body count quickly rises. Can Harley, his mom and their new pals safely escape?','/vG9FY2wHVwOOQfqNlUt2LbRzRNl.jpg','2019-09-04',89,'Released','Tra la la terror!','The Banana Splits Movie',608654,3.932,6.509,'0R1-ZZTcTBY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46861,_binary '\0','/raBg7yAxT9U53hEfXIgsl2FzxhV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9834492',6.4,1303,'fa','یلدا','Maryam accidentally killed her husband Nasser and is sentenced to death. The only person who can save her is Mona, Nasser\'s daughter. All Mona has to do is appear on a TV show and forgive Maryam. But forgiveness proves difficult when they are forced to relive the past.','/icr4yFsFkaXNbTNLATAJf88ORAj.jpg','2020-08-27',89,'Released','A Night for Forgiveness','Yalda',584356,1.3372,6.2,'MIU7UPn5-I0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46862,_binary '\0','/qYHM1QaR86eQeKX8qi8kFtqFAGd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9834506',5.5,4287,'hu','Post Mortem','A post mortem photographer and a little girl confront ghosts in a haunted village after the First World War.','/YRqKTFtMe2uLxYziumSva42RJ1.jpg','2020-10-28',115,'Released','You only know if you\'ve been to the other side.','Post Mortem',655363,1.8725,6.6,'s8AMy2Oh-7I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46863,_binary '\0','/w6vPIf8fh0H0T34f2eMfSVKMbGN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9840958',3.8,2202,'en','Love Struck Sick','This movie is all about one of the greatest YouTubers of all time, AlienAmerican. He is legendary, a man of his time, yet so far beyond it as well.','/u0RsER53c36G47r64b8xvAnTzIm.jpg','2019-08-08',92,'Released',NULL,'Love Struck Sick',1224267,1.0453,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46864,_binary '\0','/avVKoXUcYF0Cum0r9jsyboCyG4M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9844322',6.1,4789,'fr','Kaamelott : Premier Volet','Hidden in Rome, King Arthur is planning his return to oppose the army of his former friend Lancelot.','/hfq2Wgm86DeXGxcBrrpk9EShAZ8.jpg','2021-07-21',120,'Released','Patience is better served with sauce','Kaamelott: The First Chapter',577242,2.5267,6.6,'bwehRSStb9I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46865,_binary '\0','/qo9tN87uTsbXnaAob6aa7U33ayb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9844522',5.8,69791,'en','Escape Room: Tournament of Champions','Six people unwittingly find themselves locked in another series of escape rooms, slowly uncovering what they have in common to survive... and discovering they\'ve all played the games before.','/jGYJyPzVgrVV2bgClI9uvEZgVLE.jpg','2021-07-01',88,'Released','Winning was just the beginning.','Escape Room: Tournament of Champions',585216,11.9531,6.5,'KlfUbZJVInA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46866,_binary '\0','/6Ogax4OJwTmY69cN2u0laFdXU15.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9844938',7.2,3512,'fr','Onoda, 10 000 nuits dans la jungle','Japan, 1944. Trained for intelligence work, Hiroo Onoda, 22 years old, discovers a philosophy contrary to the official line: no suicide; stay alive whatever happens; the mission is more important than anything else. Sent to Lubang, a small island in the Philippines where the Americans are about to land, this role will be to wage a guerrilla war until the return of the Japanese troops. The Empire will surrender soon after; Onoda, 10,000 days later.','/tKzFwiEm86AVRsefgqODTBjjh98.jpg','2021-07-21',167,'Released',NULL,'Onoda: 10,000 Nights in the Jungle',695089,3.3375,7.087,'VLWLA20Jp0g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46867,_binary '\0','/ym2xIbKKm46Xe6kxNnFOhAb79yN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9845110',7.2,4355,'fr','Deux','Nina and Madeleine have been sharing their lives and the landing between their two apartments for decades. After more than 20 years of loving in the shadows, Madeleine promises Nina she will tell her family the truth. It takes an unexpected event to show her the importance of living your truth.','/itPHi7V84mUOYuvD3t0QK2oWfVP.jpg','2020-02-12',92,'Released',NULL,'Two of Us',621744,2.175,7,'Yp9PPAv9PyU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46868,_binary '\0','/wfhEIz0Sp0X9pi8x3syn5wM2Vji.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9845398',6.8,4543,'es','Fin de siglo','When Ocho, an Argentine poet on vacation in Barcelona, spots Javi from his balcony, the attraction is subtle but persistent. After a missed connection on the beach, a third chance encounter escalates to a seemingly random hookup. But are they part of each other’s histories, or maybe even destinies?','/ohKFWPragxPcF3WqhgsKkA0EWkI.jpg','2019-08-16',84,'Released',NULL,'End of the Century',586961,1.4953,7.2,'-dNcyO7FP-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46869,_binary '\0','/6TPZSJ06OEXeelx1U1VIAt0j9Ry.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9845564',6.2,23253,'es','Bajocero','When a prisoner transfer van is attacked, the cop in charge must fight those inside and outside while dealing with a silent foe: the icy temperatures.','/dWSnsAGTfc8U27bWsy2RfwZs0Bs.jpg','2021-01-29',106,'Released','Escape is not the exit.','Below Zero',587996,6.0943,6.346,'UCLz92vUYJY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46870,_binary '\0','/5nxDn3mrdmeUHJOZi1Wfqya8Vji.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9847360',5.2,2404,'en','A Glitch in the Matrix','Are we in fact living in a simulation? This is the question postulated, wrestled with, and ultimately argued for through archival footage, compelling interviews with real people shrouded in digital avatars, and a collection of cases from some of our most iconoclastic figures in contemporary culture.','/bn0BLVadmvzq6MmJ0n97MLxGpNQ.jpg','2021-02-05',108,'Released','True stories / False realities','A Glitch in the Matrix',696109,1.7675,5.5,'W0RgpwWlEZo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46871,_binary '\0','/7QabKu8tizoqy8qCZJXljdSpP4A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9848626',6,49091,'en','Hotel Transylvania: Transformania','When Van Helsing\'s mysterious invention, the \"Monsterfication Ray,\" goes haywire, Drac and his monster pals are all transformed into humans, and Johnny becomes a monster. In their new mismatched bodies, Drac and Johnny must team up and race across the globe to find a cure before it\'s too late, and before they drive each other crazy.','/teCy1egGQa0y8ULJvlrDHQKnxBL.jpg','2022-01-31',92,'Released','Change can be scary.','Hotel Transylvania: Transformania',585083,15.7701,7,'6suJohjIvfo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46872,_binary '\0','/4nlHGM6XWj3YJm28E849h0cf76U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9848668',7.5,1709,'nl','Zee van tijd','Two former lovers find themselves struggling for shared closure as one of them prepares to stage a play about the unspeakable tragedy that tore them apart decades ago.','/beOttBg7SjRnOXXBEb3Xv9UEgKV.jpg','2022-09-21',116,'Released',NULL,'Sea of Time',1002125,1.796,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46873,_binary '\0','/kA0gFQDo4vFrg2ZEsPWVv9J0Xng.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9849004',5.3,4994,'en','Happily','Tom and Janet have been happily married for years. But a visit from a mysterious stranger leads to a dead body, a lot of questions, and a tense couples\' trip with friends who may not actually be friends at all.','/uCV98jOIxwd0SMICfHFNcuo5CHS.jpg','2021-03-19',96,'Released','A killer romantic comedy.','Happily',673319,2.3712,5.789,'CzBGS5jDzxU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46874,_binary '\0','/tfJAWaFo16JBM0bcaeD0kn7qXtD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9849644',5.8,1359,'en','Mind Thief','A novelist realizes that her neighbors may be under the control of unknown forces. Little does she realize how close and sinister its influence has become. A harrowing, darkly humorous journey through the depths of the human psyche.','/1JJk2ptoyPnZ4p47s5LK6cY7WOY.jpg','2022-11-06',108,'Released',NULL,'Mind Thief',1163804,0.9121,5.5,'tMTKuBcnowM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46875,_binary '\0','/bvsp4VuvwEweg72PCNvbnYTU8sz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9850050',6.2,1690,'sv','Charter','After a recent and difficult divorce, Alice hasn\'t seen her children in two months as she awaits a custody verdict. When her son calls her in the middle of the night, Alice takes action, abducting the children on an illicit charter trip to the Canary Islands.','/5HmswsvTpHYEXDqEU23mYoSflQ.jpg','2020-03-13',94,'Released',NULL,'Charter',653580,1.3789,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46876,_binary '\0','/wDbcEcTIfTp7yDBj0zVnqpQ24N7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9850064',6.5,4501,'ja','海獣の子供','Ruka is a young girl whose parents are separated and whose father works in an aquarium. When two boys, Umi and Sora, who were raised in the sea by dugongs, are brought to the aquarium, Ruka feels drawn to them and begins to realize that she has the same sort of supernatural connection to the ocean that they do. Umi and Sora\'s special power seems to be connected to strange events that have been occurring more and more frequently, such as the appearance of sea creatures far from their home territory and the disappearance of aquarium animals around the world. However, the exact nature of the boys\' power and of the abnormal events is unknown, and Ruka gets drawn into investigating the mystery that surrounds her new friends.','/9Fch8X5C5yW2srPVBiq6LNRvwd.jpg','2019-06-07',111,'Released',NULL,'Children of the Sea',585077,3.923,7.093,'SOhRCIv-VOE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46877,_binary '\0','/bInCRTfq1RvXGACQwls2LHOWPEm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9850344',5.4,2375,'fr','Police','Three officers are tasked with escorting an illegal immigrant to Charles de Gaulle airport, where he will be forced onto a plane and sent back to his homeland. But when they find out about the truth, they have to make a difficult choice.','/52KQaRQiEIZ9TE4P5iIrRIK7Wej.jpg','2020-05-21',98,'Released',NULL,'Night Shift',660330,1.8866,5.2,'lsLoRIbYSV8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46878,_binary '\0','/pYziM5SEmptPW0LdNhWvjzR2zD1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9850370',6.5,1833,'en','#AnneFrank. Parallel Stories','One single Anne Frank moves us more than the countless others who suffered just as she did but whose faces have remained in the shadows-Primo Levi. The Oscar®-winning Helen Mirren will introduce audiences to Anne Frank\'s story through the words in her diary. The set will be her room in the secret refuge in Amsterdam, reconstructed in every detail by set designers from the Piccolo Theatre in Milan. Anne Frank this year would have been 90 years old. Anne\'s story is intertwined with that of five Holocaust survivors, teenage girls just like her, with the same ideals, the same desire to live: Arianna Szörenyi, Sarah Lichtsztejn-Montard, Helga Weiss and sisters Andra and Tatiana Bucci. Their testimonies alternate with those of their children and grandchildren.','/hkC4yNDFmW1yQuQhtZydMeRuaAb.jpg','2019-10-18',92,'Released',NULL,'#AnneFrank. Parallel Stories',610643,1.662,6.9,'FzT7-NfkxLA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46879,_binary '\0','/jTa7z3T7czm91mC7fEgV2BgHoS7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9850386',8.1,6423,'en','The Bee Gees: How Can You Mend a Broken Heart','The story of the triumphs and hurdles of brothers Barry, Maurice, and Robin Gibb, otherwise known as the Bee Gees. The iconic trio, who found early fame in the 1960s, went on to write over 1,000 songs and have 20 No. 1 hits throughout their career, transcending more than five decades of changing tastes and styles.','/yyodIRVfyXXC9Z4Lq3b1u9ZqL4E.jpg','2020-10-08',111,'Released',NULL,'The Bee Gees: How Can You Mend a Broken Heart',730009,3.0584,7.7,'B5tncybE7Wg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46880,_binary '\0','/d7kwGh1SJZKv6oWqpIkEG6AEXNp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9850488',6.8,1797,'sv','Tigrar','Super-talented footballing prodigy Martin is bought by top club Inter Milan, aged just 16. It’s the chance of a lifetime – but at what price?','/hEw0bwwrBUWbSBMcyDL4IqHDAQg.jpg','2021-07-22',116,'Released',NULL,'Tigers',743232,2.0397,5.7,'j7KaVwE2_HA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46881,_binary '\0','/biJKLNiGHjqRJaUpG3Kcn9IayBo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9850646',5.9,2255,'pa','ਦੂਰਬੀਨ','Shinda is a young man from Punjab who masterminds in the liquor smuggling business. When the new Deputy Superintendent of Police moves into town and a large 