th a safe, happy home, Sandra decides to build one - from scratch. Using all her ingenuity to make her ambitious dream a reality, Sandra draws together a community to lend a helping hand to build her house and ultimately recover her own sense of self.','/qTCdyHTibEl90w6rDxTTHTX9k3O.jpg','2020-11-26',97,'Released','Life under construction','Herself',653708,3.1252,6.7,'xwJ5IFxyc5c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46918,_binary '\0','/tVa0v0iX7ksdfHtYdTdJglZWy5N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9904802',4.6,2122,'en','Enemy Lines','In the frozen, war torn landscape of occupied Poland during World War II, a crack team of allied commandos are sent on a deadly mission behind enemy lines to extract a rocket scientist from the hands of the Nazis.','/vG8qBkByy9naORB6zahcntIC2N.jpg','2020-04-24',92,'Released','Courage has no border.','Enemy Lines',679796,2.1521,5.3,'xyYcuvAaTDM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46919,_binary '\0','/hPurpFeAkvkvWYRVSDYGDaDSgva.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9907782',6.2,23241,'en','The Cursed','In the late 19th century, a brutal land baron slaughters a Roma clan, unleashing a curse on his family and village. In the days that follow, the townspeople are plagued by nightmares, the baron\'s son goes missing, and a boy is found murdered. The locals suspect a wild animal, but a visiting pathologist warns of a more sinister presence lurking in the woods.','/bewmBcjJxHeipS1PNu9Lfyvt3zY.jpg','2021-07-28',111,'Released','Innocence will fall prey.','The Cursed',630392,6.0158,6.5,'-zT0jhfm1og','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000'),(46920,_binary '\0','/fpX67PBBlozc2UOf2LBB5IiQHT8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:11.000000','tt9908390',5.5,1673,'fr','Le Lion','A psychiatric hospital patient pretends to be crazy. In charge of caring for this patient, a caregiver will begin to doubt the mental state of his \"protégé\".','/zfLuACsPcwH6aonTKukn96d1qpp.jpg','2020-01-29',95,'Released',NULL,'The Lion',589970,3.202